values
  ('445118176038140611', 'The Shop on Main Street', 1965, 'Drama, War', 'Ján Kadár, Elmar Klos, René Mattes', 'Ladislav Grosman, Ján Kadár, Elmar Klos', 'Ida Kamińska, Jozef Kroner, František Zvarík, Hana Slivková, Martin Hollý, Elena Zvaríková-Pappová, Martin Gregor, Adam Matejka', null, 'In a small town in Nazi-occupied Slovakia during World War II, decent but timid carpenter Tono is named "Aryan comptroller" of a button store owned by an old Jewish widow, Rozalie. Since the post comes with a salary and standing in the town''s corrupt hierarchy, Tono wrestles with greed and guilt as he and Rozalie gradually befriend each other. When the authorities order all Jews in town to be rounded up, Tono faces a moral dilemma unlike any he''s known before.', 'In a small town in Nazi-occupied Slovakia during World War II, decent but timid carpenter Tono is named "Aryan comptroller" of a button store owned by an old Jewish widow, Rozalie. Since the post comes with a salary and standing in the town''s corrupt hierarchy, Tono wrestles with greed and guilt as he and Rozalie gradually befriend each other. When the authorities order all Jews in town to be rounded up, Tono faces a moral dilemma unlike any he''s known before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pOjsOzPzYrCFsMsatKxAwYzIeCg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25905'),
  ('95787306230061115', 'The Shopworn Angel', 1938, 'Romance, Drama, War', 'H. C. Potter, Joseph Ruttenberg', 'Waldo Salt', 'Margaret Sullavan, James Stewart, Walter Pidgeon, Hattie McDaniel, Nat Pendleton, Alan Curtis, Sam Levene, Eleanor Lynn', 'NR', 'During WWI Bill Pettigrew, a naive young Texan soldier is sent to New York for basic training. He meets worldly wise actress Daisy Heath when her car nearly runs him over.', 'During WWI Bill Pettigrew, a naive young Texan soldier is sent to New York for basic training. He meets worldly wise actress Daisy Heath when her car nearly runs him over.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ZBMVD7YXX32ddNjXn13BB3Jiiw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99318'),
  ('652300519075082388', 'The Short & Curlies', 1987, 'Comedy, Romance, TV Movie', 'Mike Leigh, Roger Pratt, Mark Sherwood', 'Mike Leigh', 'Alison Steadman, Sylvestra Le Touzel, David Thewlis, Wendy Nottingham', null, 'A short comedy by Mike Leigh about the romance between a young woman and a man who communicates only through jokes and humor...', 'A short comedy by Mike Leigh about the romance between a young woman and a man who communicates only through jokes and humor...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vHPJGFP7UONECmRW1blxcJ5clJ6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49455'),
  ('1073459311751500415', 'The Shortcut', 2009, 'Mystery, Horror, Thriller', 'Nicholaus Goossen, Michael Neumann, Elizabeth Farrer', 'Dan Hannon, Scott Sandler', 'Drew Seeley, Shannon Woodward, Dave Franco, Katrina Bowden, Raymond J. Barry, Kent Allen, Wendy Anderson, Jeremy Bastian', 'R', 'When Derek moves to a new town and discovers a shortcut through the woods to his high school, he learns about a crazy old man who lives near its path: Legend has it that he abducted a group of teenagers years ago. Ignoring the warning, Derek and his friends set out to uncover the dark secret that''s buried deep in the woods. But will they survive to tell it?', 'When Derek moves to a new town and discovers a shortcut through the woods to his high school, he learns about a crazy old man who lives near its path: Legend has it that he abducted a group of teenagers years ago. Ignoring the warning, Derek and his friends set out to uncover the dark secret that''s buried deep in the woods. But will they survive to tell it?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wAW0WNevBmmyaN8m1QkQkWyZGW7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22175'),
  ('456038827330157203', 'The Shortest Day', 1963, 'Comedy, History, War', 'Franco Rossellini, Ruggero Deodato, Sergio Corbucci', 'Bruno Corbucci, Giorgio Arlorio, Giovanni Grimaldi', 'Ciccio Ingrassia, Franco Franchi, Gino Cervi, Totò, Eduardo De Filippo, Peppino De Filippo, Terence Hill, Aldo Fabrizi', null, 'Two jerks are enlisted in the Italian army during W.W.1 and by pure luck manage to help win an important battle.', 'Two jerks are enlisted in the Italian army during W.W.1 and by pure luck manage to help win an important battle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dt73bf9xsYkShGidD6mEDgBCLFb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113332'),
  ('621993637824411927', 'The Shortest Distance Is Round', 2019, 'Romance, Drama', 'Daisuke Yamanouchi, Takehiko Tamiya, Yujiro Koseki', 'Daisuke Yamanouchi', 'Riku Mukai, Ryohei Shioguchi, Hattori Muo, Hasegawa Hiroto, Taishi Takemoto, Omino Jinya, Yuki Shin, Masamitsu Kani', null, 'Haruto is a freshman and a loner high school student until the arrival of the new teacher Aoyama. Aoyama cares for Haruto and starts to exchange letters with him, as something more grows inside both of them. But one night, an unexpected kiss ends their beautiful relationship. Three years later, Haruto has become a male prostitute in order to pay back his debts, when he reunites with Aoyama by chance.', 'Haruto is a freshman and a loner high school student until the arrival of the new teacher Aoyama. Aoyama cares for Haruto and starts to exchange letters with him, as something more grows inside both of them. But one night, an unexpected kiss ends their beautiful relationship. Three years later, Haruto has become a male prostitute in order to pay back his debts, when he reunites with Aoyama by chance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q8bhgg4k1EuNBo1neareES0Ihwj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:617132'),
  ('667934165599894373', 'The Shout', 1968, 'Documentary, History', 'Leobardo López Aretche, Alfredo Joskowicz', 'Oriana Fallaci', 'Rolando de Castro, Magda Vizcaíno, Óscar Chávez, Gustavo Díaz Ordaz', null, 'In the summer of revolt 1968, student Leobardo López Aretche captured the protests in Mexico City, and the state’s brutal response, up close – and like many of his subjects and fellow comrades, would pay a high price for his audacity. Fifty years later, his movie is no longer a secret.', 'In the summer of revolt 1968, student Leobardo López Aretche captured the protests in Mexico City, and the state’s brutal response, up close – and like many of his subjects and fellow comrades, would pay a high price for his audacity. Fifty years later, his movie is no longer a secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/41sQqWaQ65rPgjzXi6ohCZcNOKA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:194162'),
  ('324715955751930428', 'The Shout', 1978, 'Thriller, Mystery, Horror', 'Peter Waller, Patsy Pollock, Jerzy Skolimowski', 'Michael Austin, Jerzy Skolimowski', 'Alan Bates, Susannah York, John Hurt, Robert Stephens, Tim Curry, Julian Hough, Carol Drinkwater, John Rees', 'R', 'A traveller by the name of Crossley forces himself upon a musician and his wife in a lonely part of Devon, and uses the aboriginal magic he has learned to displace his host.', 'A traveller by the name of Crossley forces himself upon a musician and his wife in a lonely part of Devon, and uses the aboriginal magic he has learned to displace his host.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/89SfSiIgUjyxPDaRe5SedgVRggV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48131'),
  ('579501520175425829', 'The Show', 1922, 'Comedy, Action', 'Larry Semon, Norman Taurog, Hans F. Koenekamp', 'Larry Semon, Norman Taurog', 'Oliver Hardy, Larry Semon, Frank Alexander, Lucille Carlisle, Betty Young, Alice Davenport, Al Thompson, Pete Gordon', null, 'A harried propman backstage at a theater must put up with malfunctioning wind machines, roosters that spit nitroglycerine, and a gang planning to rob the theater''s payroll.', 'A harried propman backstage at a theater must put up with malfunctioning wind machines, roosters that spit nitroglycerine, and a gang planning to rob the theater''s payroll.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iBzayhQjfiSF5DdzNQX4iUDZtyg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94459'),
  ('622032687311658067', 'The Show', 1927, 'Drama, Romance', 'Tod Browning, John Arnold', 'Waldemar Young', 'John Gilbert, Renée Adorée, Lionel Barrymore, Gertrude Short, Edward Connelly, Andy MacLennan, Agostino Borgato, Betty Boyd', 'NR', 'Cock Robin is the swaggering ballyhoo man of a Hungarian sideshow known as the Palace of Illusions. The highlight of the show is a reenactment of Salome''s dance of the seven veils, replete with the beheading of Jokanaan. The performer portraying Salome is in love with Cock Robin. Jealous, sinister The Greek is determined to eliminate that competition.', 'Cock Robin is the swaggering ballyhoo man of a Hungarian sideshow known as the Palace of Illusions. The highlight of the show is a reenactment of Salome''s dance of the seven veils, replete with the beheading of Jokanaan. The performer portraying Salome is in love with Cock Robin. Jealous, sinister The Greek is determined to eliminate that competition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gMdoBDkaLyp1vgWKOWYRh77Y946.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108632'),
  ('1038784172916301858', 'The Show', 1995, 'Documentary', 'Brian Robbins', null, 'Kurtis Blow, Sean Combs, Snoop Dogg, Dr. Dre, Warren G, Method Man, The Notorious B.I.G., Slick Rick', 'R', 'A documentary about the culture of hip-hop. Through interviews with some of hip-hops biggest names, the film makers attempt to find out why it has become so popular.', 'A documentary about the culture of hip-hop. Through interviews with some of hip-hops biggest names, the film makers attempt to find out why it has become so popular.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u08TkPYyKeHvkrpvLEZxRLVxdwu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56088'),
  ('493323272511724949', 'The Show', 2017, 'Drama', 'Giancarlo Esposito, Paul Mitchnick', 'Noah Pink, Kenny Yakkel', 'Josh Duhamel, Famke Janssen, Giancarlo Esposito, Sarah Wayne Callies, Caitlin FitzGerald, Chris Ellis, Chelah Horsdal, Johannah Newmarch', 'R', 'An unsettling look at reality television, where a disturbing game show has its contestants ending their lives for the public''s enjoyment.', 'An unsettling look at reality television, where a disturbing game show has its contestants ending their lives for the public''s enjoyment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oe0WzIcsCfwYLu5WhHKOjXO4aYx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:375098'),
  ('92367605521788583', 'The Show', 2021, 'Drama, Fantasy, Mystery', 'Simon Tindall, Mitch Jenkins', 'Alan Moore', 'Tom Burke, Siobhan Hewlett, Ellie Bamber, Sheila Atim, Richard Dillane, Alan Moore, Eric Lampaert, Daniel Tuite', null, 'A man goes on a mission to locate a stolen artifact for a client, which leads him to a haunted town full of vampires, sleeping beauties, and Voodoo gangsters.', 'A man goes on a mission to locate a stolen artifact for a client, which leads him to a haunted town full of vampires, sleeping beauties, and Voodoo gangsters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iZJ3IEJ5rvWgxbVbkAF4uU6ZIo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:567910'),
  ('838708993951223467', 'The Show Must Go On', 2007, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Han Jae-rim, Park Yong-su', 'Han Jae-rim', 'Song Kang-ho, Park Ji-young, Oh Dal-su, Yoon Je-moon, Choi Il-hwa, Kim So-eun, Min Do-gi, Lee Jong-kwan', null, 'A middle-aged gangster''s lifetime of mistakes catch up with him as his personal and professional life is destroyed.', 'A middle-aged gangster''s lifetime of mistakes catch up with him as his personal and professional life is destroyed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r32KWFc2jRItbAzHypGu9yHSfNs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55771'),
  ('367743366213065322', 'The Show Must Go On: The Queen + Adam Lambert Story', 2019, 'Music, Documentary', 'Christopher Bird, Simon Lupton', null, 'Adam Lambert, Brian May, Roger Taylor, Rami Malek, Taylor Hawkins, Simon Cowell, Joe Elliott, David Bowie', null, 'A documentary chronicling Queen and Lambert''s incredible journey since they first shared the stage together on "American Idol" in 2009.', 'A documentary chronicling Queen and Lambert''s incredible journey since they first shared the stage together on "American Idol" in 2009.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b2L91hIyRSpM59ArCCJk0U02XWv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:597965'),
  ('353824867528933869', 'The Showdown', 2011, 'Action, Drama', 'Park Hoon-jung, Kim Yeong-ho', 'Park Hoon-jung', 'Park Hee-soon, Jin Goo, Choi Il-hwa, Jang Hee-jin, Jeon Kuk-hwan, Ko Chang-seok, Lee Jung-eun', null, 'In the 11th year of Kwang Hae-gun, Jo-seon soldiers go to war with China after an invasion. In the middle of Manchu, three people who have barely survived are being cornered by the Chinese forces, and begin a bloody battle not with their enemies but with their friends.', 'In the 11th year of Kwang Hae-gun, Jo-seon soldiers go to war with China after an invasion. In the middle of Manchu, three people who have barely survived are being cornered by the Chinese forces, and begin a bloody battle not with their enemies but with their friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y9UCFsdauPo1gdpfId0t8vguuks.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52421'),
  ('560670226332170340', 'The Shower', 1979, 'Romance, Drama', 'Go Yeong-nam, Lee Seong-chun, Son Han-su', 'Lee Jin-mo', 'Jo Yun-suk, Yeong-sun Lee, Kim Shin-jae, Go Yeong-nam', null, 'Yeon-ee, a city girl moves to the countryside to live with her great-grandparents when her father’s business fails. She gradually becomes friends with Seok-ee, a country boy from the neighboring farm. One day they go on a long hike to a nearby mountain, where they’re caught in a sudden storm.', 'Yeon-ee, a city girl moves to the countryside to live with her great-grandparents when her father’s business fails. She gradually becomes friends with Seok-ee, a country boy from the neighboring farm. One day they go on a long hike to a nearby mountain, where they’re caught in a sudden storm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7dfKpIfC1ZEin8sAdL8RR8KI049.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161280'),
  ('632224160835197345', 'The Shrimp on the Barbie', 1990, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Alan Smithee, Michael Gottlieb, James Bartle', 'Grant Morris, Ronald E. House, Alan Shearman', 'Cheech Marin, Emma Samms, Vernon Wells, Bruce Spence, Carole Davis, Terence Cooper, Jeanette Cronin, Gary McCormick', 'PG-13', 'Carlos has failed in show-biz and currently works as a waiter in a Mexican restaurant. There he meets Alex and dumb footballer Bruce celebrating their engagement with her parents. Alex'' father is less than thrilled of her fiancée and says he''d rather accept anybody else. Eventually Alex hires Carlos to present him as her new fiancée.', 'Carlos has failed in show-biz and currently works as a waiter in a Mexican restaurant. There he meets Alex and dumb footballer Bruce celebrating their engagement with her parents. Alex'' father is less than thrilled of her fiancée and says he''d rather accept anybody else. Eventually Alex hires Carlos to present him as her new fiancée.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8UnWJss37wVLTVj4fTzKyv3Mrbp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34564'),
  ('10614490117812404', 'The Shrine', 2010, 'Horror', 'James Griffith, Jon Knautz, Jonnie Katz', 'Jon Knautz, Trevor Matthews, Brendan Moore', 'Aaron Ashmore, Cindy Sampson, Meghan Heffern, Ben Lewis, Trevor Matthews, Vieslav Krystyan, Laura de Carteret, Monica Hewes', null, 'A group of young journalists investigate a cult said to practice human sacrifice, but their ambitious ways may lead them to becoming the cult''s next victims.', 'A group of young journalists investigate a cult said to practice human sacrifice, but their ambitious ways may lead them to becoming the cult''s next victims.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sfiHjYGnDUnJK7ag7xrzL8jiAX4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47763'),
  ('950387528139697669', 'The Shrink Is In', 2001, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Richard Benjamin, Kenneth MacMillan, Michael Cedar', 'Joanna Johnson', 'Courteney Cox, David Arquette, David James Elliott, Kimberley Davies, Viola Davis, Jon Polito, Carol Kane, Chris Potter', 'R', 'A young woman impersonates a shrink to win over her Prince Charming.', 'A young woman impersonates a shrink to win over her Prince Charming.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4nj4LaBxDuizYJmQ9KZy4unJGjh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66668'),
  ('131341432329871548', 'The Shrinking Man', 2025, 'Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Jan Kounen, Christophe Nuyens, Stéphane Gluck', 'Jan Kounen, Christophe Deslandes', 'Jean Dujardin, Marie-Josée Croze, Daphné Richard, Serge Swysen, Salim Talbi, Miranda Raison, Stéphanie Van Vyve', null, 'Paul, is an ordinary man who divides his life between his shipbuilding company, his wife Elise and their daughter Mia. During a sea trip, Paul finds himself confronted with a strange, unexplained meteorological phenomenon. From then on, Paul shrinks inexorably, without science being able to explain why or be of any help to him. When, by accident, he finds himself a prisoner in his own cellar, and while he is only a few centimeters tall, he will have to fight to survive in this banal environment that has become perilous. During this experience, Paul will find himself confronted with himself, with his humanity, and will try to answer the great questions of existence.', 'Paul, is an ordinary man who divides his life between his shipbuilding company, his wife Elise and their daughter Mia. During a sea trip, Paul finds himself confronted with a strange, unexplained meteorological phenomenon. From then on, Paul shrinks inexorably, without science being able to explain why or be of any help to him. When, by accident, he finds himself a prisoner in his own cellar, and while he is only a few centimeters tall, he will have to fight to survive in this banal environment that has become perilous. During this experience, Paul will find himself confronted with himself, with his humanity, and will try to answer the great questions of existence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5scjQRQq4i0zpbfyvWJX8LFEWjt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1233506'),
  ('541659052245423456', 'The Shrouds', 2025, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Horror, Drama, Mystery', 'David Cronenberg, David Warry-Smith, Ken A. Smith', 'David Cronenberg', 'Vincent Cassel, Diane Kruger, Guy Pearce, Sandrine Holt, Elizabeth Saunders, Jennifer Dale, Eric Weinthal, Jeff Yung', 'R', 'Inconsolable since the death of his wife, Karsh, a prominent businessman, invents a revolutionary and controversial technology that enables the living to monitor their dear departed in their shrouds. One night, multiple graves, including that of Karsh’s wife, are desecrated, and he sets out to track down the perpetrators.', 'Inconsolable since the death of his wife, Karsh, a prominent businessman, invents a revolutionary and controversial technology that enables the living to monitor their dear departed in their shrouds. One night, multiple graves, including that of Karsh’s wife, are desecrated, and he sets out to track down the perpetrators.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6J4lPto3rjlHZwhIhCy9cOWNnqb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:970947'),
  ('531057272271337814', 'The Shuttered Room', 1967, 'Drama, Mystery, Horror', 'David Greene, Ken Hodges', 'D.B. Ledrov, Nat Tanchuck', 'Gig Young, Carol Lynley, Oliver Reed, Flora Robson, Judith Arthy, Ann Bell, William Devlin, Charles Lloyd Pack', null, 'In a small island off the American coast, the Whateleys live in an old mill where a mysterious bloody being creates an atmosphere of horror. After her parents get killed by lightning, young Susannah is sent to New York by her aunt Agatha, who wants her to avoid the family curse. Years later Susannah, now married, persuades her husband to spend a holiday in the abandoned mill. Once on the island, Susannah and Mike soon find themselves exposed to the hostility of a gang of thugs led by Ethan, Susannah''s brutal cousin.', 'In a small island off the American coast, the Whateleys live in an old mill where a mysterious bloody being creates an atmosphere of horror. After her parents get killed by lightning, young Susannah is sent to New York by her aunt Agatha, who wants her to avoid the family curse. Years later Susannah, now married, persuades her husband to spend a holiday in the abandoned mill. Once on the island, Susannah and Mike soon find themselves exposed to the hostility of a gang of thugs led by Ethan, Susannah''s brutal cousin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fyRqdjKyBzv23A5AclQFSe71leC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93939'),
  ('53077247625140940', 'The Sicilian', 1987, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Michael Cimino, Alex Thomson, Michael Stevenson', 'Steve Shagan, Gore Vidal', 'Christopher Lambert, Terence Stamp, Joss Ackland, John Turturro, Richard Bauer, Barbara Sukowa, Giulia Boschi, Ray McAnally', 'R', 'Egocentric bandit Salvatore Giuliano fights the Church, the Mafia, and the landed gentry while leading a populist movement for Sicilian independence.', 'Egocentric bandit Salvatore Giuliano fights the Church, the Mafia, and the landed gentry while leading a populist movement for Sicilian independence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3zjrYyAtTs0uxX1a4hhDR3Ir5Rz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31945'),
  ('1089353480067895911', 'The Sicilian Clan', 1969, 'Crime, Drama', 'Henri Verneuil, Henri Decaë, Bernard Stora', 'José Giovanni, Henri Verneuil, Pierre Pelegri', 'Jean Gabin, Alain Delon, Lino Ventura, Irina Demick, Amedeo Nazzari, Yves Lefebvre, Philippe Baronnet, Marc Porel', 'PG', 'An ambitious mobster plans an elaborate diamond heist while seducing the daughter-in-law of a ruthless mob patriarch as a determined police commissioner closes in on all of them.', 'An ambitious mobster plans an elaborate diamond heist while seducing the daughter-in-law of a ruthless mob patriarch as a determined police commissioner closes in on all of them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uVBbDPbm1H4Z9M7uZ976KFaAjDR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4235'),
  ('432458993465319675', 'The Sicilian Connection', 1972, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Ferdinando Baldi, Aiace Parolin', 'Duilio Coletti, Ferdinando Baldi', 'Ben Gazzara, Silvia Monti, Fausto Tozzi, Jess Hahn, José Greci, Malisa Longo, Mario Pilar, Luciano Catenacci', null, 'A small time hood smuggles drugs from Turkey to Italy in an effort to make it into the big time, but along the way everyone has to have their cut.', 'A small time hood smuggles drugs from Turkey to Italy in an effort to make it into the big time, but along the way everyone has to have their cut.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6iesddLTvBE7KbogIu6xhlCNcPE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:240607'),
  ('681169091542605567', 'The Sicilian Connection', 1985, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Damiano Damiani, Sebastiano Celeste, Luigi Vallini', 'Laura Toscano, Damiano Damiani, Franco Marotta', 'Michele Placido, Mark Chase, Simona Cavallari, Massimo De Francovich, Renato Mori, Domenico Gennaro, Adriana Russo, Francesco Sciacca', null, 'An Italian-American pizzeria manager returns to Sicily to assassinate a judge, enlisting his honest younger brother for help. As the brother''s morals clash with the task, the only way to save him is through a sacrifice that appeases the mafia.', 'An Italian-American pizzeria manager returns to Sicily to assassinate a judge, enlisting his honest younger brother for help. As the brother''s morals clash with the task, the only way to save him is through a sacrifice that appeases the mafia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cAVR6NTEVoX2njwALl9eC8XhHTf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40982'),
  ('332906754248466064', 'The Sicilian Girl', 2008, 'Drama', 'Marco Amenta, Luca Bigazzi', 'Sergio Donati, Marco Amenta, Gianni Romoli', 'Veronica D''Agostino, Marcello Mazzarella, Gérard Jugnot, Francesco Casisa, Paolo Briguglia, Mario Pupella, Giulia Andò, Robarto Bonura', null, 'Inspired to a true story, on November 5th 1991, Rita Atria a young 17-year-old Sicilian girl, goes to see an anti-Mafia judge Paolo Borsellino to denounce the Mafia system that was responsible for the murder of her father and her brother. It is the first time that such a young woman from a Mafia family rebels and betrays the Mafia. From that moment on, Rita''s days are numbered. She only has nine months to live...', 'Inspired to a true story, on November 5th 1991, Rita Atria a young 17-year-old Sicilian girl, goes to see an anti-Mafia judge Paolo Borsellino to denounce the Mafia system that was responsible for the murder of her father and her brother. It is the first time that such a young woman from a Mafia family rebels and betrays the Mafia. From that moment on, Rita''s days are numbered. She only has nine months to live...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4uJv2reiF1EgwVzslS2LtlZoVxL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31111'),
  ('623857172143189730', 'The Sicily Barbers', 1967, 'Comedy', 'Tino Santoni, Giuliano Carnimeo, Marcello Ciorciolini', 'Marcello Ciorciolini, Dino Verde, Roberto Gianviti', 'Franco Franchi, Ciccio Ingrassia, Carlo Hintermann, Daniela Giordano, Jean Valmont, Giorgia Moll, Adriana Facchetti, Franco Pesce', null, 'In a little Sicilian village two hairdressers who are in love with the same girl manage to sabotage the bacteriological weapons the Nazis are preparing to use against the allied armies invasion.', 'In a little Sicilian village two hairdressers who are in love with the same girl manage to sabotage the bacteriological weapons the Nazis are preparing to use against the allied armies invasion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/87aMNSucblay7P16GGDSULCVL4Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:315965'),
