  ('547148520910958714', 'The Siege', 1998, 'Drama, Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Edward Zwick, Roger Deakins, Jess Gonchor', 'Lawrence Wright, Menno Meyjes, Edward Zwick', 'Denzel Washington, Annette Bening, Bruce Willis, Tony Shalhoub, Sami Bouajila, Aasif Mandvi, Mark Valley, Jack Gwaltney', 'R', 'The secret US abduction of a suspected terrorist from his Middle East homeland leads to a wave of terrorist attacks in New York. An FBI senior agent and his team attempt to locate and decommission the enemy cells, but must also deal with an Army General gone rogue and a female CIA agent of uncertain loyalties.', 'The secret US abduction of a suspected terrorist from his Middle East homeland leads to a wave of terrorist attacks in New York. An FBI senior agent and his team attempt to locate and decommission the enemy cells, but must also deal with an Army General gone rogue and a female CIA agent of uncertain loyalties.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gbeeWu8rYaIYMyq9ayN1AepjNxP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9882'),
  ('168958194638035', 'The Siege', 2023, 'Action, Thriller', 'Brad Watson, James Oldham', 'Nicole Bartlett', 'Daniel Stisen, Lauren Okadigbo, Yennis Cheung, Byron Gibson, Steven Blades, Samantha Schnitzler, Michael Billington, Michael Geary', 'R', 'International assassin Walker is compromised during a mission and sent to a reassignment center for a new identity. During his stay at the facility, a ruthless assault team storms the compound searching for someone their boss has lost. Walker begrudgingly falls in with skilled hitwoman Elda and her mysterious ward Juliet in order to survive the night.', 'International assassin Walker is compromised during a mission and sent to a reassignment center for a new identity. During his stay at the facility, a ruthless assault team storms the compound searching for someone their boss has lost. Walker begrudgingly falls in with skilled hitwoman Elda and her mysterious ward Juliet in order to survive the night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hVh4hMzkXNLnScudbid6hDvjMPk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1092899'),
  ('214769530885826358', 'The Siege at Ruby Ridge', 1996, 'Drama, History, TV Movie', 'Roger Young, Donald M. Morgan, Todd Y. Murata', 'Lionel Chetwynd', 'Laura Dern, Randy Quaid, Kirsten Dunst, Darren E. Burrows, G.W. Bailey, Bradley Pierce, Gary Graham, August Schellenberg', null, 'A mini-series dramatization of the controversial 1992 attack by federal agents on the Idaho home of Randy Weaver, a white seperatist. The ten-day siege, begun over a minor gun charge, resulted in the deaths of Weaver''s son, wife and dog, and a U.S. Marshall. The incident caused major public outcry against the FBI and U.S. Marshals.', 'A mini-series dramatization of the controversial 1992 attack by federal agents on the Idaho home of Randy Weaver, a white seperatist. The ten-day siege, begun over a minor gun charge, resulted in the deaths of Weaver''s son, wife and dog, and a U.S. Marshall. The incident caused major public outcry against the FBI and U.S. Marshals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6dgB0nOdPKPOkkbSJFUYvYazVvZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68148'),
  ('1130690535632412646', 'The Siege at Thorn High', 2025, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Joko Anwar, Ical Tanjung, Rieviena Yulietta', 'Joko Anwar', 'Morgan Oey, Omara Esteghlal, Hana Malasan, Endy Arfian, Fatih Unru, Dewa Dayana, Satine Zaneta, Florian Rutters', 'NR', 'Edwin promised to his sister on her deathbed to find her son she gave up a long time ago. Edwin''s quest brought him to become a substitute teacher in Duri High School, Jakarta, a school for juvenile delinquents. There he must face the most violent students to find his nephew. When he eventually finds the boy, a city-wide riot erupts and Edwin is trapped in the school with the cruel kids out for his blood.', 'Edwin promised to his sister on her deathbed to find her son she gave up a long time ago. Edwin''s quest brought him to become a substitute teacher in Duri High School, Jakarta, a school for juvenile delinquents. There he must face the most violent students to find his nephew. When he eventually finds the boy, a city-wide riot erupts and Edwin is trapped in the school with the cruel kids out for his blood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uis9PJkI6WHRczCumsfPFaaUAxm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1280089'),
  ('910746779511030854', 'The Siege of Firebase Gloria', 1989, 'Action, War', 'Brian Trenchard-Smith, Kevan Lind', 'William L. Nagle, Tony Johnston', 'Wings Hauser, R. Lee Ermey, Robert Arevalo, Margaret Gerard, Mark Neely, Gary Hershberger, Clyde Jones, Richard Kuhlman', 'R', 'A Marine patrol stops at Firebase Gloria at the start of the Tet Offensive during the Vietnam war. With the firebase attacked, the patrol remains to help defend it.', 'A Marine patrol stops at Firebase Gloria at the start of the Tet Offensive during the Vietnam war. With the firebase attacked, the patrol remains to help defend it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cAN1OLcfRt6ONQOLGGGEcAtC6tn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33545'),
