  ('371596182276384757', 'The Siege of Robin Hood', 2022, 'Adventure, Action', 'Paul Allica', 'Celbeth Andreovski, Don MacNab-Stark, Paul Allica', 'Paul Allica, John Fallon, Peter Roordink, Keanu Gonzalez, Dave Beamish, Kahli Williams, David Macrae, Tom McCathie', 'R', 'In a time of chaos and tyranny, the once great nation of England teeters perilously on the brink of mass revolution. After the merciless Sheriff of Nottingham orders a brutal attack on his family, a young man named Robin swears bloody revenge on the men responsible, vowing to restore freedom to those trapped under the realm’s oppressive rule. Advised and mentored by the reclusive magician Merlin, Robin and his right-hand man Lancelot recruit a deadly team of exiled fighters and skilled mavericks to rally the villagers for an explosive all-out assault on the Crown’s castle.', 'In a time of chaos and tyranny, the once great nation of England teeters perilously on the brink of mass revolution. After the merciless Sheriff of Nottingham orders a brutal attack on his family, a young man named Robin swears bloody revenge on the men responsible, vowing to restore freedom to those trapped under the realm’s oppressive rule. Advised and mentored by the reclusive magician Merlin, Robin and his right-hand man Lancelot recruit a deadly team of exiled fighters and skilled mavericks to rally the villagers for an explosive all-out assault on the Crown’s castle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zetKhTVOuScOavtqi2sQT14vcyR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:829577'),
  ('1150799777316279224', 'The Sight', 2000, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Paul W. S. Anderson, David Johnson', 'Paul W. S. Anderson', 'Andrew McCarthy, Kevin Tighe, Amanda Redman, Jessica Oyelowo, David Roper, Honor Blackman, Alexander Armstrong, Julian Firth', 'PG-13', 'The American successful architect Michael Lewis travels to London with his partner and friend, the builder Jake, to refurbish an old hotel. Michael is having successive nightmares, and once in London, he realizes that twenty-one spirits are trying to contact him to solve murders of a serial killer. Michael, with the support of Jake, Detective Pryce and the ghosts, try to avoid the ninth crime and find the serial-killer.', 'The American successful architect Michael Lewis travels to London with his partner and friend, the builder Jake, to refurbish an old hotel. Michael is having successive nightmares, and once in London, he realizes that twenty-one spirits are trying to contact him to solve murders of a serial killer. Michael, with the support of Jake, Detective Pryce and the ghosts, try to avoid the ninth crime and find the serial-killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/98XPZYfh2zRxrgcpOgAwVLOYOOq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71550'),
  ('758605204935163488', 'The Sign of Chaos', 2003, 'Drama', 'Rogério Sganzerla, Marcos Bonisson, Nélio Ferreira', 'Rogério Sganzerla', 'Otávio Terceiro, Sálvio do Prado, Helena Ignez, Guará Rodrigues, Freddy Ribeiro, Vânia de Magalhães, Anita Terrana, Felipe Murray', null, 'A customs agent, Dr. Amnésio, examines some reels of film, a documentary Orson Welles made about Brazil, and tries to confiscate the material. Then, a party in which repression agents celebrate their victory against freedom and creativity.', 'A customs agent, Dr. Amnésio, examines some reels of film, a documentary Orson Welles made about Brazil, and tries to confiscate the material. Then, a party in which repression agents celebrate their victory against freedom and creativity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tsT6xjexwybfXuEmedmGQDV5y0r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:183059'),
