  ('39281710005316875', 'The Silence of Joan', 2011, 'History', 'Philippe Ramos, Philippe Ramos', 'Philippe Ramos', 'Clémence Poésy, Thierry Frémont, Liam Cunningham, Mathieu Amalric, Louis-Do de Lencquesaing, Jean-François Stévenin, Johan Leysen, Bernard Blancan', null, 'In 1430, Joan of Arc, the prisoner of a powerful lord of the north of France is sold to the English. As a captive awaiting her death, she is approached by different men for whom she is believed to be the embodiment of the infinite.', 'In 1430, Joan of Arc, the prisoner of a powerful lord of the north of France is sold to the English. As a captive awaiting her death, she is approached by different men for whom she is believed to be the embodiment of the infinite.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/muBdRsWm5VLWulFiGRF5KhTlmwp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110954'),
  ('552227936411130994', 'The Silence of Marcos Tremmer', 2024, 'Drama, Romance', 'Miguel García de la Calera, Analía Pollio', 'Javier Dampierre, Ricardo Urroz', 'Benjamín Vicuña, Adriana Ugarte, Félix Gómez, Daniel Hendler, Mirta Busnelli, Hony Estrella, Irene Ferreiro, Julián Valcárcel', null, 'Marcos Tremmer is a successful publicist who lives in Madrid, madly in love with his wife, Lucía. One day, Marcos discovers that a deadly disease will end his life in a few months.', 'Marcos Tremmer is a successful publicist who lives in Madrid, madly in love with his wife, Lucía. One day, Marcos discovers that a deadly disease will end his life in a few months.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jB26CKrdHYbqZPKotbUfieqkbNl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1387957'),
  ('339472526882999919', 'The Silence of Others', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Almudena Carracedo, Robert Bahar, Almudena Carracedo', 'Almudena Carracedo', 'Ana Messuti, Ascensión Mendieta, Carlos Slepoy, Felisa Echegoyen, José María Galante, María Martín, Maria Servini, María Ángeles Martín', null, 'The story of the tortuous struggle against the silence of the victims of the dictatorship imposed by General Franco after the victory of the rebel side in the Spanish Civil War (1936-1975). In a democratic country, but still ideologically divided, the survivors seek justice as they organize the so-called “Argentinian lawsuit” and denounce the legally sanctioned pact of oblivion that intends to hide the crimes they were subjects of.', 'The story of the tortuous struggle against the silence of the victims of the dictatorship imposed by General Franco after the victory of the rebel side in the Spanish Civil War (1936-1975). In a democratic country, but still ideologically divided, the survivors seek justice as they organize the so-called “Argentinian lawsuit” and denounce the legally sanctioned pact of oblivion that intends to hide the crimes they were subjects of.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1mokbbJue9a60PJy1r1lyra8RjD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:500850'),
  ('335532058184890851', 'The Silence of Pelešjan', 2011, 'Documentary', 'Pietro Marcello', 'Pietro Marcello', 'Artavazd Peleshian, Aleksandr Medvedkin, Vasiliy Shukshin, Alexandra Khokhlova, Alexei Leonov', null, 'A documentary about the Armenian avant-garde filmmaker, Artavazd Pelešjan.', 'A documentary about the Armenian avant-garde filmmaker, Artavazd Pelešjan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g9ajLDcmpIRgnyzS4mqvqaJg1HY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:202208'),
  ('980785105983291291', 'The Silence of Snow', 2026, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Malin Dahl, Johnny Wernersson', 'Malin Dahl, Johnny Wernersson', 'Marie-Anne Persson, Malin Dahl, Johnny Wernersson', null, 'Aftermath of a suicide, grief and longing collide with memories of a relationship marked by violence. Fragments of the past and a lingering presence haunts the shared home as a woman struggles to make sense and find a way forward.', 'Aftermath of a suicide, grief and longing collide with memories of a relationship marked by violence. Fragments of the past and a lingering presence haunts the shared home as a woman struggles to make sense and find a way forward.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FnhnTJVMwhpkxTytBWpyqT5iRYQg.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-silence-of-snow-2026'),
  ('373596033568926097', 'The Silence of the Church', 2013, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Edwin Baily, Virginie Saint-Martin', 'Thierry Debroux', 'Robin Renucci, Robinson Stévenin, Astrid Whettnall, Sandrine Blancke, Bernard Eylenbosch, Florian Vigilante', null, 'At the age of 12, Gabriel was sexually abused by Father Vincey, his headmaster. Fifteen years later, he is still traumatized. Constantly racked by this wrong that he has kept secret, Gabriel buys a gun and moves in near the boarding school where the priest is still headmaster...', 'At the age of 12, Gabriel was sexually abused by Father Vincey, his headmaster. Fifteen years later, he is still traumatized. Constantly racked by this wrong that he has kept secret, Gabriel buys a gun and moves in near the boarding school where the priest is still headmaster...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vagtGDTpS6Fm7qpXk8AlBDVDAZ7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:184801'),
  ('142339711676959577', 'The Silence of the Donkeys', 2023, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Karl Markovics, Leena Koppe', 'Karl Markovics', 'Karl Markovics, Julia Koch, Caroline Frank, Gerhard Liebmann, Valentin Sottopietra, Klaus Windisch, Tobias Fend, Julian Sark', null, 'Fake detective Jonas Horak is now in custody after being arrested by police officer Sophie Landner. A series of murders has Horak on edge, and he fears a serial killer is targeting him.', 'Fake detective Jonas Horak is now in custody after being arrested by police officer Sophie Landner. A series of murders has Horak on edge, and he fears a serial killer is targeting him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kStPCFG9xQtT41UfBgsvm7nIPSJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1154955'),
  ('752823811113113374', 'The Silence of the Hams', 1994, 'Thriller, Comedy', 'Ezio Greggio, Jacques Haitkin, Craig Campobasso', 'Ezio Greggio', 'Ezio Greggio, Dom DeLuise, Billy Zane, Joanna Pacula, Charlene Tilton, Martin Balsam, Stuart Pankin, John Astin', 'R', 'Rookie FBI agent Jo Dee Foster has been assigned to work on the case of the Psycho Killer, a psycho killer who has psycho-killed over 120 people. But to learn more about the Psycho Killer, Jo is forced to meet Dr. Animal Cannibal Pizza, a famous doctor turned cannibal who ate pizzas with human body parts. Meanwhile, Jo''s girlfriend Jane Wine has just stolen $400,000 in cash from her money-hungry boss, Mr. Laurel, so she and Jo can be happy, but gets lost in a horrible storm, caused mostly by a special effects crew behind her car, and stops at the Cemetery Motel, where the owner, Antonio Motel, is dominated by his insane mother.', 'Rookie FBI agent Jo Dee Foster has been assigned to work on the case of the Psycho Killer, a psycho killer who has psycho-killed over 120 people. But to learn more about the Psycho Killer, Jo is forced to meet Dr. Animal Cannibal Pizza, a famous doctor turned cannibal who ate pizzas with human body parts. Meanwhile, Jo''s girlfriend Jane Wine has just stolen $400,000 in cash from her money-hungry boss, Mr. Laurel, so she and Jo can be happy, but gets lost in a horrible storm, caused mostly by a special effects crew behind her car, and stops at the Cemetery Motel, where the owner, Antonio Motel, is dominated by his insane mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s4mxntM3FM7joVGz1LECSGfvYtm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10450'),
  ('1001261666362970864', 'The Silence of the Marsh', 2019, 'Thriller', 'Marc Vigil, Isaac Vila, Sergio Francisco', 'Sara Antuña, Carlos de Pando', 'Pedro Alonso, Nacho Fresneda, Carmina Barrios, Àlex Monner, Zaira Romero, Maite Sandoval, Javier Godino, José Ángel Egido', null, 'A successful, cold-blooded crime novelist gets involved in a kidnapping case while uncovering the corrupt ties between politicians and the local mafia in Valencia, Spain.', 'A successful, cold-blooded crime novelist gets involved in a kidnapping case while uncovering the corrupt ties between politicians and the local mafia in Valencia, Spain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vwBelKkECxMdN1UMhwqitPIFsjB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:632931'),
  ('804899940842275288', 'The Silence of The Rain', 2020, 'Crime', 'Bruno Garotti, Pedro Barbalho, Daniel Filho', 'Lusa Silvestre', 'Lázaro Ramos, Thalita Carauta, Mayana Neiva, Peter Brandão, Cláudia Abreu, Pedro Nercessian, Otávio Müller, Bruno Gissoni', null, 'When executive Ricardo is found shot dead in the seat of his car without suspicion, Inspector Espinosa and police officer Daia are in charge of the case and soon begin to investigate the people closest to the victim. But when everyone involved in the case mysteriously disappears, the situation takes on unexpected proportions.', 'When executive Ricardo is found shot dead in the seat of his car without suspicion, Inspector Espinosa and police officer Daia are in charge of the case and soon begin to investigate the people closest to the victim. But when everyone involved in the case mysteriously disappears, the situation takes on unexpected proportions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8nUWNGJYNx4Y4WDIe9kJkgeFBfK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:747016'),
  ('276069751463969116', 'The Silence of the Sky', 2016, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Marco Dutra, Nina Kopko, Germán Zecchi', 'Sergio Bizzio, Caetano Gotardo, Lucía Puenzo', 'Leonardo Sbaraglia, Carolina Dieckmmann, Chino Darín, Álvaro Armand Ugón, Mirella Pascual, Roberto Suárez, Paula Cohen, Dylan Cortés', null, 'After being a victim of rape within their own home, Diana chooses to keep the trauma secret. Mario, her husband, also has something to hide. The silence takes the couple''s account over the day turns gradually into a peculiar form of violence.', 'After being a victim of rape within their own home, Diana chooses to keep the trauma secret. Mario, her husband, also has something to hide. The silence takes the couple''s account over the day turns gradually into a peculiar form of violence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bE5cuGJEEM5nXSGMCcfhYPw8UtQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:413388'),
  ('400041490604766388', 'The Silenced', 2015, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Lee Hae-young, Kim Il-yeon, Kim Min-jae', 'Lee Hae-young', 'Park Bo-young, Uhm Ji-won, Park So-dam, Kong Ye-ji, Sim Hee-seop, Go Won-hee, Keum Sae-rok, Joo Bo-bi', null, 'A sickly girl Ju-ran transfers to a new sanitorium boarding school to regain health. But she discovers that students are disappearing and notices abnormal changes happening to her body. She suspects the school for what''s happening and tries to discover what secret is hidden.', 'A sickly girl Ju-ran transfers to a new sanitorium boarding school to regain health. But she discovers that students are disappearing and notices abnormal changes happening to her body. She suspects the school for what''s happening and tries to discover what secret is hidden.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hNXiG7fYDwnnpBU2qPlwEI84SLS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:342657'),
  ('883942909671471643', 'The Silencers', 1966, 'Comedy, Action, Adventure', 'Phil Karlson, Burnett Guffey, Clark L. Paylow', 'Oscar Saul', 'Dean Martin, Stella Stevens, Daliah Lavi, Victor Buono, Arthur O''Connell, Robert Webber, James Gregory, Nancy Kovack', 'NR', 'Matt Helm is called out of retirement to stop the evil Big O organization who plan to explode an atomic bomb over Alamagordo, NM, and start WW III.', 'Matt Helm is called out of retirement to stop the evil Big O organization who plan to explode an atomic bomb over Alamagordo, NM, and start WW III.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eLxVPMCV3IWiOKwxRKoSZqpT8lY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21779'),
  ('860861112585985156', 'The Silencers', 1996, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Richard Pepin, Ken Blakey, Cole S. McKay', 'Joseph John Barmettler', 'Jack Scalia, Dennis Christopher, Carlos Lauchu, Lucinda Weist, Terri Poch, Bill Frenzer, Christopher Kriesa, Jeffrey Broadhurst', null, 'U.S. Senator is assassinated by Men in Black, mysterious organization which suppresses all knowledge about UFOs. Agent Rafferty from the U.S. Secret Service will confront them and discover the sinister truth. The only person that can help him comes from another world.', 'U.S. Senator is assassinated by Men in Black, mysterious organization which suppresses all knowledge about UFOs. Agent Rafferty from the U.S. Secret Service will confront them and discover the sinister truth. The only person that can help him comes from another world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Osmx5YAaxeQSJLrmtMjZ9sfh32.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26832'),
  ('1019369699632359271', 'The Silences', 2019, 'Drama', 'Beatriz Seigner, Sofia Oggioni, Julia Medeiros', 'Beatriz Seigner', 'Marleyda Soto, Enrique Díaz, María Paula Tabares Peña, Adolfo Savinvino, Astrid Fernanda López MartÍnez, Doña Albina, Yerson Castellanos, Alida Pandurro', null, 'Nuria, 12, Fabio, 9, and their mother arrive on a small island in the middle of the Amazon, bordering Brazil, Colombia and Peru. They fled the Colombian armed conflict, in which their father disappeared. One day, he mysteriously reappears in their new home.', 'Nuria, 12, Fabio, 9, and their mother arrive on a small island in the middle of the Amazon, bordering Brazil, Colombia and Peru. They fled the Colombian armed conflict, in which their father disappeared. One day, he mysteriously reappears in their new home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4TP4XmM0w3lUnzn65lM4jkNS1li.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:519121'),
  ('956504945708084472', 'The Silences of the Palace', 1994, 'Drama', 'Moufida Tlatli, Youssef Ben Youssef, Mounir Baaziz', 'Moufida Tlatli, Nouri Bouzid', 'Hend Sabry, Ghalya Lacroix, Nejia Ouerghi, Amel Hedhili, Kamel Fazaa, Fatima Ben Saïdane, Zahira Ben Ammar, Sabah Bouzouita', null, 'The death of a prince brings a young woman back to the palace where she was born into servitude. The lingering legacy is brought into light from behind frosted windows and velvet curtains.', 'The death of a prince brings a young woman back to the palace where she was born into servitude. The lingering legacy is brought into light from behind frosted windows and velvet curtains.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c8QQRaI3k3LNUqYKmlKldhLpgYK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44284'),
  ('1152307896853771864', 'The Silencing', 2020, 'Thriller, Action, Crime', 'Aurèle Gaudet, Sara Kay, Jenny Lewis', 'Micah Ranum', 'Nikolaj Coster-Waldau, Annabelle Wallis, Zahn McClarnon, Melanie Scrofano, Hero Fiennes Tiffin, Patrick Garrow, Danielle Ryan, Shaun Smyth', 'R', 'A reformed hunter becomes involved in a deadly game of cat and mouse when he and the local sheriff set out to track a vicious killer who may have kidnapped his daughter years ago.', 'A reformed hunter becomes involved in a deadly game of cat and mouse when he and the local sheriff set out to track a vicious killer who may have kidnapped his daughter years ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dnN1ncxEOO1TY0gYL2FWxJqlhlL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:603119'),
  ('730031304040447339', 'The Silent Army', 2008, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Theo van de Sande, Jean van de Velde', 'Jean van de Velde', 'Marco Borsato, Thekla Reuten, Ricky Koole, Jacqueline Blom, Peter van den Begin', null, 'Eduard Zuiderwijk (Marco Borsato) runs a restaurant in Africa. When his wife (Ricky Koole) suddenly dies, he is left to take care of his son Thomas (Siebe Schoneveld) on his own. When his son''s best friend Abu (Andrew Kintu) is abducted by a rebel leader to be trained as a child soldier, Eduard goes in pursuit to save the boy and regain his son''s respect.', 'Eduard Zuiderwijk (Marco Borsato) runs a restaurant in Africa. When his wife (Ricky Koole) suddenly dies, he is left to take care of his son Thomas (Siebe Schoneveld) on his own. When his son''s best friend Abu (Andrew Kintu) is abducted by a rebel leader to be trained as a child soldier, Eduard goes in pursuit to save the boy and regain his son''s respect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lx0BSGJmmNRHvVo8AWu173Ou9RA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17772'),
  ('505152843278657707', 'The Silent Child', 2017, 'Drama', 'Chris Overton, Ali Farahani', 'Rachel Shenton', 'Maisie Sly, Rachel Shenton, Rachel Fielding, Anna Barry, Philip York, Sam Rees, Annie Cusselle, Marilyn Willrich', null, 'A deaf 4-year-old girl named Libby lives in a world of silence until a caring social worker teaches her to use sign language to communicate.', 'A deaf 4-year-old girl named Libby lives in a world of silence until a caring social worker teaches her to use sign language to communicate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mnaMZZeuLvOTpa1niyGel7um6IM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:492223'),
  ('636146512682126315', 'The Silent City', 2006, 'Science Fiction, War', 'Ruairi Robinson', 'Ruairi Robinson', 'Don Wycherley, Garvan Mcgrath, Cillian Murphy', null, 'The story revolves around 3 soldiers who are on the outskirts of a war torn city. They are patrolling an area when a bomb is accidentally set off and they have to wait for help.', 'The story revolves around 3 soldiers who are on the outskirts of a war torn city. They are patrolling an area when a bomb is accidentally set off and they have to wait for help.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iGRHOhGEB4I6DfKzVWQ2mYx6gjW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34083'),
  ('805984244159247338', 'The Silent Enemy', 1930, 'Documentary, Drama', 'H.P. Carver, Earl M. Welch, Marcel Le Picard', null, 'Chief Yellow Robe, Chief Buffalo Child Long Lance, Chief Akawanush, Molly Spotted Elk, Cheeka, Mali Spotted Elk', 'NR', 'In the Canadian Northwest, the Chippewa tribe struggles to find food before the onset of winter.', 'In the Canadian Northwest, the Chippewa tribe struggles to find food before the onset of winter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jc0OoyagxP0jfREtFrxBKZupCvY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151052'),
  ('225341042173612120', 'The Silent Enemy', 1958, 'History, War', 'William Fairchild', 'William Fairchild', 'Laurence Harvey, Michael Craig, Dawn Addams, John Clements, Sidney James, Alec McCowen, Nigel Stock, Ian Whittaker', 'NR', 'The Mediterranean, 1941/42 - Axis forces are using frogmen and manned torpedoes to attack previously impregnable harbours. The Allied forces need to come up with something to answer this threat, which they find in the form of Lt. Lionel "Buster" Crabb.', 'The Mediterranean, 1941/42 - Axis forces are using frogmen and manned torpedoes to attack previously impregnable harbours. The Allied forces need to come up with something to answer this threat, which they find in the form of Lt. Lionel "Buster" Crabb.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9srqtNqB5onJTSNeia5RjPFJuDZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25387'),
  ('967704604241742455', 'The Silent Forest', 2020, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Leslie Chuang, Alex Hsu, Chen-Nien Ko', 'Pin-Jun Lin, Chen-Nien Ko', 'Troy Liu, Buffy Chen, Kim Hyun-bin, Liu Kuan-ting, Yang Kuei-mei, Tai Bo, Chang Pen-Yu, Cheng-Fang Pao', null, 'Hearing-impaired teenager Chang Cheng transfers to a school for children with special needs. However, the world of the hearing-impaired doesn’t seem quiet at all. When Chang witnesses the game taking place in the last row on the school bus, his excitement about blending into a new environment immediately turns into fear.', 'Hearing-impaired teenager Chang Cheng transfers to a school for children with special needs. However, the world of the hearing-impaired doesn’t seem quiet at all. When Chang witnesses the game taking place in the last row on the school bus, his excitement about blending into a new environment immediately turns into fear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mzdEAxwkTCXBG1EKOblIkemQ6l8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:717395'),
  ('463079380943082327', 'The Silent Forest', 2022, 'Mystery, Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Saralisa Volm, Roland Stuprich, Stephanie Maile', 'Wolfram Fleischhauer', 'Henriette Confurius, Robert Stadlober, Noah Saavedra, August Zirner, Johanna Bittenbinder, Christoph Jungmann, Johannes Herrschmann, Moritz Katzmair', null, 'As a forestry student doing an internship, Anja Grimm ends up in that remote area in the Upper Palatinate Forest, where she went on vacation with her parents as an eight-year-old girl and her father disappeared without a trace. Her job is to take soil samples to create a soil map. At one point in the forest floor she comes across abnormal irregularities. Not long after their arrival, a brutal murder occurs. Anja soon arouses suspicion and hostility not only among the villagers with her suspicion that the perpetrator knows something about her father''s fate and with her questions about the atypical soil composition in the forest clearing. Even the police react extremely reservedly to their investigations. And when it turns out that the young woman can read the signs of the forest like an open book, forces mobilize in the village who are apparently ready for anything because there is a dark secret that needs to be kept.', 'As a forestry student doing an internship, Anja Grimm ends up in that remote area in the Upper Palatinate Forest, where she went on vacation with her parents as an eight-year-old girl and her father disappeared without a trace. Her job is to take soil samples to create a soil map. At one point in the forest floor she comes across abnormal irregularities. Not long after their arrival, a brutal murder occurs. Anja soon arouses suspicion and hostility not only among the villagers with her suspicion that the perpetrator knows something about her father''s fate and with her questions about the atypical soil composition in the forest clearing. Even the police react extremely reservedly to their investigations. And when it turns out that the young woman can read the signs of the forest like an open book, forces mobilize in the village who are apparently ready for anything because there is a dark secret that needs to be kept.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xdJwvRM6sVbEccPaVsavWSYCeAM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:926967'),
  ('893936787881396136', 'The Silent Hour', 2024, 'Crime, Thriller, Action', 'Brad Anderson, Dan Gibling, Will McDonagh', 'Dan Hall', 'Joel Kinnaman, Sandra Mae Frank, Mekhi Phifer, Mark Strong, Michael Eklund, Anthony Grant, Jonathan Koensgen, Mike Parish', 'R', 'While working a case as an interpreter, a hearing-impaired police detective must confront a group of criminals trying to eliminate a deaf murder witness in her apartment building.', 'While working a case as an interpreter, a hearing-impaired police detective must confront a group of criminals trying to eliminate a deaf murder witness in her apartment building.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j736cRzBtEPCm0nHnpRN1prqiqj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1047373'),
  ('447384055916856630', 'The Silent House', 2010, 'Drama, Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Gustavo Hernández, Juan Ponce de León, Hernán González Villamil', 'Oscar Estévez', 'Florencia Colucci, Abel Tripaldi, Gustavo Alonso, María Salazar', null, 'Laura and her father Wilson arrive at a cottage off the beaten path in order to repair it since its owner will soon put the house on sale. They will spend the night there in order to start the repairs the following morning. Everything seems to go on smoothly until Laura hears a sound that comes from outside and gets louder and louder in the upper floor of the house. Wilson goes up to see what is going on while she remains downstairs on her own waiting for her father to come down. The plot is based on a true story that occurred in the 1940s in a small village in Uruguay. La casa muda focuses on the last seventy eight minutes, second by second, as Laura tries to leave the house unharmed and discovers the dark secret it hides.', 'Laura and her father Wilson arrive at a cottage off the beaten path in order to repair it since its owner will soon put the house on sale. They will spend the night there in order to start the repairs the following morning. Everything seems to go on smoothly until Laura hears a sound that comes from outside and gets louder and louder in the upper floor of the house. Wilson goes up to see what is going on while she remains downstairs on her own waiting for her father to come down. The plot is based on a true story that occurred in the 1940s in a small village in Uruguay. La casa muda focuses on the last seventy eight minutes, second by second, as Laura tries to leave the house unharmed and discovers the dark secret it hides.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lVl4kAIVswaPR2mmgUMQ1seYoj9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56180'),
  ('44798600051959889', 'The Silent Majority', 1987, null, 'Mehrnaz Saeed-Vafa', null, 'Julio Cavalero, Eduardo Gasca, April Sopkin, Farzin Yazdanfar', null, 'The 8 minute short is open to interpretation as it examines the inner thoughts of several people around a table, with the Rita Hayworth version of Put the Blame on Mame playing on the soundtrack.', 'The 8 minute short is open to interpretation as it examines the inner thoughts of several people around a table, with the Rita Hayworth version of Put the Blame on Mame playing on the soundtrack.', null, 'tmdb:movie:195024'),
  ('414495225339222290', 'The Silent Mountain', 2014, 'War, Adventure, Drama, Romance', 'Ernst Gossner, Daniela Knapp', 'Clemens Aufderklamm', 'William Moseley, Eugenia Costantini, Claudia Cardinale, Werner Daehn, Corrado Invernizzi, Michael Cadeddu, Fritz Karl, Julia Gschnitzer', null, 'A young Austrian soldier in World War I fights his way through the Alps to rescue his Italian girlfriend and escape the impending explosion that will rock the mountain.', 'A young Austrian soldier in World War I fights his way through the Alps to rescue his Italian girlfriend and escape the impending explosion that will rock the mountain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f0VXZnoOdgvnBwBzEpMtU26d9I9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:259171'),
  ('394696232373854824', 'The Silent One', 1973, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Claude Pinoteau, Jean Collomb', 'Claude Pinoteau, Jean-Loup Dabadie', 'Lino Ventura, Leo Genn, Suzanne Flon, Robert Hardy, Lea Massari, Roger Crouzet, Lucienne Legrand, Bernard Dhéran', null, 'Who is Anton Haliakov, who has just been abducted by the M.I.5 in London? A Soviet scientist apparently. But sixteen years before the man had another identity, Clément Tibère, and another nationality, French. So what led him to become Russian and to change identity? And why are the British secret services interested in him?', 'Who is Anton Haliakov, who has just been abducted by the M.I.5 in London? A Soviet scientist apparently. But sixteen years before the man had another identity, Clément Tibère, and another nationality, French. So what led him to become Russian and to change identity? And why are the British secret services interested in him?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hlCvpOUC1XQhyMeCeMAJvE4HK7a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70928'),
  ('692386637824550687', 'The Silent Partner', 1978, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Daryl Duke, Billy Williams, Alan Simmonds', 'Curtis Hanson', 'Elliott Gould, Christopher Plummer, Susannah York, Céline Lomez, Michael Kirby, Ken Pogue, John Candy, Gail Dahms-Bonine', 'R', 'Toronto, Canada. A few days before Christmas, Miles Cullen, a bored teller working at a bank branch located in a shopping mall, accidentally learns that the place is about to be robbed when he finds a disconcerting note on one of the counters.', 'Toronto, Canada. A few days before Christmas, Miles Cullen, a bored teller working at a bank branch located in a shopping mall, accidentally learns that the place is about to be robbed when he finds a disconcerting note on one of the counters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mN5kB6uXIKETr2DcsG0u3wSFolN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25338'),
  ('722946545463564794', 'The Silent Party', 2019, 'Thriller', 'Diego Fried, Federico Finkielstain, Manuel Rebella', 'Luz Orlando Brennan, Diego Fried, Nicolás Gueilburt', 'Jazmín Stuart, Esteban Bigliardi, Hudson Gomes de Oliveira Santana, Lautaro Bettoni, Gerardo Romano, Gastón Cocchiarale, Diego Heck Dos Santos, Roxxana Ramos', 'NR', 'The day before their wedding, Laura and Daniel go to her family country house. The couple is under a lot stress. She decides to take a walk, and ended in the young neighbour''s house, where a silent party is taking place. What started like a fun night, quickly escalates in a violent and horrible experience.', 'The day before their wedding, Laura and Daniel go to her family country house. The couple is under a lot stress. She decides to take a walk, and ended in the young neighbour''s house, where a silent party is taking place. What started like a fun night, quickly escalates in a violent and horrible experience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bCkcxqUdHmvHKdaSvHTOWU00WBv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:648467'),
  ('356069145550237272', 'The Silent Revolution', 2018, 'Drama, History', 'Lars Kraume, Jens Harant', 'Lars Kraume', 'Leonard Scheicher, Tom Gramenz, Lena Klenke, Isaiah Michalski, Jonas Dassler, Nora Labisch, Nele Labisch, Ronald Zehrfeld', null, 'In 1956 Stalinstadt, East Germany, during the Hungarian uprising against Soviets is taking place, local teenagers perform a seemingly harmless act that causes unexpected consequences.', 'In 1956 Stalinstadt, East Germany, during the Hungarian uprising against Soviets is taking place, local teenagers perform a seemingly harmless act that causes unexpected consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uXhYEKlIyTysM3jf82fA4hMiN7Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:454693'),
  ('428192527123571391', 'The Silent Service: The Battle of Arctic Ocean', 2025, 'War', 'Kohei Yoshino', 'Hikaru Takai', 'Takao Osawa, Aya Ueto, Aoi Nakamura, Takashi Sasano, Yui Natsukawa, Yoshi Sakō, Yosuke Eguchi, Kou Maehara', null, 'In the freezing northern seas, the Yamato nuclear submarine begins its deep underwater voyage to the tune of Mozart, heading for the United Nations headquarters in New York. In the Bering Strait between the US and Russia, another submarine approaches: an American nuclear submarine that overwhelmingly dwarfs the Yamato. Now, a battle commences among the cracking floes of the cold Arctic Ocean.', 'In the freezing northern seas, the Yamato nuclear submarine begins its deep underwater voyage to the tune of Mozart, heading for the United Nations headquarters in New York. In the Bering Strait between the US and Russia, another submarine approaches: an American nuclear submarine that overwhelmingly dwarfs the Yamato. Now, a battle commences among the cracking floes of the cold Arctic Ocean.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9AkMDYdQN6ndso5myJ594Vs3lVY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1450115'),
  ('276698343235219785', 'The Silent Star', 1960, 'Science Fiction', 'Kurt Maetzig, Hieronim Przybył, Joachim Hasler', 'Jan Fethke, Alexander Stenbock-Fermor, Günter Reisch', 'Oldřich Lukeš, Ignacy Machowski, Julius Ongewe, Mikhail Postnikov, Kurt Rackelmann, Günther Simon, Hua-Ta Tang, Lucyna Winnicka', 'G', 'A mysterious magnetic spool found during a construction project is discovered to have originated from Venus. A rocket expedition to Venus is launched to discover the origin of the spool and the race that created it.', 'A mysterious magnetic spool found during a construction project is discovered to have originated from Venus. A rocket expedition to Venus is launched to discover the origin of the spool and the race that created it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fe3enWP5eETHDQ3g65zQs2hltSF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17938'),
  ('631144231052836391', 'The Silent Stranger', 1968, 'Western', 'Luigi Vanzi, Mario Capriotti', 'Vincenzo Cerami, Tony Anthony, Giancarlo Ferrando', 'Tony Anthony, Lloyd Battista, Rita Maura, Hitoshi Ōmae, Kanji Ohara, Kyōichi Satō, Yoshio Nukano, Raf Baldassarre', null, 'The Stranger comes across some bad guys trying to kill a Japanese emissary for a very important scroll. Before the emissary dies, he asks The Stranger to return the scroll to Japan. Once there he finds himself stuck in the middle of two rival clans and decides to play them off one against each other to free the town.', 'The Stranger comes across some bad guys trying to kill a Japanese emissary for a very important scroll. Before the emissary dies, he asks The Stranger to return the scroll to Japan. Once there he finds himself stuck in the middle of two rival clans and decides to play them off one against each other to free the town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b5V6hH2VzTyI5e7EK0aICYlfggx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70409'),
  ('915456602339222150', 'The Silent Touch', 1992, 'Drama', 'Krzysztof Zanussi, Jarosław Żamojda', 'Peter Morgan, Mark Wadlow', 'Max von Sydow, Lothaire Bluteau, Sarah Miles, Sofie Gråbøl, Aleksander Bardini, Beata Tyszkiewicz, Sławomira Łozińska, Peter Hesse Overgaard', null, 'Henry Kesdi is a silenced classical composer and a survivor of the Holocaust. He is coaxed out from retirement by an inspired musicologist, Stefan, who convinces him to compose a complex symphony on his neglected piano. As a help Kesdi gets his new musical secretary. His loyal wife reluctantly accepts her as his young lover.', 'Henry Kesdi is a silenced classical composer and a survivor of the Holocaust. He is coaxed out from retirement by an inspired musicologist, Stefan, who convinces him to compose a complex symphony on his neglected piano. As a help Kesdi gets his new musical secretary. His loyal wife reluctantly accepts her as his young lover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aZJ7OWRN3Mg5CjmctHBMth0hMbP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:168976'),
  ('1072551044947311099', 'The Silent Twins', 2022, 'Drama', 'Agnieszka Smoczyńska, Jakub Kijowski, Magnus von Horn', 'Andrea Seigel', 'Letitia Wright, Tamara Lawrance, Leah Mondesir-Simmonds, Eva-Arianna Baxter, Nadine Marshall, Treva Etienne, Michael Smiley, Jodhi May', 'R', 'June and Jennifer Gibbons are twins from the only Black family in a small town in Wales in the 1970s and ''80s. Feeling isolated from the community, the pair turn inward and reject communication with everyone but each other, retreating into their own fantasy world of inspiration and adolescent desires. After a spree of vandalism, the girls are sentenced to Broadmoor, an infamous psychiatric hospital, where they face the choice to separate and survive or die together.', 'June and Jennifer Gibbons are twins from the only Black family in a small town in Wales in the 1970s and ''80s. Feeling isolated from the community, the pair turn inward and reject communication with everyone but each other, retreating into their own fantasy world of inspiration and adolescent desires. After a spree of vandalism, the girls are sentenced to Broadmoor, an infamous psychiatric hospital, where they face the choice to separate and survive or die together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/44zhSoVvpLDye6rJmU63TIpasUg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:812025'),
  ('605458455342030597', 'The Silent War', 2012, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Felix Chong Man-Keung, Alan Mak Siu-Fai, Anthony Pun Yiu-Ming', 'Alan Mak Siu-Fai, Felix Chong Man-Keung', 'Zhou Xun, Tony Leung Chiu-wai, Wang Xuebing, Mavis Fan, Dong Yong, David Lam Wai, Jacob Cheung Chi-Leung, Pal Sinn Lap-Man', null, 'An espionage thriller set in the 1950s and adapted from the novel "Year Suan/Plot Against" by May Jia. Tony Leung Chiu Wai plays a blind man who works for a piano tuner. He is recruited for a spy mission because of his exceptional hearing.', 'An espionage thriller set in the 1950s and adapted from the novel "Year Suan/Plot Against" by May Jia. Tony Leung Chiu Wai plays a blind man who works for a piano tuner. He is recruited for a spy mission because of his exceptional hearing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A6vo0HbWsCNwQb4mQr3KMNlv6c0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129070'),
  ('305584213729050886', 'The Silent World', 1956, 'Documentary, Adventure', 'Jacques-Yves Cousteau, Louis Malle, Philippe Agostini', 'Jacques-Yves Cousteau, James Dugan', 'Jacques-Yves Cousteau', null, 'Join renowned explorer Jacques-Yves Cousteau as he investigates aquatic habitats worldwide, showcasing whales, sharks, and diverse marine life. The film highlights the brutal realities of nature while capturing the wonder of underwater exploration, as the team ventures into previously unseen ocean depths.', 'Join renowned explorer Jacques-Yves Cousteau as he investigates aquatic habitats worldwide, showcasing whales, sharks, and diverse marine life. The film highlights the brutal realities of nature while capturing the wonder of underwater exploration, as the team ventures into previously unseen ocean depths.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ys1AiQJbQPNimud1kZQ91FgOJLR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60234'),
  ('129357719171918548', 'The Silk Road', 1988, 'Drama, History', 'Junya Satō, Akira Shiizuka, 松橋亮', 'Junya Satō, Takeshi Yoshida', 'Toshiyuki Nishida, Koichi Sato, Anna Nakagawa, Tsunehiko Watase, Takahiro Tamura, Akira Emoto, Daijirō Harada, Yoshiko Mita', null, 'In 1026, students in western China are shanghaied into the forces of crown prince Li Yuanhao of Xi Xia, who wants to control the length of the Silk Road. One student is Zhao Xingde, who becomes the favorite of his commander, Zhu Wangli. While sacking a fortress, Xingde discovers Tsurpia, princess of the Uighur. He hides her; they fall in love. When he''s sent away to study Xixian, he leaves Tsurpia in Zhu''s care, but returns to find her engaged to Li. Tragedy follows, and he and Zhu enter a pact to take revenge when Li arrives at Dun-Huang, the region''s seat of learning and culture. Against overwhelming odds, they find a surprising way to leave a monument to their life and love.', 'In 1026, students in western China are shanghaied into the forces of crown prince Li Yuanhao of Xi Xia, who wants to control the length of the Silk Road. One student is Zhao Xingde, who becomes the favorite of his commander, Zhu Wangli. While sacking a fortress, Xingde discovers Tsurpia, princess of the Uighur. He hides her; they fall in love. When he''s sent away to study Xixian, he leaves Tsurpia in Zhu''s care, but returns to find her engaged to Li. Tragedy follows, and he and Zhu enter a pact to take revenge when Li arrives at Dun-Huang, the region''s seat of learning and culture. Against overwhelming odds, they find a surprising way to leave a monument to their life and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uytyIfMMQUilZuoDKTkmXrd1DDe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123617'),
  ('800353684381451554', 'The Silver Brumby', 1993, 'Family, Drama', 'John Tatoulis', 'John Tatoulis, Jon Stephens', 'Russell Crowe, Caroline Goodall, Amiel Daemion, Johnny Raaen, Buddy Tyson, Graeme Fullgrabe, Gary Amos, Murray Chesson', 'G', 'A mother tells her daughter a fable about the prince of the brumbies, brumby being a term for the feral horses of Australia, who must find its place among its kind, while one man makes it his mission to capture it and tame it. Australian adaptation of Elyne Mitchell''s "The silver Brumby".', 'A mother tells her daughter a fable about the prince of the brumbies, brumby being a term for the feral horses of Australia, who must find its place among its kind, while one man makes it his mission to capture it and tame it. Australian adaptation of Elyne Mitchell''s "The silver Brumby".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uw5Cy8I0pbwg2dPFza1FAnXKyB3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43757'),
  ('193319978956134010', 'The Silver Chalice', 1954, 'Drama, Romance, History', 'Victor Saville, William V. Skall', 'Lesser Samuels', 'Virginia Mayo, Pier Angeli, Jack Palance, Paul Newman, Walter Hampden, Joseph Wiseman, Alexander Scourby, Lorne Greene', null, 'A Greek artisan is commissioned to cast the cup of Christ in silver and sculpt around its rim the faces of the disciples and Jesus himself. He travels to Jerusalem and eventually to Rome to complete the task. Meanwhile, a nefarious interloper is trying to convince the crowds that he is the new Messiah by using nothing more than cheap parlor tricks.', 'A Greek artisan is commissioned to cast the cup of Christ in silver and sculpt around its rim the faces of the disciples and Jesus himself. He travels to Jerusalem and eventually to Rome to complete the task. Meanwhile, a nefarious interloper is trying to convince the crowds that he is the new Messiah by using nothing more than cheap parlor tricks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dwcpH7EX5glxxAvRmuiCVtBNBDN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65212'),
  ('1107344841987035612', 'The Silver Cliff', 2011, 'Drama', 'Karim Aïnouz, Mauro Pinheiro Jr., Cris Azzi', 'Beatriz Bracher, Karim Aïnouz', 'Alessandra Negrini, Otto Jr., Thiago Martins, Gabi Pereira, Carla Ribas, João Vitor Silva, Rebecca Orenstein, Alice Borges', null, 'Violeta is a married dentist on a normal working day. While listening to a message left on the cell she enters in despair. The message of her husband, Djalma, says he is leaving her and going to another city.', 'Violeta is a married dentist on a normal working day. While listening to a message left on the cell she enters in despair. The message of her husband, Djalma, says he is leaving her and going to another city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qLWZ4kISmXBjWbGei9lIKy56qBe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110949'),
  ('397849324077678273', 'The Silver Forest', 2019, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Marie Spencer, Emmanuel Bourdieu', 'Emmanuel Bourdieu', 'Nicolas Duvauchelle, Julia Faure, Alexandru Mihăescu, Dominique Reymond, Ioana Visalon, Marina Palii, Albert Carpentier, Adriana Mosca', null, 'Roxana is a young Romanian nanny looking after 8-year-old Georges, the son of David and Elizabeth. David''s a financier at the European Bank of Strasbourg. Working on a project for a motorway across Romania, David asks Roxana for some help.', 'Roxana is a young Romanian nanny looking after 8-year-old Georges, the son of David and Elizabeth. David''s a financier at the European Bank of Strasbourg. Working on a project for a motorway across Romania, David asks Roxana for some help.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nNrsRzUHSTCqd1nMieW1uqkhPSo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:645451'),
  ('202628218552162765', 'The Silver Horde', 1930, 'Drama', 'George Archainbaud, John W. Boyle, Leo Tover', 'Rex Beach, Wallace Smith', 'Evelyn Brent, Louis Wolheim, Jean Arthur, Raymond Hatton, Blanche Sweet, Gavin Gordon, Purnell Pratt, William B. Davidson', 'NR', 'A salmon fisherman has to choose between a bad girl and a society doll.', 'A salmon fisherman has to choose between a bad girl and a society doll.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4rKBNRNSQBPIh7EN1FRrWhJ7aWW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162959'),
  ('491692562120061327', 'The Silver Mask', 1985, 'Adventure, History, Action', 'Gheorghe Vitanidis', 'Eugen Barbu, Nicolae Paul Mihail', 'Florin Piersic, Marga Barbu, Alexandru Repan, Szabolcs Cseh, Ion Besoiu, Ovidiu Iuliu Moldovan, Traian Stănescu, George Motoi', null, 'Agatha Slatineanu, together with the alleged banker Troianoff, rob the boyar Valcu of a treasure collected in order to buy the throne. However, the gold is recovered by Margelatu for the benefit of the "Brotherhood".', 'Agatha Slatineanu, together with the alleged banker Troianoff, rob the boyar Valcu of a treasure collected in order to buy the throne. However, the gold is recovered by Margelatu for the benefit of the "Brotherhood".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vkiGYXwsM6tFSxl68VbB202iZAb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:315448'),
  ('678761720590042197', 'The Silver Screen: Color Me Lavender', 1997, 'History, Documentary', 'Mark Rappaport', 'Mark Rappaport', 'Dan Butler, Don Ameche, Johnny Arthur, Lucille Ball, Noah Beery Jr., Eric Blore, Humphrey Bogart, Walter Brennan', null, 'A film scrapbook, images, phrases from our past, hiding their meanings behind veils. Let''s lift those veils, one by one, to find how images, at one time seeming innocent, have revealed, after decades, to have homosexual overtones.', 'A film scrapbook, images, phrases from our past, hiding their meanings behind veils. Let''s lift those veils, one by one, to find how images, at one time seeming innocent, have revealed, after decades, to have homosexual overtones.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s1TjxmFqj63rhvXq9zR4oo8UKXj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:135787'),
  ('676524919977003422', 'The Similars', 2015, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Isi Sarfati, Isaac Ezban', 'Isaac Ezban', 'Gustavo Sánchez Parra, Cassandra Ciangherotti, Fernando Becerril, Humberto Busto, Carmen Beato, Santiago Torres, María Elena Olivares, Catalina Salas', null, 'Eight people experience a strange phenomenon while waiting for a bus at a remote station on a rainy October night.', 'Eight people experience a strange phenomenon while waiting for a bus at a remote station on a rainy October night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gFySRlyCiay9wsqPUcIIyXf2VwL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:268105'),
  ('926760200638480365', 'The Simple Life of Noah Dearborn', 1999, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Gregg Champion, Gordon Lonsdale', 'Sterling Anderson', 'Sidney Poitier, Dianne Wiest, Mary-Louise Parker, George Newbern, Roxzane T. Mims, Afemo Omilami, Bernie Casey, James Thomas Lee Knight', null, 'In the small Southern community of Twin Pines, GA, lives Noah Dearborn, a master craftsman and farmer who cherishes his solitude almost as much as the local townspeople cherish him — especially restaurant owner Sarah McClellan. But when greedy real estate developers set their sights on Noah''s land and he rejects their six-figure offer, this taciturn man is forced to summon all his strength in order to defend not only his property and way of life, but his sanity.', 'In the small Southern community of Twin Pines, GA, lives Noah Dearborn, a master craftsman and farmer who cherishes his solitude almost as much as the local townspeople cherish him — especially restaurant owner Sarah McClellan. But when greedy real estate developers set their sights on Noah''s land and he rejects their six-figure offer, this taciturn man is forced to summon all his strength in order to defend not only his property and way of life, but his sanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5pLvBGqQFQpB2oZK4lFJzbInMH7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57680'),
  ('368933520049908360', 'The Simple Things', 1953, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Charles August Nichols', null, 'James MacDonald, Pinto Colvig', 'G', 'Mickey and Pluto go fishing. Pluto has a run-in with a clam, who eventually lodges in Pluto''s mouth; Mickey thinks the clam is Pluto''s tongue and can''t understand why Pluto keeps begging for more food. After they get rid of the clam, Mickey''s attempts to use his minnows as bait are thwarted by a hungry seagull; he brings his friends, and they chase our heroes away.', 'Mickey and Pluto go fishing. Pluto has a run-in with a clam, who eventually lodges in Pluto''s mouth; Mickey thinks the clam is Pluto''s tongue and can''t understand why Pluto keeps begging for more food. After they get rid of the clam, Mickey''s attempts to use his minnows as bait are thwarted by a hungry seagull; he brings his friends, and they chase our heroes away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/llIbbkyPE53o9ht8o6ZWjFTpbX6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67600'),
  ('140035983405334590', 'The Simple-Minded Murderer', 1982, 'Drama', 'Hans Alfredson, Niklas Rådström, Rolf Lindström', 'Hans Alfredson', 'Stellan Skarsgård, Hans Alfredson, Maria Johansson, Per Myrberg, Gösta Ekman, Carl Billquist, Lena Nyman, Nils Ahlroth', null, 'The feeble-minded Sven''s mother dies and he gets work as a farm-hand at the rich, affluent Höglund''s farm. He has to work without pay and sleeps together with the cows. He meets the disabled Anna who is the first one to treat him as an adult. One day he has had enough of Höglund''s maltreatment and moves in with Anna''s family. Plot by Mattias Thuresson.', 'The feeble-minded Sven''s mother dies and he gets work as a farm-hand at the rich, affluent Höglund''s farm. He has to work without pay and sleeps together with the cows. He meets the disabled Anna who is the first one to treat him as an adult. One day he has had enough of Höglund''s maltreatment and moves in with Anna''s family. Plot by Mattias Thuresson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jzKjJVWiUfHqScib0nb5tFgkmO3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24129'),
  ('482680711249785550', 'The Simpsons in Plusaversary', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy, Fantasy', 'David Silverman', 'Joel H. Cohen, Jessica Conrad, Al Jean', 'Dan Castellaneta, Nancy Cartwright, Yeardley Smith, Hank Azaria, Tress MacNeille', 'G', 'The Simpsons host a Disney+ Day party and everyone is on the list… except Homer. With friends from across the service and music fit for a Disney Princess, Plusaversary is Springfield''s event of the year.', 'The Simpsons host a Disney+ Day party and everyone is on the list… except Homer. With friends from across the service and music fit for a Disney Princess, Plusaversary is Springfield''s event of the year.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p5jzbffrXuBTjsiwrQ3aOMTrvCj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:877183'),
  ('1118263040676153404', 'The Simpsons Meet the Bocellis in "Feliz Navidad"', 2022, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'David Silverman', null, 'Nancy Cartwright, Yeardley Smith, Dan Castellaneta, Julie Kavner, Andrea Bocelli, Matteo Bocelli, Virginia Bocelli', 'PG', 'This Christmas, Homer surprises Marge with the ultimate gift: an unforgettable performance from Italian opera superstar Andrea Bocelli and his children Matteo and Virginia.', 'This Christmas, Homer surprises Marge with the ultimate gift: an unforgettable performance from Italian opera superstar Andrea Bocelli and his children Matteo and Virginia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9rJFKvYvSyQ3HoTl1gcU55FOzYi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1058732'),
  ('1006004964695917615', 'The Simpsons Movie', 2007, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'David Silverman, Matthew Schofield, Gary McCarver', 'Matt Groening, James L. Brooks, Sam Simon', 'Dan Castellaneta, Julie Kavner, Nancy Cartwright, Yeardley Smith, Hank Azaria, Harry Shearer, Pamela Hayden, Tress MacNeille', 'PG-13', 'After Homer accidentally pollutes the town''s water supply, Springfield is encased in a gigantic dome by the EPA and the Simpsons are declared fugitives.', 'After Homer accidentally pollutes the town''s water supply, Springfield is encased in a gigantic dome by the EPA and the Simpsons are declared fugitives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s3b8TZWwmkYc2KoJ5zk77qB6PzY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35'),
