  ('73390849195826125', 'The Sin', 1965, 'Drama', 'Henry Barakat, Ahmed Dia Al-Mahdi', 'Saad al-Din Wahbah', 'Faten Hamama, Abdallah Ghaith, Zaki Rostom, Hassan El Baroudy, Hassan Mostafa, Abdel Salam Mohamed, Sami Sarhan, Kawthar Shafik', null, 'Aziza and her husband Abdullah are both day laborers who work on various farms. When Aziza is brutally raped by a guard while she is picking potatoes in a field, she tries to hide the pregnancy and plans to kill the baby once it is born.', 'Aziza and her husband Abdullah are both day laborers who work on various farms. When Aziza is brutally raped by a guard while she is picking potatoes in a field, she tries to hide the pregnancy and plans to kill the baby once it is born.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AjeFj2Uqq9sYL0tkYexEIJK6X4a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198808'),
  ('565211338172129070', 'The Sin', 2024, 'Horror, Fantasy, Mystery', 'Han Dong-seok, Moon Sang-won', 'Han Dong-seok', 'Kim Yoon-hye, Song Yi-jae, Park Ji-hoon, Lee Sang-ah', null, 'A group of actors and production staff, upon arriving at a rural abandoned school for filming, find themselves enveloped in a mysterious energy from the first day of filming itself. The situation takes a drastic turn after they encounter an entity that should not have been awakened. They now strive to escape from it.', 'A group of actors and production staff, upon arriving at a rural abandoned school for filming, find themselves enveloped in a mysterious energy from the first day of filming itself. The situation takes a drastic turn after they encounter an entity that should not have been awakened. They now strive to escape from it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/17esFRgxCM5zvFoAdywxrNKRaT3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1169340'),
  ('228538727205452694', 'The Sin of Adam and Eve', 1969, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Miguel Zacarías', 'Miguel Zacarías', 'Jorge Rivero, Kandy', null, 'Absurd retelling of the story of Adam and Eve, this was the first of several biblical movies by director Miguel Zacarías that were intended to inspire the faithful but only inspired laughter instead. This film gained much notoriety due to the abundant nudity of its stars and was released worldwide.', 'Absurd retelling of the story of Adam and Eve, this was the first of several biblical movies by director Miguel Zacarías that were intended to inspire the faithful but only inspired laughter instead. This film gained much notoriety due to the abundant nudity of its stars and was released worldwide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oBlTswYjy9wygztXZkxXdSXEJsJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174842'),
  ('645038399881779413', 'The Sin of Harold Diddlebock', 1947, 'Comedy', 'Preston Sturges, Robert Pittack, Barton Adams', 'Preston Sturges', 'Harold Lloyd, Jimmy Conlin, Raymond Walburn, Rudy Vallee, Edgar Kennedy, Margaret Hamilton, Franklin Pangborn, Jack Norton', 'NR', 'Twenty-three years after scoring the winning touchdown for his college football team mild-mannered Harold Diddlebock, who has been stuck in a dull, dead-end book-keeping job for years, is let go by his pompous boss, advertising tycoon J.E. Wagglebury, with nothing but a tiny pension. Harold, who never touches the stuff, takes a stiff drink with his new pal... and another, and another. What happened Wednesday?', 'Twenty-three years after scoring the winning touchdown for his college football team mild-mannered Harold Diddlebock, who has been stuck in a dull, dead-end book-keeping job for years, is let go by his pompous boss, advertising tycoon J.E. Wagglebury, with nothing but a tiny pension. Harold, who never touches the stuff, takes a stiff drink with his new pal... and another, and another. What happened Wednesday?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gXYOAlBjG2bx65sL1ObWWVRvGnp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23001'),
  ('489707280987612492', 'The Sin of Madelon Claudet', 1931, 'Drama', 'Edgar Selwyn, Douglas Shearer, Oliver T. Marsh', 'Charles MacArthur, Ben Hecht', 'Helen Hayes, Lewis Stone, Neil Hamilton, Cliff Edwards, Robert Young, Jean Hersholt, Marie Prevost, Karen Morley', 'NR', 'Out of jail for a crime she did not commit, Madelon turns to prostitution and thievery to send her illegitimate son to medical school.', 'Out of jail for a crime she did not commit, Madelon turns to prostitution and thievery to send her illegitimate son to medical school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nr3dzgku0NqqwQntJxS5YcyUwVL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85504'),
  ('1066936078723667584', 'The Sin of Nora Moran', 1933, 'Crime, Drama', 'Phil Goldstone, Ira H. Morgan', 'W. Maxwell Goodhue, Frances Hyland', 'Zita Johann, John Miljan, Alan Dinehart, Paul Cavanagh, Claire Du Brey, Sarah Padden, Henry B. Walthall, Harvey Clark', 'NR', 'Nora Moran, a young woman with a difficult and tragic past, is sentenced to die for a murder that she did not commit. She could easily reveal the truth and save her own life, if only it would not damage the lives, careers and reputations of those whom she loves.', 'Nora Moran, a young woman with a difficult and tragic past, is sentenced to die for a murder that she did not commit. She could easily reveal the truth and save her own life, if only it would not damage the lives, careers and reputations of those whom she loves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rwcTh9CbJ9uSmZzBbYltKIppuVM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27976'),
  ('309794551549608286', 'The Sinful Nuns of Saint Valentine', 1974, 'Drama, Horror', 'Sergio Grieco, Emore Galeassi, Massimo Carocci', 'Max Vitali', 'Françoise Prévost, Jenny Tamburi, Paolo Malco, Franco Ressel, Corrado Gaipa, Gino Rocchetti, Pier Giovanni Anchisi, Calisto Calisti', null, 'Lucita has been locked away in a convent by her family in order to keep her away from her lover, Esteban. The pair make plans to elope, but Esteban is accused of heresy before Lucita can escape. Hiding in the convent, Esteban discovers the horrifying depravity of the covent''s abbess, Sister Incarnation. Can Esteban rescue his love from this madhouse before the inquisitor discovers what is going on and has everyone executed?', 'Lucita has been locked away in a convent by her family in order to keep her away from her lover, Esteban. The pair make plans to elope, but Esteban is accused of heresy before Lucita can escape. Hiding in the convent, Esteban discovers the horrifying depravity of the covent''s abbess, Sister Incarnation. Can Esteban rescue his love from this madhouse before the inquisitor discovers what is going on and has everyone executed?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6yJtqwMDy5xVb5l92cyFdOd8jGs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107068'),
  ('683616331245701551', 'The Singer', 2006, 'Drama, Romance, Music', 'Xavier Giannoli, Yorick Le Saux, Dominique Delany', 'Xavier Giannoli', 'Gérard Depardieu, Cécile de France, Mathieu Amalric, Christine Citti, Patrick Pineau, Jean-Pierre Gos, Antoine de Prekel, Monique Gailleurd', null, 'Alain Moreau sings for one of the few remaining dance-bands in Clermont-Ferrand. Though something of an idol amongst his female audience he has a melancholic awareness of the slow disappearance of that audience and of his advancing years. He is completely knocked off balance when he meets strikingly attractive and much younger businesswoman Marion. She seems distant and apparently otherwise involved but soon shows quiet signs of reciprocating his interest.', 'Alain Moreau sings for one of the few remaining dance-bands in Clermont-Ferrand. Though something of an idol amongst his female audience he has a melancholic awareness of the slow disappearance of that audience and of his advancing years. He is completely knocked off balance when he meets strikingly attractive and much younger businesswoman Marion. She seems distant and apparently otherwise involved but soon shows quiet signs of reciprocating his interest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q2mwJ10bTevPwI7Sze4EP5XYxTm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31325'),
  ('458483083141778194', 'The Singer from Mexico', 1957, 'Comedy, Music', 'Richard Pottier, Lucien Joulin', 'Jesús María de Arozamena, Félix Gandéra, Raymond Vincy', 'Luis Mariano, Annie Cordy, Manolo Morán, Bourvil, Tilda Thamar, Santiago Rivero, Gisèle Grandpré, Domingo Rivas', null, 'Vincent Etchebar is spotted by the impresario Cartoni who gives him the opportunity to break into Paris. But nothing will go as planned.', 'Vincent Etchebar is spotted by the impresario Cartoni who gives him the opportunity to break into Paris. But nothing will go as planned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6NRorpuge8DUvkwLleiNsxnDVTW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66898'),
