  ('425636032521368049', 'The Sinister Eyes of Dr. Orloff', 1973, 'Horror, Drama', 'Jesús Franco, Anne Settimó', 'Jesús Franco', 'William Berger, Montserrat Prous, Edmund Purdom, Loreta Tovar, Robert Woods, Lina Romay, Kali Hansa, Joaquín Blanco', null, 'Amid the craggy, dusty hills of southern France, a woman screams in the night. Gorgeous Melissa Comfort, a wealthy heiress confined to a wheelchair since birth, cries out in her nightmares, terrified of a dream that comes night after night. In this night terror, she''s 10-years-old. Running from a man who may or may not be her father.', 'Amid the craggy, dusty hills of southern France, a woman screams in the night. Gorgeous Melissa Comfort, a wealthy heiress confined to a wheelchair since birth, cries out in her nightmares, terrified of a dream that comes night after night. In this night terror, she''s 10-years-old. Running from a man who may or may not be her father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eVNqs9SYDCkQsnohp6FA2ZTKWLP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86480'),
