  ('727404896968395375', 'The Sixth', 1982, 'Drama, Action', 'Samvel Gasparov, Aleksandr Kovalchuk, Boris Golev', 'Ramiz Fataliyev', 'Sergey Nikonenko, Mikhail Kozakov, Vladimir Grammatikov, Mikhail Pugovkin, Larisa Belogurova, Nina Menshikova, Marina Yakovleva, Georgi Millyar', null, 'The Civil War in Russia has just finished. The sixth chief of militia came to a small town in the south. Five Glodov’s predecessors had been killed by a gang of elusive Vakhromeyev. Now Glodov and his crew are going to have a mortal combat with the smart gangsters…', 'The Civil War in Russia has just finished. The sixth chief of militia came to a small town in the south. Five Glodov’s predecessors had been killed by a gang of elusive Vakhromeyev. Now Glodov and his crew are going to have a mortal combat with the smart gangsters…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z97Zop1KfPWMb1qkCX7aTUxqz38.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79594'),
  ('525022470626447006', 'The Sixth Child', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Julien Ramirez Hernan, Léopold Legrand, Clémence Catto', 'Catherine Paillé, Léopold Legrand, Philippe Lioret', 'Sara Giraudeau, Benjamin Lavernhe, Judith Chemla, Damien Bonnard, Olivier Faliez, Marie-Christine Orry, Olivier Rabourdin, Naidra Ayadi', null, 'Franck, a scrap merchant, and Meriem have five children, a sixth on the go, and serious money issues. Julien and Anna are lawyers and cannot have a child. This is the story of an inconceivable agreement.', 'Franck, a scrap merchant, and Meriem have five children, a sixth on the go, and serious money issues. Julien and Anna are lawyers and cannot have a child. This is the story of an inconceivable agreement.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iDLaK0Gb7O7yPpbGwS7NGdot74k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:956957'),
  ('108541846672736168', 'The Sixth Sense', 1929, 'Drama', 'Eusebio Fernández Ardavín, Nemesio M. Sobrevila, Armando Pou', 'Nemesio M. Sobrevila', 'Ricardo Baroja, Enrique Durán, Antonia Fernández, Eusebio Fernández Ardavín, Gertrudis Pajares, Faustino Bretaño, Francisco Martí, María Anaya', null, 'Carlos and his girlfriend Carmen are a happy and fun couple; however, his friend León and his girlfriend Luisa are quite the opposite; so Carlos recommends León to visit the mysterious Kamus —an artist, a drunkard, a philosopher—, in the hope that he can free him from his depressing and contagious existential pessimism…', 'Carlos and his girlfriend Carmen are a happy and fun couple; however, his friend León and his girlfriend Luisa are quite the opposite; so Carlos recommends León to visit the mysterious Kamus —an artist, a drunkard, a philosopher—, in the hope that he can free him from his depressing and contagious existential pessimism…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9THgA1iYSSIlO6I88VdIenJN7Om.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190328'),
  ('173551189607083650', 'The Sixth Sense', 1999, 'Mystery, Thriller, Drama', 'M. Night Shyamalan, Tak Fujimoto, John Rusk', 'M. Night Shyamalan', 'Bruce Willis, Haley Joel Osment, Toni Collette, Olivia Williams, Donnie Wahlberg, Trevor Morgan, Mischa Barton, Angelica Page', 'PG-13', 'Following an unexpected tragedy, child psychologist Malcolm Crowe meets a nine year old boy named Cole Sear, who is hiding a dark secret.', 'Following an unexpected tragedy, child psychologist Malcolm Crowe meets a nine year old boy named Cole Sear, who is hiding a dark secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vOyfUXNFSnaTk7Vk5AjpsKTUWsu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:745'),
  ('167326525409206001', 'The Sixth Side of the Pentagon', 1968, 'Documentary, History', 'Chris Marker, François Reichenbach, Chris Marker', null, 'Henri de Turenne, Chris Marker, William Sloane Coffin, Paul Stookey, Mary Travers, John Wilson, Peter Yarrow', null, 'Chris Marker and François Reichenbach document the massive anti–Vietnam War protest held in Washington, D.C., on October 21, 1967, where more than 100,000 demonstrators gathered at the Lincoln Memorial before marching on the Pentagon. Filmed amid the crowd, the short captures the tension, idealism, and growing radicalism of the American peace movement.', 'Chris Marker and François Reichenbach document the massive anti–Vietnam War protest held in Washington, D.C., on October 21, 1967, where more than 100,000 demonstrators gathered at the Lincoln Memorial before marching on the Pentagon. Filmed amid the crowd, the short captures the tension, idealism, and growing radicalism of the American peace movement.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yQbV5oLuZhQszZX7hf7gpJZPlJK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258656'),
  ('243848672304189242', 'The Skateboard Kid', 1993, 'Family, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Don E. FauntLeRoy, Larry Swerdlove, Scott P. Levy', 'Gary Stuart Kaplan, Larry Swerdlove', 'Trevor Lissauer, Dom DeLuise, Timothy Busfield, Bess Armstrong, Cliff DeYoung, Rick Dean, Shanelle Gray, Lee McLaughlin', 'PG', 'No one could be more bored than Zack, the new kid in town with no friends in sight. When a gang of hip, skateboarding thrashers start cruising his neighborhood, Zack hopes his luck will change. But they want nothing to do with him. Then Zack makes the discovery of his life: a talking wisecracking, magical skateboard. And suddenly, skateboarding rises to entirely new heights.', 'No one could be more bored than Zack, the new kid in town with no friends in sight. When a gang of hip, skateboarding thrashers start cruising his neighborhood, Zack hopes his luck will change. But they want nothing to do with him. Then Zack makes the discovery of his life: a talking wisecracking, magical skateboard. And suddenly, skateboarding rises to entirely new heights.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7VsJXR1u6IM2XwGeDGV2kXIskys.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125059'),
  ('813508311078457615', 'The Skeleton Dance', 1929, 'Animation, Family, Music, Comedy, Horror', 'Walt Disney', null, 'Walt Disney, Carl W. Stalling', 'NR', 'The clock strikes midnight, the bats fly from the belfry, a dog howls at the full moon, and two black cats fight in the cemetery: a perfect time for four skeletons to come out and dance a bit.', 'The clock strikes midnight, the bats fly from the belfry, a dog howls at the full moon, and two black cats fight in the cemetery: a perfect time for four skeletons to come out and dance a bit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zYwp7SK4HRc9sf4oog3XP02dJv4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88018'),
  ('959209172435288423', 'The Skeleton Key', 2005, 'Drama, Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Iain Softley, Dan Mindel, Jann K. Engel', 'Ehren Kruger', 'Kate Hudson, Gena Rowlands, Peter Sarsgaard, John Hurt, Joy Bryant, Marion Zinser, Maxine Barnett, Fahnlohnee R. Harris', 'PG-13', 'A hospice nurse working at a spooky New Orleans plantation home finds herself entangled in a mystery involving the house''s dark past.', 'A hospice nurse working at a spooky New Orleans plantation home finds herself entangled in a mystery involving the house''s dark past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wHmubdzrVw8oq7htzrf364wsJNp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9913'),
  ('855441017060011646', 'The Skeleton of Mrs. Morales', 1960, 'Comedy, Crime, Horror', 'Rogelio A. González, Víctor Herrera, Jaime Contreras', 'Luis Alcoriza', 'Arturo de Córdova, Amparo Rivelles, Elda Peralta, Guillermo Orea, Rosenda Monteros, Luis Aragón, Mercedes Pascual, Antonio Bravo', null, 'A taxidermist decides to murder his wife after having to put up with her after twenty years of hellish marriage.', 'A taxidermist decides to murder his wife after having to put up with her after twenty years of hellish marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bWC7hLO1EOHYeK6zNiLT7jonVg4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118007'),
  ('390426699962255288', 'The Skeleton Twins', 2014, 'Drama', 'Craig Johnson, Reed Morano, Joseph Ciccarella', 'Mark Heyman, Craig Johnson', 'Bill Hader, Kristen Wiig, Luke Wilson, Ty Burrell, Boyd Holbrook, Joanna Gleason, Kathleen Rose Perkins, Adriane Lenox', 'R', 'Estranged twins Maggie and Milo coincidentally cheat death on the same day, prompting them to reunite and confront the reasons their lives went so wrong. As the twins'' reunion reinvigorates them, they realize the key to fixing their lives may just lie in repairing their relationship.', 'Estranged twins Maggie and Milo coincidentally cheat death on the same day, prompting them to reunite and confront the reasons their lives went so wrong. As the twins'' reunion reinvigorates them, they realize the key to fixing their lives may just lie in repairing their relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lDygTdg1KlrVJVzqsFL515uGzSe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:244772'),
  ('601832776016917885', 'The Skeptic', 2009, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Tennyson Bardwell, Claudio Rocha, Michael A. Moffa', 'Tennyson Bardwell', 'Tim Daly, Tom Arnold, Zoe Saldaña, Andrea Roth, Edward Herrmann, Robert Prosky, Bruce Altman, Lea Coco', null, 'After the mysterious death of his Aunt, a confirmed skeptic lawyer, Bryan Becket, dismisses reports that her house is haunted and moves in. Immediately occurrences begin he cannot explain. And beyond the occurrences there is something about the house which gnaws at Becket - some strange connection he senses he has with the house''s past. Soon, the haunting turns personal.', 'After the mysterious death of his Aunt, a confirmed skeptic lawyer, Bryan Becket, dismisses reports that her house is haunted and moves in. Immediately occurrences begin he cannot explain. And beyond the occurrences there is something about the house which gnaws at Becket - some strange connection he senses he has with the house''s past. Soon, the haunting turns personal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x7K5DIDhCwqDD9VIMVCMdDld9pK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24116'),
  ('688415369796263327', 'The Skin', 1981, 'Drama, War, History', 'Armando Nannuzzi, Liliana Cavani, Colette Caron', 'Robert Katz, Catherine Breillat, Liliana Cavani', 'Marcello Mastroianni, Claudia Cardinale, Burt Lancaster, Ken Marshall, Alexandra King, Carlo Giuffrè, Rosaria della Femmina, Jeanne Valérie', null, 'Based on the memoirs of author Curzio Malaparte, diplomatic liaison between the Allied and Italian forces after the defeat of the Nazis in Italy, The Skin follows the collapse of Italian society under the US occupation and the desperate measures required for survival.', 'Based on the memoirs of author Curzio Malaparte, diplomatic liaison between the Allied and Italian forces after the defeat of the Nazis in Italy, The Skin follows the collapse of Italian society under the US occupation and the desperate measures required for survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/76BT7xQFchy6FO3jAKj3IMKu66T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63186'),
  ('211028851841803155', 'The Skin Game', 1931, 'Drama', 'Alfred Hitchcock, Jack E. Cox, Frank Mills', 'Alma Reville', 'C. V. France, Helen Haye, Jill Esmond, Edmund Gwenn, John Longden, Phyllis Konstam, Frank Lawton, Edward Chapman', 'NR', 'An old traditional family and a modern family battle over land in a small English village.', 'An old traditional family and a modern family battle over land in a small English village.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/toLLyYTaAvQyLIvpAu8UeQ0sqOL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52748'),
  ('852198880772677677', 'The Skin I Live In', 2011, 'Drama, Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Pedro Almodóvar, José Luis Alcaine, Francisco Lareu', 'Pedro Almodóvar', 'Antonio Banderas, Elena Anaya, Marisa Paredes, Jan Cornet, Roberto Álamo, Eduard Fernández, José Luis Gómez, Blanca Suárez', 'R', 'A brilliant plastic surgeon creates a synthetic skin that withstands any kind of damage. His guinea pig: a mysterious and volatile woman who holds the key to his obsession.', 'A brilliant plastic surgeon creates a synthetic skin that withstands any kind of damage. His guinea pig: a mysterious and volatile woman who holds the key to his obsession.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xa7uCwGYykrf8MMI8iF5dZvNlrG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63311'),
  ('1041833342512268875', 'The Skin of Others', 2018, 'Drama', 'Thomas Stiller', 'Thomas Stiller', 'Oliver Mommsen, Isabel Thierauch, Sonja Kerskes, Pierre Kiwitt, Marco Hofschneider, Torsten Michaelis, Lasse Myhr, Johannes Franke', null, 'Marc Deville is an acclaimed author of erotic literature. In his personal life, however, physical closeness with the opposite sex eludes him. Being a porn addict, his sexuality is narrowly defined by the framed images he can masturbate to. One day he meets Justine, a nurse with a fetish of her own: her love for erotic asphyxiaton has estranged her from her husband Eric, a theatre director...', 'Marc Deville is an acclaimed author of erotic literature. In his personal life, however, physical closeness with the opposite sex eludes him. Being a porn addict, his sexuality is narrowly defined by the framed images he can masturbate to. One day he meets Justine, a nurse with a fetish of her own: her love for erotic asphyxiaton has estranged her from her husband Eric, a theatre director...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uJ9BXpiz53mEKMQKE2bERZ1Mcf3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:394514'),
  ('1096418652648533135', 'The Skin of Sorrow', 2010, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Philippe Lardon, Alain Berliner', null, 'Thomas Coumans, Annabelle Hettmann, Julien Honoré, Mylène Jampanoï, Jean-Pierre Marielle, Aymeric Cormerais, Henri Courseaux, Louis-Do de Lencquesaing', null, 'It''s 1832, 22-year-old Raphaël''s gambling has driven him to the brink of suicide. As he is about to throw himself in the Seine, a shopkeeper offers him something: a mysterious "skin of sorrow", which will grant all his wishes, but in doing so will shrink his remaining time on earth.', 'It''s 1832, 22-year-old Raphaël''s gambling has driven him to the brink of suicide. As he is about to throw himself in the Seine, a shopkeeper offers him something: a mysterious "skin of sorrow", which will grant all his wishes, but in doing so will shrink his remaining time on earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hExfXPzp6A52eLFG8LoD9n56fJd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:273279'),
  ('519645729097154411', 'The Skin of the Wolf', 2018, 'Romance, Drama', 'Samu Fuentes, Aitor Mantxola', 'Samu Fuentes', 'Mario Casas, Irene Escolar, Ruth Díaz, Quimet Pla, Paco Sagarzazu, Kandido Uranga, Josean Bengoetxea', null, 'Martinón is the last inhabitant of Auzal, a village in the mountains where he lives in communion with nature. He only goes down to the valleys twice a year to trade and to buy provisions. But one day he’s convinced to take a wife, a decision intended to soften his calloused soul—but in some ways his real struggle is only just beginning.', 'Martinón is the last inhabitant of Auzal, a village in the mountains where he lives in communion with nature. He only goes down to the valleys twice a year to trade and to buy provisions. But one day he’s convinced to take a wife, a decision intended to soften his calloused soul—but in some ways his real struggle is only just beginning.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iPwqpdpyYz2LGw5oU1DczGrNi2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:437380'),
  ('601880774315118836', 'The Skin Under the Claws', 1975, 'Mystery, Horror', 'Alessandro Santini', 'Alessandro Santini', 'Gordon Mitchell, Geneviève Audry, Tino Boriani, Ettore Ribotta, Agostino De Simone, Renzo Borelli, Mirella Rossi, Ada Pometti', null, 'A series of brutal murders, the police on their toes, but they can not find a way to catch the sadistic murderer. A mad doctor experiments with ways to cheat death and confuse his pursuers with the help of a corpse identical DNA to his own. His young female victims are raped and brutally murdered with a knife. In the victims'' fingernails will find the police traces of rotted human flesh.', 'A series of brutal murders, the police on their toes, but they can not find a way to catch the sadistic murderer. A mad doctor experiments with ways to cheat death and confuse his pursuers with the help of a corpse identical DNA to his own. His young female victims are raped and brutally murdered with a knife. In the victims'' fingernails will find the police traces of rotted human flesh.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ALeuRD5wkrGpFTVEqXT2rnIjnr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105432'),
  ('514115828038998819', 'The Skippers of the Cameleon', 2003, 'Family', 'Steven de Jong', 'Jean Ummels', 'Koen van der Donk, Jos van der Donk, Maarten Spanjer, Steven de Jong, Saar Koningsberger, Rense Westra, Willeke van Ammelrooy, Peter Tuinman', null, 'Two young boy twins receive a boat of their own by a stroke of luck. It turns out to be very fast and they use their boat to help out their friends.', 'Two young boy twins receive a boat of their own by a stroke of luck. It turns out to be very fast and they use their boat to help out their friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kEH4MVGLM0y1Za9U2snpVdOZUjE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33021'),
