  ('1010194126457931414', 'The Skipping Cheese', 1907, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Georges Méliès', null, null, null, 'The interior of a trolley car. A menagerie of passengers notices a foul odour, and pinpoint the source of the stench at a cheese saleswoman. The gendarmerie removes her from the trolley and drags her to the precinct.', 'The interior of a trolley car. A menagerie of passengers notices a foul odour, and pinpoint the source of the stench at a cheese saleswoman. The gendarmerie removes her from the trolley and drags her to the precinct.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1YFvkHqvRQaQpgIvgjryVQqfvdJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:166760'),
