  ('8778948145084410', 'The Skull', 1965, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Kenneth Ryan, Freddie Francis, John Wilcox', 'Robert Bloch', 'Peter Cushing, Christopher Lee, Patrick Wymark, Jill Bennett, Peter Woodthorpe, Nigel Green, April Olrich, George Coulouris', null, 'Esoterica collector Dr Maitland buys an unusual skull from his ordinary source; the artifact is what remains of the Marquis De Sade. Much too soon, Maitland discovers that the skull is turning him into a frenzied killer.', 'Esoterica collector Dr Maitland buys an unusual skull from his ordinary source; the artifact is what remains of the Marquis De Sade. Much too soon, Maitland discovers that the skull is turning him into a frenzied killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zBMT4WHMk4xdYv3puiHTa663Kd5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42745'),
  ('772634834005841845', 'The Skulls', 2000, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Shane Hurlbut, Rob Cohen, Branko Racki', 'John Pogue', 'Joshua Jackson, Paul Walker, Hill Harper, Leslie Bibb, Christopher McDonald, Steve Harris, William Petersen, Craig T. Nelson', 'PG-13', 'A senior at an Ivy League college, who depends on scholarships and working on the side, gets accepted into the secret society The Skulls. He hopes it betters chances at Harvard but The Skulls is not what he thought and comes at a price.', 'A senior at an Ivy League college, who depends on scholarships and working on the side, gets accepted into the secret society The Skulls. He hopes it betters chances at Harvard but The Skulls is not what he thought and comes at a price.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pYuggibfzm8LWgjnUKMMtii2430.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11478'),
  ('939457899808995018', 'The Skulls II', 2002, 'Action, Thriller', 'Joe Chappelle, Steve Danyluk', 'John Pogue', 'Robin Dunne, Nathan West, Ashley Tesoro, Lindy Booth, James Gallanders, Andrew Gillies, Aaron Ashmore, Stephen Young', 'R', 'After joining the Skulls, Ryan Sommers (Robin Dunne) is warned not to betray any secrets about the organization or its high-powered members. However, when Ryan witnesses a murder within the Skulls'' private chambers, he finds that the closer he gets to revealing the truth - the more dangerous life becomes.', 'After joining the Skulls, Ryan Sommers (Robin Dunne) is warned not to betray any secrets about the organization or its high-powered members. However, when Ryan witnesses a murder within the Skulls'' private chambers, he finds that the closer he gets to revealing the truth - the more dangerous life becomes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h6atL0SP5qg6TXOXy9DklZgObn2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8460'),
  ('871813028389220744', 'The Skulls III', 2004, 'Thriller', 'J. Miles Dale, David A. Makin', 'John Pogue, Joe Johnson', 'Clare Kramer, Barry Bostwick, Steve Braun, Maria del Mar, Len Cariou, Brooke D''Orsay, Dean McDermott, Bryce Johnson', 'PG-13', 'A young college co-ed tries joining the elite, all-male, secret society, the Skulls, and in so doing, she uncovers some unscrupulous methods used by some of the members to get what they want.', 'A young college co-ed tries joining the elite, all-male, secret society, the Skulls, and in so doing, she uncovers some unscrupulous methods used by some of the members to get what they want.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b6ugfuEwEND5UCuf6Hu6XBmWOQP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10594'),
  ('687711912642674397', 'The Sky Above Paris', 1992, 'Drama', 'Michel Béna, Jean-Marc Fabre', 'Isabelle Coudrier-Kleist, Michel Béna, Cécile Vargaftig', 'Sandrine Bonnaire, Marc Fourastier, Paul Blain, Tanya Lopert, Évelyne Bouix, Armand Delcampe, Niels Dubost, Françoise Patou', null, 'Marc is in love with Lucien, who''s in love with Suzanne, who''s in love with someone else.', 'Marc is in love with Lucien, who''s in love with Suzanne, who''s in love with someone else.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pfpZvFNrIFGqUudT1GKi5oVBc8O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63690'),
  ('889638159266876211', 'The Sky Calls', 1959, 'Science Fiction', 'Aleksandr Kozyr, Mikhail Karyukov, Georgi Parakhnikov', 'Evgeniy Pomeshchikov, Aleksey Sazonov, Mikhail Karyukov', 'Ivan Pereverzev, Gurgen Tonunts, Aleksandr Shvorin, Konstantin Bartashevich, Larisa Borisenko, Valentin Chernyak, Viktor Dobrovolsky, Aleksandra Popova', null, 'This movie follows the crew of the spaceship Homeland, preparing for the first manned mission to Mars. When an American ship, Typhoon, rushes to beat them and suffers a critical malfunction, the Soviets divert their mission to attempt a rescue. Stranded on the asteroid Icarus with depleted fuel, the cosmonauts await a desperate rescue mission that may cost another crew their lives.', 'This movie follows the crew of the spaceship Homeland, preparing for the first manned mission to Mars. When an American ship, Typhoon, rushes to beat them and suffers a critical malfunction, the Soviets divert their mission to attempt a rescue. Stranded on the asteroid Icarus with depleted fuel, the cosmonauts await a desperate rescue mission that may cost another crew their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cp7LLXSJvCb3gK6gxe0m1NjyEEu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:268717'),
  ('1132401355751902073', 'The Sky Crawlers', 2008, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, War, Science Fiction', 'Mamoru Oshii, Tetsuya Nishio, Kazuhiro Wakabayashi', 'Chihiro Ito', 'Rinko Kikuchi, Ryo Kase, Shosuke Tanihara, Megumi Yamaguchi, Daisuke Hirakawa, Takuma Takewaka, Mugihito, Hochu Otsuka', 'PG-13', 'Youngsters called Kildren, who are destined to live eternally in their adolescence. The Kildren are conscious that every day could be the last, because they fight a war as entertainment, organized and operated by adults. But as they embrace the reality they are faced with, they live their day-to-day lives to the full.', 'Youngsters called Kildren, who are destined to live eternally in their adolescence. The Kildren are conscious that every day could be the last, because they fight a war as entertainment, organized and operated by adults. But as they embrace the reality they are faced with, they live their day-to-day lives to the full.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bCObr03CsKOOwKysoUL5teG8wmU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15877'),
  ('866283634595243828', 'The Sky Is Everywhere', 2022, 'Drama, Romance, Music', 'Ava Berkofsky, Josephine Decker, Jeremiah Kelleher', 'Jandy Nelson', 'Grace Kaufman, Jacques Colimon, Cherry Jones, Jason Segel, Pico Alexander, Ji-young Yoo, Havana Rose Liu, Julia Schlaepfer', 'PG-13', 'Lennie is a teen musical prodigy grieving the death of her sister when she finds herself caught between a new guy at school and her sister''s devastated boyfriend. Through her vivid imagination and conflicted heart, Lennie navigates first love and first loss.', 'Lennie is a teen musical prodigy grieving the death of her sister when she finds herself caught between a new guy at school and her sister''s devastated boyfriend. Through her vivid imagination and conflicted heart, Lennie navigates first love and first loss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qMVUlq6rdqFo1xZ5ozQcKFCDbgj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:640265'),
  ('11935160437914145', 'The Sky is Falling', 1975, 'Drama, Fantasy, Horror, Thriller', 'Silvio Narizzano, Fernando Arribas, Rudy Modina', 'Gonzalo Suárez, Win Wells', 'Carroll Baker, Dennis Hopper, Win Wells, Richard Todd, Faith Brook, Ivonne Sentis, Rory MacDonald, David Carpenter', null, 'Chicken, a desperate hippie junkie living in a small Spanish village, is finding it difficult to separate fantasy and reality. This isn''t helped by the villagers practising magic and child sacrifice, or his involvement with a group of boozy expatriates lost in their own dreams and regrets.', 'Chicken, a desperate hippie junkie living in a small Spanish village, is finding it difficult to separate fantasy and reality. This isn''t helped by the villagers practising magic and child sacrifice, or his involvement with a group of boozy expatriates lost in their own dreams and regrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jfhjd2VKFF8HVpXQdPKbspCgDxn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:253788'),
  ('438126857838737548', 'The Sky Is Falling', 2000, 'War, Drama, Music, Romance', 'Andrea Frazzi, Antonio Frazzi', 'Suso Cecchi d''Amico', 'Isabella Rossellini, Jeroen Krabbé, Barbara Enrichi, Gianna Giachetti, Luciano Virgilio, Azzurra Antonacci', null, '1943, an estate north of Firenze. The weight of the world is on the shoulders of Penny, who''s about 10. An orphan, she must watch over her little sister when they go to live with her aunt and uncle. Penny''s a Catholic, and worries about her uncle''s soul. He''s Jewish, progressive and a free thinker, a fair boss, and devoted to his family. He can be stern, so Penny also worries that she''ll never please him and that he won''t love her. Then, after the Allied forces land in Sicily and the Germans begin their retreat, Penny must worry about her uncle''s life. She tries logic and appeals to human decency. Can a child keep the sky from falling?', '1943, an estate north of Firenze. The weight of the world is on the shoulders of Penny, who''s about 10. An orphan, she must watch over her little sister when they go to live with her aunt and uncle. Penny''s a Catholic, and worries about her uncle''s soul. He''s Jewish, progressive and a free thinker, a fair boss, and devoted to his family. He can be stern, so Penny also worries that she''ll never please him and that he won''t love her. Then, after the Allied forces land in Sicily and the Germans begin their retreat, Penny must worry about her uncle''s life. She tries logic and appeals to human decency. Can a child keep the sky from falling?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4jz6cBeGeOf3UPR2JMcek0XWHD8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:173374'),
  ('1003084562397893083', 'The Sky Is Pink', 2019, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Shonali Bose, Anubhav Chopra, Shubhagat Chowdhury', 'Nilesh Maniyar, Shonali Bose', 'Priyanka Chopra Jonas, Zaira Wasim, Farhan Akhtar, Rohit Saraf, Manas Mittal, Rajshri Deshpande, Sunil Chitkara, Lushin Dubey', null, 'The 25-year-old love story of a couple is told through the lens of their teenage daughter after she is diagnosed with pulmonary fibrosis.', 'The 25-year-old love story of a couple is told through the lens of their teenage daughter after she is diagnosed with pulmonary fibrosis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jXseh5pR0NuuNhHhyhM5DasqL8v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:613446'),
  ('762596673663577117', 'The Sky Slow-Mover', 1946, 'War, Comedy, Romance', 'Semyon Timoshenko, Alexandr Sigaev, I. Shchipanov', 'Semyon Timoshenko', 'Nikolay Kryuchkov, Vasili Merkuryev, Vasili Neshchiplenko, Alla Parfanyak, Lyudmila Glazova, Tamara Alyoshina, Yakov Gudkin, Faina Ranevskaya', null, 'Three pilots are best friends and good fighters. During the WWII they are taking an oath to refrain from love until the end of the War. But soon they meet three women-pilots. One by one they give up the oath, and all three fall in love.', 'Three pilots are best friends and good fighters. During the WWII they are taking an oath to refrain from love until the end of the War. But soon they meet three women-pilots. One by one they give up the oath, and all three fall in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9IKmWEqAhoZtshyG1B7tTDDTuIN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65678'),
  ('42574824427101780', 'The Sky''s the Limit', 1943, 'Comedy, Romance, Music', 'Edward H. Griffith, Russell Metty, Ruby Rosenberg', 'Frank Fenton, Lynn Root', 'Fred Astaire, Joan Leslie, Robert Benchley, Robert Ryan, Elizabeth Patterson, Marjorie Gateson, Freddie Slack, Bobby Barber', 'NR', 'Flying Tiger Fred Atwell sneaks away from his famous squadron''s personal appearance tour and goes incognito for several days of leave. He quickly falls for photographer Joan Manion, pursuing her in the guise of a carefree drifter.', 'Flying Tiger Fred Atwell sneaks away from his famous squadron''s personal appearance tour and goes incognito for several days of leave. He quickly falls for photographer Joan Manion, pursuing her in the guise of a carefree drifter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3JyoLIc6Okuyl2aZh0EwpmkwW7s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43515'),
