  ('107012271719714996', 'The Sleeping Beast Within', 1960, 'Action, Crime', 'Seijun Suzuki, Shigeyoshi Mine, Kazunari Takeda', 'Ichirō Ikeda', 'Hiroyuki Nagato, Kazuko Yoshiyuki, Shoichi Ozawa, Shinsuke Ashida, Hisano Yamaoka, Tsutomu Shimomoto, Kōjirō Kusanagi, Keisuke Noro', null, 'A newspaper reporter''s search for his girlfriend''s missing father lead him into heart of the criminal underworld of Yokohama''s Chinatown.', 'A newspaper reporter''s search for his girlfriend''s missing father lead him into heart of the criminal underworld of Yokohama''s Chinatown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x0vYWTwHnqgPYWfmlEnDDd0Ph89.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:363586'),
  ('719885936178269075', 'The Sleeping Beauty', 1952, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Gilberto Martínez Solares, Raúl Martínez Solares', null, 'Germán Valdés, Lilia del Valle, Wolf Ruvinskis, Marcelo Chávez, José René Ruiz ''Tun-Tun'', Pascual García Peña, Ramón Valdés', null, 'A Mexican comedy loosely playing off of the tale of Sleeping Beauty. A caveman wakes up after a thousand year slumber. When he awakens he is seen as a wonder to behold, and discovers his ancient love and romantic rival are seemingly still alive as well.', 'A Mexican comedy loosely playing off of the tale of Sleeping Beauty. A caveman wakes up after a thousand year slumber. When he awakens he is seen as a wonder to behold, and discovers his ancient love and romantic rival are seemingly still alive as well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7nBNndkMEYhaN13vcagfFiOsvKb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:333349'),
  ('1110764755407116459', 'The Sleeping Beauty', 2010, 'Fantasy, Drama', 'Catherine Breillat, Denis Lenoir, Gwenaëlle Duriaud', 'Catherine Breillat', 'Carla Besnaïnou, Julia Artamonov, Kerian Mayan, David Chausse, Luna Charpentier, Rhizlaine El Cohen, Dounia Sichov, Leslie Lipkins', 'NR', 'A young princess is the subject of a tug-of-war among witches, as each struggles to find the suitable antidote to a death sentence inculcated by an evil sister.', 'A young princess is the subject of a tug-of-war among witches, as each struggles to find the suitable antidote to a death sentence inculcated by an evil sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/79SW6ThZOgBk23I6wexdcwPormM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65016'),
  ('613402887977699013', 'The Sleeping Car', 1990, 'Horror', 'Douglas Curtis, Hope Perello, Max W. Anderson', 'Greg Collins O''Neill', 'David Naughton, Judie Aronson, Kevin McCarthy, Jeff Conaway, Dani Minnick, Ernestine Mercer, John Carl Buechler, Gary Brockette', 'R', 'Jason moves into an abandoned train car where he resurrects the vicious ghost of his landlady''s dead husband... The Mister. After some near-fatal encounters with the violent specter, he consults a local exorcist.', 'Jason moves into an abandoned train car where he resurrects the vicious ghost of his landlady''s dead husband... The Mister. After some near-fatal encounters with the violent specter, he consults a local exorcist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g68lbZWfS8dubHWKvJN6tfDd3ZU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108933'),
  ('252883514458071762', 'The Sleeping Car Murders', 1965, 'Crime, Thriller, Mystery', 'Costa-Gavras, Jean Tournier, Bernard Paul', 'Costa-Gavras', 'Yves Montand, Pierre Mondy, Jean-Louis Trintignant, Jacques Perrin, Catherine Allégret, Simone Signoret, Claude Mann, Michel Piccoli', 'NR', 'Six people travel by overnight train from Marseilles to Paris. When they arrive, one of them, a young woman, is found dead in a sleeping berth. The police, led by Inspector Grazzi, investigate the other five passengers, suspecting that one among them was responsible. However, as the investigation is stepped up, the others start turning up dead. It''s up to the remaining two to solve the case, lest they become the next victims.', 'Six people travel by overnight train from Marseilles to Paris. When they arrive, one of them, a young woman, is found dead in a sleeping berth. The police, led by Inspector Grazzi, investigate the other five passengers, suspecting that one among them was responsible. However, as the investigation is stepped up, the others start turning up dead. It''s up to the remaining two to solve the case, lest they become the next victims.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/msJGRCLe3WV3geKQ0suhVAlms97.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4311'),
  ('475409891334680908', 'The Sleeping Cardinal', 1931, 'Mystery, Crime', 'Leslie S. Hiscott, Sydney Blythe', 'Cyril Twyford', 'Arthur Wontner, Ian Fleming, Minnie Rayner, Leslie Perrins, Jane Welsh, Norman McKinnel, William Fazan, Sydney King', 'NR', 'A card cheat is threatened with exposure into joining a criminal enterprise that Sherlock Holmes believes is controlled by Professor Moriarity.', 'A card cheat is threatened with exposure into joining a criminal enterprise that Sherlock Holmes believes is controlled by Professor Moriarity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6JN7iV2u3BZfSQH2Rb8P3AjbYjF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97554'),
  ('296898982901200142', 'The Sleeping City', 1950, 'Crime, Mystery, Drama', 'George Sherman, William Miller, Frank Skinner', 'Jo Eisinger', 'Richard Conte, Coleen Gray, Richard Taber, John Alexander, Peggy Dow, Alex Nicol, Carroll Ashburn, Frank Baxter', 'NR', 'A young doctor taking a break from work is shot in the head, and the police can''t find a clue even as to a possible motive. Inspector Al Gordon (John Alexander) decides that he has to put some men on duty at the hospital, and one of them is Fred Rowan (Richard Conte), a detective with experience as an army medic, masquerading as an intern. What Rowan finds is a high-pressure world in which interns are hopelessly squeezed for time, sleep, energy, and -- most of all -- money, and walk a fine line on the edge of personal and professional disaster.', 'A young doctor taking a break from work is shot in the head, and the police can''t find a clue even as to a possible motive. Inspector Al Gordon (John Alexander) decides that he has to put some men on duty at the hospital, and one of them is Fred Rowan (Richard Conte), a detective with experience as an army medic, masquerading as an intern. What Rowan finds is a high-pressure world in which interns are hopelessly squeezed for time, sleep, energy, and -- most of all -- money, and walk a fine line on the edge of personal and professional disaster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9sL3BRctVMOLACQqKRlpCYxj7wX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36664'),
  ('237171546896980125', 'The Sleeping Dictionary', 2003, 'Drama, Romance', 'Guy Jenkin, Martin Fuhrer, Clinton Cavers', 'Guy Jenkin', 'Jessica Alba, Brenda Blethyn, Hugh Dancy, Bob Hoskins, Christopher Ling Lee Ian, Junix Inocian, Michael Jessing Langgi, Mano Maniam', 'R', 'In the 1930s, British officer John Truscott journeys to a remote village in colonial Malaysia to educate and Westernize the local Iban population. There, he''s introduced to the lovely Selima. In keeping with tradition, Selima is assigned to sleep with Truscott and teach him the native language and customs. But when they fall in love, both colonists and natives object to their plans to marry.', 'In the 1930s, British officer John Truscott journeys to a remote village in colonial Malaysia to educate and Westernize the local Iban population. There, he''s introduced to the lovely Selima. In keeping with tradition, Selima is assigned to sleep with Truscott and teach him the native language and customs. But when they fall in love, both colonists and natives object to their plans to marry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bszp3HdnaBE6ptfio37vB3JckuL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25988'),
  ('771802773515175592', 'The Sleeping Tiger', 1954, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Joseph Losey, Harry Waxman, Denis Johnson', 'Harold Buchman, Carl Foreman', 'Dirk Bogarde, Alexis Smith, Alexander Knox, Hugh Griffith, Patricia McCarron, Maxine Audley, Glyn Houston, Harry Towb', null, 'A petty thief breaks into the home of a psychiatrist and gets caught in a web of a doctor who wishes to experiment on him and a doctor''s wife who wishes to seduce him.', 'A petty thief breaks into the home of a psychiatrist and gets caught in a web of a doctor who wishes to experiment on him and a doctor''s wife who wishes to seduce him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6NXrKPB7iP4Fa3nZwhbj8U9hWga.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74753'),
  ('452925115069658442', 'The Sleeping Voice', 2011, 'Drama, History', 'Benito Zambrano, Álex Catalán', 'Benito Zambrano, Ignacio del Moral, Carmen López Areal', 'Inma Cuesta, María León, Marc Clotet, Daniel Holguín, Ana Wagener, Susi Sánchez, Berta Ojea, Lola Casamayor', null, 'Finished the Spanish Civil War in April 1939, in November 1940, while Spain is being crushed by the ruthless boot of dictator Franco, Pepita travels from rural Córdoba to Madrid to be near her sister Hortensia, who is seven months pregnant and imprisoned, haunted by the shadow of a death sentence.', 'Finished the Spanish Civil War in April 1939, in November 1940, while Spain is being crushed by the ruthless boot of dictator Franco, Pepita travels from rural Córdoba to Madrid to be near her sister Hortensia, who is seven months pregnant and imprisoned, haunted by the shadow of a death sentence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8lZkChW71KsJlhypnsbKwaYP05d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79745'),
  ('677809698442796766', 'The Sleeping Woman', 2024, 'Thriller, Horror, Fantasy', 'Laura Alvea', 'Marta Armengol, Miguel Ibáñez Monroy, Daniel González', 'Almudena Amor, Javier Rey, Amanda Goldsmith, Yaneli Hernández, Alicia Lobo, Pino Montesdeoca, Vera Curbelo, Leo Venosa', null, 'Ana, a nursing assistant, begins to feel attracted to Agustín, the husband of the woman in a vegetative state that she has been hired to take care of. Soon she begins to be harassed by strange paranormal phenomena that seem to try to throw her out of the house and separate her from Agustín.', 'Ana, a nursing assistant, begins to feel attracted to Agustín, the husband of the woman in a vegetative state that she has been hired to take care of. Soon she begins to be harassed by strange paranormal phenomena that seem to try to throw her out of the house and separate her from Agustín.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7pByTJnxbnOzRTIxA6jOXf41nvR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1235926'),
  ('870124794518265439', 'The Sleepover', 2020, 'Family, Action', 'Trish Sie, Conrad W. Hall', 'Sarah Rothschild', 'Sadie Stanley, Maxwell Simkins, Cree Cicchino, Lucas Jaye, Malin Åkerman, Ken Marino, Joe Manganiello, Harry Aspinwall', 'PG-13', 'Two siblings who discover their seemingly normal mom is a former thief in witness protection. Mom is forced to pull one last job, and the kids team up to rescue her over the course of an action-packed night.', 'Two siblings who discover their seemingly normal mom is a former thief in witness protection. Mom is forced to pull one last job, and the kids team up to rescue her over the course of an action-packed night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9iEc34Qje2V3FZnrSXKfZsbiHjW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:626393'),
  ('1116761522408130126', 'The Sleepwalker', 1942, 'Animation', 'Clyde Geronimi', null, 'Pinto Colvig', 'NR', 'Pluto has a tussle over a bone with a female dachsaund named Dinah unaware that he is actually giving her the bone whenever he walks in his sleep and presents it to her. However, each time he awakens, he angrily demands it back until he discovers Dinah''s puppies at which point he feels bad and offers up his entire collection of bones to Dinah''s family as well as his doghouse.', 'Pluto has a tussle over a bone with a female dachsaund named Dinah unaware that he is actually giving her the bone whenever he walks in his sleep and presents it to her. However, each time he awakens, he angrily demands it back until he discovers Dinah''s puppies at which point he feels bad and offers up his entire collection of bones to Dinah''s family as well as his doghouse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b2sZDnbRqUbEsybAngbFYlLJihf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68522'),
  ('133352500587739067', 'The Sleepwalker', 1951, 'Comedy', 'Maurice Labro, Denys de La Patellière, Roger de Broin', 'Gérard Cartier', 'Fernandel, Louis de Funès, Gaby André, Andrex, Michel Ardan, André Roanne, Raoul Marco, Julien Maffre', null, 'Victor Boniface''s life is not exactly a rest cure. Just imagine: Victor is both a store detective and a ... shoplifter (only when he walks in his sleep, mind you)! And falling in love while sleepwalking is no bed of roses either, as the good-natured man simply forgets everything after waking up. Fortunately love wins the game in the end. Does that mean that life will become as easy as pie ? Certainly not: the little Bonifaces will be sleepwalkers just like their daddy!', 'Victor Boniface''s life is not exactly a rest cure. Just imagine: Victor is both a store detective and a ... shoplifter (only when he walks in his sleep, mind you)! And falling in love while sleepwalking is no bed of roses either, as the good-natured man simply forgets everything after waking up. Fortunately love wins the game in the end. Does that mean that life will become as easy as pie ? Certainly not: the little Bonifaces will be sleepwalkers just like their daddy!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/61cWZQW0SbWm3AYqeT9TIRxLoeY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35822'),
  ('85146003082031912', 'The Sleepwalkers', 2019, 'Drama, Family', 'Verónica Biasin, Gastón Grazide, Mariano Biasin', 'Paula Hernández', 'Érica Rivas, Ornella D''Elía, Marilú Marini, Luis Ziembrowski, Daniel Hendler, Rafael Federman, Valeria Lois, Gloria Demassi', null, 'A woman and her 14-year-old daughter, who is a sleepwalker, in the midst of awakening. A marriage on the edges of a silenced crisis. A ritualistic, matriarchal, and endogamous family. Grandmother, siblings, cousins. A new summer, sweat, alcohol, traditions. Naked bodies, changing bodies, and the gazes upon those emerging bodies. A new New Year''s celebration in the old historic family mansion is the trap for the sleepwalkers to finally awaken.', 'A woman and her 14-year-old daughter, who is a sleepwalker, in the midst of awakening. A marriage on the edges of a silenced crisis. A ritualistic, matriarchal, and endogamous family. Grandmother, siblings, cousins. A new summer, sweat, alcohol, traditions. Naked bodies, changing bodies, and the gazes upon those emerging bodies. A new New Year''s celebration in the old historic family mansion is the trap for the sleepwalkers to finally awaken.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tN9BEDSBJGag4oFIPgXFKjUKmOm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:621462'),
  ('130475328565769608', 'The Slender Thread', 1965, 'Drama', 'Sydney Pollack, Donald Roberts, William R. Poole', 'Stirling Silliphant', 'Sidney Poitier, Anne Bancroft, Telly Savalas, Steven Hill, Ed Asner, Indus Arthur, Paul Newlan, Dabney Coleman', 'NR', 'Alan is a Seattle college student volunteering at a crisis center. One night when at the clinic alone, a woman calls up the number and tells Alan that she needs to talk to someone. She informs Alan she took a load of pills, and he secretly tries to get help. During this time, he learns more about the woman, her family life, and why she wants to die. Can Alan get the cavalry to save her in time before it''s too late?', 'Alan is a Seattle college student volunteering at a crisis center. One night when at the clinic alone, a woman calls up the number and tells Alan that she needs to talk to someone. She informs Alan she took a load of pills, and he secretly tries to get help. During this time, he learns more about the woman, her family life, and why she wants to die. Can Alan get the cavalry to save her in time before it''s too late?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bVJ9p6nTX2nvzAviASuvtMSQ6Jp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51054'),
  ('984088539794102933', 'The Slime People', 1963, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Robert Hutton, William G. Troiano', 'Blair Robertson, Joseph F. Robertson', 'Robert Hutton, Robert Burton, Susan Hart, Judee Morton, William Boyce, Les Tremayne, John Close, Edward Finch Abrams', 'NR', 'After Los Angeles is invaded by an army of subterranean monsters, a small group of people must fight for survival in the deserted metropolis.', 'After Los Angeles is invaded by an army of subterranean monsters, a small group of people must fight for survival in the deserted metropolis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dQxxekz2IygIn9x7ODxdc9DiZ20.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63087'),
  ('408765839412554896', 'The Slingshot', 1993, 'Drama', 'Åke Sandgren, Göran Nilsson', 'Åke Sandgren, Roland Schütt', 'Stellan Skarsgård, Jesper Salén, Basia Frydman, Niclas Olund, Ernst-Hugo Järegård, Reine Brynolfsson, Frida Hallgren, Axel Düberg', null, 'Stockholm in the 1920s. Young Roland lives with his socialist father, Jewish mother and a boxing brother. His mother sells condoms illegally, and from them, Roland makes slingshots which he sells. His rebellious ways has gotten him the special attention of his school teacher, who always makes sure that Roland is punished. Roland also tries to make extra money by repairing bicycles, a successful business that in the end lands him in hot water.', 'Stockholm in the 1920s. Young Roland lives with his socialist father, Jewish mother and a boxing brother. His mother sells condoms illegally, and from them, Roland makes slingshots which he sells. His rebellious ways has gotten him the special attention of his school teacher, who always makes sure that Roland is punished. Roland also tries to make extra money by repairing bicycles, a successful business that in the end lands him in hot water.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hu8OM6AkfZeYlG10q5aQ9e07PqZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41653'),
  ('622109922470633446', 'The Slipper and the Rose', 1976, 'Fantasy, Romance, Music', 'Bryan Forbes, Tony Imi, Jack Causey', 'Bryan Forbes, Robert B. Sherman, Richard M. Sherman', 'Richard Chamberlain, Gemma Craven, Annette Crosbie, Edith Evans, Christopher Gable, Michael Hordern, Margaret Lockwood, Kenneth More', 'G', 'Prince Edward wants to marry for love, but the King and court of the Kingdom of Euphrania are anxious for the Prince to wed no matter what. When the Prince meets Cinderella at a ball, he''s sure she''s the one, and when she loses her slipper upon exiting the dance, the Prince is determined to find and marry her.', 'Prince Edward wants to marry for love, but the King and court of the Kingdom of Euphrania are anxious for the Prince to wed no matter what. When the Prince meets Cinderella at a ball, he''s sure she''s the one, and when she loses her slipper upon exiting the dance, the Prince is determined to find and marry her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o7tQ79sqZwt5dQskCW5ymjtd13r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16176'),
  ('625933439081982787', 'The Sloth Lane', 2024, 'Animation, Family', 'Tania Vincent, Ricard Cussó', 'Ryan Greaves, Tania Vincent', 'Teo Vergara, Olivia Vasquez, Benjamín Gorroño, Facundo Hache Herrera, Remy Hii, Leslie Jones, Matteo Romaniuk, Evie', 'PG', 'After a terrifying storm destroys their home, a speedy sloth named Laura and her kooky family move to the big city in their rusted old food truck, Gordito, hoping to make their business a success. The family''s delicious food catches the eye of a quick-witted cheetah who will stop at nothing to revive her failing fast-food business.', 'After a terrifying storm destroys their home, a speedy sloth named Laura and her kooky family move to the big city in their rusted old food truck, Gordito, hoping to make their business a success. The family''s delicious food catches the eye of a quick-witted cheetah who will stop at nothing to revive her failing fast-food business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/toBN1A9AnhoUzXyu9gaVyQVJehp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1189423'),
  ('288245542657152290', 'The Slugger''s Wife', 1985, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Caleb Deschanel, Hal Ashby, Frank Bueno', 'Neil Simon', 'Michael O''Keefe, Rebecca De Mornay, Martin Ritt, Randy Quaid, Cleavant Derricks, Lisa Langlois, Loudon Wainwright III, Georgann Johnson', 'PG-13', 'Darryl Palmer is a major league baseball player who meets and pursues an attractive singer. After some setbacks, the two are married and sent on an emotional journey that sees his career take off, while hers doesn''t. She can''t escape unhappiness when she gives up her dreams to support her husband. With a separation on the horizon, Darryl must choose between his big-league life and his one true love.', 'Darryl Palmer is a major league baseball player who meets and pursues an attractive singer. After some setbacks, the two are married and sent on an emotional journey that sees his career take off, while hers doesn''t. She can''t escape unhappiness when she gives up her dreams to support her husband. With a separation on the horizon, Darryl must choose between his big-league life and his one true love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g5psR5tS3uFKRwcUGmHQcycc6iF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78364'),
  ('891511495259299088', 'The Slumber Party', 2023, 'Comedy, Family', 'Veronica Rodriguez, John Rusk, Justin Riemer', 'Eydie Faye', 'Darby Camp, Emmy Liu-Wang, Alex Cooper Cohen, Valentina Herrera, Dallas Liu, Ramon Jose Rodriguez, Caroline Valencia, Jacqueline Correa', 'PG', 'The hilarious aftermath of a sleepover birthday party hypnotism gone wrong as best friends Megan and Paige, along with soon-to-be step-sister Veronica, wake up with absolutely no memory of the night before.', 'The hilarious aftermath of a sleepover birthday party hypnotism gone wrong as best friends Megan and Paige, along with soon-to-be step-sister Veronica, wake up with absolutely no memory of the night before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2jjOBcKJYb5FRTcsqL6yRtAY3Wr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1029549'),
  ('1021561126029922002', 'The Slumber Party Massacre', 1982, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Amy Holden Jones, Stephen L. Posey, Mark Allan', 'Rita Mae Brown, Amy Holden Jones', 'Michele Michaels, Robin Stille, Michael Villella, Debra De Liso, Andree Honore, Gina Smika Hunter, Jennifer Meyers, Joseph Alan Johnson', 'R', 'Trish invites her high school basketball teammates over for a night they''ll never forget when an unexpected guest crashes the party: an escaped psychopath with a portable power drill.', 'Trish invites her high school basketball teammates over for a night they''ll never forget when an unexpected guest crashes the party: an escaped psychopath with a portable power drill.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rh65oDy8CNJoEAOf7oudhIt3DM6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27475'),
  ('331821535286327920', 'The Slurb', 2001, 'Comedy', 'Ben Verbong, Klaus Eichhammer', 'Paul Maar, Ulrich Limmer', 'Ulrich Noethen, Christine Urspruch, Aglaia Szyszkowitz, Armin Rohde, Eva Mattes, August Zirner, Götz Schubert, Jan-Gregor Kremp', null, 'One Saturday, the Slurb, a strange little creature with a proboscis nose, enters Mr. Taschenbier''s life. Slurb, who immediately adopts the shy Mr. Taschenbier as his "daddy," is, however, his sheer opposite: he is cheeky and chaotic and throws his well-ordered life into sheer chaos. But when Taschenbier discovers that he can fulfill all his wishes with the help of Slurb''s blue freckles, his life suddenly changes. He appeases his bad-tempered landlady, Mrs. Rotkohl, and he can finally get one over on his nasty neighbor, Mr. Lürcher. Everything could be so nice if Mr. Taschenbier didn''t fall in love with his pretty colleague Mrs. März and if the Slurb didn''t almost burst with jealousy...', 'One Saturday, the Slurb, a strange little creature with a proboscis nose, enters Mr. Taschenbier''s life. Slurb, who immediately adopts the shy Mr. Taschenbier as his "daddy," is, however, his sheer opposite: he is cheeky and chaotic and throws his well-ordered life into sheer chaos. But when Taschenbier discovers that he can fulfill all his wishes with the help of Slurb''s blue freckles, his life suddenly changes. He appeases his bad-tempered landlady, Mrs. Rotkohl, and he can finally get one over on his nasty neighbor, Mr. Lürcher. Everything could be so nice if Mr. Taschenbier didn''t fall in love with his pretty colleague Mrs. März and if the Slurb didn''t almost burst with jealousy...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z5iCvXEzt4nXz8NQzqfTz7JuHBP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10645'),
  ('533482876469262666', 'The Small Back Room', 1949, 'Drama, War, Romance', 'Emeric Pressburger, Christopher Challis, Michael Powell', 'Emeric Pressburger, Michael Powell', 'David Farrar, Kathleen Byron, Jack Hawkins, Leslie Banks, Michael Gough, Cyril Cusack, Milton Rosmer, Walter Fitzgerald', null, 'As the Germans drop explosive booby-traps on 1943 Britain, the embittered expert who''ll have to disarm them fights a private battle with alcohol.', 'As the Germans drop explosive booby-traps on 1943 Britain, the embittered expert who''ll have to disarm them fights a private battle with alcohol.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9f1NRCFv634J0jXsdyEiwKLqgWV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46096'),
  ('391081538813565667', 'The Small One', 1978, 'Animation, Family', 'Don Bluth, Richard Rich', 'Vance Gerry, Peter Young', 'Sean Marshall, William Woodson, Olan Soule, Joe Higgins, Gordon Jump, Hal Smith', 'G', 'Ordered by his father to sell an old mule called Small One, a Hebrew boy in the ancient Holy Land takes the donkey to the Jerusalem market. Finding no buyers there, the boy is about to give up when he meets a kind man named Joseph, who buys Small One and uses the steed to take his pregnant wife Mary to Bethlehem.', 'Ordered by his father to sell an old mule called Small One, a Hebrew boy in the ancient Holy Land takes the donkey to the Jerusalem market. Finding no buyers there, the boy is about to give up when he meets a kind man named Joseph, who buys Small One and uses the steed to take his pregnant wife Mary to Bethlehem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dumrBarjoCd7tSarOYSRLiPFcPC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27287'),
  ('123963967052840346', 'The Small Town', 1997, 'Drama', 'Nuri Bilge Ceylan, Nuri Bilge Ceylan', 'Nuri Bilge Ceylan', 'Mehmet Emin Toprak, Havva Sağlam, Cihat Bütün, Fatma Ceylan, Mehmet Emin Ceylan, Sercihan Alioğlu, Semra Yılmaz, Latif Altıntaş', null, 'A story in four parts is told from the perspective of two children, showing life in school, in nature, with family and at home. All of this unfolding along with the seasons. The Small Town depicts life in the village, while also portraying the relationships between members of a small-town family, in a long centerpiece scene around a campfire with family members talking about the past, life and its disappointments. Both brother and sister witness the complexities and darkness of the adult world, as well as the mysteries of nature and wildlife.', 'A story in four parts is told from the perspective of two children, showing life in school, in nature, with family and at home. All of this unfolding along with the seasons. The Small Town depicts life in the village, while also portraying the relationships between members of a small-town family, in a long centerpiece scene around a campfire with family members talking about the past, life and its disappointments. Both brother and sister witness the complexities and darkness of the adult world, as well as the mysteries of nature and wildlife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3l8X5JRmdZckhaHbIml0UY0mbP5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52111'),
  ('691810475045455373', 'The Small Victories', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Mélanie Auffret, Laurent Dailland, Anahide Testud', 'Romain Compingt, Yoann Gromb', 'Michel Blanc, Julia Piaton, Lionel Abelanski, Marie Bunel, Marie-Pierre Casey, Sébastien Chassagne, India Hair, Bruno Raffaelli', null, 'Between her roles as mayor and teacher in the small village of Kerguen, Alice''s days are very full. When an unexpected new student, 60-year-old Emile, finally decides to learn to read and write, her daily life threatens to become unmanageable. Especially since Alice will also have to save her village and her school...', 'Between her roles as mayor and teacher in the small village of Kerguen, Alice''s days are very full. When an unexpected new student, 60-year-old Emile, finally decides to learn to read and write, her daily life threatens to become unmanageable. Especially since Alice will also have to save her village and her school...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7abkBKQ65ktmLus53D8d9BVEDvp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1000603'),
  ('905645677479118074', 'The Small World of Sammy Lee', 1963, 'Drama', 'Ken Hughes, Wolfgang Suschitzky, Ray Freeborn', 'Ken Hughes', 'Anthony Newley, Julia Foster, Robert Stephens, Wilfrid Brambell, Warren Mitchell, Miriam Karlin, Kenneth J. Warren, Clive Colin Bowler', null, 'Soho strip club compère Sammy Lee struggles to stay one step ahead of the notorious bookie, to whom he owes £300.', 'Soho strip club compère Sammy Lee struggles to stay one step ahead of the notorious bookie, to whom he owes £300.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Trt44jLU4rTRYg7JK8dbVdXNfe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95220'),
  ('291409238489288538', 'The Smallest Show on Earth', 1957, 'Comedy', 'Basil Dearden, Douglas Slocombe, Eddie Pike', 'William Rose, John Eldridge', 'Virginia McKenna, Bill Travers, Margaret Rutherford, Peter Sellers, Bernard Miles, Francis de Wolff, Leslie Phillips, June Cunningham', null, 'Jean and Bill are a married couple trying to scrape a living. Out of the blue they receive a telegram informing them Bill''s long-lost uncle has died and left them his business—a cinema in the town of Sloughborough. Unfortunately they can''t sell it for the fortune they hoped as they discover it is falling down and almost worthless.', 'Jean and Bill are a married couple trying to scrape a living. Out of the blue they receive a telegram informing them Bill''s long-lost uncle has died and left them his business—a cinema in the town of Sloughborough. Unfortunately they can''t sell it for the fortune they hoped as they discover it is falling down and almost worthless.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/epQZGlatIZvtJPAsfLJ8jOxFBNg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35185'),
  ('811328365278215979', 'The Smashing Bird I Used to Know', 1969, 'Drama', 'Robert Hartford-Davis, Peter Newbrook', 'John Peacock', 'Madeleine Hinde, Renée Asherson, Dennis Waterman, Patrick Mower, David Lodge, Maureen Lipman, Faith Brook, Janina Faye', null, 'A traumatized and troubled teenager is sent to an all-girls detention home where she strikes up an unlikely friendship with a fellow inmate.', 'A traumatized and troubled teenager is sent to an all-girls detention home where she strikes up an unlikely friendship with a fellow inmate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nF1SwYFu8aTUuUA5zCzf5TLKVL5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110431'),
  ('355375711737308931', 'The Smashing Machine', 2025, 'Drama, History', 'Benny Safdie, Maceo Bishop, Misha Bukowski', 'Benny Safdie', 'Dwayne Johnson, Emily Blunt, Ryan Bader, Bas Rutten, Oleksandr Usyk, Lyndsey Gavin, Zoe Kosovic, Satoshi Ishii', 'R', 'In the late 1990s, up-and-coming mixed martial artist Mark Kerr aspires to become the greatest fighter in the world. However, he must also battle his opioid dependence and a volatile relationship with his girlfriend Dawn.', 'In the late 1990s, up-and-coming mixed martial artist Mark Kerr aspires to become the greatest fighter in the world. However, he must also battle his opioid dependence and a volatile relationship with his girlfriend Dawn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mPuBDGrVIBGOymBxR6rO3iIvBSe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:760329'),
  ('709011478909697897', 'The Smell of Burning Ants', 1994, 'Documentary', 'Jay Rosenblatt', null, 'Richard J. Silberg', null, 'A haunting documentary on the pains of growing up male. It explores the inner and outer cruelties that boys perpetrate and endure. The film provokes the viewer to reflect on how our society can deprive boys of wholeness.', 'A haunting documentary on the pains of growing up male. It explores the inner and outer cruelties that boys perpetrate and endure. The film provokes the viewer to reflect on how our society can deprive boys of wholeness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gyyuv7Qxdy4W92KvbcV2nbt70a7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:249994'),
  ('747900111795489518', 'The Smell of Us', 2015, 'Drama', 'Hélène Louvart, Larry Clark, Andreas Meszaros', 'Mathieu Landais, Larry Clark', 'Lukas Ionesco, Diane Rouxel, Théo Cholbi, Hugo Behar-Thinieres, Rayan Ben Yaiche, Adrien Binh Doan, Maxime Terin, Valentin Charles', null, 'Self-destructive teens go skateboarding, use drugs and turn tricks in Paris.', 'Self-destructive teens go skateboarding, use drugs and turn tricks in Paris.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vKP9PDKRP9x0sDQWHyHdEPJV7YM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:157824'),
  ('423729699091125211', 'The Smile Man', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Anton Lanshakov, Craig Kief', 'Anton Lanshakov', 'Willem Dafoe, Camille Guaty, Damien D. Smith, Jeremy Luke, David St. James, Alexana Thomas', null, 'A gentleman deals with the consequences of a car accident, which has left him with a spinal injury that means he has a permanent smile on his face.', 'A gentleman deals with the consequences of a car accident, which has left him with a spinal injury that means he has a permanent smile on his face.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2VQ1fH5GovXxc3xC6BY81zE93fq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:210293'),
  ('560198455987881694', 'The Smile of the Fox', 1992, 'Thriller', 'Sergio Martino, Giancarlo Ferrando, Federica Martino', 'Sergio Martino, Piero Regnoli', 'Debora Caprioglio, Steve Bond, Sharon Marino, Leonardo Treviglio, Pedro Loeb, Raffaella Offidani, Raffaele Mottola, Martín Coria', null, 'Mark, a hitman haunted by his past as a corrupt Miami cop and the death of his wife and son, prepares for his next killing. Gradually he becomes fascinated by the beautiful prostitute who lives in the next apartment and they embark on a passionate affair. Their dreams of a life together are complicated by her pimp being a drugs baron; before they can escape he must die, but things are never that simple...', 'Mark, a hitman haunted by his past as a corrupt Miami cop and the death of his wife and son, prepares for his next killing. Gradually he becomes fascinated by the beautiful prostitute who lives in the next apartment and they embark on a passionate affair. Their dreams of a life together are complicated by her pimp being a drugs baron; before they can escape he must die, but things are never that simple...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5nXdKIlB0G2Nv19Tx5ZUZU2fixI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108450'),
  ('10587479002394732', 'The Smile of the Virgin', 1958, 'Drama', 'Roberto Rodríguez, Gabriel Figueroa', 'Rafael García Travesí', 'María Gracia, Jorge Martínez de Hoyos, Prudencia Grifell, Miguel Manzano', null, 'Marita, a charming little girl, lives in the country with her grandmother. Her best friend is a modest servant, Anselmo, who almost everyday takes the girl to visit the church known as "Guadalupe''s Basilica", an important cathedral in Mexico City, where she discovers Virgin Guadalupe and the legend about her apparitions in that place. Marita doesn''t behave properly in school, and her teacher always has a punishment for the girl. She doesn''t like school, and she doesn''t want to return to school anymore. Besides, Marita''s worried about her animals, like a cow who doesn''t produce milk. The girl asks many miracles of Virgin Guadalupe, one of them is to not have to go to school. During a visit to the Basilica, Marita hears the Virgin''s voice, and this could be the beginning of a responsible life for the girl, like to study and to be a good child.', 'Marita, a charming little girl, lives in the country with her grandmother. Her best friend is a modest servant, Anselmo, who almost everyday takes the girl to visit the church known as "Guadalupe''s Basilica", an important cathedral in Mexico City, where she discovers Virgin Guadalupe and the legend about her apparitions in that place. Marita doesn''t behave properly in school, and her teacher always has a punishment for the girl. She doesn''t like school, and she doesn''t want to return to school anymore. Besides, Marita''s worried about her animals, like a cow who doesn''t produce milk. The girl asks many miracles of Virgin Guadalupe, one of them is to not have to go to school. During a visit to the Basilica, Marita hears the Virgin''s voice, and this could be the beginning of a responsible life for the girl, like to study and to be a good child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gmWnGK7cXBtoHtiF7x4oL2nLAXI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:500678'),
  ('744169088116770511', 'The Smiling Lieutenant', 1931, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Ernst Lubitsch, George J. Folsey, Adolph Deutsch', 'Ernst Lubitsch', 'Maurice Chevalier, Claudette Colbert, Miriam Hopkins, Charles Ruggles, George Barbier, Hugh O''Connell, Maude Allen, Granville Bates', 'NR', 'An amorous lieutenant is forced to marry a socially awkward princess, though he tries to keep his violin-playing girlfriend on the side.', 'An amorous lieutenant is forced to marry a socially awkward princess, though he tries to keep his violin-playing girlfriend on the side.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6CiCOw0DYgi2Fjn3Bl8O5AAYH17.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31409'),
  ('1025574603479989862', 'The Smiling Madame Beudet', 1923, 'Drama', 'A. Morrin, Maurice Forster, Paul Parguel', 'Germaine Dulac, André Obey', 'Germaine Dermoz, Alexandre Arquillière, Jean d''Yd, Yvette Grisier, Madeleine Guitty, Raoul Paoli, Armand Thirard', null, 'An unhappily married woman devises a scheme to get rid of her husband.', 'An unhappily married woman devises a scheme to get rid of her husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xUdd29vYVJKjDUrjdYfpxytQIdf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49452'),
  ('1120558400142691100', 'The Smoke', 1991, 'Comedy, Music', 'Tomáš Vorel, Martin Duba, Eva Kadaňková', 'Lumír Tuček, Tomáš Vorel', 'Jan Slovák, Lucie Zedníčková, Jaroslav Dušek, Monika Šeligová, Jan Fuchs, Ladislav Myslivec, Eva Holubová, Šimon Caban', null, 'The film is based on a legendary school film of Tomáš Vorel, called INg (1985). The storyline stays the same - a young engineer finds a new job and wants to work, this proves to be impossible in the last days of the communist era.', 'The film is based on a legendary school film of Tomáš Vorel, called INg (1985). The storyline stays the same - a young engineer finds a new job and wants to work, this proves to be impossible in the last days of the communist era.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q6ECC6VDdw89to0beMBltfQ2Vn4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55636'),
  ('51229296078382625', 'The Smoke Master', 2023, 'Action, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Fabio Dellore, Thiago Freire, Luiza Azevedo', 'Andre Sigwalt, Augusto Soares', 'Daniel Rocha, Tony Le Nguyen, Luana Frez, Tristan Aronovich, Thiago Stechinni, Yasmin Thin Qi, Cléber Colombo, Paula Zago', 'NR', 'The journey of Gabriel and Daniel, two brothers cursed by the Chinese mafia with its feared Three Generations Revenge, who have already reaped the life of their grandfather and their father. To survive, one of the brothers must learn the Smoke Style secrets, a little known Cannabis martial art, taught by a single master, high up in the mountains.', 'The journey of Gabriel and Daniel, two brothers cursed by the Chinese mafia with its feared Three Generations Revenge, who have already reaped the life of their grandfather and their father. To survive, one of the brothers must learn the Smoke Style secrets, a little known Cannabis martial art, taught by a single master, high up in the mountains.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mg6YkwftQOJjpT2ygYlCi11LWeC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:950526'),
  ('283945799921435584', 'The Smoke Seller', 2012, 'Animation, Family', 'Jaime Maestro', 'Alejandro Monreal, Marta Rodríguez', null, null, 'A salesman comes to town offering an extraordinary merchandise: to realize the dreams of its inhabitants, though, for a small fee. However, the locals do not have time to fantasize, more busy with their chores.', 'A salesman comes to town offering an extraordinary merchandise: to realize the dreams of its inhabitants, though, for a small fee. However, the locals do not have time to fantasize, more busy with their chores.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AoslOLzzap15uLp84lkLPIPKHeL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:169856'),
  ('488892502509567914', 'The Smoking Fish', 1977, 'Comedy, Drama', 'César Bolívar, Román Chalbaud, Julio Garbi', 'José Ignacio Cabrujas, Román Chalbaud', 'Hilda Vera, Orlando Urdaneta, Haydée Balza, Miguelangel Landa, Rafael Briceño, Arturo Calderón, Ignacio Navarro, Nelly Meruane', null, 'A handsome young man is released from jail and goes to "El Pez que Fuma", a bordello in the outskirts of Caracas. La Garza, its middle-aged owner, hires the young man as handy man, but soon he takes the place of the administrator, who is also La Garza''s lover.', 'A handsome young man is released from jail and goes to "El Pez que Fuma", a bordello in the outskirts of Caracas. La Garza, its middle-aged owner, hires the young man as handy man, but soon he takes the place of the administrator, who is also La Garza''s lover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rAXvWizj5BweIL619BNa7Zn6jyp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91805'),
  ('983997974909599510', 'The Smurfic Games', 1984, 'Animation, Family', 'Gerard Baldwin', 'Patsy Cameron, Tedd Anasti', 'Michael Bell, Lucille Bliss, William Callaway, Hamilton Camp, Julie McWhirter, June Foray, Alan Oppenheimer, Frank Welker', null, 'The Smurfs engage in athletic competition to settle a dispute between both ends of the village over misquoted compound words, which turns deadly when the medal Clumsy is awarded actually causes an earthquake.', 'The Smurfs engage in athletic competition to settle a dispute between both ends of the village over misquoted compound words, which turns deadly when the medal Clumsy is awarded actually causes an earthquake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vJVgfqm0pmJfHMtPu6pTNSDgbUm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:358148'),
  ('994628074951159405', 'The Smurfs', 2011, 'Animation, Family, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Raja Gosnell, Maura Kelly, Phil Meheux', 'David N. Weiss, David Ronn, Jay Scherick', 'Hank Azaria, Neil Patrick Harris, Jayma Mays, Jonathan Winters, Katy Perry, Anton Yelchin, Sofía Vergara, Tim Gunn', 'PG', 'When the evil wizard Gargamel chases the tiny blue Smurfs out of their village, they tumble from their magical world and into ours -- in fact, smack dab in the middle of Central Park. Just three apples high and stuck in the Big Apple, the Smurfs must find a way to get back to their village before Gargamel tracks them down.', 'When the evil wizard Gargamel chases the tiny blue Smurfs out of their village, they tumble from their magical world and into ours -- in fact, smack dab in the middle of Central Park. Just three apples high and stuck in the Big Apple, the Smurfs must find a way to get back to their village before Gargamel tracks them down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vRhnslP2gW0QDym7BsMeSuioUfK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41513'),
  ('119856974876596049', 'The Smurfs 2', 2013, 'Fantasy, Family, Comedy, Animation', 'Sean Dwyer, Sinan Saber, Felix Baudouin', 'J. David Stem, Karey Kirkpatrick, David N. Weiss', 'Katy Perry, Hank Azaria, Neil Patrick Harris, Jayma Mays, Brendan Gleeson, Jacob Tremblay, Nancy O''Dell, Karim Babin', 'PG', 'The evil wizard Gargamel creates a couple of mischievous Smurf-like creatures called the Naughties that he hopes will let him harness the all-powerful, magical Smurf-essence. But when he discovers that only a real Smurf can give him what he wants, and only a secret spell that Smurfette knows can turn the Naughties into real Smurfs, Gargamel kidnaps Smurfette and brings her to Paris, where he has been winning the adoration of millions as the world¹s greatest sorcerer. It''s up to Papa, Clumsy, Grouchy, and Vanity to return to our world, reunite with their human friends Patrick and Grace Winslow, and rescue her! Will Smurfette, who has always felt different from the other Smurfs, find a new connection with the Naughties Vexy and Hackus or will the Smurfs convince her that their love for her is True Blue?', 'The evil wizard Gargamel creates a couple of mischievous Smurf-like creatures called the Naughties that he hopes will let him harness the all-powerful, magical Smurf-essence. But when he discovers that only a real Smurf can give him what he wants, and only a secret spell that Smurfette knows can turn the Naughties into real Smurfs, Gargamel kidnaps Smurfette and brings her to Paris, where he has been winning the adoration of millions as the world¹s greatest sorcerer. It''s up to Papa, Clumsy, Grouchy, and Vanity to return to our world, reunite with their human friends Patrick and Grace Winslow, and rescue her! Will Smurfette, who has always felt different from the other Smurfs, find a new connection with the Naughties Vexy and Hackus or will the Smurfs convince her that their love for her is True Blue?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tmjvgbEH4BKYFfHmWXjXrHgi8wT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77931'),
  ('720342353889190922', 'The Smurfs and the Magic Flute', 1975, 'Animation, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Eddie Lateste, Peyo', 'Yvan Delporte', 'William Coryn, Michel Modo, Jacques Dynam, Henri Crémieux, Michel Elias, Ginette Garcin, Henri Labussière, Georges Atlas', 'G', 'The evil knight Torchesac, who is at the service of the sinister lord of La Mortaille, gets a very powerful magic flute and uses it for evil purposes. Johan and Pirlouit, assisted by the magician Homnibus, travel to the land of the Smurfs, the only manufacturers of this sort of instrument, to get a new one and battle the usurpers.', 'The evil knight Torchesac, who is at the service of the sinister lord of La Mortaille, gets a very powerful magic flute and uses it for evil purposes. Johan and Pirlouit, assisted by the magician Homnibus, travel to the land of the Smurfs, the only manufacturers of this sort of instrument, to get a new one and battle the usurpers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mrTcqCsW7W6H3LIBzI13ODFWT9g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53566'),
  ('700723996030670396', 'The Smurfs Christmas Special', 1982, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Gerard Baldwin', null, 'René Auberjonois, Michael Bell, Lucille Bliss, William Callaway, Hamilton Camp, June Foray, Danny Goldman, David Mendenhall', null, 'The Smurfs come to the rescue of two children and their grandfather when an evil mysterious stranger shows up and causes their sleigh to turn over, forcing them to seek help and inadvertently bring Gargamel in on the action.', 'The Smurfs come to the rescue of two children and their grandfather when an evil mysterious stranger shows up and causes their sleigh to turn over, forcing them to seek help and inadvertently bring Gargamel in on the action.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mait4XCh8eVyCMgd65eTUQz8kTh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49240'),
  ('661979398599854051', 'The Smurfs Springtime Special', 1982, 'Family, Animation, TV Movie, Comedy', 'Gerard Baldwin', null, 'Lucille Bliss, William Callaway, Frank Welker, Alan Oppenheimer, Michael Bell, June Foray, Paul Winchell', null, 'The evil wizard Gargamel--who hates spring because it makes the Smurfs happy, and he hates happy--devises a scheme to put Mother Nature to sleep.', 'The evil wizard Gargamel--who hates spring because it makes the Smurfs happy, and he hates happy--devises a scheme to put Mother Nature to sleep.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rweIyreel5cSslXbeYTU1aP2q8a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:357677'),
  ('250123859254746388', 'The Smurfs: ''Tis the Season to Be Smurfy', 1987, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Ray Patterson', 'Glenn Leopold', 'Lucille Bliss, Charlie Adler, William Callaway, Hamilton Camp, Julie McWhirter, Jeff Doucette, Bernard Erhard, June Foray', null, 'The Smurfs set out to help out an elderly human couple.', 'The Smurfs set out to help out an elderly human couple.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bFYUhUiKLJUrB6zn81LDfFhAVwV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:217333'),
  ('570623676505015494', 'The Smurfs: A Christmas Carol', 2011, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Troy Quane, James C.J. Williams', 'Todd Berger', 'Jack Angel, Fred Armisen, Hank Azaria, Gary Basaraba, George López, Melissa Sturm, Anton Yelchin, Frank Welker', 'PG', 'When Grouchy Smurf behaves badly to everyone and refuses to celebrate Christmas, the Smurfs of Christmas Past, Present and Future teach him to appreciate Christmas.', 'When Grouchy Smurf behaves badly to everyone and refuses to celebrate Christmas, the Smurfs of Christmas Past, Present and Future teach him to appreciate Christmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1gjT65lS29BbclJlmGvtwnT7hya.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79443'),
  ('633012093101228016', 'The Smurfs: The Legend of Smurfy Hollow', 2013, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Stephan Franck, Darlie Brewster', 'Todd Berger', 'Hank Azaria, Melissa Sturm, Frank Welker, Anton Yelchin, Tom Kane, Alan Cumming, Fred Armisen, Jack Angel', 'G', 'When Brainy Smurf is favored to win the annual Smurfberry Hunt for the ninth year in a row, Gutsy Smurf sets out to discover how Brainy wins every year. Gutsy’s investigation takes him into spooky Smurfy Hollow–and right into Gargamel’s trap! Can Brainy and Gutsy, with the help of Smurfette, put aside their rivalry before Gargamel captures them–or worse, they come face-to-face with the legendary ghost, the Headless Horseman?', 'When Brainy Smurf is favored to win the annual Smurfberry Hunt for the ninth year in a row, Gutsy Smurf sets out to discover how Brainy wins every year. Gutsy’s investigation takes him into spooky Smurfy Hollow–and right into Gargamel’s trap! Can Brainy and Gutsy, with the help of Smurfette, put aside their rivalry before Gargamel captures them–or worse, they come face-to-face with the legendary ghost, the Headless Horseman?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AgFkdZawIUFY20rLRX9ejQtn0q2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:220845'),
  ('262394798573326593', 'The Snail and the Whale', 2020, 'Animation, Family, TV Movie', 'Max Lang, Daniel Snaddon', 'Suzanne Lang, Max Lang', 'Rob Brydon, Sally Hawkins, Diana Rigg, Cariad Lloyd, Max Lang', null, 'A half hour animated film for all the family based on the much-loved book written by Julia Donaldson and illustrated by Axel Scheffler. The Snail and the Whale is the much loved classic that shows us a restless young snail who has ambitions to travel the world. The other snails think she should stay put, but she puts out a call for a “Lift wanted around the world”. Eventually her call is answered by a great big grey-blue humpback whale! She sets off with him across the seas. On their journey the snail and the whale discover towering icebergs and far-off lands, fiery mountains and golden sands. The snail is delighted by the wonderful world around her, until she realises how small it makes her feel.', 'A half hour animated film for all the family based on the much-loved book written by Julia Donaldson and illustrated by Axel Scheffler. The Snail and the Whale is the much loved classic that shows us a restless young snail who has ambitions to travel the world. The other snails think she should stay put, but she puts out a call for a “Lift wanted around the world”. Eventually her call is answered by a great big grey-blue humpback whale! She sets off with him across the seas. On their journey the snail and the whale discover towering icebergs and far-off lands, fiery mountains and golden sands. The snail is delighted by the wonderful world around her, until she realises how small it makes her feel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qWsqdJ6XUvwimqxwlplIazKjpve.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:655424'),
  ('226001241407908432', 'The Snails', 1966, 'Animation, Comedy, Fantasy, Science Fiction, Horror', 'René Laloux', 'René Laloux, Roland Topor', null, null, 'In a distant planetoid, an industrious but hapless old farmer strives to make his vegetables flourish, however, to no avail.', 'In a distant planetoid, an industrious but hapless old farmer strives to make his vegetables flourish, however, to no avail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/54WVRe5mKwpu9kNOylfPFbQ9L0x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116351'),
  ('170608956605976289', 'The Snails'' Senator', 1995, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Mircea Daneliuc', 'Mircea Daneliuc', 'Dorel Vișan, Cecilia Bârbora, Clara Vodă, Madeleine Thibeault, Dan Chișu, Florin Zamfirescu, Constanta Comanoiu, Nicolae Albani', null, 'This Romanian dramatic comedy offers metaphorical commentary on life after Ceausescu''s reign as it tells the story of a rural community turned topsy-turvy in their mad quest for the snails a prominent senator has requested for his dinner. The trouble begins when a rather imposing, pompous senator comes to visit a small rural Romanian town for a ribbon-cutting ceremony for their new hydro-electric dam. After he finishes his speech, the senator is accosted by a Swiss film crew eager to interview him. The senator is inordinately concerned with presenting a positive image of Romania to the world at large and so when he learns that he and the journalists are to stay at the same villa, does everything he came to make sure that they see nothing scandalous.', 'This Romanian dramatic comedy offers metaphorical commentary on life after Ceausescu''s reign as it tells the story of a rural community turned topsy-turvy in their mad quest for the snails a prominent senator has requested for his dinner. The trouble begins when a rather imposing, pompous senator comes to visit a small rural Romanian town for a ribbon-cutting ceremony for their new hydro-electric dam. After he finishes his speech, the senator is accosted by a Swiss film crew eager to interview him. The senator is inordinately concerned with presenting a positive image of Romania to the world at large and so when he learns that he and the journalists are to stay at the same villa, does everything he came to make sure that they see nothing scandalous.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aay601cGXiY8gFTng1IN1dOqVVe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198429'),
  ('742504076895356117', 'The Snake', 2006, 'Thriller', 'Eric Barbier', 'Eric Barbier, Trân-Minh Nam', 'Yvan Attal, Clovis Cornillac, Pierre Richard, Simon Abkarian, Olga Kurylenko, Minna Haapkylä, Gérald Laroche, Jean-Claude Bouillon', null, 'A ruthless gang led by private detective Joseph Plender is extorting rich people and famous fashion photographer Vincent Mandel seems the next victim. He is married to Hélène, daughter of one of the richest people in Europe, but not quite happily. In fact the marriage is on the brink of a divorce and a judge is deciding who will take the two children. Can Hélène take them to Germany or will they stay with Vincent? Vincent has a lot on his mind and he improvises when model Sofia Kippiani comes to his studio, but his makeup crew doesn''t show up. Before he knows it, he is accused of a rape. Things go worse and worse for Vincent, he sees his entire life slipping away and, most importantly, he might lose his children. But why does his former schoolmate Joseph Plender seek contact with Vincent and even solve a nasty problem for him? Does Plender want something more than money?', 'A ruthless gang led by private detective Joseph Plender is extorting rich people and famous fashion photographer Vincent Mandel seems the next victim. He is married to Hélène, daughter of one of the richest people in Europe, but not quite happily. In fact the marriage is on the brink of a divorce and a judge is deciding who will take the two children. Can Hélène take them to Germany or will they stay with Vincent? Vincent has a lot on his mind and he improvises when model Sofia Kippiani comes to his studio, but his makeup crew doesn''t show up. Before he knows it, he is accused of a rape. Things go worse and worse for Vincent, he sees his entire life slipping away and, most importantly, he might lose his children. But why does his former schoolmate Joseph Plender seek contact with Vincent and even solve a nasty problem for him? Does Plender want something more than money?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5nG8gVE1GmMdltOL4gHKlCWDXNc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21382'),
  ('444442683329147750', 'The Snake Girl and the Silver-Haired Witch', 1968, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Noriaki Yuasa, Heihachi Kuboe, Akira Uehara', 'Kimiyuki Hasegawa', 'Yachie Matsui, Mayumi Takahashi, Sei Hiraizumi, Yūko Hamada, Yoshirō Kitahara, Kuniko Miyake, Sachiko Meguro, Mariko Fukuhara', null, 'Up until this point, young Sayuri Nanjo has had to live most of her life in a nun-run boarding school for orphans and away from her parents. That''s all about to change when her real father mysteriously comes to get her and finally bring her home.', 'Up until this point, young Sayuri Nanjo has had to live most of her life in a nun-run boarding school for orphans and away from her parents. That''s all about to change when her real father mysteriously comes to get her and finally bring her home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zVdI4C4xZcK4ZA85AqtHiZiTG1b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:182921'),
  ('902221089754193516', 'The Snake God', 1970, 'Adventure, Drama, Horror', 'Piero Vivarelli', 'Piero Vivarelli, Ottavio Alessi', 'Nadia Cassini, Beryl Cunningham, Sergio Tramonti, Arnoldo Palacios, Galeazzo Benti, Claudio Trionfi, Evaristo Márquez, Koike Mahoco', null, 'A beautiful Italian woman is told by her black friend about the Carribean love god Jambaya who appears in the form of the snake. By the end of the movie, Cassini has decided to give herself to Jambaya while Cunningham departs with her white friend''s ex-lover, establishing a neat symmetry between their respective fantasies of exoticism.', 'A beautiful Italian woman is told by her black friend about the Carribean love god Jambaya who appears in the form of the snake. By the end of the movie, Cassini has decided to give herself to Jambaya while Cunningham departs with her white friend''s ex-lover, establishing a neat symmetry between their respective fantasies of exoticism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cPDfQgIN8VZUpuv6TFljD1mMeUn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88665'),
  ('357379244004147476', 'The Snake Pit', 1948, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Anatole Litvak, Leo Tover', 'Frank Partos, Millen Brand', 'Olivia de Havilland, Mark Stevens, Leo Genn, Celeste Holm, Glenn Langan, Helen Craig, Leif Erickson, Beulah Bondi', null, 'Virginia Cunningham is confused upon finding herself in a mental hospital, with no memory of her arrival at the institution. Tormented by delusions and unable to even recognize her husband, Robert, she is treated by Dr. Mark Kik, who is determined to get to the root of her mental illness. As her treatment progresses, flashbacks depict events in Virginia''s life that may have contributed to her instability.', 'Virginia Cunningham is confused upon finding herself in a mental hospital, with no memory of her arrival at the institution. Tormented by delusions and unable to even recognize her husband, Robert, she is treated by Dr. Mark Kik, who is determined to get to the root of her mental illness. As her treatment progresses, flashbacks depict events in Virginia''s life that may have contributed to her instability.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wLO2TVjM4UUQUwOq7RqfS8PCdMC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62694'),
  ('416286601566678179', 'The Snake Woman', 1961, 'Horror', 'Stephen Dade, Sidney J. Furie, Douglas Hickox', 'Orville H. Hampton', 'John McCarthy, Susan Travers, Geoffrey Denton, Elsie Wagstaff, Arnold Marlé, John Cazabon, Frances Bennett, Jack Cunningham', null, 'A doctor in 1890 England, in order to cure his wife''s "sick mind," injects her with snake venom. She later gives birth to a daughter whom the villagers call "The Devil''s Baby" and in a fit of fear they end up burning the family''s house down. Years later a Scotland Yard detective is sent to the village to investigate a rash of deaths that are caused by snakebite.', 'A doctor in 1890 England, in order to cure his wife''s "sick mind," injects her with snake venom. She later gives birth to a daughter whom the villagers call "The Devil''s Baby" and in a fit of fear they end up burning the family''s house down. Years later a Scotland Yard detective is sent to the village to investigate a rash of deaths that are caused by snakebite.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/laipjUlFxCWA72aARnzkrvue08p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116389'),
  ('390076802399616799', 'The Snapper', 1993, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Stephen Frears, Oliver Stapleton, Martin O''Malley', 'Roddy Doyle', 'Colm Meaney, Tina Kellegher, Ruth McCabe, Eanna MacLiam, Peter Rowen, Joanne Gerrard, Colm O''Byrne, Ciara Duffy', 'R', 'Sharon Curley is a 20-year-old living with her parents and many brothers and sisters in Dublin. When she gets pregnant and refuses to name the father, she becomes the talk of the town.', 'Sharon Curley is a 20-year-old living with her parents and many brothers and sisters in Dublin. When she gets pregnant and refuses to name the father, she becomes the talk of the town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t5sgHOd9NmfyGPWDbv6MoT0f9qM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12664'),
  ('105513582815585751', 'The Snare', 2017, 'Thriller, Horror', 'C. A. Cooper, Tom Butler', 'C. A. Cooper', 'Eaoifa Forward, Daniel Paton, Rachel Warren, Fin Banks, Lily-Mae Hebbes, Tia Shenton, Arthur Wraight, Bruno Wraight', 'NR', 'Three friends head to the seafront for a drunken weekend, only to be imprisoned on the top floor of their holiday apartment by a malevolent paranormal force.', 'Three friends head to the seafront for a drunken weekend, only to be imprisoned on the top floor of their holiday apartment by a malevolent paranormal force.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/njA7M4yIKEdilFS2OdNAUK1Rd0w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:406115'),
  ('208374821817670929', 'The Snatch Thief', 2018, 'Drama', 'Catriel Vildosola, Agustín Toscano, Sergio de León', 'Agustín Toscano', 'Sergio Prina, Liliana Juárez, Daniel Elías, León Zelarayán, Pilar Benítez Vibart, Mirella Pascual, Camila Plaate, Pablo Ríos', null, 'In the Argentinian city of Tucumán, Miguel is making a living as a “motochorro”, a thief who snatches people’s belongings fromhis motorbike. When he steals the purse of Elena, an old woman, he ends up hurting her badly. After the brutal incident, Miguel is plagued by guilt and unable to forget about his victim. In an attempt to make things right, he conceals his true identity from the old woman and starts to take care of the injured and unsuspecting Elena. The closer he gets to her the more he becomes entangled in his own lies. Afraid of telling Elena the truth, Miguel continues to be haunted by his past and is unable to find true redemption.', 'In the Argentinian city of Tucumán, Miguel is making a living as a “motochorro”, a thief who snatches people’s belongings fromhis motorbike. When he steals the purse of Elena, an old woman, he ends up hurting her badly. After the brutal incident, Miguel is plagued by guilt and unable to forget about his victim. In an attempt to make things right, he conceals his true identity from the old woman and starts to take care of the injured and unsuspecting Elena. The closer he gets to her the more he becomes entangled in his own lies. Afraid of telling Elena the truth, Miguel continues to be haunted by his past and is unable to find true redemption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3GLLoGGGnAcAJJCmK3NqnRboIFR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:518749'),
  ('327498402729477464', 'The Sniper', 1952, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Burnett Guffey, Edward Dmytryk', 'Harry Brown', 'Arthur Franz, Adolphe Menjou, Gerald Mohr, Marie Windsor, Frank Faylen, Richard Kiley, Mabel Paige, Marlo Dwyer', 'NR', 'Eddie Miller struggles with his hatred of women, he''s especially bothered by seeing women with their lovers. He starts a killing spree as a sniper by shooting women from far distances. In an attempt to get caught, he writes an anonymous letter to the police begging them to stop him.', 'Eddie Miller struggles with his hatred of women, he''s especially bothered by seeing women with their lovers. He starts a killing spree as a sniper by shooting women from far distances. In an attempt to get caught, he writes an anonymous letter to the police begging them to stop him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/upYwLa9rKoejM79p9DRXuLjYXN7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25551'),
  ('684518495045165062', 'The Sniper', 2009, 'Action, Thriller', 'Dante Lam Chiu-Yin, Cox Chong Wing-Ching, Kwok Man-Ki', 'Jack Ng Wai-Lun', 'Richie Jen, Edison Chen, Huang Xiaoming, Mango Wong Sau-Lam, Bowie Lam Bo-Yee, Michelle Ye Xuan, Wilfred Lau Ho-Lung, Jack Kao', null, 'A police sniper teams up with a hot-headed rookie to take down his former friend and teammate, who is exacting revenge on the police force.', 'A police sniper teams up with a hot-headed rookie to take down his former friend and teammate, who is exacting revenge on the police force.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A7aBssjWennxvNxWT6be3PzFvSC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17082'),
  ('729263369589608790', 'The Snitch Cartel', 2011, 'Drama, Crime', 'Carlos Moreno', 'Luiso Berdejo', 'Juana Acosta, Manolo Cardona, Diego Cadavid, Kuno Becker, Pedro Armendáriz Jr., Adriana Barraza, Tom Sizemore, Robinson Díaz', 'R', 'The real life story of Andres Lopez Lopez aka "Frecita" during his years involved with the Colombian Cartel aka "Cartel Norte del Valle"', 'The real life story of Andres Lopez Lopez aka "Frecita" during his years involved with the Colombian Cartel aka "Cartel Norte del Valle"', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8GOf6nwrnaGu6mNv8VdVkD42lzL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:136735'),
  ('86955966705176053', 'The Snorkel', 1958, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Jack Asher, Guy Green, Tom Walls Jr.', 'Jimmy Sangster, Peter Myers', 'Peter van Eyck, Betta St. John, Mandy Miller, William Franklyn, Marie Burke, Irene Prador, Henri Vidon, Grégoire Aslan', 'NR', 'On the Italian coast, writer Paul Decker has grown unhappy in his marriage and executes what appears to be a perfect murder of his wife. While Paul is believed to be writing a book in France, his stepdaughter, Candy, suspects him of murdering her mother, as well as her father years before. With the police unwilling to investigate any further, Candy sets out to confirm her suspicions and take Paul down herself.', 'On the Italian coast, writer Paul Decker has grown unhappy in his marriage and executes what appears to be a perfect murder of his wife. While Paul is believed to be writing a book in France, his stepdaughter, Candy, suspects him of murdering her mother, as well as her father years before. With the police unwilling to investigate any further, Candy sets out to confirm her suspicions and take Paul down herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cimYDFGjTTfPUNaJT1S0VUnL3Ao.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36754'),
  ('468004333673619617', 'The Snow Child', 1980, 'Animation, Family', 'Duan Xiaoxuan, Wenxiao Lin', 'Wenxiao Lin', null, null, 'A young rabbit is rescued from disaster by the snowman he makes with his mother.', 'A young rabbit is rescued from disaster by the snowman he makes with his mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pAOGpxFVgkAMgyLyvpS4LoV5uWP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:182221'),
  ('171598703144749210', 'The Snow Creature', 1954, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'W. Lee Wilder, Floyd Crosby', 'Myles Wilder', 'Paul Langton, Leslie Denison, Teru Shimada, William Phipps, Lock Martin, Rollin Moriyama, Robert Kino, George Douglas', null, 'A botanical expedition to the Himalayas captures a Yeti and brings it back alive to Los Angeles, where it escapes and runs amok, seeking food.', 'A botanical expedition to the Himalayas captures a Yeti and brings it back alive to Los Angeles, where it escapes and runs amok, seeking food.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bJQZlaxR3Ak5xqnB8NTGeAGncVE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41030'),
  ('957522444653152048', 'The Snow Maiden', 1952, 'Family, Animation, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Ivan Ivanov-Vano, Aleksandra Snezhko-Blotskaya, Nikolay Voinov', 'Aleksandra Snezhko-Blotskaya, Ivan Ivanov-Vano, Oleg Leonidov', 'Nikolai Bogolyubov, Margarita Kupriyanova, Anastasiya Zuyeva, Georgi Millyar, Georgiy Vitsin, Leonid Pirogov, Vladlen Davydov, Irina Maslennikova', null, 'The tale about a girl with a cold heart who is dying in agony because of joy and love.', 'The tale about a girl with a cold heart who is dying in agony because of joy and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z7SO0Ka0kRZzxXZ71OR5J1tth6W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89617'),
  ('809706573226716449', 'The Snow Maiden', 1968, 'Fantasy, Family', 'Pavel Kadochnikov, Aleksandr Chirov, Andrei Apsolon', 'Leonid Lyubashevsky, Pavel Kadochnikov', 'Yevghenia Filonova, Yevgeni Zharikov, Boris Khimichev, Pavel Kadochnikov, Irina Gubanova, Sergei Filippov, Vladimir Vasilyev, Svetlana Loshchinina', null, 'A fairytale based on the play by Aleksandr Ostrovskiy. Snegurochka is the daughter of Grandfather Frost and the Beautiful Spring. Her icy heart had never known simple human joys, never known love until she met Lel. His warmth gave the girl a rich sense of the world around her and melted the heart of the cold beauty.', 'A fairytale based on the play by Aleksandr Ostrovskiy. Snegurochka is the daughter of Grandfather Frost and the Beautiful Spring. Her icy heart had never known simple human joys, never known love until she met Lel. His warmth gave the girl a rich sense of the world around her and melted the heart of the cold beauty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/IW178JcCLHdfI2RiapL3r6xrdP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:302436'),
  ('436176718559610015', 'The Snow Queen', 1957, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'Lev Atamanov, Mikhail Druyan, Nikolay Prilutskiy', 'Georgiy Grebner, Lev Atamanov, Nikolay Erdman', 'Vladimir Gribkov, Yanina Zheymo, Anna Komolova, Mariya Babanova, Galina Kozhakina, Sergei Martinson, Aleksey Konsovskiy, Irina Murzayeva', 'NR', 'When the Snow Queen, a lonely and powerful fairy, kidnaps the human boy Kai, his best friend Gerda must overcome many obstacles on her journey to rescue him.', 'When the Snow Queen, a lonely and powerful fairy, kidnaps the human boy Kai, his best friend Gerda must overcome many obstacles on her journey to rescue him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ptCK2qAyGEmQBys3cImY6o6qAyp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72214'),
  ('539462243588542377', 'The Snow Queen', 1967, 'Family, Fantasy, Adventure, Drama', 'Gennadi Kazansky, Vadim Grammatikov, Sergei Ivanov', 'Yevgeni Shvarts', 'Elena Proklova, Vyacheslav Tsyupa, Yevgeniya Melnikova, Natalya Klimova, Nikolai Boyarsky, Evgeni Leonov, Irina Gubanova, Georgiy Korolchuk', null, 'The film tells a story about the extraordinary journey of the modest little girl Gerda. She is looking for her friend Kai, who was kidnapped and taken to her kingdom by the powerful evil Snow Queen. In search of her beloved friend, Gerda ends up in the castle to the cunning, insidious and at the same time funny king, meets forest robbers. On the way, the girl will have many obstacles before the decisive battle with the Snow Queen. But Gerda’s faithful heart will overcome all adversity...', 'The film tells a story about the extraordinary journey of the modest little girl Gerda. She is looking for her friend Kai, who was kidnapped and taken to her kingdom by the powerful evil Snow Queen. In search of her beloved friend, Gerda ends up in the castle to the cunning, insidious and at the same time funny king, meets forest robbers. On the way, the girl will have many obstacles before the decisive battle with the Snow Queen. But Gerda’s faithful heart will overcome all adversity...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gDE9hHwtB8RiqKQiGEii6hkrjBt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14493'),
  ('661305059395216791', 'The Snow Queen', 1986, 'Fantasy, Family', 'Päivi Hartzell, Henrik Paersch, Nadja Pyykkö', 'Päivi Hartzell', 'Satu Silvo, Outi Vainionkulma, Sebastian Kaatrasalo, Tuula Nyman, Esko Hukkanen, Pirjo Bergström, Juulia Ukkonen, Paavo Westerberg', null, 'A Finnish live action adaptation of Hans Christian Andersen''s fairy tale, The Snow Queen. The tale centers on the struggle between good and evil as experienced by a little boy and girl, Kai and Kerttu.', 'A Finnish live action adaptation of Hans Christian Andersen''s fairy tale, The Snow Queen. The tale centers on the struggle between good and evil as experienced by a little boy and girl, Kai and Kerttu.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mSwR8C9UMQ0EkFFirad9ePWDUxq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64022'),
  ('245056114250976369', 'The Snow Queen', 1995, 'Animation, Family', 'Martin Gates, Mick De Falco', 'Sue Radley, Martin Gates', 'Helen Mirren, David Jason, Hugh Laurie, Rik Mayall, Julia McKenzie, Imelda Staunton, Ellie Beaven, Damian Hunt', null, 'Far away, in her vast ice palace, the Snow Queen plots to rule the world by deflecting all the sun''s warmth away from Earth so that it freezes over. But her mirror breaks, and on her mission to find all the missing pieces, she kidnaps Tom, who has part of the mirror in his body. Can his sister Ellie save Tom, and stop the evil Queen from achieving global dominance?', 'Far away, in her vast ice palace, the Snow Queen plots to rule the world by deflecting all the sun''s warmth away from Earth so that it freezes over. But her mirror breaks, and on her mission to find all the missing pieces, she kidnaps Tom, who has part of the mirror in his body. Can his sister Ellie save Tom, and stop the evil Queen from achieving global dominance?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fF5mUf8i4h4nxL6aWOzcbwcnvvc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150342'),
  ('925032740890616460', 'The Snow Queen', 2012, 'Animation, Fantasy, Family', 'Alexey Tsitsilin, Vladlen Barbe, Maksim Sveshnikov', 'Aleksandr Ligay, Alexey Tsitsilin, Vadim Sveshnikov', 'Ivan Okhlobystin, Dmitriy Nagiev, Lyudmila Artemeva, Anna Ardova, Elizaveta Arzamasova, Galina Tyunina, Anna Shurochkina, Yuriy Stoyanov', 'PG', 'The Snow Queen creates a world of eternal winter, frosting human souls and emotions. When she turns Kai, the son of a wizard, into an ice statue, his sister embarks on a journey to save him and bring life back to the world.', 'The Snow Queen creates a world of eternal winter, frosting human souls and emotions. When she turns Kai, the son of a wizard, into an ice statue, his sister embarks on a journey to save him and bring life back to the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/siQpJAT2IQjN218hxJXvrHePtNS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:164372'),
  ('522535811103006912', 'The Snow Queen', 2014, 'Family, Fantasy', 'Karola Hattop, Sebastian Hattop', 'Thomas Brinx, Anja Kömmerling', 'Flora Thiemann, Kristo Ferkic, Linda Zilliacus, Annette Frier, Steffi Kühnert, Michael von Au, Paula Knüpling, Moritz Jahn', null, 'A young girl must journey through the seasons to rescue her boyfriend who has been kidnapped by the evil Snow Queen.', 'A young girl must journey through the seasons to rescue her boyfriend who has been kidnapped by the evil Snow Queen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jgSXwMzmy7UrV8syTdEQWSPA76R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:314062'),
  ('784341013615065605', 'The Snow Queen 2: Refreeze', 2014, 'Fantasy, Family, Animation, Adventure', 'Alexey Tsitsilin', 'Vladimir Nikolaev, Alexey Tsitsilin, Alexey Zamyslov', 'Anna Shurochkina, Ivan Okhlobystin, Anna Khilkevich, Aleksandr Uman, Leva Bi-2, Roman Yunusov, Garik Kharlamov, Fyodor Dobronravov', 'PG', 'After the trolls'' victory over the Snow Queen, Orm claims that he is destined to marry the princess and inherit great power.', 'After the trolls'' victory over the Snow Queen, Orm claims that he is destined to marry the princess and inherit great power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fU6kiB3p4efwC48hDdy77eC5qJK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:292014'),
  ('521674356283827384', 'The Snow Queen 3: Fire and Ice', 2016, 'Family, Animation, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Alexey Tsitsilin', 'Alexey Tsitsilin, Robert Lence, Andrey Korn', 'Nikolay Bystrov, Natalya Bystrova, Filipp Lebedev, Diomid Vinogradov, Alexander Gruzdev, Olga Zubkova, Mikhail Tikhonov, Olga Shorokhova', 'PG', 'After heroically defeating both the Snow Queen and the Snow King, Gerda still cannot find peace. Her dream is to find her parents who were once taken away from them by the North Wind and finally reunite the family. Thus, Gerda and her friends embark on an exiting journey to find her parents and encounter new challenges along the way: they discover an ancient magical artifact of the trolls, the Stone of Fire and Ice. From that moment on, things don''t go according to the initial plan...Will Gerda be able to tame the mighty forces of the magical elements and get her family back? The answer will be reveled in 2016. This is a story which encompasses everything you love about Wizart: kindness, bravery, friendship, mystery, love of one''s family, and a happy ending, of course!', 'After heroically defeating both the Snow Queen and the Snow King, Gerda still cannot find peace. Her dream is to find her parents who were once taken away from them by the North Wind and finally reunite the family. Thus, Gerda and her friends embark on an exiting journey to find her parents and encounter new challenges along the way: they discover an ancient magical artifact of the trolls, the Stone of Fire and Ice. From that moment on, things don''t go according to the initial plan...Will Gerda be able to tame the mighty forces of the magical elements and get her family back? The answer will be reveled in 2016. This is a story which encompasses everything you love about Wizart: kindness, bravery, friendship, mystery, love of one''s family, and a happy ending, of course!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nZmUrl59UXIC1pXrviJMB3ERCnv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:362058'),
  ('645140552349877964', 'The Snow Queen: Mirror Lands', 2018, 'Family, Animation, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Robert Lence, Alexey Tsitsilin', 'Robert Lence, Vladimir Nikolaev, Alexey Zamyslov', 'Lina Ivanova, Nikolay Bystrov, Vladimir Zaytsev, Olga Zubkova, Nikita Prozorovsky, Lyaysan Utyasheva, Irina Bezrukova, Nadezhda Angarskaya', null, 'A mighty king has lost his family because of the Snow Queen. He finds a way to expel all magic creatures from his world to Mirrorlands. Gerda and Snow Queen, along with all wizards and magicians, have to forget their offenses and disputes to defend their right to exist and not to allow fairytales to disappear from our lives.', 'A mighty king has lost his family because of the Snow Queen. He finds a way to expel all magic creatures from his world to Mirrorlands. Gerda and Snow Queen, along with all wizards and magicians, have to forget their offenses and disputes to defend their right to exist and not to allow fairytales to disappear from our lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8251dVxltnhqbt2DaO9bwJYmvAK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:564145'),
  ('737528736387993309', 'The Snow Queen''s Revenge', 1996, 'Family, Animation', 'Martin Gates', 'Martin Gates, Sue Radley', 'Hugh Laurie, Julia McKenzie, Ellie Beaven, Patrick Barlow, Tim Healy, Gary Martin, Alison Steadman, Russell Floyd', null, 'The Snow Queen holds Ellie responsible for ruining her plans to freeze the world and sets out to seek revenge. She kidnaps Dimly the flying reindeer and once again Ellie and her friend Peeps the Sparrow are forced to travel, this time to the South Pole, where the Snow Queen and her Trolls have taken up residence.', 'The Snow Queen holds Ellie responsible for ruining her plans to freeze the world and sets out to seek revenge. She kidnaps Dimly the flying reindeer and once again Ellie and her friend Peeps the Sparrow are forced to travel, this time to the South Pole, where the Snow Queen and her Trolls have taken up residence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pkAW8geq6L9ZrQLzIaTi9fDgfLz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150347'),
  ('387754412785847899', 'The Snow Sister', 2024, 'Fantasy, Family, Adventure, Drama', 'Cecilie A. Mosli, John-Erling Holmenes Fredriksen, Mia Jensen', 'Siv Rajendram Eliassen', 'Mudit Gupta, Celina Meyer Hovland, Jan Sælid, Sampda Sharma, Gunnar Eiriksson, Advika Bal, Ole Steinkjer Øyen, Nemi Wiklund', 'PG', 'A young boy whose grieving family has forgotten about Christmas forms an unexpected, healing bond with a bubbly girl full of holiday spirit.', 'A young boy whose grieving family has forgotten about Christmas forms an unexpected, healing bond with a bubbly girl full of holiday spirit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ArMZ9DEw3ajkLYNmj3iXdveO9oQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1365044'),
  ('763006842181912720', 'The Snow Walker', 2003, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Charles Martin Smith, Jon Joffin, David Connell', 'Farley Mowat, Charles Martin Smith', 'Barry Pepper, Annabella Piugattuk, James Cromwell, Kiersten Warren, Jon Gries, Robin Dunne, Malcolm Scott, Michael Bublé', null, 'A bush pilot in nothern Canada who with the aid of modernity thinks he can handle it all & knows it all. After reluctantly agreeing to transport a local indian girl to a medical facility his light plane crashes & they have to survive whilst finding their way back to civilization. Along the journey the man finds a new respect for the native ways as they battle to survive the elements.', 'A bush pilot in nothern Canada who with the aid of modernity thinks he can handle it all & knows it all. After reluctantly agreeing to transport a local indian girl to a medical facility his light plane crashes & they have to survive whilst finding their way back to civilization. Along the journey the man finds a new respect for the native ways as they battle to survive the elements.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1UlHIWfqjkizc2qem0IPZBG6nn5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14694'),
  ('581083760478522541', 'The Snow White Murder Case', 2014, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Yoshihiro Nakamura, Megumu Sawada, Gen Kobayashi', 'Tamio Hayashi', 'Mao Inoue, Go Ayano, Misako Renbutsu, Nanao, Shihori Kanjiya, Erena Ono, Mitsuki Tanimura, Katsuhisa Namase', null, 'Beautiful Noriko Miki works at a cosmetic company. One day, Noriko is murdered. People begin to suspect her co-worker Miki Shirono might have killed her. Television begins to cover her story. A TV show interviews Miki Shirono''s colleagues, family, people from her hometown. Rumors turn into fear. Is she a wicked a woman?', 'Beautiful Noriko Miki works at a cosmetic company. One day, Noriko is murdered. People begin to suspect her co-worker Miki Shirono might have killed her. Television begins to cover her story. A TV show interviews Miki Shirono''s colleagues, family, people from her hometown. Rumors turn into fear. Is she a wicked a woman?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8xlgARZowpGglrIcUvEXQCnn2vS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:253454'),
  ('51112654090206868', 'The Snow Woman', 1968, 'Horror, Fantasy, Romance', 'Tokuzō Tanaka, Chikashi Makiura', 'Fuji Yahiro', 'Shiho Fujimura, Akira Ishihama, Machiko Hasegawa, Yoshirō Kitahara, Sachiko Murase, Taketoshi Naitō, Mizuho Suzuki, Fujio Suga', null, 'Two sculptors spend the night in a mountain lodge after being caught in a snowstorm. A female spirit appears and takes the life of one of the men. She spares the other man''s life on the condition that he never tell anyone what happened that night.', 'Two sculptors spend the night in a mountain lodge after being caught in a snowstorm. A female spirit appears and takes the life of one of the men. She spares the other man''s life on the condition that he never tell anyone what happened that night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4vFYCaNLBvHiZ210HuP4spnWWeB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57875'),
  ('1042418492266068147', 'The Snowball on a Sunny Day', 2026, 'Comedy, Family, Drama', 'Ronnie Chau, Ning Chan, Philip Yung Chi-Kwong, Joseph Leung Yau-Cheong, Philip Yung Chi Kwong', 'Philip Yung Chi-Kwong, Gabriel Ng, Philip Yung Chi Kwong', 'Elaine Jin Yan-Ling, Chung Suet-ying, Edan Lui, Lee Sheung-Ching, Harriet Yeung Sze-Man', null, 'Sunnie failed to buy her grandmother''s lucky lottery numbers, which won the jackpot. She pretended to have bought a villa with the winnings, bringing her family closer, but the truth was eventually revealed.', 'Sunnie failed to buy her grandmother''s lucky lottery numbers, which won the jackpot. She pretended to have bought a villa with the winnings, bringing her family closer, but the truth was eventually revealed.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FafSvIXKuQmdIoxGo2cbeK0Agazd.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-snowball-on-a-sunny-day-2026'),
  ('452511841998080574', 'The Snowdrop Festival', 1984, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jiří Menzel, Jiří Macák, Stanislava Hutková', 'Bohumil Hrabal, Jiří Menzel', 'Rudolf Hrušínský, Jaromír Hanzlík, Josef Somr, Petr Čepek, Miloslav Štibich, Petr Brukner, Rudolf Hrušínský, Eugen Jegorov', null, 'An episodic film about the inhabitants of Kersko, their hardships and their joys, most prominently hunting. A lyrical and humorous adaptation of writings by Bohumil Hrabal.', 'An episodic film about the inhabitants of Kersko, their hardships and their joys, most prominently hunting. A lyrical and humorous adaptation of writings by Bohumil Hrabal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/och5s3EHiNfSFd1Ki9Wr5zJHjOF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45039'),
  ('1289581233914400', 'The Snowman', 1982, 'Adventure, Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'Dianne Jackson, Jimmy T. Murakami, Jill Brooks', null, 'Raymond Briggs, David Bowie, Mel Smith', 'G', 'A young boy makes a snowman one Christmas Eve, which comes to life at midnight and takes him on a magical adventure to the North Pole to meet Santa Claus.', 'A young boy makes a snowman one Christmas Eve, which comes to life at midnight and takes him on a magical adventure to the North Pole to meet Santa Claus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b3CMolkeXrPaVvd5vTsssMKfZZo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13396'),
  ('710933419930483192', 'The Snowman', 2017, 'Crime, Thriller, Mystery, Horror', 'Tomas Alfredson, Ben Collins, Grant Butler', 'Peter Straughan', 'Michael Fassbender, Rebecca Ferguson, Charlotte Gainsbourg, Jonas Karlsson, Michael Yates, Ronan Vibert, J.K. Simmons, Val Kilmer', 'R', 'Detective Harry Hole investigates the disappearance of a woman whose pink scarf is found wrapped around an ominous looking snowman.', 'Detective Harry Hole investigates the disappearance of a woman whose pink scarf is found wrapped around an ominous looking snowman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mKsQ8KMOk0VBX26Ev0Lj6EmfGJu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:372343'),
  ('226320029937821975', 'The Snowman and the Snowdog', 2012, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Hilary Audus, Robin Shaw', 'Joanna Harrison, Hilary Audus', null, 'G', 'Charming animated sequel to Raymond Briggs''s classic The Snowman. When a young boy and his mother move house, he builds a Snowman and a Snowdog who magically come to life.', 'Charming animated sequel to Raymond Briggs''s classic The Snowman. When a young boy and his mother move house, he builds a Snowman and a Snowdog who magically come to life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bwQyPZKkr14UWwXTSkSA3XiuKif.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:185025'),
  ('650736506833527433', 'The Snowman-Postman', 1955, 'Animation', 'Leonid Amalrik, Mikhail Druyan, Nikolay Prilutskiy', 'Vladimir Suteev', 'Larisa Bukhartseva, Mariya Vinogradova, Georgiy Vitsin, Aleksei Gribov, Rostislav Plyatt, Yuri Khrzhanovsky, Aleksandr Shchagin, Yuliya Yulskaya', null, 'On the eve of the New Year, several children write a letter to Father Frost asking him to send them a Christmas tree for the holiday, and then they make a Snowman who should take the letter to the magic forest. When midnight arrives, under the beat of a clock, the Snowman comes to life and, together with a small yard puppy, nicknamed Druzhok, sets off in search of Father Frost.', 'On the eve of the New Year, several children write a letter to Father Frost asking him to send them a Christmas tree for the holiday, and then they make a Snowman who should take the letter to the magic forest. When midnight arrives, under the beat of a clock, the Snowman comes to life and, together with a small yard puppy, nicknamed Druzhok, sets off in search of Father Frost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1G8oK4hYrD2nZQeANQFOuf2R24l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144602'),
  ('600526952133235457', 'The Snows of Kilimanjaro', 1952, 'Adventure, Romance, Drama', 'Henry King, Leon Shamroy, Henry Weinberger', 'Casey Robinson', 'Gregory Peck, Susan Hayward, Ava Gardner, Hildegard Knef, Leo G. Carroll, Torin Thatcher, Ava Norring, Helene Stanley', 'NR', 'Writer Harry Street reflects on his life as he lies dying from an infection while on safari in the shadow of Mount Kilimanjaro.', 'Writer Harry Street reflects on his life as he lies dying from an infection while on safari in the shadow of Mount Kilimanjaro.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xIdEt2rycY6h3QAKGqWrIGqhviD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4460'),
  ('123040157722519000', 'The Snows of Kilimanjaro', 2011, 'Drama', 'Robert Guédiguian, Pierre Milon, Ferdinand Verhaeghe', 'Robert Guédiguian, Jean-Louis Milesi', 'Ariane Ascaride, Jean-Pierre Darroussin, Gérard Meylan, Grégoire Leprince-Ringuet, Marilyne Canto, Anaïs Demoustier, Adrien Jolivet, Robinson Stévenin', null, 'A union pensioner and his wife are robbed, but find that merely getting the assailants brought to justice is not enough for their consciences.', 'A union pensioner and his wife are robbed, but find that merely getting the assailants brought to justice is not enough for their consciences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nCqihL2CZ9eNlP8vM5s0ldoNMk1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91690'),
  ('79075960276686890', 'The Snowshoers', 1958, 'Documentary', 'Michel Brault, Gilles Groulx, Louis Portugais', null, 'Maurice Richard', null, 'This short documentary records the celebration and ritual surrounding a snowshoe competition in Sherbrooke in the late 1950s. The film marked the beginning of a new approach to reality in documentary and prefigures the trademark style of the NFB''s newly formed French Unit. Today, "Les raquetteurs" is considered a precursor to the birth of direct cinema.', 'This short documentary records the celebration and ritual surrounding a snowshoe competition in Sherbrooke in the late 1950s. The film marked the beginning of a new approach to reality in documentary and prefigures the trademark style of the NFB''s newly formed French Unit. Today, "Les raquetteurs" is considered a precursor to the birth of direct cinema.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/owhYG28cErKwkpAnCPHsGcHwsQa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163106'),
  ('486632033632433264', 'The So-Called Caryatids', 1984, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Agnès Varda, Cyril Lathus, Jean-Pierre Albasy', null, 'Agnès Varda', null, 'Commissioned by French television, this is a short documentary on the neo-classical statues found throughout Paris, predominantly on the walls of buildings, holding up windows, roofs etc.', 'Commissioned by French television, this is a short documentary on the neo-classical statues found throughout Paris, predominantly on the walls of buildings, holding up windows, roofs etc.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sospfiRpt5TQMLF0Ny7BGGtIR4R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46777'),
  ('599038267933004714', 'The Soccer Football Movie', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Mitch Schauer, Richard Finn', 'Deeki Deke', 'Zlatan Ibrahimović, Megan Rapinoe, ''Weird Al'' Yankovic, Rob Stone, Kieran Walton, Madison Zamor, Tania Gunadi, Arnie Pantoja', 'PG', 'When mysterious green slime monsters start popping out of soccer balls, all-star athletes Zlatan Ibrahimović and Megan Rapinoe must team up with their four biggest fans to stop evil scientist "Weird Al" Yankovic from stealing their talent.', 'When mysterious green slime monsters start popping out of soccer balls, all-star athletes Zlatan Ibrahimović and Megan Rapinoe must team up with their four biggest fans to stop evil scientist "Weird Al" Yankovic from stealing their talent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sWoYDNPNZs5MtzPbirXV73tIHrA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1037858'),
  ('686369150053718885', 'The Social Dilemma', 2020, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Jeff Orlowski, John Behrens, Jonathan Pope', 'Davis Coombe, Vickie Curtis, Jeff Orlowski', 'Tristan Harris, Jeff Seibert, Bailey Richardson, Joe Toscano, Sandy Parakilas, Guillaume Chaslot, Lynn Fox, Aza Raskin', 'PG-13', 'This documentary-drama hybrid explores the dangerous human impact of social networking, with tech experts sounding the alarm on their own creations.', 'This documentary-drama hybrid explores the dangerous human impact of social networking, with tech experts sounding the alarm on their own creations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jcaM6V2tCtu6iMHDsGLBUbaYgYp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:656690'),
  ('249413784771735764', 'The Social Network', 2010, 'Drama', 'David Fincher, Matt Carver, Allen Kupetsky', 'Aaron Sorkin', 'Jesse Eisenberg, Andrew Garfield, Armie Hammer, Josh Pence, Justin Timberlake, Max Minghella, Brenda Song, Rashida Jones', 'PG-13', 'In 2003, Harvard undergrad and computer programmer Mark Zuckerberg begins work on a new concept that eventually turns into the global social network known as Facebook. Six years later, Mark is one of the youngest billionaires ever, but his unprecedented success leads to both personal and legal complications when he ends up on the receiving end of two lawsuits, one involving his former friend.', 'In 2003, Harvard undergrad and computer programmer Mark Zuckerberg begins work on a new concept that eventually turns into the global social network known as Facebook. Six years later, Mark is one of the youngest billionaires ever, but his unprecedented success leads to both personal and legal complications when he ends up on the receiving end of two lawsuits, one involving his former friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n0ybibhJtQ5icDqTp8eRytcIHJx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37799'),
  ('743340133922003528', 'The Society of the Spectacle', 1974, 'Documentary', 'Guy Debord', 'Guy Debord', 'Leonid Brezhnev, Fidel Castro, Guy Debord, Jacques Duclos, Robert Fabre, Nino Ferrer, Valéry Giscard d''Estaing, Johnny Hallyday', null, 'Guy Debord''s analysis of a consumer society.', 'Guy Debord''s analysis of a consumer society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yoRpCz35ixl8LyGHHUb9ytmfiE2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8977'),
  ('829326466198902917', 'The Sociologist and the Bear Cub', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Etienne Chaillou, Mathias Théry, Dan Weingrod', null, 'Irène Théry', null, 'Between September 2012 and May 2013, France is debating the upcoming marriage equality laws. During those nine months, sociologist Irène Théry talks about what is at stake with her son Mathias Théry, who will make a movie with Étienne Chaillou out of those hours of conversations. It is a documentary about the social debate in France, but also about family and intimacy.', 'Between September 2012 and May 2013, France is debating the upcoming marriage equality laws. During those nine months, sociologist Irène Théry talks about what is at stake with her son Mathias Théry, who will make a movie with Étienne Chaillou out of those hours of conversations. It is a documentary about the social debate in France, but also about family and intimacy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8a4BBFZ6PaFQUQJWMf5VNbuvpYg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:392587'),
  ('171480299785652396', 'The Soeur Brothers', 2000, 'Comedy', 'Frédéric Jardin, Laurent Machuel', 'Édouard Baer, Fabrice Roger-Lacan, Frédéric Jardin', 'José Garcia, Denis Podalydès, Jackie Berroyer, Édouard Baer, Alexandra London', null, 'The Soeur brothers would like to work in the film making business. They wrote a complex story that doesn''t make any sense, and nobody wants to produce it. They''re willing to do anything in order to make their film come to life.', 'The Soeur brothers would like to work in the film making business. They wrote a complex story that doesn''t make any sense, and nobody wants to produce it. They''re willing to do anything in order to make their film come to life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aFA839CAuOXOcz70bAjs7iS4kz1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:457070'),
  ('703562186326757097', 'The Soft One', 1951, 'Drama', 'Fernando Méndez', 'Gabriel Ramírez Osante', 'Víctor Parra, Aurora Segura, Dagoberto Rodríguez, Jacqueline Evans, María Amelia de Torres, Enrique del Castillo, Gilberto González, Manuel Dondé', null, 'Charming but unreliable, Roberto has earned his nickname "El Suavecito" through his constant flirtations and the easy way he moves through life, even when it causes pain to his devoted aging mother and his beautiful neighbor Lupita, who resists his overtures in the hopes he can learn to settle down and behave. When Lupita gains a steady and honest suitor in Carlos, El Suavecito can''t resist trying to foul his chances with the help of the unscrupulous gambler "El Nene"--but it all goes badly wrong. This neglected noir asks whether a morally impoverished gangster is capable of redemption.', 'Charming but unreliable, Roberto has earned his nickname "El Suavecito" through his constant flirtations and the easy way he moves through life, even when it causes pain to his devoted aging mother and his beautiful neighbor Lupita, who resists his overtures in the hopes he can learn to settle down and behave. When Lupita gains a steady and honest suitor in Carlos, El Suavecito can''t resist trying to foul his chances with the help of the unscrupulous gambler "El Nene"--but it all goes badly wrong. This neglected noir asks whether a morally impoverished gangster is capable of redemption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iYj9JEtuQuGhWb0cP13QcHzCbV7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:194155'),
  ('851939119880255007', 'The Soft Skin', 1964, 'Drama, Romance', 'François Truffaut, Raoul Coutard, Claude Othnin-Girard', 'François Truffaut, Jean-Louis Richard', 'Françoise Dorléac, Jean Desailly, Nelly Benedetti, Daniel Ceccaldi, Laurence Badie, Philippe Dumat, Paule Emanuele, Maurice Garrel', 'NR', 'Pierre Lachenay is a well-known publisher and lecturer, married to Franca and father of Sabine. He starts a love affair with air hostess Nicole, which Pierre is hiding, but he cannot stay away from her.', 'Pierre Lachenay is a well-known publisher and lecturer, married to Franca and father of Sabine. He starts a love affair with air hostess Nicole, which Pierre is hiding, but he cannot stay away from her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nYo083NgJCAQQByHzYrayxQ5xBV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1719'),
  ('348623777782162242', 'The Soilers', 1923, 'Comedy', 'Ralph Ceder, Clarence Hennecke', 'Hal Conklin', 'Stan Laurel, Ena Gregory, Mae Laurel, James Finlayson, Billy Engle, Eddie Baker, Katherine Grant, Glenn Tryon', null, 'During the Alaska gold rush, a miner hits the motherlode, but a corrupt sheriff jumps his claim, leading to a tremendous fight.', 'During the Alaska gold rush, a miner hits the motherlode, but a corrupt sheriff jumps his claim, leading to a tremendous fight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v0VWgG1IvDUwlWGkjN2pcCpSUfO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175764'),
  ('236900538499254081', 'The Soldier', 1982, 'Action, Drama', 'Robert M. Baldwin, Ron Bozman, Paula Mazur', 'James Glickenhaus', 'Ken Wahl, Alberta Watson, Jeremiah Sullivan, William Prince, Joaquim de Almeida, Peter Hooten, Steve James, Alexander Spencer', 'R', 'Terrorists take over a plutonium bomb and threaten to detonate it in a Saudi Arabian oil field. A special anti-terrorist unit is sent in to stop them.', 'Terrorists take over a plutonium bomb and threaten to detonate it in a Saudi Arabian oil field. A special anti-terrorist unit is sent in to stop them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1aIohAxW05nOL6PXh05dCDgLFeS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76395'),
  ('427076621475231311', 'The Soldier with Great Maneuvers', 1978, 'Comedy', 'Nando Cicero, Giancarlo Ferrando, Evi Farinelli', 'Annie Albert, Fiorenzo Fiorentini, Nando Cicero', 'Edwige Fenech, Renzo Montagnani, Alvaro Vitali, Michele Gammino, Lucio Montanaro, Enzo Monteduro, Nino Terzo, Antonino Faà di Bruno', null, 'Doctor Eva Marini takes up a position at an army base to investigate the sexual behavior of the Italian male soldier and soon finds out she''s taken on more than she bargained for.', 'Doctor Eva Marini takes up a position at an army base to investigate the sexual behavior of the Italian male soldier and soon finds out she''s taken on more than she bargained for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zWGFtuDT5B10Km0jrIhOX8kDeac.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151024'),
  ('202446576397170298', 'The Solid Gold Cadillac', 1956, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Irving J. Moore, Richard Quine, Charles Lang', 'Abe Burrows', 'Judy Holliday, Paul Douglas, Fred Clark, John Williams, Hiram Sherman, Neva Patterson, Ralph Dumke, Ray Collins', null, 'Laura Partridge is a very enthusiastic small stockholder of 10 shares in International Projects, a large corporation based in New York. She attends her first stockholder meeting ready to question the board of directors from their salaries to their operations.', 'Laura Partridge is a very enthusiastic small stockholder of 10 shares in International Projects, a large corporation based in New York. She attends her first stockholder meeting ready to question the board of directors from their salaries to their operations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ennpt6fPoCQSzULMr6oK1CXtIx2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78331'),
  ('946992336275054465', 'The Solitary Gourmet', 2025, 'Adventure, Comedy, Drama', 'Yutaka Matsushige, Ryuichi Kitahata, Junki Ozaki', 'Yutaka Matsushige, Yoshihiro Taguchi', 'Yutaka Matsushige, Yuki Uchida, Hayato Isomura, Takehiro Murata, You Chea-myung, Sansei Shiomi, Kenichi Endo, Anne Watanabe', null, 'Upon receiving a message from an old friend’s daughter, Goro arrives in Paris and learns of the elderly man’s wish to taste a particular soup he had in his childhood before he dies. Deciding to help, Goro sets out on a quest to find this mysterious soup, traveling through Japan, braving a storm, and even ending up in South Korea.', 'Upon receiving a message from an old friend’s daughter, Goro arrives in Paris and learns of the elderly man’s wish to taste a particular soup he had in his childhood before he dies. Deciding to help, Goro sets out on a quest to find this mysterious soup, traveling through Japan, braving a storm, and even ending up in South Korea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3KvWwXJaG8T1qsOKGIzyAy9FVEB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1315076'),
  ('798200609004459693', 'The Solitude of Prime Numbers', 2010, 'Drama', 'Saverio Costanzo', 'Paolo Giordano, Saverio Costanzo', 'Alba Rohrwacher, Luca Marinelli, Aurora Ruffino, Arianna Nastro, Tommaso Maria Neri, Isabella Rossellini, Maurizio Donadoni, Roberto Sbaratto', null, 'Prime numbers are divisible only by one and themselves. These numbers are solitary and incomprehensible to others. Alice and Mattia are both "prime", both haunted by the tragedies that have marked them in childhood: a skiing accident for Alice which has caused a defect in her leg, and the loss of his twin sister for Matthew.', 'Prime numbers are divisible only by one and themselves. These numbers are solitary and incomprehensible to others. Alice and Mattia are both "prime", both haunted by the tragedies that have marked them in childhood: a skiing accident for Alice which has caused a defect in her leg, and the loss of his twin sister for Matthew.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m0gus7fk5eAZHS0OOAHa70Rqu9F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53399'),
  ('829708339433639942', 'The Soloist', 2009, 'Drama, Music', 'Joe Wright, Seamus McGarvey, Chris Castaldi', 'Susannah Grant', 'Robert Downey Jr., Jamie Foxx, Catherine Keener, Tom Hollander, Nelsan Ellis, Michael Bunin, LisaGay Hamilton, Rachael Harris', 'PG-13', 'A Los Angeles journalist befriends a homeless Juilliard-trained musician, while looking for a new article for the paper.', 'A Los Angeles journalist befriends a homeless Juilliard-trained musician, while looking for a new article for the paper.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6GnFN9OTkaoeKNzd2Fbp3ZyJjKi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17332'),
  ('818167393372293854', 'The Son', 2002, 'Drama', 'Jean-Pierre Dardenne, Luc Dardenne, Alain Marcoen', 'Jean-Pierre Dardenne, Luc Dardenne', 'Olivier Gourmet, Morgan Marinne, Isabella Soupart, Nassim Hassaïni, Pierre Nisse, Anne Gerard, Annette Closset, Félicien Pitsaer', null, 'A joinery instructor at a rehab center refuses to take a new teen as his apprentice, but then begins to follow the boy through the hallways and streets.', 'A joinery instructor at a rehab center refuses to take a new teen as his apprentice, but then begins to follow the boy through the hallways and streets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mbAG0JOVgcOIH8LVVynw87ONgej.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35172'),
  ('455246066566577270', 'The Son', 2012, 'Drama, Family', 'Venci Kostov, Kike Ramírez, Fran García Vera', 'Venci Kostov, Enrique De Tomás', 'Ignacio Montes, Álvaro Blanco Morett, Pedro Casablanc, Aníbal Cortés, José Carlos Cuevas, Fanny de Castro, Salvador Flores, Mateo Rubistein', null, 'Pedro is a 17 years old boy who attends high school as all the boys do. In the afternoon he and his friends mess around. What Pedro loves the most is his mother''s lentil soup.', 'Pedro is a 17 years old boy who attends high school as all the boys do. In the afternoon he and his friends mess around. What Pedro loves the most is his mother''s lentil soup.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lIGmBQ4s8isJUYWaFf8kvgcbo8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:567568'),
