  ('331459063405101373', 'The Son', 2022, 'Drama', 'Florian Zeller, Jamie D. Allen, Benjamin Dol', 'Christopher Hampton, Florian Zeller', 'Hugh Jackman, Zen McGrath, Vanessa Kirby, Laura Dern, Anthony Hopkins, William Hope, George Cobell, Felix Goddard', 'PG-13', 'A successful lawyer, with a new wife and infant, agrees to care for his teenage son from a previous marriage after his ex-wife becomes concerned about the boy''s wayward behavior.', 'A successful lawyer, with a new wife and infant, agrees to care for his teenage son from a previous marriage after his ex-wife becomes concerned about the boy''s wayward behavior.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hYR2doH3arnX0Y6WULuBPbtaLjN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:806368'),
  ('545742569065926646', 'The Son of a Thousand Men', 2025, 'Drama', 'Daniel Rezende, Azul Serra, Luciana Baptista', 'Daniel Rezende', 'Rodrigo Santoro, Rebeca Jamir, Miguel Martines, Johnny Massaro, Marcello Escorel, Lívia Silva, Antonio Haddad, Juliana Caldas', 'R', 'In a small village, a lonely fisherman yearning for a son is drawn to an ethereal light that links him to others and their long-buried secrets.', 'In a small village, a lonely fisherman yearning for a son is drawn to an ethereal light that links him to others and their long-buried secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vIFdUrfIuOnW6YRGK1BqPAYOaTY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1299209'),
  ('23450589865579638', 'The Son of Bigfoot', 2017, 'Family, Animation, Comedy', 'Jérémie Degruson, Ben Stassen, Barbara Meyers', 'Bob Barlen, Cal Brunker', 'Pappy Faulkner, Christopher Lee Parson, Terrence Stone, Marieve Herington, Cinda Adams, Jeff Doucette, Laila Berzins, Joey Camen', 'PG', 'Teenage outsider Adam sets out on an epic and daring quest to uncover the mystery behind his long-lost dad, only to find out that he is none other than the legendary Bigfoot! He has been hiding deep in the forest for years to protect himself and his family from HairCo., a giant corporation eager to run scientific experiments with his special DNA. As father and son start making up for lost time after the boy''s initial disbelief, Adam soon discovers that he too is gifted with superpowers beyond his imagination. But little do they know, HairCo. is on their tail as Adam''s traces have led them to Bigfoot!', 'Teenage outsider Adam sets out on an epic and daring quest to uncover the mystery behind his long-lost dad, only to find out that he is none other than the legendary Bigfoot! He has been hiding deep in the forest for years to protect himself and his family from HairCo., a giant corporation eager to run scientific experiments with his special DNA. As father and son start making up for lost time after the boy''s initial disbelief, Adam soon discovers that he too is gifted with superpowers beyond his imagination. But little do they know, HairCo. is on their tail as Adam''s traces have led them to Bigfoot!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5yCQvhFuFPY0pACxoUpLUlYCxop.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:413644'),
  ('1027198326526073708', 'The Son of Dr. Jekyll', 1951, 'Crime, Horror, Romance, Science Fiction', 'Seymour Friedman, Henry Freulich, James Nicholson', null, 'Louis Hayward, Jody Lawrance, Alexander Knox, Lester Matthews, Gavin Muir, Paul Cavanagh, Rhys Williams, Victor Adamson', null, 'The son of the notorious Dr. Henry Jekyll is determined to prove that his father''s reputation has been unjustly deserved. He sets out to develop his father''s formula in order to prove that he was a brilliant scientist rather than a murderous monster.', 'The son of the notorious Dr. Henry Jekyll is determined to prove that his father''s reputation has been unjustly deserved. He sets out to develop his father''s formula in order to prove that he was a brilliant scientist rather than a murderous monster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7FP9FwucgIzWpEgpmtEZy5KWcDh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115609'),
  ('240302079373554971', 'The Son of Joseph', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Eugène Green', 'Eugène Green', 'Victor Ezenfis, Natacha Régnier, Fabrizio Rongione, Mathieu Amalric, Maria de Medeiros, Julia Gros de Gasquet, Jacques Bonnaffé, Christelle Prot', null, 'A young man who lives with his mother and has never known his father, heads off to look for him. He finds a cynical and Machiavellian man who works as a publisher in Paris. After he attempts to kill him, he finds filial love thanks to his uncle.', 'A young man who lives with his mother and has never known his father, heads off to look for him. He finds a cynical and Machiavellian man who works as a publisher in Paris. After he attempts to kill him, he finds filial love thanks to his uncle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eI1ghTLv9ZKMFDkx5YXEw7Ol82t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:377287'),
