  ('411178629362647311', 'The Son of Monte Cristo', 1940, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Romance', 'Rowland V. Lee, George Robinson, Lambert Hillyer', 'George Bruce', 'Louis Hayward, Joan Bennett, George Sanders, Florence Bates, Lionel Royce, Montagu Love, Ian Wolfe, Clayton Moore', 'NR', 'Rightful owner of the kingdom, the Duchess of Zona, is engaged in a power struggle with the evil General Gurko. Edmond, the son of Monte Cristo, dons many disguises to come to the aid of the Duchess.', 'Rightful owner of the kingdom, the Duchess of Zona, is engaged in a power struggle with the evil General Gurko. Edmond, the son of Monte Cristo, dons many disguises to come to the aid of the Duchess.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9aVqZdhbcL2YSn4xcKmBn9bWNwv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80086'),
  ('1060696345526730990', 'The Son of No One', 2011, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Benoît Delhomme, Dito Montiel', 'Dito Montiel', 'Channing Tatum, Al Pacino, Juliette Binoche, Katie Holmes, James Ransone, Ray Liotta, Tracy Morgan, Ursula Parker', null, 'A rookie cop is assigned to the 118 Precinct in the same district where he grew up. The Precinct Captain starts receiving letters about two unsolved murders that happened many years ago in the housing projects when the rookie cop was just a kid. These letters bring back bad memories and old secrets that begin to threaten his career and break up his family.', 'A rookie cop is assigned to the 118 Precinct in the same district where he grew up. The Precinct Captain starts receiving letters about two unsolved murders that happened many years ago in the housing projects when the rookie cop was just a kid. These letters bring back bad memories and old secrets that begin to threaten his career and break up his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/koxJAJTPTKzMxKu3vVhPvoZc4w6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74536'),
  ('683839999494815503', 'The Son of Revenge – The Story of Kalevala', 2026, 'Drama, Fantasy, History, Action', 'Antti J. Jokinen, Teppo Salonen, Rauno Ronkainen, Donatas Daugela, Dagnė Puodžiūnaitė', 'Antti J. Jokinen, Jorma Tommila, Elias Lonnrot', 'Elias Salonen, Eero Aho, Ilkka Koivula, Ronja Kuoppamäki, Olli Rahkonen', null, 'A Kalevalian tale about a tragic hero full of torment and revenge.', 'A Kalevalian tale about a tragic hero full of torment and revenge.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2F0%2Fgracenote%2F0f466d57a2df86b952e3b9ddd750cf4a.jpg', 'plex:movie:kalevala-the-story-of-kullervo-2026'),
  ('442473522006430232', 'The Son of the Sheik', 1926, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Romance', 'George Fitzmaurice, George Barnes', 'Frances Marion, Fred De Gresac', 'Rudolph Valentino, Vilma Banky, George Fawcett, Montagu Love, Agnes Ayres, Karl Dane, Bull Montana, Bynunsky Hyman', null, 'Ahmed, son of Diana and Sheik Ahmed Ben Hassan, falls in love with Yasmin, a dancing girl who fronts her father''s gang of mountebanks. She and Ahmed meet secretly until one night when her father and the gang capture the son of the sheik, torture him, and hold him for ransom.', 'Ahmed, son of Diana and Sheik Ahmed Ben Hassan, falls in love with Yasmin, a dancing girl who fronts her father''s gang of mountebanks. She and Ahmed meet secretly until one night when her father and the gang capture the son of the sheik, torture him, and hold him for ransom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yZib8tHbOHrSTSszif728VwU2L6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85689'),
  ('224582205455644389', 'The Son Of...', 1995, 'Drama', 'Maurice Pialat, Myriam Touzé, Jean-Claude Larrieu', 'Maurice Pialat, Sylvie Pialat', 'Gérard Depardieu, Géraldine Pailhas, Dominique Rocheteau, Fabienne Babe, Elisabeth Depardieu, Antoine Pialat, Claude Davy, Isabelle Costacurta', null, 'A self-centered man (Gérard Depardieu) with many diversions occasionally visits his 4-year-old son (Antoine Pialat) and the boy''s mother (Géraldine Pailhas).', 'A self-centered man (Gérard Depardieu) with many diversions occasionally visits his 4-year-old son (Antoine Pialat) and the boy''s mother (Géraldine Pailhas).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5JUEy8sDkzKp0Ok2G5KW2TCqYF4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47119'),
  ('473670375576770346', 'The Son''s Room', 2001, 'Drama', 'Nanni Moretti, Giuseppe Lanci', 'Linda Ferri, Nanni Moretti, Heidrun Schleef', 'Nanni Moretti, Laura Morante, Jasmine Trinca, Giuseppe Sanfelice, Silvio Orlando, Stefano Accorsi, Claudia Della Seta, Eleonora Danco', 'R', 'A psychoanalyst and his family go through profound emotional trauma when their son dies in a scuba diving accident.', 'A psychoanalyst and his family go through profound emotional trauma when their son dies in a scuba diving accident.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e9s1Hvw9TcVZspbkq2V8Bmvhky1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11447'),
  ('70765614734650283', 'The Sonata', 2018, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Andrew Desmond, Jānis Eglītis', 'Andrew Desmond, Arthur Morin', 'Freya Tingley, Simon Abkarian, James Faulkner, Rutger Hauer, Catherine Schaub-Abkarian, Matt Barber, Christopher Brand, James Kermack', null, 'After a gifted musician inherits a mansion after her long lost father dies under mysterious circumstances, she discovers his last musical masterpiece riddled with cryptic symbols that unravels an evil secret, triggering dark forces that reach beyond her imagination.', 'After a gifted musician inherits a mansion after her long lost father dies under mysterious circumstances, she discovers his last musical masterpiece riddled with cryptic symbols that unravels an evil secret, triggering dark forces that reach beyond her imagination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iiL3AWKPx6GIZN6AmmSq7pbtyc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:477036'),
  ('618238812327145302', 'The Song', 2014, 'Music, Romance, Drama', 'Richard Ramsey, Kevin Bryan', 'Richard Ramsey', 'Alan Powell, Ali Faulkner, Caitlin Nicol-Thomas, Danny Vinson, Kenda Benward, Landon Marshall, Jason Bynum, Aaron Benward', 'PG-13', 'Aspiring singer-songwriter Jed King struggles to catch a break and escape the long shadow of his father, a country music legend. After reluctantly accepting a gig at a local vineyard harvest festival, Jed is love-struck by the vineyard owner’s daughter, Rose, and a romance quickly blooms. Soon after their wedding, Jed writes Rose “The Song,” which becomes a breakout hit. Thrust into a life of stardom and a world of temptation in the form of fellow performer Shelby Bale, Jed’s life and marriage begin to fall apart.', 'Aspiring singer-songwriter Jed King struggles to catch a break and escape the long shadow of his father, a country music legend. After reluctantly accepting a gig at a local vineyard harvest festival, Jed is love-struck by the vineyard owner’s daughter, Rose, and a romance quickly blooms. Soon after their wedding, Jed writes Rose “The Song,” which becomes a breakout hit. Thrust into a life of stardom and a world of temptation in the form of fellow performer Shelby Bale, Jed’s life and marriage begin to fall apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aC8oNmIDByUWnTrkUQddJcvV34T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:271164'),
  ('990670543017790638', 'The Song of Bernadette', 1943, 'Drama', 'Henry King, Arthur C. Miller', 'George Seaton', 'Jennifer Jones, William Eythe, Charles Bickford, Vincent Price, Lee J. Cobb, Gladys Cooper, Anne Revere, Roman Bohnen', 'NR', 'In 1858 Lourdes, France, adolescent peasant Bernadette has a vision of "a beautiful lady" in the Massabielle grotto - the townspeople assume this lady to be the Virgin Mary. Pompous government officials think the girl is insane, doing their best to suppress her and her followers, while the church wants nothing to do with the matter. But as Bernadette attracts wider and wider attention, the phenomenon overtakes everyone in the town, ultimately transforming their lives.', 'In 1858 Lourdes, France, adolescent peasant Bernadette has a vision of "a beautiful lady" in the Massabielle grotto - the townspeople assume this lady to be the Virgin Mary. Pompous government officials think the girl is insane, doing their best to suppress her and her followers, while the church wants nothing to do with the matter. But as Bernadette attracts wider and wider attention, the phenomenon overtakes everyone in the town, ultimately transforming their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kRZItSgFaSDnHePwxX5PfZvu5M8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43516'),
  ('770104570025293135', 'The Song of Ceylon', 1934, 'Documentary', 'Basil Wright, Basil Wright, John Taylor', null, 'Lionel Wendt', null, 'Ambitious documentary chronicling the cultural life and religious customs of the Sinhalese and the effects of advanced industrialism on such customs.', 'Ambitious documentary chronicling the cultural life and religious customs of the Sinhalese and the effects of advanced industrialism on such customs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/baCKNOPACI8EaHvlSs7LrQJokzo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54051'),
  ('116349565524548119', 'The Song of Love', 1930, 'Drama, Romance', 'Gennaro Righelli, Massimo Terzano, Ubaldo Arata', 'Gennaro Righelli, Giorgio Simonelli', 'Dria Paola, Isa Pola, Elio Steiner, Mercedes Brignone, Camillo Pilotto, Emilia Vidali, Olga Capri, Nello Rocchi', null, 'A young woman takes care of the just-born child of her late mother. Sacrificing her engagement and studies along the way.', 'A young woman takes care of the just-born child of her late mother. Sacrificing her engagement and studies along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6k8QR0axj7BKqJhncvDWOIPZtgX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:282026'),
  ('205997434275392804', 'The Song of Names', 2019, 'Drama, Music', 'François Girard, David Franco', 'Jeffrey Caine', 'Tim Roth, Clive Owen, Catherine McCormack, Eddie Izzard, Saul Rubinek, Jonah Hauer-King, Gerran Howell, Luke Doyle', 'PG-13', 'A man searches for his childhood best friend, a Polish violin prodigy orphaned in the Holocaust, who vanished decades before on the night of his first public performance.', 'A man searches for his childhood best friend, a Polish violin prodigy orphaned in the Holocaust, who vanished decades before on the night of his first public performance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iIEZG0WD0sraPqo4al6oaU1vibJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:617768'),
  ('956433202658171718', 'The Song of Songs', 1933, 'Drama, Romance', 'Rouben Mamoulian, Victor Milner', 'Edwin Justus Mayer, Rouben Mamoulian, Benjamin Glazer', 'Marlene Dietrich, Brian Aherne, Lionel Atwill, Alison Skipworth, Hardie Albright, Helen Freeman, Max Barwyn, Adrienne D''Ambricourt', 'NR', 'After her father dies, Lily moves to the city to live with her strict aunt. During the day Lily works in her aunt''s bookstore, and at night she sneaks across the street to model for Richard, a sculptor with whom she falls in love. A patron of Richard''s, Baron von Merzbach, develops an interest in Lily that may not be with the best of intentions.', 'After her father dies, Lily moves to the city to live with her strict aunt. During the day Lily works in her aunt''s bookstore, and at night she sneaks across the street to model for Richard, a sculptor with whom she falls in love. A patron of Richard''s, Baron von Merzbach, develops an interest in Lily that may not be with the best of intentions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7icXsF5eqVX6aBClv8pvTsdOPwg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78699'),
  ('231234538867068580', 'The Song of Sparrows', 2008, 'Drama', 'Majid Majidi, Turaj Mansuri', 'Mehran Kashani, Majid Majidi', 'Reza Naji, Hamid Aghazi, Kamran Dehghan, Maryam Akbari, Hamid Aghazi, Schabnam Akhlaghi, Neshat Nazari, Hassan Rezaee', null, 'When an ostrich-rancher focuses on replacing his daughter''s hearing aid, which breaks right before crucial exams, everything changes for a struggling rural family in Iran. Karim motorbikes into a world alien to him - incredibly hectic Tehran, where sudden opportunities for independence, thrill and challenge him. But his honor and honesty, plus traditional authority over his inventive clan, are tested, as he stumbles among vast cultural and economic gaps between his village nestled in the desert, and a throbbing international metropolis.', 'When an ostrich-rancher focuses on replacing his daughter''s hearing aid, which breaks right before crucial exams, everything changes for a struggling rural family in Iran. Karim motorbikes into a world alien to him - incredibly hectic Tehran, where sudden opportunities for independence, thrill and challenge him. But his honor and honesty, plus traditional authority over his inventive clan, are tested, as he stumbles among vast cultural and economic gaps between his village nestled in the desert, and a throbbing international metropolis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hPevXwgadyU6ce5F4CZY1XRfq3I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54254'),
  ('901060864468116336', 'The Song of the Birds', 1935, 'Animation', 'Dave Fleischer', null, null, null, 'A boy gets trigger happy with his BB gun, but soon regrets it.', 'A boy gets trigger happy with his BB gun, but soon regrets it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dOIfGcZoVY3f9mMid9KZNjUn6V0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:184672'),
  ('579461532096204084', 'The Song of the Scarlet Flower', 1938, 'Drama', 'Teuvo Tulio, Fred Runeberg', 'Yrjö Kivimies', 'Kille Oksanen, Rakel Linnanheimo, Mirjami Kuosmanen, Nora Mäkinen, Birgit Nuotio, Maire Ranius, Sylvi Palo, Aku Peltonen', null, 'Olavi, a farmer''s son, leaves his home after a dispute with his father and leads a life of a womanizing logger.', 'Olavi, a farmer''s son, leaves his home after a dispute with his father and leads a life of a womanizing logger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q4pha0uGPxsT27bpln933GKW5YO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256081'),
  ('252137382602539666', 'The Sons of Great Bear', 1966, 'Drama, Western, Adventure', 'Josef Mach', 'Hans-Joachim Wallstein, Liselotte Welskopf-Henrich, Margot Beichler', 'Gojko Mitić, Jiří Vršťala, Rolf Römer, Hans Hardt-Hardtloff, Gerhard Rachold, Horst Jonischkan, Jozef Majerčík, Milan Jablonský', null, 'As American settlers encroach on the lands of the Lakota people, Tokei-ihto witnesses the murder of his father at the hands of Red Fox, who wanted information on where the tribe finds its gold. Two years later, at the height of the Great Sioux War, Tokei-ihto and Red Fox meet again.', 'As American settlers encroach on the lands of the Lakota people, Tokei-ihto witnesses the murder of his father at the hands of Red Fox, who wanted information on where the tribe finds its gold. Two years later, at the height of the Great Sioux War, Tokei-ihto and Red Fox meet again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l4XcScQR80x6tVL9O0yiR15zMFR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130957'),
  ('349625724818265348', 'The Sons of Ilir', 2026, 'Drama', 'Robert Deçani, Alessandra Albano', 'Robert Deçani', 'Nik Prekazi, Kasem Hoxha, Paul Ahrens, Rovena Kuka, Lulzim Zeqja', null, 'Having fled Albania over 30 years ago, Agim and Erjon have led different lives. Their father''s last wish brings them back. There they have to confront their past, their fragile relationship and a country that has changed as much as they have.', 'Having fled Albania over 30 years ago, Agim and Erjon have led different lives. Their father''s last wish brings them back. There they have to confront their past, their fragile relationship and a country that has changed as much as they have.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4c4HwszHxgGoy5SUI1NwK9bACH3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1463251'),
  ('617920432276543920', 'The Sons of Katie Elder', 1965, 'Western', 'Lucien Ballard, Henry Hathaway, Joselito Rodríguez', 'Harry Essex, Allan Weiss, William H. Wright', 'John Wayne, Dean Martin, Martha Hyer, Michael Anderson Jr., Earl Holliman, Jeremy Slate, James Gregory, Paul Fix', 'PG-13', 'The four sons of Katie Elder reunite in their hometown of Clearwater, Texas for her funeral and discover that the family ranch is now in the hands of Morgan Hastings, a corrupt businessman who wants to exploit the area around the town.', 'The four sons of Katie Elder reunite in their hometown of Clearwater, Texas for her funeral and discover that the family ranch is now in the hands of Morgan Hastings, a corrupt businessman who wants to exploit the area around the town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n6ox5IniBxxx6ISTol5pm36WoFr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16211'),
  ('456323840674624870', 'The Soong Sisters', 1997, 'Drama, History, Romance', 'Mabel Cheung Yuen-Ting, Michael Baskett, Wang Biao', 'Alex Law Kai-Yui', 'Maggie Cheung, Michelle Yeoh, Vivian Wu, Winston Chao, Niu Zhen-Hua, Elaine Jin Yan-Ling, Jiang Wen, Wu Hsing-Guo', null, 'Ai-ling married a wealthy and powerful businessman. Ching-ling married Sun Yat-sen, the revolutionary founder of modern China. Mei-ling married Chiang Kai-shek, China''s leader during World War II. The sisters captured the world''s fascination for their brilliant marriages and their strong influence on their nation.', 'Ai-ling married a wealthy and powerful businessman. Ching-ling married Sun Yat-sen, the revolutionary founder of modern China. Mei-ling married Chiang Kai-shek, China''s leader during World War II. The sisters captured the world''s fascination for their brilliant marriages and their strong influence on their nation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kJHuHIpwxNmSf49sWGGggTk0k2J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29346'),
  ('252604539429210143', 'The Sorcerer and the White Snake', 2011, 'Action, Fantasy', 'Tony Ching Siu-Tung, Venus Keung, William Chan Wai-Lin', 'Charcoal Tan', 'Jet Li, Wen Zhang, Raymond Lam Fung, Eva Huang Shengyi, Charlene Choi Chuek-Yin, Vivian Hsu, Jiang Wu, Miriam Yeung Chin-Wah', 'PG-13', 'The Sorcerer and the White Snake is an ancient Chinese fable about a woman demon who falls in love with a mortal is brought to life through the latest advances in CGI and action techniques.', 'The Sorcerer and the White Snake is an ancient Chinese fable about a woman demon who falls in love with a mortal is brought to life through the latest advances in CGI and action techniques.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Jfv3CtMULd41C5jpLR8PGAMgE3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75948'),
  ('2389738315816247', 'The Sorcerer''s Apprentice', 1978, 'Animation, Fantasy', 'Karel Zeman, Zdeněk Krupa, Bohuslav Pikhart', 'Karel Zeman', 'Luděk Munzar, Jaroslav Moučka', null, 'Krabat, a beggar boy, is lured to become an apprentice to an evil, one-eyed sorcerer. With a number of other boys, he works at the sorcerer''s mill while learning black magic. Every Christmas one of the boys has to face the master in a magical duel, where the boy never stands a chance because the master is the only person who is allowed to use a secret spell: The Koraktor.', 'Krabat, a beggar boy, is lured to become an apprentice to an evil, one-eyed sorcerer. With a number of other boys, he works at the sorcerer''s mill while learning black magic. Every Christmas one of the boys has to face the master in a magical duel, where the boy never stands a chance because the master is the only person who is allowed to use a secret spell: The Koraktor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lTQyzYE1K64CeihYjEwCJZHdauC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8128'),
  ('1128427868080112386', 'The Sorcerer''s Apprentice', 2010, 'Fantasy, Adventure, Action', 'Jon Turteltaub, Francisco Ortiz, George Marshall Ruge', 'Mark Rosenthal, Matt Lopez, Lawrence Konner', 'Nicolas Cage, Jay Baruchel, Alfred Molina, Teresa Palmer, Toby Kebbell, Omar Benson Miller, Monica Bellucci, Alice Krige', 'PG', 'Balthazar Blake is a master sorcerer in modern-day Manhattan trying to defend the city from his arch-nemesis, Maxim Horvath. Balthazar can''t do it alone, so he recruits Dave Stutler, a seemingly average guy who demonstrates hidden potential, as his reluctant protégé. The sorcerer gives his unwilling accomplice a crash course in the art and science of magic, and together, these unlikely partners work to stop the forces of darkness.', 'Balthazar Blake is a master sorcerer in modern-day Manhattan trying to defend the city from his arch-nemesis, Maxim Horvath. Balthazar can''t do it alone, so he recruits Dave Stutler, a seemingly average guy who demonstrates hidden potential, as his reluctant protégé. The sorcerer gives his unwilling accomplice a crash course in the art and science of magic, and together, these unlikely partners work to stop the forces of darkness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b5pIUsGll0418NyfNA5eYCI9aoK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27022'),
  ('898099156752564245', 'The Sorcerers', 1967, 'Horror', 'Michael Reeves, Stanley A. Long', 'Michael Reeves, Tom Baker', 'Boris Karloff, Catherine Lacey, Elizabeth Ercy, Ian Ogilvy, Victor Henry, Sally Adams, Meier Tzelniker, Gerald Campion', null, 'An aging hypnotist creates a device that allows the user to control the mind of another person, but his wife abuses its power by manipulating a younger man to commit evil acts.', 'An aging hypnotist creates a device that allows the user to control the mind of another person, but his wife abuses its power by manipulating a younger man to commit evil acts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nDzpHpsnbJbyj7jMlxH5m7TUokT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73203'),
  ('591544940184702522', 'The Sorrows of Satan', 1926, 'Drama, Romance', 'D.W. Griffith, Frank Walsh, Arthur de Titta', 'Forrest Halsey', 'Adolphe Menjou, Ricardo Cortez, Carol Dempster, Lya De Putti, Ivan Lebedeff, Marcia Harris, Lawrence D''Orsay, Nellie Savage', null, 'Geoffrey is desperately in love with Mavis, who lives at his boardinghouse and is also pursuing a writing career. Unable to marry her because of his poverty, in his anger he curses God for abandoning him. Soon Geoffrey meets Prince Lucio de Rimanez, a wealthy, urbane gentleman who informs Geoffrey that he has inherited a fortune, but that he must place himself in the Prince''s hands in order to enjoy the fruits of his inheritance. What Geoffrey doesn''t know is that Prince Lucio is actually Satan.', 'Geoffrey is desperately in love with Mavis, who lives at his boardinghouse and is also pursuing a writing career. Unable to marry her because of his poverty, in his anger he curses God for abandoning him. Soon Geoffrey meets Prince Lucio de Rimanez, a wealthy, urbane gentleman who informs Geoffrey that he has inherited a fortune, but that he must place himself in the Prince''s hands in order to enjoy the fruits of his inheritance. What Geoffrey doesn''t know is that Prince Lucio is actually Satan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jMUBi64a4PvQT9OanMBgHWY5BLo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:189630'),
  ('18602136233246539', 'The Souffleur', 2026, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Gastón Solnicki, Rui Poças', 'Gastón Solnicki, Julia Niemann', 'Willem Dafoe, Stéphanie Argerich, Lilly Lindner, Klaus Lemke, Matthias Kassmannhuber', null, 'Lucius Glantz, a veteran hotel manager in Vienna, fights to save his beloved establishment from a scheming realtor''s plan to demolish it, leading to a clash of wills that even affects the hotel''s renowned soufflé recipe.', 'Lucius Glantz, a veteran hotel manager in Vienna, fights to save his beloved establishment from a scheming realtor''s plan to demolish it, leading to a clash of wills that even affects the hotel''s renowned soufflé recipe.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2F3%2Fgracenote%2F3886b21d0968cf3213b8962f244427f5.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-souffleur'),
  ('986595549816573648', 'The Soul', 2021, 'Mystery, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Kartik Vijay, Cheng Wei-hao', 'Veronica Jin, Cheng Wei-hao, Chen Yen-Chi', 'Chang Chen, Janine Chang Chun-Ning, Christopher Lee, Sun Anke, Lin Hui-min, Samuel Ku, Lü Hsueh-feng, Zhang Bojia', 'NR', 'Wang Shicong, chairman of the famous group, died tragically at home. The prosecutor Liang Wenchao and his wife, Abang, learned during the investigation that the deceased’s long-term partner, Dr. Wan, and his ex-wife’s Son Wang Tianyou, young newlywed wife Li Yan, and even the dead ex-wife, each suspect has an intricate connection. As more clues gradually surfaced, they gradually discovered the rich. The amazing secret hidden behind the murder...', 'Wang Shicong, chairman of the famous group, died tragically at home. The prosecutor Liang Wenchao and his wife, Abang, learned during the investigation that the deceased’s long-term partner, Dr. Wan, and his ex-wife’s Son Wang Tianyou, young newlywed wife Li Yan, and even the dead ex-wife, each suspect has an intricate connection. As more clues gradually surfaced, they gradually discovered the rich. The amazing secret hidden behind the murder...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hrLX0HY408IFiVdSFytOtqcfLAs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:773569'),
  ('791063279034268339', 'The Soul Collector', 1999, 'Romance, Drama, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Brian O''Kelley, Don E. FauntLeRoy, Robert J. Wilson', null, 'Bruce Greenwood, Melissa Gilbert, Christina Carlisi, Ossie Davis, Todd Allen, Buck Taylor, J.D. Garfield, Scotty Leavenworth', null, 'Zachariah, makes a few mistakes and it is decided that he is to live as a human being for thirty days. Mordecai is his supervisor. Rebecca''s husband died and Zachariah the soul collector, or, the angel of the death helped him to make the transition between heaven and earth. There are some complications with Rebecca''s farm and Zachariah helps her out.', 'Zachariah, makes a few mistakes and it is decided that he is to live as a human being for thirty days. Mordecai is his supervisor. Rebecca''s husband died and Zachariah the soul collector, or, the angel of the death helped him to make the transition between heaven and earth. There are some complications with Rebecca''s farm and Zachariah helps her out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zCB3q3USVf1GKkla1B3GSurVTd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:279013'),
  ('786177818642802132', 'The Soul Conductor', 2018, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Ilya Maximov, Dmitriy Kuvshinov, Yury Bekhterev', 'Alexandr Topuriya', 'Aleksandra Bortich, Evgeny Tsyganov, Aleksandr Robak, Vyacheslav Razbegaev, Vladimir Yaglych, Konstantin Murzenko, Yury Skulyabin, Marta Timofeeva', null, 'Katya has a powerful gift: she sees ghosts. When her twin sister disappears, Katya begins a desperate search. Police insist her sister doesn’t exist, that she is a figment of Katya’s twisted imagination. However, during her search Katya discovers that there is a serial killer loose on the streets, and her sister is one of his victims. There is still hope to save her, but in a dark and mysterious city full of secrets, you can’t trust anyone. Not even yourself...', 'Katya has a powerful gift: she sees ghosts. When her twin sister disappears, Katya begins a desperate search. Police insist her sister doesn’t exist, that she is a figment of Katya’s twisted imagination. However, during her search Katya discovers that there is a serial killer loose on the streets, and her sister is one of his victims. There is still hope to save her, but in a dark and mysterious city full of secrets, you can’t trust anyone. Not even yourself...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sam9cFSJknPKW4m4fjwj5idRUkf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:517285'),
  ('1117251408409814659', 'The Soul Eater', 2024, 'Thriller, Horror, Crime, Mystery', 'Anacaona Beauzile, Simon Roca, Mickael Denoyer', 'Ludovic Lefebvre, Annelyse Batrel', 'Virginie Ledoyen, Paul Hamy, Sandrine Bonnaire, Malik Zidi, Emmanuel Lanzi, Christophe Favre, Jérémy Margallé, Francis Renaud', null, 'When the disappearance of children and bloody murders multiply in a small mountain village, an old legend shrouded in sulphur reappears... Commander Guardiano and Captain of the Gendarmerie De Rolan are forced to join forces to uncover the truth.', 'When the disappearance of children and bloody murders multiply in a small mountain village, an old legend shrouded in sulphur reappears... Commander Guardiano and Captain of the Gendarmerie De Rolan are forced to join forces to uncover the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8XsQVmGQukwIVDM88Aa0C7L5hCp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1084863'),
  ('1066497796680510257', 'The Soul Keeper', 2003, 'Drama, Romance, History', 'Matteo Bellizzi, Valerio Valente, Roberto Faenza', 'Hugh Fleetwood, Elda Ferri, François Cohen-Séat', 'Iain Glen, Emilia Fox, Craig Ferguson, Caroline Ducey, Jane Alexander, Viktor Sergachyov, Ivan Igogin, Joanna David', null, 'Zurich, 1905. Nineteen-year-old Russian Sabina Spielrein is put by her parents in a psychiatric hospital, suffering from a severe form of hysteria and refusing to eat. A compassionate doctor, Carl Gustav Jung, takes her under his care and, for the first time, experiments with the psychoanalytical method of his teacher Sigmund Freud. Thus is born a sweeping story of love and passion, of body and soul, soaring to the utmost heights, but also plunging to the darkest depths of the 20th century.', 'Zurich, 1905. Nineteen-year-old Russian Sabina Spielrein is put by her parents in a psychiatric hospital, suffering from a severe form of hysteria and refusing to eat. A compassionate doctor, Carl Gustav Jung, takes her under his care and, for the first time, experiments with the psychoanalytical method of his teacher Sigmund Freud. Thus is born a sweeping story of love and passion, of body and soul, soaring to the utmost heights, but also plunging to the darkest depths of the 20th century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vi96XZn3t8EEm6B2h4tVm780fHi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47505'),
  ('313996720802770626', 'The Soul of a Man', 2003, 'Documentary, Music', 'Wim Wenders, Lisa Rinzler', 'Wim Wenders', 'Laurence Fishburne, Chris Thomas King, Keith B. Brown, J.B. Lenoir, Skip James, T Bone Burnett, John Mayall, Lucinda Williams', null, 'In "The Soul of A Man," director Wim Wenders looks at the dramatic tension in the blues between the sacred and the profane by exploring the music and lives of three of his favorite blues artists: Skip James, Blind Willie Johnson and J. B. Lenoir. Part history, part personal pilgrimage, the film tells the story of these lives in music through an extended fictional film sequence (recreations of ''20s and ''30s events - shot in silent-film, hand-crank style), rare archival footage, present-day documentary scenes and covers of their songs by contemporary musicians such as Shemekia Copeland, Alvin Youngblood Hart, Garland Jeffreys, Chris Thomas King, Cassandra Wilson, Nick Cave, Los Lobos, Eagle Eye Cherry, Vernon Reid, James "Blood" Ulmer, Lou Reed, Bonnie Raitt, Marc Ribot, The Jon Spencer Blues Explosion, Lucinda Williams and T-Bone Burnett.', 'In "The Soul of A Man," director Wim Wenders looks at the dramatic tension in the blues between the sacred and the profane by exploring the music and lives of three of his favorite blues artists: Skip James, Blind Willie Johnson and J. B. Lenoir. Part history, part personal pilgrimage, the film tells the story of these lives in music through an extended fictional film sequence (recreations of ''20s and ''30s events - shot in silent-film, hand-crank style), rare archival footage, present-day documentary scenes and covers of their songs by contemporary musicians such as Shemekia Copeland, Alvin Youngblood Hart, Garland Jeffreys, Chris Thomas King, Cassandra Wilson, Nick Cave, Los Lobos, Eagle Eye Cherry, Vernon Reid, James "Blood" Ulmer, Lou Reed, Bonnie Raitt, Marc Ribot, The Jon Spencer Blues Explosion, Lucinda Williams and T-Bone Burnett.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rKZYI4MSwFjTS7QGku3TgdFonLI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103475'),
  ('1088476768733495779', 'The Soul of a Monster', 1944, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Burnett Guffey, Will Jason, Mischa Bakaleinikoff', 'Edward Dein', 'Rose Hobart, George Macready, Jim Bannon, Jeanne Bates, Erik Rolf, Ernest Hilliard, Ida Moore, Clarence Muse', 'NR', 'A man recovers on his death bed after his wife makes a mysterious pact with a strange woman. But is he really alive?', 'A man recovers on his death bed after his wife makes a mysterious pact with a strange woman. But is he really alive?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q7mN96JSXUbE4kopBNC7y2QTnqY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43613'),
  ('601006484197894178', 'The Soul of Bread', 2012, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Kao Pin-chuan, Lin Chun-yang', 'Er Mu', 'Michelle Chen Yan-Hsi, Hank Chen Han-Dian, Anthony Neely, Janel Tsai, Rex Kao, Phil Hou', null, 'Gao-bing works in a bakery in a small town. The owner, Mr Chiu, is so into his Rock ''n ''Roll band, and the apprentice Di doesn''t seem enthusiastic about learning baking at all. The business of the bakery is getting down and Gao-bing doesn''t know what to do with the situation. All he can do is work harder and makes more bread. Ping, the daughter of Mr Chiu, grew up together with Gao-bing and is Gao-bing''s girlfriend. She often complains that Gao-bing only follows the traditions and doesn''t take any dramatic actions to save the bakery. In order to develop revolutionary new flavors, Ping takes baking courses in the city where she meets Bread. Bread, born in America, is charming and humorous. He falls for Ping at the very first sight. Even though Ping is with Gao-bing, she finds Bread''s bread has a special magic. She thinks Bread might be the one that saves the bakery', 'Gao-bing works in a bakery in a small town. The owner, Mr Chiu, is so into his Rock ''n ''Roll band, and the apprentice Di doesn''t seem enthusiastic about learning baking at all. The business of the bakery is getting down and Gao-bing doesn''t know what to do with the situation. All he can do is work harder and makes more bread. Ping, the daughter of Mr Chiu, grew up together with Gao-bing and is Gao-bing''s girlfriend. She often complains that Gao-bing only follows the traditions and doesn''t take any dramatic actions to save the bakery. In order to develop revolutionary new flavors, Ping takes baking courses in the city where she meets Bread. Bread, born in America, is charming and humorous. He falls for Ping at the very first sight. Even though Ping is with Gao-bing, she finds Bread''s bread has a special magic. She thinks Bread might be the one that saves the bakery', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sNGMrWZUctXJtp3Wv9wfZm1giPh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118761'),
  ('663552074406781106', 'The Soul-Mate', 2018, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Crime, Drama', 'Shin Tae-seob, Jo Won-hee, Ha Gyeong-ho', 'Kim Sung-jin', 'Don Lee, Kim Young-kwang, Lee You-young, Choi Gwi-hwa, Ju Jin-mo, Choi Yu-ri, Heo Jae-ho, Ko Kyu-pil', null, 'Jang-soo is a judo instructor who is indifferent to everyone but his daughter. One day he realizes he can see Tae-jin, a ghost who used to be a devoted police officer. Tae-jin asks Jang-soo to help solve the case that took his life away from him.', 'Jang-soo is a judo instructor who is indifferent to everyone but his daughter. One day he realizes he can see Tae-jin, a ghost who used to be a devoted police officer. Tae-jin asks Jang-soo to help solve the case that took his life away from him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jiiwGHv3FomwWD1VNRCpux4LH9V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:540384'),
  ('1114629042800623655', 'The Sound', 2025, 'Action, Horror, Thriller', 'Brendan Devane, Ryan Galvan', 'Brendan Devane', 'William Fichtner, Jocelyn Hudon, David Clennon, Christina Kirkman, Kyle Gass, Brette Harrington, Hazel Findlay, Marc Hills', 'R', 'A group of climbers embarks on a dangerous climb that has been off-limits for years. What initially begins as an audacious expedition transforms into a battle for survival against a force that toys with them.', 'A group of climbers embarks on a dangerous climb that has been off-limits for years. What initially begins as an audacious expedition transforms into a battle for survival against a force that toys with them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nH26cUZns2jyCAzKsgZkEiinTri.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1362052'),
  ('23523187711523386', 'The Sound and the Fury', 1959, 'Drama', 'Martin Ritt, Charles G. Clarke, Eli Dunn', 'Harriet Frank Jr., Irving Ravetch', 'Yul Brynner, Joanne Woodward, Margaret Leighton, Stuart Whitman, Ethel Waters, Jack Warden, Albert Dekker, John Beal', 'NR', 'The once-prominent Compson family of Jefferson, Miss., has been reduced to near-penury by generations of alcoholism and sin. Levelheaded Jason struggles to keep the family together, but his teenage stepsister, Quentin, chafes against his strictures. When Quentin''s estranged mother reappears in town, and carnival worker Charles attempts to seduce the virginal teen, the family may finally be headed for complete collapse.', 'The once-prominent Compson family of Jefferson, Miss., has been reduced to near-penury by generations of alcoholism and sin. Levelheaded Jason struggles to keep the family together, but his teenage stepsister, Quentin, chafes against his strictures. When Quentin''s estranged mother reappears in town, and carnival worker Charles attempts to seduce the virginal teen, the family may finally be headed for complete collapse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vNzr5YImhoBwOyCSBhcIZhAF9IA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159615'),
  ('284110658223351813', 'The Sound Barrier', 1952, 'Drama, Romance, War', 'David Lean, Jack Hildyard, Adrian Pryce-Jones', 'Terence Rattigan', 'Ralph Richardson, Ann Todd, Nigel Patrick, John Justin, Dinah Sheridan, Joseph Tomelty, Denholm Elliott, Jack Allen', null, 'A young RAF pilot tests his father-in-law’s prototype supersonic aircraft to the limit, at a time of intense development in the field of aviation, just as commercial jet airliners are about to enter service.', 'A young RAF pilot tests his father-in-law’s prototype supersonic aircraft to the limit, at a time of intense development in the field of aviation, just as commercial jet airliners are about to enter service.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cExgxdISr0gEvVr74mmpEL4yLh4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51619'),
  ('644555258930343366', 'The Sound of 007', 2022, 'Documentary, Music, TV Movie', 'Mat Whitecross', null, 'Daniel Craig, Rami Malek, Naomie Harris, Sam Mendes, Hans Zimmer, Cary Joji Fukunaga, Billie Eilish, Maryam D''Abo', null, 'Pull back the curtain on the remarkable history of six decades of James Bond music, from Sean Connery’s Dr No through to Daniel Craig’s final outing in No Time to Die.', 'Pull back the curtain on the remarkable history of six decades of James Bond music, from Sean Connery’s Dr No through to Daniel Craig’s final outing in No Time to Die.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wHsfL0ub95Xr6GK6tJUpmVnrT1J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1028506'),
  ('752091412919230129', 'The Sound of a Flower', 2015, 'Romance, Drama, History, Music', 'Lee Chol-o, Lee Jong-pil, Kim Hyun-seok', 'Lee Jong-pil', 'Ryu Seung-ryong, Suzy, Kim Nam-gil, Noh Young-hak, Song Sae-byuk, Lee Dong-hwi, Ahn Jae-hong, Hwang Chae-won', null, 'During the Joseon Dynasty, lowborn Chae-sun challenges the rule that states only men allowed to sing while navigating devotion to her teacher and the demands of the king''s father.', 'During the Joseon Dynasty, lowborn Chae-sun challenges the rule that states only men allowed to sing while navigating devotion to her teacher and the demands of the king''s father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x9ISvdDpOQAs6uij1rK4wqjLNBa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:366093'),
  ('329292096384779817', 'The Sound of Fury', 1950, 'Crime, Drama', 'Cy Endfield, Guy Roe, Ivan Volkman', 'Jo Pagano, Cy Endfield', 'Frank Lovejoy, Kathleen Ryan, Richard Carlson, Lloyd Bridges, Katherine Locke, Adele Jergens, Art Smith, Renzo Cesana', null, 'A family man – desperate for a job – latches onto a friend who encourages him into being a criminal.', 'A family man – desperate for a job – latches onto a friend who encourages him into being a criminal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wNaVQXctttdfOHPmHIHWzxu80rM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27543'),
  ('222809872976558602', 'The Sound of Insects: Record of a Mummy', 2009, 'Documentary', 'Peter Liechti, Matthias Kälin, Peter Liechti', 'Peter Liechti', 'Peter Mettler, Alexander Tschernek', null, 'The incredible story of how the mummified corpse of a 40-year-old man was discovered by a hunter in one of the most remote parts of the country. The dead man''s detailed notes reveal that he actually committed suicide through self-imposed starvation only the summer before. Liechti''s film is a stunning rapprochement of a fictional text, which itself is based upon a true event: a cinematic manifesto for life, challenged by the main character''s radical renunciation of life itself.', 'The incredible story of how the mummified corpse of a 40-year-old man was discovered by a hunter in one of the most remote parts of the country. The dead man''s detailed notes reveal that he actually committed suicide through self-imposed starvation only the summer before. Liechti''s film is a stunning rapprochement of a fictional text, which itself is based upon a true event: a cinematic manifesto for life, challenged by the main character''s radical renunciation of life itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jEzbSeVlQU5KmMTSCj0PwUkaSKJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55655'),
  ('614921124133390298', 'The Sound of Music Live!', 2013, 'TV Movie, Drama, Family, Music', 'Rob Ashford, Beth McCarthy-Miller, David Chase', null, 'Carrie Underwood, Stephen Moyer, Laura Benanti, Christian Borle, Audra McDonald, Ariane Rinehart, Michael Campayno, Sophia Anne Caruso', 'NR', 'The Sound of Music Live! is a television special that was originally broadcast by NBC on December 5, 2013. Produced by Craig Zadan and Neil Meron, the special was an adaptation of Rodgers and Hammerstein''s Broadway musical The Sound of Music, starring country singer Carrie Underwood as Maria von Trapp, performed and televised live from Grumman Studios in Bethpage, New York. Meron felt that if the telecast were successful, the concept could become "another kind of entertainment that can exist on TV." By her request, Underwood''s casting as Maria was personally endorsed by Julie Andrews, who starred in the 1965 film.', 'The Sound of Music Live! is a television special that was originally broadcast by NBC on December 5, 2013. Produced by Craig Zadan and Neil Meron, the special was an adaptation of Rodgers and Hammerstein''s Broadway musical The Sound of Music, starring country singer Carrie Underwood as Maria von Trapp, performed and televised live from Grumman Studios in Bethpage, New York. Meron felt that if the telecast were successful, the concept could become "another kind of entertainment that can exist on TV." By her request, Underwood''s casting as Maria was personally endorsed by Julie Andrews, who starred in the 1965 film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wEuX82vFWTzN4zHs5U20mv4pjj5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:231401'),
  ('907235731142958595', 'The Soup', 1981, 'Comedy', 'Sergio Citti, Dante Spinotti, Giancarlo Scarchilli', 'Sergio Citti, Vincenzo Cerami', 'Roberto Benigni, Ninetto Davoli, Franco Citti, Giorgio Gaber, Daria Nicolodi, Fabio Traversa, Francesca Rinaldi, Olimpia Carlisi', null, 'Two homeless men in Rome are arrested due to a misunderstanding. In jail, they meet a man who has been arrested for eating and running from restaurants. Together they embark on a series of escapades around Tuscany.', 'Two homeless men in Rome are arrested due to a misunderstanding. In jail, they meet a man who has been arrested for eating and running from restaurants. Together they embark on a series of escapades around Tuscany.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/enylEGKYiFYNc5Qv46pPh1H8lzx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162056'),
  ('663737328978704003', 'The Source', 1999, 'Documentary, History', 'Chuck Workman', 'Chuck Workman', 'Johnny Depp, Dennis Hopper, John Turturro, Allen Ginsberg, William S. Burroughs, Philip Glass, Robert Creeley, Ann Charters', null, 'Traces the Beats from Allen Ginsberg and Jack Kerouac''s meeting in 1944 at Columbia University to the deaths of Ginsberg and William S. Burroughs in 1997. Three actors provide dramatic interpretations of the work of these three writers, and the film chronicles their friendships, their arrival into American consciousness, their travels, frequent parodies, Kerouac''s death, and Ginsberg''s politicization. Their movement connects with bebop, John Cage''s music, abstract expressionism, and living theater. In recent interviews, Ginsberg, Burroughs, Kesey, Ferlinghetti, Mailer, Jerry Garcia, Tom Hayden, Gary Snyder, Ed Sanders, and others measure the Beats'' meaning and impact.', 'Traces the Beats from Allen Ginsberg and Jack Kerouac''s meeting in 1944 at Columbia University to the deaths of Ginsberg and William S. Burroughs in 1997. Three actors provide dramatic interpretations of the work of these three writers, and the film chronicles their friendships, their arrival into American consciousness, their travels, frequent parodies, Kerouac''s death, and Ginsberg''s politicization. Their movement connects with bebop, John Cage''s music, abstract expressionism, and living theater. In recent interviews, Ginsberg, Burroughs, Kesey, Ferlinghetti, Mailer, Jerry Garcia, Tom Hayden, Gary Snyder, Ed Sanders, and others measure the Beats'' meaning and impact.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cVWKNCnosCBfEmSDVNoxtrI8px0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51679'),
  ('351080153905070028', 'The Source', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Radu Mihăileanu, Glynn Speeckaert', 'Alain-Michel Blanc, Radu Mihăileanu', 'Leïla Bekhti, Hafsia Herzi, Biyouna, Sabrina Ouazani, Saleh Bakri, Hiam Abbass, Mohamed Majd, Amal El Atrache', null, 'A comedy/drama set in a village and centered on a battle of the sexes, where women threaten to withhold sexual favours as long as the men refuse to install a water pipe.', 'A comedy/drama set in a village and centered on a battle of the sexes, where women threaten to withhold sexual favours as long as the men refuse to install a water pipe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s6aeswUubPwVtWFnVcaClS6980q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56418'),
  ('382637167151206666', 'The Source of Shadows', 2020, 'Horror', 'Jennifer Bonior, James Bowsher, Zev Chevat', 'Gigi Saul Guerrero', 'Mathias Retamal, Kelly Vrooman, Janice Kingsley, Éliane Gagnon, Jenna Heffernan, Tom Bonington, Marissa Kaye, Andrew Leland Rogers', 'NR', 'This horror anthology film depicts ten tales of horror from twelve visionary directors as they take us on a journey to experience one of humanity’s most carnal fears; the fear of the unknown.', 'This horror anthology film depicts ten tales of horror from twelve visionary directors as they take us on a journey to experience one of humanity’s most carnal fears; the fear of the unknown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kzYtpIlEAMFLsRGNjZ3NYJVTqmJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:697953'),
  ('277658635237699374', 'The Source of Snakes', 1997, 'Romance, Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Sergey Astakhov, Nikolay Lebedev, Vladimir Kaplan', 'Nikolay Lebedev', 'Ekaterina Guseva, Olga Ostroumova, Evgeny Mironov, Sergey Makhovikov, Dmitriy Maryanov, Elena Anisimova, Lev Borisov, Mikhail Filippov', null, 'Provincial story, beautifully played out in the spirit of the sinister detective. Dina, the student of Pedagogical Institute, comes to the practice to the little town paralyzed with fear. A series of mysterious murders seemingly dissimilar girls forcing residents to think that it is a work of a maniac.', 'Provincial story, beautifully played out in the spirit of the sinister detective. Dina, the student of Pedagogical Institute, comes to the practice to the little town paralyzed with fear. A series of mysterious murders seemingly dissimilar girls forcing residents to think that it is a work of a maniac.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nxjspDh8hCFrpkICagXqaPnuBTm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:302684'),
  ('472345315474053940', 'The South', 1988, 'Drama, Music', 'Fernando E. Solanas, Gaspar Noé, Ana Poliak', 'Fernando E. Solanas', 'Miguel Ángel Solá, Philippe Léotard, Lito Cruz, Roberto Goyeneche, Ulises Dumont, Gabriela Toscano, Mario Lozano, Nathán Pinzón', null, 'After the end of the military dictatorship in Argentina in 1983, Floreal is released from prison. Instead of returning to his wife, he wanders through the night of Buenos Aires. He meets some people from his past–most of which are only imaginary–and remembers the events of his imprisonment.', 'After the end of the military dictatorship in Argentina in 1983, Floreal is released from prison. Instead of returning to his wife, he wanders through the night of Buenos Aires. He meets some people from his past–most of which are only imaginary–and remembers the events of his imprisonment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xyOeNv5YturVNqxBFQ5DQAKjp3E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46770'),
  ('597167908393416783', 'The Southern Star', 1969, 'Adventure', 'Sidney Hayers, Raoul Coutard', 'David Pursall, Jack Seddon', 'George Segal, Ursula Andress, Orson Welles, Ian Hendry, Johnny Sekka, Michel Constantin, Georges Géret, Sylvain Lévignac', 'PG', 'Comedy adventure based on a Jules Verne novel about the ups and downs of jewel thieves in the wilds of Africa circa 1900. George Segal is the appealing hero-heel and Ursula Andress is visually stunning as the lady in the proceedings. Orson Welles has a small role.', 'Comedy adventure based on a Jules Verne novel about the ups and downs of jewel thieves in the wilds of Africa circa 1900. George Segal is the appealing hero-heel and Ursula Andress is visually stunning as the lady in the proceedings. Orson Welles has a small role.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bodegCbUIlBB20TsufqSYVWUWfL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61862'),
  ('654377363259868361', 'The Southerner', 1945, 'Drama', 'Jean Renoir, Lucien N. Andriot, Robert Aldrich', 'Jean Renoir, Nunnally Johnson, William Faulkner', 'Zachary Scott, Betty Field, J. Carrol Naish, Beulah Bondi, Percy Kilbride, Charles Kemper, Blanche Yurka, Norman Lloyd', null, 'Sam Tucker, a cotton picker, in search of a better future for his family, decides to grow his own cotton crop. In the first year, the Tuckers battle disease, a flood, and a jealous neighbor. Can they make it as farmers?', 'Sam Tucker, a cotton picker, in search of a better future for his family, decides to grow his own cotton crop. In the first year, the Tuckers battle disease, a flood, and a jealous neighbor. Can they make it as farmers?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bCX8D1Zpk1SXCCYLIq5p5o1p5ly.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45219'),
  ('860242587522460637', 'The Souvenir', 2019, 'Romance, Drama', 'Hattie Gent, Luke Moran-Morris, Joanna Hogg', 'Joanna Hogg', 'Honor Swinton Byrne, Tom Burke, Tilda Swinton, Richard Ayoade, Ariane Labed, Jaygann Ayeh, Jack McMullen, Chyna Terrelonge Vaughan', 'R', 'A shy but ambitious film student falls into an intense, emotionally fraught relationship with a charismatic but untrustworthy older man.', 'A shy but ambitious film student falls into an intense, emotionally fraught relationship with a charismatic but untrustworthy older man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Nj04HsZ0lNkv07JnfBZ0bAIECn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:473019'),
  ('1028131680222873394', 'The Souvenir: Part II', 2021, 'Romance, Drama', 'David Raedeker, Byron Broadbent, Tony Boffey', 'Joanna Hogg', 'Honor Swinton Byrne, Tilda Swinton, Charlie Heaton, Jaygann Ayeh, Harris Dickinson, Richard Ayoade, Ariane Labed, Joe Alwyn', 'R', 'In the aftermath of her tumultuous relationship with a charismatic and manipulative older man, Julie begins to untangle her fraught love for him in making her graduation film, sorting fact from his elaborately constructed fiction.', 'In the aftermath of her tumultuous relationship with a charismatic and manipulative older man, Julie begins to untangle her fraught love for him in making her graduation film, sorting fact from his elaborately constructed fiction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fYNvmZ1vW7bNcUhrAzYjUBgKJWP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:473021'),
  ('236651177574885492', 'The Sovereign''s Servant', 2007, 'Action, Adventure, History', 'Dmitriy Yashonkov, Oleg Ryaskov, Aleksandr Abramov', 'Oleg Ryaskov', 'Dmitriy Miller, Aleksandr Bukharov, Kseniya Knyazeva, Aleksey Chadov, Nikolay Chindyaykin, Valeriy Malikov, Darya Semyonova, Andrey Sukhov', null, 'Europe, 1709. Russia and Sweden are at war. Two French duelists are exiled by King Louis XIV of France: one to the side of Czar Peter the Great of Russia, the other to the side of King Charles XII of Sweden. Although separated by war and allegiance, fate has not finished with them.', 'Europe, 1709. Russia and Sweden are at war. Two French duelists are exiled by King Louis XIV of France: one to the side of Czar Peter the Great of Russia, the other to the side of King Charles XII of Sweden. Although separated by war and allegiance, fate has not finished with them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3PyvVMdWXAbHrPQfovg4PF3Rsbp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19798'),
  ('1071250192787614322', 'The Soviet Story', 2008, 'Documentary, War, History', 'Edvīns Šņore, Edgars Daugavvanags-Vanags, Jānis Zaneribs', 'Edvīns Šņore', 'Jon Strickland, Vladimir Lenin, Alfred Rosenberg, Adolf Hitler, Joseph Goebbels, Hermann Göring, George Bernard Shaw, Mikhail Gorbachev', null, '“The Soviet Story” is a story of an Allied power, which helped the Nazis to fight Jews and which slaughtered its own people on an industrial scale. Assisted by the West, this power triumphed on May 9th, 1945. Its crimes were made taboo, and the complete story of Europe’s most murderous regime has never been told. Until now...', '“The Soviet Story” is a story of an Allied power, which helped the Nazis to fight Jews and which slaughtered its own people on an industrial scale. Assisted by the West, this power triumphed on May 9th, 1945. Its crimes were made taboo, and the complete story of Europe’s most murderous regime has never been told. Until now...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r7OyvtTQo710tNLNhX6io5al3ul.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31688'),
  ('198830802112904076', 'The Sow', 1992, 'Comedy', 'José Luis Cuerda, Hans Burmann, Sergio Francisco', 'José Luis Cuerda', 'Alfredo Landa, Antonio Resines, Agustín González, Manuel Alexandre, El Gran Wyoming, Cayetana Guillén Cuervo, Fernando Rey, Antonio Gamero', null, 'After spending three years in captivity in Tunis, Bartolomé returns home Extremadura with the only hope to eat his favorite dish: the pork. Along the way he meets a deserter who is traveling with a sow.', 'After spending three years in captivity in Tunis, Bartolomé returns home Extremadura with the only hope to eat his favorite dish: the pork. Along the way he meets a deserter who is traveling with a sow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/LYBZs6kIKoTpQBmGvOErawQVZq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75503'),
  ('1120621825777538449', 'The Sower', 2017, 'Drama', 'Alain Duplantier, Marine Francen', 'Jacques Fieschi, Marine Francen, Jacqueline Surchat', 'Pauline Burlet, Géraldine Pailhas, Alban Lenoir, Iliana Zabeth, Françoise Lebrun, Raphaëlle Agogué, Barbara Probst, Anamaria Vartolomei', null, 'In 1852, the mountain village in Provence where Violette lives is brutally deprived of all its men after the repression of the republicans ordered by Napoleon III. Women spend months in total isolation, desperate to see their men again. In this situation, they make an oath in case a man arrives in the village.', 'In 1852, the mountain village in Provence where Violette lives is brutally deprived of all its men after the repression of the republicans ordered by Napoleon III. Women spend months in total isolation, desperate to see their men again. In this situation, they make an oath in case a man arrives in the village.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kNBJRN1ksEGbYH7SMnviHu7vjJD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:467539'),
  ('248539946614640743', 'The Sower', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Melissa Elizondo Moreno, Natali Montell', 'Melissa Elizondo Moreno', 'Bartolomé Vázquez López, Roxana Hernández Pérez, Samuel Vázquez Méndez, Karina Gómez Pérez, Marcos Hernández Hernández, Maricela Hernández Pérez, Olivia Hernández Rodríguez, Esperanza Méndez Pérez', null, 'Bartolomé, a teacher in a multigrade school on the mountains of Chiapas in Mexico, knows well that pedagogy is not based on textbooks and cannot fit behind the four walls of a classroom. A true sower of knowledge unravels his philosophy and method and becomes a beacon of hope for the creation of a humanistic model of education based on curiosity and love for the outside world.', 'Bartolomé, a teacher in a multigrade school on the mountains of Chiapas in Mexico, knows well that pedagogy is not based on textbooks and cannot fit behind the four walls of a classroom. A true sower of knowledge unravels his philosophy and method and becomes a beacon of hope for the creation of a humanistic model of education based on curiosity and love for the outside world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q2t1mrDQim0POoACAJoVi12SSrM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:553788'),
  ('905645509097474949', 'The Space Between', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Rachel Winter, Matthew Irving, Heather I. Denton', 'Will Aldis', 'Kelsey Grammer, Jackson White, Julia Goldani Telles, Andy Daly, Paris Jackson, Glenn McCuen, Ashley Eskew, Andrew Kai', 'R', 'Micky Adams, an eccentric has-been rock musician, loses his grip on reality as his record label looks to drop him and his new "unique" albums. In hopes of breaking out of the mailroom, young Charlie Porter is tasked with traveling to the musician''s bizarre home and forcing Micky out of his contract. Micky realizes Charlie could be the key to an artistic breakthrough and the pair''s unlikely friendship grows. The odd but powerful bond helps both gain perspective on the music industry, life, love... and the space between.', 'Micky Adams, an eccentric has-been rock musician, loses his grip on reality as his record label looks to drop him and his new "unique" albums. In hopes of breaking out of the mailroom, young Charlie Porter is tasked with traveling to the musician''s bizarre home and forcing Micky out of his contract. Micky realizes Charlie could be the key to an artistic breakthrough and the pair''s unlikely friendship grows. The odd but powerful bond helps both gain perspective on the music industry, life, love... and the space between.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uJ1LnBCzcjWwoKDrm2niIdsf4iN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:536728'),
  ('1079669326824267652', 'The Space Between the Lines', 2019, 'Romance, Drama', 'Vanessa Jopp, Sten Mende', 'Jane Ainscough', 'Nora Tschirner, Alexander Fehling, Ulrich Thomsen, Ella Rumpf, Claudia Eisinger, Katharina Gieron, Eleonore Weisgerber, Yoran Leicher', null, 'Emmi would like to cancel her subscription to "Like" magazine via e-mail. But due to a typo, her messages land in Leo Leike’s inbox. When Emmi repeatedly sends mails to the wrong address, Leo decides to inform her of her mistake. This marks the beginning of an extraordinary e-mail exchange, which can only be held between two strangers. Treading the fine line between complete strangeness and noncommittal intimacy, the two are soon sharing their innermost secrets and longings – until they need to face the unavoidable question: Will their feelings, sent and received virtually, survive the test of a real-life encounter? And what will happen if they do?', 'Emmi would like to cancel her subscription to "Like" magazine via e-mail. But due to a typo, her messages land in Leo Leike’s inbox. When Emmi repeatedly sends mails to the wrong address, Leo decides to inform her of her mistake. This marks the beginning of an extraordinary e-mail exchange, which can only be held between two strangers. Treading the fine line between complete strangeness and noncommittal intimacy, the two are soon sharing their innermost secrets and longings – until they need to face the unavoidable question: Will their feelings, sent and received virtually, survive the test of a real-life encounter? And what will happen if they do?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rFOvOWiwkdMTKtKfYISfR8CeSjj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:611259'),
  ('338540058530920370', 'The Space Between Us', 2017, 'Romance, Adventure, Science Fiction, Drama', 'Peter Chelsom, Barry Peterson, Hans Bjerno', 'Allan Loeb', 'Asa Butterfield, Britt Robertson, Carla Gugino, Gary Oldman, Janet Montgomery, BD Wong, Trey Tucker, Scott Takeda', 'PG-13', 'A young man raised by scientists on Mars returns to Earth to find his father.', 'A young man raised by scientists on Mars returns to Earth to find his father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lRBl9mfvUbZeaAyXoP09XwPOo0W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:365942'),
  ('960670549535729592', 'The Space Children', 1958, 'Science Fiction', 'Jack Arnold, Ernest Laszlo', 'Bernard C. Schoenfeld', 'Michel Ray, Adam Williams, Peggy Webber, John Washbrook, Jackie Coogan, Richard Shannon, Raymond Bailey, Sandy Descher', null, 'A glowing brain-like creature arrives on a beach near a rocket test site via a teleportation beam. The alien communicates telepathically with the children of scientists. The kids start doing the alien''s bidding as the adults try to find out what''s happening to their unruly offspring.', 'A glowing brain-like creature arrives on a beach near a rocket test site via a teleportation beam. The alien communicates telepathically with the children of scientists. The kids start doing the alien''s bidding as the adults try to find out what''s happening to their unruly offspring.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7TXlrL4dygamb70MXhddYeFRXgV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115054'),
  ('470241142948519147', 'The Space in Between: Marina Abramović and Brazil', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Marco del Fiol, Cauê Ito, Gustavo Almeida', 'Fabiana Werneck Barcinski, Marco del Fiol, Marina Abramović', 'Marina Abramović', null, 'Marina Abramović travels through Brazil, in search of personal healing and artistic inspiration, experiencing sacred rituals and revealing her creative process. The route is comprised of poignant encounters with healers and sages from the Brazilian countryside, exploring the limits between art and spirituality. This external trip triggers in Marina a profound introspective journey through memories, pain and past experiences.', 'Marina Abramović travels through Brazil, in search of personal healing and artistic inspiration, experiencing sacred rituals and revealing her creative process. The route is comprised of poignant encounters with healers and sages from the Brazilian countryside, exploring the limits between art and spirituality. This external trip triggers in Marina a profound introspective journey through memories, pain and past experiences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/69mhllEHTfrtmcSvnBYLAhiQfwD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:381027'),
  ('431265135428611264', 'The Spacewalker', 2017, 'Adventure, Drama, History, Thriller', 'Dmitry Kiselev, Vladimir Bashta', 'Yuri Korotkov, Irina Pivovarova, Sergey Kaluzhanov', 'Evgeny Mironov, Konstantin Khabenskiy, Vladimir Ilin, Anatoliy Kotenyov, Aleksandra Ursulyak, Elena Panova, Aleksandr Ilyin Jr, Yuriy Itskov', 'PG', 'March 1965. In the heat of the Cold War, the USA and the USSR are competing for supremacy in space. What both superpowers aim for in this race, is to be the first to have a man walk in outer space. To accomplish that, no price is too high and no risk is too great. Now it’s up to the unlikely duo of a seasoned war veteran and a hot-headed test-pilot to fulfill this mission. Two men in a tiny spaceship, without proper testing, facing the complete unknown. They were supposed to do what no man has done before—and no man imagined what would happen next.', 'March 1965. In the heat of the Cold War, the USA and the USSR are competing for supremacy in space. What both superpowers aim for in this race, is to be the first to have a man walk in outer space. To accomplish that, no price is too high and no risk is too great. Now it’s up to the unlikely duo of a seasoned war veteran and a hot-headed test-pilot to fulfill this mission. Two men in a tiny spaceship, without proper testing, facing the complete unknown. They were supposed to do what no man has done before—and no man imagined what would happen next.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hDNVRmrprxI9NQ0zc2Uu03p65Fw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:440642'),
  ('222927286092493865', 'The Spaniard''s Curse', 1958, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Ralph Kemplen, Arthur Grant', 'Kenneth Hyde', 'Tony Wright, Lee Patterson, Michael Hordern, Susan Beaumont, Ralph Truman, Henry Oscar, Brian Oulton, Olga Dickie', null, 'A convicted murderer uses an ancient curse to take his revenge on those responsible for sending him to prison.', 'A convicted murderer uses an ancient curse to take his revenge on those responsible for sending him to prison.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vNOgWmD1a5XLVlD2ym1XhBPqwxS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:261264'),
  ('354353983595231403', 'The Spanish Apartment', 2002, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Cédric Klapisch, Dominique Colin, Ophélie Gelber', 'Cédric Klapisch', 'Romain Duris, Judith Godrèche, Audrey Tautou, Kelly Reilly, Cécile de France, Cristina Brondo, Federico D''Anna, Barnaby Metschurat', null, 'A strait-laced French student moves into an apartment in Barcelona with a cast of six other characters from all over Europe. Together, they speak the international language of love and friendship.', 'A strait-laced French student moves into an apartment in Barcelona with a cast of six other characters from all over Europe. Together, they speak the international language of love and friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/baDm4V3Dqx2hNh7WF1NvGrHGgqQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1555'),
  ('899608869569207827', 'The Spanish Cape Mystery', 1935, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Lewis D. Collins', 'Albert DeMond', 'Donald Cook, Helen Twelvetrees, Berton Churchill, Frank Sheridan, Harry Stubbs, Guy Usher, Huntley Gordon, Jack La Rue', null, 'Ellery Queen''s vacation is interrupted when murder strikes next door to his oceanside cabin.', 'Ellery Queen''s vacation is interrupted when murder strikes next door to his oceanside cabin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jV6xMPYsacuKQCOqadYl4FmBNq0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69702'),
  ('458952501200767448', 'The Spanish Earth', 1937, 'Documentary', 'Joris Ivens, John Fernhout', 'Prudencio de Pereda, John Dos Passos, Joris Ivens', 'Manuel Azaña, José Díaz, Dolores Ibárruri, Enrique Lister, Commander Martinez de Aragón, Gustav Regler, Orson Welles, Ernest Hemingway', null, 'Joris Ivens’s advocacy documentary for the Republican cause intercuts a besieged Madrid with a nearby village digging an irrigation canal, linking the war to bread, land, and survival. Produced by the writers’ collective Contemporary Historians, edited by Helen van Dongen, scored by Marc Blitzstein, and narrated in its U.S. version by Ernest Hemingway (after an initial Orson Welles track), it blends frontline reportage with persuasion against Franco’s forces and their German–Italian backers.', 'Joris Ivens’s advocacy documentary for the Republican cause intercuts a besieged Madrid with a nearby village digging an irrigation canal, linking the war to bread, land, and survival. Produced by the writers’ collective Contemporary Historians, edited by Helen van Dongen, scored by Marc Blitzstein, and narrated in its U.S. version by Ernest Hemingway (after an initial Orson Welles track), it blends frontline reportage with persuasion against Franco’s forces and their German–Italian backers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dufvAY4hxoBqAm2gWA27ijvdEBI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126783'),
  ('601309566964021643', 'The Spanish Gardener', 1956, 'Drama', 'Philip Leacock, Christopher Challis, Charles Hammond', 'John Bryan', 'Dirk Bogarde, Jon Whiteley, Michael Hordern, Cyril Cusack, Geoffrey Keen, Maureen Swanson, Lyndon Brook, Josephine Griffin', null, 'Harrington Brande, a British diplomat who recently broke up with his wife, is stationed in a small coastal town in Spain with his son, Nicholas. Harrington is unreasonably possessive of Nicholas and becomes jealous when he begins to form a close friendship with Jose, their gentle gardener.', 'Harrington Brande, a British diplomat who recently broke up with his wife, is stationed in a small coastal town in Spain with his son, Nicholas. Harrington is unreasonably possessive of Nicholas and becomes jealous when he begins to form a close friendship with Jose, their gentle gardener.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l2nSjUE2qqd2culSVUW1AM2ON8j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123354'),
  ('1045202058934831854', 'The Spanish Main', 1945, 'Adventure, Drama, Romance', 'Frank Borzage, George Barnes, Lew Borzage', 'George Worthing Yates, Herman J. Mankiewicz', 'Paul Henreid, Maureen O''Hara, Walter Slezak, Binnie Barnes, John Emery, Barton MacLane, J.M. Kerrigan, Fritz Leiber', 'NR', 'Laurent van Horn is the leader of a band of Dutch refugees on a ship seeking freedom in the Carolinas, when the ship is wrecked on the coast of Cartagene, governed by Don Juan Alvardo, a Spanish ruler. Alvarado has Laurent thrown in prison, but the latter escapes, and five-years later is a pirate leader. He poses as the navigator on a ship in which Contessa Francesca, daughter of a Mexican noble, is traveling on her way to marry Alvarado, whom she has never seen. Laurent''s pirates capture the ship and Francesca, in order to save another ship, gives her hand-in-marriage to Laurent, who sails her to the pirate hideout. This irks his jealous pirate comrades Anne Bonney and Captain Benjamin Black. They overpower Laurent and send Francesca to Alvarado, and then Mario du Billar, a trusted right-hand man, makes a deal to deliver Laurent to Alvarado.', 'Laurent van Horn is the leader of a band of Dutch refugees on a ship seeking freedom in the Carolinas, when the ship is wrecked on the coast of Cartagene, governed by Don Juan Alvardo, a Spanish ruler. Alvarado has Laurent thrown in prison, but the latter escapes, and five-years later is a pirate leader. He poses as the navigator on a ship in which Contessa Francesca, daughter of a Mexican noble, is traveling on her way to marry Alvarado, whom she has never seen. Laurent''s pirates capture the ship and Francesca, in order to save another ship, gives her hand-in-marriage to Laurent, who sails her to the pirate hideout. This irks his jealous pirate comrades Anne Bonney and Captain Benjamin Black. They overpower Laurent and send Francesca to Alvarado, and then Mario du Billar, a trusted right-hand man, makes a deal to deliver Laurent to Alvarado.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9I6sv8uaZQTnSX78Pqpp4bogv4n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97735'),
  ('647373850848120755', 'The Spanish Prisoner', 1997, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'David Mamet, Gabriel Beristain', 'David Mamet', 'Steve Martin, Campbell Scott, Ben Gazzara, Rebecca Pidgeon, Ricky Jay, Felicity Huffman, David Pittu, J.J. Johnston', 'PG', 'An inventor of a secret process suddenly finds himself alone as both his friends and the corporation he works for turn against him.', 'An inventor of a secret process suddenly finds himself alone as both his friends and the corporation he works for turn against him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cwkWlWfFrvH6WW6ovX5gfGHo7ks.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29193'),
  ('752653506874523093', 'The Sparks Brothers', 2021, 'Documentary, Music', 'Edgar Wright, Jake Polonsky', 'Edgar Wright', 'Ron Mael, Russell Mael, Beck, Gary Stewart, Mike Berns, Jane Wiedlin, Sal Maida, Christi Haydon', 'R', 'Take a musical odyssey through five weird and wonderful decades with brothers Ron & Russell Mael, celebrating the inspiring legacy of Sparks: your favorite band’s favorite band.', 'Take a musical odyssey through five weird and wonderful decades with brothers Ron & Russell Mael, celebrating the inspiring legacy of Sparks: your favorite band’s favorite band.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e8jtG3WS0Ku7Dh4fBne1rgriXZt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:776485'),
  ('864687893821046907', 'The Sparring Partner', 2022, 'Crime, Drama', 'Ho Cheuk-Tin, Joseph Leung Yau-Cheong, Adrian Leung Ho Fung', 'Frankie Tam Gong-Yuen, Oliver Yip, Thomas Leung Wing-ho', 'Yeung Wai-Lun, Mak Pui-Tung, Louisa So Yuk-Wah, Jan Lam Hoi-Fung, Michael Chow Man-Kin, Gloria Yip Wan-Yee, Chung Suet-ying, Harriet Yeung Sze-Man', null, 'Adapted from a sensational real-life case in 2013, the intricate story begins when a young man partners with his friend to murder and dismember his parents. Pleading not guilty, the defense attorneys soon turn on each other, as the defendants play the devil and idiot game. Meanwhile, heated debates emerge inside the jury room, where nine jurors grapple with the truth.', 'Adapted from a sensational real-life case in 2013, the intricate story begins when a young man partners with his friend to murder and dismember his parents. Pleading not guilty, the defense attorneys soon turn on each other, as the defendants play the devil and idiot game. Meanwhile, heated debates emerge inside the jury room, where nine jurors grapple with the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Jh0O3AwUK7zzzAvkGf9xRfmB76.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1005251'),
  ('445592260506038699', 'The Sparrow''s Fluttering', 1988, 'Drama, Romance', 'Gianfranco Mingozzi, Luigi Verga', 'Gianfranco Mingozzi, Tonino Guerra, Roberto Roversi', 'Philippe Noiret, Ornella Muti, Nicola Farron, Chiara Argelli, Sabrina Ferilli, Claudine Auger, Beppe Chierici, Claudio Del Falco', null, 'A woman, who has been the mistress of a man who has just died, thinks about leaving the little Italian village where they lived and moving to another place. An old and rich man offers her a place in his house, however, she will have to listen to him telling his past love stories.', 'A woman, who has been the mistress of a man who has just died, thinks about leaving the little Italian village where they lived and moving to another place. An old and rich man offers her a place in his house, however, she will have to listen to him telling his past love stories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Q5INiyhPf7QxCIcXFWF8QXLPuN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:200066'),
  ('929411938415988039', 'The Special', 2020, 'Horror, Comedy', 'B. Harrison Smith, Matt Nease', 'James Newman, Mark Steensland', 'Dave Sheridan, Sarah French, Davy Raphaely, Doug Henderson, Paul Cottman, Wayne Shearer, Tony Barber, Lisa Budwig', 'NR', 'Suspecting his wife of infidelity, Jerry is persuaded by his best friend to accompany him to a brothel to sample ‘The Special’, which proves to be a lifechanging experience in more ways than one. Because every pleasure has its price...', 'Suspecting his wife of infidelity, Jerry is persuaded by his best friend to accompany him to a brothel to sample ‘The Special’, which proves to be a lifechanging experience in more ways than one. Because every pleasure has its price...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kVRVgtgPDm9Wg6lVMpE4PGNs1V5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:728144'),
  ('332006087420260042', 'The Special Need', 2014, 'Documentary, Comedy', 'Carlo Zoratti', 'Cosimo Bizzarri, Carlo Zoratti', 'Alex Nazzi, Enea Gabino, Carlo Zoratti', null, '28 year old Enea is looking for love - physical love that is. But as the autist he is, living in Italy, this is anything but easy. So he and his best friends Carlo and Alex set out on a journey through Europe and eventually find a lot more than they are looking for.', '28 year old Enea is looking for love - physical love that is. But as the autist he is, living in Italy, this is anything but easy. So he and his best friends Carlo and Alex set out on a journey through Europe and eventually find a lot more than they are looking for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oPsQ7ozClC5xk3DLcxyfhoMyBE7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:215646'),
  ('367858440010422120', 'The Special Relationship', 2010, 'TV Movie, Drama, History', 'Richard Loncraine, Anthony Wilcox, Michael Elliott', 'Peter Morgan', 'Michael Sheen, Demetri Goritsas, Adam Godley, Marc Rioufol, Mark Bazeley, Helen McCrory, Nancy Crane, Dennis Quaid', 'NR', 'A dramatisation that follows Tony Blair''s journey from political understudy waiting in the wings of the world arena to accomplished prime minister standing confidently in the spotlight of centre stage. It is a story about relationships, between two powerful men (Blair and Bill Clinton), two powerful couples, and husbands and wives.', 'A dramatisation that follows Tony Blair''s journey from political understudy waiting in the wings of the world arena to accomplished prime minister standing confidently in the spotlight of centre stage. It is a story about relationships, between two powerful men (Blair and Bill Clinton), two powerful couples, and husbands and wives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4lTtWEWMWE0NCVkW1Ss9GRTFbLv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45371'),
  ('804927175620971761', 'The Specialist', 1994, 'Action, Thriller', 'Luis Llosa, Jeffrey L. Kimball, John Gallagher', 'Alexandra Seros', 'Sylvester Stallone, Sharon Stone, James Woods, Rod Steiger, Eric Roberts, Mario Ernesto Sánchez, Sergio Doré Jr., Chase Randolph', 'R', 'May Munro is a woman obsessed with getting revenge on the people who murdered her parents when she was still a girl. She hires Ray Quick, a retired explosives expert, to kill her parents'' killers. When Ned Trent, embittered ex-partner of Quick''s, is assigned to protect one of Quick''s potential victims, a deadly game of cat and mouse ensues.', 'May Munro is a woman obsessed with getting revenge on the people who murdered her parents when she was still a girl. She hires Ray Quick, a retired explosives expert, to kill her parents'' killers. When Ned Trent, embittered ex-partner of Quick''s, is assigned to protect one of Quick''s potential victims, a deadly game of cat and mouse ensues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9CVAjtkSaFs9FyddGfThj11ZuQq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2636'),
  ('854986834759821760', 'The Specialists', 1969, 'Western', 'Sergio Corbucci, Dario Di Palma', 'Sergio Corbucci, Sabatino Ciuffini', 'Johnny Hallyday, Sylvie Fennec, Mario Adorf, Françoise Fabian, Gastone Moschin, Serge Marquand, Remo De Angelis, Angela Luce', null, 'Hud Dixon returns to his hometown when his brother is killed by a lynch mob.', 'Hud Dixon returns to his hometown when his brother is killed by a lynch mob.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6vfaorXGPVHRFp025Ow2GZOEC5b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7507'),
  ('661756674876810576', 'The Specialists', 1985, 'Adventure, Crime', 'Patrice Leconte, Eduardo Serra', 'Patrice Leconte', 'Bernard Giraudeau, Gérard Lanvin, Christiane Jean, Maurice Barrier, Bertie Cortez, Daniel Jégou, Jacques Nolot, Patrick Massieu', null, 'While being transferred to another prison, two convicts - Stéphane Carella and Paul Brandon - effect a miraculous escape. They are pursued across the Verdon Gorge before arriving at an isolated farmhouse whose owner, Laura, offers them sanctuary. Since the death of her husband, Laura has longed to get her own back on the police and she agrees to help Carella and Brandon in their scheme to rob a casino in Nice. After a shoot out with the casino’s owners, Carella realises that not everything is what it seems. Brandon is not what he appears...', 'While being transferred to another prison, two convicts - Stéphane Carella and Paul Brandon - effect a miraculous escape. They are pursued across the Verdon Gorge before arriving at an isolated farmhouse whose owner, Laura, offers them sanctuary. Since the death of her husband, Laura has longed to get her own back on the police and she agrees to help Carella and Brandon in their scheme to rob a casino in Nice. After a shoot out with the casino’s owners, Carella realises that not everything is what it seems. Brandon is not what he appears...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cY2O270hCbwbPsBM9uiR5gpUXox.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12111'),
  ('422239441962189019', 'The Specials', 2000, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Science Fiction, Action', 'Craig Mazin, Eliot Rockett', 'James Gunn', 'Rob Lowe, Jamie Kennedy, Thomas Haden Church, Jordan Ladd, Mike Schwartz, Paget Brewster, Kelly Coffield Park, Sean Gunn', 'R', 'America''s seventh best superhero team, the Specials, are a group of geeks and oddballs. Lifelong fan Nightbird joins the group just in time for the group to get a new line of action figures. But the members'' extreme personalities and personal issues threaten to rip the group apart.', 'America''s seventh best superhero team, the Specials, are a group of geeks and oddballs. Lifelong fan Nightbird joins the group just in time for the group to get a new line of action figures. But the members'' extreme personalities and personal issues threaten to rip the group apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kCoifvSC6tUa7Ia4YClf4npqjQp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29015'),
  ('402411136124198590', 'The Speckled Band', 1931, 'Romance, Mystery, Crime, Drama', 'Jack Raymond, Freddie Young', null, 'Raymond Massey, Lyn Harding, Angela Baddeley, Athole Stewart, Nancy Price, Marie Ault', 'NR', 'After her sister dies under mysterious circumstances, a young heiress seeks Holmes'' help when she feels threatened by her brutish stepfather.', 'After her sister dies under mysterious circumstances, a young heiress seeks Holmes'' help when she feels threatened by her brutish stepfather.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k4joS5pipe2l1SZKcKaEFJLBtNu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48253'),
  ('377871927211891633', 'The Spectacular Now', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'James Ponsoldt, Jess Hall, Nicolas Harvard', 'Michael H. Weber, Scott Neustadter', 'Miles Teller, Shailene Woodley, Masam Holden, Kaitlyn Dever, Brie Larson, Kyle Chandler, Jennifer Jason Leigh, Mary Elizabeth Winstead', 'R', 'Sutter, a popular party animal, unexpectedly meets the introverted Aimee after waking up on a stranger''s lawn. As Sutter deals with the problems in his life and Aimee plans for her future beyond school, an unexpected romance blossoms between them.', 'Sutter, a popular party animal, unexpectedly meets the introverted Aimee after waking up on a stranger''s lawn. As Sutter deals with the problems in his life and Aimee plans for her future beyond school, an unexpected romance blossoms between them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/obDS8pTWVWZiNAaTyfIFWYZbRsZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:157386'),
  ('347212144201605739', 'The Spectator', 2004, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Paolo Franchi, Giuseppe Lanci, Marina Benedetto', 'Paolo Franchi, Diego Ribon, Rinaldo Rocco', 'Barbora Bobuľová, Andrea Renzi, Brigitte Catillon, Guido Zaccagnini, Chiara Picchi, Matteo Mussoni', null, 'Valeria is a passive onlooker to her own life in Turin, and she grows so obsessed with the activities of her neighbor Massimo that when he moves to Rome she decides to follow him. There she meets and unexpectedly befriends Massimo''s companion Flavia, and becomes enmeshed in both of their lives.', 'Valeria is a passive onlooker to her own life in Turin, and she grows so obsessed with the activities of her neighbor Massimo that when he moves to Rome she decides to follow him. There she meets and unexpectedly befriends Massimo''s companion Flavia, and becomes enmeshed in both of their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bYloJ4KV9j3EGvaVjHEv7131og5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58193'),
  ('336406962588686123', 'The Specter''s Road', 1967, 'Comedy, Horror, Mystery', 'Gilberto Martínez Solares, Raúl Martínez Solares', 'Roberto Gómez Bolaños', 'Gaspar Henaine, Marco Antonio Campos, Crox Alvarado, Consuelo Monteagudo, Mario García ''Harapos'', Arturo Ripstein, Nathanael León, Manuel Barrera Nápoli', null, 'A group of people, including Capulina and Viruta, head towards the city by train. A heavy storm interrupts their journey and now they must take a haunted path to reach they city. (English Subtitled)', 'A group of people, including Capulina and Viruta, head towards the city by train. A heavy storm interrupts their journey and now they must take a haunted path to reach they city. (English Subtitled)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y5aOdky72Rf20MRJWiZsEMvHAOx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:352848'),
  ('1135624481527619062', 'The Speech', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Laurent Tirard', 'Laurent Tirard', 'Benjamin Lavernhe, Sara Giraudeau, Kyan Khojandi, Julia Piaton, François Morel, Guilaine Londez, Sébastien Chassagne, Sarah Suco', null, 'Meet Adrien! He''s 35. He''s stuck in a mid-life crisis. He''s neurotic and hypochondriac. Tonight he''s stuck in an endless family dinner and his girlfriend is not answering his texts. On top of that, his dumb brother-in-law asks him to prepare a speech for his wedding. Could it get even worse?', 'Meet Adrien! He''s 35. He''s stuck in a mid-life crisis. He''s neurotic and hypochondriac. Tonight he''s stuck in an endless family dinner and his girlfriend is not answering his texts. On top of that, his dumb brother-in-law asks him to prepare a speech for his wedding. Could it get even worse?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i2G0QrM10xCkrJmzgky53DlNjn2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:712150'),
  ('976395824588707802', 'The Speed Cubers', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Ben Blennerhassett, Chris Olson, Sue Kim', null, 'Max Park, Feliks Zemdegs', null, 'This documentary captures the extraordinary twists and turns in the journeys of Rubik''s Cube-solving champions Max Park and Feliks Zemdegs.', 'This documentary captures the extraordinary twists and turns in the journeys of Rubik''s Cube-solving champions Max Park and Feliks Zemdegs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wuJmswUneNrlCUYpZ8NDU7FHjIG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:720748'),
  ('580369781534406391', 'The Spell', 1977, 'Horror, TV Movie', 'Lee Phillips, Joseph M. Ellis, Toby Lovallo', 'Brian Taggert', 'Lee Grant, Susan Myers, Lelia Goldoni, Helen Hunt, Jack Colvin, James Olson, James Greene, Wright King', 'NR', 'A distraught mother must cope with her embittered daughter who has the ability to cause "accidents" to happen.', 'A distraught mother must cope with her embittered daughter who has the ability to cause "accidents" to happen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qna3z275c272vG7eYLC3mj62S4x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67744'),
  ('141205195445733920', 'The Spellbound', 2019, 'Drama', 'Pierre Milon, Julien Hirsch, Pascal Bonitzer', 'Pascal Bonitzer, Agnès de Sacy', 'Sara Giraudeau, Nicolas Duvauchelle, Nicolas Maury, Anabel Lopez, Josiane Balasko, Iliana Lolic, Laurent Pedebernard, Jérôme Kircher', null, 'For the "story of the month," Coline, a contributor to a women''s magazine, is sent deep into the Pyrenees to interview Simon, a rather wild artist who claims his mother appeared to him at the precise moment she died. Coline is particularly intrigued since her beautiful neighbor Azar insists the same thing happened with her father! On the night they meet, Simon attempts to seduce Coline, who resists but falls in love...', 'For the "story of the month," Coline, a contributor to a women''s magazine, is sent deep into the Pyrenees to interview Simon, a rather wild artist who claims his mother appeared to him at the precise moment she died. Coline is particularly intrigued since her beautiful neighbor Azar insists the same thing happened with her father! On the night they meet, Simon attempts to seduce Coline, who resists but falls in love...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wXEMVpKcegzk5SR0QKE3JljlnIF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:633187'),
  ('1150596878178129351', 'The Spessart Inn', 1958, 'Comedy, Adventure, Music', 'Kurt Hoffmann, Richard Angst, Wolfgang Kühnlenz', 'Luiselotte Enderle, Curt Hanno Gutbrod, Heinz Pauck', 'Liselotte Pulver, Carlos Thompson, Günther Lüders, Rudolf Vogel, Hubert von Meyerinck, Herbert Hübner, Paul Esser, Ina Peters', null, 'Countess Franziska "is kidnapped" by a band of robbers. However, her father is not willing to pay the ransom so Franziska changes sides.', 'Countess Franziska "is kidnapped" by a band of robbers. However, her father is not willing to pay the ransom so Franziska changes sides.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k8VdtzO8nujAUxQ3iHVkm7dFHfn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6914'),
  ('278918939609869052', 'The Sphinx', 1933, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Phil Rosen, Gilbert Warrenton', 'Albert DeMond', 'Lionel Atwill, Sheila Terry, Theodore Newton, Paul Hurst, Luis Alberni, Robert Ellis, Lucien Prival, Lillian Leighton', 'NR', 'A man known to be a mute is suspected of committing a murder, as he was noticed at the scene. However, witnesses saw and heard him talking as he was leaving the scene of the crime. The police must determine if he is the actual killer or if he is being framed.', 'A man known to be a mute is suspected of committing a murder, as he was noticed at the scene. However, witnesses saw and heard him talking as he was leaving the scene of the crime. The police must determine if he is the actual killer or if he is being framed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c7Kwxh22IobVhBArYimWj138mFw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70787'),
  ('564701459028786160', 'The Spice of Life', 1948, 'Comedy', 'Jean Dréville, Jacques Garcia, Yves Ciampi', 'Noël-Noël', 'Noël-Noël, Bernard Blier, Marguerite Deval, Jean Tissier, Aline André, Henri Crémieux, Pierre Destailles, Paul Frankeur', null, 'A series of vignettes, in which Noel-Noel appears as the moderator, lecturer, commentator and leading actor, that examine the bores and pests of everyday life much like Pete Smith and Robert Benchley had done for years in American short subjects. Among those are the Practical Joker who will do anything for a laugh; the Party Entertainer who never stops singing; the Talkative Neigbor who forgets the time; the noisy neighbors who dance the tango all night; and women drivers, people who telephone at meal time, the friend you never saw before and amatuer medical experts. Much use of trick photography, montages, puppets and animation along with some adult Gallic wit and gentle satire.', 'A series of vignettes, in which Noel-Noel appears as the moderator, lecturer, commentator and leading actor, that examine the bores and pests of everyday life much like Pete Smith and Robert Benchley had done for years in American short subjects. Among those are the Practical Joker who will do anything for a laugh; the Party Entertainer who never stops singing; the Talkative Neigbor who forgets the time; the noisy neighbors who dance the tango all night; and women drivers, people who telephone at meal time, the friend you never saw before and amatuer medical experts. Much use of trick photography, montages, puppets and animation along with some adult Gallic wit and gentle satire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/slEkbEfgEbitwVXCksxR3coLKqc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:335762'),
  ('523090582764084901', 'The Spider', 1945, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Robert D. Webb, Glen MacWilliams', 'Scott Darling, Jo Eisinger', 'Richard Conte, Faye Marlowe, Kurt Kreuger, John Harvey, Martin Kosleck, Mantan Moreland, Walter Sande, Cara Williams', 'NR', 'An ex-cop is suspected of murder after he is found with a dead woman. The private detective is on the run -- attempting to prove his innocence.', 'An ex-cop is suspected of murder after he is found with a dead woman. The private detective is on the run -- attempting to prove his innocence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ewBPe9ny7nxAJTAwnmezepTS89e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43537'),
  ('515656541725470741', 'The Spider and the Butterfly', 1909, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'Georges Méliès', null, null, null, 'Surviving fragment of a longer film. A magician makes a butterfly woman appear, and a woman in a star. Exhausted, the magician falls asleep and the star woman turns into a spider, dragging the butterfly into her web.', 'Surviving fragment of a longer film. A magician makes a butterfly woman appear, and a woman in a star. Exhausted, the magician falls asleep and the star woman turns into a spider, dragging the butterfly into her web.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vMb2Ro7ZEtA6HAVLAOtDdlgb27r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130015'),
  ('929185486189815021', 'The Spider and the Fly', 1931, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Wilfred Jackson', null, null, 'NR', 'A kitchen is filled with houseflies. A spider wakes up and plays his web like a harp, attracting a pair of them; the female is trapped, and the male summons the cavalry, which arrives riding horseflies, riding dragonflies to drop pepper bombs, firing champagne bottles, and ultimately setting the web on fire and catching the spider on flypaper when he falls.', 'A kitchen is filled with houseflies. A spider wakes up and plays his web like a harp, attracting a pair of them; the female is trapped, and the male summons the cavalry, which arrives riding horseflies, riding dragonflies to drop pepper bombs, firing champagne bottles, and ultimately setting the web on fire and catching the spider on flypaper when he falls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dVk3IG854mrjAy7ParCoJ9iRGcG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67602'),
  ('1010128636284953444', 'The Spider Labyrinth', 1988, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Gianfranco Giagni, Sebastiano Celeste', 'Riccardo Aragno, Tonino Cervi, Cesare Frugoni', 'Roland Wybenga, Claudio Capone, Paola Rinaldi, Margareta von Krauss, Claudia Muzii, William Berger, Stéphane Audran, Vanna Busoni', null, 'A young professor travels to Budapest to locate a lost colleague. Once there, he gets tangled up in a supernatural mystery.', 'A young professor travels to Budapest to locate a lost colleague. Once there, he gets tangled up in a supernatural mystery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ogslEcLdm7eV60Nk1RcriwRsccd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104308'),
  ('926071810601131800', 'The Spider Within: A Spider-Verse Story', 2023, 'Animation, Drama', 'Jarelle Dampier', 'Khaila Amazan', 'Shameik Moore, Brian Tyree Henry', 'NR', 'After a particularly challenging day, Miles experiences a panic attack that forces him to confront the manifestations of his anxiety and learn that reaching out for help can be just as brave an act as protecting his city from evil.', 'After a particularly challenging day, Miles experiences a panic attack that forces him to confront the manifestations of his anxiety and learn that reaching out for help can be just as brave an act as protecting his city from evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2xlk27ZW2WI6Q77SLEmwhUpz190.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1106299'),
  ('744898973029737228', 'The Spider Woman', 1943, 'Mystery, Crime, Thriller', 'Roy William Neill, Charles Van Enger, Hans J. Salter', 'Bertram Millhauser', 'Basil Rathbone, Nigel Bruce, Gale Sondergaard, Dennis Hoey, Vernon Downing, Alec Craig, Arthur Hohl, Mary Gordon', 'NR', 'Sherlock Holmes investigates a series of so-called "pajama suicides". He knows the female villain behind them is as cunning as Moriarty and as venomous as a spider. Based on "The Sign of Four" and the short stories "The Dying Detective", "The Final Problem", "The Speckled Band" and "The Adventure of the Devil''s Foot".', 'Sherlock Holmes investigates a series of so-called "pajama suicides". He knows the female villain behind them is as cunning as Moriarty and as venomous as a spider. Based on "The Sign of Four" and the short stories "The Dying Detective", "The Final Problem", "The Speckled Band" and "The Adventure of the Devil''s Foot".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yTbwfGfrJ1opMAIrdltCCf3eRo2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2443'),
  ('33465916478219412', 'The Spider Woman Strikes Back', 1946, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Milton Rosen, Arthur Lubin, Fred Frank', 'Eric Taylor', 'Gale Sondergaard, Brenda Joyce, Kirby Grant, Rondo Hatton, Hobart Cavanaugh, Milburn Stone, Tom Daly, Norman Leavitt', 'NR', 'A young girl goes to work as a live-in caretaker for a spooky old woman. She doesn''t know that every night, the woman drains some blood from her to feed her strange plant.', 'A young girl goes to work as a live-in caretaker for a spooky old woman. She doesn''t know that every night, the woman drains some blood from her to feed her strange plant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qMIQro5j7DctGMoHqWdO3zudgyW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90016'),
  ('405723157429644113', 'The Spider''s Stratagem', 1970, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Bernardo Bertolucci, Vittorio Storaro, Giuseppe Bertolucci', 'Marilù Parolini, Bernardo Bertolucci, Eduardo de Gregorio', 'Giulio Brogi, Alida Valli, Pippo Campanini, Franco Giovanelli, Tino Scotti, Allen Midgette', null, 'A young man returns to his countryside hometown to investigate the unclear circumstances behind the death of his father, ostensibly killed by Fascists in 1936, before his birth. As he unravels a web of lies that seems to encompass the whole town, he finds himself entangled in the same web.', 'A young man returns to his countryside hometown to investigate the unclear circumstances behind the death of his father, ostensibly killed by Fascists in 1936, before his birth. As he unravels a web of lies that seems to encompass the whole town, he finds himself entangled in the same web.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z8IK3qwu3pscCFsIK6Wkbn4boq3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42595'),
  ('698797750500604394', 'The Spider''s Web', 1960, 'Mystery, Comedy', 'Godfrey Grayson, James Wilson, Peter Russell', 'Albert G. Miller, Eldon Howard', 'Glynis Johns, John Justin, Jack Hulbert, Cicely Courtneidge, Ronald Howard, David Nixon, Wendy Turner, Basil Dignam', null, 'Mystery film based on an Agatha Christie play. An ambassador''s wife must hide the corpse of her stepdaughter''s unlikeable stepfather from her husband, who is bringing important visitors to their country home.', 'Mystery film based on an Agatha Christie play. An ambassador''s wife must hide the corpse of her stepdaughter''s unlikeable stepfather from her husband, who is bringing important visitors to their country home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sHM8Zqwqe0MyHmj0tx8M8d0Aqa4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151606'),
  ('326779991313941833', 'The Spiders: Part 1 - The Golden Sea', 1919, 'Adventure, Crime', 'Karl Freund, Emil Schünemann, Fritz Lang', 'Fritz Lang', 'Carl de Vogt, Ressel Orla, Georg John, Lil Dagover, Rudolf Lettinger, Edgar Pauly, Paul Morgan, Meinhart Maur', null, 'In San Francisco, well-known sportsman Kay Hoog announces to a club that he has found a message in a bottle with a map drawn by a Harvard professor who has gone missing. The map tells of a lost Incan civilization that possesses an immense treasure. Hoog immediately plans an expedition to find it. But Lio Sha, the head of a criminal organization known as the Spiders, is determined to get the treasure for herself and plans a rival expedition.', 'In San Francisco, well-known sportsman Kay Hoog announces to a club that he has found a message in a bottle with a map drawn by a Harvard professor who has gone missing. The map tells of a lost Incan civilization that possesses an immense treasure. Hoog immediately plans an expedition to find it. But Lio Sha, the head of a criminal organization known as the Spiders, is determined to get the treasure for herself and plans a rival expedition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9QNyYzPy20gNOn1k3XkIr3op7xm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91893'),
  ('1014718018628612311', 'The Spiders: Part 2 - The Diamond Ship', 1920, 'Adventure, Crime', 'Fritz Lang, Karl Freund', 'Fritz Lang', 'Carl de Vogt, Ressel Orla, Georg John, Friedrich Kühne, Rudolf Lettinger, Thea Zander, Reiner Steiner, Edgar Pauly', null, 'When we last saw Kay Hoog (millionaire adventurer, courageous hunk), he’d been beset with tragedy. Having escaped an ancient Incan city by the skin of his gleaming teeth, Hoog looked forward to a few years of settled life with his (amicably) captured Incan lovely, Naela. But the past struck quickly. Hoog’s arch-nemesis, the homicidal femme Lio Sha, murdered Naela on the very grounds of Hoog’s estate, prompting him to swear revenge upon her and her criminal organization, the Spiders. Now he must find them, as the Spiders continue their global quest for the Buddha-head Diamond. The head, it’s said, has the power to restore Asia to world dominance.', 'When we last saw Kay Hoog (millionaire adventurer, courageous hunk), he’d been beset with tragedy. Having escaped an ancient Incan city by the skin of his gleaming teeth, Hoog looked forward to a few years of settled life with his (amicably) captured Incan lovely, Naela. But the past struck quickly. Hoog’s arch-nemesis, the homicidal femme Lio Sha, murdered Naela on the very grounds of Hoog’s estate, prompting him to swear revenge upon her and her criminal organization, the Spiders. Now he must find them, as the Spiders continue their global quest for the Buddha-head Diamond. The head, it’s said, has the power to restore Asia to world dominance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d8ITbno8Sa6prOoHYzrOAtL9gga.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92332'),
  ('1012794225761291096', 'The Spiderwick Chronicles', 2008, 'Family, Adventure, Fantasy, Drama', 'Mark Waters, Caleb Deschanel, Isabelle Guay', 'Karey Kirkpatrick, David Berenbaum, John Sayles', 'Freddie Highmore, Sarah Bolger, David Strathairn, Mary-Louise Parker, Nick Nolte, Joan Plowright, Andrew McCarthy, Seth Rogen', 'PG', 'Upon moving into the run-down Spiderwick Estate with their mother, twin brothers Jared and Simon Grace, along with their sister Mallory, find themselves pulled into an alternate world full of faeries and other creatures.', 'Upon moving into the run-down Spiderwick Estate with their mother, twin brothers Jared and Simon Grace, along with their sister Mallory, find themselves pulled into an alternate world full of faeries and other creatures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uN7MUMaCXfa8DbMMp61A8iXEcEG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8204'),
  ('483789579758337543', 'The Spies', 1957, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Henri-Georges Clouzot, Christian Matras', 'Henri-Georges Clouzot, Jérôme Géronimi', 'Curd Jürgens, Peter Ustinov, O.E. Hasse, Sam Jaffe, Paul Carpenter, Véra Clouzot, Martita Hunt, Gérard Séty', null, 'A doctor at a run-down psychiatric hospital is offered a large sum of money to shelter a new patient. Soon the place is full of suspicious and secretive characters, all apparently international secret agents trying to find out who and what the patient is.', 'A doctor at a run-down psychiatric hospital is offered a large sum of money to shelter a new patient. Soon the place is full of suspicious and secretive characters, all apparently international secret agents trying to find out who and what the patient is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/stGXgP9dlE6URa0Otx3jcL8BliP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80176'),
  ('736548533986758826', 'The Spies', 2012, 'Drama, Action, Comedy', 'Woo Min-ho, Kim Hak-su, Lee Jae-hyuk', 'Woo Min-ho', 'Kim Myung-min, Yum Jung-ah, Jung Gyu-woon, Yoo Hai-jin, Jeong Man-sik, Cheon Bo-geun, Byun Hee-bong, Oh Na-ra', null, 'Kim, a North Korean spy, lives in South Korea for 22 years and is contacted unexpectedly by his superior. His team plans to complete an earlier mission and steal the target''s large stockpile of cash.', 'Kim, a North Korean spy, lives in South Korea for 22 years and is contacted unexpectedly by his superior. His team plans to complete an earlier mission and steal the target''s large stockpile of cash.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gIKmeZRapp9S9C5pkZq79uvQKcE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133983'),
  ('509873036422407564', 'The Spikes Gang', 1974, 'Western, Action', 'Richard Fleischer, Brian West', 'Irving Ravetch, Harriet Frank Jr.', 'Lee Marvin, Gary Grimes, Ron Howard, Charles Martin Smith, Arthur Hunnicutt, Noah Beery Jr., Marc Smith, Don Fellows', 'PG', 'Three teenage farm boys stumble upon Harry Spikes, a local bandit wounded in a gun battle. While Harry is recuperating, he regales the young men with stories of his exciting past. The adventurous tales inspire them to start a gang of their own. Failing at their first attempt to rob a bank, the boys convince the gruff Spikes to teach them the ways of the desperado.', 'Three teenage farm boys stumble upon Harry Spikes, a local bandit wounded in a gun battle. While Harry is recuperating, he regales the young men with stories of his exciting past. The adventurous tales inspire them to start a gang of their own. Failing at their first attempt to rob a bank, the boys convince the gruff Spikes to teach them the ways of the desperado.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sLUSBzsNSVcV2uMZdEjA8xaU3dP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38152'),
  ('334311293635007363', 'The Spine of Night', 2021, 'Animation, Fantasy, Action, Horror', 'Morgan Galen King, Philip Gelatt, Morgan Galen King', 'Morgan Galen King, Philip Gelatt', 'Richard E. Grant, Lucy Lawless, Patton Oswalt, Betty Gabriel, Joe Manganiello, Larry Fessenden, Malcolm Mills, Jordan Douglas Smith', 'NR', 'When ancient dark magic falls into sinister hands and unleashes ages of suffering onto mankind, a group of heroes from different eras and cultures must band together in order to defeat it at all costs.', 'When ancient dark magic falls into sinister hands and unleashes ages of suffering onto mankind, a group of heroes from different eras and cultures must band together in order to defeat it at all costs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9uERhKRCtgDztLsx5Pg36j61rqC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:795522'),
  ('181395016308359357', 'The Spiral', 1978, 'Drama', 'Krzysztof Zanussi, Edward Kłosiński', 'Krzysztof Zanussi', 'Jan Nowicki, Maja Komorowska, Zofia Kucówna, Aleksander Bardini, Jan Świderski, Seweryna Broniszówna, Piotr Garlicki, Marian Glinka', null, 'In what appears to be an inexplicable incident, a man drives up to a resort hotel in midwinter, throws away his car keys, enters, and proceeds to agitate everyone he meets with his urgency -- a message he is somehow unable to communicate. Then he leaves, disappearing in the snow. Later, the people he appeared to have upset have gathered to search for him and find him frostbitten, but alive. Visiting him at the sanatorium to which he has been taken, they gradually discover what was really happening.', 'In what appears to be an inexplicable incident, a man drives up to a resort hotel in midwinter, throws away his car keys, enters, and proceeds to agitate everyone he meets with his urgency -- a message he is somehow unable to communicate. Then he leaves, disappearing in the snow. Later, the people he appeared to have upset have gathered to search for him and find him frostbitten, but alive. Visiting him at the sanatorium to which he has been taken, they gradually discover what was really happening.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hIPRcNTHxum1c2RaByg3NHSRI89.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198515'),
  ('732963302192048771', 'The Spiral', 1998, 'Fantasy, Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Makoto Watanabe, George Iida', null, 'Koichi Sato, Miki Nakatani, Hinako Saeki, Shingo Tsurumi, Shigemitsu Ogi, Yutaka Matsushige, Daisuke Ban, Naoaki Manabe', 'NR', 'A young pathologist seeks answers to the mysterious death of a friend and soon comes into contact with the same cursed videotape that caused the death of the friend''s wife and son, which is haunted by the curse of Sadako, a relentless spirit.', 'A young pathologist seeks answers to the mysterious death of a friend and soon comes into contact with the same cursed videotape that caused the death of the friend''s wife and son, which is haunted by the curse of Sadako, a relentless spirit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rusooZ8fDGD48QaP3u4PAYygi7r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9706'),
