  ('1004297748311827649', 'The Spring Festival', 1991, 'Drama', 'Huang Jian-Zhong, Yue Jiang', 'Jiang Yi', 'Zhao Lirong, Ge You, Ding Jiali, Liang Tian, Li Baotian, Zhang Jinlai, Shi Lanya, Shen Junyi', null, 'A story of a family''s dilemma between different family member especially between 2 generations which erupted on “chu xi” (the day before the first day in Chinese lunar year).', 'A story of a family''s dilemma between different family member especially between 2 generations which erupted on “chu xi” (the day before the first day in Chinese lunar year).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pbCJ1RtD1w9dMeRS9g2Cz66vsFW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:341564'),
  ('747815714456144763', 'The Spring Outside the Fence', 1985, 'Drama', 'Li Youning', 'Li Youning', 'Su Ming-ming, Cherie Chung Cho-Hung, Kris Phillips, Lin Ruiyang, Li Feng, Hsiao Hou Tao, Chen Hui-Lou, Hsueh Han', null, 'The rebellious and free-spirited Li Lin and the introverted Wu Ai-hua are best friends who grow up together in the military dependents'' village. However, they both fall in love with pilot He Kang, their mutual childhood friend. After He Kang is killed in a crash, the village only reminds the heartbroken girls of the tragedy. They escape to Taipei and work as hostess and accountant, earning a living from American soldiers on leave from Vietnam. The girls reunite with Michael, an American flight instructor, at the club. Michael ardently pursues Li Lin, but struggling to forget He Kang, Li Lin rejects Michael'' s proposal. Having taken different paths, the two girls eventually return to their childhood village, reminiscing about the bonds of the past.', 'The rebellious and free-spirited Li Lin and the introverted Wu Ai-hua are best friends who grow up together in the military dependents'' village. However, they both fall in love with pilot He Kang, their mutual childhood friend. After He Kang is killed in a crash, the village only reminds the heartbroken girls of the tragedy. They escape to Taipei and work as hostess and accountant, earning a living from American soldiers on leave from Vietnam. The girls reunite with Michael, an American flight instructor, at the club. Michael ardently pursues Li Lin, but struggling to forget He Kang, Li Lin rejects Michael'' s proposal. Having taken different paths, the two girls eventually return to their childhood village, reminiscing about the bonds of the past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dVTCpfSTBiPZKYRIit9QEW4YBpW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:625119'),
  ('759482760102885866', 'The Spring River Flows East', 1947, 'Drama', 'Chusheng Cai, Zheng Jun-li, Shen Xilin', 'Chusheng Cai, Zheng Jun-li', 'Yang Bai, Tao Jin, Wu Yin, Shangguan Yunzhu, Shu Xiuwen, Boxun Zhou, Gongshang Yan, Xia Tian', null, '1930''s China. The village of a poor family is taken over by the occupying Japanese army. One son, Zhongliang, leaves his wife and young son to join a medic group for the Chinese Army. The other son, Zhangmin goes into hiding to protect his family. The focus shifts back and forth from the brothers'' parents and Zhongliang''s wife and son to Zhongliang''s newfound life of luxury in a town not too far away. The plight of Zhongliang''s mother, his wife, Sufan and her son, Kongeson is contrasted with Zhongliang''s rise in a flourishing company.', '1930''s China. The village of a poor family is taken over by the occupying Japanese army. One son, Zhongliang, leaves his wife and young son to join a medic group for the Chinese Army. The other son, Zhangmin goes into hiding to protect his family. The focus shifts back and forth from the brothers'' parents and Zhongliang''s wife and son to Zhongliang''s newfound life of luxury in a town not too far away. The plight of Zhongliang''s mother, his wife, Sufan and her son, Kongeson is contrasted with Zhongliang''s rise in a flourishing company.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eipL0o8w2skC6uO9XRgGUJj2ZG3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:140260'),
  ('1128745513208172686', 'The Sprinkler Sprinkled', 1895, 'Comedy', 'Louis Lumière', null, 'François Clerc, Benoît Duval', null, 'A gardener is watering his flowers, when a mischievous boy sneaks up behind his back, and puts a foot on the water hose. The gardener is surprised and looks into the nozzle to find out why the water has stopped coming. The boy then lifts his foot from the hose, whereby the water squirts up in the gardener''s face. The gardener chases the boy, grips his ear and slaps him in his buttocks. The boy then runs away and the gardener continues his watering. Three separate versions of this film exist, this is the original, filmed by Louis Lumière.', 'A gardener is watering his flowers, when a mischievous boy sneaks up behind his back, and puts a foot on the water hose. The gardener is surprised and looks into the nozzle to find out why the water has stopped coming. The boy then lifts his foot from the hose, whereby the water squirts up in the gardener''s face. The gardener chases the boy, grips his ear and slaps him in his buttocks. The boy then runs away and the gardener continues his watering. Three separate versions of this film exist, this is the original, filmed by Louis Lumière.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rSZghvrFWTGqi4UecyG9jimzpEO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82120'),
  ('354562338843330000', 'The Spy', 2019, 'Thriller, Drama, History', 'Anton Mertens, Jens Jonsson', 'Harald Rosenløw-Eeg, Jan Trygve Røyneland', 'Ingrid Bolsø Berdal, Rolf Lassgård, Alexander Scheer, Damien Chapelle, Edvin Endre, Anders T. Andersen, Erik Hivju, Ingrid Vollan', null, 'Sonja Wigert, Scandinavia''s most acclaimed female movie star, enlists as a spy for Swedish intelligence but ends up becoming entangled with the German Reichskommissar Terboven.', 'Sonja Wigert, Scandinavia''s most acclaimed female movie star, enlists as a spy for Swedish intelligence but ends up becoming entangled with the German Reichskommissar Terboven.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cJdrqRggDs6t5iKTsmg7XwViWE0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:616558'),
  ('174689341517234343', 'The Spy Gone North', 2018, 'Drama, History, Thriller', 'You Seok-moon, Yoon Jong-bin, Choi Chan-min', 'Yoon Jong-bin, Kwon Sung-hui', 'Hwang Jung-min, Lee Sung-min, Cho Jin-woong, Ju Ji-hoon, Jeong So-ri, Kim Hong-pa, Ki Joo-bong, Kim Eung-soo', 'PG-13', 'South Korea, 1993. An agent of the National Intelligence Service is sent to Beijing to infiltrate a group of North Korean officials with the ultimate goal of obtaining information about their nuclear program.', 'South Korea, 1993. An agent of the National Intelligence Service is sent to Beijing to infiltrate a group of North Korean officials with the ultimate goal of obtaining information about their nuclear program.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ib7SNOKqPKLyVXTjhuVJIglTC3E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:517991'),
  ('745220732905866917', 'The Spy in Black', 1939, 'War, Thriller', 'Michael Powell, Bernard Browne, Patrick Jennings', 'Roland Pertwee', 'Conrad Veidt, Sebastian Shaw, Valerie Hobson, Marius Goring, June Duprez, Athole Stewart, Agnes Lauchlan, Helen Haye', 'NR', 'A German submarine is sent to the Orkney Isles in 1917 to sink the British fleet.', 'A German submarine is sent to the Orkney Isles in 1917 to sink the British fleet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ukPn5dtccNT29wMfwpMdz0P5rY6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75363'),
  ('693862504302334423', 'The Spy in the Green Hat', 1967, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'Joseph Sargent, Robert Webb, Eddie Saeta', 'Peter Allan Fields', 'Robert Vaughn, David McCallum, Jack Palance, Janet Leigh, Eduardo Ciannelli, Allen Jenkins, Jack La Rue, Leo G. Carroll', null, '"Spy in the Green Hat, The (1966)" on the other hand, is both exciting AND funny. Especially the scene where Napoleon Solo (Robert Vaughn) hides from THRUSH agents under a young woman''s (the incredibly cute Letícia Román) bed and is caught by the woman''s grandmother (Penny Santon), who is forcing Solo to marry the young woman. He successfully escapes, but is hunted by a legion of stereotyped Italian gangsters. Now that''s comedy.', '"Spy in the Green Hat, The (1966)" on the other hand, is both exciting AND funny. Especially the scene where Napoleon Solo (Robert Vaughn) hides from THRUSH agents under a young woman''s (the incredibly cute Letícia Román) bed and is caught by the woman''s grandmother (Penny Santon), who is forcing Solo to marry the young woman. He successfully escapes, but is hunted by a legion of stereotyped Italian gangsters. Now that''s comedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kjQ5fpCL2TIapNHqLVWozsH5y0S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113582'),
  ('335110134617228439', 'The Spy Next Door', 2010, 'Action, Comedy, Family', 'Brian Levant, Dean Cundey', 'James Greer, Jonathan Bernstein, Gregory Poirier', 'Jackie Chan, Amber Valletta, Madeline Carroll, Will Shadley, Alina Foley, Magnús Scheving, Billy Ray Cyrus, George López', 'PG', 'Former CIA spy Bob Ho takes on his toughest assignment to date: looking after his girlfriend''s three kids, who haven''t exactly warmed to their mom''s beau. And when one of the youngsters accidentally downloads a top-secret formula, Bob''s longtime nemesis, a Russian terrorist, pays a visit to the family.', 'Former CIA spy Bob Ho takes on his toughest assignment to date: looking after his girlfriend''s three kids, who haven''t exactly warmed to their mom''s beau. And when one of the youngsters accidentally downloads a top-secret formula, Bob''s longtime nemesis, a Russian terrorist, pays a visit to the family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nJJrceb2xHGIA0irADX0JvWSIHT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23172'),
  ('873646937814014004', 'The Spy Who Came In from the Cold', 1965, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Martin Ritt, Oswald Morris, Colin M. Brewer', 'Paul Dehn, Guy Trosper', 'Richard Burton, Claire Bloom, Oskar Werner, Sam Wanamaker, George Voskovec, Rupert Davies, Cyril Cusack, Peter van Eyck', null, 'British agent Alec Leamas refuses to come in from the Cold War during the 1960s, choosing to face another mission, which may prove to be his final one.', 'British agent Alec Leamas refuses to come in from the Cold War during the 1960s, choosing to face another mission, which may prove to be his final one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lN3PWv6cW22mqXDcgGZgK1Aa2gh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13580'),
  ('740750435443342935', 'The Spy Who Dumped Me', 2018, 'Comedy, Action, Adventure', 'Gary Powell, Deanna Stadler, Artist W. Robinson', 'Susanna Fogel, David Iserson', 'Mila Kunis, Kate McKinnon, Justin Theroux, Sam Heughan, Lolly Adefope, Dustin Demri-Burns, Hasan Minhaj, Mirjam Novak', 'R', 'A couple of thirtysomething best friends unwittingly become entangled in an international conspiracy when one’s ex-boyfriend shows up at their apartment with a team of deadly assassins on his trail.', 'A couple of thirtysomething best friends unwittingly become entangled in an international conspiracy when one’s ex-boyfriend shows up at their apartment with a team of deadly assassins on his trail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/szEKivKPOdRyogROoQIldwbMl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:454992'),
  ('770929856924084009', 'The Spy Who Loved Me', 1977, 'Adventure, Action, Thriller', 'Claude Renoir, Lewis Gilbert, John Glen', 'Christopher Wood, Richard Maibaum', 'Roger Moore, Barbara Bach, Curd Jürgens, Richard Kiel, Caroline Munro, Walter Gotell, Geoffrey Keen, Bernard Lee', 'PG', 'Russian and British submarines with nuclear missiles on board both vanish from sight without a trace. England and Russia both blame each other as James Bond tries to solve the riddle of the disappearing ships. But the KGB also has an agent on the case.', 'Russian and British submarines with nuclear missiles on board both vanish from sight without a trace. England and Russia both blame each other as James Bond tries to solve the riddle of the disappearing ships. But the KGB also has an agent on the case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ZxHKFxMYvAko680DsRgAZKWcLi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:691'),
  ('639324266065141651', 'The Spy with My Face', 1965, 'Adventure', 'John Newland, Fred J. Koenekamp', 'Clyde Ware, Joseph Calvelli', 'Robert Vaughn, David McCallum, Senta Berger, Leo G. Carroll, Michael A. Evans, Sharon Farrell, Fabrizio Mioni, Donald Harron', null, 'Napoleon Solo is captured by Thrush and replaced with a double.', 'Napoleon Solo is captured by Thrush and replaced with a double.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/FKbOjbLeyW1IBxT6ROQO4smk3c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26344'),
  ('201885125505831284', 'The Spy: Undercover Operation', 2013, 'Action, Comedy', 'Lee Seung-jun, Choi Jin-woong, Kim Seung-gyu', 'JK Youn, Park Soo-jin', 'Sul Kyung-gu, Moon So-ri, Daniel Henney, Han Ye-ri, Ra Mi-ran, Song Jae-ho, Ko Chang-seok, Kim So-jin', null, 'Chul-soo is one of Korea’s best intelligence agents: he can accomplish any given mission. One day, a mysterious explosion takes place in Seoul. Chul-soo flies to Thailand on a mission to rescue a person who holds clues to the incident. Meanwhile, Young-hee goes on a business trip to Thailand and gets entangled with Chul-soo’s mission. Will he accomplish his mission and save his wife at the same time?', 'Chul-soo is one of Korea’s best intelligence agents: he can accomplish any given mission. One day, a mysterious explosion takes place in Seoul. Chul-soo flies to Thailand on a mission to rescue a person who holds clues to the incident. Meanwhile, Young-hee goes on a business trip to Thailand and gets entangled with Chul-soo’s mission. Will he accomplish his mission and save his wife at the same time?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tZf0CO7WD9X7Gxirmc52VMJUCct.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:221518'),
  ('14854689905934296', 'The Squad', 2011, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Jaime Osorio Márquez, Alejandro Moreno', 'Diego Vivanco, Jaime Osorio Márquez, Tania Cárdenas Paulsen', 'Juan David Restrepo, Mateo Stevel, Mauricio Navas, Andrés Castañeda, Julio César Valencia, Juan Pablo Barragán, Daniela Catz, Andres Torres', null, 'The air is thick with tension as a military squad proceeds to the foot of a mountain base, where they''re ordered to wait for backup and hold their position. The mountain is shrouded in fog and the men are exhausted. They''ve been fighting guerrillas on enemy turf for some time, and they''re worn down by the stress and anxiety of battle. The men don''t want to wait; they want to charge up the hill, fearing that their comrades in the base have been overrun by the guerrillas. The squad''s leader tries futilely to keep his men in line while dealing with his insolent second-in-command.', 'The air is thick with tension as a military squad proceeds to the foot of a mountain base, where they''re ordered to wait for backup and hold their position. The mountain is shrouded in fog and the men are exhausted. They''ve been fighting guerrillas on enemy turf for some time, and they''re worn down by the stress and anxiety of battle. The men don''t want to wait; they want to charge up the hill, fearing that their comrades in the base have been overrun by the guerrillas. The squad''s leader tries futilely to keep his men in line while dealing with his insolent second-in-command.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dshRGSHMsUxGeh1TPtkcJHkfOfs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83705'),
  ('821936854689024872', 'The Squad: Home Run', 2023, 'Action, Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Benjamin Rocher, Maxime Cointe, Mathis Dujardin', 'François Loubeyre, Bertrand Soulier, Benjamin Rocher', 'Alban Lenoir, Jean Reno, Sofia Essaïdi, Stéfi Celma, Cassiopée Mayance, Sébastien Lalanne, Jean-Toussaint Bernard, Oumar Diaw', null, 'Former Antigang legend Niels Cartier, known for his muscular and unconventional methods, left the force following an intervention that went wrong and led to the death of his wife. When the gang of bank robbers responsible for her death reappears eight years later, Niels won''t let anyone stand in his way to seek revenge. Even if it means forming an explosive duo with his temperamental 14-year-old daughter.', 'Former Antigang legend Niels Cartier, known for his muscular and unconventional methods, left the force following an intervention that went wrong and led to the death of his wife. When the gang of bank robbers responsible for her death reappears eight years later, Niels won''t let anyone stand in his way to seek revenge. Even if it means forming an explosive duo with his temperamental 14-year-old daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kGclAzPJobEy7qg7LNuFI9grNoh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1020394'),
  ('661185762539936275', 'The Square', 2008, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Nash Edgerton, Brad Shield', 'Joel Edgerton, Matthew Dabner', 'David Roberts, Claire van der Boom, Joel Edgerton, Hanna Mangan Lawrence, Anthony Hayes, Peter Phelps, Bill Hunter, Kieran Darcy-Smith', 'R', 'Ray, a construction worker trapped in an unhappy marriage, pursues an affair with his neighbor, Carla. Carla''s husband, Greg, is a mobster who keeps large sums of drug money in their home. With this in mind, Carla comes up with a plan: She and Ray will steal Greg''s money, burn down her house, convince Greg the money was lost in the fire and then run away together. Carla''s scheme, however, doesn''t go off as planned.', 'Ray, a construction worker trapped in an unhappy marriage, pursues an affair with his neighbor, Carla. Carla''s husband, Greg, is a mobster who keeps large sums of drug money in their home. With this in mind, Carla comes up with a plan: She and Ray will steal Greg''s money, burn down her house, convince Greg the money was lost in the fire and then run away together. Carla''s scheme, however, doesn''t go off as planned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kLed7chodgFBAC2hUFqtVt9KyGk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15912'),
  ('775145299726982957', 'The Square', 2013, 'Documentary, Drama, History', 'Jehane Noujaim, Mohammed Hamdy, Ahmed Hassan', null, 'Khalid Abdalla, Dina Abd Allah, Dina Amer, Magdy Ashour, Ramy Essam, Ahmed Hassan, Aida El Kashef, Buthayana Kamel', null, 'The Square looks at the hard realities faced day-to-day by people working to build Egypt’s new democracy. Cairo’s Tahrir Square is the heart and soul of the film, which follows several young activists. Armed with values, determination, music, humor, an abundance of social media, and sheer obstinacy, they know that the thorny path to democracy only began with Hosni Mubarak’s fall. The life-and-death struggle between the people and the power of the state is still playing out.', 'The Square looks at the hard realities faced day-to-day by people working to build Egypt’s new democracy. Cairo’s Tahrir Square is the heart and soul of the film, which follows several young activists. Armed with values, determination, music, humor, an abundance of social media, and sheer obstinacy, they know that the thorny path to democracy only began with Hosni Mubarak’s fall. The life-and-death struggle between the people and the power of the state is still playing out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kc3cLOxhTQ2aMNdPGZxAzm0aaTK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159037'),
  ('369594875596542889', 'The Square', 2017, 'Drama', 'Ruben Östlund, Fredrik Wenzel, Rikard Waxin', 'Ruben Östlund', 'Claes Bang, Elisabeth Moss, Dominic West, Terry Notary, Christopher Læssø, Lise Stephenson Engström, Lilianne Mardon, Marina Schiptjenko', 'R', 'A prestigious Stockholm museum''s chief art curator finds himself in times of both professional and personal crisis as he attempts to set up a controversial new exhibit.', 'A prestigious Stockholm museum''s chief art curator finds himself in times of both professional and personal crisis as he attempts to set up a controversial new exhibit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pefcv5VNspSK4Dt8doei5bJmmln.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:401246'),
  ('252810434085736118', 'The Square Peg', 1958, 'War, Comedy', 'John Paddy Carstairs', 'Jack Davies, Eddie Leslie, Henry Blyth', 'Norman Wisdom, Honor Blackman, Edward Chapman, Campbell Singer, Hattie Jacques, Brian Worth, Terence Alexander, John Warwick', null, 'Norman Pitkin and Mr Grimsdale are council workmen mending the road outside an Army base when they come into conflict with the military. Shortly afterwards, they get drafted and fall into the clutches of the Sergeant they have just bested. They are sent to France to repair roads in front of the Allied advance but get captured. Pitkin takes advantage of a useful similarity to impersonate General Schreiber and manages to return a hero', 'Norman Pitkin and Mr Grimsdale are council workmen mending the road outside an Army base when they come into conflict with the military. Shortly afterwards, they get drafted and fall into the clutches of the Sergeant they have just bested. They are sent to France to repair roads in front of the Allied advance but get captured. Pitkin takes advantage of a useful similarity to impersonate General Schreiber and manages to return a hero', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8wOTPzXNo9uSZ7VPyot2U7GUhCv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38364'),
  ('539662412491307358', 'The Squaw Man', 1931, 'Drama, Western', 'Cecil B. DeMille, Mitchell Leisen, Earl Haley', 'Lenore J. Coffee, Lucien Hubbard', 'Warner Baxter, Lupe Vélez, Eleanor Boardman, Charles Bickford, Roland Young, Paul Cavanagh, Raymond Hatton, Julia Faye', null, 'Jim Wyngate, an English aristocrat, comes to the American West under a cloud of suspicion for embezzlement actually committed by his cousin Lord Henry. In Wyoming, Wyngate runs afoul of cattle rustler Cash Hawkins by rescuing the Indian girl Naturich from Hawkins. Wyngate marries Naturich, but then learns that his cousin Lord Henry has been killed and has cleared his name before dying. As Wyngate has long loved Lady Diana, Lord Henry''s wife, he is perplexed at his situation. But fate takes a hand and resolves matters as Wyngate could not have predicted.', 'Jim Wyngate, an English aristocrat, comes to the American West under a cloud of suspicion for embezzlement actually committed by his cousin Lord Henry. In Wyoming, Wyngate runs afoul of cattle rustler Cash Hawkins by rescuing the Indian girl Naturich from Hawkins. Wyngate marries Naturich, but then learns that his cousin Lord Henry has been killed and has cleared his name before dying. As Wyngate has long loved Lady Diana, Lord Henry''s wife, he is perplexed at his situation. But fate takes a hand and resolves matters as Wyngate could not have predicted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jmiJVY11VQw1VGsOAKxlXYsaP7s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:206039'),
  ('1123904092086457315', 'The Squeaker', 1963, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Alfred Vohrer, Karl Löb', 'Harald G. Petersson', 'Heinz Drache, Barbara Rütting, Günter Pfitzmann, Agnes Windeck, Eddi Arent, Siegfried Schürenberg, Jan Hendriks, Klaus Kinski', null, 'Scotland Yard investigates a series of murders where the victims have died by snake venom poisoning.', 'Scotland Yard investigates a series of murders where the victims have died by snake venom poisoning.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vktJzwdCk5bpfUfAuoL6cuey2x7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1663'),
  ('731305773207043970', 'The Squeeze', 1977, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Michael Apted, Dennis C. Lewiston', 'Leon Griffiths', 'Stacy Keach, David Hemmings, Edward Fox, Stephen Boyd, Carol White, Freddie Starr, Hilary Gasson, Rod Beacham', 'R', 'An alcoholic London ex-cop becomes involved in a kidnapping drama and tries to free the daughter of a friend from a brutal gangster mob.', 'An alcoholic London ex-cop becomes involved in a kidnapping drama and tries to free the daughter of a friend from a brutal gangster mob.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1MBRYmi5nTTOVonlQRgvPzZfET7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86208'),
  ('264143182750591607', 'The Squeeze', 1987, 'Action, Comedy, Crime, Romance, Thriller', 'Roger Young, Arthur Albert', 'Daniel Taplitz', 'Michael Keaton, Rae Dawn Chong, Joe Pantoliano, Danny Aiello III, Ronald Guttman, Meat Loaf, Leslie Bevis, Richard Portnow', 'PG-13', 'Harry Berg is both a con artist and an actual artist -- he constructs large sculptures out of television sets -- but he is not particularly successful in either role. He owes some money, which gets him involved with Rachel Dobs, a police detective who works with a collection agency. When Harry comes into possession of a strange parcel, both the con man and the detective find themselves wrapped up in a sinister corporate plot to fix the lottery.', 'Harry Berg is both a con artist and an actual artist -- he constructs large sculptures out of television sets -- but he is not particularly successful in either role. He owes some money, which gets him involved with Rachel Dobs, a police detective who works with a collection agency. When Harry comes into possession of a strange parcel, both the con man and the detective find themselves wrapped up in a sinister corporate plot to fix the lottery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sJEuDQ64KTXQhxfwGltZrhHBfJP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109161'),
  ('632975131689303125', 'The Squid and the Whale', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Robert D. Yeoman, Noah Baumbach, Eric Yellin', 'Noah Baumbach', 'Jeff Daniels, Laura Linney, Jesse Eisenberg, Owen Kline, William Baldwin, Halley Feiffer, Anna Paquin, David Benger', 'R', 'Based on the true childhood experiences of Noah Baumbach and his brother, The Squid and the Whale tells the touching story of two young boys dealing with their parents'' divorce in Brooklyn in the 1980s.', 'Based on the true childhood experiences of Noah Baumbach and his brother, The Squid and the Whale tells the touching story of two young boys dealing with their parents'' divorce in Brooklyn in the 1980s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9NbXn1NMdfGM491V3EFjZADR9SX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10707'),
  ('644423023429784267', 'The St. Francisville Experiment', 2000, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Ted Nicolaou', null, 'Madison Charap, Troy Taylor, Ryan Larson, P.J. Palmer, Tim Baldini, Paul Salamoff, Ava Jones, Katherine Smith', 'PG-13', 'Four non-actors, with no script, lock themselves in a haunted Louisiana plantation home overnight to film what takes places. The Lalaurie plantation, site of grisly murders, comes alive before their camera lens and they experience a night more terrifying and incredible than they imagined.', 'Four non-actors, with no script, lock themselves in a haunted Louisiana plantation home overnight to film what takes places. The Lalaurie plantation, site of grisly murders, comes alive before their camera lens and they experience a night more terrifying and incredible than they imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/erXOuvL0nyREuvASXr24Lf3N2F4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34794'),
  ('646848572649875829', 'The St. Valentine''s Day Massacre', 1967, 'History, Crime', 'Roger Corman, Milton Krasner, Wesley Barry', 'Howard Browne', 'Jason Robards, George Segal, Ralph Meeker, Jean Hale, Clint Ritchie, Frank Silvera, Joseph Campanella, Richard Bakalyan', 'NR', 'Chicago February 14th 1929. Al Capone finally establishes himself as the city''s boss of organised crime. In a north-side garage his hoods, dressed as policemen, surprise and mow down with machine-guns the key members of Bugs Moran''s rival gang. The film traces the history of the incident, and the lives affected and in some cases ended by it.', 'Chicago February 14th 1929. Al Capone finally establishes himself as the city''s boss of organised crime. In a north-side garage his hoods, dressed as policemen, surprise and mow down with machine-guns the key members of Bugs Moran''s rival gang. The film traces the history of the incident, and the lives affected and in some cases ended by it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jNESk6Y5ViKmbOHPocKkatGbNb5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42702'),
  ('311072110114742527', 'The Staffan Stolle Story', 1956, 'Romance, Comedy, Music, Mystery', 'Åke Dahlqvist, Hasse Ekman', 'Povel Ramel, Martin Ljung, Yngve Gamlin', 'Povel Ramel, Martin Ljung, Gunwer Bergkvist, Yvonne Lombard, Hasse Ekman, Sigge Fürst, Georg Funkquist, Siv Ericks', null, 'Staffan Stolle becomes the sole heir to a rich and noble family when he is just a little boy. Early on he is engaged to be married to a girl he finds he does not love. Instead he flees the country only to return under a false name, looking for true love.', 'Staffan Stolle becomes the sole heir to a rich and noble family when he is just a little boy. Early on he is engaged to be married to a girl he finds he does not love. Instead he flees the country only to return under a false name, looking for true love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dg7evZ9fOLjjsq7YT3UGn3gImPf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146502'),
  ('1136377087403085886', 'The Stag', 2013, 'Comedy', 'John Butler, Peter Robertson', 'John Butler, Peter McDonald', 'Andrew Scott, Hugh O''Conor, Peter McDonald, Brian Gleeson, Michael Legge, Andrew Bennett, Amy Huberman, Marcella Plunkett', null, 'At his fiancée’s urging, a very modern Irish groom-to-be reluctantly agrees to a stag weekend with his friends, camping in the western wilderness of Ireland. Much to their chagrin, these modern men are joined by the brother of the bride, a crazy, unpredictable alpha male known as “The Machine”, and an explosive Id to their collective Ego. The Machine is a force of nature, and under his leadership, the men—stripped of modern comfort, convenience and, finally, clothing—must begin their journey into the wild.', 'At his fiancée’s urging, a very modern Irish groom-to-be reluctantly agrees to a stag weekend with his friends, camping in the western wilderness of Ireland. Much to their chagrin, these modern men are joined by the brother of the bride, a crazy, unpredictable alpha male known as “The Machine”, and an explosive Id to their collective Ego. The Machine is a force of nature, and under his leadership, the men—stripped of modern comfort, convenience and, finally, clothing—must begin their journey into the wild.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yKW97IU1Wijj6rc3EJr47xHTVVp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:215962'),
  ('223787943652130721', 'The Stage', 2025, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Chen Peisi, Zhao Xiaoding, Li Danfeng', 'Chen Peisi', 'Chen Peisi, Huang Bo, Jiang Wu, Yin Zheng, Yang Haoyu, Yu Shaoqun, Dayu Chen, 徐卓儿', null, 'During the Republican era, wars and conflicts were frequent. On stage, the "Overlord" sings with resounding passion, while below, the absurd spectacle of life unfolds. They must both secure the opera troupe''s livelihood and appease the audience in their seats. Once the curtain rises, how should this play be performed?', 'During the Republican era, wars and conflicts were frequent. On stage, the "Overlord" sings with resounding passion, while below, the absurd spectacle of life unfolds. They must both secure the opera troupe''s livelihood and appease the audience in their seats. Once the curtain rises, how should this play be performed?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wSFGtkoz8SW6yIgu1Xvxs584QQt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1406607'),
  ('886631816551989919', 'The Staggering Girl', 2019, 'Drama', 'Luca Guadagnino, Sayombhu Mukdeeprom, Miguel Lombardi', 'Michael Mitnick', 'Julianne Moore, Marthe Keller, Kyle MacLachlan, KiKi Layne, Alba Rohrwacher, Edoardo Gabbriellini, Arianna Pesce, Mia Goth', null, 'Francesca, an Italian-American writer who lives in New York, must return to Rome to retrieve her aging mother. There, the ghosts of her childhood will come to her through her mother''s art.', 'Francesca, an Italian-American writer who lives in New York, must return to Rome to retrieve her aging mother. There, the ghosts of her childhood will come to her through her mother''s art.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7yo1622dsvzHOwIo9CUs7vJ9cdF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:560949'),
  ('726826535299957592', 'The Stain', 2026, 'Horror, Thriller, Romance', 'Bhanbhassa Dhubthien, Krisda Witthayakhajorndet, Ping Lumpraploeng', 'Sorarat Jirabovornwisut, Parida Manomaiphibul, Ning Bhanbhassa Dhubtien, Pond Krisda Witthayakhajorndet', 'Nattawin Wattanagitiphat, Engfa Waraha, Jespipat Tilapornputt, Sarocha Chankimha, Padung Songsang', null, 'When Malee, a young woman with a dark past, is drawn by fate to an apartment where she must confront haunting memories from her childhood, she encounters Pran, a botanist, a tea blending master, and the founder of a Thai floral tea brand.', 'When Malee, a young woman with a dark past, is drawn by fate to an apartment where she must confront haunting memories from her childhood, she encounters Pran, a botanist, a tea blending master, and the founder of a Thai floral tea brand.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FlUnrNTiDaONFIsFKVEcceZg7IZp.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-stain-2026'),
  ('1099171466513943114', 'The Stairs', 1969, 'Animation, Fantasy, Drama', 'Stefan Schabenbeck', null, null, null, 'A figure wanders through a world of endless stairs, seeking purpose to his monotonous existence.', 'A figure wanders through a world of endless stairs, seeking purpose to his monotonous existence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2K8F8pFQRcgL318st5nkEndanyo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:301767'),
