  ('972234463613902026', 'The Stakelander', 2016, 'Action, Horror', 'Trevor Cunningham, Jason Bohn, Chadd Harbold', 'Nick Damici', 'Connor Paolo, Nick Damici, Laura Abramsen, A.C. Peterson, Steven Williams, Bonnie Dennison, Kristina Hughes, Zane Clifford', null, 'When his home of New Eden is destroyed by a revitalized Brotherhood and its new Vamp leader, Martin finds himself alone in the badlands of America with only the distant memory of his mentor and legendary vampire hunter, Mister, to guide him.', 'When his home of New Eden is destroyed by a revitalized Brotherhood and its new Vamp leader, Martin finds himself alone in the badlands of America with only the distant memory of his mentor and legendary vampire hunter, Mister, to guide him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3K9sca6hMxVzCtE7EnAxTjdKWpM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:410988'),
  ('119659104814741065', 'The Stalking Moon', 1968, 'Western', 'Robert Mulligan, Don Kranze, Charles Lang', 'Alvin Sargent', 'Gregory Peck, Eva Marie Saint, Robert Forster, Noland Clay, Russell Thorson, Frank Silvera, Lonny Chapman, Lou Frizzell', 'G', 'While moving a group of Apaches to a Native American reservation in Arizona, an American scout named Sam Varner is surprised to find a white woman, Sarah Carver, living with the tribe. When Sam learns that she was taken captive by an Indian named Salvaje ten years ago, he attempts to escort Sarah and her half-Native American son to his home in New Mexico. However, it soon becomes clear that Salvaje is hot on their trail.', 'While moving a group of Apaches to a Native American reservation in Arizona, an American scout named Sam Varner is surprised to find a white woman, Sarah Carver, living with the tribe. When Sam learns that she was taken captive by an Indian named Salvaje ten years ago, he attempts to escort Sarah and her half-Native American son to his home in New Mexico. However, it soon becomes clear that Salvaje is hot on their trail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mKgo8n39VQh9JDqjKDJxBHteQUE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42685'),
  ('783226974323680206', 'The Stalls of Barchester', 1971, 'TV Movie, Horror', 'Lawrence Gordon Clark, John McGlashan', 'Lawrence Gordon Clark', 'Robert Hardy, Clive Swift, Thelma Barlow, Will Leighton, Harold Bennett, Penny Service, Martin Hoyle, Erik Chitty', null, 'Scholar Dr. Black''s seemingly mundane assignment of sorting through the assets of the Barchester Cathedral library takes an eerie turn when he comes across the papers of the late Archdeacon, who plotted to gain his position through murder. However, he soon comes to discover something truly horrific about the wooden choir stalls in the church, which are tied to a famous local tree and a sinister local legend.', 'Scholar Dr. Black''s seemingly mundane assignment of sorting through the assets of the Barchester Cathedral library takes an eerie turn when he comes across the papers of the late Archdeacon, who plotted to gain his position through murder. However, he soon comes to discover something truly horrific about the wooden choir stalls in the church, which are tied to a famous local tree and a sinister local legend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hXQPc3uNZsn72GuIVFcCto2AQlO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134182'),
  ('120423134334827887', 'The Stand at Apache River', 1953, 'Western', 'Lee Sholem, Charles P. Boyle, Jesse Hibbs', 'Arthur A. Ross', 'Stephen McNally, Julie Adams, Hugh Marlowe, Jaclynne Greene, Hugh O''Brian, Russell Johnson, Jack Kelly, Edgar Barrier', 'NR', 'Sheriff Lane Dakota captures robbery-murder suspect Greiner just as the latter is wounded in an Apache ambush. At remote outpost Apache River, Lane and his prisoner spend the night with other travelers, including 2 women with a surprising number of fancy dresses. In the morning, who should appear but a band of ostensibly peaceful Apaches strayed from the reservation. And bigoted Colonel Morsby is strongly inclined to shoot first and ask questions afterward...', 'Sheriff Lane Dakota captures robbery-murder suspect Greiner just as the latter is wounded in an Apache ambush. At remote outpost Apache River, Lane and his prisoner spend the night with other travelers, including 2 women with a surprising number of fancy dresses. In the morning, who should appear but a band of ostensibly peaceful Apaches strayed from the reservation. And bigoted Colonel Morsby is strongly inclined to shoot first and ask questions afterward...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pk2fA5Ek1zas2aeccIWwE3kmYNZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75366'),
  ('258395719503072957', 'The Stand at Paxton County', 2020, 'Thriller', 'Reuben Steinberg, Brett Hedlund', 'Carl Morris', 'Jacqueline Toboni, Michael O''Neill, Tyler Jacob Moore, Christopher McDonald, Sean O''Bryan, Blake Sheldon, Tanner Thomason, Greg Perrow', 'R', 'A military veteran comes home to find her father harassed by a sheriff intent on confiscating the livestock on their ranch under shady pretenses.', 'A military veteran comes home to find her father harassed by a sheriff intent on confiscating the livestock on their ranch under shady pretenses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lO12VOT6k1hBln9AOPgDadlmBKb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:699511'),
  ('467050128482835396', 'The Stand In', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Eric Moynier, Alice Johnson, Inna Braude', 'Sam Bain', 'Drew Barrymore, Michael Zegen, T.J. Miller, Holland Taylor, Michelle Buteau, Teddy Coluca, Andrew Rannells, Wendy Meredith', 'R', 'When ordered to serve a year in rehab, actress Candy hires her on-set stand-in to take her place. The unassuming woman flips the script and steals her identity, career and boyfriend in this hilarious comedy about trading places.', 'When ordered to serve a year in rehab, actress Candy hires her on-set stand-in to take her place. The unassuming woman flips the script and steals her identity, career and boyfriend in this hilarious comedy about trading places.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/twQeFldoNaDnMYXmZNXpm3NHlhP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:633908'),
  ('457868142198805362', 'The Standoff', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Ilyssa Goodman', 'Leigh Dunlap', 'Olivia Holt, Ryan McCartan, Alex Wolff, Sydney Park, McKaley Miller, Regan Burns, Audrey Whitby, Chandler Massey', null, 'At Big Jim’s Auto Depot there’s only one rule. The last man – or woman – standing wins. Eight teens enter, one teen leaves. Actually, all eight teens leave, but only one leaves with the ride of their dreams. To reach that dream, they’re going through a nightmare. Keep your hand on the car. That sounds simple enough, but two days of sleep deprivation and fierce competition can make things awfully hard.', 'At Big Jim’s Auto Depot there’s only one rule. The last man – or woman – standing wins. Eight teens enter, one teen leaves. Actually, all eight teens leave, but only one leaves with the ride of their dreams. To reach that dream, they’re going through a nightmare. Keep your hand on the car. That sounds simple enough, but two days of sleep deprivation and fierce competition can make things awfully hard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5FxwA8I8WJgx1eSfQiSR2ZDdRIA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:408151'),
  ('19700002792685229', 'The Standoff at Sparrow Creek', 2019, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Rachel Svatos, Meg Beatty, Henry Dunham', 'Henry Dunham', 'James Badge Dale, Brian Geraghty, Patrick Fischler, Chris Mulkey, Happy Anderson, Robert Aramayo, Gene Jones, Cotter Smith', 'NR', 'After a mass shooting at a police funeral, reclusive ex-cop Gannon finds himself unwittingly forced out of retirement when he realizes that the killer belongs to the same militia he joined after quitting the force.', 'After a mass shooting at a police funeral, reclusive ex-cop Gannon finds himself unwittingly forced out of retirement when he realizes that the killer belongs to the same militia he joined after quitting the force.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uCyDJGQ54vcCclNqa6nLcSqH3DQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:516630'),
  ('92502258427944015', 'The Stanford Prison Experiment', 2015, 'Thriller, Drama, History', 'Kyle Patrick Alvarez, Jas Shelton', 'Tim Talbott', 'Billy Crudup, Michael Angarano, Ezra Miller, Tye Sheridan, Olivia Thirlby, Nelsan Ellis, Moisés Arias, Nicholas Braun', 'R', 'In 1971, Stanford''s Professor Philip Zimbardo conducts a controversial psychology experiment in which college students pretend to be either prisoners or guards, but the proceedings soon get out of hand. Based on a true story.', 'In 1971, Stanford''s Professor Philip Zimbardo conducts a controversial psychology experiment in which college students pretend to be either prisoners or guards, but the proceedings soon get out of hand. Based on a true story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/orMkBkPqu7szuBRdMLUB4TWKiVV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:308032'),
  ('698143915755719854', 'The Star', 1952, 'Drama, Romance', 'Stuart Heisler, Ernest Laszlo, Robert Vreeland', 'Katherine Albert, Dale Eunson', 'Bette Davis, Sterling Hayden, Natalie Wood, Warner Anderson, Minor Watson, June Travis, Paul Frees, Robert Warwick', 'NR', 'Actress Margaret Elliot is well past her prime but refuses to retire from the acting business. Despite entreaties from both her daughter, Gretchen, and one-time professional colleague Jim Johannsen, Margaret remains convinced that she can regain her former glory. As she sets her sights on a coveted Hollywood role, Johannsen tries doggedly to get his unrequited love to see the folly of her ways.', 'Actress Margaret Elliot is well past her prime but refuses to retire from the acting business. Despite entreaties from both her daughter, Gretchen, and one-time professional colleague Jim Johannsen, Margaret remains convinced that she can regain her former glory. As she sets her sights on a coveted Hollywood role, Johannsen tries doggedly to get his unrequited love to see the folly of her ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gvga2csMHbDYjSTIIFS0TArTurp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85783'),
  ('718932939330777593', 'The Star', 2002, 'War, Drama', 'Nikolay Lebedev, Aleksandr Pogosyan, Yuriy Nevskiy', 'Nikolay Lebedev, Aleksandr Borodyanskiy, Evgeniy Grigorev', 'Igor Petrenko, Artyom Semakin, Aleksey Panin, Aleksei Kravchenko, Anatoliy Gushchin, Amadu Mamadakov, Yuri Laguta, Yekaterina Vulichenko', null, 'In the summer of 1944, the Nazi Armies prepare a massive Tank Division named ''Viking" for the offensive on occupied Russian land. The Russian Army''s special group of seven snipers named "Zvezda" is sent for a reconnaissance operation behind the enemy lines in the back of the Nazi Tank Division. Two previous Russian groups never came back. The seven Russians know that they are going to an almost certain Death for the sake of Victory.', 'In the summer of 1944, the Nazi Armies prepare a massive Tank Division named ''Viking" for the offensive on occupied Russian land. The Russian Army''s special group of seven snipers named "Zvezda" is sent for a reconnaissance operation behind the enemy lines in the back of the Nazi Tank Division. Two previous Russian groups never came back. The seven Russians know that they are going to an almost certain Death for the sake of Victory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eAphHhkP3NtseCsJ36tUMyT1xrk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54474'),
