  ('751872599890608889', 'The Starling', 2021, 'Drama', 'Theodore Melfi', 'Matt Harris', 'Melissa McCarthy, Chris O''Dowd, Kevin Kline, Timothy Olyphant, Daveed Diggs, Skyler Gisondo, Laura Harrier, Kimberly Quinn', 'PG-13', 'A woman adjusting to life after a loss contends with a feisty bird that''s taken over her garden — and a husband who''s struggling to find a way forward.', 'A woman adjusting to life after a loss contends with a feisty bird that''s taken over her garden — and a husband who''s struggling to find a way forward.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gPkaPGNbjZCeRurSYGi0JD63DBa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:468225'),
  ('187969199198463938', 'The Starling Girl', 2023, 'Drama', 'Laurel Parmet, Brian Lannin, Charlotte Arnoux', 'Laurel Parmet', 'Eliza Scanlen, Lewis Pullman, Wrenn Schmidt, Jimmi Simpson, Claire Elizabeth Green, Austin Abrams, Chris Dinner, Paige Leigh Landers', 'R', '17-year-old Jem Starling struggles with her place within her Christian fundamentalist community. But everything changes when her magnetic youth pastor Owen returns to their church.', '17-year-old Jem Starling struggles with her place within her Christian fundamentalist community. But everything changes when her magnetic youth pastor Owen returns to their church.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ysgnrkXwfFCxaBwviG2yNvzpfw5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1001500'),
  ('613957327384108337', 'The Starry Sky Above Me', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Ilan Klipper, Lazare Pedron', 'Ilan Klipper, Raphaël Neal', 'Laurent Poitrenaux, Camille Chamoux, Marilyne Canto, Alma Jodorowsky, Michèle Moretti, François Chattot, Claire Viroulaud, Frank Williams', null, '1996, Bruno publishes his first novel. He is critically acclaimed and is seen as the french John Fante. Twenty years later, Bruno is soon 50 and has not published anything since. He is single, has no children and lives with a young Femen as a roommate. For him, all goes well but his loved ones are worried and decide to take action.', '1996, Bruno publishes his first novel. He is critically acclaimed and is seen as the french John Fante. Twenty years later, Bruno is soon 50 and has not published anything since. He is single, has no children and lives with a young Femen as a roommate. For him, all goes well but his loved ones are worried and decide to take action.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q83adbHn3cj3GX2P52CuVu4cN23.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:457324'),
  ('107861333245956032', 'The Stars Are Beautiful', 1974, 'Documentary', 'Stan Brakhage', 'Stan Brakhage', 'Bearthm Brakhage, Jane Wodening, Stan Brakhage, Myrrena Brakhage', null, 'We move back and forth between scenes of a family at home and thoughts about the stars and creation. Children hold chickens while an adult clips their wings; we see a forest; a narrator talks about stars and light and eternity. A dog joins the hens and the family, while the narrator explains the heavens. We see a bee up close. The narrator suggests metaphors for heavenly bodies. Scenes fade into a black screen or dim purple; close-ups of family life may be blurry. The words about the heavens, such as "The stars are a flock of hummingbirds," contrast with images and sounds of real children.', 'We move back and forth between scenes of a family at home and thoughts about the stars and creation. Children hold chickens while an adult clips their wings; we see a forest; a narrator talks about stars and light and eternity. A dog joins the hens and the family, while the narrator explains the heavens. We see a bee up close. The narrator suggests metaphors for heavenly bodies. Scenes fade into a black screen or dim purple; close-ups of family life may be blurry. The words about the heavens, such as "The stars are a flock of hummingbirds," contrast with images and sounds of real children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iUyXNzihIgPjzZsR1vODFmJ1pQO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126187'),
  ('752682333336218466', 'The Stars Between Us', 2026, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Michael P. Northey, Michael Robison, William McKnight, Dylan Staniforth, Calogero Scarpulla', 'Tim Huddleston', 'Sarah Drew, Matt Long, Donna Benedicto, Noah Paul, Grayson Maxwell Gurnsey', 'TV-G', 'Seven years ago, Kim made a connection with a stranger during an eclipse event. Now a fledgling news reporter, Kim returns to Illinois for this year''s eclipse, unaware that their paths may cross again.', 'Seven years ago, Kim made a connection with a stranger during an eclipse event. Now a fledgling news reporter, Kim returns to Illinois for this year''s eclipse, unaware that their paths may cross again.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2Fb%2Fgracenote%2Fbbae9f24f22263f9888084b9eea7a724.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-stars-between-us-2026-1'),
  ('108353405487918864', 'The Stars Fell on Henrietta', 1995, 'Drama', 'Bruce Surtees, James Keach', 'Philip Railsback', 'Robert Duvall, Aidan Quinn, Frances Fisher, Brian Dennehy, Lexi Randall, Kaytlyn Knowles, Francesca Eastwood, Joe Stevens', 'PG', 'The setting is early America during the oil boom. An elderly, down on his luck ''oil man'', Mr. Cox finds himself in the town of Henrietta. Using unconventional methods, he convinces himself and local Don Day that there is oil on Day''s land. The financially strapped Day puts everything into finding oil...but at what cost?', 'The setting is early America during the oil boom. An elderly, down on his luck ''oil man'', Mr. Cox finds himself in the town of Henrietta. Using unconventional methods, he convinces himself and local Don Day that there is oil on Day''s land. The financially strapped Day puts everything into finding oil...but at what cost?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dQYD0WNRNZ5OBQ8iWRySIH8TEVd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139408'),
  ('323872208508095566', 'The Stars Look Down', 1940, 'Drama', 'Mutz Greenbaum, Carol Reed', 'J.B. Williams', 'Michael Redgrave, Margaret Lockwood, Emlyn Williams, Nancy Price, Allan Jeayes, Edward Rigby, Desmond Tester, David Markham', 'NR', 'Davey Fenwick leaves his mining village on a university scholarship intent on returning to better support the miners against the owners. But he falls in love with Jenny who gets him to marry her and return home as local schoolteacher before finishing his degree.', 'Davey Fenwick leaves his mining village on a university scholarship intent on returning to better support the miners against the owners. But he falls in love with Jenny who gets him to marry her and return home as local schoolteacher before finishing his degree.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aUmcGT0ghKBc82fXvJYypkVt2Pg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43822'),
  ('983598833144742578', 'The Startup', 2017, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Alessandro D''Alatri, Ferran Paredes, Biljana Mirkovic', 'Alessandro D''Alatri, Francesco Arlanch', 'Andrea Arcangeli, Paola Calliari, Matilde Gioli, Luca Di Giovanni, Matteo Leoni, Matteo Vignati, Paolo Bessegato, Guglielmo Poggi', null, 'Matteo Achilli, a nineteen-year-old from Rome, manages to fulfill every young person’s dream: creating an app and becoming rich. But the world of success quickly turns out to be a jungle, and fame presents the young man with a steep price to pay. Based on a true story.', 'Matteo Achilli, a nineteen-year-old from Rome, manages to fulfill every young person’s dream: creating an app and becoming rich. But the world of success quickly turns out to be a jungle, and fame presents the young man with a steep price to pay. Based on a true story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rLxx8hokh09V07F5ZzuNVEOIiRx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:450823'),
  ('860644791765168833', 'The Starving Games', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Jason Friedberg, Aaron Seltzer, Shawn Maurer', 'Aaron Seltzer, Jason Friedberg', 'Maiara Walsh, Cody Christian, Brant Daugherty, Diedrich Bader, Ross Wyngaarden, Lauren Bowles, Dean J. West, Michael Hartson', 'PG-13', 'In this Hunger Games spoof, Kantmiss Evershot must fight for her life in the 75th annual Starving Games, where she could also win an old ham, a coupon for a foot-long sub, and a partially eaten pickle.', 'In this Hunger Games spoof, Kantmiss Evershot must fight for her life in the 75th annual Starving Games, where she could also win an old ham, a coupon for a foot-long sub, and a partially eaten pickle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oHTNil93kpVQ6TOE4pzypgxPKLb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:225703'),
  ('128794858290296460', 'The State Against Mandela and the Others', 2018, 'Documentary, Animation, History', 'Gilles Porte, Nicolas Champeaux, Oerd van Cuijlenborg', 'Gilles Porte, Nicolas Champeaux', 'Ahmed Mohamed ''Kathy'' Kathrada, Andrew Mlangeni, Denis Goldberg, Sylvia Neame, Winnie Mandela, Quartus de Wet, Nelson Mandela, Daniël François Malan', null, 'South Africa, July 11th, 1963. Several members of the African National Congress, an organization declared illegal, are arrested in Rivonia, a country house near Johannesburg. The detainees, along with Nelson Mandela, imprisoned since 1962, are charged with serious crimes for their radical activism against the apartheid regime.', 'South Africa, July 11th, 1963. Several members of the African National Congress, an organization declared illegal, are arrested in Rivonia, a country house near Johannesburg. The detainees, along with Nelson Mandela, imprisoned since 1962, are charged with serious crimes for their radical activism against the apartheid regime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gP2bLXsvh344jLIJSaZVCWrF9qb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:517952'),
  ('66520491884249370', 'The State Counsellor', 2005, 'Action, Crime, Mystery', 'Vladislav Opelyants, Filipp Yankovsky, Tamara Odintsova', 'Boris Akunin', 'Oleg Menshikov, Nikita Mikhalkov, Konstantin Khabenskiy, Vladimir Mashkov, Oleg Tabakov, Oksana Fandera, Mariya Mironova, Mikhail Efremov', null, 'Third film based on Boris Akunin''s "Priklucheniya Erasta Petrovicha Fandorina" series of novels. On a train from St. Petersburg to Moscow general Khrapov was killed and no one else but Erast Petrovich is under suspicion because the killer pretended to be Fandorin. There are initials BG on the handle of the knife Khrapov was stabbed with, the initials belong to a terrorist organization which keeps both capital cities (Moscow and St. Petersburg) in fear. This time Fandorin is not the only one trying to solve the crime, general Pozharski, a famous detective takes over the investigation...', 'Third film based on Boris Akunin''s "Priklucheniya Erasta Petrovicha Fandorina" series of novels. On a train from St. Petersburg to Moscow general Khrapov was killed and no one else but Erast Petrovich is under suspicion because the killer pretended to be Fandorin. There are initials BG on the handle of the knife Khrapov was stabbed with, the initials belong to a terrorist organization which keeps both capital cities (Moscow and St. Petersburg) in fear. This time Fandorin is not the only one trying to solve the crime, general Pozharski, a famous detective takes over the investigation...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uPRGZnY30gVKM2IuRklLR2PVdDD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59529'),
  ('950140316388776514', 'The State I Am In', 2001, 'Drama', 'Christian Petzold, Hans Fromm, Hernani Borges', 'Harun Farocki, Christian Petzold', 'Julia Hummer, Barbara Auer, Richy Müller, Bilge Bingul, Rogério Jacques, Maria João, Vasco Machado, Noberto Paula', null, 'Clara and Hans are left-wing terrorists who have been sought by police for almost fifteen years. Their increasingly rebellious daughter Jeanne begins to pose a threat to their security when she falls in love with a boy she meets on the beach.', 'Clara and Hans are left-wing terrorists who have been sought by police for almost fifteen years. Their increasingly rebellious daughter Jeanne begins to pose a threat to their security when she falls in love with a boy she meets on the beach.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wQoYYvXYaeZNsGPtP1vvvyTmuhF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:191'),
  ('1035008466778069075', 'The State of the World', 2007, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Ayisha Abraham, Chantal Akerman, Vicente Ferraz', 'Wang Bing', 'Jenjira Pongpas, Sakda Kaewbuadee, Prasit Densung, Jurandyr Ferreira, Babu Santana, Shyam Bahadur, Wake Li, Xu Ning', null, 'Six directors, six independent films, six visions on the state of the world. Each carrying a unique and personal interpretation of a specific experience, their crossover creates new space for a dynamic and radical inquisitive reflection.', 'Six directors, six independent films, six visions on the state of the world. Each carrying a unique and personal interpretation of a specific experience, their crossover creates new space for a dynamic and radical inquisitive reflection.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k39yZMY5U84r3gdUl04ek6vqKNX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126677'),
  ('199144595172217299', 'The State of Things', 1982, 'Drama', 'Wim Wenders, Fred Murphy, Henri Alekan', 'Robert Kramer, Josh Wallace, Wim Wenders', 'Isabelle Weingarten, Rebecca Pauly, Jeffrey Kime, Geoffrey Carey, Camila Mora-Scheihing, Alexandra Auder, Patrick Bauchau, Paul Getty Jr.', null, 'On location in Portugal, a film crew runs out of film while making their own version of Roger Corman''s The Day the World Ended (1956). The producer is nowhere to be found and director Munro attempts to find him in hopes of being able to finish the film.', 'On location in Portugal, a film crew runs out of film while making their own version of Roger Corman''s The Day the World Ended (1956). The producer is nowhere to be found and director Munro attempts to find him in hopes of being able to finish the film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gHFOZph5GuFcDKe3Xgmrcc2sYwP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30363'),
  ('635445144140437598', 'The Statement', 2003, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Norman Jewison, Kevin Jewison, Arnaud Le Roch', 'Ronald Harwood', 'Michael Caine, Tilda Swinton, Jeremy Northam, Alan Bates, Charlotte Rampling, John Neville, Ciarán Hinds, Frank Finlay', null, 'An ambitious Judge and an exacting Colonel re-open the sixty-year-old case of Pierre Brossard, an escaped Nazi collaborator accused of murdering seven Jews. Now an old man living a sheltered life within the Catholic Church, Brossard is also being trailed by mysterious hit men, determined to kill him before he''s arrested.', 'An ambitious Judge and an exacting Colonel re-open the sixty-year-old case of Pierre Brossard, an escaped Nazi collaborator accused of murdering seven Jews. Now an old man living a sheltered life within the Catholic Church, Brossard is also being trailed by mysterious hit men, determined to kill him before he''s arrested.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a7IvoBJ70dp6U1fjRlvB04ZtxvF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41488'),
  ('291998125526755478', 'The Station', 1990, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Sergio Rubini, Alessio Gelsini Torresi, Francesco Germi', 'Filippo Ascione, Sergio Rubini, Umberto Marino', 'Sergio Rubini, Margherita Buy, Ennio Fantastichini, Michel Rocher, Beppe Tosco, Popeck, Pietro Genuardi, Maria Antonia Capotorto', 'NR', 'In a forgotten railway outpost, a humble stationmaster meets a glamorous society woman. Their brief wait for her train turns unexpectedly intimate—until her fiancé arrives, and the night erupts into a desperate struggle as he tries to drag her back by force.', 'In a forgotten railway outpost, a humble stationmaster meets a glamorous society woman. Their brief wait for her train turns unexpectedly intimate—until her fiancé arrives, and the night erupts into a desperate struggle as he tries to drag her back by force.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jFssWz1ARthKzmU60Xy8bxqJVjN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72979'),
  ('564114189903840957', 'The Station Agent', 2003, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Oliver Bokelberg, Tom McCarthy', 'Tom McCarthy', 'Peter Dinklage, Patricia Clarkson, Bobby Cannavale, Michelle Williams, Raven Goodwin, Paul Benjamin, Jase Blankfort, Paula Garcés', 'R', 'When his only friend dies, a man born with dwarfism moves to rural New Jersey to live a life of solitude, only to meet a chatty hot dog vendor and a woman dealing with her own personal loss.', 'When his only friend dies, a man born with dwarfism moves to rural New Jersey to live a life of solitude, only to meet a chatty hot dog vendor and a woman dealing with her own personal loss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kjJg6eJa9I9flfHaJG67ecEv8YX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2056'),
  ('478221744141970465', 'The Station Master', 1941, 'Comedy', 'Jan Sviták, Ivo Novák, Jaroslav Tuzar', 'Václav Wasserman', 'Vlasta Burian, Antonín Zacpal, Zita Kabátová, Jaroslav Marvan, Čeněk Šlégl, Růžena Šlemrová, Václav Trégl, Theodor Pištěk', null, 'Vlasta Burian, as a stowaway, disrupts the disciplined operation of a railway station. Mr. Ťopka gives the impression of a gentleman, somewhat Chaplin-like. He makes a living by doing odd jobs, for which he exclusively rides the train as a stowaway. During one of his trips, he meets the feared railway inspector general Kokrhel. At a small station, he manages to get out and change into the stationmaster''s uniform. However, he cannot avoid meeting Inspector Kokrhel...', 'Vlasta Burian, as a stowaway, disrupts the disciplined operation of a railway station. Mr. Ťopka gives the impression of a gentleman, somewhat Chaplin-like. He makes a living by doing odd jobs, for which he exclusively rides the train as a stowaway. During one of his trips, he meets the feared railway inspector general Kokrhel. At a small station, he manages to get out and change into the stationmaster''s uniform. However, he cannot avoid meeting Inspector Kokrhel...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/59WbbLrvsYgx86aKmOeuEsFC9Gk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65915'),
  ('271090111901044018', 'The Stationmaster Meets His Match', 1980, 'Comedy', 'Sándor Mihályfy', 'Sándor Rideg, György Schwajda', 'Imre Olvasztó, Róbert Koltai, Teri Horváth, Péter Haumann, Piroska Molnár, János Zách, László Cuczor, Ildikó Pécsi', null, 'The story of Bendegúz, the teenage boy who never succeeds in anything and about whom everybody''s first though is "I wish you had been hanged when you were born!" drops out of school and becomes a cowboy. He works for the Stationmaster whose cows he has to graze by the railway. Despite his goodwill and kindheartedness he always manages to spoil everything he touches. No matter his wit, he gets into humiliating situations and regularly fights with the Ugly Witch (the Stationmaster''s mother-in-law). However his good spirit and cheerfulness never leave him.', 'The story of Bendegúz, the teenage boy who never succeeds in anything and about whom everybody''s first though is "I wish you had been hanged when you were born!" drops out of school and becomes a cowboy. He works for the Stationmaster whose cows he has to graze by the railway. Despite his goodwill and kindheartedness he always manages to spoil everything he touches. No matter his wit, he gets into humiliating situations and regularly fights with the Ugly Witch (the Stationmaster''s mother-in-law). However his good spirit and cheerfulness never leave him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fgAd27qMb8fKcxbTLOAHL9LIZWp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63625'),
  ('66877738241734370', 'The Stationmaster’s Wife', 1977, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Rainer Werner Fassbinder, Michael Ballhaus', 'Rainer Werner Fassbinder', 'Elisabeth Trissenaar, Kurt Raab, Bernhard Helfrich, Karl-Heinz von Hassel, Volker Spengler, Gustl Bayrhammer, Udo Kier, Peter Kern', null, 'The lackluster and plodding Bolweiser has the (mis)fortune to be married to the town’s siren; his trusting nature leads him into serious trouble when she beds nearly every available guy.', 'The lackluster and plodding Bolweiser has the (mis)fortune to be married to the town’s siren; his trusting nature leads him into serious trouble when she beds nearly every available guy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kKse6jN56AEQ64LYOkZ48Wyojkm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122487'),
  ('176496948148426375', 'The Statue', 1971, 'Comedy', 'Rod Amateau, Piero Portalupi', 'Denis Norden', 'David Niven, Virna Lisi, Robert Vaughn, Ann Bell, John Cleese, Tim Brooke-Taylor, Hugh Burden, Erik Chitty', 'R', 'Bolt, a British linguist, develops a universal language, so he''s a sudden sensation and receives a Nobel prize. An ambitious diplomat, capitalizing on Bolt''s celebrity, arranges for the U.S. to commission a statue for a London square to honor Bolt''s achievement. Bolt''s Italian wife, a renowned artist, sculpts an 18-foot nude of Bolt. In a pique, because he''s neglected her for years to do his work, she gives the statue a spectacular phallus, telling Bolt that he wasn''t its model. Thinking he''s a cuckold, Bolt goes on a jealous search for a man matching the statue. The diplomat, too, wants changes in the statue to protect his conservative image. Can art and love reconcile?', 'Bolt, a British linguist, develops a universal language, so he''s a sudden sensation and receives a Nobel prize. An ambitious diplomat, capitalizing on Bolt''s celebrity, arranges for the U.S. to commission a statue for a London square to honor Bolt''s achievement. Bolt''s Italian wife, a renowned artist, sculpts an 18-foot nude of Bolt. In a pique, because he''s neglected her for years to do his work, she gives the statue a spectacular phallus, telling Bolt that he wasn''t its model. Thinking he''s a cuckold, Bolt goes on a jealous search for a man matching the statue. The diplomat, too, wants changes in the statue to protect his conservative image. Can art and love reconcile?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qIoORjHqDsrHuNapAYKuKwTztZ1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:135614'),
  ('320793609419952987', 'The Statue of Liberty', 1985, 'History, Documentary', 'Ken Burns', 'Geoffrey C. Ward, Bernard Weisberger', 'David McCullough, Jeremy Irons, Derek Jacobi, Paul Roebling, Arthur Miller, James Baldwin, Mario Cuomo, Miloš Forman', 'G', 'For more than 100 years, the Statue of Liberty has been a symbol of hope and refuge for generations of immigrants. In this lyrical, compelling and provocative portrait of the statue, Ken Burns explores both the history of America’s premier symbol and the meaning of liberty itself. Featuring rare archival photographs, paintings and drawings, readings from actual diaries, letters and newspapers of the day, the fascinating story of this universally admired monument is told. In interviews with Americans from all walks of life, including former New York governor Mario Cuomo, the late congresswoman Barbara Jordan and the late writers James Baldwin and Jerzy Kosinski, The Statue of Liberty examines the nature of liberty and the significance of the statue to American life. Nominated for both the Academy Award ® and the Emmy Award ®, The Statue of Liberty received the prestigious CINE Golden Eagle, the Christopher Award and the Blue Ribbon at the American Film Festival.', 'For more than 100 years, the Statue of Liberty has been a symbol of hope and refuge for generations of immigrants. In this lyrical, compelling and provocative portrait of the statue, Ken Burns explores both the history of America’s premier symbol and the meaning of liberty itself. Featuring rare archival photographs, paintings and drawings, readings from actual diaries, letters and newspapers of the day, the fascinating story of this universally admired monument is told. In interviews with Americans from all walks of life, including former New York governor Mario Cuomo, the late congresswoman Barbara Jordan and the late writers James Baldwin and Jerzy Kosinski, The Statue of Liberty examines the nature of liberty and the significance of the statue to American life. Nominated for both the Academy Award ® and the Emmy Award ®, The Statue of Liberty received the prestigious CINE Golden Eagle, the Christopher Award and the Blue Ribbon at the American Film Festival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o3kBVnoUasxR6DRUglW9RFpvAJV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51594'),
  ('989614695144641094', 'The Stay Awake', 1987, 'Horror', 'Darryl Martin, John Bernard', 'John Bernard', 'Shirley Jane Harris, Tanya Gordon, Jayne Hutton, Heath Potter, Ken Marshall, Lindsay Reardon, Michelle Carey, Christobel d''Ortez', 'R', 'The ghost of a serial killer, executed for murdering students at a Catholic girls'' school, returns to the school to take revenge on the current student body.', 'The ghost of a serial killer, executed for murdering students at a Catholic girls'' school, returns to the school to take revenge on the current student body.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yUfIen5cDDSgHLBtuclZ9p9GGkg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85161'),
  ('819879035032808441', 'The Steadfast Tin Soldier', 1955, 'Animation', 'Ivo Caprino', null, 'Arne Bang-Hansen', null, 'This is the tale of the tin soldier with one leg who won the heart of a ballerina, but was swallowed by a fish before he found his way back to her. The film is a delightful presentation of Hans Christian Andersen''s story, employing puppets and clever camerawork.', 'This is the tale of the tin soldier with one leg who won the heart of a ballerina, but was swallowed by a fish before he found his way back to her. The film is a delightful presentation of Hans Christian Andersen''s story, employing puppets and clever camerawork.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2jQ4eNHtfpaUM3v26FT2z8vGKYe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62832'),
  ('260953603681228242', 'The Steal', 1995, 'Thriller, Comedy', 'John Hay, Ronnie Taylor, Stephen Woolfenden', 'John Hay', 'Helen Slater, Alfred Molina, Peter Bowles, Dinsdale Landen, Heathcote Williams, Stephen Fry, Jack Dee, Bryan Pringle', null, 'A young American computer hackeress is hired by a liberal British lawyer to right the wrong done to a third world country by a London investment company. Even the expertise of her building inspector sidekick can not prevent a surprising development though.', 'A young American computer hackeress is hired by a liberal British lawyer to right the wrong done to a third world country by a London investment company. Even the expertise of her building inspector sidekick can not prevent a surprising development though.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a7NbLWLbaYQalXV0bUrvd4r6MGf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:325616'),
  ('638833809466987487', 'The Steam Experiment', 2009, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Philippe Martinez, Erik Curtis', 'Robert Malkani', 'Val Kilmer, Armand Assante, Eric Roberts, Megan Brown, Patrick Muldoon, Cordelia Reynolds, Eve Mauro, Quinn Duffy', 'R', 'A deranged scientist locks 6 people in a steam room and threatens to turn up the heat if the local paper doesn''t publish his story about global warming.', 'A deranged scientist locks 6 people in a steam room and threatens to turn up the heat if the local paper doesn''t publish his story about global warming.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vUfeNA0jLH0Q0TCWOziDtLfxQxA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20047'),
  ('114627009236829285', 'The Steamroller and the Violin', 1961, 'Drama', 'Andrei Tarkovsky, Vadim Yusov', 'Andrei Konchalovsky, Andrei Tarkovsky', 'Igor Fomchenko, Vladimir Zamanskiy, Marina Adzhubei, Yuri Brusser, Vyacheslav Borisov, Lyudmila Semyonova, Tanya Prokhorova, Natalya Arkhangelskaya', 'PG', 'Seven year old Sasha practices violin every day to satisfy the ambition of his parents. Already withdrawn as a result of his routines, Sasha quickly regains confidence when he accidentally meets and befriends worker Sergei, who works on a steamroller in their upscale Moscow neighborhood.', 'Seven year old Sasha practices violin every day to satisfy the ambition of his parents. Already withdrawn as a result of his routines, Sasha quickly regains confidence when he accidentally meets and befriends worker Sergei, who works on a steamroller in their upscale Moscow neighborhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rQILTYttUhFTy715d41SG50Xpfi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38311'),
  ('1039402285044070042', 'The Steel Helmet', 1951, 'Action, Drama, War', 'Samuel Fuller, Ernest Miller, John Francis Murphy', 'Samuel Fuller', 'Gene Evans, Robert Hutton, Steve Brodie, James Edwards, Richard Loo, Sid Melton, Richard Monahan, William Chun', 'NR', 'A ragtag group of American stragglers battles against superior Communist troops in an abandoned Buddhist temple during the Korean War.', 'A ragtag group of American stragglers battles against superior Communist troops in an abandoned Buddhist temple during the Korean War.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vaGLD07umhVJfma1lciYd4uIW4W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46872'),
  ('744008176451832014', 'The Steel Road', 1929, 'Documentary', 'Victor Turin, Boris Frantsisson, Yevgeni Slavinsky', 'Aleksandr Macheret, Victor Turin, Viktor Shklovskiy', null, null, 'Bold and exhilarating documentary account of the building of the Turkestan-Siberian railway, presented as a heroic triumph of Soviet progress over natural adversity.', 'Bold and exhilarating documentary account of the building of the Turkestan-Siberian railway, presented as a heroic triumph of Soviet progress over natural adversity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gNUIyNrL6sQ4dJkbIH9q6l1idDa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:136141'),
  ('556862936139991119', 'The Steel Trap', 1952, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Andrew L. Stone, Ernest Laszlo, Jack R. Berne', 'Andrew L. Stone', 'Joseph Cotten, Teresa Wright, Jonathan Hale, Walter Sande, Eddie Marr, Carleton Young, Katherine Warren, Tom Powers', 'NR', 'Joseph Cotten plays an assistant bank manager who steals $1,000,000 from the safe late on a Friday and then plans to flee to Brazil over the weekend.', 'Joseph Cotten plays an assistant bank manager who steals $1,000,000 from the safe late on a Friday and then plans to flee to Brazil over the weekend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b0AifWNRWGkw0gCn30H358PfmdD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31559'),
  ('765905492563532204', 'The Steeple Chase', 1933, 'Animation', 'Burt Gillett', null, 'Pinto Colvig, Walt Disney, Marcellite Garner', 'NR', 'Mickey is set to ride Thunderbolt in the big race; his owner, the Colonel, has bet everything. But the stable-hands goof off and incapacitate the horse. In desperation, Mickey rents a horse costume and puts the stable-hands inside. They manage to eventually clear the hurdles, but get hung up on one near a beehive; the bees propel them to victory.', 'Mickey is set to ride Thunderbolt in the big race; his owner, the Colonel, has bet everything. But the stable-hands goof off and incapacitate the horse. In desperation, Mickey rents a horse costume and puts the stable-hands inside. They manage to eventually clear the hurdles, but get hung up on one near a beehive; the bees propel them to victory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4lyILXn55Gd34062gX5MQXwYn16.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161887'),
  ('513592088935076768', 'The Stendhal Syndrome', 1996, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Dario Argento, Giuseppe Rotunno', 'Dario Argento, Franco Ferrini', 'Asia Argento, Thomas Kretschmann, Marco Leonardi, Luigi Diberti, Paolo Bonacelli, Lucia Stara, Lorenzo Crespi, Vera Gemma', 'NR', 'A young policewoman slowly goes insane while tracking down an elusive serial rapist/killer through Italy when she herself becomes a victim of the brutal man''s obsession.', 'A young policewoman slowly goes insane while tracking down an elusive serial rapist/killer through Italy when she herself becomes a victim of the brutal man''s obsession.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ttgMlgv76nbh3vwRl91P4JkgroA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39434'),
  ('556957059895196867', 'The Step', 1975, 'Animation', 'Piotr Kamler', null, null, null, 'A short film in which pieces of paper fly off of an animated cube.', 'A short film in which pieces of paper fly off of an animated cube.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o2tERQh8ICJLu2cYt0rvp7EXZr6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:340336'),
  ('465681157481327252', 'The Step', 1987, 'Drama', 'Aleqsandre Rekhviashvili, Archil Pilipashvili', 'Dato Chubinishvili, Aleqsandre Rekhviashvili', 'Merab Ninidze, Irina Chichinadze, Levan Abashidze, Nineli Chankvetadze, Ramaz Giorgobiani, Zhanri Lolashvili, Nino Tarkhan-Mouravi, Leo Antadze', null, 'Alexi leaves the house of his father and stepmother and rents an apartment. He wants to be independent and find his place in the world. But no basic changes ensue – he has the same friends, with the same trivial conversations and the same inactivity. Only the death of his favorite teacher, to whom the young man felt very close, really changes his habitual way of life. Alexi makes a decision: he refuses a place at a research institute and leaves for a teaching job at a village school, the same school his mentor used to work at.', 'Alexi leaves the house of his father and stepmother and rents an apartment. He wants to be independent and find his place in the world. But no basic changes ensue – he has the same friends, with the same trivial conversations and the same inactivity. Only the death of his favorite teacher, to whom the young man felt very close, really changes his habitual way of life. Alexi makes a decision: he refuses a place at a research institute and leaves for a teaching job at a village school, the same school his mentor used to work at.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6MqxPuUtAbnUtCUpCy65ND80fh8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150099'),
  ('703770059591334933', 'The Stepfather', 1987, 'Horror, Thriller', 'John Lindley, Joseph Ruben, James Marshall', 'Donald E. Westlake', 'Terry O''Quinn, Jill Schoelen, Shelley Hack, Charles Lanyer, Stephen Shellen, Stephen E. Miller, Robyn Stevan, Jeff Schultz', 'R', 'Seemingly mild-mannered Henry Morrison has just murdered his entire family. After adopting a new identity and skipping town, he begins building a new relationship with a widow and her teenage daughter. However, he soon begins struggling to hide his true identity and maintain a grip on reality.', 'Seemingly mild-mannered Henry Morrison has just murdered his entire family. After adopting a new identity and skipping town, he begins building a new relationship with a widow and her teenage daughter. However, he soon begins struggling to hide his true identity and maintain a grip on reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r5CKg3VJQjYvSWTRojK2tE7LpM0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25155'),
  ('340326053402376069', 'The Stepfather', 2009, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Nelson McCormick, Patrick Cady, Mike Smith', 'Donald E. Westlake', 'Dylan Walsh, Sela Ward, Penn Badgley, Amber Heard, Sherry Stringfield, Paige Turco, Jon Tenney, Nancy Linehan Charles', 'PG-13', 'Michael Harding returns home from military school to find his mother happily in love and living with her new boyfriend, David. As the two men get to know each other, Michael becomes more and more suspicious of the man who is always there with a helpful hand. Is he really the man of her dreams or could David be hiding a dark side?', 'Michael Harding returns home from military school to find his mother happily in love and living with her new boyfriend, David. As the two men get to know each other, Michael becomes more and more suspicious of the man who is always there with a helpful hand. Is he really the man of her dreams or could David be hiding a dark side?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bTolBUgHeU4Tcq8HjBxL92f9wLm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19904'),
  ('201562813379731014', 'The Stepford Children', 1987, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller, TV Movie, Mystery', 'Alan J. Levi, Bruce Moriarty, Scott Maitland', 'William Bleich', 'Barbara Eden, Don Murray, Tammy Lauren, Pat Corley, Ken Swofford, Richard Anderson, Sharon Spelman, James Staley', null, 'Steven and Laura Harding, along with their kids David and Mary, have moved to the quiet community of Stepford. Steven joins the men''s club, which is still assimilating their wives into robots. This time, they have begun to turn their out of control teens into robots as well. Once they are assimilated, they are obedient, homework loving, big band dancing droids. Laura, David, and Mary stumble onto this mystery, and they must avoid Steven''s plans to turn them into robots.', 'Steven and Laura Harding, along with their kids David and Mary, have moved to the quiet community of Stepford. Steven joins the men''s club, which is still assimilating their wives into robots. This time, they have begun to turn their out of control teens into robots as well. Once they are assimilated, they are obedient, homework loving, big band dancing droids. Laura, David, and Mary stumble onto this mystery, and they must avoid Steven''s plans to turn them into robots.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jGbW8HvDOW4GA3tbvUf8kUBOXS8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112703'),
  ('1078282434718311613', 'The Stepford Wives', 1975, 'Mystery, Thriller, Science Fiction, Horror', 'Bryan Forbes, Owen Roizman, Michael Haley', 'William Goldman', 'Katharine Ross, Paula Prentiss, Nanette Newman, Judith Baldwin, Peter Masterson, Tina Louise, Carol Eve Rossen, William Prince', 'PG', 'Joanna Eberhart comes to the town of Stepford, Connecticut with her family, but soon discovers there lies a sinister truth in the all too perfect behavior of the female residents.', 'Joanna Eberhart comes to the town of Stepford, Connecticut with her family, but soon discovers there lies a sinister truth in the all too perfect behavior of the female residents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5z1ogJJmQkCoU62VJmut4nnc2qs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12223'),
  ('119495942113928529', 'The Stepford Wives', 2004, 'Comedy, Science Fiction, Horror', 'Rob Hahn, Frank Oz, Doug Huszti', 'Paul Rudnick', 'Nicole Kidman, Matthew Broderick, Bette Midler, Glenn Close, Christopher Walken, Roger Bart, David Marshall Grant, Jon Lovitz', 'PG-13', 'What does it take to become a Stepford wife, a woman perfect beyond belief? Ask the Stepford husbands, who''ve created this high-tech, terrifying little town.', 'What does it take to become a Stepford wife, a woman perfect beyond belief? Ask the Stepford husbands, who''ve created this high-tech, terrifying little town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ygr0Wlmm1KmE16TUefNitIscVBG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9890'),
  ('312213978233512135', 'The Stepmother', 1972, 'Drama', 'Howard Avedis, Jack Beckett', 'Howard Avedis', 'Alejandro Rey, John Anderson, Katherine Justice, Larry Linville, Marlene Schmidt, Duncan McLeod, David Renard, Claudia Jennings', 'R', 'Returning home from a business trip, an architect assumes that a client is having an affair with his wife and murders the man. His feelings of guilt and attempts to conceal the crime lead to more complications and death.', 'Returning home from a business trip, an architect assumes that a client is having an affair with his wife and murders the man. His feelings of guilt and attempts to conceal the crime lead to more complications and death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kqYa9WXTOze5N3WC5JcD69T2nlq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87886'),
  ('267339898234575702', 'The Stepmother', 1973, 'Drama', 'Oleg Bondarev, Igor Chernykh, Evgeniya Indlina', 'Edgar Smirnov', 'Tatyana Doronina, Leonid Nevedomsky, Nadezhda Fedosova, Vladimir Samoylov, Yelena Kostereva, Aleksandr Dalyokiy, Tamara Sovchi, Irina Khlopkova', null, 'Based on novel of the same name by Mariya Khalfina. In Pavel Olevantsev’s family suddenly comes news that his daughter by another woman was orphaned. Pavel did not know about the existence of the girl, nor could his wife know about it... It is not easy to decide to take the child to his house. But it will be much more difficult to endear the girl to them, to return her the joy of childhood and the belief that she is not alone...', 'Based on novel of the same name by Mariya Khalfina. In Pavel Olevantsev’s family suddenly comes news that his daughter by another woman was orphaned. Pavel did not know about the existence of the girl, nor could his wife know about it... It is not easy to decide to take the child to his house. But it will be much more difficult to endear the girl to them, to return her the joy of childhood and the belief that she is not alone...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n9KxXLNZHvpUKTlRGaQqiyCVzQ5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67687'),
  ('51803713428306108', 'The Stepmother''s Bond', 2025, 'Drama', 'Yolanda Centeno, José Luis Bernal, Almudena Martín de los Santos', 'Yolanda Centeno, Jesús Luque', 'Alexandra Jiménez, Juan Diego Botto, Ruth Gabriel, Álex Infantes, Tamara Arias de Saavedra, Stéphanie Magnin, Marisol Membrillo, Fran Cantos', null, 'Paula and Raúl, who live with Dani, a six-year-old boy, could be just another couple... They could be, except that the boy is not Paula''s son, and Paula faces the everyday challenge of proving that she deserves the title of mother. This conflict, along with the couple''s separation and, as a result, the possibility that Paula might never see Dani again, sets up a story that puts the pain of a child at the heart of it.', 'Paula and Raúl, who live with Dani, a six-year-old boy, could be just another couple... They could be, except that the boy is not Paula''s son, and Paula faces the everyday challenge of proving that she deserves the title of mother. This conflict, along with the couple''s separation and, as a result, the possibility that Paula might never see Dani again, sets up a story that puts the pain of a child at the heart of it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6QuOnj9x3gDbdLWAVIxuzZltEuf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1451288'),
  ('271757008535559377', 'The Sterile Cuckoo', 1969, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Alan J. Pakula, Milton Krasner, Newt Arnold', 'Alvin Sargent', 'Liza Minnelli, Wendell Burton, Tim McIntire, Anita Alberts, Eric Best, Chris Bugbee, Becki Davis, Philip S. Derfler', 'PG', 'Uptight college freshman Jerry Payne finds a carefree friend in zany Pookie. After an awkward meeting on the bus, Pookie quickly works her way into Jerry''s life. She makes an unannounced visit to Jerry''s campus, and before long annoyance turns to affection, and friendship turns to romance. But with Pookie''s increasingly neurotic behavior, how long can this love affair last?', 'Uptight college freshman Jerry Payne finds a carefree friend in zany Pookie. After an awkward meeting on the bus, Pookie quickly works her way into Jerry''s life. She makes an unannounced visit to Jerry''s campus, and before long annoyance turns to affection, and friendship turns to romance. But with Pookie''s increasingly neurotic behavior, how long can this love affair last?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8IP6hkHhmyVvgKPL8V37yjDMiAp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54494'),
  ('25034652258256588', 'The Stewardesses', 1969, 'Comedy', 'Al Silliman Jr., Chris J. Condon', 'Al Silliman Jr.', 'Christina Hart, Ronald South, William Condos, Anita de Moulin, Paula Erikson, Kathy Ferrick, Janet Wass, Donna Stanley', 'R', 'A single eventful night in the lives of a crew of Los Angeles-based, trans-Pacific stewardesses, as they experiment with drugs and engage in various sexual encounters. The Stewardesses is a 1969 Softcore 3-D film. Produced on a budget of just over $100,000, the film grossed over $27,000,000 (USD) in 1970 dollars, becoming the most profitable 3-D film ever released.', 'A single eventful night in the lives of a crew of Los Angeles-based, trans-Pacific stewardesses, as they experiment with drugs and engage in various sexual encounters. The Stewardesses is a 1969 Softcore 3-D film. Produced on a budget of just over $100,000, the film grossed over $27,000,000 (USD) in 1970 dollars, becoming the most profitable 3-D film ever released.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/otrgebmsmyFVXv2R5pWp3DqY9eQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70478'),
  ('1094513583776554952', 'The Stickleback''s Eggs', 1925, 'Documentary', 'Jean Painlevé', null, null, null, 'An educational film, a movie through a microscope, in two parts. Within minutes after the egg drops in the water, fertilization occurs and contractions start. Soon, in a fertilized egg, we see the germinal disc divide into two blastomeres. Divisions continue; contractions re-occur at the cap as it covers the egg. Title cards in French tell us what to watch for. Muscular movements and circulation appear; the heart beats. In part two, we see blood circulation begin as red cells develop on the surface of the yoke. They mass toward the heart. Arteries form, blood flows. The egg hatches and blood flows to new areas.', 'An educational film, a movie through a microscope, in two parts. Within minutes after the egg drops in the water, fertilization occurs and contractions start. Soon, in a fertilized egg, we see the germinal disc divide into two blastomeres. Divisions continue; contractions re-occur at the cap as it covers the egg. Title cards in French tell us what to watch for. Muscular movements and circulation appear; the heart beats. In part two, we see blood circulation begin as red cells develop on the surface of the yoke. They mass toward the heart. Arteries form, blood flows. The egg hatches and blood flows to new areas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rD7TorlzQ1pG08DmasbmAZLjcSy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163238'),
  ('240720702775181684', 'The Sticky Fingers of Time', 1997, 'Science Fiction, Drama', 'Hilary Brougher, Ethan Mass', 'Hilary Brougher', 'Terumi Matthews, Nicole Zaray, Belinda Becker, James Urbaniak, Thomas Pasley, Samantha Buck, Julie Anderson, Amanda Vogel', null, 'A sci-fi novelist in 1950s Brooklyn suddenly finds herself transported 40 years into the future. She quickly learns that she isn’t the only “timefreak,” and that her time may already be up.', 'A sci-fi novelist in 1950s Brooklyn suddenly finds herself transported 40 years into the future. She quickly learns that she isn’t the only “timefreak,” and that her time may already be up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rTyNAfz8znLPMzytmKGhvlXFee.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70687'),
  ('92786739874649922', 'The Sting', 1973, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'George Roy Hill, Robert Surtees, Charles Dismukes', 'David S. Ward', 'Paul Newman, Robert Redford, Robert Shaw, Charles Durning, Ray Walston, Eileen Brennan, Harold Gould, John Heffernan', 'PG', 'A novice con man teams up with an acknowledged master to avenge the murder of a mutual friend by pulling off the ultimate big con and swindling a fortune from a big-time mobster.', 'A novice con man teams up with an acknowledged master to avenge the murder of a mutual friend by pulling off the ultimate big con and swindling a fortune from a big-time mobster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ckmYng37zey8INYf6d10cVgIG93.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9277'),
  ('61614737506376888', 'The Sting II', 1983, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Jeremy Kagan, Bill Butler', 'David S. Ward, Dean Riesner', 'Jackie Gleason, Mac Davis, Teri Garr, Karl Malden, Oliver Reed, Bert Remsen, Kathalina Veniero, José Pérez', 'PG', 'Hooker and Gondorf pull a con on Macalinski, an especially nasty mob boss with the help of Veronica, a new grifter. They convince this new victim that Hooker is a somewhat dull boxer who is tired of taking dives for Gondorf. There is a ringer. Lonigan, their victim from the first movie, is setting them up to take the fall.', 'Hooker and Gondorf pull a con on Macalinski, an especially nasty mob boss with the help of Veronica, a new grifter. They convince this new victim that Hooker is a somewhat dull boxer who is tired of taking dives for Gondorf. There is a ringer. Lonigan, their victim from the first movie, is setting them up to take the fall.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oWySCxbLK4vB7BY5CzonJZuLYa7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36912'),
  ('464917801049989875', 'The Sting of Death', 1990, 'Drama', 'Kōhei Oguri, Shōhei Andō', 'Kōhei Oguri', 'Keiko Matsuzaka, Ittoku Kishibe, Midori Kiuchi, Takenori Matsumura, Yuri Chikamori, Akira Yamanouchi, Miyoko Nakamura, Seiko Kitamura', null, 'Miho and Toshio, putting their children and household at stake, duel for control in their degrading, middle-aged marriage.', 'Miho and Toshio, putting their children and household at stake, duel for control in their degrading, middle-aged marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dSLPZAgtze5DUTJJe4VX8Trl9lZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128775'),
  ('889320590983072834', 'The Stingiest Man in Town', 1978, 'Animation, TV Movie, Fantasy, Family', 'Jules Bass, Arthur Rankin, Jr., Katsuhisa Yamada', 'Romeo Muller, Janice Torre', 'Walter Matthau, Tom Bosley, Theodore Bikel, Robert Morse, Dennis Day, Paul Frees, Sonny Melendrez, Debra Clinger', null, 'An animated adaptation of A Christmas Carol from Arthur Rankin Jr. and Jules Bass -- the duo behind some of the most enduring Christmas specials ever (including Rudolph the Red-Nosed Reindeer). Reinvented as a 49-minute musical, this charming cartoon stars the voice of Walter Matthau as the bedeviled Scrooge and Tom Bosley as the Jiminy Cricket-type narrator, B. Humbug, Esq. It features animation by Japanese studio Topcraft, known for their work on other Rankin/Bass films such as The Hobbit, The Flight of Dragons, and The Last Unicorn.', 'An animated adaptation of A Christmas Carol from Arthur Rankin Jr. and Jules Bass -- the duo behind some of the most enduring Christmas specials ever (including Rudolph the Red-Nosed Reindeer). Reinvented as a 49-minute musical, this charming cartoon stars the voice of Walter Matthau as the bedeviled Scrooge and Tom Bosley as the Jiminy Cricket-type narrator, B. Humbug, Esq. It features animation by Japanese studio Topcraft, known for their work on other Rankin/Bass films such as The Hobbit, The Flight of Dragons, and The Last Unicorn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9fg5lZyW2FPMLAnaYoGFEVyJrS8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46044'),
  ('477743882176181541', 'The Stoker', 2010, 'Drama, Crime', 'Aleksei Balabanov, Aleksandr Simonov, Maksim Belovolov', 'Aleksei Balabanov', 'Mikhail Skryabin, Yuri Matveyev, Aleksandr Mosin, Aida Tumutova, Anna Korotayeva, Filipp Dyachkov, Vyacheslav Pavlyut, Vyacheslav Telnov', null, 'A shell-shocked Afghanistan war hero named Ivan Skryabin (Mikhail Skryabin) spends his days stoking the fire in a giant coal furnace. When he isn’t tending the flames, he keeps busy with other activities. He works on a historical novel. His adult daughter Sasha (Aida Tumutova) comes to visit. Local kids come to gaze at the flames. Gangsters, including a former Army sergeant (Aleksandr Mosin) and a sniper known as Bison (Yuri Matveyev), drop by to add special kindling to the fire.', 'A shell-shocked Afghanistan war hero named Ivan Skryabin (Mikhail Skryabin) spends his days stoking the fire in a giant coal furnace. When he isn’t tending the flames, he keeps busy with other activities. He works on a historical novel. His adult daughter Sasha (Aida Tumutova) comes to visit. Local kids come to gaze at the flames. Gangsters, including a former Army sergeant (Aleksandr Mosin) and a sniper known as Bison (Yuri Matveyev), drop by to add special kindling to the fire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k5Zd5PwXbGDwt0bvNTc1eBY1JGJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56212'),
  ('653556223944840621', 'The Stolen', 2017, 'Western, Action, Adventure, Drama', 'Niall Johnson, Alun Bollinger', 'Niall Johnson, Emily Corcoran', 'Alice Eve, Jack Davenport, Graham McTavish, Richard O''Brien, Cohen Holloway, Glen Levy, Gillian MacGregor, Stig Eldred', null, 'The story of a woman who must find her kidnapped son, navigating a world she doesn''t know, on the edge of danger with every heartbeat.', 'The story of a woman who must find her kidnapped son, navigating a world she doesn''t know, on the edge of danger with every heartbeat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lOdfW2FXC6Em4b9IL4TXkzhpSsK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:484238'),
  ('529546999196245744', 'The Stolen Airship', 1967, 'Adventure, Science Fiction, Animation', 'Karel Zeman, Milan Vácha, Karel Kovář', 'Karel Zeman, Radovan Krátký', 'Michal Pospíšil, Hanuš Bor, Jan Čížek, Josef Stráník, Jan Malát, Jitka Zelenohorská, Čestmír Řanda, Stanislav Šimek', null, 'Five young people take off in a lighter-than-air machine at the Prague Centennial Exhibition. A live-action/animated film based loosely on Jules Verne''s novels Two Years'' Vacation and The Mysterious Island. The film in Art Nouveau style consists of live-action scenes, generally shot in black and white, as well as hand-drawn, stop-motion, and cutout animation. Various live-action and animated elements are often composited into the same scene.', 'Five young people take off in a lighter-than-air machine at the Prague Centennial Exhibition. A live-action/animated film based loosely on Jules Verne''s novels Two Years'' Vacation and The Mysterious Island. The film in Art Nouveau style consists of live-action scenes, generally shot in black and white, as well as hand-drawn, stop-motion, and cutout animation. Various live-action and animated elements are often composited into the same scene.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s7s1tbAeEd3oHvgWh6mCi50m6nR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71504'),
  ('836435098901487585', 'The Stolen Caravaggio', 2018, 'Drama', 'Roberto Andò', 'Angelo Pasquini, Roberto Andò', 'Micaela Ramazzotti, Renato Carpentieri, Laura Morante, Jerzy Skolimowski, Antonio Catania, Marco Foschi, Martina Pensa, Renato Scarpa', null, 'Valeria, young secretary of a producer, lives with an eccentric mother and secretly writes for a successful screenwriter, Alessandro. One day, she receives an unusual present from a stranger: it’s the plot of a movie about the mysterious but really-happened theft of a famous Caravaggio’s painting.', 'Valeria, young secretary of a producer, lives with an eccentric mother and secretly writes for a successful screenwriter, Alessandro. One day, she receives an unusual present from a stranger: it’s the plot of a movie about the mysterious but really-happened theft of a famous Caravaggio’s painting.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oiMzn20dKb7iyCApanA4ujUsIP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:536070'),
  ('1147171087855214532', 'The Stolen Children', 1992, 'Drama', 'Gianni Amelio, Renato Tafuri, Tonino Nardi', 'Gianni Amelio, Sandro Petraglia, Stefano Rulli', 'Enrico Lo Verso, Valentina Scalici, Giuseppe Ieracitano, Marina Golovine, Florence Darel, Vitalba Andrea, Massimo De Lorenzo, Renato Carpentieri', null, 'Antonio, a policeman (carabiniere), has an order to take two children (Rosetta and her brother Luciano) from Milan to Sicily to an orphanage. Their mother has been arrested for forcing Rosetta (11 years old) to work as a prostitute. First the relation between Antonio and the children is tough, but it relaxes so they become temporary friends.', 'Antonio, a policeman (carabiniere), has an order to take two children (Rosetta and her brother Luciano) from Milan to Sicily to an orphanage. Their mother has been arrested for forcing Rosetta (11 years old) to work as a prostitute. First the relation between Antonio and the children is tough, but it relaxes so they become temporary friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fkFYNR4iCz5n1j5Drf0jejKmNVb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47714'),
  ('1038478529906131431', 'The Stolen Death', 1938, 'Thriller', 'Nyrki Tapiovaara, Erik Blomberg, Olavi Gunnari', 'Erik Blomberg, Eino Mäkinen', 'Tuulikki Paananen, Ilmari Mänty, Santeri Karilo, Annie Mörk, Bertha Lindberg, Hertta Leistén, Ahti H. Einola, Jalmari Parikka', null, 'A group of Finnish activists are waging an underground war against Russian oppression led by young idealistic aristocrat Robert Hedman.', 'A group of Finnish activists are waging an underground war against Russian oppression led by young idealistic aristocrat Robert Hedman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mxuOHdbgNjwj7SdkvkchBJXK6uX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106742'),
  ('460978296077060464', 'The Stolen Diary', 1993, 'Drama, Romance', 'Romain Winding, Christine Lipinska', 'Bernard Revon, Christine Lipinska', 'Élodie Bouchez, Edwige Navarro, Benoît Magimel, Malcolm Conrath, Serge Avédikian, Marie Rivière, Laurence Calame, Anne-Marie Pisani', null, 'A young woman in a lesbian relationship keeps a diary that is stolen by a young man who loves her.', 'A young woman in a lesbian relationship keeps a diary that is stolen by a young man who loves her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oJN0UENZHAlD9bFzs0NGQ0Ctu6t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66973'),
  ('718531746723597607', 'The Stolen Jools', 1931, 'Comedy', 'William C. McGann, Harold S. Bucquet, Thomas Atkins', 'Henry Myers, Percy Heath, Al Boasberg', 'Norma Shearer, Richard Barthelmess, Warner Baxter, Matthew Beard, Wallace Beery, El Brendel, Joe E. Brown, Charles Butterworth', 'NR', 'Famous actress Norma Shearer''s jewels are stolen… (Star-packed promotional short film intended to raise funds for the National Variety Artists Tuberculosis Sanatorium.)', 'Famous actress Norma Shearer''s jewels are stolen… (Star-packed promotional short film intended to raise funds for the National Variety Artists Tuberculosis Sanatorium.)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AwtWbIO21T83FNcI60SaNmXOfKg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53572'),
  ('458750984748845392', 'The Stolen Princess', 2018, 'Animation, Comedy, Adventure, Family', 'Oleh Malamuzh', 'Yaroslav Voytseshek', 'Nadya Dorofeeva, Oleksii Zavgorodnii, Yevhen Malukha, Oleh Mykhailiuta, Mykola Boklan, Serhii Prytula, Yurii Horbunov, Roman Lutskyi', 'NR', 'This wonderful story happened in the age of valiant knights, beautiful princesses, and battling sorcerers. Ruslan, a wandering artist dreaming to become a knight, met beautiful Mila and fell in love with her; he didn’t even suspect that she is the King’s daughter. However, the lovers’ happiness wasn’t meant to last too long. Chernomor, the evil sorcerer, appeared in a magic vortex and stole Mila right before Ruslan’s eyes to transform her power of love into his own magic power. Without further ado, Ruslan sets out on a chase after the stolen princess to overcome all obstacles and to prove that real love is stronger than magic.', 'This wonderful story happened in the age of valiant knights, beautiful princesses, and battling sorcerers. Ruslan, a wandering artist dreaming to become a knight, met beautiful Mila and fell in love with her; he didn’t even suspect that she is the King’s daughter. However, the lovers’ happiness wasn’t meant to last too long. Chernomor, the evil sorcerer, appeared in a magic vortex and stole Mila right before Ruslan’s eyes to transform her power of love into his own magic power. Without further ado, Ruslan sets out on a chase after the stolen princess to overcome all obstacles and to prove that real love is stronger than magic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jJaRhOk9FaPTIqP8L4NqnOYEXHo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:463116'),
  ('1088903626264860410', 'The Stolen Years', 1998, 'Drama, Adventure', 'Fernando Colomo', null, 'Jordi Mollà, Ernesto Alterio, Hedy Burress, Allison Smith, Juan Echanove, Josep Maria Pou, Samuel Le Bihan, Pepón Nieto', null, 'Two students are arrested for painting revolutionary graffiti on the university walls. They escape from the camp and flee with two American girls, disguised as rich young men who are showing Spain to two tourists.', 'Two students are arrested for painting revolutionary graffiti on the university walls. They escape from the camp and flee with two American girls, disguised as rich young men who are showing Spain to two tourists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9qRq6MTKpEx0oXBKkFaC3UJPJ8Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117906'),
  ('658244096245390760', 'The Stolen Years', 2013, 'Romance', 'Barbara Wong Chun-Chun', 'Shanyu Zheng, Barbara Wong Chun-Chun, Yingyan Hou', 'Bai Baihe, Joseph Chang, Christine Fan, Ken Lin, Amber An, Gardner Tse Kwan-Ho, Queenie Tai, Deng Ziyi', null, 'He Man awakes from a coma thinking that she’s still on her honeymoon with her husband Xie Yu, but she gets a rude shock: there’s a five-year gap in her memory, and during that time the couple has divorced. Confused and desperate to figure out how their marriage crumbled, He Man seeks out her ex-husband and her ex-best-friend for answers.', 'He Man awakes from a coma thinking that she’s still on her honeymoon with her husband Xie Yu, but she gets a rude shock: there’s a five-year gap in her memory, and during that time the couple has divorced. Confused and desperate to figure out how their marriage crumbled, He Man seeks out her ex-husband and her ex-best-friend for answers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bQPAJcXbpWL2pxu2tcY1cCtyrIa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:221112'),
  ('810666699002298782', 'The Stone', 2025, 'Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Arak Amornsupasiri, Kitsada Nakagate, Yodchai Phachanee', 'Paween Purijitpanya, Arak Amornsupasiri, Wutthiphong Sukanin', 'Jinjett Wattanasin, Korranid Laosubinprasoet, Noppol Gomarachun, Chulachak Chakrabongse, Itkron Pungkiatrussamee, Grisana Punpeng, Narubeth Jinpinpetch, Somjet Payakso', null, 'When Ake desperately needs money to pay for his gravely ill father''s medical treatment, he takes his father''s sacred amulet to be appraised by the renowned expert Seng Paradise.', 'When Ake desperately needs money to pay for his gravely ill father''s medical treatment, he takes his father''s sacred amulet to be appraised by the renowned expert Seng Paradise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7oEw3gXpu4mDbAufQZrlvflYphM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1278965'),
  ('809596344722302352', 'The Stone Angel', 2007, 'Drama', 'Kari Skogland, Bobby Bukowski', 'Kari Skogland', 'Ellen Burstyn, Christine Horne, Cole Hauser, Kevin Zegers, Elliot Page, Dylan Baker, Wings Hauser, Jordan Todosey', 'R', 'The feisty aging Hagar Shipley has lived an unconventional life. Her rebellious heart has always ruled and her choices have put her at odds with family and friends. Faced with her own mortality, and desperate to find solace, she goes on the run. In both the past and the present, she is forced to come to terms with the pain and pleasure, the disappointments and the exhilarations of her life.', 'The feisty aging Hagar Shipley has lived an unconventional life. Her rebellious heart has always ruled and her choices have put her at odds with family and friends. Faced with her own mortality, and desperate to find solace, she goes on the run. In both the past and the present, she is forced to come to terms with the pain and pleasure, the disappointments and the exhilarations of her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iUmjFO2ZjdbqLvSyX4CENOY1aRI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14634'),
  ('688976806773299337', 'The Stone Council', 2006, 'Adventure, Crime, Drama, Fantasy, Mystery, Thriller', 'Guillaume Nicloux, Peter Suschitzky', 'Jean-Christophe Grangé, Guillaume Nicloux, Stéphane Cabel', 'Monica Bellucci, Catherine Deneuve, Moritz Bleibtreu, Sami Bouajila, Elsa Zylberstein, Nicolas Thau, Lorenzo Balducci, Nicolas Jouhet', null, 'In France, the single translator Diane Siprien adopts an Asian baby named Liu-San in a foundation directed by Sybille Weber. Years later, a weird mark appears on the boy''s chest and Diane and Liu share their dreadful nightmares. Diane is assigned for a three-day job in Germany and she leaves Liu with her friend Sybille. However, while going to the airport, Diane finds Liu hidden in the backseat and startles with an eagle flying toward the windshield, crashing her car. Liu falls into a coma and his digital recorder records the boy speaking in an unknown dialect. When Diane searches the translation and the origins of Liu, she is surrounded by mysterious murders. She discovers that the dialect is from the mystic Mongolian Tseven tribe and that Liu is a powerful Observer; further, he is in danger, threatened by sorcerers that need the boy for their Council of the Stone..', 'In France, the single translator Diane Siprien adopts an Asian baby named Liu-San in a foundation directed by Sybille Weber. Years later, a weird mark appears on the boy''s chest and Diane and Liu share their dreadful nightmares. Diane is assigned for a three-day job in Germany and she leaves Liu with her friend Sybille. However, while going to the airport, Diane finds Liu hidden in the backseat and startles with an eagle flying toward the windshield, crashing her car. Liu falls into a coma and his digital recorder records the boy speaking in an unknown dialect. When Diane searches the translation and the origins of Liu, she is surrounded by mysterious murders. She discovers that the dialect is from the mystic Mongolian Tseven tribe and that Liu is a powerful Observer; further, he is in danger, threatened by sorcerers that need the boy for their Council of the Stone..', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9hFKhOI7bUnkXjE2gbG2bpFSVh9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21775'),
  ('397418560737197914', 'The Stone Cross', 1968, 'Drama, History', 'Leonid Osyka, Valeriy Kvas', 'Ivan Drach', 'Danylo Ilchenko, Kateryna Mateyko, Boryslav Brondukov, Ivan Mykolaichuk, Kostiantyn Stepankov, Vasyl Symchych, Borys Savchenko, Oleksa Atamanyuk', null, 'In 1890s Western Ukraine, Ivan Didukh, a proud and ripe Galician farmer, has decided to abandon his ancestral home to emigrate to Canada in search of a better life. His final hours are clouded by both internal and communal discord as his village convenes to ceremonially mark his departure. The celebrations that echo those of a funeral, forecast the imminent death of a man estranged from his motherland, and of an antiquated way of life on the cusp of obsoletion.', 'In 1890s Western Ukraine, Ivan Didukh, a proud and ripe Galician farmer, has decided to abandon his ancestral home to emigrate to Canada in search of a better life. His final hours are clouded by both internal and communal discord as his village convenes to ceremonially mark his departure. The celebrations that echo those of a funeral, forecast the imminent death of a man estranged from his motherland, and of an antiquated way of life on the cusp of obsoletion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uHTNi0wosZH1AfzYifSuYanNFDG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:249586'),
  ('443809832556949810', 'The Stone Eater', 2018, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Nicola Bellucci', null, 'Luigi Lo Cascio, Vincenzo Crea, Bruno Todeschini, Ursina Lardi, Leonardo Nigro', null, 'In a small mountain valley in Italy, the former criminal Cesare discovers the corpse of his nephew Fausto.', 'In a small mountain valley in Italy, the former criminal Cesare discovers the corpse of his nephew Fausto.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v7v8iXx6UVmzRk0W9Bo0sDtu5lj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:551369'),
  ('698140103690775435', 'The Stone Flower', 1946, 'Fantasy, Family', 'Aleksandr Ptushko, Fyodor Provorov, A. Slobodnik', 'Pavel Bazhov, Iosif Keller', 'Vladimir Druzhnikov, Yekaterina Derevshchikova, Tamara Makarova, Mikhail Troyanovsky, Mikhail Yanshin, Aleksandr Kleberer, Serafim Zaytsev, Lidiya Deikun', null, 'This remarkable film is based on P. Bazhov’s fairy tale “The Malachite Box”. Little Danila was the most inquisitive apprentice of old Prokopich, a famous stone-carving master. Years passed… Like his teacher, the grown-up Danila has learned to feel the soul of his material and became an expert in handling rare precious stones found in the Ural Mountains. One day he met the Mistress of the Copper Mountain, a fairy who ordered for herself an unusual stone flower.', 'This remarkable film is based on P. Bazhov’s fairy tale “The Malachite Box”. Little Danila was the most inquisitive apprentice of old Prokopich, a famous stone-carving master. Years passed… Like his teacher, the grown-up Danila has learned to feel the soul of his material and became an expert in handling rare precious stones found in the Ural Mountains. One day he met the Mistress of the Copper Mountain, a fairy who ordered for herself an unusual stone flower.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iXdo4gXPXVF5EmgWjvAFnx3hOw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14495'),
  ('647158010916905471', 'The Stone Killer', 1973, 'Crime, Action', 'Michael Winner, Richard Moore, Mel Efros', 'Gerald Wilson', 'Charles Bronson, Martin Balsam, Jack Colvin, Paul Koslo, Norman Fell, David Sheiner, Stuart Margolin, Ralph Waite', 'R', 'A Los Angeles detective is sent to New York where he must solve a case involving an old Sicilian Mafia family feud.', 'A Los Angeles detective is sent to New York where he must solve a case involving an old Sicilian Mafia family feud.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4q5gLjMEfV0JV10KK59Lfp2kuX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26202'),
  ('254025974828715595', 'The Stone Raft', 2002, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'George Sluizer', 'George Sluizer, Yvette Biro', 'Federico Luppi, Icíar Bollaín, Gabino Diego, Ana Padrão, Diogo Infante, Antonia San Juan, Simon Chandler, Marques D''Arede', null, 'An inexplicable crack in the Pyrenees Mountains provokes excitement and scientific curiosity. As the geological fracture deepens and widens, the European community begins to disassociate itself from the calamity, and panic ensues among tourists and residents attempting to escape. When Spain and Portugal physically separate from the continent, the detached Iberian peninsula aimlessly floats off to sea, becoming home to a group of god-like humans.', 'An inexplicable crack in the Pyrenees Mountains provokes excitement and scientific curiosity. As the geological fracture deepens and widens, the European community begins to disassociate itself from the calamity, and panic ensues among tourists and residents attempting to escape. When Spain and Portugal physically separate from the continent, the detached Iberian peninsula aimlessly floats off to sea, becoming home to a group of god-like humans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r7N1EXTQFdo5UgUjOoK54oWIBr0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95647'),
  ('845757745484596297', 'The Stone Tape', 1972, 'Horror, TV Movie, Mystery, Drama', 'Peter Sasdy, Robert Wright', 'Nigel Kneale', 'Michael Bryant, Jane Asher, Iain Cuthbertson, Michael Bates, Reginald Marsh, Tom Chadbon, John Forgeham, Philip Trewinnard', null, 'A research team from an electronics company move into an old Victorian house to start work on finding a new recording medium. When team member Jill Greeley witnesses a ghost, team director Peter Brock decides not only to analyse the apparition, which he believes is a psychic impression trapped in a stone wall (dubbed a "stone tape"), but to exorcise it too - with terrifying results...', 'A research team from an electronics company move into an old Victorian house to start work on finding a new recording medium. When team member Jill Greeley witnesses a ghost, team director Peter Brock decides not only to analyse the apparition, which he believes is a psychic impression trapped in a stone wall (dubbed a "stone tape"), but to exorcise it too - with terrifying results...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oNa0LrdaOCZUFmSJZviBHBoXepZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41032'),
  ('615495284812186910', 'The Stone Wedding', 1973, 'Drama', 'Mircea Veroiu, Dan Pița, Domnica Radulescu', 'Dan Pița, Mircea Veroiu', 'Leopoldina Bălănuță, Eliza Petrăchescu, Nina Doniga, Adrian Georgescu, Mircea Diaconu, Radu Boruzescu, Petre Gheorghiu, Ursula Nussbacher', null, 'Two bleak stories about absent love. In the first, a widow is working hard in a desperate attempt to save her dying daughter. The second tells the story of two wandering singers who kidnap a bride from her wedding.', 'Two bleak stories about absent love. In the first, a widow is working hard in a desperate attempt to save her dying daughter. The second tells the story of two wandering singers who kidnap a bride from her wedding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uf6qaASF0mw9TFDPuS8Lrewv7Oa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:244560'),
  ('1131221402329729231', 'The Stonebreaker', 2020, 'Drama', 'Massimiliano De Serio, Gianluca De Serio, Antoine Héberlé', 'Gianluca De Serio, Massimiliano De Serio', 'Salvatore Esposito, Samuele Carrino, Antonella Carone, Giuseppe Lo Console, Vito Signorile, Licia Lanera', null, 'After a serious accident Giuseppe is out of work. His son Antò dreams of being an archaeologist and thinks his father''s glass eye is a sign he has superpowers. It''s just the two of them now, since their beloved wife and mother Angela collapsed and died while working in the fields. Now they''ve lost their home, too, and have taken shelter in a tent city with other seasonal workers. Through all this, Giuseppe still summons up the strength to hug his son every night and tell him a story. He''s promised Antò he will have his mother back, one day, and will do anything to keep his promise.', 'After a serious accident Giuseppe is out of work. His son Antò dreams of being an archaeologist and thinks his father''s glass eye is a sign he has superpowers. It''s just the two of them now, since their beloved wife and mother Angela collapsed and died while working in the fields. Now they''ve lost their home, too, and have taken shelter in a tent city with other seasonal workers. Through all this, Giuseppe still summons up the strength to hug his son every night and tell him a story. He''s promised Antò he will have his mother back, one day, and will do anything to keep his promise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lhKzxRXY9DU70fWNFcn4OZ8gnPQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:727001'),
  ('289706094093729857', 'The Stöned Age', 1994, 'Comedy', 'James Melkonian, Paul Holahan', 'James Melkonian, Rich Wilkes', 'Michael Kopelow, China Kantner, Renee Griffin, Clifton Collins Jr., David Groh, Michael Wiseman, Bradford Tatum, Kevin Kilner', 'R', 'Determined to avoid another night of driving aimlessly around Torrance in the Blue Torpedo, Joe and Hubbs set out on a quest for fine chicks. Their paths soon cross with Tack, from whom they learn about a pair of foreign radical chicks hanging out near the Frankie Avalon place. Over Joe''s objections, Hubbs worms Tack out of the deal, and the pair take a slow ride toward their destiny.', 'Determined to avoid another night of driving aimlessly around Torrance in the Blue Torpedo, Joe and Hubbs set out on a quest for fine chicks. Their paths soon cross with Tack, from whom they learn about a pair of foreign radical chicks hanging out near the Frankie Avalon place. Over Joe''s objections, Hubbs worms Tack out of the deal, and the pair take a slow ride toward their destiny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kamyDHHWjIkW35M0d0lJ2RzXjhp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20860'),
  ('83286277029385013', 'The Stoneman Murders', 2009, 'Crime', 'Manish Gupta', null, 'Kay Kay Menon, Arbaaz Khan, Rukhsar Rehman, Vikram Gokhale, Veerendra Saxena, Ashraf Ul Haq', null, 'In 1980s Bombay, a serial killer starts targeting homeless street dwellers, whilst a suspended police officer attempts to solve the case.', 'In 1980s Bombay, a serial killer starts targeting homeless street dwellers, whilst a suspended police officer attempts to solve the case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eeAFUCp1VKvxHq6wXbmWwjdDn7j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85708'),
  ('821519401938417139', 'The Stoning of Soraya M.', 2009, 'Crime, Drama', 'Cyrus Nowrasteh, Joel Ransom, Matthew J. Clark', 'Betsy Giffen Nowrasteh, Cyrus Nowrasteh', 'Shohreh Aghdashloo, Mozhan Navabi, Jim Caviezel, Navid Negahban, Ali Pourtash, David Diaan, Parviz Sayyad, Vida Ghahremani', null, 'In 1986 Iran, Sahebjam, whose car breaks down in a remote village, enters into a conversation with Zahra, who relays to him the story about her niece, Soraya, whose arranged marriage to an abusive tyrant ended in tragedy.', 'In 1986 Iran, Sahebjam, whose car breaks down in a remote village, enters into a conversation with Zahra, who relays to him the story about her niece, Soraya, whose arranged marriage to an abusive tyrant ended in tragedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m4CfYBh1ZnYqZbt7ziYjHf53P4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33409'),
  ('542502334042134755', 'The Stooge', 1951, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Norman Taurog, Daniel L. Fapp, Joseph J. Lilley', 'Fred F. Finklehoffe, Martin Rackin', 'Dean Martin, Jerry Lewis, Polly Bergen, Marion Marshall, Eddie Mayehoff, Richard Erdman, Frances Bavier, Percy Helton', 'G', 'Bill Miller is an unsuccessful Broadway performer until his handlers convince him to enhance his act with a stooge—Ted Rogers, a guy positioned in the audience to be the butt of Bill''s jokes. After Ted begins to steal the show, Bill''s girlfriend and his pals advise him to make Ted an equal partner.', 'Bill Miller is an unsuccessful Broadway performer until his handlers convince him to enhance his act with a stooge—Ted Rogers, a guy positioned in the audience to be the butt of Bill''s jokes. After Ted begins to steal the show, Bill''s girlfriend and his pals advise him to make Ted an equal partner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cskQxPZ9hvOAnfnmhfvMMmplIeI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58182'),
  ('566736278623880423', 'The Stool Pigeon', 2010, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Kenny Tse Chung-To, Dante Lam Chiu-Yin', 'Dante Lam Chiu-Yin', 'Nicholas Tse Ting-Fung, Nick Cheung Ka-Fai, Gwei Lun-mei, Miao Pu, Liu Kai-Chi, Lu Yi, Philip Keung Ho-Man, Lau Kong', null, 'Living in the guilt of sacrificing his informant in a previous operation, Criminal Intelligence Inspector Don Lee is wary when his superior orders him to send another informant to spy on the criminal operations of Barbarian, a vicious gangster plotting a jewelry heist. He seeks ex-convict Ghost, who agrees to work for Don despite vowing to go straight since he''s desperately in need of money to repay a debt and save his sister. Ghost''s driving skills help him infiltrate Barbarian''s gang and earn his trust, but by feeding information to Don and hooking up with Barbarian''s girlfriend Dee, Ghost is pushing himself into a tight and deadly corner...', 'Living in the guilt of sacrificing his informant in a previous operation, Criminal Intelligence Inspector Don Lee is wary when his superior orders him to send another informant to spy on the criminal operations of Barbarian, a vicious gangster plotting a jewelry heist. He seeks ex-convict Ghost, who agrees to work for Don despite vowing to go straight since he''s desperately in need of money to repay a debt and save his sister. Ghost''s driving skills help him infiltrate Barbarian''s gang and earn his trust, but by feeding information to Don and hooking up with Barbarian''s girlfriend Dee, Ghost is pushing himself into a tight and deadly corner...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yWZJOHIOy3osra6fwX8RpzFKFtu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48417'),
  ('843036052354779453', 'The Stopover', 2016, 'Drama, War', 'Jean-Louis Vialard, Muriel Coulin, Delphine Coulin', 'Muriel Coulin, Delphine Coulin', 'Soko, Ariane Labed, Ginger Romàn, Karim Leklou, Andreas Konstantinou, Makis Papadimitriou, Alexis Manenti, Robin Barde', null, 'At the end of their tour of duty in Afghanistan, two young military women, Aurore and Marine, are given three days of decompression leave with their unit at a five-star resort in Cyprus, among tourists. But it''s not that easy to forget the war and leave the violence behind.', 'At the end of their tour of duty in Afghanistan, two young military women, Aurore and Marine, are given three days of decompression leave with their unit at a five-star resort in Cyprus, among tourists. But it''s not that easy to forget the war and leave the violence behind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sni2LE3RQjKJ2iMmccLgYo0KCnW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:392788'),
  ('623679758934549528', 'The Store', 1983, 'Documentary', 'Frederick Wiseman, John Davey', null, 'Art Buchwald, Lady Bird Johnson', null, 'THE STORE is a film about the main Neiman-Marcus store and corporate headquarters in Dallas. The sequences in the film include the selection, presentation, marketing, pricing, advertising and selling of a vast array of consumer products including designer clothes and furs, jewelry, perfumes, shoes, electronic products, sportswear, china and porcelain and many other goods. The internal management and organizational aspects of a large corporation are shown, i.e., sales meetings, development of marketing and advertising strategies, training, personnel practices and sales techniques.', 'THE STORE is a film about the main Neiman-Marcus store and corporate headquarters in Dallas. The sequences in the film include the selection, presentation, marketing, pricing, advertising and selling of a vast array of consumer products including designer clothes and furs, jewelry, perfumes, shoes, electronic products, sportswear, china and porcelain and many other goods. The internal management and organizational aspects of a large corporation are shown, i.e., sales meetings, development of marketing and advertising strategies, training, personnel practices and sales techniques.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2A01SAII7gq2xNZVlseGXj1VW98.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110777'),
  ('343166208206511612', 'The Storied Life of A.J. Fikry', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Hans Canosa, Conrad de la Torres III, Roger Mendoza', 'Gabrielle Zevin', 'Kunal Nayyar, Lucy Hale, Christina Hendricks, David Arquette, Scott Foley, Lauren Stamile, Mia Sinclair Jenness, Chase Ramsey', 'PG-13', 'This comical love story follows the story of A.J. Fikry, whose life is not at all what he expected it to be. His wife has died, his bookstore is experiencing the worst sales in its history and now his prized possession, a rare edition of Poe poems, has been stolen. He’s given up on people and even the books in his store offer another reminder that the world is changing too rapidly. But when a mysterious package arrives at the store, it gives Fikry the chance to make his life over and see things anew.', 'This comical love story follows the story of A.J. Fikry, whose life is not at all what he expected it to be. His wife has died, his bookstore is experiencing the worst sales in its history and now his prized possession, a rare edition of Poe poems, has been stolen. He’s given up on people and even the books in his store offer another reminder that the world is changing too rapidly. But when a mysterious package arrives at the store, it gives Fikry the chance to make his life over and see things anew.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jBAYPL15J3BecGujAydLZ1a06mF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:841733'),
  ('394783757432126194', 'The Stork Club', 1945, 'Comedy, Music', 'Hal Walker, Charles Lang', 'Jack McGowan, Buddy G. DeSylva', 'Betty Hutton, Barry Fitzgerald, Don DeFore, Robert Benchley, Bill Goodwin, Iris Adrian, Mikhail Rasumny, Mary Young', null, 'After aspiring singer Judy Peabody rescues the elderly J.B. Bates from drowning, she assumes that the disheveled man is a vagrant and goes back to her job checking hats at New York City''s famed Stork Club. But Bates is actually a grateful millionaire who becomes Judy''s anonymous benefactor, and before long the working girl is swathed in minks and diamonds, much to the dismay of her suspicious beau.', 'After aspiring singer Judy Peabody rescues the elderly J.B. Bates from drowning, she assumes that the disheveled man is a vagrant and goes back to her job checking hats at New York City''s famed Stork Club. But Bates is actually a grateful millionaire who becomes Judy''s anonymous benefactor, and before long the working girl is swathed in minks and diamonds, much to the dismay of her suspicious beau.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tNFEuqL5sLuXNPSNxhxrqp2DKxw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151017'),
  ('472787032448848381', 'The Stork''s Mistake', 1993, 'Adventure, Comedy', 'María Elena Velasco', null, 'María Elena Velasco, Sebastian Ligarde, Malena Doria, Pedro Gamez, Claudio Brook, Morris Gilbert, Irma Dorantes, Ernesto Gómez Cruz', null, 'India María raises a kidnapped newborn and is pursued by criminals who want the boy.', 'India María raises a kidnapped newborn and is pursued by criminals who want the boy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3qaSgsAxHbQrFn9oO1yN8nsHjNg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:351750'),
  ('280864654202122159', 'The Storm', 2008, 'Drama', 'Kazım Öz', 'Kazım Öz', 'Cahit Gök, Havin Funda Saç, Mehmet Selim Akgul, Asiye Dinçsoy, Kadim Yaşar, Bertan Dirikolu, Engin Emre Değer, Volga Sorgu', null, 'Cemal comes to Istanbul from a small Kurdish town after finishing high-school to pursue higher education. He feels isolated and out of place in the crowded city and soon meets a group Kurdish students who are against the repressive Turkish political system.', 'Cemal comes to Istanbul from a small Kurdish town after finishing high-school to pursue higher education. He feels isolated and out of place in the crowded city and soon meets a group Kurdish students who are against the repressive Turkish political system.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gKoRmApXTKHzoy3NTJvY2QDZA07.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:402304'),
  ('1075239691671556363', 'The Storm', 2009, 'Drama', 'Ben Sombogaart, Piotr Kukla', 'Rik Launspach', 'Sylvia Hoeks, Barry Atsma, Dirk Roofthooft, Monic Hendrickx, Sanne den Hartogh, Katja Herbers, Bas Keijzer, Lottie Hellingman', null, 'A fictional story within the historical context of the disastrous flood that engulfed the Dutch coastal province of Zeeland in 1953. When their farmhouse is destroyed by the flood, teenage mother Julia gets separated from her baby boy, whom she kept hidden in a box. She is saved from drowning by a young air force lieutenant, who agrees to go help looking for Julia''s little son.', 'A fictional story within the historical context of the disastrous flood that engulfed the Dutch coastal province of Zeeland in 1953. When their farmhouse is destroyed by the flood, teenage mother Julia gets separated from her baby boy, whom she kept hidden in a box. She is saved from drowning by a young air force lieutenant, who agrees to go help looking for Julia''s little son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6tUtLfBhI9HTpOFdviuzPR2XTal.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29602'),
  ('533716726151957140', 'The Storm', 2024, 'Animation, Fantasy, Action, Adventure', 'Busifan, Li Danfeng', 'Busifan', 'Chen Hao, Xingliner, He Ziqian, Liang Sheng, Joseph, Li Nan, 一舟, Zhang Yunqi', null, 'Poverty-stricken Daguzi encounters a child - Mantou - floating downstream at the river bank, he decides to take him by his side as his son, with compassion and affection.', 'Poverty-stricken Daguzi encounters a child - Mantou - floating downstream at the river bank, he decides to take him by his side as his son, with compassion and affection.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rIwxNjhl0ndF0V5zrYGdwplAJAU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1026821'),
  ('109736535182145908', 'The Storm Riders', 1998, 'Fantasy, Action, Adventure, Drama', 'Andrew Lau Wai-Keung, Andrew Lau Wai-Keung', 'Manfred Wong Man-Chun', 'Aaron Kwok, Ekin Cheng Yee-Kin, Sonny Chiba, Kristy Yang Rongru, Shu Qi, Anthony Wong Chau-Sang, Alex Fong Chung-Sun, Michael Tse Tin-Wah', null, 'Heeding a prophecy, a warlord trains two orphans after killing their parents. But the skills he teaches could lead to his downfall.', 'Heeding a prophecy, a warlord trains two orphans after killing their parents. But the skills he teaches could lead to his downfall.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9vLOmW27iY3oHLPknNwMGxfa0IT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2137'),
  ('239539258369007188', 'The Storm Warriors', 2009, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Oxide Pang Chun, Danny Pang Phat, Cub Chin Kong-Hon', 'Danny Pang Phat, Oxide Pang Chun, Timax Wong', 'Aaron Kwok, Ekin Cheng Yee-Kin, Charlene Choi Chuek-Yin, Nicholas Tse Ting-Fung, Tang Yan, Simon Yam, Kenny Ho Ka-King, Patrick Tam Yiu-Man', 'PG-13', 'Wind and Cloud find themselves up against a ruthless Japanese warlord intent on invading China.', 'Wind and Cloud find themselves up against a ruthless Japanese warlord intent on invading China.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rbziEQVh5qvFAeBCWCObfZlB0ea.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32654'),
  ('1112425071872353195', 'The Storm Within', 1948, 'Drama', 'Jean Cocteau, Michel Kelber', 'Jean Cocteau', 'Jean Marais, Josette Day, Yvonne de Bray, Marcel André, Gabrielle Dorziat, Jean Cocteau', null, 'Young Michel is in love with the attractive Madeleine, so he decides to tell his parents of his intention to marry her. He thinks his announcement is innocent enough; his engagement, however, threatens to reveal dark secrets lurking within his family''s home. Yvonne, Michel''s overbearing mother, concocts an elaborate scheme to drive Madeleine away, thus keeping uncomfortable household truths from being exposed.', 'Young Michel is in love with the attractive Madeleine, so he decides to tell his parents of his intention to marry her. He thinks his announcement is innocent enough; his engagement, however, threatens to reveal dark secrets lurking within his family''s home. Yvonne, Michel''s overbearing mother, concocts an elaborate scheme to drive Madeleine away, thus keeping uncomfortable household truths from being exposed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cDG1NhUhfWlnvXxqMf48KRl4pUM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63151'),
  ('91097743658351127', 'The Storm-Tamer', 1947, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Jean Epstein, Albert Militon', 'Jean Epstein', null, null, 'Following a premonition, a young woman tries to persuade her fiancé not to go out to sea in his fishing boat, but the boy ignores her and sets out. Soon, a storm occurs, and the girl frantically tries to find out his fate. Eventually, at the advice of her grandmother, she goes to the "Tempestaire", who has the power to speak to the wind and subdue it.', 'Following a premonition, a young woman tries to persuade her fiancé not to go out to sea in his fishing boat, but the boy ignores her and sets out. Soon, a storm occurs, and the girl frantically tries to find out his fate. Eventually, at the advice of her grandmother, she goes to the "Tempestaire", who has the power to speak to the wind and subdue it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iq49iWSeYwrCnwgNvdVlfm6eFzg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146823'),
  ('420520113690714967', 'The Story Behind ''Toy Story''', 1996, 'Documentary', null, 'Phil Savenick', 'Corey Burton, Tom Hanks, John Lasseter, Tim Allen, Pete Docter, Laurie Metcalf, Randy Newman, Annie Potts', null, 'The documentary short of Toy Story of why and how the feature length blockbuster sleeper movie became a success and helps to boost Pixar''s popularity of making one of the few animation movie production companies in the world today, especially in North America.', 'The documentary short of Toy Story of why and how the feature length blockbuster sleeper movie became a success and helps to boost Pixar''s popularity of making one of the few animation movie production companies in the world today, especially in North America.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ul7sy0m9GPifIgMaEXX8ivENqHP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:464729'),
  ('1007820362438306434', 'The Story of a Cheat', 1936, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Sacha Guitry, Marcel Lucien', 'Sacha Guitry', 'Sacha Guitry, Jacqueline Delubac, Marguerite Moreno, Pauline Carton, Rosine Deréan, Fréhel, Elmire Vautier, Serge Grave', null, 'Life story of a charming scoundrel, with little dialogue other than the star/director''s witty narration. As a boy, only he survives a family tragedy when he''s deprived of supper (poisonous mushrooms!) for stealing...concluding that dishonesty pays. Through years of dabbling in crime and amusing adventures, two women appear and reappear in his life, a dazzling blonde jewel thief and a stunning brunette gambler. Finally, he meets the mysterious Charbonnier who had saved his life in World War I, leading to the surprising next phase in his career...', 'Life story of a charming scoundrel, with little dialogue other than the star/director''s witty narration. As a boy, only he survives a family tragedy when he''s deprived of supper (poisonous mushrooms!) for stealing...concluding that dishonesty pays. Through years of dabbling in crime and amusing adventures, two women appear and reappear in his life, a dazzling blonde jewel thief and a stunning brunette gambler. Finally, he meets the mysterious Charbonnier who had saved his life in World War I, leading to the surprising next phase in his career...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qxoUomd2i4jzLbGKQFPreLucAi5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65642'),
  ('21496773566525762', 'The Story of a Poor Young Man', 1995, 'Drama', 'Ettore Scola, Amanzio Todini, Franco Di Giacomo', 'Giacomo Scarpelli, Ettore Scola, Silvia Scola', 'Rolando Ravello, André Dussollier, Alberto Sordi, Isabella Ferrari, Mario Carotenuto, Renato De Carmine, Gianfelice Imparato, Sara Franchetti', null, 'Two neighbors, young Vincenzo and old Mr. Bartoloni, are utterly unhappy. On the one hand Vincenzo must lead a miserable and frustrating life as he cannot find any regular job, despite his Arts degree. On the other hand, Mr. Bartoloni is fed up with his despotic wife: the woman who used to be a beautiful artist is now a fat and shabby drunkard. The two men meet on a particularly sad night and, during an outburst Mr. Bartoloni asks Vincenzo to help him to get rid of his wife by simulating an accident with the promise of a considerable amount of money. At night Vincenzo can''t sleep: Mr. Bartoloni wasn''t joking and he is in a desperate need for money...', 'Two neighbors, young Vincenzo and old Mr. Bartoloni, are utterly unhappy. On the one hand Vincenzo must lead a miserable and frustrating life as he cannot find any regular job, despite his Arts degree. On the other hand, Mr. Bartoloni is fed up with his despotic wife: the woman who used to be a beautiful artist is now a fat and shabby drunkard. The two men meet on a particularly sad night and, during an outburst Mr. Bartoloni asks Vincenzo to help him to get rid of his wife by simulating an accident with the promise of a considerable amount of money. At night Vincenzo can''t sleep: Mr. Bartoloni wasn''t joking and he is in a desperate need for money...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wd3mN0VxNqxSlthWShwHqTWL85u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59106'),
  ('795233599043092545', 'The Story of a Three-Day Pass', 1968, 'Drama, Romance', 'Melvin Van Peebles', 'Melvin Van Peebles', 'Harry Baird, Nicole Berger, Pierre Doris, Christian Marin, Hal Brav, Tria French, Karell Jonathan Beer, George Birt', null, 'Turner, a black American soldier, is given three days leave in Paris. Not knowing what to do with himself, he goes to a nightclub where he meets a French girl named Miriam. Their romance blossoms, but their love affair is darkened by Turner''s impending departure and the specter of racial prejudice.', 'Turner, a black American soldier, is given three days leave in Paris. Not knowing what to do with himself, he goes to a nightclub where he meets a French girl named Miriam. Their romance blossoms, but their love affair is darkened by Turner''s impending departure and the specter of racial prejudice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vWKwTXl75x4DFb5oQdnOLXc2buz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95954'),
  ('349075958078123052', 'The Story of Adèle H.', 1975, 'Drama, History', 'François Truffaut, Néstor Almendros, Carl Hathwell', 'Frances Vernor Guille', 'Isabelle Adjani, Bruce Robinson, Sylvia Marriott, Joseph Blatchley, Ivry Gitlis, Louise Bourdet, Cecil De Sausmarez, Ruben Dorey', 'PG', 'In the 19th century a mysterious woman named Adele H. crosses the ocean, from Europe to North America, to relentlessly pursue a handsome officer that denies her satisfaction.', 'In the 19th century a mysterious woman named Adele H. crosses the ocean, from Europe to North America, to relentlessly pursue a handsome officer that denies her satisfaction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ymzUeHZP5SguHeyx28aN3PLBReA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1829'),
  ('378491045804194023', 'The Story of Alexander Graham Bell', 1939, 'Drama, History', 'Irving Cummings, Leon Shamroy, Louis Silvers', 'Lamar Trotti', 'Don Ameche, Loretta Young, Henry Fonda, Charles Coburn, Gene Lockhart, Spring Byington, Sally Blane, Polly Ann Young', 'NR', 'Alexander Graham Bell falls in love with deaf girl Mabel Hubbard while teaching the deaf and trying to invent means for telegraphing the human voice. She urges him to put off thoughts of marriage until his experiments are complete. He invents the telephone, marries and becomes rich and famous, though his happiness is threatened when a rival company sets out to ruin him.', 'Alexander Graham Bell falls in love with deaf girl Mabel Hubbard while teaching the deaf and trying to invent means for telegraphing the human voice. She urges him to put off thoughts of marriage until his experiments are complete. He invents the telephone, marries and becomes rich and famous, though his happiness is threatened when a rival company sets out to ruin him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mi1IX2qBgtwiMihaNTGiPC8nG72.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67375'),
  ('544195806312187446', 'The Story of Anyburg U.S.A.', 1957, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Clyde Geronimi', null, 'Hans Conried, Thurl Ravenscroft, Bill Thompson', 'NR', 'The city of Anyburg decides its traffic situation has gotten out of hand, so it puts the automobile on trial. The trial (conducted in rhyme) starts with a car that was in a hit-and-run accident, followed by a sports car whose sins are peeling rubber and general hot-rodding, followed by a heap, on trial for lack of safety. Next, a number of safety equipment designers testify that, despite their best efforts, the accident rate keeps rising. Through all this, the defense lawyer declines to ask questions. A highway designer bemoans the problems on his beautiful roads. At last, defense. He shows a number of scenarios, pointing out that the real problem isn''t the car but the driver. Everyone left the courtroom, declaring the car not guilty, and drove politely again, for a little while.', 'The city of Anyburg decides its traffic situation has gotten out of hand, so it puts the automobile on trial. The trial (conducted in rhyme) starts with a car that was in a hit-and-run accident, followed by a sports car whose sins are peeling rubber and general hot-rodding, followed by a heap, on trial for lack of safety. Next, a number of safety equipment designers testify that, despite their best efforts, the accident rate keeps rising. Through all this, the defense lawyer declines to ask questions. A highway designer bemoans the problems on his beautiful roads. At last, defense. He shows a number of scenarios, pointing out that the real problem isn''t the car but the driver. Everyone left the courtroom, declaring the car not guilty, and drove politely again, for a little while.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/of3jyT902J2wO1dopLL8y63vBsk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93718'),
  ('649731010104763368', 'The Story of Asya Klyachina, Who Loved, But Did Not Marry', 1966, 'Drama, Romance', 'Andrei Konchalovsky, Raisa Margachyova, Georgi Rerberg', 'Yuri Klepikov', 'Iya Savvina, Lyubov Sokolova, Aleksandr Surin, Gennadi Yegorychev, Lyudmila Zaytseva, Nikolay Pogodin, Mikhail Kislov, Ivan Petrov', null, 'Asya, a lame collective farmer, is in love with the father of her unborn child. However, he does not reciprocate, leaving her forced to choose between a loveless marriage to another suitor, or single motherhood.', 'Asya, a lame collective farmer, is in love with the father of her unborn child. However, he does not reciprocate, leaving her forced to choose between a loveless marriage to another suitor, or single motherhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lSD150yCfGzXywF7KKqRK7LIKTC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91261'),
  ('871056242817127874', 'The Story of Boys and Girls', 1989, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Pupi Avati, Pasquale Rachini', 'Pupi Avati', 'Felice Andreasi, Lucrezia Lante della Rovere, Alessandro Haber, Angiola Baggi, Davide Bechini, Lina Bernardi, Claudio Botosso, Enrica Maria Modugno', null, 'At a farmhouse, a large family cooks mountains of food for the next day''s engagement party for Silvia and her city fiancé, Angelo. Her parents feud about infidelity; an aging salesman who rents a cottage from them arrives with a young French woman; in Bologna, Angelo''s mother frets that her son is marrying beneath him; his sisters are less critical. Early the next morning, the four of them go by train to the farmhouse, joined by Angelo''s married, unpregnant sister. The day-long dinner is riotous, couples display affection and impatience, children chase angels. Angelo''s family stays the night, and his sister Linda has a visitor. A silver elephant makes the perfect gift.', 'At a farmhouse, a large family cooks mountains of food for the next day''s engagement party for Silvia and her city fiancé, Angelo. Her parents feud about infidelity; an aging salesman who rents a cottage from them arrives with a young French woman; in Bologna, Angelo''s mother frets that her son is marrying beneath him; his sisters are less critical. Early the next morning, the four of them go by train to the farmhouse, joined by Angelo''s married, unpregnant sister. The day-long dinner is riotous, couples display affection and impatience, children chase angels. Angelo''s family stays the night, and his sister Linda has a visitor. A silver elephant makes the perfect gift.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3LHVqMyPn1BWHYeSh9K05dsvMXR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56166'),
  ('710161275884089944', 'The Story of Dr. Wassell', 1944, 'War, Adventure, Drama, Action, Romance', 'Cecil B. DeMille, William E. Snyder, Victor Milner', 'Alan Le May, Charles Bennett', 'Gary Cooper, Laraine Day, Signe Hasso, Dennis O''Keefe, Carol Thurston, Carl Esmond, Paul Kelly, Elliott Reid', 'NR', 'As the Japanese sweep through the East Indies during World War II, Dr. Wassell is determined to escape from Java with some crewmen of the cruiser Marblehead. Based on a true story of how Dr. Wassell saved a dozen or so wounded sailors who were left behind when able bodied men were evacuated to Australia.', 'As the Japanese sweep through the East Indies during World War II, Dr. Wassell is determined to escape from Java with some crewmen of the cruiser Marblehead. Based on a true story of how Dr. Wassell saved a dozen or so wounded sailors who were left behind when able bodied men were evacuated to Australia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yjrMxwMxhsahGbCHLFpDUW5fR1t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92399'),
  ('950585618864678519', 'The Story of Esther Costello', 1957, 'Drama', 'David Miller', 'Charles Kaufman', 'Joan Crawford, Rossano Brazzi, Heather Sears, Lee Patterson, Ron Randell, Fay Compton, Maureen Delaney, John Loder', 'NR', 'Eighteen-year-old Esther has been deaf and blind since the accident that killed her mother. Wealthy Margaret Landi, a native of Esther''s village in Ireland, is persuaded to help educate and possibly heal Esther. Margaret grows to love Esther as a daughter, but finds Esther''s innocence threatened by sleazy promoters and her own sleazy ex-husband.', 'Eighteen-year-old Esther has been deaf and blind since the accident that killed her mother. Wealthy Margaret Landi, a native of Esther''s village in Ireland, is persuaded to help educate and possibly heal Esther. Margaret grows to love Esther as a daughter, but finds Esther''s innocence threatened by sleazy promoters and her own sleazy ex-husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ohrDHraZWe26Tu4qX2ullyW95zZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:202436'),
  ('169963447695661362', 'The Story of Heidi', 1979, 'Animation, Family, Adventure', 'Isao Takahata', 'Hisao Ohkawa, Yoshiaki Yoshida, Mamoru Sasaki', 'Kazuko Sugiyama, Kohei Miyauchi, Yoshiaki Nemoto, Hiroko Maruyama, Terue Nunami, Taeko Nakanishi, Keiko Han, Hisako Kyoda', null, 'Heidi is five years old when her aunt Dete, who has raised Heidi since her parents'' deaths four years earlier, takes the orphaned Heidi to live with her formidable grandfather in the Swiss Alps.', 'Heidi is five years old when her aunt Dete, who has raised Heidi since her parents'' deaths four years earlier, takes the orphaned Heidi to live with her formidable grandfather in the Swiss Alps.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dfGfVXXq7SrO43rQYaP5aieuCmn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:266220'),
  ('115182888403352915', 'The Story of Lady Sue', 1992, 'Horror', 'Lam Yee Hung', null, 'Maria Tung Ling, Pal Sinn Lap-Man, David Lam Wai, Charlie Cho Cha-Lee, Susan Shaw Yam-Yam', null, 'Young master Ying Feng is kicked out of home by his father, a master of mystical magic cures, because the "leader of black religion" is out to kill his entire family. Honest and stout-hearted, Ying Feng punches three guys who want to screw pretty dancer Miss Fan. Fan gets sweet on Feng and he agrees to let her stay with him. The Fairy comes to town, touting his magic powers to cure the sick for anyone who''ll pay his exorbitant fee. Ying Feng has some of the same talent, and cures a sick woman with no money and for no payment, thereby shaming The Fairy into both taking him on as a disciple and agreeing to charge less. Li Quan, the "leader of black religion", has not given up trying to find Ying Feng, but his search is greatly slowed down by his assistants being far more interested in screwing each other silly than revenge. Note - Both of the lead characters are actually called "Fung" in Cantonese, so I have used the Mandarin forms of their names, to distinguish them.', 'Young master Ying Feng is kicked out of home by his father, a master of mystical magic cures, because the "leader of black religion" is out to kill his entire family. Honest and stout-hearted, Ying Feng punches three guys who want to screw pretty dancer Miss Fan. Fan gets sweet on Feng and he agrees to let her stay with him. The Fairy comes to town, touting his magic powers to cure the sick for anyone who''ll pay his exorbitant fee. Ying Feng has some of the same talent, and cures a sick woman with no money and for no payment, thereby shaming The Fairy into both taking him on as a disciple and agreeing to charge less. Li Quan, the "leader of black religion", has not given up trying to find Ying Feng, but his search is greatly slowed down by his assistants being far more interested in screwing each other silly than revenge. Note - Both of the lead characters are actually called "Fung" in Cantonese, so I have used the Mandarin forms of their names, to distinguish them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hqKYv5ccPL4bcheabT4VN4jEoPc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:561166'),
  ('110868582257518558', 'The Story of Linda', 1981, 'Adventure, Crime, Drama', 'Jesús Franco, Juan Soler, Lina Romay', 'Erich Tomek', 'Katja Bienert, Ursula Buchfellner, Raquel Evans, Antonio Mayans, Bea Fiedler, Otto Retzer, Antonio Rebollo, Andrea Guzon', null, 'Betsy Norman is a happy assistant at a luxurious Spanish hotel. Shiela, the hotel owner, caters for all wishes of her clientele with another lucrative business, the brothel "Rio Amore" where clients from all over the world come to relax with the girls and watch the sado-masochistic shows. Linda, Betsy''s sister, is drugged and forced to work as a prostitute there.', 'Betsy Norman is a happy assistant at a luxurious Spanish hotel. Shiela, the hotel owner, caters for all wishes of her clientele with another lucrative business, the brothel "Rio Amore" where clients from all over the world come to relax with the girls and watch the sado-masochistic shows. Linda, Betsy''s sister, is drugged and forced to work as a prostitute there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kKIfZIxdzP7wdIvR1qVk7TiAiuY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81529'),
  ('510859063440670398', 'The Story of Little Mook', 1953, 'Fantasy, Family', 'Wolfgang Staudte, Robert Baberske', 'Peter Podehl, Wolfgang Staudte', 'Thomas Schmidt, Johannes Maus, Friedrich Richter, Trude Hesterberg, Gerd Frickhöffer, Harry Riebauer, Alwin Lippisch, Silja Lesny', null, 'An old man living in an oriental city tells the story of his life to a group of kids: He too was once a young boy by the name of Little Muck - much like them, but with better manners and a heap of problems. Having lost his father at early age, little Muck is expelled from home by his greedy relatives. He wanders off into the desert hoping to find the merchant who sells good fortune. Amidst the dunes of sand he comes across a small house owned by a wicked woman and her many cats. She wants to make Little Muck her servant, but he manages to escape by stealing a pair of magic shoes which enable him to run faster than any man in the country. From there he heads right into the next set of challenges...', 'An old man living in an oriental city tells the story of his life to a group of kids: He too was once a young boy by the name of Little Muck - much like them, but with better manners and a heap of problems. Having lost his father at early age, little Muck is expelled from home by his greedy relatives. He wanders off into the desert hoping to find the merchant who sells good fortune. Amidst the dunes of sand he comes across a small house owned by a wicked woman and her many cats. She wants to make Little Muck her servant, but he manages to escape by stealing a pair of magic shoes which enable him to run faster than any man in the country. From there he heads right into the next set of challenges...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5sFFn3G5GaTYsWXTlLiKgfOg3nO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13294'),
  ('144486366467876795', 'The Story of Louis Pasteur', 1936, 'Drama, History', 'William Dieterle, Tony Gaudio, Irving Rapper', 'Sheridan Gibney, Pierre Collings', 'Paul Muni, Josephine Hutchinson, Anita Louise, Donald Woods, Fritz Leiber, Henry O''Neill, Porter Hall, Raymond Brown', 'NR', 'A true story about Louis Pasteur, who revolutionized medicine by proving that much disease is caused by microbes, that sanitation is paramount and that at least some diseases can be cured by vaccinations.', 'A true story about Louis Pasteur, who revolutionized medicine by proving that much disease is caused by microbes, that sanitation is paramount and that at least some diseases can be cured by vaccinations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tEYBb5ZKK22TWSwLY1hkFSD2rjG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74469'),
  ('227399285182408645', 'The Story of Luke', 2013, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Alonso Mayo, David Klein', 'Alonso Mayo', 'Seth Green, Cary Elwes, Al Sapienza, Kristin Bauer, Lou Taylor Pucci, Lisa Ryder, Kenneth Welsh, Jayne Eastwood', 'NR', 'Sheltered by his grandparents, Luke, a young man with autism, is thrust into a world that doesn''t expect anything from him. But Luke is on a quest for a job and true love. And he isn''t taking no for an answer.', 'Sheltered by his grandparents, Luke, a young man with autism, is thrust into a world that doesn''t expect anything from him. But Luke is on a quest for a job and true love. And he isn''t taking no for an answer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dSXad96zPtphKHnDNiOD34EhcA0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:176088'),
  ('100244500021215408', 'The Story of Mankind', 1957, 'Drama, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Nicholas Musuraca, Irwin Allen', 'Irwin Allen, Charles Bennett', 'Ronald Colman, Hedy Lamarr, Groucho Marx, Harpo Marx, Chico Marx, Virginia Mayo, Agnes Moorehead, Vincent Price', 'NR', 'The devil and the spirit of mankind argue as to whether or not humanity is ultimately good or evil.', 'The devil and the spirit of mankind argue as to whether or not humanity is ultimately good or evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lkjbuh3YRgA191YFvlwKPe7qb9U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43252'),
  ('461753782719383482', 'The Story of Marie and Julien', 2003, 'Drama, Romance, Mystery, Fantasy', 'Jacques Rivette, William Lubtchansky', 'Jacques Rivette, Pascal Bonitzer, Christine Laurent', 'Emmanuelle Béart, Jerzy Radziwiłowicz, Anne Brochet, Bettina Kee, Olivier Cruveiller, Mathias Jung, Nicole Garcia', null, 'Julien is a clockmaker with destructive impulses who decides to blackmail Madame X, a rich, attractive woman who traffics in stolen antiques. What he doesn’t know is that she has an even more dangerous secret that leads him to Marie, with whom he had fallen in love a year earlier.', 'Julien is a clockmaker with destructive impulses who decides to blackmail Madame X, a rich, attractive woman who traffics in stolen antiques. What he doesn’t know is that she has an even more dangerous secret that leads him to Marie, with whom he had fallen in love a year earlier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9mvzqG2or3CXfvVgP8EJ8TcpWyK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79043'),
  ('631861662512001414', 'The Story of Me', 2009, 'Drama', 'Luiz Villaça, Lauro Escorel', 'José Roberto Torero, Maurício Arruda', 'Maria de Medeiros, Marco Antonio Ribeiro, Paulinho Mendes, Malu Galli, Cleiton Santos, Ju Colombo, Victor Augusto da Silva, Teuda Bara', null, 'Based on the life of Roberto Carlos Ramos, a Brazilian teacher and storyteller brought up in a state educational institution for poor children.', 'Based on the life of Roberto Carlos Ramos, a Brazilian teacher and storyteller brought up in a state educational institution for poor children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vWiNxay25tq3QOoJmoTNmkapXv1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32958'),
  ('1080391666789676147', 'The Story of Menstruation', 1946, 'Animation, Documentary', 'Jack Kinney', null, 'Gloria Blondell', 'NR', 'A basic explanation of the purpose and process of menstruation, told largely with diagrams.', 'A basic explanation of the purpose and process of menstruation, told largely with diagrams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wryQZXn0qyHQQcOpCHnGZhXwm3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58828'),
  ('417815262307178281', 'The Story Of My Life', 2004, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Gilles Henry, Laurent Tirard', null, 'Édouard Baer, Clovis Cornillac, Marie-Josée Croze, Alice Taglioni, Éric Berger, Jean-Michel Lahmi, Jean-Christophe Bouvet, Raphaël Fuchs-Willig', null, 'Raphael is a ghostwriter who takes a job writing for famous footy player Kevin. To his delight and his girlfriend, Murials horror, Kevins current girlfriend is an old (easily rekindled) flame of Raphaels. A freak accident leaves a close friend dead and Raphael is forced to reconsider his priorities.', 'Raphael is a ghostwriter who takes a job writing for famous footy player Kevin. To his delight and his girlfriend, Murials horror, Kevins current girlfriend is an old (easily rekindled) flame of Raphaels. A freak accident leaves a close friend dead and Raphael is forced to reconsider his priorities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yjBq8pSEXpnmypHkIXqFhVXahnw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10271'),
  ('515618350589445146', 'The Story of My Wife', 2021, 'Romance, Drama', 'Ildikó Enyedi, Marcell Rév', 'Ildikó Enyedi', 'Léa Seydoux, Gijs Naber, Louis Garrel, Sergio Rubini, Jasmine Trinca, Luna Wedler, Josef Hader, Udo Samel', null, 'A sea captain makes a bet in a cafe with a friend that he will marry the first woman who walks in.', 'A sea captain makes a bet in a cafe with a friend that he will marry the first woman who walks in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4PilF6fzZpbHVuT0EIYwqElSyc0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:574078'),
  ('549813812579545928', 'The Story of O Part 2', 1984, 'Drama', 'Éric Rochat, Andrés Berenguer', 'Éric Rochat', 'Sandra Wey, Rosa Valenty, Manuel de Blas, Carole James, Christian Cid, Eduardo Bea, Rubén Blanco', null, 'James Pembroke, a powerful industrialist, has become a nuisance to his rivals. That is the reason why they have decided to neutralize him. To this end they call on O, who has turned from victim to dominatrix. Her mission is to compromise not only James in person but his whole family as well. And to tell the truth, O does not find much resistance on her way...', 'James Pembroke, a powerful industrialist, has become a nuisance to his rivals. That is the reason why they have decided to neutralize him. To this end they call on O, who has turned from victim to dominatrix. Her mission is to compromise not only James in person but his whole family as well. And to tell the truth, O does not find much resistance on her way...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/64AOVnkp8f2MBXUT3znqgpmYnGH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:165108'),
  ('96133857613678110', 'The Story of One Day', 1941, 'Documentary', 'Maks Kalmić', null, null, null, 'A short film which documents a 24 hour period in the city of Belgrade, Yugoslavia.', 'A short film which documents a 24 hour period in the city of Belgrade, Yugoslavia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d1mRD34nAZKpSNg5hQFqcFAi5fg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127981'),
  ('1023849588137442536', 'The Story of Ong-nyeo', 2014, 'Romance, Drama', 'Gyeong Seok-Ho', 'Gyeong Seok-Ho, Son Yeon-hee', 'Han Chae-you, Kang Kyung-woo, Shin Yu-ju, Kim Tae-hoon, Gil Son, Baek Gil-seong, Park Seon-joo, Bae Geon-sik', null, 'Ong-nye had a world of men wrapped around her finger, until, one day, a horrific injury leaves her handicapped, and she retreats to the mountains. But one man may break her loneliness.', 'Ong-nye had a world of men wrapped around her finger, until, one day, a horrific injury leaves her handicapped, and she retreats to the mountains. But one man may break her loneliness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rtl4hW2KJHInieeCiGgrDJmMG7s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:308624'),
  ('884752557875428746', 'The Story of Piera', 1983, 'Drama', 'Marco Ferreri, Ennio Guarnieri', 'Piera Degli Esposti, Marco Ferreri, Dacia Maraini', 'Isabelle Huppert, Hanna Schygulla, Marcello Mastroianni, Angelo Infanti, Aiche Nana, Tanya Lopert, Bettina Grühn, Renato Cecchetto', null, 'Piera is a young woman who grows up under the parentage of two extremely original overseers: both her mother and father have incestuous relations with her before they are committed to insane asylums. A special connection, between a mother and her daughter, full of sensuality and complicity, has allowed to portray a family full of fears, rather unbalanced, but nevertheless searching infinite love.', 'Piera is a young woman who grows up under the parentage of two extremely original overseers: both her mother and father have incestuous relations with her before they are committed to insane asylums. A special connection, between a mother and her daughter, full of sensuality and complicity, has allowed to portray a family full of fears, rather unbalanced, but nevertheless searching infinite love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5JOjkbiAZWDlhTGak3afhkbrkIr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53914'),
  ('191727676688798221', 'The Story of Qiu Ju', 1992, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Zhang Yimou, Hongyi Lu, Chi Xiao Ning', 'Liu Heng', 'Gong Li, Liu Peiqi, Liuchun Yang, Lei Kesheng, Ge Zhijun, Wanqing Zhu, Luowen Cui, Huiqin Yang', 'PG', 'When her husband is kicked in the groin by the village head, Qiu Ju, a peasant woman, despite her pregnancy, travels to a nearby town, and later a big city to deal with its bureaucrats and find justice.', 'When her husband is kicked in the groin by the village head, Qiu Ju, a peasant woman, despite her pregnancy, travels to a nearby town, and later a big city to deal with its bureaucrats and find justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5yYnTVXuLBjFQ91k2FnSWcwNn3x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38143'),
  ('363902366278781852', 'The Story of Richard O', 2007, 'Drama', 'Damien Odoul, Myrtille Saint-Martin, Patrick Ghiringhelli', 'Damien Odoul', 'Mathieu Amalric, Rhizlaine El Cohen, Stéphane Terpereau, Alexandra Sollogoub, Caroline Demangel, Ludmila Ruoso, Marianne Costa, Lucie Borleteau', null, 'Prey to his desire for women, Richard O. explores the sinuous mysteries of eroticism in a Paris full of summer inhabitants in the torrid month of August.', 'Prey to his desire for women, Richard O. explores the sinuous mysteries of eroticism in a Paris full of summer inhabitants in the torrid month of August.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2RV7fuWTx76YbjK0US4hYgEPYwv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72286'),
  ('377282107930640809', 'The Story of Robin Hood and His Merrie Men', 1952, 'Action, Adventure', 'Guy Green, Ken Annakin, Peter Bolton', 'Lawrence Edward Watkin', 'Richard Todd, Joan Rice, Peter Finch, James Hayter, James Robertson Justice, Martita Hunt, Hubert Gregg, Bill Owen', 'NR', 'Young Robin Hood, in love with Maid Marian, enters an archery contest with his father at the King''s palace. On the way home his father is murdered by henchmen of Prince John. Robin takes up the life of an outlaw, gathering together his band of merry men with him in Sherwood Forest, to avenge his father''s death and to help the people of the land that Prince John are over taxing.', 'Young Robin Hood, in love with Maid Marian, enters an archery contest with his father at the King''s palace. On the way home his father is murdered by henchmen of Prince John. Robin takes up the life of an outlaw, gathering together his band of merry men with him in Sherwood Forest, to avenge his father''s death and to help the people of the land that Prince John are over taxing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qnVw3CwQgHnKiOWKhAv69dsKBfG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27884'),
  ('218248605708156883', 'The Story of Romance and Knife', 1971, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Sergio Corbucci, Franco Cirino, Pasqualino De Santis', 'Sabatino Ciuffini, Sergio Corbucci, Mario Amendola', 'Adriano Celentano, Claudia Mori, Vittorio Caprioli, Romolo Valli, Ninetto Davoli, Gianni Macchia, Maurizio Arena, Gino Santercole', null, 'The story of fish-monger Nino of Rione Borgo. Nino is in love with Rosa but he always manages to postpone their wedding.', 'The story of fish-monger Nino of Rione Borgo. Nino is in love with Rosa but he always manages to postpone their wedding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hPSPMqs8qpipg2hlkM8wg2cvEG9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81652'),
  ('1058612635288293857', 'The Story of Ruth', 1960, 'Drama, History', 'Henry Koster, Arthur E. Arling', 'Norman Corwin', 'Elana Eden, Stuart Whitman, Tom Tryon, Peggy Wood, Viveca Lindfors, Jeff Morrow, Thayer David, Les Tremayne', null, 'Ruth is one of two Moabite women who marry the sons of Elimelech and Naomi. When Elimelech and sons Mahlon and Chillion die, leaving Naomi a widow with two widowed daughters-in-law, Naomi decides to return to Israel. One daughter-in-law, Orpah, bids her goodbye. Daughter-in-law Ruth however says she will not desert her.', 'Ruth is one of two Moabite women who marry the sons of Elimelech and Naomi. When Elimelech and sons Mahlon and Chillion die, leaving Naomi a widow with two widowed daughters-in-law, Naomi decides to return to Israel. One daughter-in-law, Orpah, bids her goodbye. Daughter-in-law Ruth however says she will not desert her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4MPqitAdH1WC52AOMZStTc6bRMX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43042'),
  ('500752032225813642', 'The Story of Santa Claus', 1996, 'Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Toby Bluth', 'Rachel Koretsky, Steven Whitestone', 'Ed Asner, Jim Cummings, Tim Curry, Miko Hughes, Betty White', null, 'An animated musical that explains how a toymaker named Nicholas Claus (voice of Edward Asner) started the tradition of delivering a toy to every child on Christmas. Other voices: Betty White (Mrs. Claus); Tim Curry (Nostros); Miko Hughes (Clement).', 'An animated musical that explains how a toymaker named Nicholas Claus (voice of Edward Asner) started the tradition of delivering a toy to every child on Christmas. Other voices: Betty White (Mrs. Claus); Tim Curry (Nostros); Miko Hughes (Clement).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qAycltpHtCAdbhvjreUbWf3WXKm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81685'),
  ('102167699184131004', 'The Story of Seabiscuit', 1949, 'Drama, Family, Romance', 'David Butler', 'John Taintor Foote', 'Shirley Temple, Barry Fitzgerald, Lon McCallister, Rosemary DeCamp, Donald MacBride, Pierre Watkin, William Forrest, Hal J. Moore', null, 'Horse trainer Shawn O''Hara and his lovely niece, Margaret, come to America to escape the memory of an accident involving Margaret''s brother, Danny. Working with thoroughbreds in Kentucky, Shawn takes a liking to a yearling named Seabiscuit, and fights to convince the horse''s owner that the tiny horse with big knees will become a top-notch racehorse. Meanwhile, Margaret begins a tentative relationship with jockey Ted Knowles, but is haunted by her brother''s death in a steeplechase spill. Written by Ray Hamel', 'Horse trainer Shawn O''Hara and his lovely niece, Margaret, come to America to escape the memory of an accident involving Margaret''s brother, Danny. Working with thoroughbreds in Kentucky, Shawn takes a liking to a yearling named Seabiscuit, and fights to convince the horse''s owner that the tiny horse with big knees will become a top-notch racehorse. Meanwhile, Margaret begins a tentative relationship with jockey Ted Knowles, but is haunted by her brother''s death in a steeplechase spill. Written by Ray Hamel', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s5J3PMRNrV8Z1AKoBXZWdbQjGhX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61828'),
  ('600046369351115603', 'The Story of Sin', 1975, 'Drama, Romance', 'Walerian Borowczyk, Ewa Smal, Zygmunt Samosiuk', 'Walerian Borowczyk', 'Grażyna Długołęcka, Mieczysław Voit, Marek Walczewski, Marek Bargiełowski, Janusz Zakrzeński, Zbigniew Zapasiewicz, Jerzy Zelnik, Zdzisław Mrożewski', 'R', 'A beautiful Polish girl whose lover has gone to Rome to seek a divorce from his previous wife travels around Europe in search of him and suffers a variety of tragic adventures as the men around her try to fit her into their own selfish schemes.', 'A beautiful Polish girl whose lover has gone to Rome to seek a divorce from his previous wife travels around Europe in search of him and suffers a variety of tragic adventures as the men around her try to fit her into their own selfish schemes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pNDQqR2wWWYX29CFGgxLf8p8LmT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156627'),
  ('262837167696485587', 'The Story of Southern Islet', 2021, 'Fantasy, Drama, Horror', 'Chan Hai Liang, Cheng Thim Kiam, Keat Aun Chong', 'Keat Aun Chong', 'Jojo Goh, Season Chee, Hong Herr Wong, Wei Hern Teoh, Ling Tang, Pearlly Chua, Kok Hin Kuan, Mei-Sim Hoon', null, 'Cheong, a Chinese man, falls sick after a row with his neighbour. His wife Yan is desperately looking for a remedy to cure her husband. Throughout the journey, Yan endures strange encounters and unearthly experiences. Finally, Yan is convinced that she should seek help from the village shaman. Mysteries, legends and shamanism surround Yan with unknowns yet to be solved.', 'Cheong, a Chinese man, falls sick after a row with his neighbour. His wife Yan is desperately looking for a remedy to cure her husband. Throughout the journey, Yan endures strange encounters and unearthly experiences. Finally, Yan is convinced that she should seek help from the village shaman. Mysteries, legends and shamanism surround Yan with unknowns yet to be solved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lDBaG2swLMRI4WVZLq36VMavu8C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:759524'),
  ('99308786858306532', 'The Story of Star Wars', 2004, 'Documentary', 'Angelo Pacifici, Sam Hurwitz', null, 'Anthony Daniels, Kenny Baker, Hayden Christensen, James Earl Jones, David Prowse, Jake Lloyd, Sebastian Shaw, Alec Guinness', null, 'The Skywalker family is at the heart of the Star Wars saga. Now hear the inside story of Luke and Anakin Skywalker from the characters who witnessed it all: the famous droid duo C-3PO and R2-D2. Episodes IV,V and VI are explored in "The Story of Luke Skywalker," which follows the young man escaping from his daily chores on Tatooine to his becoming a hero in the Rebal Alliance. In "The Story of Anakin Skywalker," you''ll go behind the mask of the greatest Star Wars villain and discover how Darth Vader started life as a young Podracing Champ on Tatooine and later became a headstrong young Jedi seduced by the Dark Side of the Force. With clips from the Star Wars films, C-3PO and R2-D2 take you on an hour-long journey through the saga and prepare you for the explosive final chapter: Star Wars: Episode III Revenge of the Sith.', 'The Skywalker family is at the heart of the Star Wars saga. Now hear the inside story of Luke and Anakin Skywalker from the characters who witnessed it all: the famous droid duo C-3PO and R2-D2. Episodes IV,V and VI are explored in "The Story of Luke Skywalker," which follows the young man escaping from his daily chores on Tatooine to his becoming a hero in the Rebal Alliance. In "The Story of Anakin Skywalker," you''ll go behind the mask of the greatest Star Wars villain and discover how Darth Vader started life as a young Podracing Champ on Tatooine and later became a headstrong young Jedi seduced by the Dark Side of the Force. With clips from the Star Wars films, C-3PO and R2-D2 take you on an hour-long journey through the saga and prepare you for the explosive final chapter: Star Wars: Episode III Revenge of the Sith.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fvw9W7ds0Q51hQIbS7JoUBqL3tK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:435365'),
  ('479345096591642729', 'The Story of Temple Drake', 1933, 'Crime, Drama', 'Stephen Roberts, Karl Struss', 'Oliver H.P. Garrett', 'Miriam Hopkins, William Gargan, Jack La Rue, Florence Eldridge, Guy Standing, Irving Pichel, Jobyna Howland, William Collier Jr.', 'NR', 'The coquettish granddaughter of a respected small-town judge is stranded at a bootleggers’ hide-out, subjected to an act of nightmarish sexual violence, and plunged into a criminal underworld that threatens to swallow her up completely.', 'The coquettish granddaughter of a respected small-town judge is stranded at a bootleggers’ hide-out, subjected to an act of nightmarish sexual violence, and plunged into a criminal underworld that threatens to swallow her up completely.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hOuRZF5KemHS5LPkdGO3HnjsSv1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27986'),
  ('1026059662956268374', 'The Story of the Last Chrysanthemum', 1939, 'Romance, Drama', 'Kenji Mizoguchi, Tazuko Sakane, Shigeto Miki', 'Yoshikata Yoda, Matsutarō Kawaguchi', 'Shōtarō Hanayagi, Kakuko Mori, Kōkichi Takada, Kinnosuke Takamatsu, Gonjurô Kawarazaki, Benkei Shiganoya, Kikuko Hanaoka, Nobuko Fushimi', null, 'In late 19th-century Tokyo, Kikunosuke Onoue, the adopted son of a legendary actor, himself an actor specializing in female roles, discovers that the praise he receives is only due to his status as his father''s heir. Devastated, he turns to Otoku, a servant of his family, for comfort, and they fall in love. Kikunosuke becomes determined to leave home and develop as an actor on his own merits, and Otoku faithfully joins him.', 'In late 19th-century Tokyo, Kikunosuke Onoue, the adopted son of a legendary actor, himself an actor specializing in female roles, discovers that the praise he receives is only due to his status as his father''s heir. Devastated, he turns to Otoku, a servant of his family, for comfort, and they fall in love. Kikunosuke becomes determined to leave home and develop as an actor on his own merits, and Otoku faithfully joins him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m43EBVmYBiNC2RtcMUAag4IWsZS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46069'),
  ('885646474267539742', 'The Story of the Stone', 2018, 'Drama, Crime, Romance', 'Starr Wu', 'Starr Wu', 'Sky Li, Aric Chen, J.R. Chien, Etsen Chen, Stephen Rong, Dean Tong, Li-Yun Tsai, Adam Lin', null, 'A young gay man navigates the nightlife of Taipei, its thrills and heartbreaks, dangers and dreams, in this coming-of-age saga.', 'A young gay man navigates the nightlife of Taipei, its thrills and heartbreaks, dangers and dreams, in this coming-of-age saga.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iX8oYFp6Ptyl7FclEiMft7OLlpm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:538514'),
  ('1001837827142455410', 'The Story of the Voyages', 1983, 'Family, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Aleksandr Mitta, N. Esadze, Milan Vácha', 'Yuli Dunsky, Valeri Frid, Aleksandr Mitta', 'Andrey Mironov, Tatyana Aksyuta, Lev Durov, Kseniya Piryatinskaya, Valeriy Storozhik, Baltabay Seitmamytuly, Carmen Galin, Marie Rosůlková', null, 'In this fantasy with dragons and flying machines, 10-year-old Marta is determined to find her brother who was kidnapped at Christmastime by a fake Saint Nick because the little boy is blessed with the ability to locate gold. A kindly, wise philosopher-type by the name of Orlando joins Marta in her search, and together they survive a gigantic sleeping dragon and imprisonment in a tower with no clear means of escape. They overcome that hurdle, but later on, Orlando succumbs to the evils of The Plague (an all-consuming woman!) and Marta continues on her search alone. Eventually, she does find her brother -- but that only introduces problems she had never considered.', 'In this fantasy with dragons and flying machines, 10-year-old Marta is determined to find her brother who was kidnapped at Christmastime by a fake Saint Nick because the little boy is blessed with the ability to locate gold. A kindly, wise philosopher-type by the name of Orlando joins Marta in her search, and together they survive a gigantic sleeping dragon and imprisonment in a tower with no clear means of escape. They overcome that hurdle, but later on, Orlando succumbs to the evils of The Plague (an all-consuming woman!) and Marta continues on her search alone. Eventually, she does find her brother -- but that only introduces problems she had never considered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qbtWz2qjxThJGPMyld0uqTkSY4M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:167858'),
  ('515164978423374429', 'The Story of the Weeping Camel', 2004, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Byambasuren Davaa, Luigi Falorni, Sebastian Grundt', 'Byambasuren Davaa, Luigi Falorni', 'Janchiv Ayurzana, Chimed Ohin, Amgaabazar Gonson, Zeveljamz Nyam, Ikhbayar Amgaabazar, Odgerel Ayusch, Enkhbulgan Ikhbayar, Uuganbaatar Ikhbayar', null, 'When a Mongolian nomadic family''s newest camel colt is rejected by its mother, a musician is needed for a ritual to change her mind.', 'When a Mongolian nomadic family''s newest camel colt is rejected by its mother, a musician is needed for a ritual to change her mind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c3SAAO5hNJqLWLlJr9TZ6CQ8eGI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1114'),
