  ('138530547667996919', 'The Story of Us', 1999, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Michael Chapman, Rob Reiner, Frank Capra III', 'Alan Zweibel, Jessie Nelson', 'Bruce Willis, Michelle Pfeiffer, Rob Reiner, Colleen Rennison, Jake Sandvig, Julie Hagerty, Rita Wilson, Paul Reiser', 'R', 'After 15 years of marriage, Katie and her husband, Ben, have grown apart. While they keep up the facade of having a contented marriage, mostly to not worry their children, they aren''t happy together and argue frequently. While the kids are away at camp, Katie and Ben decide to separate and try to reassess their relationship to see if they should stay together or split up for good.', 'After 15 years of marriage, Katie and her husband, Ben, have grown apart. While they keep up the facade of having a contented marriage, mostly to not worry their children, they aren''t happy together and argue frequently. While the kids are away at camp, Katie and Ben decide to separate and try to reassess their relationship to see if they should stay together or split up for good.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8rm0CZpHW1D7pIv8OguJNHF93LV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12220'),
  ('69618633447487788', 'The Story of Vernon and Irene Castle', 1939, 'Music, Romance', 'H. C. Potter, Perry Ferguson, Victor Baravalle', 'Richard Sherman', 'Fred Astaire, Ginger Rogers, Edna May Oliver, Walter Brennan, Lew Fields, Etienne Girardot, Janet Beecher, Rolfe Sedan', 'PG', 'In 1911, minor stage comic, Vernon Castle meets the stage-struck Irene Foote. A few misadventures later, they marry and then abandon comedy to attempt a dancing career together. While they''re performing in Paris, an agent sees them rehearse and starts them on their brilliant career as the world''s foremost ballroom dancers. However, at the height of their fame, World War I begins.', 'In 1911, minor stage comic, Vernon Castle meets the stage-struck Irene Foote. A few misadventures later, they marry and then abandon comedy to attempt a dancing career together. While they''re performing in Paris, an agent sees them rehearse and starts them on their brilliant career as the world''s foremost ballroom dancers. However, at the height of their fame, World War I begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nIGYzyl31VD3doz9CYeh2yKHi0E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18651'),
  ('132345285905837850', 'The Story of Vickie', 1954, 'History, Romance, Comedy', 'Alexander Sawczynski, Bruno Mondi, Hermann Leitner', 'Ernst Marischka', 'Romy Schneider, Adrian Hoven, Magda Schneider, Karl Ludwig Diehl, Christl Mardayn, Paul Hörbiger, Rudolf Vogel, Fred Liewehr', null, 'Vickie, short for Victoria, is crowned Queen of England and as such needs to learn the responsibilities of her new post.', 'Vickie, short for Victoria, is crowned Queen of England and as such needs to learn the responsibilities of her new post.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f3JfFL9ilDHe4pMeM7RTBbUN6A3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46363'),
  ('786764760009482370', 'The Story of Woo Viet', 1981, 'Crime, Drama', 'Bill Wong Chung-Piu, Ann Hui, Stanley Kwan Kam-Pang', 'Alfred Cheung Kin-Ting', 'Chow Yun-Fat, Cora Miao, Cherie Chung Cho-Hung, Lo Lieh, Gam Biu, Homer Cheung, Tong Kam-Tong, Lam Ying-Fat', null, 'The Story of Woo Viet, seven years before they traded wistful looks in An Autumn''s Tale. Chow, in one of his earliest and meatiest film roles, plays the title role of Woo Viet, a Vietnamese refugee who hopes to immigrate to the United States.', 'The Story of Woo Viet, seven years before they traded wistful looks in An Autumn''s Tale. Chow, in one of his earliest and meatiest film roles, plays the title role of Woo Viet, a Vietnamese refugee who hopes to immigrate to the United States.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/twYWuPNFRaaZCULbSL8dk16mhE5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256071'),
