  ('1100824001963507729', 'The Strange Case of Angelica', 2010, 'Drama, Fantasy, Romance', 'Manoel de Oliveira, Gonçalo Pires, Sabine Lancelin', 'Manoel de Oliveira', 'Pilar López de Ayala, Leonor Silveira, Filipe Vargas, Ricardo Trêpa, Paulo Matos, Luis Miguel Cintra, Ana Maria Magalhães, Isabel Ruth', null, 'A photographer, Isaac is asked by hotel owners to take portraits of their recently deceased daughter Angélica. When he looks at her through the lens of his camera, she appears to come back to life just for him. He instantly falls in love with her. From that moment, he will be haunted by Angélica day and night.', 'A photographer, Isaac is asked by hotel owners to take portraits of their recently deceased daughter Angélica. When he looks at her through the lens of his camera, she appears to come back to life just for him. He instantly falls in love with her. From that moment, he will be haunted by Angélica day and night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dQy0i5hOQU2HkkhEJIFOrkLgYrO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53413'),
  ('1080056896059691983', 'The Strange Case of Doctor Rx', 1942, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Hans J. Salter, William Nigh, Elwood Bredell', 'Clarence Upson Young', 'Patric Knowles, Lionel Atwill, Anne Gwynne, Mantan Moreland, Samuel S. Hinds, Mona Barrie, Shemp Howard, Paul Cavanagh', null, 'Private eye Jerry Church is hired by a criminal defense lawyer after five mobsters he has gotten acquitted are apparently strangled by a serial killer.', 'Private eye Jerry Church is hired by a criminal defense lawyer after five mobsters he has gotten acquitted are apparently strangled by a serial killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l6UDxqX9OywkYdezlg7HuKTv1gC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84230'),
