  ('630334894326678734', 'The Strange Hostel of Naked Pleasures', 1976, 'Horror', 'Marcelo Motta, José Mojica Marins, Giorgio Attili', 'Rubens Francisco Lucchetti, José Mojica Marins', 'José Mojica Marins, Caçador Guerreiro, Maribeth Baumgarten, Luzia Zaracausca, Alfredo Almeida, Enicirley Nunes, David Húngaro, Elza Ferreira', null, 'An eclectic group of strangers seek shelter on a dark and stormy night, soon finding an isolated guest house owned by a mysterious proprietor.', 'An eclectic group of strangers seek shelter on a dark and stormy night, soon finding an isolated guest house owned by a mysterious proprietor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4UW2FlIgNKXzDK1o18EEVBOEOwP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70420'),
  ('301326655665065458', 'The Strange House', 2015, 'Drama, Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Danny Pang Phat', 'Chan Pang-Chun', 'Eddie Cheung Siu-Fai, Josie Xu Jiao, Tian Zitian, Song Yi', null, 'A young girl pretends to be the deceased granddaughter of an ailing grandmother soon to celebrate her birthday. The aged woman does not know her granddaughter has died; thinking she has only left, and the young girl, with her remarkable resemblance, is asked by the family to accompany the grandmother in her last days; posing as her granddaughter in order to cheer her up for her anniversary. The young girl suddenly experiences horrific visions of the dead granddaughter, and her life is threatened when the rest of the family suddenly conspires to kill her. Now in danger, she seeks the truth about the dead girl, while slowly succumbing to insanity as illusion and reality merge.', 'A young girl pretends to be the deceased granddaughter of an ailing grandmother soon to celebrate her birthday. The aged woman does not know her granddaughter has died; thinking she has only left, and the young girl, with her remarkable resemblance, is asked by the family to accompany the grandmother in her last days; posing as her granddaughter in order to cheer her up for her anniversary. The young girl suddenly experiences horrific visions of the dead granddaughter, and her life is threatened when the rest of the family suddenly conspires to kill her. Now in danger, she seeks the truth about the dead girl, while slowly succumbing to insanity as illusion and reality merge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ioO9K1G16d16nMaxqCSBSGW1O6E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:376549'),
  ('614877552417712622', 'The Strange Life of Dr. Frankenstein', 2018, 'Documentary, History, TV Movie', 'Jean Froment, Katell Djian', null, 'Béatrice Chéramy, Angela Wright, Christopher Frayling, Fiona Stafford, Gwyneth Jones, Jean-Claude Carrière, Laurent Lantieri, Miranda Seymour', 'PG', 'In 1818, Mary Shelley wrote Frankenstein; or, The Modern Prometheus, a powerful and timelessness novel which eternal theme is nothing other than man''s quest for the secret of life. Since then, the Creature became a pop culture icon, overshadowing the novel and Doctor Frankenstein himself.', 'In 1818, Mary Shelley wrote Frankenstein; or, The Modern Prometheus, a powerful and timelessness novel which eternal theme is nothing other than man''s quest for the secret of life. Since then, the Creature became a pop culture icon, overshadowing the novel and Doctor Frankenstein himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nUCbVmvGa5Au8QAb1Se7JfLVshZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:555479'),
  ('315978353149692334', 'The Strange Little Cat', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Ramon Zürcher, Alex Hasskerl', 'Ramon Zürcher', 'Anjorka Strechel, Jenny Schily, Matthias Dittmer, Luk Pfaff, Monika Hetterle, Kathleen Morgeneyer, Gustav Körner, Leon Beiersdorf', null, 'It is a Saturday in autumn, and Karin and Simon are visiting their parents and youngest sister Clara. This family gathering provides the occasion for a dinner together, at which other relatives appear over the course of the day. While the family members animate the apartment’s space with their conversations, everyday activities and cooking preparations, the cat and dog range through the various rooms. they too become a central element in this quotidian familial dance that repeatedly manifests stylized elements, disrupting any naturalistic mode of presentation. In this way, adjoining spaces open up between family drama, fairy tale and the psychological study of a mother.', 'It is a Saturday in autumn, and Karin and Simon are visiting their parents and youngest sister Clara. This family gathering provides the occasion for a dinner together, at which other relatives appear over the course of the day. While the family members animate the apartment’s space with their conversations, everyday activities and cooking preparations, the cat and dog range through the various rooms. they too become a central element in this quotidian familial dance that repeatedly manifests stylized elements, disrupting any naturalistic mode of presentation. In this way, adjoining spaces open up between family drama, fairy tale and the psychological study of a mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bcGc12rQIoEQzxgA2x0YKwYTM5B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:164328'),
  ('724435418185334519', 'The Strange Love of Martha Ivers', 1946, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Lewis Milestone, Victor Milner', 'Robert Rossen', 'Barbara Stanwyck, Van Heflin, Lizabeth Scott, Kirk Douglas, Judith Anderson, Roman Bohnen, Darryl Hickman, Janis Wilson', 'NR', 'Three childhood friends, Martha, Walter and Sam, share a terrible secret. Over time, the ambitious Martha and the pusillanimous Walter have married. She is a cold businesswoman; he is the district attorney: a perfect combination to dominate the corrupt city of Iverstown at will. But the unexpected return of Sam, after years of absence, deeply disturbs the life of the odd couple.', 'Three childhood friends, Martha, Walter and Sam, share a terrible secret. Over time, the ambitious Martha and the pusillanimous Walter have married. She is a cold businesswoman; he is the district attorney: a perfect combination to dominate the corrupt city of Iverstown at will. But the unexpected return of Sam, after years of absence, deeply disturbs the life of the odd couple.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iUAq0UYHglCsnHVbBLcJvZ6KQN9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27033'),
  ('514659195317016893', 'The Strange Love of Molly Louvain', 1932, 'Drama, Crime, Romance', 'Michael Curtiz, Robert Kurrle, Rufus Le Maire', 'Brown Holmes, Erwin S. Gelsey', 'Ann Dvorak, Lee Tracy, Richard Cromwell, Guy Kibbee, Leslie Fenton, Frank McHugh, Evalyn Knapp, Charles Middleton', 'NR', 'A fast-talking reporter befriends a young woman and her male companion who are wanted for a policeman''s shooting.', 'A fast-talking reporter befriends a young woman and her male companion who are wanted for a policeman''s shooting.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8xuEoLoS5dT04o0PEgLxZh9v8sg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159045'),
  ('812093722341830087', 'The Strange Monsieur Victor', 1938, 'Crime, Drama', 'Jean Grémillon, Werner Krien', 'Albert Valentin, Marcel Achard, Charles Spaak', 'Raimu, Madeleine Renaud, Pierre Blanchar, Viviane Romance, Andrex, Marcelle Géniat, Georges Flamant, Charles Blavette', null, 'Outwardly, Monsieur Victor would appear to be the model citizen. A respectable Toulon shopkeeper, he has a devoted wife and is courteous and considerate to all who know him. However, beneath this veneer of respectability hides a notorious receiver of stolen goods, who trades with hardened criminals. Victor manages to keep up his double life without any difficulty until the fateful day when one of his partners in crime threatens to expose him. Fearing a scandal, Victor kills the crook in a moment of panic, using a shoemaker''s tool. Naturally, the murder is blamed on a local shoemaker, who is sentenced to ten years'' hard labour. Seven years later, the former shoemaker reappears in Toulon, having escaped from prison. The first person to recognise him is Monsieur Victor...', 'Outwardly, Monsieur Victor would appear to be the model citizen. A respectable Toulon shopkeeper, he has a devoted wife and is courteous and considerate to all who know him. However, beneath this veneer of respectability hides a notorious receiver of stolen goods, who trades with hardened criminals. Victor manages to keep up his double life without any difficulty until the fateful day when one of his partners in crime threatens to expose him. Fearing a scandal, Victor kills the crook in a moment of panic, using a shoemaker''s tool. Naturally, the murder is blamed on a local shoemaker, who is sentenced to ten years'' hard labour. Seven years later, the former shoemaker reappears in Toulon, having escaped from prison. The first person to recognise him is Monsieur Victor...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/799QZHQDvij2le5nund5GfdXgJG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133840'),
  ('563498556127001609', 'The Strange One', 1957, 'Drama', 'Jack Grossberg, Arthur Steckler, Jack Garfein', 'Calder Willingham', 'Ben Gazzara, Pat Hingle, Peter Mark Richman, Arthur Storch, Paul E. Richards, Larry Gates, Clifton James, Geoffrey Horne', 'NR', 'A military school student develops a destructive power over his fellow cadets.', 'A military school student develops a destructive power over his fellow cadets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b0SrpyJp7R2UG8cLFEo5qsZ1QHx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80264'),
  ('840844084931732165', 'The Strange Ones', 1950, 'Drama', 'Jean-Pierre Melville, Henri Decaë, Serge Bourguignon', 'Jean-Pierre Melville, Jean Cocteau', 'Nicole Stéphane, Edouard Dermithe, Renée Cosima, Jacques Bernard, Jean Cocteau, Melvyn Martin, Maria Cyliakus, Jean-Marie Robain', null, 'Elisabeth and her brother Paul live isolated from much of the world after Paul is injured in a snowball fight. As a coping mechanism, the two conjure up a hermetic dream of their own making. Their relationship, however, isn''t exactly wholesome. Jealousy and a malevolent undercurrent intrude on their fantasy when Elisabeth invites the strange Agathe to stay with them -- and Paul is immediately attracted to her.', 'Elisabeth and her brother Paul live isolated from much of the world after Paul is injured in a snowball fight. As a coping mechanism, the two conjure up a hermetic dream of their own making. Their relationship, however, isn''t exactly wholesome. Jealousy and a malevolent undercurrent intrude on their fantasy when Elisabeth invites the strange Agathe to stay with them -- and Paul is immediately attracted to her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yxcc8CfOn6M2HSGbjaDkAKb0QNQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15390'),
  ('983744588627704743', 'The Strange Ones', 2018, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Lauren Wolkstein, Christopher Radcliff, Todd Banhazl', 'Christopher Radcliff', 'Alex Pettyfer, James Freedson-Jackson, Marin Ireland, Cindy Cheung, Melanie Nicholls-King, Gene Jones, Owen Campbell, Emily Althaus', 'R', 'Mysterious events surround the travels of two brothers as they make their way across a remote American landscape. On the surface all seems normal, but what appears to be a simple vacation soon gives way to a dark and complex web of secrets. This is the feature film version of the 2011 short film going by the same name.', 'Mysterious events surround the travels of two brothers as they make their way across a remote American landscape. On the surface all seems normal, but what appears to be a simple vacation soon gives way to a dark and complex web of secrets. This is the feature film version of the 2011 short film going by the same name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bbeS9X3xTHrziocOov750LoWmvo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:426258'),
  ('127189478923935409', 'The Strange Saga of Hiroshi the Freeloading Sex Machine', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Yūji Tajiri, Masahide Iioka', 'Fumio Moriya', 'Rinako Hirasawa, Minami Aiyama, Akino Hirasawa, Takeshi Itō, Hidetoshi Kawaya, Setsuhiko Kobayashi, Yuya Matsuura, Kazuhiro Sano', null, 'Sex Machine tells of the affable but simple Hiroshi, who during one sweltering summer in a small, parochial town, moves in with his girlfriend, Haruka. Their lovemaking is as athletic as it is bizarre but a dark storm comes looming when Haruka''s ex boyfriend comes knocking at the door.', 'Sex Machine tells of the affable but simple Hiroshi, who during one sweltering summer in a small, parochial town, moves in with his girlfriend, Haruka. Their lovemaking is as athletic as it is bizarre but a dark storm comes looming when Haruka''s ex boyfriend comes knocking at the door.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A26f1qs19XTYseRdLPvJ2Ob6bQp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44124'),
  ('923274614124923197', 'The Strange Summer', 2017, 'Drama', 'Jules Herrmann', 'Jules Herrmann', 'Godehard Giese, Adeline Moreau, Fabien Ara, Bettina Grahs, Alain Denizart, Denise Lecocq, Morgane Delamotte', null, 'The teacher Antek Liebmann moves to the French countryside to leave his former life in Germany behind. He soon gets a job and finds himself in a new relationship...', 'The teacher Antek Liebmann moves to the French countryside to leave his former life in Germany behind. He soon gets a job and finds himself in a new relationship...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eGqxZjTblGNr545HW4VOVCgRXJr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:381765'),
  ('355166200303975923', 'The Strange Type', 1963, 'Comedy', 'Lucio Fulci, Stefano Rolla, Nino Zanchin', 'Lucio Fulci, Vittorio Metz', 'Adriano Celentano, Claudia Mori, Donatella Turri, Giacomo Furia, Rosalba Neri, Luigi Pavese, Carlo Campanini, Gianni Agus', null, 'Peppino, a slow-witted local villager of the Italian resort town of Amalfi, is bribed to impersonate famed rock and roll star Adriano Celentano for autographs and personal appearances. While Celentano tries to romance Emanuela Mazzolani, the daughter of a well-to-do resident who dissaproves of the union between his daughter and the man he thinks of as a "punk", Peppino, unaware of the true nature of his job to impersonate Celentano, tries to deal with his girlfriend''s newborn baby which gets switched around between him and Celentano.', 'Peppino, a slow-witted local villager of the Italian resort town of Amalfi, is bribed to impersonate famed rock and roll star Adriano Celentano for autographs and personal appearances. While Celentano tries to romance Emanuela Mazzolani, the daughter of a well-to-do resident who dissaproves of the union between his daughter and the man he thinks of as a "punk", Peppino, unaware of the true nature of his job to impersonate Celentano, tries to deal with his girlfriend''s newborn baby which gets switched around between him and Celentano.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k7FKBtEGc83PApopLw4TwLxwxch.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81654'),
  ('611944043438855926', 'The Strange Vice of Mrs Wardh', 1971, 'Horror, Mystery, Crime', 'Sergio Martino, Florian Trenker, Emilio Foriscot', 'Vittorio Caronia, Ernesto Gastaldi, Eduardo Manzanos', 'Edwige Fenech, George Hilton, Ivan Rassimov, Conchita Airoldi, Manuel Gil, Carlo Alighiero, Alberto de Mendoza, Bruno Corazzari', null, 'When socialite and heiress Julie Wardh begins receiving blackmail letters attributed to a mysterious serial killer, she suspects her cruel and sadistic former lover Jean is behind them. With her husband Neil frequently out of town, she falls into the arms of her friend''s cousin George, and as the unknown assassin begins to make his move, she fears that one of the three men in her life may be the killer.', 'When socialite and heiress Julie Wardh begins receiving blackmail letters attributed to a mysterious serial killer, she suspects her cruel and sadistic former lover Jean is behind them. With her husband Neil frequently out of town, she falls into the arms of her friend''s cousin George, and as the unknown assassin begins to make his move, she fears that one of the three men in her life may be the killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6UvVeGdC1DFc97e8U2Jis121bjq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30903'),
  ('713853885416374333', 'The Strange Woman', 1946, 'Drama, Thriller, History', 'Edgar G. Ulmer, Lucien N. Andriot, Victor Greene', 'Hunt Stromberg, Edgar G. Ulmer', 'Hedy Lamarr, George Sanders, Louis Hayward, Gene Lockhart, Hillary Brooke, Rhys Williams, June Storey, Moroni Olsen', 'NR', 'In early 19th century New England, an unscrupulous woman uses her beauty and wits to seduce, deceive and control the men around her.', 'In early 19th century New England, an unscrupulous woman uses her beauty and wits to seduce, deceive and control the men around her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4hlj2BT6b1N2jJnBabJdMHUC4ir.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32945'),
  ('1058367451798034939', 'The Strange World of Coffin Joe', 1968, 'Horror, Thriller', 'José Mojica Marins', 'Rubens Francisco Lucchetti', 'José Mojica Marins, Luiz Sérgio Person, Mario Lima, Íris Bruzzi, Oswaldo De Souza, Nidi Reis, Vany Miller, Verônica Krimann', null, 'Coffin Joe hosts this anthology of three short horror stories which feature a strange dollmaker, a necrophiliac balloon seller with a foot fetish, and a psychotic professor involved in sadistic rituals.', 'Coffin Joe hosts this anthology of three short horror stories which feature a strange dollmaker, a necrophiliac balloon seller with a foot fetish, and a psychotic professor involved in sadistic rituals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j8C2FN710FCKnuEHPT8OXbkJrmC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107016'),
  ('196033107886390933', 'The Strange World of Planet X', 1958, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Gilbert Gunn, Josef Ambor', 'Paul Ryder', 'Forrest Tucker, Gaby André, Martin Benson, Alec Mango, Wyndham Goldie, Hugh Latimer, Dandy Nichols, Richard Warner', 'NR', 'Near a small English village, a scientific team is conducting experiments with magnetic fields, the results of which may have military applications but the intensification of which seem to be connected to UFO reports, a series of murders, an enormous insect egg, and a strange visitor with exceptional scientific knowledge.', 'Near a small English village, a scientific team is conducting experiments with magnetic fields, the results of which may have military applications but the intensification of which seem to be connected to UFO reports, a series of murders, an enormous insect egg, and a strange visitor with exceptional scientific knowledge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e1XJeRBmbIgnHU6YseqMLNLREhw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71990'),
  ('1075418199799948897', 'The Strangeness', 1985, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Melanie Anne Phillips, Stephen Greenfield, Kevin O''Brien', 'Melanie Anne Phillips, Chris Huntley', 'Dan Lunham, Terri Berland, Mark Sawicki, Chris Huntley, Rolf Theison, Keith Hurt, Diane Borcyckowski, Robin Sortman', null, 'A group of young miners venture into the Gold Spike Mine in search of gold, even after being warned by old-time prospectors to stay away. The miners proceed into the caverns anyway and soon realize that there’s no gold in these mines, but also that they’re not alone.', 'A group of young miners venture into the Gold Spike Mine in search of gold, even after being warned by old-time prospectors to stay away. The miners proceed into the caverns anyway and soon realize that there’s no gold in these mines, but also that they’re not alone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7dqpavG1WhJdvwSPdwLtMbWeNHz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92702'),
  ('30881361571210449', 'The Stranger', 1946, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Orson Welles, Russell Metty, Arthur Johns', 'John Huston, Orson Welles', 'Edward G. Robinson, Loretta Young, Orson Welles, Philip Merivale, Richard Long, Konstantin Shayne, Byron Keith, Billy House', null, 'An investigator from the War Crimes Commission travels to Connecticut to find an infamous Nazi, who may be hiding out in a small town in the guise of a distinguished professor engaged to the Supreme Court Justice’s daughter.', 'An investigator from the War Crimes Commission travels to Connecticut to find an infamous Nazi, who may be hiding out in a small town in the guise of a distinguished professor engaged to the Supreme Court Justice’s daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bzjoPScBLUWpSu10m3GbSbSwVhS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20246'),
  ('1022318458542362313', 'The Stranger', 1967, 'Drama', 'Luchino Visconti, Giuseppe Rotunno, Rinaldo Ricci', 'Suso Cecchi d''Amico, Georges Conchon, Luchino Visconti', 'Marcello Mastroianni, Anna Karina, Bernard Blier, Alfred Adam, Pierre Bertin, Angela Luce, Jacques Herlin, Mimmo Palmara', null, 'Meursault is a man who feels utterly isolated from everyone and everything around him. This alienation results in sudden, inexplicable bursts of violence, culminating in murder.', 'Meursault is a man who feels utterly isolated from everyone and everything around him. This alienation results in sudden, inexplicable bursts of violence, culminating in murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q4SP2AyOyMAdWZhgWvDLZ9MY680.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31332'),
  ('218942749302625798', 'The Stranger', 1973, 'TV Movie, Science Fiction, Drama', 'Lee H. Katzin', 'Gerald Sanford', 'Glenn Corbett, Cameron Mitchell, Sharon Acker, Lew Ayres, George Coulouris, Dean Jagger, Steve Franken, Tim O''Connor', null, 'An astronaut enters a vortex and crash-lands on a parallel planet where he''s not welcome.', 'An astronaut enters a vortex and crash-lands on a parallel planet where he''s not welcome.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cW9O7ge37Miw2aKeG7BFDO8Jon0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:160799'),
  ('577175746878932459', 'The Stranger', 1987, 'Thriller', 'Adolfo Aristarain, Fernando Bassi, Antonio Barrio', 'Dan Gurskis', 'Bonnie Bedelia, Peter Riegert, Barry Primus, David Spielberg, Marcos Woinsky, Cecilia Roth, Jacques Arndt, Ricardo Darín', 'R', 'Bonnie Bedilia stars in this psychological thriller about a woman who witnesses a murder and then flees. During her escape, she has a car accident. She becomes an amnesia victim and although, she doesn''t know her own identity, is able to describe the murder, but doesn''t remember where it occurred or who was involved.', 'Bonnie Bedilia stars in this psychological thriller about a woman who witnesses a murder and then flees. During her escape, she has a car accident. She becomes an amnesia victim and although, she doesn''t know her own identity, is able to describe the murder, but doesn''t remember where it occurred or who was involved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nFqZrCmAmh4sEzfswNJZdU6JWdB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:275729'),
  ('693431105286290199', 'The Stranger', 1991, 'Drama', 'Satyajit Ray, Ramen Chatterjee, Subrata Lahiri', 'Satyajit Ray', 'Utpal Dutt, Dipankar Dey, Mamata Shankar, Bikram Bhattacharya, Rabi Ghosh, Dhritiman Chatterjee, Subrata Chattopadhyay, Promode Ganguly', null, 'A well-off Indian family is paid an unexpected, and rather unwanted, visit by a man claiming to be the woman''s long lost uncle. The initial suspicion with which they greet the man slowly dissolves as he regales them with stories of his travels, tales that are at odds with their conventional middle class perspective on the world.', 'A well-off Indian family is paid an unexpected, and rather unwanted, visit by a man claiming to be the woman''s long lost uncle. The initial suspicion with which they greet the man slowly dissolves as he regales them with stories of his travels, tales that are at odds with their conventional middle class perspective on the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uNYlRzs8PBGCvJO5O9NO3Hx7L3x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41781'),
  ('579959799064333983', 'The Stranger', 1995, 'Action', 'Fritz Kiersch, Christopher Walling, Kurt Bryant', 'Gregory Poirier', 'Kathy Long, Andrew Divoff, Eric Pierpoint, Robin Lynn Heath, Ash Adams, Ginger Lynn, David Anthony Marshall, Nils Allen Stewart', 'R', 'In this modern retelling of High Plains Drifter, a female biker rides into a desert town to seek revenge on "Angel" and his ruthless gang.', 'In this modern retelling of High Plains Drifter, a female biker rides into a desert town to seek revenge on "Angel" and his ruthless gang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1WwDuojrgL9u6DT1nTkumZoR5xL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56451'),
  ('928037584458754307', 'The Stranger', 2010, 'Action, Thriller, Mystery, Crime', 'Rob Lieberman, Peter F. Woeste, Robert Crippen', 'Quinn Scott', 'Steve Austin, Erica Cerra, Calista Bashuk, Karly Warkentin, Dalila Bela, Adam Beach, Samantha Page, John Tench', 'R', 'The Stranger is a man with no name, no memory and absolutely nothing left to lose. But when he finds himself hunted by both the FBI and the Russian mob, this amnesiac decides to fight back. Pursuit cannot stop him. Torture will not break him. And with every beating, bullet and betrayal, he’ll remember another piece of the horror that took away his career, his family and his identity.', 'The Stranger is a man with no name, no memory and absolutely nothing left to lose. But when he finds himself hunted by both the FBI and the Russian mob, this amnesiac decides to fight back. Pursuit cannot stop him. Torture will not break him. And with every beating, bullet and betrayal, he’ll remember another piece of the horror that took away his career, his family and his identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fXg4MXYruDKrssFmfzKlf2TINJb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38166'),
  ('183019097072247447', 'The Stranger', 2014, 'Thriller, Horror, Mystery', 'Guillermo Amoedo, Chechu Graf', 'Guillermo Amoedo', 'Lorenza Izzo, Ariel Levy, Aaron Burns, Cristo Montt, Luis Gnecco, Sally Rose, Pablo Vila, Alessandra Guerzoni', null, 'A supernatural thriller, laced by flashbacks, and set in Canada’s North-West, “The Stranger” turns on the mysterious titular figure of Martin, who comes to a small quiet town seeking to kill his wife Ana who suffers from a very dangerous decease that makes her addicted to human blood - just like himself-. However, when he arrives to the town, he discovers that Ana has been dead for a couple of years and decides to commit suicide to definitely eradicate this dangerous decease, but, before he can do it, Martin''s brutally attacked by three local thugs led by Caleb, the son of a corrupt police lieutenant, and the incident suddenly starts a snowball that will plunge the community into a bloodbath.', 'A supernatural thriller, laced by flashbacks, and set in Canada’s North-West, “The Stranger” turns on the mysterious titular figure of Martin, who comes to a small quiet town seeking to kill his wife Ana who suffers from a very dangerous decease that makes her addicted to human blood - just like himself-. However, when he arrives to the town, he discovers that Ana has been dead for a couple of years and decides to commit suicide to definitely eradicate this dangerous decease, but, before he can do it, Martin''s brutally attacked by three local thugs led by Caleb, the son of a corrupt police lieutenant, and the incident suddenly starts a snowball that will plunge the community into a bloodbath.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8YjSy1vG4yuuatgdAU1NbitA52F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:291151'),
  ('312520527596004936', 'The Stranger', 2022, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Thomas M. Wright, Sam Chiplin', 'Thomas M. Wright', 'Joel Edgerton, Sean Harris, Jada Alberts, Fletcher Humphrys, Mike Foenander, Steve Mouzakis, Simon Elrahi, Alan Dukes', 'R', 'Two strangers strike up a conversation on a long journey. However, neither is who they appear to be, each carry secrets that threaten to ruin them — and in the background, one of the nation''s largest police operations is closing in.', 'Two strangers strike up a conversation on a long journey. However, neither is who they appear to be, each carry secrets that threaten to ruin them — and in the background, one of the nation''s largest police operations is closing in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ydbm5Ad1nyZq7eywWsw82Wxdsgg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:848791'),
  ('100566002013041211', 'The Stranger and the Gunfighter', 1974, 'Action, Western, Comedy', 'Alejandro Ulloa, Antonio Margheriti', 'Barth Jules Sussman', 'Lee Van Cleef, Lo Lieh, Wang Hsieh, Chan Shen, Ching Miao, Karen Yip Leng-Chi, Patty Shepard, Femi Benussi', 'PG', 'During a hold-up in the Wild West, Dakota kills a rich old Chinese man, Wang. Later, he is captured, sentenced, and is about to be hanged - and he never profitted from Wang''s death, has he buried him with the photographs of his four widows, and a few worthless papers. Meanwhile, Ho comes to America in search of his uncle''s fortune, and must get Dakota free, as he his the only man who can lead him to Wang''s tomb. They open the tomb, retaking the pictures of Wang''s widows. It happens he reads the papers and knows that Wang had one quarter of a map tattooed in each of his women''s buttocks. Now, the difficult part will really start... Treasure hunt.', 'During a hold-up in the Wild West, Dakota kills a rich old Chinese man, Wang. Later, he is captured, sentenced, and is about to be hanged - and he never profitted from Wang''s death, has he buried him with the photographs of his four widows, and a few worthless papers. Meanwhile, Ho comes to America in search of his uncle''s fortune, and must get Dakota free, as he his the only man who can lead him to Wang''s tomb. They open the tomb, retaking the pictures of Wang''s widows. It happens he reads the papers and knows that Wang had one quarter of a map tattooed in each of his women''s buttocks. Now, the difficult part will really start... Treasure hunt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9z8QUU352esv2CKD9QRqTfDLW6n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42544'),
  ('205221166552948008', 'The Stranger Beside Me', 1995, 'Thriller, TV Movie', 'Sandor Stern, Larry Lipton, Susie Flower', 'Bruce Miller', 'Tiffani-Amber Thiessen, Eric Close, Lorrie Morgan, Steven Eckholdt, Casey Sander, Alyson Hannigan, Patrick Labyorteaux, Gerald McRaney', 'PG-13', 'When Jennifer marries Chris, it seems she can finally let go of her tragic past. But behind the perfect facade lies a violent, possessive dark side--and a past filled with secrets. As she begins to suspect his involvement with a string of rapes, Jennifer sets out to expose the horrifying truth about her husband...before he strikes again.', 'When Jennifer marries Chris, it seems she can finally let go of her tragic past. But behind the perfect facade lies a violent, possessive dark side--and a past filled with secrets. As she begins to suspect his involvement with a string of rapes, Jennifer sets out to expose the horrifying truth about her husband...before he strikes again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cDbF8bejKlUe7w2yAZ4Vch0xEKT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107729'),
  ('993267898259848270', 'The Stranger Beside Me', 2003, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime, TV Movie', 'Paul Shapiro, Ron Orieux', null, 'Billy Campbell, Barbara Hershey, Kevin Dunn, Maureen Thomas, Suki Kaiser, Brenda James, Jay Brazeau, Ben Immanuel', 'PG-13', 'While working at a Seattle clinic for women in the 1970s, Ann Rule becomes friends with Ted Bundy. Based on a book by Ann Rule.', 'While working at a Seattle clinic for women in the 1970s, Ann Rule becomes friends with Ted Bundy. Based on a book by Ann Rule.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rSqNYIYRLSfbHeZ6ExSrei8zWZI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48891'),
  ('137986284093743535', 'The Stranger by the Shore', 2020, 'Animation, Romance, Drama', 'Mayumi Watanabe, Akiyo Ohashi, Tomoko Minobe', 'Akiyo Ohashi', 'Taishi Murata, Yoshitsugu Matsuoka, Yu Shimamura, Kanae Itou, Sayaka Nakaya, Hana Sato', null, 'Abandoned after coming out, Shun befriends Mio just before he has to move. Years later, Mio returns with a confession. How will Shun feel?', 'Abandoned after coming out, Shun befriends Mio just before he has to move. Years later, Mio returns with a confession. How will Shun feel?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4m74lboTcvrmnCM506t4y4c3klc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:642121'),
  ('408648745096077749', 'The Stranger Came Home', 1954, 'Mystery, Drama, Crime', 'Terence Fisher, Walter J. Harvey, John Hollingsworth', 'Michael Carreras', 'Paulette Goddard, William Sylvester, Patrick Holt, Paul Carpenter, Alvys Maben, Russell Napier, Kay Callard, David King-Wood', 'NR', 'Someone knocked out a man and left him for dead during a fishing trip in Portugal. That someone is either his fetching wife, or two business partners, all sporting guilty faces after his unexpected return. Two more murders and a frame-up befall the quartet before an inspector closes the case.', 'Someone knocked out a man and left him for dead during a fishing trip in Portugal. That someone is either his fetching wife, or two business partners, all sporting guilty faces after his unexpected return. Two more murders and a frame-up befall the quartet before an inspector closes the case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nLWGeg7YfR2JAJV2POQpWqxaI8L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124557'),
  ('264213295469554434', 'The Stranger in Me', 2008, 'Drama', 'Emily Atef', 'Emily Atef', 'Susanne Wolff, Johann von Bülow, Maren Kroymann, Hans Diehl, Judith Engel, Herbert Fritsch, Dörte Lyssewski, Brigitte Zeh', null, 'A young couple in love: Rebecca (32) and her boyfriend Julian (34) are expecting their first child and are full of pleasant expectation. As Rebecca gives birth to a healthy boy their luck seems to be perfect. But instead of the unconditional motherly love she was expecting she is thrown into an emotional turmoil. Helplessness and desperation reign and her own baby is a stranger to her. With every day that passes her inability to meet the demands of motherhood become more and more apparent. Unable to admit this to anyone, not even Julian, she falls into a deep darkness - to the point that she realises she is becoming a threat to her child. Now only unconditional love can bring her back on track…', 'A young couple in love: Rebecca (32) and her boyfriend Julian (34) are expecting their first child and are full of pleasant expectation. As Rebecca gives birth to a healthy boy their luck seems to be perfect. But instead of the unconditional motherly love she was expecting she is thrown into an emotional turmoil. Helplessness and desperation reign and her own baby is a stranger to her. With every day that passes her inability to meet the demands of motherhood become more and more apparent. Unable to admit this to anyone, not even Julian, she falls into a deep darkness - to the point that she realises she is becoming a threat to her child. Now only unconditional love can bring her back on track…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uhE6tl4W1gz7p3Lo3CyEF1QIGen.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54315'),
  ('388517399353695070', 'The Stranger in My Home', 2025, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Jeff Fisher', 'Chris Sivertson', 'Sophia Bush, Chris Carmack, Briana Price, Amiah Miller, Kate Rachesky, Monica Lacy, Charlotte Hemmings, Chris Johnson', 'R', 'A handsome stranger''s claim that a couple''s 15-year-old daughter was switched at birth throws their perfect family into turmoil, unearthing shattering secrets.', 'A handsome stranger''s claim that a couple''s 15-year-old daughter was switched at birth throws their perfect family into turmoil, unearthing shattering secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8rxFUdvtFwAxbyZfSBKPB2Vaal9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1389255'),
  ('623057888597332495', 'The Stranger in Our Bed', 2022, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Giles Alderson, Richard Swingle', 'Samantha Lee Howe', 'Emily Berrington, Ben Lloyd-Hughes, Samantha Bond, Joseph Marcell, Nina Wadia, Andi Osho, Bart Edwards, Paul Casar', null, 'A newly married woman leaves her wealthy husband for a lover who mysteriously disappears. Things start to unravel and become life-threatening on a trip to the husband''s family estate.', 'A newly married woman leaves her wealthy husband for a lover who mysteriously disappears. Things start to unravel and become life-threatening on a trip to the husband''s family estate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9bX57QlmpI1DcWLkggGmg5guqJx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:993621'),
  ('315775269801762823', 'The Stranger Returns', 1967, 'Western', 'Luigi Vanzi, Gaetano Scala, Marcello Masciocchi', 'Giuseppe Mangione', 'Tony Anthony, Dan Vadis, Daniele Vargas, Jill Banner, Ettore Manni, Marina Berti, Marco Guglielmi, Raf Baldassarre', 'R', 'The Stranger happens across a murdered postal inspector and a gang of bandits set on a prize of stolen gold which should be transported in a stagecoach. The Stranger, a sharpshooter named En plein and a treacherous postal agent try to get their hands on the gold. Source: SWDB www.spaghetti-western.net', 'The Stranger happens across a murdered postal inspector and a gang of bandits set on a prize of stolen gold which should be transported in a stagecoach. The Stranger, a sharpshooter named En plein and a treacherous postal agent try to get their hands on the gold. Source: SWDB www.spaghetti-western.net', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wjs9byN4KFVwWpyuaYeD0KXbXoK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144344'),
  ('5845499711071176', 'The Stranger Within', 1974, 'TV Movie, Mystery, Science Fiction', 'Lee Philips, Michael D. Margulies, Kurt Neumann', null, 'Barbara Eden, George Grizzard, Joyce Van Patten, David Doyle, Nehemiah Persoff', 'NR', 'Who is the father of Ann Collins’ baby? Her husband had a vasectomy years ago. And Ann hasn’t been with another man. Even more mysterious: as the baby grows inside her, Ann begins to change. She is beset by strange illnesses, pours tablespoons of salt on her food, turns the thermostat to 50 degrees, speed-reads academic tomes. But much bigger shocks are yet to come. Barbara Eden stars in this hypnotic, swiftly paced blend of horror and sci-fi from Richard Matheson, the popular and prolific writer who also penned the novel I AM LEGEND and several notable THE TWILIGHT ZONE scripts.', 'Who is the father of Ann Collins’ baby? Her husband had a vasectomy years ago. And Ann hasn’t been with another man. Even more mysterious: as the baby grows inside her, Ann begins to change. She is beset by strange illnesses, pours tablespoons of salt on her food, turns the thermostat to 50 degrees, speed-reads academic tomes. But much bigger shocks are yet to come. Barbara Eden stars in this hypnotic, swiftly paced blend of horror and sci-fi from Richard Matheson, the popular and prolific writer who also penned the novel I AM LEGEND and several notable THE TWILIGHT ZONE scripts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vt0L24tkp75CgSbz7WQkHUFwcpz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:217487'),
  ('142841952914329468', 'The Stranger Within a Woman', 1966, 'Crime, Drama', 'Mikio Naruse, Masazumi Kawanishi, Yasumichi Fukuzawa', 'Toshiro Ide', 'Keiju Kobayashi, Michiyo Aratama, Mitsuko Kusabue, Tatsuya Mihashi, Akiko Wakabayashi, Daisuke Katō, Toshio Kurosawa, Hisao Toake', null, 'Tashiro coincidentally meets his best friend Sugimoto in a bar very close to the apartment in which Sugimoto’s wayward wife is found dead. Although Tashiro is not a suspect in the police investigation, he is racked with guilt and confesses to his wife, Masako. In an effort to further relieve his tortured sense of guilt, he then confesses to Sugimoto. Neither his wife nor his friend can believe that he could have been involved.', 'Tashiro coincidentally meets his best friend Sugimoto in a bar very close to the apartment in which Sugimoto’s wayward wife is found dead. Although Tashiro is not a suspect in the police investigation, he is racked with guilt and confesses to his wife, Masako. In an effort to further relieve his tortured sense of guilt, he then confesses to Sugimoto. Neither his wife nor his friend can believe that he could have been involved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g0M0gz5f9HuHg7y1XW5yThgTr5o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138034'),
  ('81774415620031726', 'The Stranger Wore a Gun', 1953, 'Western', 'André de Toth, Willard M. Reineck, Mischa Bakaleinikoff', 'Kenneth Gamet', 'Randolph Scott, Claire Trevor, Lee Marvin, Ernest Borgnine, Joan Weldon, George Macready, Alfonso Bedoya, Pierre Watkin', 'NR', 'Having been a spy for Quantrill''s raiders during the Civil War, Jeff Travis thinking himself a wanted man, flees to Prescott Arizona where he runs into Jules Mourret who knows of his past. He takes a job on the stage line that Mourret is trying to steal gold from. When Mourret''s men kill a friend of his he sets out to get Mourret and his men. When his plan to have another gang get Mourret fails, he has to go after them himself.', 'Having been a spy for Quantrill''s raiders during the Civil War, Jeff Travis thinking himself a wanted man, flees to Prescott Arizona where he runs into Jules Mourret who knows of his past. He takes a job on the stage line that Mourret is trying to steal gold from. When Mourret''s men kill a friend of his he sets out to get Mourret and his men. When his plan to have another gang get Mourret fails, he has to go after them himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gCB76s6nPPt2vOjE1JZFvzpVLuw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43356'),
  ('82283077592492705', 'The Stranger''s Return', 1933, 'Drama, Romance', 'King Vidor, Douglas Shearer, William H. Daniels', 'Brown Holmes, Philip Stong', 'Lionel Barrymore, Miriam Hopkins, Franchot Tone, Stuart Erwin, Irene Hervey, Beulah Bondi, Grant Mitchell, Tad Alexander', 'NR', 'A divorcée leaves New York to visit her grandfather''s farm and recover in the Midwest, where she unexpectedly falls in love with a married farmer.', 'A divorcée leaves New York to visit her grandfather''s farm and recover in the Midwest, where she unexpectedly falls in love with a married farmer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nLnd54nZMmQeYKB4ITiLDGnDrxz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120657'),
  ('923323786971333131', 'The Strangers', 2008, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Bryan Bertino, Rudy Persico, Tim Fitzgerald', 'Bryan Bertino', 'Liv Tyler, Scott Speedman, Gemma Ward, Kip Weeks, Laura Margolis, Glenn Howerton, Alex Fisher, Peter Clayton-Luce', 'R', 'After a 4 a.m. knock at the door and haunting voices, Kristen McKay and James Hoyt’s remote getaway becomes a psychological night of terror as three masked strangers invade. Now they must go far beyond what they thought themselves capable of if they hope to survive.', 'After a 4 a.m. knock at the door and haunting voices, Kristen McKay and James Hoyt’s remote getaway becomes a psychological night of terror as three masked strangers invade. Now they must go far beyond what they thought themselves capable of if they hope to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gwsg4qFmLOvlhwXj4OZuxfFUdP0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10665'),
  ('433303988064483936', 'The Strangers: Chapter 1', 2024, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Renny Harlin, Jan Melikant, Mark Roper', 'Bryan Bertino', 'Madelaine Petsch, Froy Gutierrez, Gabriel Basso, Ema Horvath, Ella Bruccoleri, Richard Brake, Brooke Lena Johnson, Rafaella Biscayn-Debest', 'R', 'After their car breaks down in an eerie small town, a young couple are forced to spend the night in a remote cabin. Panic ensues as they are terrorized by three masked strangers who strike with no mercy and seemingly no motives.', 'After their car breaks down in an eerie small town, a young couple are forced to spend the night in a remote cabin. Panic ensues as they are terrorized by three masked strangers who strike with no mercy and seemingly no motives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oYsCNpW4k7Pd7ac3uQfBhr2ihtW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1010600'),
  ('151079463157570911', 'The Strangers: Chapter 2', 2025, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Renny Harlin, José David Montero, Mark Roper', 'Bryan Bertino', 'Madelaine Petsch, Froy Gutierrez, Gabriel Basso, Ema Horvath, Brooke Lena Johnson, Richard Brake, Pedro Leandro, Rachel Shenton', 'R', 'After learning that one of their victims, Maya, is still alive, The Strangers return to finish the job. With nowhere to run and no one to trust, Maya soon finds herself in a brutal fight for survival against psychopaths more than willing to kill anyone who stands in their way.', 'After learning that one of their victims, Maya, is still alive, The Strangers return to finish the job. With nowhere to run and no one to trust, Maya soon finds herself in a brutal fight for survival against psychopaths more than willing to kill anyone who stands in their way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pqADzs5SJvI2jC0DThPVMuNJcWS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1010756'),
  ('249083654395414889', 'The Strangers: Chapter 3', 2026, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Renny Harlin, José David Montero, Courtney Solomon', 'Alan Freedland, Alan R. Cohen, Bryan Bertino', 'Madelaine Petsch, Richard Brake, Ema Horvath, Gabriel Basso, Pedro Leandro, Rachel Shenton, George Young, Kyle Breitkopf', 'R', 'Tethered by a frightening conclusion, Maya and the Strangers are locked on an unavoidable, unforgiving collision course — a showdown that proves they’re far from strangers now.', 'Tethered by a frightening conclusion, Maya and the Strangers are locked on an unavoidable, unforgiving collision course — a showdown that proves they’re far from strangers now.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yPHwX78mcwJw3I6YOJ9qh2wQBFr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1010755'),
  ('975486384705527707', 'The Strangers: Prey at Night', 2018, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Johannes Roberts, Ryan Samul, Ilyssa Peltz', 'Bryan Bertino, Ben Ketai', 'Bailee Madison, Christina Hendricks, Martin Henderson, Lewis Pullman, Damian Maffei, Emma Bellomy, Lea Enslin, Mary Louise Casanta', 'R', 'A family''s road trip takes a dangerous turn when they arrive at a secluded mobile home park to stay with some relatives and find it mysteriously deserted. Under the cover of darkness, three masked killers pay them a visit to test the family''s every limit as they struggle to survive.', 'A family''s road trip takes a dangerous turn when they arrive at a secluded mobile home park to stay with some relatives and find it mysteriously deserted. Under the cover of darkness, three masked killers pay them a visit to test the family''s every limit as they struggle to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vdxLpPsZkPZdFrREp7eSeSzcimj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:371608'),
  ('1044423814289169395', 'The Strangler', 1964, 'Horror', 'Jacques R. Marquette, Burt Topper, Clark L. Paylow', 'Bill S. Ballinger', 'Victor Buono, David McLean, Diane Sayer, Davey Davison, Baynes Barron, Ellen Corby, Russ Bender, Jeanne Bates', null, 'An overweight lab technician with low self esteem, brought on by his dominant mother, becomes a serial killer of female nurses.', 'An overweight lab technician with low self esteem, brought on by his dominant mother, becomes a serial killer of female nurses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dnttPCxSz367Ue2htpedKXSnAWx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42796'),
  ('1007522654320749740', 'The Strangler', 1971, 'Crime, Horror, Thriller', 'Paul Vecchiali, Georges Strouvé', 'Paul Vecchiali', 'Jacques Perrin, Julien Guiomar, Eva Simonet, Paul Barge, Jacqueline Danno, Katia Cavaignac, Jean-Pierre Miquel, Hélène Surgère', 'NR', 'Émile targets women he believes are too depressed to go on living. As multiple victims fall to his suffocating white scarf, an inspector resorts to unorthodox methods to get him with the assistance of a potential victim.', 'Émile targets women he believes are too depressed to go on living. As multiple victims fall to his suffocating white scarf, an inspector resorts to unorthodox methods to get him with the assistance of a potential victim.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hfZvvus6fB3ZujnmYdZlOxy1TzM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:185843'),
  ('1131103868991486785', 'The Strangler of Blackmoor Castle', 1963, 'Crime, Thriller, Horror', 'Harald Reinl, Ernst W. Kalinke, Charles M. Wakefield', 'Ladislas Fodor, Gustav Kampendonk', 'Karin Dor, Harry Riebauer, Ingmar Zeisberg, Walter Giller, Rudolf Fernau, Hans Nielsen, Dieter Eppler, Hans Reiser', null, 'A strangler is loose on a British estate, and he not only strangles his victims but brands an "M" onto their foreheads before he decapitates them.', 'A strangler is loose on a British estate, and he not only strangles his victims but brands an "M" onto their foreheads before he decapitates them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sEXE3QSduKxvz5hAXkFAeHPfwkM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5634'),
  ('503951813723593142', 'The Stranglers of Bombay', 1959, 'Thriller, Crime, Horror', 'Terence Fisher, Arthur Grant', 'David Zelag Goodman', 'Guy Rolfe, Allan Cuthbertson, Andrew Cruickshank, George Pastell, Marne Maitland, Jan Holden, Paul Stassino, Tutte Lemkow', 'NR', 'In 1826 British-ruled India, the secret Cult of Thugee demonstrates their worship of their goddess, Kali, by the mutilation and mass murder of thousands of Indians while pirating the shipments of the British East-Indian Tea Company. As the British military leaders play down the implications of the piracy and disappearances, a lone captain realizes that they are not just coincidence and sets out to uncover the source of the deviltry, at the risk of his career. Based on history.', 'In 1826 British-ruled India, the secret Cult of Thugee demonstrates their worship of their goddess, Kali, by the mutilation and mass murder of thousands of Indians while pirating the shipments of the British East-Indian Tea Company. As the British military leaders play down the implications of the piracy and disappearances, a lone captain realizes that they are not just coincidence and sets out to uncover the source of the deviltry, at the risk of his career. Based on history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pQPz9R7Fr5FwEqe4FU4WrE2G3ba.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85611'),
  ('123332178142140003', 'The Strategy of Failure', 2001, 'Comedy', 'Dominique Farrugia, Pascal Gennesseaux', 'Dominique Farrugia, Laurent Zeitoun', 'Dominique Farrugia, Kad Merad, Maurice Barthélemy, Jean-Paul Rouve, Michel Field, Judith El Zein, Virginie Caliari, Pascale Ruben', null, 'My various experiences in the field of failure have allowed me to highlight specific areas in which it is crucial to get disorganized and to recognize the steps to be taken to end in ineffective management. This sentence is totally incomprehensible. It''s normal. The longer the sentences, the less we understand them. It is the strategy of failure. To help us understand the failure and illustrate this video, we will need two men who we will call Luc for further misunderstanding. We will also need a woman whom we will call Sylvie for hygiene reasons.', 'My various experiences in the field of failure have allowed me to highlight specific areas in which it is crucial to get disorganized and to recognize the steps to be taken to end in ineffective management. This sentence is totally incomprehensible. It''s normal. The longer the sentences, the less we understand them. It is the strategy of failure. To help us understand the failure and illustrate this video, we will need two men who we will call Luc for further misunderstanding. We will also need a woman whom we will call Sylvie for hygiene reasons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iJiVmex6FmNBhjQoeUGunEbSsk6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58487'),
  ('624238099839828493', 'The Strategy of the Snail', 1993, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Sergio Cabrera, Carlos Congote, William González', 'Humberto Dorado, Jorge Goldenberg, Frank Ramírez', 'Frank Ramírez, Fausto Cabrera, Florina Lemaitre, Humberto Dorado, Delfina Guido, Vicky Hernández, Gustavo Angarita, Luis Fernando Múnera', null, 'A group of tenants facing eviction due to a city renovation unite to fight back, but as they clash with the landlord and his ruthless attorney, they each transform into the opposite of who they once were.', 'A group of tenants facing eviction due to a city renovation unite to fight back, but as they clash with the landlord and his ruthless attorney, they each transform into the opposite of who they once were.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aSZ0HB5UxQrCn2NyiXIQkKgs89R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10000'),
  ('1050365702722946632', 'The Stratton Story', 1949, 'Drama, Romance', 'Adolph Deutsch, Sam Wood, Earl McEvoy', 'Douglas Morrow, Guy Trosper', 'James Stewart, June Allyson, Frank Morgan, Agnes Moorehead, Bill Williams, Bruce Cowling, Cliff Clark, Mary Lawrence', null, 'Star major league pitcher Monty Stratton loses a leg in a hunting accident, but becomes determined to leave the game on his own terms.', 'Star major league pitcher Monty Stratton loses a leg in a hunting accident, but becomes determined to leave the game on his own terms.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pp301J6FXlnHAoeY5zExdfui42N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43440'),
  ('145278157045756035', 'The Straw Hat', 1974, 'Comedy', 'Leonid Kvinikhidze', 'Leonid Kvinikhidze', 'Andrey Mironov, Lyudmila Gurchenko, Efim Kopelyan, Vladislav Strzhelchik, Mikhail Kozakov, Zinoviy Gerdt, Yekaterina Vasilyeva, Alisa Freyndlikh', null, 'A musical comedy based on the classic play by Eugène Labiche.', 'A musical comedy based on the classic play by Eugène Labiche.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Af4idqKyVcN2ZoJsTREokam62N3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63452'),
  ('906532383007286453', 'The Strawberry Blonde', 1941, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Raoul Walsh, James Wong Howe, Leo F. Forbstein', 'Julius J. Epstein, Philip G. Epstein', 'James Cagney, Olivia de Havilland, Rita Hayworth, Alan Hale, Jack Carson, George Tobias, Una O''Connor, George Reeves', 'NR', 'Biff Grimes is desperately in love with Virginia, but his best friend Hugo marries her and manipulates Biff into becoming involved in his somewhat nefarious businesses. Hugo appears to have stolen Biff''s dreams, and Biff has to deal with the realisation that having what he wants and wanting what another has can be very different things.', 'Biff Grimes is desperately in love with Virginia, but his best friend Hugo marries her and manipulates Biff into becoming involved in his somewhat nefarious businesses. Hugo appears to have stolen Biff''s dreams, and Biff has to deal with the realisation that having what he wants and wanting what another has can be very different things.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cjNJlLKUJQGysAiAucKLDOmzujr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76465'),
  ('112107686999718039', 'The Strawberry Statement', 1970, 'Drama, Romance', 'Stuart Hagmann, Ralph Woolsey', 'Israel Horovitz', 'Bruce Davison, Kim Darby, Bud Cort, Murray MacLeod, Tom Foral, Bob Balaban, Michael Margotta, Israel Horovitz', null, 'A college student joins a group of revolutionaries to meet girls but ends up committed to their goals.', 'A college student joins a group of revolutionaries to meet girls but ends up committed to their goals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kKhzIkHWrg51jkTRxq6eAhBSIIl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51956'),
  ('177730967465809320', 'The Stray White and the Speckled', 1986, 'Drama', 'Darezhan Omirbayev, Ardak Amirkulov, Rashid Nugmanov', 'Sergey Solovyov', 'Vyacheslav Ilyushchenko, Liubomiras Laucevičius, Sultan Banov, Vladimir Steklov, Ilya Ivanov, Andrei Bitov, Boris Olekhnovich, Aleksandr Bashirov', null, 'In a poor provincial town, the ragamuffin boys are frenziedly drilled for combat, and at nights the local elite, gathered in a pool room, boasts of fictitious biographies, while bands of boys amuse themselves with bloody fights on trashy vacant plots… One of the most vivid staples of the postwar childhood were pigeons. They could be bought, sold or stolen. One day a beautiful white dove appeared over the town. Risking his life, Ivan caught the White. And immediately became the target of the "pigeon" mafia…', 'In a poor provincial town, the ragamuffin boys are frenziedly drilled for combat, and at nights the local elite, gathered in a pool room, boasts of fictitious biographies, while bands of boys amuse themselves with bloody fights on trashy vacant plots… One of the most vivid staples of the postwar childhood were pigeons. They could be bought, sold or stolen. One day a beautiful white dove appeared over the town. Risking his life, Ivan caught the White. And immediately became the target of the "pigeon" mafia…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2hYEwa8qnRtwvNiRlk5gvsd4z4y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143119'),
  ('387492118577811005', 'The Strays', 2023, 'Thriller', 'Nathaniel Martello-White, Adam Scarth', 'Nathaniel Martello-White', 'Ashley Madekwe, Justin Salinger, Jorden Myrie, Bukky Bakray, Samuel Paul Small, Maria Almeida, Caroline Martin, Michael Warburton', 'R', 'A Black woman''s meticulously crafted life of privilege starts to unravel when two strangers show up in her quaint suburban town.', 'A Black woman''s meticulously crafted life of privilege starts to unravel when two strangers show up in her quaint suburban town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3OKBFYRVSKkBVJ7WpKogTVQfUqC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1063422'),
  ('427658006627605313', 'The Street', 1923, 'Drama, Crime', 'Karl Grune, Karl Hasselmann', 'Karl Grune, Julius Urgiss', 'Anton Edthofer, Aud Egede-Nissen, Leonhard Haskel, Lucie Höflich, Max Schreck, Eugen Klöpfer, Etelka Maquita, Hans Trautner', null, 'The movie follows two distinct plot lines until the two eventually merge: the first is that of the bored middle-aged man seeking a departure from monotony in his life; the second is that of the blind man and the little boy, his grandson, who are interdependent. None of the characters have been given names and are therefore referred to only by description. The city is an expressionistic nightmare, a dangerous and chaotic place.', 'The movie follows two distinct plot lines until the two eventually merge: the first is that of the bored middle-aged man seeking a departure from monotony in his life; the second is that of the blind man and the little boy, his grandson, who are interdependent. None of the characters have been given names and are therefore referred to only by description. The city is an expressionistic nightmare, a dangerous and chaotic place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/84cRJwtD6Yonnant5pSyvbb9xJl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130052'),
  ('578712293114854822', 'The Street', 1977, 'Comedy, Animation, Drama', 'Caroline Leaf', null, 'Mort Ransen, Sarah Dwight, John Hood, Vera Leitman, Howard Ryshpan', null, 'This film deals with a Jewish family in Montreal, Canada as they care for a dying grandmother and the young boy who is impatient to get the room he was promised as soon as she kicks the bucket.', 'This film deals with a Jewish family in Montreal, Canada as they care for a dying grandmother and the young boy who is impatient to get the room he was promised as soon as she kicks the bucket.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uT7noLBm6yw55UiqFgG74txkaCo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95380'),
  ('986714661936701797', 'The Street Fighter', 1974, 'Action, Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Shigehiro Ozawa, Takayuki Minagawa', 'Motohiro Torii, Kōji Takada', 'Sonny Chiba, Etsuko Shihomi, Goichi Yamada, Masashi Ishibashi, Yutaka Nakajima, Masafumi Suzuki, Fumio Watanabe, Rinichi Yamamoto', 'R', 'Takuma Tsurugi takes on the government, the police, the mafia and an international ring of kidnappers who aim to dispossess a beautiful young heiress of her millions.', 'Takuma Tsurugi takes on the government, the police, the mafia and an international ring of kidnappers who aim to dispossess a beautiful young heiress of her millions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e0g4jc7RQLkQitIKADjCfnyjYoj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40810'),
  ('628134665118485329', 'The Street Fighter''s Last Revenge', 1974, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Shigehiro Ozawa, Akira Shimizu, Nagaki Yamagishi', 'Kōji Takada, Seiko Shimura, Shigehiro Ozawa', 'Sonny Chiba, Reiko Ike, Kōji Wada, Tatsuo Endō, Akira Shioji, Seizō Fukumoto, Etsuko Shihomi, Masafumi Suzuki', null, 'Terry Sugury is hired to recover one of two tapes containing a formula for making heroin for a price of 200 dollars a pound. But he gets double crossed. So he wants the tape back.', 'Terry Sugury is hired to recover one of two tapes containing a formula for making heroin for a price of 200 dollars a pound. But he gets double crossed. So he wants the tape back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kciiX68V94RM8oAuNZUuUFQP2TZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40813'),
  ('908692142260298517', 'The Street Player', 1983, 'Drama', 'Mohamed Khan, Fawzy Ali, Saeed Shimi', 'Bashir El Deek', 'Adel Emam, Ferdoos Abdel Hamid, Nagah El-Mogui, Abdallah Farghaly, Zizi Mostafa, Abdullah Mahmoud, Hamdy El Wazeer, Sabry Abdelmonem', null, 'Fares, a shoe factory worker, has only one passion in life: football. He lives a humble life in a chaotic neighborhood where he plays street football to increase his income. However, neither his marriage nor his job is stable enough. He goes through a lot of problems due to his lack of self-discipline with his divorced wife and his son.', 'Fares, a shoe factory worker, has only one passion in life: football. He lives a humble life in a chaotic neighborhood where he plays street football to increase his income. However, neither his marriage nor his job is stable enough. He goes through a lot of problems due to his lack of self-discipline with his divorced wife and his son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tCD7QbaWBwDh6i7Kl8T8tMTOn9u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258773'),
  ('1009875714872473958', 'The Street with No Name', 1948, 'Crime, Thriller', 'William Keighley, Joseph MacDonald, Lionel Newman', 'Harry Kleiner', 'Mark Stevens, Richard Widmark, Lloyd Nolan, Barbara Lawrence, Ed Begley, Donald Buka, Joseph Pevney, John McIntire', 'NR', 'After two gang-related killings in "Center City," a suspect (who was framed) is arrested, released on bail...and murdered. Inspector Briggs of the FBI recruits a young agent, Gene Cordell, to go undercover in the shadowy Skid Row area (alias George Manly) as a potential victim of the same racket. Soon, Gene meets Alec Stiles, neurotic mastermind who''s "building an organization along scientific lines." Stiles recruits Cordell, whose job becomes a lot more dangerous.', 'After two gang-related killings in "Center City," a suspect (who was framed) is arrested, released on bail...and murdered. Inspector Briggs of the FBI recruits a young agent, Gene Cordell, to go undercover in the shadowy Skid Row area (alias George Manly) as a potential victim of the same racket. Soon, Gene meets Alec Stiles, neurotic mastermind who''s "building an organization along scientific lines." Stiles recruits Cordell, whose job becomes a lot more dangerous.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t2OkuSVnw1KxeSGwhTbTaXiQfxr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36814'),
  ('370827600659915700', 'The Striker with Number 9', 1988, 'Drama', 'Pantelis Voulgaris, Alexis Grivas, Thanassis Christopoulos', 'Menis Koumantareas, Vangelis Raptopoulos', 'Themis Bazaka, Stratos Tzortzoglou, Stamatis Tzelepis, Kostas Kleftogiannis, Zano Danias, Nikos Tsachiridis, Maria Georgiadou, Nikos Bousdoukos', null, 'The story of a talented yet self-destructive soccer player in Greece. Based on the novel of the same name by Menis Koumandareas, the film narrates the life and works of Vassilis Seretis, a young, unknown, poor, but talented and ambitious football player, who dreams of conquering the pitches. The hero is willing to give everything and suffer whatever it takes in order to conquer the football world. With his talent as his only weapon, he tries to define his destiny, on a route from Thessaloniki, to Volos and from there to Athens. With him, we taste the mud of the fields, the loneliness of the countryside, the "sold out" matches, but also the ephemeral glow of success. Pantelis Voulgaris signs a film that left an era, as, in addition to its original directorial perspective, it outlines the phenomenon of Greek football in a poetic and at the same time realistic way.', 'The story of a talented yet self-destructive soccer player in Greece. Based on the novel of the same name by Menis Koumandareas, the film narrates the life and works of Vassilis Seretis, a young, unknown, poor, but talented and ambitious football player, who dreams of conquering the pitches. The hero is willing to give everything and suffer whatever it takes in order to conquer the football world. With his talent as his only weapon, he tries to define his destiny, on a route from Thessaloniki, to Volos and from there to Athens. With him, we taste the mud of the fields, the loneliness of the countryside, the "sold out" matches, but also the ephemeral glow of success. Pantelis Voulgaris signs a film that left an era, as, in addition to its original directorial perspective, it outlines the phenomenon of Greek football in a poetic and at the same time realistic way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/26Cw0e9ZVVvCADpEDu2BTXiDVLA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47858'),
  ('544260111378662826', 'The String', 2009, 'Romance, Drama', 'Mehdi Ben Attia', null, 'Claudia Cardinale, Antonin Stahly-Vishwanadan, Salim Kéchiouche, Driss Ramdi, Ramla Ayari, Ali Mrabet, Abir Bennani, Rihab Mejri', null, 'Malik has a lot on his plate when he returns home to Tunisia after living in France. He''s processing his father''s death, he can''t come out to his mother, and his childhood anxieties have resurfaced. But all of Malik''s problems seem to fade away when he falls for Bilal, the dreamy houseboy at his mother''s bourgeois estate.', 'Malik has a lot on his plate when he returns home to Tunisia after living in France. He''s processing his father''s death, he can''t come out to his mother, and his childhood anxieties have resurfaced. But all of Malik''s problems seem to fade away when he falls for Bilal, the dreamy houseboy at his mother''s bourgeois estate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rp4eB4dLlScp1lRoR3BA2IBmzky.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69746'),
  ('29460566991016762', 'The Strip', 1951, 'Crime, Drama, Music', 'László Kardos, Robert Surtees', 'Allen Rivkin', 'Mickey Rooney, Sally Forrest, William Demarest, James Craig, Kay Brown, Louis Armstrong, Myrna Dell, Vic Damone', 'NR', 'Drummer Stanley Maxton moves to Los Angeles with dreams of opening his own jazz club, but falls in with a gangster and a nightclub dancer and ends up accused of her murder.', 'Drummer Stanley Maxton moves to Los Angeles with dreams of opening his own jazz club, but falls in with a gangster and a nightclub dancer and ends up accused of her murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4HWJzoOHciLeRRgAeLRfadC6ycB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95949'),
  ('485622918857138112', 'The Stripper', 1963, 'Romance, Drama', 'Franklin J. Schaffner, Ellsworth Fredericks', 'Meade Roberts', 'Joanne Woodward, Richard Beymer, Claire Trevor, Carol Lynley, Robert Webber, Louis Nye, Gypsy Rose Lee, Michael J. Pollard', 'NR', 'An aging former movie starlet whose Hollywood career went nowhere, now reduced to dancing with a third-rate touring show, finds herself stranded in a small town where she''s courted by an infatuated and naive local teenager.', 'An aging former movie starlet whose Hollywood career went nowhere, now reduced to dancing with a third-rate touring show, finds herself stranded in a small town where she''s courted by an infatuated and naive local teenager.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nhv2uRFJ4z86lHyjMmZOAc9VYdR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:170343'),
  ('830826812101679273', 'The Stroll', 2003, 'Drama, Romance', 'Pavel Kostomarov, Yury Klimenko, Alexei Uchitel', 'Avdotya Smirnova', 'Irina Pegova, Pavel Barshak, Evgeny Tsyganov, Evgeniy Grishkovec, Karen Badalov, Madlen Dzhabrailova, Andrey Kazakov, Aleksey Kolubkov', null, 'Today’s twenty-something Russians are the first generation in the country’s post-communist history to have grown up free. Their twenties are the age of freedom, of fast-changing events and intense emotions. Perhaps only at this age they can live a whole life in one day. A young girl and her two accident companions walk halfway around St.-Petersburg; they flirt and tease each other, and for ninety minutes they act out a real-time romantic drama. This stroll is full of laughter and tears against a backdrop of the hustle and bustle of the streets.', 'Today’s twenty-something Russians are the first generation in the country’s post-communist history to have grown up free. Their twenties are the age of freedom, of fast-changing events and intense emotions. Perhaps only at this age they can live a whole life in one day. A young girl and her two accident companions walk halfway around St.-Petersburg; they flirt and tease each other, and for ninety minutes they act out a real-time romantic drama. This stroll is full of laughter and tears against a backdrop of the hustle and bustle of the streets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/97Fo6WpJComuBIuOgUd4HZPKHJ6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23898'),
  ('886846076141478564', 'The Stroll', 2023, 'Documentary', 'Kristen Parker Lovell, Zackary Drucker, Sara Kinney', null, 'Kristen Parker Lovell, Ceyenne Doroshow, Egyptt LaBeija, Izzi “Cashmere” Starz, Tabytha Gonzalez, Stefanie Rivera, Elizabeth Rivera, Carey Smith', 'R', 'The history of New York’s Meatpacking District, told from the perspective of transgender sex workers who lived and worked there. Filmmaker Kristen Lovell, who walked “The Stroll” for a decade, reunites her community to recount the violence, policing, homelessness, and gentrification they overcame to build a movement for transgender rights.', 'The history of New York’s Meatpacking District, told from the perspective of transgender sex workers who lived and worked there. Filmmaker Kristen Lovell, who walked “The Stroll” for a decade, reunites her community to recount the violence, policing, homelessness, and gentrification they overcame to build a movement for transgender rights.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xe097R7cR5umC1k9srZDCYc7Cv7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1058623'),
  ('480474233332244356', 'The Stroller Strategy', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Clément Michel, Steeven Petitteville', 'Louis-Paul Desanges', 'Raphaël Personnaz, Charlotte Le Bon, Jérôme Commandeur, Camélia Jordana, Julie Ferrier, François Berléand, François Rollin, Clément Michel', 'NR', 'When Thomas Platz is suddenly made the guardian of a baby - then pretends to be its real father in order to win back Marie, the girlfriend who dumped him a year before. Stuck between staying a man-child forever, and proving he is ready to take the next steps of marriage and family with the love of his life, Thomas goes on an unexpectedly hilarious adventure getting the girl of his dreams to believe he has changed.', 'When Thomas Platz is suddenly made the guardian of a baby - then pretends to be its real father in order to win back Marie, the girlfriend who dumped him a year before. Stuck between staying a man-child forever, and proving he is ready to take the next steps of marriage and family with the love of his life, Thomas goes on an unexpectedly hilarious adventure getting the girl of his dreams to believe he has changed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kWIsQB68vsQgGuLZdhdnxi6XrtZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:152989'),
  ('576004438769441257', 'The Strong Man', 1926, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Frank Capra, Glenn Kershner, Elgin Lessley', 'Arthur Ripley', 'Harry Langdon, Priscilla Bonner, Arthur Thalasso, Gertrude Astor, William V. Mong, Robert McKim, Brooks Benedict, Douglas Haig', null, 'A meek Belgian soldier (Harry Langdon) fighting in World War I receives penpal letters and a photo from "Mary Brown", an American girl he has never met. He becomes infatuated with her by long distance. After the war, the young Belgian journeys to America as assistant to a theatrical "strong man", Zandow the Great (Arthur Thalasso). While in America, he searches for Mary Brown... and he finds her, just as word comes that Zandow is incapacitated and the little nebbish must go on stage in his place.', 'A meek Belgian soldier (Harry Langdon) fighting in World War I receives penpal letters and a photo from "Mary Brown", an American girl he has never met. He becomes infatuated with her by long distance. After the war, the young Belgian journeys to America as assistant to a theatrical "strong man", Zandow the Great (Arthur Thalasso). While in America, he searches for Mary Brown... and he finds her, just as word comes that Zandow is incapacitated and the little nebbish must go on stage in his place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/64J8XyG7mNMQlMDeW1xYoBY7xnw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51263'),
  ('292309986859652753', 'The Strong Ones', 2020, 'Drama, Romance', 'Omar Zúñiga Hidalgo, Nicolás Ibieta', 'Omar Zúñiga Hidalgo', 'Antonio Altamirano, Samuel González, Marcela Salinas, Rafael Contreras, Nicolás Corales, Luis Montoya, Vanessa Ramos', null, 'Lucas travels to visit his sister to a remote town in southern Chile. In front of the ocean and the fog, he meets Antonio, a boatswain in a local fishing boat. When an intense romance grows between them, their strength, their independence and their adulthood become immovable in front of the tide.', 'Lucas travels to visit his sister to a remote town in southern Chile. In front of the ocean and the fog, he meets Antonio, a boatswain in a local fishing boat. When an intense romance grows between them, their strength, their independence and their adulthood become immovable in front of the tide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s53aBDGTA6Db6I2msWo46VLes2X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:637860'),
  ('766054438007945043', 'The Strongest Man in the World', 1975, 'Comedy, Family', 'Vincent McEveety', 'Joseph L. McEveety, Herman Groves', 'Kurt Russell, Joe Flynn, Eve Arden, Cesar Romero, Phil Silvers, Dick Van Patten, Harold Gould, Michael McGreevey', 'G', 'Medfield College science major Dexter Riley and his classmates have been working on a new vitamin compound when a lab accident creates a supercharged mix that ends up in Dexter''s cereal box, giving him superhuman strength. The powerful formula comes to the attention of the college dean and two rival cereal companies, touching off a hilarious chain of events.', 'Medfield College science major Dexter Riley and his classmates have been working on a new vitamin compound when a lab accident creates a supercharged mix that ends up in Dexter''s cereal box, giving him superhuman strength. The powerful formula comes to the attention of the college dean and two rival cereal companies, touching off a hilarious chain of events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ac9sN2mKrxZ1XmgzfAA65AmuN2x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31654'),
  ('877333993319625526', 'The Stronghold', 2017, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Family, Fantasy, History', 'Yuriy Kovalyov', 'Yuriy Kovalyov, Oleksandr Dermanskyi', 'Danyil Kamenskyi, Nataliia Sumska, Yeva Kosheva, Roman Lutskyi, Slava Krasovska, Oleh Voloshchenko, Ivan Denysenko, Alexander Komarov', null, 'A solar eclipse activates a magic time portal, and a regular schoolboy Vit''ko from the 21st century goes a thousand years back in time. It doesn’t take Vitya long to recognize the legendary bogatyrs in young Oleshko, powerful Ilya and severe Dobrynya. Their life passes in fighting cumans who try to destroy Rusichi at any cost, using both weapons and black magic. Vitya finds himself in the very midst of incredible events, battles with mythical creatures and acquires real courage.', 'A solar eclipse activates a magic time portal, and a regular schoolboy Vit''ko from the 21st century goes a thousand years back in time. It doesn’t take Vitya long to recognize the legendary bogatyrs in young Oleshko, powerful Ilya and severe Dobrynya. Their life passes in fighting cumans who try to destroy Rusichi at any cost, using both weapons and black magic. Vitya finds himself in the very midst of incredible events, battles with mythical creatures and acquires real courage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Vyo740WlMp0C9qCnYp3fXbrOU0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:434245'),
  ('1021868639268958481', 'The Stronghold', 2021, 'Thriller, Action, Crime', 'Cédric Jimenez, Laurent Tangy, Fabien Vergez', 'Audrey Diwan, Cédric Jimenez', 'Gilles Lellouche, François Civil, Karim Leklou, Adèle Exarchopoulos, Cyril Lecomte, Kenza Fortas, Michaël Abiteboul, Idir Azougli', 'R', 'Tired of the small-time grind, three Marseille cops get a chance to bust a major drug network. But lines blur when a key informant makes a big ask.', 'Tired of the small-time grind, three Marseille cops get a chance to bust a major drug network. But lines blur when a key informant makes a big ask.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nLanxl7Xhfbd5s8FxPy8jWZw4rv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:637534'),
  ('587348607989751229', 'The Strongman Who Became a Lamb', 1968, 'Comedy', 'Alekos Sakellarios, Vasilis Vasileiadis, Pantelis Filippides', 'Alekos Sakellarios, Christos Giannakopoulos', 'Labros Konstadaras, Maro Kodou, Stavros Xenidis, Pavlos Liaros, Thanos Papadopoulos, Vangelis Ioannidis, Mitsi Konstadara, Kostas Papahristos', null, 'Leonidas Petrohilos (Lambros Konstantaras), a widower with three master unruly children, Kimon (Paul Liaros), Andreas (Thanassis Papadopoulos) and dad (Vangelis Ioannidis), still loves his first wife and refuses to remarry. His friend Xenophon (Stavros Xenidis) recommends Mary''s (Maro Kondou) atychisasa a lady who needs to work. Leonidas hires Mary as housekeeper and serenity comes home. But until Leonidas understand that it is intended for rigged plot has good bite on the plate ...', 'Leonidas Petrohilos (Lambros Konstantaras), a widower with three master unruly children, Kimon (Paul Liaros), Andreas (Thanassis Papadopoulos) and dad (Vangelis Ioannidis), still loves his first wife and refuses to remarry. His friend Xenophon (Stavros Xenidis) recommends Mary''s (Maro Kondou) atychisasa a lady who needs to work. Leonidas hires Mary as housekeeper and serenity comes home. But until Leonidas understand that it is intended for rigged plot has good bite on the plate ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g6nwGv9w0AUBNkjY8TBMW8cxI8Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:181196'),
  ('359872230466147499', 'The Structure of Crystal', 1969, 'Drama', 'Krzysztof Zanussi, Stefan Matyjaszkiewicz, Joanna Krauze', 'Edward Żebrowski', 'Barbara Wrzesińska, Jan Mysłowicz, Andrzej Żarnecki, Władysław Jarema, Adam Debski, Urszula Gałecka, Monika Dzienisiewicz-Olbrychska, Daniel Olbrychski', null, 'Two friends who used to study physics together are forced to make tough decisions as their lives take different paths.', 'Two friends who used to study physics together are forced to make tough decisions as their lives take different paths.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/msGuqlQbpYXqz63GVLiUKBV4QWc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:167267'),
  ('695496875178589223', 'The Struggle', 1931, 'Drama', 'D.W. Griffith, Joseph Ruttenberg, Nick Rogalli', 'D.W. Griffith', 'Hal Skelly, Zita Johann, Charlotte Wynters, Evelyn Baldwin, Jackson Halliday, Edna Hagan, Claude Cooper, Arthur Lipson', null, 'A young couple''s marriage is jeopardized by the husband''s descent into alcoholism.', 'A young couple''s marriage is jeopardized by the husband''s descent into alcoholism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xcHJT3D4pXcxdKJHbo1AcnTErVp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:131455'),
  ('247815391710433662', 'The Struggle', 1977, 'Animation', 'Marcell Jankovics, Zoltán Bacsó', 'Marcell Jankovics', null, null, 'Metaphor about art, about time, or how art uses the artist''s life in his quest to create his work, in which he was pouring his talent, his vigor, and the best years of his life.', 'Metaphor about art, about time, or how art uses the artist''s life in his quest to create his work, in which he was pouring his talent, his vigor, and the best years of his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/853dYyMY6mO4VSDV5CwwLn9W3HI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116363'),
  ('699106842571796761', 'The Struggle for Survival', 1937, null, 'Jean Painlevé', null, null, null, 'Jean Painlevé short film examining population explosion and decline.', 'Jean Painlevé short film examining population explosion and decline.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Z29ASfxjqZzC6i1rXFOkUNSxAe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163358'),
  ('1009566492792435636', 'The Stud', 1970, 'Comedy', 'Jean-Pierre Mocky, Marcel Weiss, Luc Andrieux', 'Jean-Pierre Mocky, Alain Moury', 'Bourvil, Francis Blanche, Jacques Legras, René-Jean Chauffard, Noëlle Leiris, Michael Lonsdale, Marcel Pérès, Jean-Claude Rémoleux', null, 'Veterinary surgeon William Chaminade is having a peaceful holiday in the South of France when he is witness to an event that will change not only his life but the destiny of France! A young woman tries to kill herself by jumping from the upstairs window of the hotel where he is staying. Thanks to the services of a passing athlete, the woman is unharmed, and she reveals that her distress is down to her husband’s apparent lack of interest in her. Immediately, Chaminade has a brainwave. He will open a special centre for people like this unfortunate young woman, who will be able to satisfy their romantic needs, at the tax payers’ expense. All is well until this innovative ’pleasure centre’ draws the attention of an over-zealous tax inspector, Dupuis...', 'Veterinary surgeon William Chaminade is having a peaceful holiday in the South of France when he is witness to an event that will change not only his life but the destiny of France! A young woman tries to kill herself by jumping from the upstairs window of the hotel where he is staying. Thanks to the services of a passing athlete, the woman is unharmed, and she reveals that her distress is down to her husband’s apparent lack of interest in her. Immediately, Chaminade has a brainwave. He will open a special centre for people like this unfortunate young woman, who will be able to satisfy their romantic needs, at the tax payers’ expense. All is well until this innovative ’pleasure centre’ draws the attention of an over-zealous tax inspector, Dupuis...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hbs0bE8I5kOueufIGpNaRDBV6QF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85722'),
  ('927368368388480364', 'The Stud', 1978, 'Romance, Drama', 'Quentin Masters, Peter Hannan, Vincent Winter', 'Jackie Collins', 'Joan Collins, Sue Lloyd, Walter Gotell, Oliver Tobias, Mark Burns, Doug Fisher, Tony Allyn, Peter Lukas', 'R', 'Fontaine Khaled is the London wife of wealthy Arab businessman Benjamin, whose money she blows on partying and on her nightclub, "The Hobo". She hires handsome Tony to manage her club, but it''s understood that his job security is dependent on his satisfying her nymphomaniacal demands. He soon loses interest, and turns his attention to her stepdaughter Alexandra, who uses him to get back at Fontaine for cheating on her father.', 'Fontaine Khaled is the London wife of wealthy Arab businessman Benjamin, whose money she blows on partying and on her nightclub, "The Hobo". She hires handsome Tony to manage her club, but it''s understood that his job security is dependent on his satisfying her nymphomaniacal demands. He soon loses interest, and turns his attention to her stepdaughter Alexandra, who uses him to get back at Fontaine for cheating on her father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sNduWNPPh2qy0npxKCKIEZi5LC8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120386'),
  ('493169122662087553', 'The Student', 1988, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Claude Pinoteau, Yves Rodallec', 'Claude Pinoteau, Danièle Thompson', 'Sophie Marceau, Vincent Lindon, Élisabeth Vitali, Jean-Claude Leguay, Elena Pompei, Roberto Attias, Brigitte Chamarande, Christian Pereira', null, 'An ambitious teaching student''s finals studies are interrupted by a passionate affair with a jazz musician.', 'An ambitious teaching student''s finals studies are interrupted by a passionate affair with a jazz musician.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tDx9zW0Edb83qh9PAGrgP3Zh9RP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52286'),
  ('258950845338121930', 'The Student', 2011, 'Drama', 'Alejo Maglio, Federico Cantini, Soledad Rodríguez', 'Santiago Mitre', 'Esteban Lamothe, Romina Paula, Ricardo Felix, Valeria Correa, Agustín Rittano, Julián Larquier Tellarini, Germán de Silva, Juan Barberini', null, 'Roque starts University in Buenos Aires but he is not particularly interested in attending classes or working towards a degree. Instead, he dedicates his time to one of the many groups vying for control of the university, motivated less by grand political ideals than by a wish to get close to Paula, an attractive young teacher heavily involved in internal university politics.', 'Roque starts University in Buenos Aires but he is not particularly interested in attending classes or working towards a degree. Instead, he dedicates his time to one of the many groups vying for control of the university, motivated less by grand political ideals than by a wish to get close to Paula, an attractive young teacher heavily involved in internal university politics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/93BK54rXeMhrVbmwemAze6HPWFu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118204'),
  ('541141774241906867', 'The Student', 2016, 'Drama', 'Yekaterina Kostyukova, Svetlana Turchenko, Svetlana Gudkevich', 'Kirill Serebrennikov', 'Petr Skvortsov, Yuliya Aug, Viktoriya Isakova, Anton Vasilyev, Aleksandr Gorchilin, Aleksandra Revenko, Svetlana Bragarnik, Nikolai Roshchin', null, 'A high school student becomes convinced that the world is lost to evil and begins to challenge the morals and beliefs of the adults surrounding him.', 'A high school student becomes convinced that the world is lost to evil and begins to challenge the morals and beliefs of the adults surrounding him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8bRX3YSXNWzCTMRtlFkWcJJeg1r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:392817'),
  ('538707541211328217', 'The Student and Mister Henri', 2015, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Ivan Calbérac, Vincent Mathias', 'Ivan Calbérac', 'Claude Brasseur, Guillaume de Tonquédec, Noémie Schmidt, Frédérique Bel, Thomas Solivérès, Valérie Kéruzoré, Antoine Glemain, Grégori Baquet', null, 'Because of his wavering health, Monsieur Henri can no longer live alone in his Paris appartment. Particularly grumpy, he ends up nonetheless accepting his son Paul''s suggestion that he let one of his rooms out to a young female student. Far from falling for her charms, Henri uses her to orchestrate utter family chaos...', 'Because of his wavering health, Monsieur Henri can no longer live alone in his Paris appartment. Particularly grumpy, he ends up nonetheless accepting his son Paul''s suggestion that he let one of his rooms out to a young female student. Far from falling for her charms, Henri uses her to orchestrate utter family chaos...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vcwKqfw1bQeDz4tS96ca1mHZqLV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:360638'),
  ('893970239072557641', 'The Student Cop', 2004, 'Action, Comedy, Romance', 'Wael Ehsan, Ehab Mohamed Ali', 'Belal Fadl', 'Karim Abdel Aziz, Hassan Hosny, Ghada Adel, Mohammad Lotfi, Ramez Galal, Mohamed Ragab, Khaled El Sawy, Maha Ahmed', null, 'The film revolves in the context of romantic comedy and action through the character of a police officer under covered as student in a university and befriends key students to uncover a drug distribution network within the university.', 'The film revolves in the context of romantic comedy and action through the character of a police officer under covered as student in a university and befriends key students to uncover a drug distribution network within the university.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1gVpkTX7KKz9YVXyN1ls4heWHxr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48644'),
  ('229531162348324867', 'The Student Nurses', 1970, 'Drama', 'Stephanie Rothman, Stevan Larner', 'Don Spencer', 'Elaine Giftos, Karen Carlson, Brioni Farrell, Barbara Leigh, Reni Santoni, Richard Rust, Darrell Larson, Paul Camen', 'R', 'Four female college students in Los Angeles, who live together and have nursing internships at the same hospital, have their lives complicated by love, sex, drugs and revolution.', 'Four female college students in Los Angeles, who live together and have nursing internships at the same hospital, have their lives complicated by love, sex, drugs and revolution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d72TnkJC7I1KTDI4cT2ughFiLZ7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85962'),
  ('517276290657365559', 'The Student of Prague', 1913, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Stellan Rye, Guido Seeber', 'Paul Wegener, Stellan Rye, Hanns Heinz Ewers', 'Paul Wegener, Grete Berger, Lyda Salmonova, John Gottowt, Lothar Körner, Fritz Weidemann, Hanns Heinz Ewers', null, 'Prague, Bohemia, 1820. Balduin, a penniless student, falls in love with Countess Margit, a wealthy noblewoman whom he has saved from drowning.', 'Prague, Bohemia, 1820. Balduin, a penniless student, falls in love with Countess Margit, a wealthy noblewoman whom he has saved from drowning.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tO2zgNEY0MqtvEyPioTTfHgmN2Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28627'),
  ('684194901136916198', 'The Student of Prague', 1926, 'Horror, Drama', 'Erich Nitzschmann, Günther Krampf, Henrik Galeen', 'Hanns Heinz Ewers, Henrik Galeen', 'Conrad Veidt, Elizza La Porta, Fritz Alberti, Agnes Esterhazy, Ferdinand von Alten, Werner Krauss, Erich Kober, Max Maximilian', 'NR', 'For Balduin, going out to beer parties with his fellow students and fighting out disputes at the tip of the sword have lost their charms. He wants to find love; but how would he, a penniless student, ever dare looking up to any woman worth of loving? Absorbed in his dreary thoughts and indifferent to the advances of Lyduschka, Balduin is unexpectedly offered a fortune by the mysterious money-lender Scapinelli - but on a strange condition...', 'For Balduin, going out to beer parties with his fellow students and fighting out disputes at the tip of the sword have lost their charms. He wants to find love; but how would he, a penniless student, ever dare looking up to any woman worth of loving? Absorbed in his dreary thoughts and indifferent to the advances of Lyduschka, Balduin is unexpectedly offered a fortune by the mysterious money-lender Scapinelli - but on a strange condition...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Xr9otsNTCsSpSDhZj0XAO29qUM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27519'),
  ('700924019817840352', 'The Student Prince', 1954, 'Music, Romance', 'Richard Thorpe, Paul Vogel', 'William Ludwig, Sonya Levien', 'Ann Blyth, Edmund Purdom, John Ericson, Louis Calhern, Edmund Gwenn, S.Z. Sakall, Betta St. John, John Williams', 'NR', 'A prince has a romance with a barmaid before he must give up personal happiness for duty.', 'A prince has a romance with a barmaid before he must give up personal happiness for duty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c7KQXDSkTqittwYuXXQ4gkJyu96.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68191'),
  ('639923809225502054', 'The Student Prince in Old Heidelberg', 1928, 'Drama, Romance', 'Ernst Lubitsch, John J. Mescall', null, 'Ramon Novarro, Norma Shearer, Jean Hersholt, Gustav von Seyffertitz, Philippe De Lacy, Edgar Norton, Bobbie Mack, Edward Connelly', 'NR', 'A young prince falls in love with a beautiful barmaid while at university in old Heidelberg.', 'A young prince falls in love with a beautiful barmaid while at university in old Heidelberg.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3OUjEGUjo9SeO7VwMhukNZofuXF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85876'),
  ('508706883009332402', 'The Stuff', 1985, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Larry Cohen, Paul Glickman, Mark Croll', 'Larry Cohen', 'Michael Moriarty, Andrea Marcovicci, Garrett Morris, Paul Sorvino, Scott Bloom, Danny Aiello, Patrick O''Neal, James Dixon', 'R', 'Amalgamated Dairies hires David Rutherford, an FBI man turned industrial saboteur, to investigate a popular new product called “the Stuff,” a new dessert product that is blowing ice cream sales out of the water. Nobody knows how it’s made or what’s in it, but people are lining up to buy it. It''s got a delicious flavor to die for!', 'Amalgamated Dairies hires David Rutherford, an FBI man turned industrial saboteur, to investigate a popular new product called “the Stuff,” a new dessert product that is blowing ice cream sales out of the water. Nobody knows how it’s made or what’s in it, but people are lining up to buy it. It''s got a delicious flavor to die for!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bT0PxmeePfzX8YrZHGaAXau9RLN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18502'),
  ('520608681038083295', 'The Stuff of Dreams', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Gilles Cannatella, Edoardo Ferretti, Alessandra Fortuna', 'Francesco Marino', 'Sergio Rubini, Renato Carpentieri, Ennio Fantastichini, Jacopo Cullin, Teresa Saponangelo, Alba Gaïa Bellugi, Luca De Filippo, Francesco Di Leva', null, 'Members of the Camorra on the run and actors seeking for authority meet after a shipwreck on an island-prison. The theatre turns into a free zone where everyone may not be able to recover their social role but for sure their humanity. Somebody can even get love back. Shakespeare and Eduardo De Filippo blend together in a picaresque comedy full of coup de théâtre.', 'Members of the Camorra on the run and actors seeking for authority meet after a shipwreck on an island-prison. The theatre turns into a free zone where everyone may not be able to recover their social role but for sure their humanity. Somebody can even get love back. Shakespeare and Eduardo De Filippo blend together in a picaresque comedy full of coup de théâtre.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iADPTAuZrD3EcyUUBMw253mt2EC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:428492'),
  ('233042783728446516', 'The Stunt Man', 1980, 'Action, Comedy, Drama, Thriller, Romance', 'Richard Rush, Mario Tosi, Frank Beetson', 'Lawrence B. Marcus', 'Peter O''Toole, Steve Railsback, Barbara Hershey, Allen Garfield, Alex Rocco, Sharon Farrell, Adam Roarke, Philip Bruns', 'R', 'A fugitive stumbles onto a movie set just when they need a new stunt man, takes the job as a way to hide out and falls for the leading lady while facing off with his manipulative director.', 'A fugitive stumbles onto a movie set just when they need a new stunt man, takes the job as a way to hide out and falls for the leading lady while facing off with his manipulative director.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2GiT0zJMTMCn1Jc4aLVLsdfH4lh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42160'),
  ('91253065067487157', 'The Stunt Woman', 1996, 'Action, Drama', 'Ann Hui, Andy Lam Kwok-Wah, Jupiter Wong Kin-Man', 'Chan Man-Keung, John Chan Kin-Chung', 'Michelle Yeoh, Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Jimmy Wong Ga-Lok, Ken Lo Wing-Hang, Mang Hoi, Nick Cheung Ka-Fai, Michael Lam Wai-Leung, Paco Yick Tin-Hung', null, 'After moving to Hong Kong from China, a young martial artist starts a promising career as a stuntwoman. She begins to feel accepted in the business, but a passionate affair with a playboy ends up breaking her heart and unleashing her wild side.', 'After moving to Hong Kong from China, a young martial artist starts a promising career as a stuntwoman. She begins to feel accepted in the business, but a passionate affair with a playboy ends up breaking her heart and unleashing her wild side.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cQ7pmbMQ3Qy1bmCMr0WpU6WEsjH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142451'),
  ('150358945448137041', 'The Stupid Cupid', 1944, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Frank Tashlin', null, 'Mel Blanc, Arthur Q. Bryan', null, 'Cupid (Elmer Fudd) is on the prowl around the farm. With his ever-accurate arrows, he spreads love to sometimes unwilling recipients. But when he sets his sights on Daffy, the duck wants no part of it. When Elm...erm...Cupid fires the largest arrow at his disposal at the hapless duck, Daffy falls for the nearest hen...who happens to be the main squeeze of the cock of the walk...', 'Cupid (Elmer Fudd) is on the prowl around the farm. With his ever-accurate arrows, he spreads love to sometimes unwilling recipients. But when he sets his sights on Daffy, the duck wants no part of it. When Elm...erm...Cupid fires the largest arrow at his disposal at the hapless duck, Daffy falls for the nearest hen...who happens to be the main squeeze of the cock of the walk...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xUV2obXaWH1xkBgmqaZhFgzbSJO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236946'),
  ('457813585313073492', 'The Stupids', 1996, 'Comedy, Family', 'John Landis, Manfred Guthe', 'Brent Forrester', 'Tom Arnold, Jessica Lundy, Bug Hall, Alex McKenna, Mark Metcalf, Matt Keeslar, Christopher Lee, Frankie Faison', 'PG', 'An incredibly dull-witted family unknowingly stumble upon an illegal weapons deal while on the trail of their "stolen" garbage.', 'An incredibly dull-witted family unknowingly stumble upon an illegal weapons deal while on the trail of their "stolen" garbage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uR0EPkE66y2DU21NOZAu6xtfpQL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16299'),
  ('784088933938498125', 'The Stupor Salesman', 1948, 'Animation, Comedy, Crime', 'Arthur Davis', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Slug McSlug, a notorious bank robber, is chased by police after his latest heist. He reaches his country hideout, where he is promptly visited by an uninvited Daffy Duck, who is a door-to-door vendor of a variety of items.', 'Slug McSlug, a notorious bank robber, is chased by police after his latest heist. He reaches his country hideout, where he is promptly visited by an uninvited Daffy Duck, who is a door-to-door vendor of a variety of items.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6fw4tg9Zy3lkKHaw5RKKzhX2Ld4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:237298'),
  ('509774283387973613', 'The Stylist', 2020, 'Horror, Drama', 'Robert Patrick Stern, Jill Gevargizian', 'Eric Havens, Jill Gevargizian, Eric Stolze', 'Najarra Townsend, Brea Grant, Laura Kirk, Millie Milan, Kimberly Igla, Kyle Ament, Steven Hugh Nelson, Davis Lee DeRock Jr.', null, 'Claire is a lonely hairstylist who secretly murders and scalps her clients. When Olivia makes the well-intentioned mistake of asking Claire to style her hair for her wedding, she becomes dangerously obsessed, and her sanity starts to slip away with bloody consequences.', 'Claire is a lonely hairstylist who secretly murders and scalps her clients. When Olivia makes the well-intentioned mistake of asking Claire to style her hair for her wedding, she becomes dangerously obsessed, and her sanity starts to slip away with bloody consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gjsEk331R9VRGv6NuJGBjEUc1yZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:741612'),
  ('578774855156639117', 'The Subject Was Roses', 1968, 'Drama', 'Ulu Grosbard, Jack Priestley, Paul Ganapoler', 'Frank D. Gilroy', 'Jack Albertson, Patricia Neal, Martin Sheen, Don Saxon, Elaine Williams, Grant Gordon', 'G', 'Timmy Cleary returns to his Bronx home at the end of World War II and is soon disillusioned to find his parents'' marriage filled with discord, quarreling, and recriminations.', 'Timmy Cleary returns to his Bronx home at the end of World War II and is soon disillusioned to find his parents'' marriage filled with discord, quarreling, and recriminations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Xhp5MfPRlgJroS9JL1TR2b3BCE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118872'),
  ('731121002397596735', 'The Substance', 2024, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Drama', 'Matthieu de la Mortière, Anne Juin, Benjamin Kračun', 'Coralie Fargeat', 'Demi Moore, Margaret Qualley, Dennis Quaid, Edward Hamilton-Clark, Gore Abrams, Oscar Lesage, Christian Erickson, Robin Greer', 'R', 'A fading celebrity decides to use a black market drug, a cell-replicating substance that temporarily creates a younger, better version of herself.', 'A fading celebrity decides to use a black market drug, a cell-replicating substance that temporarily creates a younger, better version of herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lqoMzCcZYEFK729d6qzt349fB4o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:933260'),
  ('100139461588850315', 'The Substance: Albert Hofmann''s LSD', 2011, 'Documentary', 'Martin Witz, Patrick Lindenmaier, Pio Corradi', 'Martin Witz', 'James S. Ketchum', null, 'By coincidence rather than by design, the Swiss chemist Albert Hofmann makes a sensational discovery in the spring of 1943. He realizes that he is dealing with a powerful molecule that will have an impact that reaches far beyond the scientific world. THE SUBSTANCE is an investigation into our troubled relationship with LSD, told from its beginnings to today.', 'By coincidence rather than by design, the Swiss chemist Albert Hofmann makes a sensational discovery in the spring of 1943. He realizes that he is dealing with a powerful molecule that will have an impact that reaches far beyond the scientific world. THE SUBSTANCE is an investigation into our troubled relationship with LSD, told from its beginnings to today.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jpXGGmLfY5q8t8c5nkqZjuHNtQ1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103195'),
  ('200993189455894008', 'The Substitute', 1961, 'Comedy, Animation, Romance', 'Dušan Vukotić', 'Rudolf Sremec', null, null, 'With magic inflatable objects that spring to life to fill his every need, a flippant beachgoer wants for nothing. Well... almost nothing.', 'With magic inflatable objects that spring to life to fill his every need, a flippant beachgoer wants for nothing. Well... almost nothing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pSoP87jXYlmrCO5KouVYkVnqsb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128960'),
  ('187207737809808519', 'The Substitute', 1993, 'Drama, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Richard Flower, Kenna Marshall-Pittman, Glen MacPherson', 'David S. Goyer', 'Amanda Donohoe, Natasha Gregson Wagner, Mark Wahlberg, Dalton James, Eugene Robert Glazer, Patricia Gage, Shelley Owens, Brigitta', 'R', 'A high school substitute English teacher resorts to murder to protect her murderous dark past while seducing a student who begins to suspect her true identity.', 'A high school substitute English teacher resorts to murder to protect her murderous dark past while seducing a student who begins to suspect her true identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yGNW30Wdj0txJqFOhSYfQVYRxEA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:281583'),
  ('318703836779827091', 'The Substitute', 1996, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Bruce Surtees, Robert Mandel, Thomas A. Irvine', 'Rocco Simonelli, Alan Ormsby, Roy Frumkes', 'Tom Berenger, Raymond Cruz, Marc Anthony, William Forsythe, Luis Guzmán, Diane Venora, Ernie Hudson, Richard Brooks', 'R', 'When an inner-city Miami schoolteacher gets her knee broken after standing up to the school''s gang leader, her mercenary combat specialist boyfriend goes undercover as a substitute teacher to take down the punk. Soon he discovers a conspiracy of criminals at work, and must reassemble his team from his last jungle raid to stop them.', 'When an inner-city Miami schoolteacher gets her knee broken after standing up to the school''s gang leader, her mercenary combat specialist boyfriend goes undercover as a substitute teacher to take down the punk. Soon he discovers a conspiracy of criminals at work, and must reassemble his team from his last jungle raid to stop them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7vfzvhPMNauUXrVxVOPEfpOsful.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20762'),
  ('769302910101202941', 'The Substitute', 2007, 'Thriller, Comedy, Horror', 'Ole Bornedal, Dan Laustsen, Nino Jacobsen', 'Ole Bornedal, Henrik Prip', 'Paprika Steen, Ulrich Thomsen, Jonas Wandschneider, Nikolaj Falkenberg-Klok, Emma Juel Justesen, Mollie Maria Gilmartin, Josephine Gents, Emma Claudia Søndergaard', 'R', '6th Grade gets a new substitute teacher. She wants to train the class for an international competition in Paris. But something isn''t right. How is she able read kids'' minds? Why is she so mean? And how does she manage to convince everyone''s parents she is so great when the whole class knows she is really an alien?', '6th Grade gets a new substitute teacher. She wants to train the class for an international competition in Paris. But something isn''t right. How is she able read kids'' minds? Why is she so mean? And how does she manage to convince everyone''s parents she is so great when the whole class knows she is really an alien?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zHApRXaV1NckNtZh6PnKChie2l1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12416'),
  ('419259281952539047', 'The Substitute', 2022, 'Drama, Crime', 'Diego Lerman, Wojciech Staroń, Celina Duprat', 'María Meira, Diego Lerman, Luciana De Mello', 'Juan Minujín, Bárbara Lennie, Alfredo Castro, Rita Cortese, María Merlino, Lucas Arrúa, Renata Lerman, Martín Kohan', null, 'Lucio, a prestigious university professor, takes the position of substitute teacher at a high school in the suburbs of Buenos Aires, where he grew up. Through tales, novels and poetry, he tries to distract his class from the harsh reality of their everyday lives. But soon, he must step out of his professional duties when Dilan, one of his students, is threatened by a local drug kingpin.', 'Lucio, a prestigious university professor, takes the position of substitute teacher at a high school in the suburbs of Buenos Aires, where he grew up. Through tales, novels and poetry, he tries to distract his class from the harsh reality of their everyday lives. But soon, he must step out of his professional duties when Dilan, one of his students, is threatened by a local drug kingpin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6B24MiYkIlqqB2T43NohbMDt95i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:886755'),
  ('920496285483640353', 'The Substitute 2: School''s Out', 1998, 'Action, Mystery, Thriller, Crime, TV Movie', 'Steven Pearl, Larry Banks, Jude Gorjanc', 'Rocco Simonelli, Roy Frumkes', 'Treat Williams, BD Wong, Angel David, Michael Michele, Lawrence Gilliard Jr., Susan May Pratt, Edoardo Ballerini, Daryl Edwards', null, 'When teacher Randall Thomasson is killed during a carjacking, an unexpected visitor shows up at his funeral - his estranged brother, Karl Thomasson. An ex-Green Beret turned mercenary, Karl signs on as a new substitute teacher in order to investigate Randall''s murder.', 'When teacher Randall Thomasson is killed during a carjacking, an unexpected visitor shows up at his funeral - his estranged brother, Karl Thomasson. An ex-Green Beret turned mercenary, Karl signs on as a new substitute teacher in order to investigate Randall''s murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vk95MEsk43QMUsyxC3yd6Bz2Ett.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29812'),
  ('929540532872928259', 'The Substitute 3: Winner Takes All', 1999, 'Action, Thriller, Crime, TV Movie', 'Barry M. Wilson, Robert Radler, Marty Jedlicka', 'Roy Frumkes, Rocco Simonelli', 'Treat Williams, Barbara Jane Reams, Brian Simpson, Jeff Jensen, Rebecca Staab, Erin Chambers, Michael Shane Davis, James Black', 'R', 'At a college visit to a war buddy''s professor daughter, mercenary Treat Williams finds her brutally beaten. He then poses as a teacher to teach a lesson to the football jocks responsible.', 'At a college visit to a war buddy''s professor daughter, mercenary Treat Williams finds her brutally beaten. He then poses as a teacher to teach a lesson to the football jocks responsible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zQ7rVfLbl72ZGoj3MGszLtMmNL7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50820'),
  ('560194478142272046', 'The Substitute Wife', 1994, 'Drama, Romance, Western, TV Movie', 'Peter Werner, Neil Roach', 'Stan Daniels', 'Farrah Fawcett, Lea Thompson, Peter Weller, Gail Cronauer, Karis Paige Bryant, Babs George, Cory Lloyd, Colton Conklin', 'PG-13', 'In Nebraska, in pioneer days, a woman who knows she is going to die asks a prostitute to replace her with her husband and four children in order to make it possible for them to keep their family farm.', 'In Nebraska, in pioneer days, a woman who knows she is going to die asks a prostitute to replace her with her husband and four children in order to make it possible for them to keep their family farm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7CJ0prqG16NGPjclQ4d7FMGVmu5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:165549'),
  ('925674889155016547', 'The Substitute: Failure Is Not an Option', 2001, 'Action, Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Richard M. Rawlings Jr., Robert Radler, Marty Jedlicka', 'Dan Gurskis', 'Treat Williams, Angie Everhart, Patrick Kilpatrick, Bill Nunn, Tim Abell, Grayson Fricke, Simon Rhee, Scott Thomas', 'R', 'A former mercenary joins a military academy as a teacher. He soon discovers a neo-Nazi group, code-named Werewolves, formed among the cadets. He also quickly finds that they have military leadership among the officers at the Academy.', 'A former mercenary joins a military academy as a teacher. He soon discovers a neo-Nazi group, code-named Werewolves, formed among the cadets. He also quickly finds that they have military leadership among the officers at the Academy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rJyVO3RWgAGoYdmMsMqLcUMWVhV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54782'),
  ('257045549744978461', 'The Subtenant', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Matti Grönberg, Jouni Mutanen, Jari Mutikainen', 'Timo Kahilainen, Heikki Vihinen', 'Mikko Kivinen, Heikki Silvennoinen, Heikki Hela, Tuija Ernamo, Timo Kahilainen, Mari Turunen, Jasper Pääkkönen, Heikki Vihinen', null, 'A farce about blackmailing, a kidney transplant operation performed at home, deviants and human relationships.', 'A farce about blackmailing, a kidney transplant operation performed at home, deviants and human relationships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gjPMY8SZj8vmd8BnqPwgUviEF23.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22554'),
  ('81642378811769378', 'The Subtle Art of Not Giving a #@%!', 2023, 'Documentary', 'Nathan Price, Maria Ines Manchego', null, 'Mark Manson, Jackson Bliss, Tane Williams-Accra, Anna Lee, Estevez Gillespie, John Dybvig, Michael Hockey, Max Houston', 'R', 'Mark Manson cuts through the crap to offer his not-giving-a-f*ck philosophy: a dose of raw, refreshing honesty that shows us how to live more contented, grounded lives.', 'Mark Manson cuts through the crap to offer his not-giving-a-f*ck philosophy: a dose of raw, refreshing honesty that shows us how to live more contented, grounded lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cdd3fTUY4oNtOaTfR58jt8Bcn1E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1032696'),
  ('372411090513417899', 'The Suburbans', 1999, 'Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Donal Lardner Ward, Michael Barrett, Eric Davies', 'Tony Guma, Donal Lardner Ward', 'Craig Bierko, Amy Brenneman, Antonio Fargas, Will Ferrell, Tony Guma, Jennifer Love Hewitt, Robert Loggia, Ben Stiller', 'R', 'The Suburbans, a one-hit-wonder new wave band from the ''80s, reunite at their bassist''s wedding, where a promising young record executive sees the ensemble perform. When she encourages them to launch a revival, the group must weigh their dreams of fame and fortune against the reality of their relatively quiet domestic lives.', 'The Suburbans, a one-hit-wonder new wave band from the ''80s, reunite at their bassist''s wedding, where a promising young record executive sees the ensemble perform. When she encourages them to launch a revival, the group must weigh their dreams of fame and fortune against the reality of their relatively quiet domestic lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/meQUL49dy2A5f89hnDG22Pra2An.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46286'),
  ('216758039287907837', 'The Suburbs Are Everywhere', 1973, 'Comedy', 'Gérard Pirès', null, 'Marthe Keller, Jacques Higelin, Nathalie Courval, Robert Castel, Jean-Pierre Darras, Victor Lanoux, Daniel Prévost, Jacques Legras', null, 'He is a sales rep. She is a secretary. They live in the suburbs but she works in Paris. They don''t see much of each other and spend much of their time in commuter trains. They try desperately to change job locations to be more often together, but... The plot is not the important thing in the film ; what makes it emblematic of the early and mid-seventies is the insouciant atmosphere. The ''74 oil crisis had not yet morphed into a recession, and life was good - even though it was as hard as ever to find a home near one''s workplace (or the reverse) ! Marthe Keller and Jacques Higelin are both excellent. The movie is not an all-time great, but it captures the "zeitgeist" of French life in the Seventies.', 'He is a sales rep. She is a secretary. They live in the suburbs but she works in Paris. They don''t see much of each other and spend much of their time in commuter trains. They try desperately to change job locations to be more often together, but... The plot is not the important thing in the film ; what makes it emblematic of the early and mid-seventies is the insouciant atmosphere. The ''74 oil crisis had not yet morphed into a recession, and life was good - even though it was as hard as ever to find a home near one''s workplace (or the reverse) ! Marthe Keller and Jacques Higelin are both excellent. The movie is not an all-time great, but it captures the "zeitgeist" of French life in the Seventies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mWWhQ8xMYOONHnbRJV6yameUSEf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:184187'),
  ('112079274911707538', 'The Successor', 2023, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Nathalie Durand, Marie Doller, François Jaouën', 'Xavier Legrand, Dominick Parenteau-Lebeuf', 'Marc-André Grondin, Yves Jacques, Laetitia Isambert, Anne-Élisabeth Bossé, Blandine Bury, Vincent Leclerc, Louis Champagne, Mireille Naggar', null, 'Happy and accomplished, Ellias becomes the new artistic director of a famous French Haute Couture house. When he learns that his father, whom he has not seen for many years, has just died of a heart attack, Ellias goes to Quebec to settle the estate. The young creator will discover that he has inherited much worse than his father''s fragile heart.', 'Happy and accomplished, Ellias becomes the new artistic director of a famous French Haute Couture house. When he learns that his father, whom he has not seen for many years, has just died of a heart attack, Ellias goes to Quebec to settle the estate. The young creator will discover that he has inherited much worse than his father''s fragile heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Tu8EBsjLGEdzXeCD9HbhhVKXHK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1072269'),
  ('747487773073240621', 'The Sucker', 1965, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Henri Decaë, Gérard Oury', 'Marcel Jullian, Gérard Oury', 'Bourvil, Louis de Funès, Venantino Venantini, Henri Génès, Beba Lončar, Alida Chelli, Lando Buzzanca, Jacques Eyser', null, 'In this Franco-Italian gangster parody, a shopkeeper on his way to an Italian holiday suffers a crash that totals his car. The culprit can only compensate his ruined trip by driving an American friend''s car from Naples to Bordeaux, but as it happens to be filled with such contraband as stolen money, jewelry and drugs, the involuntary and unwitting companions in crime soon attract all but recreational attention from the "milieu".', 'In this Franco-Italian gangster parody, a shopkeeper on his way to an Italian holiday suffers a crash that totals his car. The culprit can only compensate his ruined trip by driving an American friend''s car from Naples to Bordeaux, but as it happens to be filled with such contraband as stolen money, jewelry and drugs, the involuntary and unwitting companions in crime soon attract all but recreational attention from the "milieu".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kGFE3U01sMApp5Q7h0akEvdTwPK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25866'),
  ('1064724989791612453', 'The Suckling', 1990, 'Horror', 'Francis Teri', 'Francis Teri', 'Frank Rivera, Marie Michaels, Gerald Preger, Lisa Petruno, Janet Sovey, Tim Martin Crouse, Susan Brodsky, Bobby Shapiro', null, 'A woman goes to a back alley abortion clinic, only to have her aborted fetus attack her, her boyfriend, and everyone else at the clinic.', 'A woman goes to a back alley abortion clinic, only to have her aborted fetus attack her, her boyfriend, and everyone else at the clinic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qAkU68rqKWZT5v6sFCxx85SrLr0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83292'),
  ('473045495946645409', 'The Sudden Wealth of the Poor People of Kombach', 1971, 'Drama, Crime', 'Volker Schlöndorff', 'Volker Schlöndorff, Margarethe von Trotta', 'Georg Lehn, Karl-Josef Cramer, Margarethe von Trotta, Walter Buschhoff, Rainer Werner Fassbinder, Reinhard Hauff, Wolfgang Bächler, Karl-Heinz Merz', null, 'In an attempt to escape 19th-century poverty, eight farmers and day laborers attack a prince''s money transport in the Hessian Hinterland.', 'In an attempt to escape 19th-century poverty, eight farmers and day laborers attack a prince''s money transport in the Hessian Hinterland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lxMMgFFB5BzSavDBGvSgjTPsCzK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102272'),
  ('962913235362520897', 'The Suffering', 2017, 'Thriller, Drama, Mystery', 'Nicolás Tuozzo, Félix "Chango" Monti', 'Marcos Negri, Nicolás Tuozzo', 'Eugenia Suárez, Benjamín Vicuña, Pablo Rago, Nicolás Francella, Ángela Torres, Luis Machín, Justina Bustos, Osmar Núñez', null, 'Pablo Rouviot is a renowned psychoanalyst. His life changes completely when Paula arrives to his office and asks him to prove that his brother, a man with serious psychological problems and accused for the murder of his father, is in no able condition to be judged.', 'Pablo Rouviot is a renowned psychoanalyst. His life changes completely when Paula arrives to his office and asks him to prove that his brother, a man with serious psychological problems and accused for the murder of his father, is in no able condition to be judged.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zHTFH4cxTeMUIt7jc2reO7Bex34.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:457314'),
  ('1152280436436712049', 'The Sufferings of a Wounded Egg', 1967, null, 'Roland Lethem', null, 'Andrée McLey, Roland Lespineux, Jio Berk, Nicole Duport, Roland Lethem', null, 'A surrealist saga in four parts: 1.) The credit sequence in which title cards show successively larger foetuses pulsating on the screen until the baby is born and cries. 2.) Etoile-directly referring to Cocteau, Lethem shows an adolescent sucking a starfish and then giving birth to a smaller starfish. A statement of inadequacy. To give birth involves an emasculation and a loss of vitality. 3.) Corps-two images of a man on a couch groping for each other, watched by a mysterious peeping Tom. As the two superimposed images come together, the heavy breathing subsides…the statement that the birth of desire is a self – realisation. 4.) Hymen – The decaying body of a girl is shot through green filters, and the final image reveals her vagina crawling with maggots and overlain with a crucifix. A representation of Catholicism preventing the free expression of desire.', 'A surrealist saga in four parts: 1.) The credit sequence in which title cards show successively larger foetuses pulsating on the screen until the baby is born and cries. 2.) Etoile-directly referring to Cocteau, Lethem shows an adolescent sucking a starfish and then giving birth to a smaller starfish. A statement of inadequacy. To give birth involves an emasculation and a loss of vitality. 3.) Corps-two images of a man on a couch groping for each other, watched by a mysterious peeping Tom. As the two superimposed images come together, the heavy breathing subsides…the statement that the birth of desire is a self – realisation. 4.) Hymen – The decaying body of a girl is shot through green filters, and the final image reveals her vagina crawling with maggots and overlain with a crucifix. A representation of Catholicism preventing the free expression of desire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q5692mEawBEx8ma2xL4zfpf9XRN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:306011'),
  ('961521595408222123', 'The Sugarland Express', 1974, 'Crime, Drama, Comedy', 'Steven Spielberg, Vilmos Zsigmond, James Fargo', 'Hal Barwood, Matthew Robbins', 'Goldie Hawn, William Atherton, Ben Johnson, Michael Sacks, Gregory Walcott, Steve Kanaly, Louise Latham, Harrison Zanuck', 'PG', 'Married small-time crooks Lou-Jean and Clovis Poplin lose their baby to the state of Texas and resolve to do whatever it takes to get him back. Lou-Jean gets Clovis out of jail, and the two steal their son from his foster home, in addition to taking a highway patrolman hostage. As a massive dragnet starts to pursue them across Texas, the couple become unlikely folk heroes and even start to bond with the captive policeman.', 'Married small-time crooks Lou-Jean and Clovis Poplin lose their baby to the state of Texas and resolve to do whatever it takes to get him back. Lou-Jean gets Clovis out of jail, and the two steal their son from his foster home, in addition to taking a highway patrolman hostage. As a massive dragnet starts to pursue them across Texas, the couple become unlikely folk heroes and even start to bond with the captive policeman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/csahjHhtJ9NzFKcxVcw7S4Pyfj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5121'),
  ('392855855488058041', 'The Suicide Forecast', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Cho Jin-mo, Choi Sang-muk, Yu Jae-gyu', 'Yu Seong-hyeob', 'Ryoo Seung-bum, Sung Dong-il, Jung Sun-kyung, Seo Ji-hye, Younha, Choi Jung-woo, Hyun Bin, Chae Bin', null, 'An insurance agent helps a financially desperate client make his suicide look like an accident and becomes the target of a fraud investigation. To protect his career, he must visit all his remaining suicide-prone clients and talk them out of killing themselves.', 'An insurance agent helps a financially desperate client make his suicide look like an accident and becomes the target of a fraud investigation. To protect his career, he must visit all his remaining suicide-prone clients and talk them out of killing themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1j4iUvzVKQYrG2RXngCMyMRQam3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72067'),
  ('376497661600186879', 'The Suicide Manual', 2003, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Osamu Fukutani, Masakazu Oka', 'Hiroshi Kanno, Osamu Fukutani', 'Nozomi Ando, Kei Horie, Ayaka Maeda, Maki Meguro, Kenji Mizuhashi, Chisato Morishita, Yuko Nakamura, Hideo Sakaki', null, 'After a group suicide, two journalists investigate the cycle of suicides caused by spirits bound by the Suicide Manual.', 'After a group suicide, two journalists investigate the cycle of suicides caused by spirits bound by the Suicide Manual.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m5JHRlMZFKwyEsXRr1sYWuZjB0A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109554'),
  ('73102560489732192', 'The Suicide Shop', 2012, 'Comedy, Animation, Music', 'Patrice Leconte, Florian Thouret', 'Patrice Leconte', 'Bernard Alane, Isabelle Spade, Kacey Mottet Klein, Isabelle Giami, Laurent Gendron, Pierre-François Martin-Laval, Eric Métayer, Jacques Mathou', null, 'In a cold French city where suicide is a common urge, there is a colorful shop, managed for many years by the Tuvache family, where it is very easy to obtain the necessary tools to satisfy the sinister desires of so many depressed citizens.', 'In a cold French city where suicide is a common urge, there is a colorful shop, managed for many years by the Tuvache family, where it is very easy to obtain the necessary tools to satisfy the sinister desires of so many depressed citizens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yKaWOrawlOXv0RQsJNKAczCLeSq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118293'),
  ('693154065409778946', 'The Suicide Squad', 2021, 'Action, Comedy, Adventure', 'Alan Hook, James McGrady, Lars P. Winther', 'James Gunn', 'Margot Robbie, Idris Elba, John Cena, Joel Kinnaman, Sylvester Stallone, Viola Davis, David Dastmalchian, Daniela Melchior', 'R', 'Supervillains Harley Quinn, Bloodsport, Peacemaker and a collection of nutty cons at Belle Reve prison join the super-secret, super-shady Task Force X as they are dropped off at the remote, enemy-infused island of Corto Maltese.', 'Supervillains Harley Quinn, Bloodsport, Peacemaker and a collection of nutty cons at Belle Reve prison join the super-secret, super-shady Task Force X as they are dropped off at the remote, enemy-infused island of Corto Maltese.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q61qEyssk2ku3okWICKArlAdhBn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:436969'),
  ('781453642211644979', 'The Suicide Theory', 2014, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Dru Brown', 'Michael J Kospiah', 'Leon Cain, Steve Mazoukis, Joss McWilliam, Matthew Scully, Todd Levi', 'R', 'Steven Ray was never quite normal. But when tragedy strikes in the form of a deadly hit-and-run incident at a city cross walk, his violent and bizarre behavior becomes uncontrollable. One night, as Steven plots his next murder, he meets Percival, whose unsuccessful attempt at suicide not only interferes with Stevens plans, but the chance encounter also introduces the two into each others sad and lonely lives. Percival believes hes cursed after miraculously surviving each suicide attempt and concludes fate brought he and Steven together. So he hires Steven to assist him in suicide. Steven does not believe in fate and thinks Percival is desperate and delusional. But he accepts the offer. Easy money. After Percival continues to miraculously survive each attempt on his life, Steven starts to believe. He tries to help Percival figure out ways to break the curse. And in the process, they form an unlikely friendship through the common bond of tragedy.', 'Steven Ray was never quite normal. But when tragedy strikes in the form of a deadly hit-and-run incident at a city cross walk, his violent and bizarre behavior becomes uncontrollable. One night, as Steven plots his next murder, he meets Percival, whose unsuccessful attempt at suicide not only interferes with Stevens plans, but the chance encounter also introduces the two into each others sad and lonely lives. Percival believes hes cursed after miraculously surviving each suicide attempt and concludes fate brought he and Steven together. So he hires Steven to assist him in suicide. Steven does not believe in fate and thinks Percival is desperate and delusional. But he accepts the offer. Easy money. After Percival continues to miraculously survive each attempt on his life, Steven starts to believe. He tries to help Percival figure out ways to break the curse. And in the process, they form an unlikely friendship through the common bond of tragedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5jSRRCza4c2AjY51KXyY6RBzglj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:273599'),
  ('951426576045493249', 'The Suite Life Movie', 2011, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family, Drama, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Sean McNamara, Attila Szalay', 'Robert Horn, Michael Saltzman', 'Dylan Sprouse, Cole Sprouse, Brenda Song, Debby Ryan, Phill Lewis, Matthew Timmons, John Ducey, Matthew Glave', 'G', 'Cody and Zack are approached to join the Gemini Project, a high-tech research center studying the dynamics between twins. Shockingly, they find themselves interconnected in a whole new way! When one twin experiences something, the other twin feels it too. This newfound revelation helps them see eye to eye for the first time, and it puts them in more danger than they could have imagined.', 'Cody and Zack are approached to join the Gemini Project, a high-tech research center studying the dynamics between twins. Shockingly, they find themselves interconnected in a whole new way! When one twin experiences something, the other twin feels it too. This newfound revelation helps them see eye to eye for the first time, and it puts them in more danger than they could have imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/31aSRwBIpn355kNQyYBdDdZoEVZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60803'),
  ('901702098732528445', 'The Suitor', 1962, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Pierre Étaix, Pierre Levent, André Bureau', 'Pierre Étaix', 'France Arnel, Laurence Lignières, Claude Massot, Pierre Étaix, Denise Péronne, Karin Vesely, Robert Blome, Pierre Maguelon', null, 'Absent-minded yet cultured, Pierre answers his parents demands to wed by ignoring both astronomy and the housemaid, instead falling head-over-heels for rich damsels.', 'Absent-minded yet cultured, Pierre answers his parents demands to wed by ignoring both astronomy and the housemaid, instead falling head-over-heels for rich damsels.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ld8Ig3n6CR5hH8g62nQuWl8E68w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67556'),
  ('475577377954270380', 'The Sum of All Fears', 2002, 'Thriller, Action, Drama', 'Phil Alden Robinson, John Lindley, Doug Juhn', 'Daniel Pyne, Paul Attanasio', 'Ben Affleck, Morgan Freeman, James Cromwell, Liev Schreiber, Bridget Moynahan, Alan Bates, Ciarán Hinds, Philip Baker Hall', 'PG-13', 'When the president of Russia suddenly dies, a man whose politics are virtually unknown succeeds him. The change in political leaders sparks paranoia among American CIA officials, so CIA director Bill Cabot recruits a young analyst to supply insight and advice on the situation. Then the unthinkable happens: a nuclear bomb explodes in a U.S. city, and America is quick to blame the Russians.', 'When the president of Russia suddenly dies, a man whose politics are virtually unknown succeeds him. The change in political leaders sparks paranoia among American CIA officials, so CIA director Bill Cabot recruits a young analyst to supply insight and advice on the situation. Then the unthinkable happens: a nuclear bomb explodes in a U.S. city, and America is quick to blame the Russians.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3E4LW4bjRhEMDeeXeIsmkJ94v8K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4614'),
  ('1061972014694660958', 'The Sum of Us', 1994, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Kevin Dowling, Geoff Burton', 'David Stevens', 'Jack Thompson, Russell Crowe, John Polson, Deborah Kennedy, Joss Moroney, Mitch Mathews, Julie Herbert, Des James', 'R', 'A widowed father has to deal with two complex issues: while he is searching for "Miss Right," his son, who is in his 20s and gay, is searching for "Mr. Right."', 'A widowed father has to deal with two complex issues: while he is searching for "Miss Right," his son, who is in his 20s and gay, is searching for "Mr. Right."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4rBI4KISTuMCsWGb0kurWxKjqPQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36614'),
  ('861962346807094551', 'The Summer After Graduation', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Mathias Junge, Eoin Moore', 'Marc Terjung', 'Bastian Pastewka, Fabian Busch, Hans Löw, Pegah Ferydoni, Alessija Lause, Steffen Münster, Cyrill Berndt, Anneke Kim Sarnau', null, '25 years after graduating from high-school, Alexander, Ole and Paul embark on a journey through Germany to see a show of their favourite band Madness.', '25 years after graduating from high-school, Alexander, Ole and Paul embark on a journey through Germany to see a show of their favourite band Madness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7JTsz2kHhYQn2rY0VsWiEwePKi6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:566691'),
  ('152252451948876154', 'The Summer Book', 2025, 'Drama', 'Charlie McDowell, Sturla Brandth Grøvlen', 'Robert Jones', 'Glenn Close, Anders Danielsen Lie, Emily Matthews, Ingvar E. Sigurðsson, Pekka Strang, Sophia Heikkilä, Theo Zilliacus', null, 'The story of the relationship between Sophia, an eight-year-old girl who is growing up fast, and her grandmother, who is nearing the end of her life. They are spending time together with Sophia’s father, at the family summer house on a tiny unspoiled island in the Gulf of Finland. All three are coming to terms with the recent death of Sophia’s mother in very different ways.', 'The story of the relationship between Sophia, an eight-year-old girl who is growing up fast, and her grandmother, who is nearing the end of her life. They are spending time together with Sophia’s father, at the family summer house on a tiny unspoiled island in the Gulf of Finland. All three are coming to terms with the recent death of Sophia’s mother in very different ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hIMSCqvN803aLUUOshO3m9MRAZO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1073112'),
  ('440162896537138529', 'The Summer House', 2014, 'Drama', 'Curtis Burz, Andreas Gockel', 'Curtis Burz', 'Sten Jacobs, Anna Altmann, Nina Spletstoßer, Jaspar Fuld, Stephan Bürgi', 'NR', 'The architect and head of the family Markus Larsen secretly lives out his bisexual tendencies while his wife Christine and their 11-year-old daughter Elisabeth drown in unbearable loneliness. When Markus gets to know the 12-year-old son of a colleague, he feels an immediate affection for the boy.', 'The architect and head of the family Markus Larsen secretly lives out his bisexual tendencies while his wife Christine and their 11-year-old daughter Elisabeth drown in unbearable loneliness. When Markus gets to know the 12-year-old son of a colleague, he feels an immediate affection for the boy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zSUrKtLHfsnW1URmhsgVqTYXLcT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:355753'),
  ('696664547875541394', 'The Summer House', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Valeria Bruni Tedeschi, Jeanne Lapoirie', 'Valeria Bruni Tedeschi, Noémie Lvovsky, Agnès de Sacy', 'Valeria Bruni Tedeschi, Pierre Arditi, Valeria Golino, Noémie Lvovsky, Oumy Bruni Garrel, Marisa Borini, Riccardo Scamarcio, Yolande Moreau', null, 'A large and beautiful property on the French Riviera. A place that seems out of time and sheltered from the rest of the world. Anna goes there with her daughter for a few days of vacation. Amidst her family, friends and the house staff, Anna has to handle her fresh break-up with her partner and the writing of her next film.', 'A large and beautiful property on the French Riviera. A place that seems out of time and sheltered from the rest of the world. Anna goes there with her daughter for a few days of vacation. Amidst her family, friends and the house staff, Anna has to handle her fresh break-up with her partner and the writing of her next film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/srneCbN2ymaYo6DYEcFLBkrb9ev.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:511404'),
  ('618915706803863164', 'The Summer I Turned 15', 1976, 'Drama', 'Knut Andersen', 'Knut Andersen, Knut Faldbakken', 'Steffen Rothschild, Anne-Lise Tangstad, Kaare Kroppan, Grethe Ryen, Carina Ruude, Arne Lendl, Inger Teien, Wilfred Breistrand', null, 'The story Peter is telling the about a special summer, when he is invited over to summer holiday from bickering parents, to his aunt and uncle in the country. He''s been there before, but this summer was quite one to remember.', 'The story Peter is telling the about a special summer, when he is invited over to summer holiday from bickering parents, to his aunt and uncle in the country. He''s been there before, but this summer was quite one to remember.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uqFTqKoh2lMDChPKcHwXaKVYJUS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:281007'),
  ('827437254219223278', 'The Summer Is Gone', 2016, 'Drama', 'Zhang Dalei, Lü Songye', 'Zhang Dalei', 'Weiyi Kong, Zhang Chen, Guo Yanyuan', null, 'In the early 1990s, Xiaolei, who lives in a small village in western China, longs for a summer holiday without homework after he graduated from primary school. However, it is filled with boring routine, and Xiaolei feels the anxiety around him. When his father has left, Xiaolei realises that his life is completely changed.', 'In the early 1990s, Xiaolei, who lives in a small village in western China, longs for a summer holiday without homework after he graduated from primary school. However, it is filled with boring routine, and Xiaolei feels the anxiety around him. When his father has left, Xiaolei realises that his life is completely changed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iUNTdwLDwbuV9XKV3Pbzkn0g2KO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:421483'),
  ('757442372798801661', 'The Summer of All My Parents', 2016, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Diastème, Pierre Milon', 'Diastème', 'Luna Lou, Alma Jodorowsky, Pascale Arbillot, Patrick Chesnais, Thierry Godard, Jérémie Laheurte, Lou Chauvain', null, 'After attempting to set a mailbox on fire, Pimpette, 14, and her elder sister, Joséphine, 18, spend their summer holidays shuttling between their secretly pregnant mom and bachelor father. But when Joséphine gets involved with the wrong crowd, little Pimpette turns out to be more responsible than the grown-ups who spend their time educating her.', 'After attempting to set a mailbox on fire, Pimpette, 14, and her elder sister, Joséphine, 18, spend their summer holidays shuttling between their secretly pregnant mom and bachelor father. But when Joséphine gets involved with the wrong crowd, little Pimpette turns out to be more responsible than the grown-ups who spend their time educating her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8u01NIyoEwhFbvuZ2fZUHBwsmaw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:395450'),
  ('566172596779247966', 'The Summer of Sangaile', 2015, 'Drama, Romance', 'Alantė Kavaitė, Dominique Colin', 'Alantė Kavaitė', 'Julija Steponaitytė, Aistė Diržiūtė, Jūratė Sodytė, Martynas Budraitis, Laurynas Jurgelis, Nelė Savičenko, Inga Šalkauskaitė, Gailė Butvilaitė', 'NR', 'Sangaile, a 17-year-old spending the summer at her parents’ lakeside villa, becomes drawn to a free-spirited girl she meets at a nearby aeronautical show. As they grow closer, she begins to confront her fears and embrace a connection that encourages her to pursue her passion for flight.', 'Sangaile, a 17-year-old spending the summer at her parents’ lakeside villa, becomes drawn to a free-spirited girl she meets at a nearby aeronautical show. As they grow closer, she begins to confront her fears and embrace a connection that encourages her to pursue her passion for flight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kdQM0SMJdsqLkj9Bz8hJNFMdguD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:310568'),
  ('1075019961682862227', 'The Summer with Carmen', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Thodoros Mihopoulos, Zacharias Mavroeidis', 'Zacharias Mavroeidis, Xenofondas Chalatsis', 'Yorgos Tsiantoulas, Andreas Labropoulos, Nikolas Mihas, Roubini Vasilakopoulou, Vasilis Tsigristaris, Nantia Margariti, Clio Chavgie, Jacques Simha', null, 'While having a day-long swim at Athens’ queer beach, best friends Demosthenes and Nikitas recall the events of a recent summer in the prospect of turning them into a screenplay for Nikitas’ feature debut.', 'While having a day-long swim at Athens’ queer beach, best friends Demosthenes and Nikitas recall the events of a recent summer in the prospect of turning them into a screenplay for Nikitas’ feature debut.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zik40amxHJ5j7XtmQMXzM8Stvis.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1157023'),
  ('1097519316860368610', 'The Summers of It - Chapter Two: It Ends', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Constantine Nasr', null, 'Andy Muschietti, Barbara Muschietti, Bill Skarsgård, James McAvoy, Bill Hader, James Ransone, Andy Bean, Jay Ryan', 'NR', 'This documentary focuses on the actors and their journey over two summers to create the remake to the original IT, by Stephen King. The documentary originally released as bonus material, bundled with IT: Chapter Two.', 'This documentary focuses on the actors and their journey over two summers to create the remake to the original IT, by Stephen King. The documentary originally released as bonus material, bundled with IT: Chapter Two.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oXtw9zyoRtt1PiF6MSBNpSYSHRu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:661289'),
  ('566575357227643538', 'The Summit', 2013, 'Adventure, Documentary, Drama', 'Robbie Ryan, Nick Ryan', 'Mark Monroe', 'Christine Barnes, Christo Mitzkov, Hoselito Bite, Marco Confortola, Cecilie Skog, Wilco Van Rooijen, Alberto Zerain, Cas Van de Gevel', 'R', 'The Summit is a 2012 documentary film about the 2008 K2 disaster directed by Nick Ryan. It combines documentary footage with dramatized recreations of the events of the 2008 K2 disaster. On the way to and from the summit, eleven climbers died during a short time span creating one of the worst catastophes in climbing history. Much of the documentary footage was captured by Swedish mountaineer Fredrik Sträng. Sträng was planning to do a Documentary which was aborted due to the fact that he did not reach the summit. The footage was still valuable to help solving what really did happen since all the climbers had different stories about what happened.', 'The Summit is a 2012 documentary film about the 2008 K2 disaster directed by Nick Ryan. It combines documentary footage with dramatized recreations of the events of the 2008 K2 disaster. On the way to and from the summit, eleven climbers died during a short time span creating one of the worst catastophes in climbing history. Much of the documentary footage was captured by Swedish mountaineer Fredrik Sträng. Sträng was planning to do a Documentary which was aborted due to the fact that he did not reach the summit. The footage was still valuable to help solving what really did happen since all the climbers had different stories about what happened.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n7hRnGpAIT75xSyBnTBPfAZQ213.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133441'),
  ('258612369207542517', 'The Summit', 2017, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Santiago Mitre, Javier Julia', 'Santiago Mitre, Mariano Llinás', 'Ricardo Darín, Érica Rivas, Gerardo Romano, Dolores Fonzi, Elena Anaya, Leonardo Franco, Paulina García, Daniel Giménez Cacho', null, 'At a summit for Latin American presidents in Chile where the region''s geopolitical strategies and alliances are in discussion, Argentine president Hernán Blanco endures political and family drama that will force him to face his own demons.', 'At a summit for Latin American presidents in Chile where the region''s geopolitical strategies and alliances are in discussion, Argentine president Hernán Blanco endures political and family drama that will force him to face his own demons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gy2fvMbEuR1uJYGpM7oJ91HFRgl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:440374'),
  ('500825362268056508', 'The Summit: A Chronicle Of Stones to Serenity', 2009, 'Drama', 'Daisaku Kimura, Daisaku Kimura, Shinichiro Ikebe', 'Daisaku Kimura, Atsuo Kikuchi, Toshimasa Miyamura', 'Tadanobu Asano, Teruyuki Kagawa, Ryuhei Matsuda, Aoi Miyazaki, Koji Yakusho, Toru Nakamura, Yukijiro Hotaru, Ichiro Hashimoto', null, 'In 1907, a group of men climb an unconquered peak in the last unmapped region of Japan.', 'In 1907, a group of men climb an unconquered peak in the last unmapped region of Japan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kgtBerZSieaxAMAn2oVMj41NFpB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148066'),
