  ('79650288829722902', 'The Sun Also Rises', 1957, 'Drama, Romance', 'Henry King, Leo Tover, Stanley Hough', 'Peter Viertel', 'Tyrone Power, Ava Gardner, Errol Flynn, Eddie Albert, Mel Ferrer, Gregory Ratoff, Juliette Gréco, Marcel Dalio', 'NR', 'A group of disillusioned American expatriate writers live a dissolute, hedonistic lifestyle in 1920''s France and Spain.', 'A group of disillusioned American expatriate writers live a dissolute, hedonistic lifestyle in 1920''s France and Spain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aUmBezgVtjtYTzw9k2tNbHEfCWI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25190'),
  ('798192648964677260', 'The Sun Also Rises', 2007, 'Fantasy, Drama', 'Jiang Wen, Tao Yang, Mark Lee Ping-Bing', 'Shu Ping, Shixing Guo, Jiang Wen', 'Zhou Yun, Jiang Wen, Joan Chen, Anthony Wong Chau-Sang, Jaycee Chan, Kong Wei, Lei Chen, Wei Chen', null, 'A polyptych of interconnected stories in different time-zones, shifting between a Yunnan village, a campus, and the Gobi Desert.', 'A polyptych of interconnected stories in different time-zones, shifting between a Yunnan village, a campus, and the Gobi Desert.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hdaNnfexnCqQswV1q2gVo8BYtff.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51885'),
  ('118451492614944864', 'The Sun in a Net', 1963, 'Drama', 'Eduard Grečner, Štefan Uher, Stanislav Szomolányi', 'Alfonz Bednár', 'Marián Bielik, Jana Beláková, Eliška Nosálová, Oľga Šalagová, Pavol Chrobák, Andrej Vandlík, Adam Jančo, Ľubomír Roman', null, 'Oldrich "Fajolo" Fajták (Marián Bielik), a student who directs quasi-existentialist verbal abuse at his girlfriend Bela Blazejová (Jana Beláková), takes off to a formally volunteer summer work camp at a farm where he meets her grandfather.', 'Oldrich "Fajolo" Fajták (Marián Bielik), a student who directs quasi-existentialist verbal abuse at his girlfriend Bela Blazejová (Jana Beláková), takes off to a formally volunteer summer work camp at a farm where he meets her grandfather.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lORMKI7cGtOW7ocrPqJRTjp0UgH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47903'),
  ('1064178598323996738', 'The sun inside', 2012, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Paolo Bianchini, Giovanni Cavallini', 'Paolo Bianchini, Marco Cavaliere, Paola Rota', 'Fallou Kama, Gaetano Fresa, Angela Finocchiaro, Diego Bianchi, Giobbe Covatta, Francesco Salvi, Mohamed Lamine Keita, Mohamed Toumany Sylla', null, 'Yaguine and Fodé, two teenagers from African Guinea, wrote a letter to the "European Parlament great leaders", on behalf of all children and teens in Africa, where they ask for help with food, health and education. Ten years later, thirteen-year-old Thabo embarks on an epic journey with his friend Rocco from Bari to return to his own African village of ''Ndula to escape a ruthless Italian gang who are exploiting young football players.', 'Yaguine and Fodé, two teenagers from African Guinea, wrote a letter to the "European Parlament great leaders", on behalf of all children and teens in Africa, where they ask for help with food, health and education. Ten years later, thirteen-year-old Thabo embarks on an epic journey with his friend Rocco from Bari to return to his own African village of ''Ndula to escape a ruthless Italian gang who are exploiting young football players.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j5YtKrM8rZHg8jrz3tyqoVTNw0h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:184679'),
  ('818122463387580504', 'The Sun Is Also a Star', 2019, 'Romance, Drama', 'Ry Russo-Young, Autumn Durald Arkapaw', 'Tracy Oliver', 'Yara Shahidi, Charles Melton, Hill Harper, Gbenga Akinnagbe, Jake Choi, John Leguizamo, Anais Lee, Miriam A. Hyman', 'PG-13', 'Two young New Yorkers begin to fall in love over the course of a single day, as a series of potentially life-altering meetings loom over their heads - hers concerning her family’s deportation to Jamaica, and his concerning an education at Dartmouth.', 'Two young New Yorkers begin to fall in love over the course of a single day, as a series of potentially life-altering meetings loom over their heads - hers concerning her family’s deportation to Jamaica, and his concerning an education at Dartmouth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dGl7ZnnL3WoiCKQAQdgkEF0EAbj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:508791'),
  ('121492249080634827', 'The Sun King', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Tomas Villum Jensen, Peter Bækkel, Emil Øigaard', 'Anders Thomas Jensen, Tomas Villum Jensen', 'Nikolaj Lie Kaas, Birthe Neumann, Thomas Bo Larsen, Niels Olsen, Mira Wanting, Peter Gantzler, Lotte Andersen, Kirsten Lehfeldt', null, 'While changing the pipes in the tanningbeds at Golden Sun, Tommy meets the owner. A middleaged former Miss Fyn called Susse. Slowly an unusual love affair begins. Tommy''s two friends Ole &amp; Flemming give him tips on how to give Golden Sun some masculine appeal. Susse just happens to have a sleazy lawyer that does not appreciate the new look.', 'While changing the pipes in the tanningbeds at Golden Sun, Tommy meets the owner. A middleaged former Miss Fyn called Susse. Slowly an unusual love affair begins. Tommy''s two friends Ole &amp; Flemming give him tips on how to give Golden Sun some masculine appeal. Susse just happens to have a sleazy lawyer that does not appreciate the new look.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xj2luouSvKtdpXNOStISSbYRjFR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33446'),
  ('581388591501910806', 'The Sun Rises on Us All', 2025, 'Romance, Drama', 'Cai Shangjun, Kim Hyun-seok', 'Cai Shangjun, Han Nianjin', 'Xin Zhilei, Zhang Songwen, William Feng, Xue Yuanyuan, Qiao Linkai, Yi Xinyun, Ye Peishi, Shan Baozhong', null, 'He sacrificed himself for love, taking the blame for a crime she committed. Unable to repay him for the sacrifice he made, she leaves to start a new life. Many years later, the former lovers meet again, but their estranged yet intertwined daily lives gradually unveil their tragic past. While one of them seeks redemption, the other yearns for release. In a painful and final farewell, they awaken from their wandering for one last heart-wrenching embrace.', 'He sacrificed himself for love, taking the blame for a crime she committed. Unable to repay him for the sacrifice he made, she leaves to start a new life. Many years later, the former lovers meet again, but their estranged yet intertwined daily lives gradually unveil their tragic past. While one of them seeks redemption, the other yearns for release. In a painful and final farewell, they awaken from their wandering for one last heart-wrenching embrace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7vySZlIzogNMwSMGWgREc1OXDSb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1329673'),
  ('1095633291574369101', 'The Sun Shines Bright', 1953, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Archie Stout, John Ford', 'Laurence Stallings', 'Charles Winninger, Arleen Whelan, John Russell, Stepin Fetchit, Russell Simpson, Ludwig Stössel, Francis Ford, Paul Hurst', 'NR', 'With the election approaching, a judge in a Southern town at the turn of the 20th century is involved variously in revealing the real identity of a young woman, reliving his Civil War memories, and preventing the lynching of an African youth.', 'With the election approaching, a judge in a Southern town at the turn of the 20th century is involved variously in revealing the real identity of a young woman, reliving his Civil War memories, and preventing the lynching of an African youth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/46aBk8HjLwruaHK9vCzjVhd82VZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109539'),
  ('782122368586718013', 'The Sun Stands Still', 2021, 'Thriller, Action', 'Eiichiro Hasumi, Yuta Morokaji, Tomoo Ezaki', 'Tamio Hayashi', 'Tatsuya Fujiwara, Ryoma Takeuchi, Han Hyo-joo, Byun Yo-han, Hayato Ichihara, Sara Minami, Seishirou Katou, Eiji Yokota', null, 'Kazuhiko Takano and Ryoichi Taoka are industrial spies. A conspiracy exits behind the technology which can shake the political and economic world in Japan. Takano faces Korean spy Kim, a mysterious woman Ayako and powerful men from various countries.', 'Kazuhiko Takano and Ryoichi Taoka are industrial spies. A conspiracy exits behind the technology which can shake the political and economic world in Japan. Takano faces Korean spy Kim, a mysterious woman Ayako and powerful men from various countries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aWYOqDyQaxr2X61c2Nbhv8lJOR3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:664286'),
  ('261047365310166570', 'The Sun''s Burial', 1960, 'Drama, Crime', 'Nagisa Ōshima, Takashi Kawamata', 'Toshirō Ishidō, Nagisa Ōshima', 'Masahiko Tsugawa, Kayoko Honoo, Isao Sasaki, Fumio Watanabe, Kamatari Fujiwara, Tanie Kitabayashi, Junzaburō Ban, Yūsuke Kawazu', null, 'In Osaka''s slum, capricious folks without futures engage in pilfering, assault and robbery, prostitution, and the trading of ID cards and blood.', 'In Osaka''s slum, capricious folks without futures engage in pilfering, assault and robbery, prostitution, and the trading of ID cards and blood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yKruoEfZtL7TakCG2nFcB6HG50N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111718'),
  ('361821831275334538', 'The Sunchaser', 1996, 'Drama, Crime', 'Michael Cimino, Douglas Milsome, David L. Butler', 'Charles Leavitt', 'Woody Harrelson, Jon Seda, Anne Bancroft, Alexandra Tydings, Matt Mulhern, Talisa Soto, Richard Bauer, Victor Aaron', 'R', 'A young half-Navajo convict dying of cancer forces a yuppie doctor to drive him to a magic healing lake.', 'A young half-Navajo convict dying of cancer forces a yuppie doctor to drive him to a magic healing lake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Y0snZwCLvG8eoJewP4G3RT8Z4v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38191'),
  ('113511972614772292', 'The Sunday Woman', 1975, 'Crime, Mystery, Comedy', 'Elio Girlanda, Amy Werba, Vincenzo D''Errico', 'Agenore Incrocci, Furio Scarpelli', 'Marcello Mastroianni, Jacqueline Bisset, Jean-Louis Trintignant, Aldo Reggiani, Maria Teresa Albani, Omero Antonutti, Gigi Ballista, Fortunato Cecilia', null, 'Police commissioner Santamaria is investigating the murder of the ambiguous architect Mr. Garrone. The investigations soon drive him into the Torino''s high society. Santamaria suspect Anna Carla and at the same time falls in love for her. Lello is the lover of Massimo, Anna Carla’s gay friend. He is following another direction in order to find out the truth, and his results are confusing the Policeman. But another murder happens...', 'Police commissioner Santamaria is investigating the murder of the ambiguous architect Mr. Garrone. The investigations soon drive him into the Torino''s high society. Santamaria suspect Anna Carla and at the same time falls in love for her. Lello is the lover of Massimo, Anna Carla’s gay friend. He is following another direction in order to find out the truth, and his results are confusing the Policeman. But another murder happens...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jb2Ocf9vNJUoM4JoISUIkxtGEDK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57310'),
  ('331398891359456445', 'The Sundowners', 1950, 'Action, Western', 'George Templeton, James Paisley, Harry Templeton', 'Alan Le May', 'Robert Preston, Robert Sterling, Chill Wills, Cathy Downs, John Litel, Jack Elam, Don Haggerty, Stanley Price', 'NR', 'Brother is pitted against brother in this tale of fueding ranchers in the old west.', 'Brother is pitted against brother in this tale of fueding ranchers in the old west.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kbAz3ih1cjucAWX9p5eWS4xjtGO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43393'),
  ('30670668652621169', 'The Sundowners', 1960, 'Drama, Adventure', 'Fred Zinnemann, Lex Halliday, Skeets Kelly', 'Isobel Lennart', 'Deborah Kerr, Robert Mitchum, Peter Ustinov, Glynis Johns, Dina Merrill, Chips Rafferty, Michael Anderson Jr., Lola Brooks', 'NR', 'In the Australian Outback, the Carmody family--Paddy, Ida, and their teenage son Sean--are sheep drovers, always on the move. Ida and Sean want to settle down and buy a farm. Paddy wants to keep moving. A sheep-shearing contest, the birth of a child, drinking, gambling, and a racehorse will all have a part in the final decision.', 'In the Australian Outback, the Carmody family--Paddy, Ida, and their teenage son Sean--are sheep drovers, always on the move. Ida and Sean want to settle down and buy a farm. Paddy wants to keep moving. A sheep-shearing contest, the birth of a child, drinking, gambling, and a racehorse will all have a part in the final decision.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yGXxKdR3sttc0Gu927wMETZH3al.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43047'),
  ('1133202079740514022', 'The Sunlit Night', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'David Wnendt, Martin Ahlgren', 'Rebecca Dinerstein', 'Jenny Slate, Alex Sharp, Fridtjov Såheim, Gillian Anderson, Zach Galifianakis, David Paymer, Jessica Hecht, Elise Kibler', null, 'An aspiring painter meets eccentric locals and a fellow New Yorker while working on a barn in Norway.', 'An aspiring painter meets eccentric locals and a fellow New Yorker while working on a barn in Norway.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/crMgeJWwAPhcE5kE8QLiVdhuyJe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:565275'),
  ('751899909301431934', 'The Suns of Easter Island', 1972, 'Drama, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Pierre Kast, Jean Collomb, José Antônio Ventura', 'Pierre Kast', 'Norma Bengell, Françoise Brion, Jacques Charrier, Maurice Garrel, Marcelo Romo, Alexandra Stewart, Zózimo Bulbul, Ursula Vian-Kübler', null, 'Six people find a mysterious mark in the center of their left hand and all independently go to Easter Island in hopes to uncover the mystery.', 'Six people find a mysterious mark in the center of their left hand and all independently go to Easter Island in hopes to uncover the mystery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rDo1ESiEa9gH8N31MeMX1Im2WXt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87386'),
  ('496792859461506339', 'The Sunset Limited', 2011, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Tommy Lee Jones, Paul Elliott', 'Cormac McCarthy', 'Tommy Lee Jones, Samuel L. Jackson', 'R', 'A deeply religious black ex-con thwarts the suicide attempt of an asocial white college professor who tries to throw himself in front of an oncoming subway train, ''The Sunset Limited.'' As the one attempts to connect on a rational, spiritual and emotional level, the other remains steadfast in his hard-earned despair. Locked in a philosophical debate, both passionately defend their personal credos and try to convert the other.', 'A deeply religious black ex-con thwarts the suicide attempt of an asocial white college professor who tries to throw himself in front of an oncoming subway train, ''The Sunset Limited.'' As the one attempts to connect on a rational, spiritual and emotional level, the other remains steadfast in his hard-earned despair. Locked in a philosophical debate, both passionately defend their personal credos and try to convert the other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8cwqylJVbCfMflcjXQ71CwsXdpf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56831'),
  ('138137741316500733', 'The Sunshine Boys', 1975, 'Comedy', 'Herbert Ross, Gary Daigler, Jack Roe', 'Neil Simon', 'Walter Matthau, George Burns, Richard Benjamin, Lee Meredith, Carol Arthur, Rosetta LeNoire, F. Murray Abraham, Howard Hesseman', 'PG', 'Lewis and Clark, aka The Sunshine Boys, were famous comedians during the vaudeville era, but off-stage they couldn''t stand each other and haven''t spoken in over 20 years of retirement. Willy Clark''s nephew is the producer of a TV variety show that wants to feature a reunion of this classic duo. It is up to him to try to get the Sunshine Boys back together again.', 'Lewis and Clark, aka The Sunshine Boys, were famous comedians during the vaudeville era, but off-stage they couldn''t stand each other and haven''t spoken in over 20 years of retirement. Willy Clark''s nephew is the producer of a TV variety show that wants to feature a reunion of this classic duo. It is up to him to try to get the Sunshine Boys back together again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e8g6sy7rBSzuBBgOZqH1Bkjquy7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16561'),
  ('698824960537571937', 'The Sunshine Boys', 1996, 'TV Movie, Drama, Comedy', 'John Erman, Michael Haley, Tony Imi', 'Neil Simon', 'Woody Allen, Peter Falk, Sarah Jessica Parker, Michael McKean, Liev Schreiber, Edie Falco, Tyler Noyes, Olga Merediz', null, 'Two aging comedians, who acrimoniously dissolved their act eight years earlier, must overcome their differences when they have the chance for a lucrative movie comeback.', 'Two aging comedians, who acrimoniously dissolved their act eight years earlier, must overcome their differences when they have the chance for a lucrative movie comeback.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/omVSgJZHEe7B0TFfWKKGJscA1xI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119694'),
  ('716332208790034974', 'The Sunshine Makers', 1935, 'Family, Animation', 'Ted Eshbaugh, Burt Gillett', null, null, null, 'Happy sunshine-bottling gnomes battle gloomy swamp-dwellers.', 'Happy sunshine-bottling gnomes battle gloomy swamp-dwellers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uHxWLuPmjj7lbbU1HP8Q74OwkNv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:184664'),
  ('241905589353281218', 'The Super', 1991, 'Comedy', 'Bruce Surtees, Rod Daniel, Henry J. Bronchtein', 'Sam Simon', 'Joe Pesci, Vincent Gardenia, Madolyn Smith Osborne, Rubén Blades, Stacey Travis, Carole Shelley, Kenn Michael, Paul Benjamin', 'R', 'Louie Kritski is a heartless landlord who has been so negligent in keeping up his ghetto apartment that he is threatened with jail time. The judge gives him another option -- he must live in his rat-infested hell hole until he brings it up to liveable standards.', 'Louie Kritski is a heartless landlord who has been so negligent in keeping up his ghetto apartment that he is threatened with jail time. The judge gives him another option -- he must live in his rat-infested hell hole until he brings it up to liveable standards.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/grkfopMr14odyBGTZQFiBXZ6K5Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53287'),
  ('963021672153142985', 'The Super', 2018, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Scott Kyger, Stephan Rick, Felix Cramer', 'John J. McLaughlin', 'Val Kilmer, Patrick John Flueger, Louisa Krause, Mattea Conforti, Taylor Richardson, Paul Ben-Victor, Yul Vazquez, Andrea Lynn Green', 'R', 'A man becomes the superintendent of a large New York City apartment building where people mysteriously go missing.', 'A man becomes the superintendent of a large New York City apartment building where people mysteriously go missing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1No4DWiCA7QiVwz3CghUQ6X8PMJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:463022'),
  ('66432656995999705', 'The Super 8 Years', 2022, 'Documentary, Drama', 'David Ernaux-Briot, Annie Ernaux, Philippe Ernaux', 'Annie Ernaux', 'Annie Ernaux', 'NR', '“In re-viewing our Super 8 films, shot between 1972 and 1981, it occurred to me that they comprised not only a family archive but a testimony to the pastimes, lifestyle and aspirations of a social class in the decade after 1968. I wanted to incorporate these silent images into a story which combined the intimate with the social and with history, to convey the taste and colour of those years.” Annie Ernaux', '“In re-viewing our Super 8 films, shot between 1972 and 1981, it occurred to me that they comprised not only a family archive but a testimony to the pastimes, lifestyle and aspirations of a social class in the decade after 1968. I wanted to incorporate these silent images into a story which combined the intimate with the social and with history, to convey the taste and colour of those years.” Annie Ernaux', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v7oBUgD2U7MVhNcekqZRGKecpDL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:964681'),
  ('1421986481188310', 'The Super Bob Einstein Movie', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Danny Gold', 'Danny Gold, Michael Mayhew', 'Bob Einstein, Jerry Seinfeld, Larry David, Susie Essman, David Letterman, Sarah Silverman, Norman Lear, Cheryl Hines', 'R', 'This documentary explores Bob Einstein’s unlikely discovery and enduring career, sharing the many evolving layers of his comedy from the people that knew him best.', 'This documentary explores Bob Einstein’s unlikely discovery and enduring career, sharing the many evolving layers of his comedy from the people that knew him best.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6GCOFPzyrhvInwsdezePQkPLK0x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:918632'),
  ('348605246352833144', 'The Super Cops', 1974, 'Action, Comedy, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Gordon Parks, Richard C. Kratina, Kurt Baker', 'Lorenzo Semple Jr.', 'Ron Leibman, David Selby, Sheila Frazier, Pat Hingle, Dan Frazer, Joseph Sirola, Arny Freeman, Bernard Kates', 'R', 'The true story of two New York City cops. Greenberg & Hantz fought the system, became detectives and were known on the streets as "Batman & Robin."', 'The true story of two New York City cops. Greenberg & Hantz fought the system, became detectives and were known on the streets as "Batman & Robin."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wOXozZxOrXdyOvuSiE1gEPauTtF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84324'),
  ('513081606983364980', 'The Super Dimension Fortress Macross: Flash Back 2012', 1987, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Music', 'Fumihiko Takayama, Noboru Ishiguro, Katsuhito Akiyama', 'Shoji Kawamori', 'Mari Iijima, Arihiro Hase, Mika Doi, Akira Kamiya, Eiji Kanie, Ryusuke Ohbayashi', null, 'Flash Back 2012 is Minmay''s farewell concert. Featuring some of her best songs, the music is performed over various scenes and events taken from the first Macross television series as well as Macross: Do You Remember Love film. Also included is a newly animated closing sequence showing the launch of Misa''s colony vessel, the Megaroad-01, into space.', 'Flash Back 2012 is Minmay''s farewell concert. Featuring some of her best songs, the music is performed over various scenes and events taken from the first Macross television series as well as Macross: Do You Remember Love film. Also included is a newly animated closing sequence showing the launch of Misa''s colony vessel, the Megaroad-01, into space.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cRZz2iM6l0shz62gHGf5U84kdPX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56127'),
  ('927625361365834601', 'The Super Elfkins', 2024, 'Animation, Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 'Juan Jose Bravo, Ute von Münchow-Pohl', 'Jan Strathmann, Constanze Behrends', 'Jella Haase, Leon Seidel, Annette Frier, Paul Pizzera, Michael Ostrowski, Cesár Sampson, Hilde Dalik, Bill Mockridge', null, 'Helvi''s world is turned upside down when she discovers the existence of a technically advanced Elfkin gang that, in stark contrast to Elfie’s own clan, is second to none when it comes to fun and thrill-seeking. Can Helvi’s friendship with Bo, the youngest gang member, reconcile the two Elfkin clans after more than 250 years?', 'Helvi''s world is turned upside down when she discovers the existence of a technically advanced Elfkin gang that, in stark contrast to Elfie’s own clan, is second to none when it comes to fun and thrill-seeking. Can Helvi’s friendship with Bo, the youngest gang member, reconcile the two Elfkin clans after more than 250 years?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/le7Lc7jmi5z9ro4SRcJLeJevo2r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1244112'),
  ('192804167998324168', 'The Super Inframan', 1975, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Hua Shan, Tadashi Nishimoto', 'Ni Kuang', 'Danny Lee Sau-Yin, Wang Hsieh, Terry Lau Wai-Yue, Yuan Man-Tzu, Dana, Lin Wen-Wei, Chiang Yang, Huang Kin-Lung', null, 'The surface of the Earth is under attack, thousands of people are killed in this unprovoked attacked. The cause, Princess Dragonmon and her army of monsters have decided to invade. Princess Dragonmon is an alien whose race has been hiding under us for centuries waiting to attack at the time is right. A doctor has been preparing for something like this and turns his assistant Rayma into the cyborg hero known as Inframan. Now only Inframan stands between the Earth and Princess Dragonmon but when a close friend is captured and brainwashed, can she be stopped with this inside man feeding her info?', 'The surface of the Earth is under attack, thousands of people are killed in this unprovoked attacked. The cause, Princess Dragonmon and her army of monsters have decided to invade. Princess Dragonmon is an alien whose race has been hiding under us for centuries waiting to attack at the time is right. A doctor has been preparing for something like this and turns his assistant Rayma into the cyborg hero known as Inframan. Now only Inframan stands between the Earth and Princess Dragonmon but when a close friend is captured and brainwashed, can she be stopped with this inside man feeding her info?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jZwmUr0QJRNYEw9XVrRtxkDy0DE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40435'),
  ('845375063043339275', 'The Super Mario Bros. Movie', 2023, 'Family, Comedy, Adventure, Fantasy, Animation', 'Aaron Horvath, Michael Jelenic, Pierre Leduc', 'Matthew Fogel', 'Chris Pratt, Anya Taylor-Joy, Charlie Day, Jack Black, Keegan-Michael Key, Seth Rogen, Fred Armisen, Sebastian Maniscalco', 'PG', 'While working underground to fix a water main, Brooklyn plumbers—and brothers—Mario and Luigi are transported down a mysterious pipe and wander into a magical new world. But when the brothers are separated, Mario embarks on an epic quest to find Luigi.', 'While working underground to fix a water main, Brooklyn plumbers—and brothers—Mario and Luigi are transported down a mysterious pipe and wander into a magical new world. But when the brothers are separated, Mario embarks on an epic quest to find Luigi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qNBAXBIQlnOThrVvA6mA2B5ggV6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:502356'),
  ('918285173131104899', 'The Super Mario Galaxy Movie', 2026, 'Family, Comedy, Adventure, Fantasy, Animation', 'Michael Jelenic, Aaron Horvath, Pierre Leduc', 'Matthew Fogel', 'Chris Pratt, Charlie Day, Anya Taylor-Joy, Jack Black, Keegan-Michael Key, Benny Safdie, Donald Glover, Luis Guzmán', 'PG', 'Having thwarted Bowser''s previous plot to marry Princess Peach, Mario and Luigi now face a fresh threat in Bowser Jr., who is determined to liberate his father from captivity and restore the family legacy. Alongside companions new and old, the brothers travel across the stars to stop the young heir''s crusade.', 'Having thwarted Bowser''s previous plot to marry Princess Peach, Mario and Luigi now face a fresh threat in Bowser Jr., who is determined to liberate his father from captivity and restore the family legacy. Alongside companions new and old, the brothers travel across the stars to stop the young heir''s crusade.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eJGWx219ZcEMVQJhAgMiqo8tYY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1226863'),
  ('773668910446268732', 'The Super Ninja', 1984, 'Action, Adventure, Crime', 'San Bao, James Wu Kuo-Ren, Chih-Cheng Wang', 'Lee Hong-Nin', 'Alexander Lo Rei, Eugene Thomas, Doris Lung Chun-Erh, Jang Il-Do, Jack Long Shi-Chia, William Yen Ming-Chang, Lo Mei, Kim Gi-jong', null, 'John, a police officer is framed and drugs are found in his home. He is arrested and brutally interrogated. Using his skills as a ninja, he escapes and uncover a plot to steal his girlfriend''s father''s life work. He travels to China to face the 5 Element Ninjas and rescue his girlfriend.', 'John, a police officer is framed and drugs are found in his home. He is arrested and brutally interrogated. Using his skills as a ninja, he escapes and uncover a plot to steal his girlfriend''s father''s life work. He travels to China to face the 5 Element Ninjas and rescue his girlfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8OTK1mCpvTqu3LaRWbrgUzn0hGY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:252819'),
  ('189214100813632655', 'The Super Snooper', 1952, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Robert McKimson', null, 'Mel Blanc, Marian Richman', null, 'In this parody of trench-coat detective films, Daffy Duck is Duck Drake, a "Private Eye, Ear, Nose, and Throat" who receives a telephone call summoning him to the J. Cleaver Axe-Handle Estate, where a murder has supposedly taken place.', 'In this parody of trench-coat detective films, Daffy Duck is Duck Drake, a "Private Eye, Ear, Nose, and Throat" who receives a telephone call summoning him to the J. Cleaver Axe-Handle Estate, where a murder has supposedly taken place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aIlBT7h0z6o0sCS2LrBEW6Nk3yQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235947'),
  ('1064799515301717231', 'The Supergrass', 1985, 'Comedy', 'Peter Richardson', 'Pete Richens, Peter Richardson', 'Adrian Edmondson, Jennifer Saunders, Peter Richardson, Robbie Coltrane, Nigel Planer, Keith Allen, Dawn French, Daniel Peacock', 'R', 'While taking a holiday in the country with his mother, Dennis hits on a scheme to impress a girl so that she''ll go away on a trip with him as his girlfriend. Although he fails to gain any interest from the girl, the police take a great interest in his story. From this point on, Dennis digs a deeper hole for himself at every turn', 'While taking a holiday in the country with his mother, Dennis hits on a scheme to impress a girl so that she''ll go away on a trip with him as his girlfriend. Although he fails to gain any interest from the girl, the police take a great interest in his story. From this point on, Dennis digs a deeper hole for himself at every turn', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p5yiUvAkwoRh37VqO9DABnRF2xU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87067'),
  ('98238549945934016', 'The Supernatural Sweet Shop: The Movie', 2024, 'Fantasy, Mystery', 'Hideo Nakata, Takahiro Imai, Ryuichi Saeki', 'Reiko Yoshida', 'Yuki Amami, Kazuya Ohashi, Rikka Ihara, Mone Kamishiraishi, Kokoro Hirasawa, Himena Irei, Noa Shiroyama, Banka Tenta', null, 'Zenitendo is a mysterious candy store that only lucky people can reach. All the candy recommended by Beniko, the owner of the store, is perfectly suited to the buyer''s troubles. However, it depends on whether the candy will be used or eaten correctly that it can bring happiness or misfortune.', 'Zenitendo is a mysterious candy store that only lucky people can reach. All the candy recommended by Beniko, the owner of the store, is perfectly suited to the buyer''s troubles. However, it depends on whether the candy will be used or eaten correctly that it can bring happiness or misfortune.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1L9NOYp2igCW2RrYGTWSbVY1rPY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1300790'),
  ('363507570226978435', 'The Supernaturals', 1986, 'Horror', 'Armand Mastroianni, Kristine Peterson, Peter Lyons Collister', 'Michael S. Murphey, Joel Soisson', 'Maxwell Caulfield, Nichelle Nichols, Talia Balsam, Bradford Bancroft, LeVar Burton, Bobby Di Cicco, Scott Jacoby, Richard Pachorek', 'R', 'Nichelle Nichols is an army sergeant who leads her platoon into the woods of the deep south on a training exercise. Unfortunately, it is the site where a bunch of yankee soldiers murdered a town of confederates. The corpses of the dead soldiers rise up to wreak revenge.', 'Nichelle Nichols is an army sergeant who leads her platoon into the woods of the deep south on a training exercise. Unfortunately, it is the site where a bunch of yankee soldiers murdered a town of confederates. The corpses of the dead soldiers rise up to wreak revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p7nq4VyiSh8fz5bHEXvP8YzvDg6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48312'),
  ('817130564053525437', 'The SuperVips', 1968, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Bruno Bozzetto, Luciano Marzetti', 'Bruno Bozzetto, Attilio Giovannini, Guido Manuli', 'Oreste Lionello, Fiorella Betti, Lydia Simoneschi, Micaela Esdra, Corrado Gaipa, Arturo Dominici, Pino Locchi, Luciano De Ambrosis', null, 'A satire of modern society or perhaps just a funny tale for children, depending on your age, mood or liking. Recounting the adventures of the last in a line of Supermen, the film pokes fun at the processes that lie behind advertising, politics and our consumer society.', 'A satire of modern society or perhaps just a funny tale for children, depending on your age, mood or liking. Recounting the adventures of the last in a line of Supermen, the film pokes fun at the processes that lie behind advertising, politics and our consumer society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tMFN0FJ6toIgFM2V7uIaumiNOOD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42557'),
  ('774612668230450707', 'The Superwife', 1996, 'Comedy', 'Tom Fährmann, Sönke Wortmann', 'Gundula Leni Ohngemach', 'Veronica Ferres, Til Schweiger, Joachim Król, Liselotte Pulver, Thomas Heinze, Richy Müller, Maren Kroymann, Esther Schweins', null, 'Franziska is a romantically inclined housewife with two children and a husband who spends most of his time traveling around the world and working as a director. However, he cheats on her with his actresses. Franziska goes to see the lawyer Enno Winkel about buying a house, but he prefers to handle divorces. And without realizing it, she suddenly inadvertently initiates her own divorce...', 'Franziska is a romantically inclined housewife with two children and a husband who spends most of his time traveling around the world and working as a director. However, he cheats on her with his actresses. Franziska goes to see the lawyer Enno Winkel about buying a house, but he prefers to handle divorces. And without realizing it, she suddenly inadvertently initiates her own divorce...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Aw7t5TYwvMt3Y55pcLsSBfikOy4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10801'),
  ('515053803311573673', 'The Superwitness', 1971, 'Comedy', 'Franco Giraldi, Carlo Di Palma', 'Tonino Guerra, Ruggero Maccari', 'Monica Vitti, Ugo Tognazzi, Orazio Orlando, Véronique Vendell, Filippo De Gara, Nerina Montagnani, Roy Bosier', null, 'A pimp is suspected of murdering his lover. He is convicted based on the testimony of a single witness. The woman begins doubting her memory of the event and then, her feelings towards the convict...', 'A pimp is suspected of murdering his lover. He is convicted based on the testimony of a single witness. The woman begins doubting her memory of the event and then, her feelings towards the convict...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ooeebWyORiPaiJc7aYLARSZq5UH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196200'),
  ('534640135181660965', 'The Supper', 1992, 'Drama, History', 'Édouard Molinaro, Alexandre Brasseur, Pascale Franck', 'Jean-Claude Brisville', 'Claude Brasseur, Claude Rich, Michel Piccoli, Ticky Holgado, Yann Collette, Stéphane Jobert, Alexandra Vandernoot, Lionel Vitrant', null, 'France, 1815. After his defeat at Waterloo, Napoleon heads for exile. Royalists occupy Paris and attempt to restore the monarchy. However, the battle doesn''t seem to be over. On July 6, Talleyrand, a shrewd politician of flexible convictions, invites chief of police and zealous revolutionary Fouché to supper and tries to convince him to serve the king. Over the meal they insult each other, accuse each other, and, at first sight, look like mortal enemies. But they definitely have one thing in common: they are both power-hungry.', 'France, 1815. After his defeat at Waterloo, Napoleon heads for exile. Royalists occupy Paris and attempt to restore the monarchy. However, the battle doesn''t seem to be over. On July 6, Talleyrand, a shrewd politician of flexible convictions, invites chief of police and zealous revolutionary Fouché to supper and tries to convince him to serve the king. Over the meal they insult each other, accuse each other, and, at first sight, look like mortal enemies. But they definitely have one thing in common: they are both power-hungry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gM9zig3RTqYJkQnkUtZ1QDeiJVs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65958'),
  ('1029198176755481464', 'The Supremes at Earl''s All-You-Can-Eat', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Tina Mabry, Sean McElwee', 'Tina Mabry, Gina Prince-Bythewood', 'Aunjanue Ellis-Taylor, Sanaa Lathan, Uzo Aduba, Mekhi Phifer, Julian McMahon, Vondie Curtis-Hall, Russell Hornsby, Kyanna Simone Simpson', 'PG-13', 'Three lifelong best friends known as “The Supremes” share the unbreakable bonds of sisterhood from decades of weathering life’s storms. Through the joys and sorrows of life, marriage and children, happiness and blues, love and loss, new shades of heartbreak and illness threaten to stir up the past when the trio sees their bond put to the test as they face their most challenging times yet.', 'Three lifelong best friends known as “The Supremes” share the unbreakable bonds of sisterhood from decades of weathering life’s storms. Through the joys and sorrows of life, marriage and children, happiness and blues, love and loss, new shades of heartbreak and illness threaten to stir up the past when the trio sees their bond put to the test as they face their most challenging times yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b6gnKDl7iMbW0LqrruhrzVArgVB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1002626'),
  ('81922104864569427', 'The Surami Fortress', 1922, 'Drama, History', 'Ivane Perestiani, Boris Zavelev', 'Ivane Perestiani', 'Hamo Bek-Nazaryan, Mikheil Chiaureli, Tamar Sakvarelidze, Tatyana Maksimova, L. Galustian, Nino Dolidze (I), Olga Maysurian, N. Odankevich', null, 'The legend of the Suram Fortress.', 'The legend of the Suram Fortress.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z1wq8UyvFUSWqP0BnzS2uOOs2Pt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:184260'),
  ('437316147041702902', 'The Sure Thing', 1985, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Robert Elswit, Rob Reiner', 'Steve Bloom, Jonathan Roberts', 'John Cusack, Daphne Zuniga, Anthony Edwards, Boyd Gaines, Tim Robbins, Lisa Jane Persky, Viveca Lindfors, Nicollette Sheridan', 'PG-13', 'Gib, a beer-guzzling slob, and Alison, an uptight Ivy-Leaguer, are an unlikely duo stuck together on a cross-country trip during Christmas break. At first they get on each other''s nerves but, as time passes, they find their divergent natures complement each other. Now they need to realize what they''ve already found before it''s too late.', 'Gib, a beer-guzzling slob, and Alison, an uptight Ivy-Leaguer, are an unlikely duo stuck together on a cross-country trip during Christmas break. At first they get on each other''s nerves but, as time passes, they find their divergent natures complement each other. Now they need to realize what they''ve already found before it''s too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a9cuohQn5kczi4htWZAZjEZvXkZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8992'),
  ('317631295462449870', 'The Surfer', 2025, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Lorcan Finnegan, Radek Ładczuk', 'Thomas Martin', 'Nicolas Cage, Julian McMahon, Justin Rosniak, Alexander Bertrand, Rahel Romahn, Nicholas Cassim, Finn Little, Charlotte Maggi', 'R', 'A man returns to the idyllic beach of his childhood to surf with his son. When he is humiliated by a group of locals, the man is drawn into a conflict that keeps rising and pushes him to his breaking point.', 'A man returns to the idyllic beach of his childhood to surf with his son. When he is humiliated by a group of locals, the man is drawn into a conflict that keeps rising and pushes him to his breaking point.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gm9Ou0dkxhb1vcrkB6uRhoifcHC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1128655'),
  ('385714396918429911', 'The Surgeon', 1995, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Carl Schenkel, Thomas Burstyn', 'Patrick Cirillo', 'Isabel Glasser, James Remar, Sean Haberle, Peter Boyle, Malcolm McDowell, Charles Dance, Beverly Todd, Charles Bailey-Gates', 'R', 'Dr. Julian Mater is suspended and gets his license revoked for performing experiments on dying patients in cellular regeneration. A couple of years later, he returns to the hospital that condemned his work to begin practicing his grizzly experiments once more.', 'Dr. Julian Mater is suspended and gets his license revoked for performing experiments on dying patients in cellular regeneration. A couple of years later, he returns to the hospital that condemned his work to begin practicing his grizzly experiments once more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dDrfpAZJPyKGBz4wFIFDHsZCP4m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133339'),
  ('222258491871814721', 'The Surgeon of the Rusty Knife', 2022, 'Drama', 'Uli Burtin, Gustavo Fernández, Yuri Scocuglia', 'Jaqueline Vargas', 'Danton Mello, Juliana Paes, Marcos Caruso, Cássio Gabus Mendes, Alexandre Borges, Marco Ricca, James Faulkner, Carlos Meceni', null, 'José Pedro de Freitas, better known as Zé Arigó, was a simple man who lived with his wife Arlete in Congonhas, Minas Gerais. During the 1950s, a time when Spiritism was not as well known and respected in the country, Arigó became a symbol of hope through his surgeries and spiritual cures. Based on a true story, Arigó, with the help of the spirit of Dr. Fritz, performed numerous spiritual surgeries on people from Brazil and the world.', 'José Pedro de Freitas, better known as Zé Arigó, was a simple man who lived with his wife Arlete in Congonhas, Minas Gerais. During the 1950s, a time when Spiritism was not as well known and respected in the country, Arigó became a symbol of hope through his surgeries and spiritual cures. Based on a true story, Arigó, with the help of the spirit of Dr. Fritz, performed numerous spiritual surgeries on people from Brazil and the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/udQKSwULzhqCpytrg084pJXw996.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:649985'),
  ('316157441181548619', 'The Surgeons Use Their Hands', 1980, 'Comedy', 'Hugo Sofovich, Horacio Maira, Felipe López', 'Hugo Sofovich', 'Alberto Olmedo, Susana Giménez, Moria Casán, Jorge Porcel, Luisa Albinoni, Mario Lozano, Coco Legrand, César Bertrand', null, 'Two orderlies pretend to be surgeons to impress two young doctors and conquer, through several scenarios. Finally, they are discovered when they had to operate on a mafia boss to remove a bullet.', 'Two orderlies pretend to be surgeons to impress two young doctors and conquer, through several scenarios. Finally, they are discovered when they had to operate on a mafia boss to remove a bullet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tFUOUn3XGoMurj4cMhr7jgpm494.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159446'),
  ('779738862720295750', 'The Surprise', 2015, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Mike van Diem, Rogier Stoffers', 'Mike van Diem, Karen van Holst Pellekaan, Belcampo', 'Georgina Verbaan, Jeroen van Koningsbrugge, Jan Decleir, Henry Goodman, Pierre Bokma, Ankur Bahl, Naveed Choudhry, Oliver Gatz', null, 'An eccentric multimillionaire signs an agreement to have his life ended. While selecting his coffin he meets a young woman who has signed up for the same arrangement. Trouble ensues when the couple falls in love and wishes to get out of the contract.', 'An eccentric multimillionaire signs an agreement to have his life ended. While selecting his coffin he meets a young woman who has signed up for the same arrangement. Trouble ensues when the couple falls in love and wishes to get out of the contract.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jkmEqQDevQwdI7NRfC7d5mnUkJ8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:277153'),
  ('1104209984911805138', 'The Surprise Visit', 2022, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Nick Lyon, Nate Haban', 'Stephen Meier, Andrew Fein', 'Rob Riordan, Jacqi Vene, Didem Erol, Eric Roberts, Tricia Hawn, Johnny Santiago, Regan Ferrier', null, 'When a young couple makes a surprise visit to Mom, they get an even bigger surprise themselves from an old family friend who plans to steal Mom’s valuable jewelry while she is out of town. But when the “easy peasy” robbery goes wrong, resulting in the accidental death of the daughter’s husband, it forces the two young drug addicts to make a difficult decision: to abandon ship, or do the unthinkable.', 'When a young couple makes a surprise visit to Mom, they get an even bigger surprise themselves from an old family friend who plans to steal Mom’s valuable jewelry while she is out of town. But when the “easy peasy” robbery goes wrong, resulting in the accidental death of the daughter’s husband, it forces the two young drug addicts to make a difficult decision: to abandon ship, or do the unthinkable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a3J0t376OE1Vk3jKN67viY31s5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:917300'),
  ('617470908209784290', 'The Surrogate', 1984, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime, Horror', 'Don Carmody, François Protat', 'Don Carmody, Robert Geoffrion', 'Art Hindle, Carole Laure, Shannon Tweed, Jim Bailey, Michael Ironside, Marilyn Lightstone, Jackie Burroughs, Barbara Law', 'R', 'Stuck in a sexless marriage, a frustrated well-to-do couple agrees to see a female sex therapist. Unfortunately, she only helps escalate the tensions between them. Meanwhile, the police are baffled by a string of brutal nightly killings.', 'Stuck in a sexless marriage, a frustrated well-to-do couple agrees to see a female sex therapist. Unfortunately, she only helps escalate the tensions between them. Meanwhile, the police are baffled by a string of brutal nightly killings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/88SkTfSYVrAYvhsoAHW4ZANabIZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163545'),
  ('850596463167654244', 'The Surrogate Womb', 1987, 'History, Drama', 'Im Kwon-taek, Koo Joong-mo', 'Song Gil-han', 'Kang Soo-youn, Kim Hyung-ja, Bang Hee, Yoon Yang-ha, Han Eun-jin, Lee Gu-sun, Kim Jeong-ha', null, 'A barren noblewoman encourages her husband to take a young peasant as a surrogate to secure the male line.', 'A barren noblewoman encourages her husband to take a young peasant as a surrogate to secure the male line.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/keRuRDDV3rPSOLjSFUpc9VVx17n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:204051'),
  ('1149524174790817039', 'The Survivalist', 2015, 'Drama, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Stephen Fingleton, Damien Elliott', 'Stephen Fingleton', 'Martin McCann, Mia Goth, Olwen Fouéré, Douglas Russell, Andrew Simpson, Ryan McParland, Hussina Raja, Ciaran Flynn', null, 'In a time of starvation, a survivalist lives off a small plot of land hidden deep in forest. When two women seeking food and shelter discover his farm, he finds his existence threatened.', 'In a time of starvation, a survivalist lives off a small plot of land hidden deep in forest. When two women seeking food and shelter discover his farm, he finds his existence threatened.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hd491WgKPxeQus2LnvFbYmyUFmt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:329004'),
  ('910700108111002266', 'The Survivalist', 2021, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Austin Schmidt, Jon Keeyes', 'Matthew Rogers', 'Jonathan Rhys Meyers, John Malkovich, Ruby Modine, Jenna Leigh Green, Julian Sands, Lori Petty, Thaddeus Street, Jonny Orsini', 'R', 'A year and a half after the fall of civilization from a virus outbreak, a former FBI agent is forced to protect a young woman, who is immune to the disease, from a dangerous gang hunting her led by a psychopath who believes he’s going to use her to save the world.', 'A year and a half after the fall of civilization from a virus outbreak, a former FBI agent is forced to protect a young woman, who is immune to the disease, from a dangerous gang hunting her led by a psychopath who believes he’s going to use her to save the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x7XhPGGtT8eIJnBuWoiB2TxjE9D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:779057'),
  ('1090046966672592495', 'The Survivor', 1981, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'David Hemmings, John Seale, Virginia Bieneman', 'David Ambrose', 'Robert Powell, Jenny Agutter, Joseph Cotten, Angela Punch McGregor, Peter Sumner, Lorna Lesley, Ralph Cotterill, Adrian Wright', null, 'When a 747 crashes shortly after take-off, the sole survivor is the pilot. Virtually unhurt, he and the investigators look for the answers to the disaster. Meanwhile mysterious deaths occur in the community and only a psychic, in touch with the supernatural, can help the pilot unravel the mystery surrounding the doomed plane.', 'When a 747 crashes shortly after take-off, the sole survivor is the pilot. Virtually unhurt, he and the investigators look for the answers to the disaster. Meanwhile mysterious deaths occur in the community and only a psychic, in touch with the supernatural, can help the pilot unravel the mystery surrounding the doomed plane.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/htgPAKGUIGCYjU6OyBKecXxhmWV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84628'),
  ('1117986539347149587', 'The Survivor', 2022, 'History, Action, Drama', 'George Steel, Barry Levinson', 'Justine Juel Gillmer', 'Ben Foster, Billy Magnussen, Vicky Krieps, Peter Sarsgaard, Saro Emirze, Danny DeVito, John Leguizamo, Dar Zuzovsky', 'R', 'Harry Haft is a boxer who fought fellow prisoners in the concentration camps to survive. Haunted by the memories and his guilt, he attempts to use high-profile fights against boxing legends like Rocky Marciano as a way to find his first love again.', 'Harry Haft is a boxer who fought fellow prisoners in the concentration camps to survive. Haunted by the memories and his guilt, he attempts to use high-profile fights against boxing legends like Rocky Marciano as a way to find his first love again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oZWJ20tGWZ5xO9CrTCVavmDRy7J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:606870'),
  ('715112359332002007', 'The Survivors', 1983, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Michael Ritchie, Billy Williams', 'Michael J. Leeson', 'Robin Williams, Walter Matthau, Jerry Reed, James Wainwright, Kristen Vigard, Joseph Carberry, John Goodman, Anne Pitoniak', 'R', 'Having both lost their jobs, two strangers become unlikely friends after a run in with a would be robber, who is actually a hitman with a grudge against the two.', 'Having both lost their jobs, two strangers become unlikely friends after a run in with a would be robber, who is actually a hitman with a grudge against the two.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eb7DrR2h2GjUCZRozH46CqU1A9d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28466'),
  ('358304290590304868', 'The Suspect', 1945, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'William Tummel, Frank Skinner, Robert Siodmak', 'Bertram Millhauser', 'Charles Laughton, Ella Raines, Dean Harens, Stanley Ridges, Henry Daniell, Rosalind Ivan, Molly Lamont, Raymond Severn', null, 'Genial shopkeeper Philip has to endure the constant nagging of a shrewish wife while he secretly yearns for a pretty young stenographer. When the henpecking gets to be too much, Philip murders his wife and manages to make her death look like an accident. A ruthless blackmailer and a low-key detective both discover Philip''s secret, and he has to decide which of them poses the more dangerous threat.', 'Genial shopkeeper Philip has to endure the constant nagging of a shrewish wife while he secretly yearns for a pretty young stenographer. When the henpecking gets to be too much, Philip murders his wife and manages to make her death look like an accident. A ruthless blackmailer and a low-key detective both discover Philip''s secret, and he has to decide which of them poses the more dangerous threat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kHInEMFDY5PG7tigy872pKzg1bm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25413'),
  ('512172352168253486', 'The Suspect', 1975, 'Crime', 'Francesco Maselli, Lorenzo Magnolia, Roberto Perpignani', 'Francesco Maselli, Franco Solinas', 'Gian Maria Volonté, Annie Girardot, Renato Salvatori, Gabriele Lavia, Bruno Corazzari, Guido De Carli, Felice Andreasi, Antonio Casale', null, 'Fascism has forced the leadership of the Italian Communist Party to settle in Paris. In Italy arrests of militants are decimating the organization, so Emilio is sent on a mission in the area of Turin, to put out of harm whistleblowers.', 'Fascism has forced the leadership of the Italian Communist Party to settle in Paris. In Italy arrests of militants are decimating the organization, so Emilio is sent on a mission in the area of Turin, to put out of harm whistleblowers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6m3q6E3pGAYJ4UDGwMNtgfXqkGm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105693'),
