  ('976099536264223502', 'The Suspect', 1998, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Ringo Lam Ling-Tung, Ross W. Clarkson, Dante Kabigting', 'Ringo Lam Ling-Tung, Sammy Lau', 'Louis Koo, Julian Cheung Chi-Lam, Ada Choi Siu-Fan, Ray Lui, Simon Yam, Eric Moo Kai-Yin, Raven Choi Yip-San, Johnny Cheung Wa', null, 'Don Lee, a reformed ex-assassin, refuses to assassinate a politician for his former boss. His best friend Max commits the hit and frames Don, forcing him on the run from both police and criminals to clear his name.', 'Don Lee, a reformed ex-assassin, refuses to assassinate a politician for his former boss. His best friend Max commits the hit and frames Don, forcing him on the run from both police and criminals to clear his name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f1Rnwr2WQP9vN0c5AVIIvglPFuG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119342'),
  ('981760249720523680', 'The Suspect', 2000, 'Animation', 'José Miguel Ribeiro, Carlos B. Cunha', 'Levina Valentim, Gonçalo Galvão Teles, Virgílio Almeida', 'Paulo Raposo, Dora Bernardo, Teresa Côrte-Real, Vitor Soares, João Catarino, Mafalda Vilhena', null, 'A train compartment, four people, a ticket collector, a Barcelos penknife and a potential assassin. Will they all make it to the end of the journey?', 'A train compartment, four people, a ticket collector, a Barcelos penknife and a potential assassin. Will they all make it to the end of the journey?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nRJL5Kt02f82sDrjY7fTD1yf0ob.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92535'),
  ('534155478218783084', 'The Suspect', 2013, 'Action, Thriller', 'Oh Se-yeong, Won Shin-yun, Lee Byeong-hoon', 'Lim Sang-Yun', 'Gong Yoo, Park Hee-soon, Cho Seong-ha, Yoo Da-in, Kim Sung-kyun, Nam Bo-ra, Jo Jae-yun, Kim Eui-sung', 'NR', 'Betrayed and on the run, a former North Korean agent tries to seek revenge on the man who killed his wife, find his missing daughter, and uncover the secrets hidden inside the eyeglasses of a dead man.', 'Betrayed and on the run, a former North Korean agent tries to seek revenge on the man who killed his wife, find his missing daughter, and uncover the secrets hidden inside the eyeglasses of a dead man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a2lMK5eoKN4ndHQpgDrS99EqzJY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:242454'),
  ('816327052132495630', 'The Suspects', 1974, 'Crime', 'Michel Wyn', 'Paul Andréota, Michel Sales, Michel Wyn', 'Mimsy Farmer, Paul Meurisse, Michel Bouquet, Bruno Cremer, Michael Lonsdale, Jacques Fabbri, Renaud Verley, Marie-Hélène Breillat', null, 'When an American tourist is murdered in the south of France, the police must investigate. In this movie, the police inspector re-creates the girl''s journeys through France until the murder is solved. Suspicions are narrowed down to four possible perpetrators early on, and flashbacks illuminate the roles each one played in the girl''s vacation.', 'When an American tourist is murdered in the south of France, the police must investigate. In this movie, the police inspector re-creates the girl''s journeys through France until the murder is solved. Suspicions are narrowed down to four possible perpetrators early on, and flashbacks illuminate the roles each one played in the girl''s vacation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x0kQexe7Gek5BmurBcJbropcY86.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12515'),
  ('306725035934869293', 'The Suspended Step of the Stork', 1991, 'Drama', 'Theo Angelopoulos, Giorgos Arvanitis, Andreas Sinanos', 'Theo Angelopoulos, Tonino Guerra, Thanasis Valtinos', 'Gregory Patrick Karr, Marcello Mastroianni, Jeanne Moreau, Dora Hrysikou, Ilias Logothetis, Dimitris Poulikakos, Gerasimos Skiadaresis, Mihalis Giannatos', null, 'A reporter notices an old man in a border town who may be an important Greek politician who disappeared mysteriously years ago.', 'A reporter notices an old man in a border town who may be an important Greek politician who disappeared mysteriously years ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9aEfulzmMHwtRmb3IpBm8MXcIo3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47432'),
  ('349437022833731449', 'The Suspicious Death of a Minor', 1975, 'Crime, Thriller, Comedy', 'Sergio Martino, Giancarlo Ferrando, Tiziana De Nora', 'Ernesto Gastaldi, Sergio Martino', 'Claudio Cassinelli, Patrizia Castaldi, Mel Ferrer, Massimo Girotti, Lia Tanzi, Gianfranco Barra, Adolfo Caruso, Jenny Tamburi', null, 'Police detective Paolo Germi and the mysterious Marisa meet each other at a dance hall. Germi is unsuspecting of the secret Marisa is carrying with her: adverse conditions forced her into prostitution. As Germi finds the young girl brutally murdered, he decides to go after her killers. During his investigation, he enters a world of intrigue and obfuscation that leave an endless trail of blood.', 'Police detective Paolo Germi and the mysterious Marisa meet each other at a dance hall. Germi is unsuspecting of the secret Marisa is carrying with her: adverse conditions forced her into prostitution. As Germi finds the young girl brutally murdered, he decides to go after her killers. During his investigation, he enters a world of intrigue and obfuscation that leave an endless trail of blood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xqEbdB77oZ9k53WVhj3gaKuY2Uj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80067'),
  ('1090415572221694534', 'The Swallows of Kabul', 2019, 'Animation, Drama', 'Zabou Breitman, Eléa Gobbé-Mévellec', 'Sébastien Tavel, Zabou Breitman, Patricia Mortagne', 'Simon Abkarian, Zita Hanrot, Swann Arlaud, Hiam Abbass, Jean-Claude Deret, Sébastien Pouderoux, Serge Bagdassarian, Michel Jonasz', null, 'Summer 1998—Kabul under Taliban rule. Zunaira and Mohsen are young and in love. Despite the daily violence and misery, they hope for a better future. One day, a foolish gesture causes life to take an irrevocable turn.', 'Summer 1998—Kabul under Taliban rule. Zunaira and Mohsen are young and in love. Despite the daily violence and misery, they hope for a better future. One day, a foolish gesture causes life to take an irrevocable turn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/djd3QU6ThcDSOEGMuUl1h1Am8sN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:582881'),
  ('176372966636541029', 'The Swamp', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Stefan Wiesen, Morgan Pehme, Daniel DiMauro', 'Morgan Pehme, Daniel DiMauro, Marc Vives', 'Matt Gaetz, Thomas Massie, Ken Buck, Katie Hill, Ro Khanna, John Sarbanes, Lawrence Lessig', null, 'A look behind the curtain of Washington politics following three "renegade" Republican Congressmen as they bring libertarian and conservative zeal to champion the President’s call to “drain the swamp.”', 'A look behind the curtain of Washington politics following three "renegade" Republican Congressmen as they bring libertarian and conservative zeal to champion the President’s call to “drain the swamp.”', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h70gDIHVJ1uKoUVjyaaCeX0txPW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:725239'),
  ('1130080583600666832', 'The Swamp of the Ravens', 1974, 'Horror', 'Manuel Caño, Manuel Merino, Mahnahén Velasco', 'Santiago Moncada', 'Ramiro Oliveros, Marcelle Bichette, Fernando Sancho, Antonia Mas, César Carmigniani, Gaspar Bacigallipi, Bill Harrison, Marcos Molina', null, 'Dr. Frosta dumps body parts and corpses in the marsh, where they rise up again for vengeance.', 'Dr. Frosta dumps body parts and corpses in the marsh, where they rise up again for vengeance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pVDax6aHrFcJ0JvKFJT1YI4LrdW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95946'),
  ('835928227277297955', 'The Swan', 1956, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Robert Surtees, Joseph Ruttenberg, Charles Vidor', 'John Dighton', 'Grace Kelly, Alec Guinness, Louis Jourdan, Agnes Moorehead, Jessie Royce Landis, Brian Aherne, Leo G. Carroll, Estelle Winwood', null, 'Princess Beatrice''s days of enjoying the regal life are numbered unless her only daughter, Princess Alexandra, makes a good impression on a distant cousin when he pays a surprise visit to their palace. Prince Albert has searched all over Europe for a bride and he''s bored by the whole courtship routine. He is more interested in the estate''s dairy than Alexandra''s rose garden. And then he starts playing football with the tutor and Alexandra''s brothers. Invite the tutor to the ball that night and watch how gracefully Alexandra dances with him.', 'Princess Beatrice''s days of enjoying the regal life are numbered unless her only daughter, Princess Alexandra, makes a good impression on a distant cousin when he pays a surprise visit to their palace. Prince Albert has searched all over Europe for a bride and he''s bored by the whole courtship routine. He is more interested in the estate''s dairy than Alexandra''s rose garden. And then he starts playing football with the tutor and Alexandra''s brothers. Invite the tutor to the ball that night and watch how gracefully Alexandra dances with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cCk7UhSLafu1hdBVMPy7nzHSSH2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61048'),
  ('336618702299173312', 'The Swan', 2023, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Wes Anderson, Martin Scali, Kevin Timon Hill', 'Wes Anderson', 'Rupert Friend, Ralph Fiennes, Asa Jennings, Eliel Ford, Truman Hanks, Benoît Herlin, Octavio Tapia', 'PG', 'Two large, ignorant bullies ruthlessly pursue a small, brilliant boy in this young adult Roald Dahl short story.', 'Two large, ignorant bullies ruthlessly pursue a small, brilliant boy in this young adult Roald Dahl short story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fRbx6DPdQBJrhZWyshjJABtAIyu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1172675'),
  ('415847618627223046', 'The Swan Princess', 1994, 'Family, Animation, Fantasy, Adventure, Comedy', 'Richard Rich, Steven E. Gordon, Gregory Daven', 'Brian Nissen', 'Jack Palance, Howard McGillin, Michelle Nicastro, Liz Callaway, John Cleese, Steven Wright, Steve Vinovich, Mark Harelik', 'G', 'The beautiful princess Odette is transformed into a swan by an evil sorcerer''s spell. Held captive at an enchanted lake, she befriends Jean-Bob the frog, Speed the turtle and Puffin the bird. Despite their struggle to keep the princess safe, these good-natured creatures can do nothing about the sorcerer''s spell, which can only be broken by a vow of everlasting love.', 'The beautiful princess Odette is transformed into a swan by an evil sorcerer''s spell. Held captive at an enchanted lake, she befriends Jean-Bob the frog, Speed the turtle and Puffin the bird. Despite their struggle to keep the princess safe, these good-natured creatures can do nothing about the sorcerer''s spell, which can only be broken by a vow of everlasting love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f5YvIPrkJ9HCsNbgzWJJyxXVNhj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22586'),
  ('667881766292448672', 'The Swan Princess Christmas', 2012, 'Family, Animation, Fantasy', 'Richard Rich', 'Brian Nissen', 'Yuri Lowenthal, Brian Nissen, Catherine Parks, David Lodge, Joseph Medrano, James Arrington, G.K. Bowes, Jennifer Miller', 'PG', 'Princess Odette, Prince Derek and their trusted woodland friends reunite in this all-new adventure for their first Christmas celebration together! As the kingdom prepares for a festive holiday, the villainous Rothbart plots to destroy Christmas. Will the castle friends be able to stop Rothbart and save the day? Told in beautiful CG animation for the very first time and featuring music by Anna Graceman from TV’s America’s Got Talent, The Swan Princess Christmas is an enchanting musical holiday treat the whole family will enjoy!', 'Princess Odette, Prince Derek and their trusted woodland friends reunite in this all-new adventure for their first Christmas celebration together! As the kingdom prepares for a festive holiday, the villainous Rothbart plots to destroy Christmas. Will the castle friends be able to stop Rothbart and save the day? Told in beautiful CG animation for the very first time and featuring music by Anna Graceman from TV’s America’s Got Talent, The Swan Princess Christmas is an enchanting musical holiday treat the whole family will enjoy!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jQLCs1HiQ1Y4SZvr3sx1fDhWNZS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141102'),
  ('226874490139066449', 'The Swan Princess: A Fairytale Is Born', 2023, 'Family, Animation, Fantasy', 'Richard Rich', 'Brian Nissen', 'Nina Herzog, Yuri Lowenthal, Jennifer Miller, Bleau Essen, Grant Durazzo', 'PG', 'Before becoming queen, Uberta lived a humble life with her husband Maximillian when she is suddenly thrust into royalty. Through triumph and tragedy, she learns the lessons needed to become a beloved Queen, all while raising the next generation of rulers. When it''s time for Uberta to pass the royal scepter to Odette and Derek, rival Queen Wixom has plans of her own to ruin the kingdom''s greatest coronation.', 'Before becoming queen, Uberta lived a humble life with her husband Maximillian when she is suddenly thrust into royalty. Through triumph and tragedy, she learns the lessons needed to become a beloved Queen, all while raising the next generation of rulers. When it''s time for Uberta to pass the royal scepter to Odette and Derek, rival Queen Wixom has plans of her own to ruin the kingdom''s greatest coronation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2axXVpi3dKfESWzgncbakLB7o7f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1118203'),
  ('1076147907503868610', 'The Swan Princess: A Royal Myztery', 2018, 'Family, Animation, Adventure, Comedy', 'Richard Rich', 'Brian Nissen', 'Nina Herzog, Yuri Lowenthal, Joseph Medrano, Grant Durazzo, Kellen Goff, Jayden Isabel, David Lodge, Jennifer Miller', 'PG', 'Your favorite characters are back in an all-new royal adventure! It seems that a mysterious “Z” is appearing as a mark on the palace residents. Who is behind the mark and what does it mean? Princess Odette, Derek, Scully and all the Swan Princess friends work as a team to uncover the secret.', 'Your favorite characters are back in an all-new royal adventure! It seems that a mysterious “Z” is appearing as a mark on the palace residents. Who is behind the mark and what does it mean? Princess Odette, Derek, Scully and all the Swan Princess friends work as a team to uncover the secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ljktBZh0wM8yVZcgMt3i43sjkdy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:510096'),
  ('1137947793219101256', 'The Swan Princess: A Royal Wedding', 2020, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'Richard Rich', 'Brian Nissen', 'Nina Herzog, Yuri Lowenthal, Vivian Lu, Joseph Medrano, Christine Lakin, Gardner Jaas, Doug Stone, Alexandre Chen', 'G', 'Princess Odette and Prince Derek are going to a wedding at Princess Mei Li and her beloved Chen. But evil forces are at stake and the wedding plans are tarnished and true love has difficult conditions.', 'Princess Odette and Prince Derek are going to a wedding at Princess Mei Li and her beloved Chen. But evil forces are at stake and the wedding plans are tarnished and true love has difficult conditions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mJaNBADFKRiMys8DiGemrLGYd9U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:718100'),
  ('920643062141731899', 'The Swan Princess: Escape from Castle Mountain', 1997, 'Family, Fantasy, Animation, Romance', 'Richard Rich', 'Brian Nissen', 'Michelle Nicastro, Douglas Sills, Steve Vinovich, Joseph Medrano, James Arrington, Rosie Mann, Jake Williamson', 'G', 'The first wedding anniversary of Princess Odette and Prince Derek is fraught with troubles brought on by Clavius, who plots to conquer the world.', 'The first wedding anniversary of Princess Odette and Prince Derek is fraught with troubles brought on by Clavius, who plots to conquer the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/baMeQSxukVdPVQUSGhtKe6fA4aR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54113'),
  ('438015552291422889', 'The Swan Princess: The Mystery of the Enchanted Kingdom', 1998, 'Family, Fantasy, Animation, Mystery', 'Richard Rich', 'Brian Nissen, Richard Rich', 'Michelle Nicastro, Brian Nissen, Joseph Medrano, Steve Vinovich, Christy Landers, Katja Zoch, Donald Sage Mackay, Doug Stone', 'G', 'The royal couple Odette and Derek face yet another evil magician, this time a woman named Zelda. Lusting for the treasure of the Forbidden Arts, which will give her absolute power, Zelda kidnaps Odette as ransom. Derek and several animal friends head off to rescue Odette', 'The royal couple Odette and Derek face yet another evil magician, this time a woman named Zelda. Lusting for the treasure of the Forbidden Arts, which will give her absolute power, Zelda kidnaps Odette as ransom. Derek and several animal friends head off to rescue Odette', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wgz5mA3FCjWZUAxNuUI0UR69CqG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28302'),
  ('685671937042455398', 'The Swap', 1979, 'Drama, Crime', 'Jordan Leondopoulos, Álex Phillips Jr.', 'John C. Broderick', 'Robert De Niro, Jennifer Warren, Jarred Mickey, Terrayne Crawford, Martin J. Kelley, Phyllis Black, Viva, Anthony Charnota', null, 'Vito gets out of jail after serving ten years and tries to find out who killed his younger brother.', 'Vito gets out of jail after serving ten years and tries to find out who killed his younger brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gSRkM0Jz6nbpyrW3Imotu4Xx7Mv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110843'),
  ('182727416687374400', 'The Swap', 2016, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Jay Karas, Ron Oliver, David A. Makin', 'Charlie Shahnaian, Shari Simpson', 'Peyton List, Jacob Bertrand, Darrin Rose, Claire Rankin, Callan Potter, Jesse Bostick, Eliana Jones, Kiana Madeira', null, 'Based on the book by Megan Shull, The Swap follows the adventures of a rhythmic gymnast named Ellie with a make-it-or-break-it competition, and the younger brother named Jack in a hockey family who''s vying for a varsity spot on his school team. But when a simple text causes the two to swap bodies, their paths take an unexpected cross.', 'Based on the book by Megan Shull, The Swap follows the adventures of a rhythmic gymnast named Ellie with a make-it-or-break-it competition, and the younger brother named Jack in a hockey family who''s vying for a varsity spot on his school team. But when a simple text causes the two to swap bodies, their paths take an unexpected cross.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4GvjFcWaSnVrbHjFof1Sy8tZK1r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:417028'),
  ('375442353914483815', 'The Swarm', 1978, 'Science Fiction, Horror, Thriller', 'Irwin Allen, Fred J. Koenekamp', 'Stirling Silliphant', 'Michael Caine, Katharine Ross, Richard Widmark, Richard Chamberlain, Olivia de Havilland, Ben Johnson, Lee Grant, José Ferrer', 'PG', 'Scientist Dr. Bradford Crane and army general Thalius Slater join forces to fight an almost invisible enemy threatening America; killer bees that have deadly venom and attack without reason. Disaster movie-master Irwin Allen''s film contains spectacular special effects, including a train crash caused by the eponymous swarm.', 'Scientist Dr. Bradford Crane and army general Thalius Slater join forces to fight an almost invisible enemy threatening America; killer bees that have deadly venom and attack without reason. Disaster movie-master Irwin Allen''s film contains spectacular special effects, including a train crash caused by the eponymous swarm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pO5qEEpjxdQ40ScLcFOowyziNiT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46878'),
  ('617509104965616677', 'The Swarm', 2021, 'Horror, Drama', 'Just Philippot, Romain Carcanade', 'Franck Victor, Jérôme Genevray', 'Suliane Brahim, Sofian Khammes, Marie Narbonne, Raphael Romand, Nathalie Boyer, Victor Bonnel, Christian Bouillette, Raphaël Liot', null, 'A single mother breeds locusts as high-protein foods but has trouble getting them to reproduce until she finds they have a taste for blood.', 'A single mother breeds locusts as high-protein foods but has trouble getting them to reproduce until she finds they have a taste for blood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A734mQnqdLfraDMJ2Ad1lyE8wwP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:661930'),
  ('72541338132568227', 'The Swaying Waterlily', 2016, 'Drama', 'Seren Yüce, Barış Özbiçer', 'Seren Yüce', 'Songül Öden, Tolga Tekin, Tülay Günal, Eraslan Sağlam, Duru Lal Pekel, Ayşe Tunaboylu, Taha Yusuf Tan, Esme Madra', null, 'Handan and Korhan a middle-aged couple who live their lives in one of istanbul''s best neighborhoods. Handan constantly invents things for herself in order to fill her life. Handan, imitates her friend Sermin and starts writing! But this desire, which is innocent in the first place, will become jealous over time and diverge in different ways.', 'Handan and Korhan a middle-aged couple who live their lives in one of istanbul''s best neighborhoods. Handan constantly invents things for herself in order to fill her life. Handan, imitates her friend Sermin and starts writing! But this desire, which is innocent in the first place, will become jealous over time and diverge in different ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eTWkwrrYQ0BUVKp2M49iyYGXYuW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:422040'),
  ('114495047921493039', 'The Sweatbox', 2002, 'Documentary', 'John-Paul Davidson, Trudie Styler', 'Trudie Styler', 'John Goodman, Tom Jones, Eartha Kitt, Marc Shaiman, David Spade, Sting, Owen Wilson, Patrick Warburton', 'PG-13', 'Trudie Styler, a documentarian, had been allowed to film the production of ''Kingdom of the Sun''/''The Emperor''s New Groove'' as part of the deal that originally brought her husband Sting to the project. As a result, Styler recorded much of the struggle, controversy, and troubles that went into making the picture on film (including when producer Fullmer called Sting to inform the pop star that his songs were being deleted from the film). Styler''s completed documentary, The Sweatbox, premiered at the Toronto Film Festival on September 13, 2002. Disney owns the rights to the documentary and has not released it on home video or DVD.', 'Trudie Styler, a documentarian, had been allowed to film the production of ''Kingdom of the Sun''/''The Emperor''s New Groove'' as part of the deal that originally brought her husband Sting to the project. As a result, Styler recorded much of the struggle, controversy, and troubles that went into making the picture on film (including when producer Fullmer called Sting to inform the pop star that his songs were being deleted from the film). Styler''s completed documentary, The Sweatbox, premiered at the Toronto Film Festival on September 13, 2002. Disney owns the rights to the documentary and has not released it on home video or DVD.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oAHBWF4RitZTSIUmDIfIdaSjvQb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97400'),
  ('757104954082125954', 'The Sweater', 1980, 'Family, Animation', 'Sheldon Cohen', 'Sheila Fischman', 'Roch Carrier, Jean-Guy Moreau', null, 'Roch Carrier recounts the most mortifying moment of his childhood. At a time when all his friends worshipped Maurice "Rocket" Richard and wore his number 9 Canadiens hockey jersey, the boy was mistakenly sent a Toronto Maple Leafs jersey from Eaton''s. Unable to convince his mother to send it back, he must face his friends wearing the colours of the opposing team. This animated short, based on the book The Hockey Sweater, is an NFB classic that appeals to hockey lovers of all ages.', 'Roch Carrier recounts the most mortifying moment of his childhood. At a time when all his friends worshipped Maurice "Rocket" Richard and wore his number 9 Canadiens hockey jersey, the boy was mistakenly sent a Toronto Maple Leafs jersey from Eaton''s. Unable to convince his mother to send it back, he must face his friends wearing the colours of the opposing team. This animated short, based on the book The Hockey Sweater, is an NFB classic that appeals to hockey lovers of all ages.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1hPRh4OlDABESIFtrZ2ql0Vd2HI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147391'),
  ('525730212915301152', 'The Swedish Connection', 2026, 'Drama, History, War', 'Marcus Olsson, Thérèse Ahlbeck, Suse Marquardt', 'Marcus Olsson, Thérèse Ahlbeck', 'Henrik Dorsin, Sissela Benn, Jonas Karlsson, Johan Glans, Olle Jansson, Oscar Töringe, Loa Falkman, Marianne Mörck', 'PG-13', 'Swedish Foreign Ministry bureaucrat Gösta Engzell, overlooked during WWII, rescued thousands while turning supposedly neutral Sweden into a moral force. His efforts challenged the status quo and left a lasting humanitarian legacy.', 'Swedish Foreign Ministry bureaucrat Gösta Engzell, overlooked during WWII, rescued thousands while turning supposedly neutral Sweden into a moral force. His efforts challenged the status quo and left a lasting humanitarian legacy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ytruJRp7Ba82IU6s8yAY0HPw5xr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1261188'),
  ('502722319111595089', 'The Sweeney', 2012, 'Action, Crime', 'Nick Love, Jamie Macdermott, Joe Withers', 'John Hodge, Nick Love', 'Ray Winstone, Plan B, Hayley Atwell, Damian Lewis, Alan Ford, Steven Mackintosh, Paul Anderson, Caroline Chikezie', 'R', 'Jack Regan, a hardened cop who doesn’t play by the rules, is confronted with a criminal from his past. With sidekick George Carter they are put on the case of a jewellery store heist that ends in a killing. But is that killing really an execution in disguise? With pressure from his boss and the fact that Regan is having an affair with that boss’s wife, it’s not going to be easy for him to stay out of trouble.', 'Jack Regan, a hardened cop who doesn’t play by the rules, is confronted with a criminal from his past. With sidekick George Carter they are put on the case of a jewellery store heist that ends in a killing. But is that killing really an execution in disguise? With pressure from his boss and the fact that Regan is having an affair with that boss’s wife, it’s not going to be easy for him to stay out of trouble.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nwGo7AoYXG4C03wbyfdeYvcVbnV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116613'),
  ('308432975383471225', 'The Sweeper', 1996, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Joseph Merhi, Ken Blakey, Alexander H. Gayner', 'Heather Ferreira, William Applegate Jr.', 'C. Thomas Howell, Jeff Fahey, Ed Lauter, Kristen Dalton, Janet Gunn, Michael Edwards, Cynda Williams, Kathrin Middleton', null, 'A young cop, haunted by the murder of his entire family years earlier, is recruited by a shadowy organization to hunt down criminals who are beyond the reach of the law.', 'A young cop, haunted by the murder of his entire family years earlier, is recruited by a shadowy organization to hunt down criminals who are beyond the reach of the law.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7YnvJNwXYxcBfc6ptrArW87Xui3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121817'),
  ('656849679474485563', 'The Sweet and the Bitter', 2007, 'Crime, Drama', 'Andrea Porporati, Alessandro Pesci', 'Andrea Porporati', 'Luigi Lo Cascio, Donatella Finocchiaro, Gaetano Bruno, Renato Carpentieri, Toni Gambino, Fabrizio Gifuni, Ornella Giusto, Pier Luigi Misasi', null, 'Saro, a young Sicilian thug, that from jobs assigned by his godfather, won the favor of leaders of Cosa Nostra, becoming a "man of honor".', 'Saro, a young Sicilian thug, that from jobs assigned by his godfather, won the favor of leaders of Cosa Nostra, becoming a "man of honor".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e5sa1pmtZu9DbHjeqbB4tbwPEmL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3982'),
  ('874535159371839068', 'The Sweet Aunts', 1975, 'Comedy', 'Mario Imperoli, Fausto Zuccoli', 'Piero Regnoli', 'Marisa Merlini, Femi Benussi, Pascale Petit, Mario Maranzana, Jean-Claude Vernè, Orchidea De Santis, Patrizia Gori, Pupo De Luca', null, 'An anarchist grandfather has custody of his nephew Free, but three aunts, two of which still handsome, they get the help of a priest and the police. So take possession of the child and cover it with lust', 'An anarchist grandfather has custody of his nephew Free, but three aunts, two of which still handsome, they get the help of a priest and the police. So take possession of the child and cover it with lust', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1lWZUVKu3BevJPn1dFHgJO6buDn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:220873'),
  ('42959315254391174', 'The Sweet Body of Deborah', 1968, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller, Romance', 'Romolo Guerrieri, Marcello Masciocchi', 'Ernesto Gastaldi', 'Carroll Baker, Jean Sorel, Ida Galli, Luigi Pistilli, Michel Bardinet, Renato Montalbano, Mirella Pamphili, Domenico Ravenna', 'R', 'A newlywed couple visits the husband''s hometown of Geneva, where they are subjected to threats stemming from the death of his former fiancée.', 'A newlywed couple visits the husband''s hometown of Geneva, where they are subjected to threats stemming from the death of his former fiancée.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bHZF0hU1QxEjzA96MLl8toKUvEn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64628'),
  ('341811759317722286', 'The Sweet East', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama, Fantasy', 'Sean Price Williams, Sean Price Williams, Christopher Dagostino', 'Nick Pinkerton', 'Talia Ryder, Earl Cave, Simon Rex, Ayo Edebiri, Jeremy O. Harris, Jacob Elordi, Rish Shah, Gibby Haynes', 'NR', 'A high school senior from South Carolina gets her first glimpse of the wider world, picturesque cities, and woods of the Eastern seaboard on a class trip to Washington, D.C.', 'A high school senior from South Carolina gets her first glimpse of the wider world, picturesque cities, and woods of the Eastern seaboard on a class trip to Washington, D.C.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/luWKeAedGQwNu3AdzygaBQN4h8f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1010639'),
  ('113503581965854023', 'The Sweet Escape', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Claire Mathon, Bruno Podalydès', 'Bruno Podalydès', 'Bruno Podalydès, Sandrine Kiberlain, Agnès Jaoui, Vimala Pons, Denis Podalydès, Michel Vuillermoz, Jean-Noël Brouté, Pierre Arditi', null, 'Michel, a fifty year old man, graphic designer, decides to change the urban lifestyle and go on an adventure. Fascinated by airmail, he dreams at Jean Mermoz when he''s on scooter. One day, Michel sees a picture of a kayak.', 'Michel, a fifty year old man, graphic designer, decides to change the urban lifestyle and go on an adventure. Fascinated by airmail, he dreams at Jean Mermoz when he''s on scooter. One day, Michel sees a picture of a kayak.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vo74Vic2ZM6E4MkVbFnAabO4hUn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:343702'),
  ('785926588636175682', 'The Sweet Hereafter', 1997, 'Drama', 'Atom Egoyan, Paul Sarossy, Bruno Bryniarski', 'Atom Egoyan', 'Ian Holm, Sarah Polley, Tom McCamus, Gabrielle Rose, Alberta Watson, Caerthan Banks, Maury Chaykin, Stephanie Morgenstern', 'R', 'A small mountain community in Canada is devastated when a school bus accident leaves more than a dozen of its children dead. A big-city lawyer arrives to help the survivors'' and victims'' families prepare a class-action suit, but his efforts only seem to push the townspeople further apart. At the same time, one teenage survivor of the accident has to reckon with the loss of innocence brought about by a different kind of damage.', 'A small mountain community in Canada is devastated when a school bus accident leaves more than a dozen of its children dead. A big-city lawyer arrives to help the survivors'' and victims'' families prepare a class-action suit, but his efforts only seem to push the townspeople further apart. At the same time, one teenage survivor of the accident has to reckon with the loss of innocence brought about by a different kind of damage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gJy7LMq4b5qO5fsSUSoBgm24BHf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10217'),
  ('191433079202840889', 'The Sweet House of Horrors', 1989, 'Horror, TV Movie', 'Lucio Fulci, Sebastiano Celeste', 'Gigliola Battaglini, Vincenzo Mannino', 'Jean-Christophe Brétignière, Cinzia Monreale, Lubka Lenzi, Lino Salemme, Franco Diogene, Vernon Dobtcheff, Giuliano Gensini, Ilary Blasi', null, 'A murdered couple return from the beyond to care for their two young children, as well as seek revenge against their killer, accept their children''s step parents, and try to prevent their house from being sold.', 'A murdered couple return from the beyond to care for their two young children, as well as seek revenge against their killer, accept their children''s step parents, and try to prevent their house from being sold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/58nRlNb797eml6vaNNCcDxgF8DF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48846'),
  ('711816823487388916', 'The Sweetest Christmas', 2017, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Terry Ingram', 'Erinne Dobson', 'Lacey Chabert, Lea Coco, Jonathan Adams, Brenden Sunderland, Lara Gilchrist, Lane Edwards, Jill Morrison, Brenda Crichlow', 'G', 'After breaking up with her long-term boyfriend just before the holidays, passionate baker Kylie reconnects with her high school sweetheart, Nick. Thanks to their newly rekindled friendship, Kylie uses Nick’s restaurant to prepare for a gingerbread baking competition with a large cash prize that would help her open her own bakery.', 'After breaking up with her long-term boyfriend just before the holidays, passionate baker Kylie reconnects with her high school sweetheart, Nick. Thanks to their newly rekindled friendship, Kylie uses Nick’s restaurant to prepare for a gingerbread baking competition with a large cash prize that would help her open her own bakery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6HLnj8mYoIM9UW5h0aC6YVSpJKO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:474972'),
  ('12635041764206412', 'The Sweetest Heart', 2018, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Anthony C. Metchie, Steven R. Monroe', null, 'Julie Gonzalo, Chris McNally, Tammy Gillis, Victor Zinck, Jr., Andrea Brooks, Benita Ha, Jordan Burtchett, Clayton James', 'G', 'High school sweethearts Maddie and Nate reconnect when Nate returns to their hometown to lecture at the hospital. Still hurt from their breakup, Maddie tries to avoid him. However, they eventually form a friendship, and Nate helps her as she secures funding to expand her cupcake shop. Just as Maddie and Nate rekindle their romance, Nate learns that a career opportunity awaits him in Boston. Devastated, Maddie returns the promise ring he gave her long ago and prepares for the grand reopening of her shop. Nate soon realizes how much he left behind, and must decide if his future lies in Boston with work or in his hometown with Maddie.', 'High school sweethearts Maddie and Nate reconnect when Nate returns to their hometown to lecture at the hospital. Still hurt from their breakup, Maddie tries to avoid him. However, they eventually form a friendship, and Nate helps her as she secures funding to expand her cupcake shop. Just as Maddie and Nate rekindle their romance, Nate learns that a career opportunity awaits him in Boston. Devastated, Maddie returns the promise ring he gave her long ago and prepares for the grand reopening of her shop. Nate soon realizes how much he left behind, and must decide if his future lies in Boston with work or in his hometown with Maddie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b6uhUULUbh1zqRYnjDakseUjRsM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:511022'),
  ('1086331662697155383', 'The Sweetest Thing', 2002, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Roger Kumble, Anthony B. Richmond, Rick Avery', 'Nancy M. Pimental', 'Cameron Diaz, Christina Applegate, Selma Blair, Thomas Jane, Jason Bateman, Parker Posey, Lillian Adams, Chelsea Bond', 'R', 'Christina''s love life is stuck in neutral. After years of avoiding the hazards of a meaningful relationship, one night while club-hopping with her girlfriends, she meets Peter, her perfect match. Fed up with playing games, she finally gets the courage to let her guard down and follow her heart, only to discover that Peter has suddenly left town. Accompanied by Courtney, she sets out to capture the one that got away.', 'Christina''s love life is stuck in neutral. After years of avoiding the hazards of a meaningful relationship, one night while club-hopping with her girlfriends, she meets Peter, her perfect match. Fed up with playing games, she finally gets the courage to let her guard down and follow her heart, only to discover that Peter has suddenly left town. Accompanied by Courtney, she sets out to capture the one that got away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qLysz4B5YmiDq52Op0zq4eD75LC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11812'),
  ('571999913169515584', 'The Swimmer', 1968, 'Drama', 'Frank Perry, Felix Trimboli, David L. Quaid', 'Eleanor Perry', 'Burt Lancaster, Janet Landgard, Janice Rule, Tony Bickley, Marge Champion, Nancy Cushman, Bill Fiore, Rose Gregorio', null, 'A man spends a summer day swimming home via all the pools in his quiet suburban neighborhood.', 'A man spends a summer day swimming home via all the pools in his quiet suburban neighborhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/urzLPHVno21hv2Ti7CwQuoQAUAI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33564'),
  ('394637007898960011', 'The Swimmer', 2021, 'Drama', 'Ofer Inov, Adam Kalderon', 'Adam Kalderon', 'Omer Perelman Striks, Asaf Jonas, Nadia Kucher, Igal Reznik, Gal Ben Amra, Aviv Karmi, Ofek Nicki-Cohen, Roy Reshef', null, 'Erez, a rising star in the Israeli swimming scene, arrives at a godforsaken training camp held in a boarding school. The winner of the competition held there wins one ticket to the Olympics. There he meets Nevo, beautiful, gifted, who awakens subconscious desires in him. However, their swimming coach does not believe in friendships between competitors. Warned to stay away from Nevo, Erez is still too attracted to him. In between practices, he attempts to act upon his feelings…', 'Erez, a rising star in the Israeli swimming scene, arrives at a godforsaken training camp held in a boarding school. The winner of the competition held there wins one ticket to the Olympics. There he meets Nevo, beautiful, gifted, who awakens subconscious desires in him. However, their swimming coach does not believe in friendships between competitors. Warned to stay away from Nevo, Erez is still too attracted to him. In between practices, he attempts to act upon his feelings…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4DBb2XUpunS6LufF1ap8GBC3h9I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:739323'),
  ('848085499061446226', 'The Swimmers', 2014, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Weerachai Yaikwawong, Sophon Sakdaphisit, Thamnoon Ar-Taroprayoon', 'Sophon Sakdaphisit, Tossaphon Riantong, Jirassaya Wongsutin', 'Chutavuth Pattarakampol, Thanapob Leeratanakachorn, Supassara Thanachart, Violette Wautier, Nussaba Punnakan, Supakit Tungtatsawat, Supaporn Kumnuansilp, Athapol Anunthavorasakul', null, 'After falling pregnant to her boyfriend''s best friend, a young woman commits suicide. She returns to haunt her unborn child''s father while her friend seeks revenge on the person who drove her to her fate.', 'After falling pregnant to her boyfriend''s best friend, a young woman commits suicide. She returns to haunt her unborn child''s father while her friend seeks revenge on the person who drove her to her fate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/umOPxkQMjFiXfILnqB6C0sgy7u8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:292625'),
  ('561451929876452038', 'The Swimmers', 2022, 'Drama, History', 'Sally El Hosaini, Freddie Hall, Adam Morris', 'Jack Thorne', 'Manal Issa, Nathalie Issa, Matthias Schweighöfer, Ali Suliman, James Floyd, Ahmed Malek, Kinda Alloush, Nahel Tzegai', 'PG-13', 'From war-torn Syria to the 2016 Rio Olympics, two young sisters embark on a risky voyage, putting their hearts and their swimming skills to heroic use.', 'From war-torn Syria to the 2016 Rio Olympics, two young sisters embark on a risky voyage, putting their hearts and their swimming skills to heroic use.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u9MiJ6zLpDw4s3qZz93WDVwTUIo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:821881'),
  ('1024803761217439250', 'The Swimming Pool', 1969, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Jacques Deray, Jean-Jacques Tarbès, Jean Mylonas', 'Jean-Claude Carrière, Jacques Deray', 'Alain Delon, Romy Schneider, Maurice Ronet, Jane Birkin, Paul Crauchet, Suzie Jaspard, Maddly Bamy, Thierry Chabert', 'PG', 'Set in a magnificent villa near a sun-drenched St. Tropez, lovers Jean-Paul and Marianne are spending a happy, lazy summer holiday. Their only concern is to gratify their mutual passion - until the day when Marianne invites her former lover and his beautiful teenage daughter to spend a few days with them. From the first moment, a certain uneasiness and tension begin to develop between the four, which soon escalates in a dangerous love-game.', 'Set in a magnificent villa near a sun-drenched St. Tropez, lovers Jean-Paul and Marianne are spending a happy, lazy summer holiday. Their only concern is to gratify their mutual passion - until the day when Marianne invites her former lover and his beautiful teenage daughter to spend a few days with them. From the first moment, a certain uneasiness and tension begin to develop between the four, which soon escalates in a dangerous love-game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pIR9bZM0bN1TwM1tppP7wZ2eJrL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4946'),
  ('444108292893616854', 'The Swimsuit Issue', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Måns Herngren, Anna Carlsten', 'Brian Cordray, Jane Magnusson, Måns Herngren', 'Jonas Inde, Amanda Davin, Benny Haag, Andreas Rothlin-Svensson, Peter Gardiner, Jimmy Lindström, Shebly Niavarani, Kalle Westerdahl', null, 'A wild bachelor party and an agonizing defeat in floorball awakens Fredrik''s passion for male synchronized swimming.', 'A wild bachelor party and an agonizing defeat in floorball awakens Fredrik''s passion for male synchronized swimming.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s0Y6Si02DbqX582C4ixQTwK0NsA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20995'),
  ('979160393370948076', 'The Swindle', 1955, 'Drama, Crime', 'Federico Fellini, Dominique Delouche, Narciso Vicario', 'Tullio Pinelli, Federico Fellini, Ennio Flaiano', 'Broderick Crawford, Giulietta Masina, Richard Basehart, Franco Fabrizi, Sue Ellen Blake, Irene Cefaro, Alberto De Amicis, Lorella De Luca', 'NR', 'Aging small-time conman Augusto works with two younger men: Roberto, who desires to become the Italian Johnny Ray, and Carlo, nicknamed Picasso. Through a series of mishaps and personal entanglements, things go badly for Augusto.', 'Aging small-time conman Augusto works with two younger men: Roberto, who desires to become the Italian Johnny Ray, and Carlo, nicknamed Picasso. Through a series of mishaps and personal entanglements, things go badly for Augusto.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kpo4sZyeOX3dIY0l8uZ2f214mK8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36102'),
