  ('597783772440748628', 'The Swindlers', 1959, 'Drama', 'Gianni Di Venanzo, Francesco Rosi, Roberto Pariante', 'Giuseppe Patroni Griffi, Suso Cecchi d''Amico, Francesco Rosi', 'Alberto Sordi, Belinda Lee, Renato Salvatori, Nino Vingelli, Aldo Giuffrè, Aldo Bufi Landi, Nino Di Napoli, Linda Vandal', null, 'Mario is in Hannover to work as a miner but after losing his job he decides to go back to Italy. When Totonno steals his passport to avoid the police and later on he offers him a new job as "magliaro" (cloth seller), Mario changes his mind and decides to follow Totonno to Hamburg. In Hamburg, Totonno and his friends have to sell Mayer''s cloth, but they meet with the hostility of a Polish gang and Mario falls in love with Paula Mayer.', 'Mario is in Hannover to work as a miner but after losing his job he decides to go back to Italy. When Totonno steals his passport to avoid the police and later on he offers him a new job as "magliaro" (cloth seller), Mario changes his mind and decides to follow Totonno to Hamburg. In Hamburg, Totonno and his friends have to sell Mayer''s cloth, but they meet with the hostility of a Polish gang and Mario falls in love with Paula Mayer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7TtYzmlp4ECrMFlifWMuE6PXRFV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5839'),
  ('346276821366830460', 'The Swindlers', 1963, 'Comedy', 'Lucio Fulci, Alfio Contini, Tino Santoni', 'Castellano, Pipolo, Mario Guerra', 'Walter Chiari, Antonella Lualdi, Raimondo Vianello, Dominique Boschero, Franco Franchi, Ciccio Ingrassia, Aroldo Tieri, Luciana Gilli', null, 'A day in a tribunal where the defendants are: the manager of a soccer team, charged with bribery, two Sicilians who have sold fake archaeological findings, two nuns who have offended a public servant and an industry manager.', 'A day in a tribunal where the defendants are: the manager of a soccer team, charged with bribery, two Sicilians who have sold fake archaeological findings, two nuns who have offended a public servant and an industry manager.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n5NeQMGEU353WY3GwfRK1cUeZZp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107084'),
  ('981452345775023156', 'The Swindlers', 2017, 'Crime, Action, Thriller', 'Jang Chang-won, Lee Tae-yoon, Yoo Huck-jun', 'Jang Chang-won', 'Hyun Bin, Yoo Ji-tae, Bae Sung-woo, Park Sung-woong, Nana, Ahn Se-ha, Choi Deok-moon, Choi Il-hwa', null, 'A group of swindlers unite to hunt down an infamous con man who was known dead, amid their hidden motives and deception.', 'A group of swindlers unite to hunt down an infamous con man who was known dead, amid their hidden motives and deception.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wzxsCW4chkwXzfJPLXImpEpjtV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:478187'),
  ('173700959524699577', 'The Swing of Things', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Jesse Brunt, Matt Shapira', 'Christopher Hewitson, Clayton Hewitson, Justin Jones', 'Chord Overstreet, Olivia Culpo, Luke Wilson, Aleksander Vayshelboym, Adelaide Kane, Matt McCoy, E.E. Bell, Carolyn Hennesy', 'R', 'Bad weather diverts Tom and Laura Jane from their Bahamas dream wedding. So, with friends, parents, and Laura''s protective big brother, they land at a mystery hotel in Jamaica—which turns out to be a swinger''s resort! Can the innocent couple avoid the nonstop booze, weed, naked bodies, and lusty dolphins long enough to make it to the altar?', 'Bad weather diverts Tom and Laura Jane from their Bahamas dream wedding. So, with friends, parents, and Laura''s protective big brother, they land at a mystery hotel in Jamaica—which turns out to be a swinger''s resort! Can the innocent couple avoid the nonstop booze, weed, naked bodies, and lusty dolphins long enough to make it to the altar?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zOrZOaDd5RfF873lKoWE6rkZG9c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:716706'),
  ('121392073789028840', 'The Swinger', 1966, 'Comedy', 'George Sidney, Joseph F. Biroc', 'Lawrence Roman', 'Ann-Margret, Anthony Franciosa, Robert Coote, Yvonne Romain, Horace McMahon, Nydia Westman, Craig Hill, Milton Frome', 'NR', 'An authoress writes a steaming sex-novel and proceeds to live out her heroine''s adventures.', 'An authoress writes a steaming sex-novel and proceeds to live out her heroine''s adventures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vbgjSCgGhh8VBlBEuV8Oc9Lr55G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96846'),
  ('940181336772799382', 'The Swingin'' Stewardesses', 1971, 'Comedy', 'Erwin C. Dietrich, Peter Baumgartner, Andreas Demmer', 'Erwin C. Dietrich', 'Evelyne Traeger, Ingrid Steeger, Kathrin Heberle, Margrit Siegel, Raphael Britten, Detlev Heyse, Bernd Wilczewski, Andreas Mannkopff', 'R', 'This 70''s soft-core sex comedy chronicles the exploits of several flight attendants whose favorite perk-of-the-trade is the ability to flit from one sexual adventure to the next. The mile high club takes on a new meaning as the swingin'' German heroines make their way throughout Europe.', 'This 70''s soft-core sex comedy chronicles the exploits of several flight attendants whose favorite perk-of-the-trade is the ability to flit from one sexual adventure to the next. The mile high club takes on a new meaning as the swingin'' German heroines make their way throughout Europe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6M7QSBkUoN6CLAEc0LWSHCYV9pw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70479'),
  ('71958343635064618', 'The Swinging Barmaids', 1975, 'Drama, Crime, Horror', 'Gus Trikonis, Irv Goodnoff', 'Charles B. Griffith', 'Bruce Watson, Laura Hippe, Katie Saylor, William Smith, Renie Radich, Dyanne Thorne, Zitto Kazann, John Alderman', 'R', 'A cop goes after a psycho who is killing cocktail waitresses.', 'A cop goes after a psycho who is killing cocktail waitresses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3GH8yysbmoGX4RtdLC74vnuBI3F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28757'),
  ('1045850527534989099', 'The Swinging Cheerleaders', 1974, 'Action, Comedy', 'Jack Hill, Alfred Taylor, Daisy Gerber', 'David Kidd, Jack Hill', 'Jo Johnston, Cheryl Smith, Colleen Camp, Rosanne Katon, Ron Hajak, Ric Carrott, Jason Sommers, Ian Sander', 'R', 'In order to write an expose on how cheerleading demeans women, a reporter for a college newspaper infiltrates the cheerleading squad.', 'In order to write an expose on how cheerleading demeans women, a reporter for a college newspaper infiltrates the cheerleading squad.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hIpmpPjDEezCzcR3omTqM0GYoUh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22092'),
  ('1082147711940815195', 'The Swiss Conspiracy', 1976, 'Drama, Action, Crime', 'Jack Arnold, Rolf M. Degener, Peter Fratzscher', 'Norman Klenman, Philip Saltzman, Michael Stanley', 'David Janssen, Senta Berger, John Ireland, John Saxon, Ray Milland, Elke Sommer, Anton Diffring, Arthur Brauss', 'PG', 'A Swiss bank discovers some of its clients are becoming the victim of a brilliant blackmailer. The bank''s president contacts David Christopher, a former agent with the U.S. Treasury, to help discover who the blackmailer is and to foil his plot. As Christopher delves into the mystery, he uncovers a complicated web of intrigue, car chases, and shoot-outs that takes all of his wits to unravel.', 'A Swiss bank discovers some of its clients are becoming the victim of a brilliant blackmailer. The bank''s president contacts David Christopher, a former agent with the U.S. Treasury, to help discover who the blackmailer is and to foil his plot. As Christopher delves into the mystery, he uncovers a complicated web of intrigue, car chases, and shoot-outs that takes all of his wits to unravel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uP1OxgBEu99gFURHLVs8mZYvHEm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61298'),
  ('1002468932655983604', 'The Swissmakers', 1978, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Rolf Lyssy, Fritz E. Mäder', 'Rolf Lyssy, Christa Maerker', 'Emil Steinberger, Walo Lüönd, Beatrice Kessler, Wolfgang Stendar, Hilde Ziegler, Claudio Caramaschi, Silvia Jost, Bill Ramsey', null, 'This romantic drama follows two policemen whose job is to investigate the lives of foreigners who have applied for Swiss citizenship. Among the applicants they must screen are a French psychiatrist and his wife, and a ballet dancer. The married couple are quickly accepted, but the dancer''s life offers some objections. However, since the younger policeman has fallen in love with her, there is a chance that she, too, will win Swiss citizenship.', 'This romantic drama follows two policemen whose job is to investigate the lives of foreigners who have applied for Swiss citizenship. Among the applicants they must screen are a French psychiatrist and his wife, and a ballet dancer. The married couple are quickly accepted, but the dancer''s life offers some objections. However, since the younger policeman has fallen in love with her, there is a chance that she, too, will win Swiss citizenship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cWEJjqK1nYHWYR1xVKKn9N5c3SM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34666'),
  ('1016877338841306341', 'The Switch', 2010, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Will Speck, Josh Gordon, Timothy Bird', 'Allan Loeb', 'Jennifer Aniston, Jason Bateman, Patrick Wilson, Thomas Robinson, Jeff Goldblum, Juliette Lewis, Victor Pagan, Todd Louiso', 'PG-13', 'Kassie is a smart, fun-loving single woman who, despite her neurotic best friend Wally’s objections, decides it’s time to have a baby – even if it means doing it herself… with a little help from a charming sperm donor. But, unbeknownst to her, Kassie’s plans go awry because of a last-minute switch that isn’t discovered until seven years later… when Wally gets acquainted with Kassie’s cute, though slightly neurotic, son.', 'Kassie is a smart, fun-loving single woman who, despite her neurotic best friend Wally’s objections, decides it’s time to have a baby – even if it means doing it herself… with a little help from a charming sperm donor. But, unbeknownst to her, Kassie’s plans go awry because of a last-minute switch that isn’t discovered until seven years later… when Wally gets acquainted with Kassie’s cute, though slightly neurotic, son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oJdMT6RGtbvQ26Tk7EHGfG8xZ6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41210'),
  ('148218595686152634', 'The Sword', 1945, 'Drama', 'Kenji Mizoguchi, Shigeto Miki', 'Masamune Yotsura', 'Shōtarō Hanayagi, Kan Ishii, Eijirō Yanagi, Ichijirō Oya, Isuzu Yamada', null, 'In 19th-century Japan, a young swordsmith is determined to make the best sword possible after an inferior one he made indirectly led to the death of his guardian.', 'In 19th-century Japan, a young swordsmith is determined to make the best sword possible after an inferior one he made indirectly led to the death of his guardian.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oGGTxplc7XlOVdPpFyhPsHAlZNE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:205649'),
  ('543921012731629695', 'The Sword', 1980, 'Action', 'Patrick Tam Kar-Ming, Bill Wong Chung-Piu', 'Patrick Tam Kar-Ming, Clifford Choi, Wong Ying', 'Adam Cheng Siu-Chow, Tien Feng, Eddy Ko Hung, Norman Tsui Siu-Keung, Jade Hsu, Bonnie Ngai Chau-Wah, JoJo Chan Kei-Kei, Lau Siu-Ming', null, 'Swordsman Li Mak-Jan is on a quest to duel the powerful and reclusive Hua Qian Shu. But will a cursed sword and the intrigues of the martial world bring him fame or tragedy?', 'Swordsman Li Mak-Jan is on a quest to duel the powerful and reclusive Hua Qian Shu. But will a cursed sword and the intrigues of the martial world bring him fame or tragedy?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hm8G4FQJN53MpSGOtXyBAmHGHZ6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73841'),
  ('911210481874977680', 'The Sword and the Balance', 1963, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'André Cayatte', 'André Cayatte, Henri Jeanson, Charles Spaak', 'Anthony Perkins, Jean-Claude Brialy, Renato Salvatori, Pascale Audret, Jacques Monod, Marie Déa, Horst Janson, Fernand Ledoux', null, 'Three young men are suspected of kidnapping and murdering a little boy. Most likely, two of them are really involved, but one is not. All of their pasts are questionable, riddled with violence and controversy. Neither the police nor the court can decide how to solve that puzzle.', 'Three young men are suspected of kidnapping and murdering a little boy. Most likely, two of them are really involved, but one is not. All of their pasts are questionable, riddled with violence and controversy. Neither the police nor the court can decide how to solve that puzzle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/68LvtORGquH2FtKR1VuvA3KHxIg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:245787'),
  ('477312368974845399', 'The Sword and the Dragon', 1956, 'Adventure, Fantasy', 'Aleksandr Ptushko, Fyodor Provorov, Gleb Kuznetsov', 'Mikhail Kochnev, Damir Vyatich-Berezhnykh', 'Boris Andreyev, Ninel Myshkova, Shukur Burkhanov, Andrei Abrikosov, Georgi Dyomin, Sergey Stolyarov, Sergei Martinson, Iya Arepina', null, 'Paralyzed since birth, Ilya can only watch helplessly as his village is plundered by barbarians. But when a mysterious traveler arrives with a magic elixir that restores him to full health, Ilya begins an adventure to protect the village and the royal family from harm.', 'Paralyzed since birth, Ilya can only watch helplessly as his village is plundered by barbarians. But when a mysterious traveler arrives with a magic elixir that restores him to full health, Ilya begins an adventure to protect the village and the royal family from harm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o56Hm5uR7FkYY4JJz2X8pfXStrm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118153'),
  ('1066842456276978367', 'The Sword and the Rose', 1953, 'Adventure, Drama, History', 'Ken Annakin, Geoffrey Unsworth', 'Lawrence Edward Watkin', 'Richard Todd, Glynis Johns, James Robertson Justice, Michael Gough, Peter Copley, Rosalie Crutchley, D.A. Clarke-Smith, Jane Barrett', 'NR', 'Tells the story of Mary Tudor and her troubled path to true love. Henry VIII, for political reasons, determines to wed her to the King of France. She tries to flee to America with her love but is captured when she is "un-hatted" on board ship. In return for her consent to the marriage with France, Henry agrees to let her choose her second husband. When King Louis of France dies, Mary is kidnaped by the Duke of Buckingham. He tries to force her to marry him but she is rescued by her love in an exciting battle on the beach.', 'Tells the story of Mary Tudor and her troubled path to true love. Henry VIII, for political reasons, determines to wed her to the King of France. She tries to flee to America with her love but is captured when she is "un-hatted" on board ship. In return for her consent to the marriage with France, Henry agrees to let her choose her second husband. When King Louis of France dies, Mary is kidnaped by the Duke of Buckingham. He tries to force her to marry him but she is rescued by her love in an exciting battle on the beach.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cFDClsUSr3ZlkQMKQ8ZEPiFFfpO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64851'),
  ('281311526492141115', 'The Sword and the Sorcerer', 1982, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy, Horror', 'Albert Pyun, Joseph Mangine, Lisa C. Cook', 'Albert Pyun, John V. Stuckmeyer, Tom Karnowski', 'Lee Horsley, Kathleen Beller, Simon MacCorkindale, George Maharis, Richard Lynch, Richard Moll, Anthony De Longis, Robert Tessier', 'R', 'A mercenary with a three-bladed sword rediscovers his royal heritage when he is recruited to help a princess foil a brutal tyrant and a powerful sorcerer''s plans to conquer the land.', 'A mercenary with a three-bladed sword rediscovers his royal heritage when he is recruited to help a princess foil a brutal tyrant and a powerful sorcerer''s plans to conquer the land.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3804sBcpgNvpNpLc53hb4MMB6f7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13945'),
  ('56642456034243279', 'The Sword Identity', 2012, 'Drama, Action', 'Xu Haofeng', 'Xu Haofeng', 'Song Yang, Yu Chenghui, Ma Jun, Fujing Xu, Ma Ke, Zhao Yuanyuan', null, 'During the Ming Dynasty one man will request a competition when his weapon is rejected. After a series of fights he is determined to prove his sword is invincible.', 'During the Ming Dynasty one man will request a competition when his weapon is rejected. After a series of fights he is determined to prove his sword is invincible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/557FlrywNJUtzkVxn645errCuUq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120460'),
  ('122221368685154161', 'The Sword in the Stone', 1963, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'Wolfgang Reitherman', 'Bill Peet', 'Sebastian Cabot, Karl Swenson, Junius Matthews, Martha Wentworth, Norman Alden, Rickie Sorensen, Ginny Tyler, Alan Napier', 'G', 'Wart is a young boy who aspires to be a knight''s squire. On a hunting trip he falls in on Merlin, a powerful but amnesiac wizard who has plans for him beyond mere squiredom. He starts by trying to give him an education, believing that once one has an education, one can go anywhere. Needless to say, it doesn''t quite work out that way.', 'Wart is a young boy who aspires to be a knight''s squire. On a hunting trip he falls in on Merlin, a powerful but amnesiac wizard who has plans for him beyond mere squiredom. He starts by trying to give him an education, believing that once one has an education, one can go anywhere. Needless to say, it doesn''t quite work out that way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7lyeeuhGAJSNXYEW34S8mJ1bwI8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9078'),
  ('214862953816418496', 'The Sword of Doom', 1966, 'Action, Drama', 'Kihachi Okamoto, Michio Yamamoto, Hiroshi Murai', 'Shinobu Hashimoto', 'Tatsuya Nakadai, Yūzō Kayama, Michiyo Aratama, Yōko Naitō, Toshirō Mifune, Tadao Nakamaru, Kei Satō, Kō Nishimura', 'NR', 'Ryunosuke, a gifted swordsman plying his trade during the turbulent final days of Shogunate rule, has no moral code and kills without remorse. It’s a way of life that leads to madness.', 'Ryunosuke, a gifted swordsman plying his trade during the turbulent final days of Shogunate rule, has no moral code and kills without remorse. It’s a way of life that leads to madness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yjHbIihqpuAXlZVoPbWdqaukllB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19884'),
  ('335335352569183089', 'The Sword of the Barbarians', 1982, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Action, Thriller', 'Michele Massimo Tarantini, Pasquale Fanetti, Giancarlo Ferrando', 'Piero Regnoli', 'Pietro Torrisi, Yvonne Fraschetti, Mario Novelli, Xiomara Rodríguez, Margareta Rance, Hal Yamanouchi, Alessandro Partexano, Luciano Rossi', null, 'A swordsman''s wife is murdered by followers of the evil Goddess Rani. He vows vengeance upon the cult and journeys to the Ark of the Templars to get a magic crossbow that will help him accomplish his mission.', 'A swordsman''s wife is murdered by followers of the evil Goddess Rani. He vows vengeance upon the cult and journeys to the Ark of the Templars to get a magic crossbow that will help him accomplish his mission.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f3mxn23uhq2xsLxTzu1n9u5s66J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105242'),
  ('269290310212801866', 'The Sword Stained with Royal Blood', 1981, 'Action, Drama', 'Chang Cheh, Chiang Sheng, Lo Yuen-Ming', 'Ni Kuang', 'Phillip Kwok Chui, Candy Man, Chiang Sheng, Lu Feng, Wong Lik, Ching Li, Yu Tai-Ping, Chu Ko', null, 'Raised to be a righteous martial artist, Yuan kicks off the story proper by finding a cave containing a skeleton, a treasure map, and a manual teaching him the Golden Snake style. Obeying a request hidden in the manual to give a portion of the treasure to the Golden Snake''s old girlfriend, Yuan begins to seek the woman out - on the way solving the riddle of the Golden Snake, and how he came to his end.', 'Raised to be a righteous martial artist, Yuan kicks off the story proper by finding a cave containing a skeleton, a treasure map, and a manual teaching him the Golden Snake style. Obeying a request hidden in the manual to give a portion of the treasure to the Golden Snake''s old girlfriend, Yuan begins to seek the woman out - on the way solving the riddle of the Golden Snake, and how he came to his end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z9xkmM7Jpq20HJjLTm7KDqjIJZC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141461'),
  ('749694799042343042', 'The Sword with No Name', 2009, 'Drama, Action, History, Romance', 'Kim Yong-gyun, Seo Jeong-dal, Jae Cheol Hong', 'Lee Suk-yeon', 'Cho Seung-woo, Soo Ae, Cheon Ho-jin, Sophie Broustal, Choi Jae-woong, Kim Young-min, Koh Soo-hee, Lee Joo-sil', null, 'Mu Myeong is a Joseon dynasty headhunter who meets and falls in love with lady Ja Yeong who will become the future Empress Myseongseong. A few years later, Ja Yeong enters the royal palace to marry King Gojong. Mu Myeong still having feelings for Ja Yeong and in an attempt to get closer to her becomes her personal body guard.', 'Mu Myeong is a Joseon dynasty headhunter who meets and falls in love with lady Ja Yeong who will become the future Empress Myseongseong. A few years later, Ja Yeong enters the royal palace to marry King Gojong. Mu Myeong still having feelings for Ja Yeong and in an attempt to get closer to her becomes her personal body guard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gzC2wata6kthYyni1gb6jjVTcSP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41441'),
  ('611834946107906598', 'The Swordsman', 1992, 'Fantasy, Action', 'Michael Kennedy', 'Michael Kennedy', 'Lorenzo Lamas, Michael Champion, Claire Stansfield, Nicholas Pasco, Raoul Max Trujillo, Eugene Clark, Michael Copeman, George Touliatos', null, 'Cop and accomplished fencer Andrew is assigned to protect archaeologist and museum curator Julie Wilkins, the only witness to the theft of the legendary sword of Alexander the Great. Andrew has recurring dreams about two men having a sword fight in what is to be a historical place. At his fencing club he meets Stratos, initiator of a deadly swordplay competition, who seems to be the key to both Andrew''s haunting visions and the loss of Alexander''s sword.', 'Cop and accomplished fencer Andrew is assigned to protect archaeologist and museum curator Julie Wilkins, the only witness to the theft of the legendary sword of Alexander the Great. Andrew has recurring dreams about two men having a sword fight in what is to be a historical place. At his fencing club he meets Stratos, initiator of a deadly swordplay competition, who seems to be the key to both Andrew''s haunting visions and the loss of Alexander''s sword.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4agc8dypZZcmQGMVrKUtwO0UIAV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102396'),
  ('723237051099527941', 'The Swordsman', 2020, 'Action, Drama, History', 'Choi Jae-hoon, Sohn Won-ho, Lee Sun-young', 'Choi Jae-hoon', 'Jang Hyuk, Kim Hyeon-soo, Joe Taslim, Jeong Man-sik, Jang Hyun-sung, Lee Na-kyeong, Lee Min-hyuk, Choi Jin-ho', 'PG-13', 'After being blinded in a coup against the king, Joseon''s greatest swordsman goes into hiding, far removed from his city''s anguish. But when traffickers kidnap his daughter, he has no choice but to unsheathe his sword once more.', 'After being blinded in a coup against the king, Joseon''s greatest swordsman goes into hiding, far removed from his city''s anguish. But when traffickers kidnap his daughter, he has no choice but to unsheathe his sword once more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r08U3dwiOeStXcjYmfnRyumgKyq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:492008'),
  ('1051675548316493521', 'The Swordsman in Double Flag Town', 1991, 'Adventure', 'He Ping', 'He Ping, Zhengguang Yang', 'Wei Gao, Mana Zhao, Jiang Chang, Sun Haiying, Wang Gang, Gaoping Zhang', null, 'Honoring his father''s dying words, a young man comes to the dusty desert village of Double Flag Town to claim his bride. Everyone looks down upon him because he looks inept and ignorant. When he kills a man who is attempting to rape his bride, he provokes the wrath of the Lethal Swordsman who is the rapist''s brother and also a famous killer. Will our hero choose to escape with his bride or face the Lethal Swordsman?', 'Honoring his father''s dying words, a young man comes to the dusty desert village of Double Flag Town to claim his bride. Everyone looks down upon him because he looks inept and ignorant. When he kills a man who is attempting to rape his bride, he provokes the wrath of the Lethal Swordsman who is the rapist''s brother and also a famous killer. Will our hero choose to escape with his bride or face the Lethal Swordsman?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bx096h9NXZvRYSVcsaeIFbDA0jF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58370'),
  ('51681794279629839', 'The Swordsman of All Swordsmen', 1968, 'Action, History, Drama', 'Joseph Kuo, Lin Tsan-Ting', 'Joseph Kuo, Tyrone Hsu', 'Tien Peng, Polly Shang-Kuan Ling-Feng, Chiang Nan, Tsao Chien, Miao Tian, Hsueh Han, Ko Yu-Min, Lu Shih', null, 'A master swordsman is on a twenty year quest to revenge the death of his parents.', 'A master swordsman is on a twenty year quest to revenge the death of his parents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gIfVroTJBjbb9jUtqoMzsl2tYWY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:369216'),
  ('321998176760448971', 'The Sylvian Experiments', 2010, 'Horror', 'Akiko Serizawa, Hiroshi Takahashi', 'Hiroshi Takahashi', 'Mina Fujii, Yuri Nakamura, Nagisa Katahira, Yoichiro Saito, Kimika Yoshino, Kaku Tomohiro, Yoko Chosokabe, Momoko Hatano', 'R', 'Dr. Hattori and her husband watch footage of brain surgery experiments with Manchurian, Russian and Japanese guinea pigs that had been found in the basement of a wrecked hospital. Out of the blue, there is a white light and when they look back, they see they children Ota Miyuki and Kaori staring at the light. Years later, Miyuki vanishes from the Tama Medical University Hospital and her sister Kaori, Miyuki''s boyfriend Motojima and detective Hirasawa are seeking her. However, Miyuki and the teenagers Kazochi, Takumi, Hattori and Rieko have been submitted to a nightmarish experiment by Dr. Hattori and her team with tragic results.', 'Dr. Hattori and her husband watch footage of brain surgery experiments with Manchurian, Russian and Japanese guinea pigs that had been found in the basement of a wrecked hospital. Out of the blue, there is a white light and when they look back, they see they children Ota Miyuki and Kaori staring at the light. Years later, Miyuki vanishes from the Tama Medical University Hospital and her sister Kaori, Miyuki''s boyfriend Motojima and detective Hirasawa are seeking her. However, Miyuki and the teenagers Kazochi, Takumi, Hattori and Rieko have been submitted to a nightmarish experiment by Dr. Hattori and her team with tragic results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xrs1UjmIlAjepFQAJeyhQX0Fw7b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70217'),
  ('1043814275974455861', 'The Symbol of the Unconquered', 1920, 'Drama', 'Oscar Micheaux', 'Oscar Micheaux', 'Iris Hall, Walker Thompson, Lawrence Chenault, Mattie Wilkes, Louis Dean, Leigh Whipper, Jim Burris, E.G. Tatum', null, 'Eve Mason, a white-passing black woman, moves to a remote cottage she inherited from her late father. She makes the acquaintance of her neighbor, a dashing black settler named Hugh Van Allen, and quickly falls for him. Trouble brews as the local cadre of racist hucksters want the valuable land Van Allen lives on, and will do anything to take it from him.', 'Eve Mason, a white-passing black woman, moves to a remote cottage she inherited from her late father. She makes the acquaintance of her neighbor, a dashing black settler named Hugh Van Allen, and quickly falls for him. Trouble brews as the local cadre of racist hucksters want the valuable land Van Allen lives on, and will do anything to take it from him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/OZxrXGPcwslC5x6V6ZkxQqpOpG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175226'),
  ('439125261032138773', 'The Syndrome', 2022, 'Horror', 'Mikhail Sledyev, Vyacheslav Rudenko, Alexey Sinitsyn', 'Vyacheslav Rudenko', 'Ilya Korobko, Darya Melnikova, Timofey Dashuk, Aleksandr Kudrenko, Varvara Verkhovykh, Vitaliy Krylov, Anna Schetinina, Roman Gribkov', null, 'While Saint Petersburg is shocked by the series of mysterious suicides, Egor is about to move to Moscow to leave the past behind and start over. His plans change when he meets Karina who believes something supernatural is happening. Together they will try to reveal the secret of the reoccuring deaths. The secret that will lead them to the sinister Man in White.', 'While Saint Petersburg is shocked by the series of mysterious suicides, Egor is about to move to Moscow to leave the past behind and start over. His plans change when he meets Karina who believes something supernatural is happening. Together they will try to reveal the secret of the reoccuring deaths. The secret that will lead them to the sinister Man in White.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d7gHC2PzBbOqIQsZDkOVfJohKDE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:863924'),
  ('552452696633071508', 'The Syrian Bride', 2004, 'Drama', 'Eran Riklis, Michael Wiesweg', 'Eran Riklis, Suha Arraf', 'Hiam Abbass, Makram J. Khoury, Clara Khoury, Evelyn Kaplun, Uri Gavriel, Alon Dahan, Julie-Anne Roth, Adnan Tarabshi', null, 'In Majdal Shams, the largest Druze village in Golan Heights on the Israeli-Syrian border, the Druze bride Mona is engaged to get married with Tallel, a television comedian that works in the Revolution Studios in Damascus, Syria. They have never met each other because of the occupation of the area by Israel since 1967; when Mona moves to Syria, she will lose her undefined nationality and will never be allowed to return home. Mona''s father Hammed is a political activist pro-Syria that is on probation by the Israeli government. His older son Hatten married a Russian woman eight years ago and was banished from Majdal Shams by the religious leaders and his father. His brother Marwan is a wolf trader that lives in Italy. His sister Amal has two teenager daughters and has the intention to join the university, but her marriage with Amin is in crisis. When the family gathers for Mona''s wedding, an insane bureaucracy jeopardizes the ceremony.', 'In Majdal Shams, the largest Druze village in Golan Heights on the Israeli-Syrian border, the Druze bride Mona is engaged to get married with Tallel, a television comedian that works in the Revolution Studios in Damascus, Syria. They have never met each other because of the occupation of the area by Israel since 1967; when Mona moves to Syria, she will lose her undefined nationality and will never be allowed to return home. Mona''s father Hammed is a political activist pro-Syria that is on probation by the Israeli government. His older son Hatten married a Russian woman eight years ago and was banished from Majdal Shams by the religious leaders and his father. His brother Marwan is a wolf trader that lives in Italy. His sister Amal has two teenager daughters and has the intention to join the university, but her marriage with Amin is in crisis. When the family gathers for Mona''s wedding, an insane bureaucracy jeopardizes the ceremony.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/utTi2nN47xzt4SUmTUQzVXGuAlu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22238'),
  ('507375437952888286', 'The Syringe', 1984, 'Crime, Action', 'Sergio Gobbi, Richard Andry', 'Sergio Gobbi, Daniel Ubaud', 'Daniel Auteuil, Marisa Berenson, Marcel Bozzuffi, Daniel Ubaud, Michel Beaune, Guy Di Rigo, Mohamed Ben Smail, Alex Descas', null, 'Good dope is becoming rare in the North of Paris. Drugstores are being raided by junkies and gangs are nervous, fighting each others: the ''Viets'', the ''Blackies'', the ''Arabs'', the neo-nazis ''Justiciers'' and some mean gays. Vincent (Daniel Auteuil) is the good cop coming from Marseilles where he was a gangster. He''s a soft method guy but also kicks assses hard and throw lethal dialog lines when needed. With the precious help of ''l''Arbalète''* (Marisa Berenson**), a tox'' prostitute ex-member of Vincent''s former gang, he will try to put order in that mess. There''s also a violent and racist cop (Marcel Bozzuffi), Algeria veteran with hard methods, whose role could be more than to protect and to serve.', 'Good dope is becoming rare in the North of Paris. Drugstores are being raided by junkies and gangs are nervous, fighting each others: the ''Viets'', the ''Blackies'', the ''Arabs'', the neo-nazis ''Justiciers'' and some mean gays. Vincent (Daniel Auteuil) is the good cop coming from Marseilles where he was a gangster. He''s a soft method guy but also kicks assses hard and throw lethal dialog lines when needed. With the precious help of ''l''Arbalète''* (Marisa Berenson**), a tox'' prostitute ex-member of Vincent''s former gang, he will try to put order in that mess. There''s also a violent and racist cop (Marcel Bozzuffi), Algeria veteran with hard methods, whose role could be more than to protect and to serve.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A4gHWG4NEW8zDopFqub1UM4miJc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:259980'),
  ('638888786093321140', 'The System', 1964, 'Drama', 'Michael Winner, Nicolas Roeg, Peter Price', 'Peter Draper', 'Oliver Reed, Jane Merrow, Barbara Ferris, Julia Foster, Harry Andrews, Ann Lynn, Guy Doleman, Andrew Ray', null, 'In a seaside village, a group of local young men mingle among the seasonal tourists in search of sexual conquests. Near the end of one summer, the leader of the group, Tinker, a strolling photographer, aims to conquer a fashion model from a well-to-do family, but he finds himself unexpectedly falling in love. The tables thus turned, Tinker begins to see that maybe it''s not the tourists who are being used in these sexual games.', 'In a seaside village, a group of local young men mingle among the seasonal tourists in search of sexual conquests. Near the end of one summer, the leader of the group, Tinker, a strolling photographer, aims to conquer a fashion model from a well-to-do family, but he finds himself unexpectedly falling in love. The tables thus turned, Tinker begins to see that maybe it''s not the tourists who are being used in these sexual games.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5sWU3cs1vMo3CZY61M19j2EhGwW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:165020'),
  ('668665636524306406', 'The System', 2022, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Dallas Jackson', 'Dallas Jackson', 'Tyrese Gibson, Terrence Howard, Jeremy Piven, Lil Yachty, Ric Reitz, Laura Aleman, Caleb Spillyards, Marrese Crump', 'R', 'When a young soldier, newly returned from war, gets caught up in a drug bust, he is recruited by the authorities to go undercover in a notoriously dangerous prison in order to figure out what is really going on.', 'When a young soldier, newly returned from war, gets caught up in a drug bust, he is recruited by the authorities to go undercover in a notoriously dangerous prison in order to figure out what is really going on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uj6BjK7OXSCDhg0AjC2duL34vwQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1024627'),
  ('500818951640955008', 'The T.A.M.I. Show', 1964, 'Documentary, Music', 'Steve Binder, James E. Kilgore', null, 'Chuck Berry, James Brown, Lesley Gore, Jan Berry, Dean Torrence, Marvin Gaye, Toni Baker, Florence Ballard', 'NR', 'Hailed by one music reviewer as "the grooviest, wildest, slickest hit ever to pound the screen," "The T.A.M.I. Show" is an unrelenting rock spectacular starring some of the greatest pop performers of the 60s. These top recording idols – representing the musical moods of London, Liverpool, Hollywood and Detroit – packed the Santa Monica Civic Auditorium with 2,600 screaming fans and virtually brought down the house. This is the cinematic record of that electrifying event.', 'Hailed by one music reviewer as "the grooviest, wildest, slickest hit ever to pound the screen," "The T.A.M.I. Show" is an unrelenting rock spectacular starring some of the greatest pop performers of the 60s. These top recording idols – representing the musical moods of London, Liverpool, Hollywood and Detroit – packed the Santa Monica Civic Auditorium with 2,600 screaming fans and virtually brought down the house. This is the cinematic record of that electrifying event.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w9t1Oa769J6x9xmjyFu4QlXTk09.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53202'),
  ('52748442718104960', 'The Table', 2017, 'Drama', 'Kim Jong-kwan, Kim Ji-yong, Lee Seung-hun', 'Kim Jong-kwan', 'Jung Yu-mi, Jung Eun-chae, Han Ye-ri, Lim Soo-jung, Jung Jun-won, Jeon Seong-woo, Kim Hye-ok, Yeon Woo-jin', null, 'Four different women discuss life, love and marriage with people from their past and present during the course of one day at a café in Seoul.', 'Four different women discuss life, love and marriage with people from their past and present during the course of one day at a café in Seoul.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x52XKSLJWFv5TWc70Dq7kkmw5mO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:420513'),
  ('926983913058476485', 'The Taebaek Mountains', 1994, 'War, Drama', 'Im Kwon-taek, Jung Il-sung, Kim Dae-seung', 'Song Neung-han', 'Ahn Sung-ki, Kim Myung-gon, Kim Kap-soo, Oh Jung-hae, Shin Hyun-jun, Choi Dong-joon, Jung Kyung-soon, Pang Eun-jin', null, 'Based on the great river story, The Taebaek Mountains chronicles the lasting generational conflict between proprietors and peasants in South Korea.', 'Based on the great river story, The Taebaek Mountains chronicles the lasting generational conflict between proprietors and peasants in South Korea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cSJFHWGhPuG3fuiH5p3oUkyPUUz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143195'),
  ('180628056541154777', 'The Tag-Along', 2015, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Cheng Wei-hao', 'Chien Shih-Keng', 'River Huang, Hsu Wei-ning, Liu Yin-Shang, Yumi Wong, Chang Pai-Chou, Mario Pu, Pai Ming-Hua, Jin Mei-Man', null, 'Wei is nowhere to be found one day before his grandma returns from her own strange missing incident. Wei''s girlfriend desperately searches for his whereabouts and discovers that a little girl in red followed them before their disappearance. Based on true events and long-circulating urban legend in Taiwan.', 'Wei is nowhere to be found one day before his grandma returns from her own strange missing incident. Wei''s girlfriend desperately searches for his whereabouts and discovers that a little girl in red followed them before their disappearance. Based on true events and long-circulating urban legend in Taiwan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2AaeSBHS8EhbcOS8cfAUqaPNGHP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:375170'),
  ('706433132384536871', 'The Tag-Along 2', 2017, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Cheng Wei-hao, Yu Hui-wen', 'Yang Wan-ju, Chien Shih-Keng', 'Rainie Yang, Hsu Wei-ning, River Huang, Lung Siu Wa, Francesca Kao, Chiao Yuan-Yuan, Brando Huang', null, 'When social worker Shu-fen discovers that her pregnant teenage daughter Ya-ting has disappeared, her search for Ya-ting ends her with many horrifying mysteries… Meeting the mysterious Mei-hua who imprisons her own daughter inside her house covered with papers written with spells and encountering the missing and pregnant Yi-chun in an abandoned hospital, the trio returns to the Red Forest to rescue Ya-ting and Shu-fen finally realizes that the deepest fear arises from love…', 'When social worker Shu-fen discovers that her pregnant teenage daughter Ya-ting has disappeared, her search for Ya-ting ends her with many horrifying mysteries… Meeting the mysterious Mei-hua who imprisons her own daughter inside her house covered with papers written with spells and encountering the missing and pregnant Yi-chun in an abandoned hospital, the trio returns to the Red Forest to rescue Ya-ting and Shu-fen finally realizes that the deepest fear arises from love…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9kJizTQoHW9Tj1QvuGkRmySUiY1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:472746'),
  ('137181239678986577', 'The Tag-Along: Devil Fish', 2018, 'Horror', 'David Chuang, Yu Hui-wen', null, 'Vivian Hsu, Rexen Cheng, Joe Chang, Wu Chih-hsuan, Lung Siu Wa, Francesca Kao, Rainie Yang, Hsu Wei-ning', 'R', 'When a spirit medium is called to exorcise a demon from a possessed man, he is unknowingly captured in the act by two students looking to document the process. When the students accidentally release the devil fish demon into the world, it is up to them and the spirit medium to send it back to the hellish world from where it came.', 'When a spirit medium is called to exorcise a demon from a possessed man, he is unknowingly captured in the act by two students looking to document the process. When the students accidentally release the devil fish demon into the world, it is up to them and the spirit medium to send it back to the hellish world from where it came.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2f3z3QiQDzW9w8cIEDqCkgn8Fka.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:565428'),
  ('283380375492131252', 'The Tailor of Panama', 2001, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Philippe Rousselot, John Boorman, Stephen Daly', 'John Boorman, Andrew Davies, John le Carré', 'Pierce Brosnan, Geoffrey Rush, Jamie Lee Curtis, Leonor Varela, Brendan Gleeson, Harold Pinter, Catherine McCormack, Daniel Radcliffe', 'R', 'A British spy is banished to Panama after having an affair with an ambassador''s mistress. Once there he makes connection with a local tailor with a nefarious past and connections to all of the top political and gangster figures in Panama. The tailor also has a wife, who works for the Panamanian president and a huge debt. The mission is to learn what the President intends to do with the Canal.', 'A British spy is banished to Panama after having an affair with an ambassador''s mistress. Once there he makes connection with a local tailor with a nefarious past and connections to all of the top political and gangster figures in Panama. The tailor also has a wife, who works for the Panamanian president and a huge debt. The mission is to learn what the President intends to do with the Canal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/na80ysnoCvoxwGTMWCWYvnmaDlz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2575'),
  ('1057672382469010885', 'The Take', 2008, 'Action, Thriller, Drama, Mystery', 'Brad Furman, Lukas Ettlin', 'Jonas Pate, Josh Pate', 'John Leguizamo, Tyrese Gibson, Rosie Perez, Bobby Cannavale, Sam Upton, Matthew Hatchette, Yul Vazquez, Curt Bouril', null, 'After he''s shot during a heist in East L.A., an armored truck driver wrestles with rehabilitation and tracking down the man who committed the crime.', 'After he''s shot during a heist in East L.A., an armored truck driver wrestles with rehabilitation and tracking down the man who committed the crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kbJ8bjRr0U2wIhomhllEGUQ9071.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18056'),
  ('227520367019325020', 'The Takedown', 2022, 'Comedy, Action', 'Thomas Hardmeier, Louis Leterrier', 'Stéphane Kazandjian', 'Omar Sy, Laurent Lafitte, Izïa Higelin, Dimitri Storoge, Stéphane Pezerat, Jo Prestia, Flavie Péan, Catherine Schaub-Abkarian', null, 'Ousmane Diakité and François Monge are two cops with very different styles, backgrounds and careers. The unlikely pair are reunited once again for a new investigation that takes them across France. What seemed to be a simple drug deal turns out to be a much bigger criminal case wrapped in danger and unexpected comedy.', 'Ousmane Diakité and François Monge are two cops with very different styles, backgrounds and careers. The unlikely pair are reunited once again for a new investigation that takes them across France. What seemed to be a simple drug deal turns out to be a much bigger criminal case wrapped in danger and unexpected comedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eGIxXsf3DXYejb0C62bfJVSPSM8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:785985'),
  ('1036569209409555812', 'The Takeover', 2022, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Annemarie van de Mond, Willem Helwig, Jocelyn Herrewijn', 'Tijs van Marle, Hans Erik Kraan', 'Holly Mae Brood, Géza Weisz, Susan Radder, Frank Lammers, Noortje Herlaar, Walid Benmbarek, Lawrence Sheldon, Jenny Hsia', null, 'Self-proclaimed ethical hacker Mel Bandison''s life is turned upside down when she stops a data breach on a high-tech self-driving bus that also happens to shut down an international criminal network. She then becomes a target and is framed with a deepfake video that “shows” that she murders someone.', 'Self-proclaimed ethical hacker Mel Bandison''s life is turned upside down when she stops a data breach on a high-tech self-driving bus that also happens to shut down an international criminal network. She then becomes a target and is framed with a deepfake video that “shows” that she murders someone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g7rdcofib7HqdlDP1LT7Hmf1f2o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:944864'),
  ('48096664672008196', 'The Taking of Beverly Hills', 1991, 'Action', 'Sidney J. Furie, Frank E. Johnson', 'David J. Burke, Rick Natkin, David Fuller', 'Ken Wahl, Matt Frewer, Harley Jane Kozak, Robert Davi, Lee Ving, Branscombe Richmond, Lyman Ward, Michael Bowen', null, 'A chemical spill has caused the occupants of Beverly Hills to be forcibly evacuated. A retiring football player left behind, finds that the toxic gas emulating from the spill is a bogus front for a heist set up by fired police officers out to plunder the city of all its valuables. Finding himself siding with a corrupt cop who was once apart of the plan until he discovered the city''s mayor had just been blown away, by one of the chief crooks in charge. Now both on the run with no help in sight...both must do whatever they can to stop these murderous looters.', 'A chemical spill has caused the occupants of Beverly Hills to be forcibly evacuated. A retiring football player left behind, finds that the toxic gas emulating from the spill is a bogus front for a heist set up by fired police officers out to plunder the city of all its valuables. Finding himself siding with a corrupt cop who was once apart of the plan until he discovered the city''s mayor had just been blown away, by one of the chief crooks in charge. Now both on the run with no help in sight...both must do whatever they can to stop these murderous looters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6odj5NeJmxn8n56ZCyMMrODVwtM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32045'),
  ('929657417828733181', 'The Taking of Deborah Logan', 2014, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Adam Robitel, Stacy Jannis, Andrew Huebscher', 'Adam Robitel, Gavin Heffernan', 'Jill Larson, Anne Ramsay, Michelle Ang, Ryan Cutrona, Anne Bedian, Brett Gentile, Jeremy DeCarlos, Randell Haynes', 'R', 'What starts as a poignant medical documentary about Deborah Logan''s descent into Alzheimer''s disease and her daughter''s struggles as caregiver degenerates into a maddening portrayal of dementia at its most frightening, as hair-raising events begin to plague the family and crew and an unspeakable malevolence threatens to tear the very fabric of sanity from them all.', 'What starts as a poignant medical documentary about Deborah Logan''s descent into Alzheimer''s disease and her daughter''s struggles as caregiver degenerates into a maddening portrayal of dementia at its most frightening, as hair-raising events begin to plague the family and crew and an unspeakable malevolence threatens to tear the very fabric of sanity from them all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/77i7EBUyQKOUiZeYQ5tWDGQb0AI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:297608'),
  ('786314684335235059', 'The Taking of Pelham 1 2 3', 2009, 'Crime, Thriller, Action', 'Tony Scott, Tobias A. Schliessler, Richard Brooks Burton', 'Brian Helgeland', 'Denzel Washington, John Travolta, John Turturro, Luis Guzmán, James Gandolfini, Michael Rispoli, Gary Basaraba, Alex Kaluzhsky', 'R', 'Armed men hijack a New York City subway train, holding the passengers hostage in return for a ransom, and turning an ordinary day''s work for dispatcher Walter Garber into a face-off with the mastermind behind the crime.', 'Armed men hijack a New York City subway train, holding the passengers hostage in return for a ransom, and turning an ordinary day''s work for dispatcher Walter Garber into a face-off with the mastermind behind the crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rEnyQiBu6goqJfvQXpUZQjpoHVp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18487'),
  ('1031515384354974959', 'The Taking of Pelham One Two Three', 1974, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Joseph Sargent, Owen Roizman, Michael Haley', 'Peter Stone', 'Walter Matthau, Robert Shaw, Martin Balsam, Héctor Elizondo, Earl Hindman, James Broderick, Dick O''Neill, Lee Wallace', 'R', 'In New York, armed men hijack a subway car and demand a ransom for the passengers. Even if it''s paid, how could they get away?', 'In New York, armed men hijack a subway car and demand a ransom for the passengers. Even if it''s paid, how could they get away?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vNhywp9w1DVG6BytxKp4kjtaaGC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8333'),
  ('684659031565056957', 'The Taking of Pelham One Two Three', 1998, 'Crime, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Félix Alcalá', 'Peter Stone', 'Edward James Olmos, Vincent D''Onofrio, Lisa Vidal, Lorraine Bracco, Ingrid Veninger, Donnie Wahlberg, Richard Schiff, Tara Rosling', null, 'In New York, armed men hijack a subway car and demand a ransom for the passengers. Even if it''s paid, how could they get away?', 'In New York, armed men hijack a subway car and demand a ransom for the passengers. Even if it''s paid, how could they get away?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/akBizBjWNtflwja701E8eZqqFdi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:314370'),
  ('894134973217609699', 'The Taking of Power by Louis XIV', 1966, 'Drama, History', 'Roberto Rossellini, Georges Leclerc, Jean-Louis Picavet', 'Michelle Podroznik, Philippe Erlanger, Jean Gruault', 'Jean-Marie Patte, Raymond Jourdan, Silvagni, Katharina Renn, Dominique Vincent, Pierre Barrat, Fernand Fabre, Françoise Ponty', null, 'Cardinal Mazarin dies, leaving a power vacuum in which the young Louis asserts his intention to govern as well as rule. Mazarin''s fiscal advisor, Colbert, warns against Fouquet, the Superintendant who has been systematically looting the treasury and wants to be prime minister. Fouquet believes Louis will soon tire of exercizing power and overplays his hand by offering a bribe to Louis'' mistress to be his ally. She reports this to the king who arrests Fouquet. Louis and Colbert design a brilliant strategy to keep merchants making money, nobles in debt, the urban poor working and fed, and peasants untaxed.', 'Cardinal Mazarin dies, leaving a power vacuum in which the young Louis asserts his intention to govern as well as rule. Mazarin''s fiscal advisor, Colbert, warns against Fouquet, the Superintendant who has been systematically looting the treasury and wants to be prime minister. Fouquet believes Louis will soon tire of exercizing power and overplays his hand by offering a bribe to Louis'' mistress to be his ally. She reports this to the king who arrests Fouquet. Louis and Colbert design a brilliant strategy to keep merchants making money, nobles in debt, the urban poor working and fed, and peasants untaxed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1cwIWZFiJc10CSb8aElC9FtpTx7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69912'),
  ('803481547402126466', 'The Taking of Tiger Mountain', 2014, 'Thriller, War, Adventure', 'Tsui Hark, Choi Sung-Fai, Yuen Bun', 'Li Yang, Huang Jianxin, Tsui Hark', 'Zhang Hanyu, Tony Leung Ka-fai, Tong Liya, Lin Gengxin, Yu Nan, Han Geng, Xie Miao, Chen Xiao', null, 'Yang Zirong disguises himself as a bandit to infiltrate and destroy a bandit group. He joins hands with a hostage, and together, they fight against the warlord, Hawk.', 'Yang Zirong disguises himself as a bandit to infiltrate and destroy a bandit group. He joins hands with a hostage, and together, they fight against the warlord, Hawk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7seDCoxCBa3O4bUbA4xlKtRfs2U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:294992'),
  ('491625153781299029', 'The Tale', 2018, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Jennifer Fox, Ivan Strasburg, Denis Lenoir', 'Jennifer Fox', 'Laura Dern, Isabelle Nélisse, Elizabeth Debicki, Jason Ritter, Frances Conroy, John Heard, Ellen Burstyn, Laura Allen', 'R', 'An investigation into one woman’s memory as she‘s forced to re-examine her first sexual relationship and the stories we tell ourselves in order to survive.', 'An investigation into one woman’s memory as she‘s forced to re-examine her first sexual relationship and the stories we tell ourselves in order to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aguq47xq3qhN807rSyz4lJyhAkX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:369523'),
  ('110826424131982024', 'The Tale of Despereaux', 2008, 'Adventure, Animation, Family', 'Sam Fell, Robert Stevenhagen, Olivier Adam', 'Gary Ross', 'Matthew Broderick, Dustin Hoffman, Emma Watson, Tracey Ullman, Kevin Kline, Sigourney Weaver, William H. Macy, Stanley Tucci', 'G', 'Once upon a time... in the far away kingdom of Dor... lived a brave and virtuous mouse with comically oversized ears who dreamt of becoming a knight. Banished from his home for having such lofty ambitions, Despereaux sets off on an amazing adventure with his good-hearted rat friend Roscuro, who leads him, at long last, on a very noble quest to rescue an endangered princess and save an entire kingdom from darkness.', 'Once upon a time... in the far away kingdom of Dor... lived a brave and virtuous mouse with comically oversized ears who dreamt of becoming a knight. Banished from his home for having such lofty ambitions, Despereaux sets off on an amazing adventure with his good-hearted rat friend Roscuro, who leads him, at long last, on a very noble quest to rescue an endangered princess and save an entire kingdom from darkness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6bBzgQ1uJabDHeGR9QvKrHvHYzG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10199'),
  ('1098808211776427505', 'The Tale of Fedot, the Shooter', 1988, 'Comedy', 'Yuri Isakov, Zinaida Alieva', 'Leonid Filatov', 'Leonid Filatov', null, 'Wanting to destroy the Archer and marry his wife, the King comes up with tests for the hero.', 'Wanting to destroy the Archer and marry his wife, the King comes up with tests for the hero.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yaJSkG2uoOCRH0UCnnrPvteI9VZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:413690'),
  ('147516723445138936', 'The Tale of Fedot, the Shooter', 2008, 'Family, Animation, Adventure, Comedy', 'Lyudmila Steblyanko, Vladimir Golounin, Galina Voropay', 'Lyudmila Steblyanko, Roman Smorodin, Leonid Filatov', 'Sergei Bezrukov, Chulpan Khamatova, Viktor Sukhorukov, Dmitriy Dyuzhev, Aleksandr Revva, Irina Bezrukova, Evgeniya Dobrovolskaya, Konstantin Bronzit', null, 'The king decided to bring a soldier to a nervous breakdown because he fell in love with soldier''s wife.', 'The king decided to bring a soldier to a nervous breakdown because he fell in love with soldier''s wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rro8x07frOKFG1cU9ecZMYwcspj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28833'),
  ('984902756758091957', 'The Tale of Genji', 1987, 'Animation, Drama, Romance', 'Juro Sugimura, Gisaburō Sugii, Tsuneo Maeda', 'Tomomi Tsutsui', 'Morio Kazama, Midori Hagio, Miwako Kaji, Reiko Ōhara, Megumi Yokoyama, Jun Fubuki, Reiko Tajima, Masane Tsukayama', null, 'Genji, the son of the emperor, is the talk of the Kyoto nobility for his charm and good looks, yet he cannot stop himself from pursuing an unobtainable object of desire: his father''s young and beautiful bride. Following the tragic consequences of his obsession, Genji wanders from one affair to another, always seeking some sort of completion to his life.', 'Genji, the son of the emperor, is the talk of the Kyoto nobility for his charm and good looks, yet he cannot stop himself from pursuing an unobtainable object of desire: his father''s young and beautiful bride. Following the tragic consequences of his obsession, Genji wanders from one affair to another, always seeking some sort of completion to his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wrqdkRM5F88ftPEOJvZJH04hBTE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85811'),
  ('471940983632473608', 'The Tale of Iya', 2013, 'Drama, Fantasy, Mystery', 'Tetsuichirô Tsuta', 'Tetsuichirô Tsuta, Masaya Kawamura, Masayuki Ueda', 'Rina Takeda, Shima Onishi, Min Tanaka, Hitoshi Murakami, Sachi Ishimaru, Christopher Pellegrini, Keisuke Yamamoto, Naomi Kawase', null, 'As a tunnel construction project threatens the natural order of one of Japan''s last untouched regions, an old man and his granddaughter Haruna''s humble lifestyle begins to influence the outlook of a man from Tokyo.', 'As a tunnel construction project threatens the natural order of one of Japan''s last untouched regions, an old man and his granddaughter Haruna''s humble lifestyle begins to influence the outlook of a man from Tokyo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dEkz7nE8lN3xXlyTL9OhRkI7uWp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:229173'),
  ('500641782037376229', 'The Tale of John and Mary', 1980, 'Animation, Fantasy, Romance', 'Karel Zeman, Eugen Spálený, Zdeněk Krupa', 'Karel Zeman', 'Otakar Brousek, Antonín Procházka, František Filipovský, Naďa Konvalinková, Jaroslav Moučka, Karel Semerád, Zdeněk Vašek, Hana Zaoralová', null, 'Young knight John travels the world in search of fame and fortune, but also to help others and prove himself. However, things go dire fast and he becomes burdened with life''s hardships. But then he meets a pretty water nymph, Mary.', 'Young knight John travels the world in search of fame and fortune, but also to help others and prove himself. However, things go dire fast and he becomes burdened with life''s hardships. But then he meets a pretty water nymph, Mary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wYcS9kz0I56nrRZFEjU7z46kdBS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51902'),
  ('739340240754040508', 'The Tale of King Crab', 2021, 'Drama', 'Alessio Rigo de Righi, Matteo Zoppis, Simone D''Arcangelo', 'Matteo Zoppis, Alessio Rigo de Righi', 'Gabriele Silli, Maria Alexandra Lungu, Ercole Colnago, Bruno Di Giovanni, Giovanni Morichelli, Renato Sterpa, Severino Sperandio, Eccelso Cassanelli', null, 'Small town in Italy, end of the 19th century. Luciano, a drunk, doesn''t fit in the town. Rebelion against authority and a forbidden love makes him to commit a crime accidentally. To pay for his crime, he is forced into exile on the most remote island in the world, Argentina’s Tierra del Fuego. The hunt for the shipwreck treasure hidden on the island becomes his opportunity for redemption.', 'Small town in Italy, end of the 19th century. Luciano, a drunk, doesn''t fit in the town. Rebelion against authority and a forbidden love makes him to commit a crime accidentally. To pay for his crime, he is forced into exile on the most remote island in the world, Argentina’s Tierra del Fuego. The hunt for the shipwreck treasure hidden on the island becomes his opportunity for redemption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/92TK8iqJCRe6kLAF7zmRVXyQ5JI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:833408'),
  ('994790062256624590', 'The Tale of Sweeney Todd', 1998, 'Horror, Mystery, TV Movie', 'John Schlesinger, Martin Fuhrer', 'Peter Buckman, Peter Shaw', 'Ben Kingsley, Campbell Scott, Joanna Lumley, Selina Boyack, David Wilmot, Sean Flanagan, Katharine Schlesinger', null, 'The fictional tale of the murderous 19th century barber (Ben Kinglsey) who sold his kills to a neighboring butcher (Joanna Lumley) for her renowned meat pies. A young innocent (Selina Boyack) and the dashing inspector (Campbell Scott) who tries to solve the murders are also thrown into the mix.', 'The fictional tale of the murderous 19th century barber (Ben Kinglsey) who sold his kills to a neighboring butcher (Joanna Lumley) for her renowned meat pies. A young innocent (Selina Boyack) and the dashing inspector (Campbell Scott) who tries to solve the murders are also thrown into the mix.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bpvJpskL0ce78UvXFMJJMEwvkji.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139244'),
  ('483323961423185726', 'The Tale of the Dead Princess and the Seven Knights', 1951, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Ivan Ivanov-Vano, Nikolay Voinov, Aleksandra Snezhko-Blotskaya', 'Ivan Ivanov-Vano, Yury Olesha', 'Galina Novozhilova, Aleksey Konsovskiy, Mariya Babanova, Anatoliy Solovyov, Mikhail Nazvanov, Andrei Abrikosov, Mikhail Troyanovsky, Nikolay Litvinov', null, 'Animated film based on the story of Alexander Pushkin. The new king''s wife wants to get rid of their stepdaughter and expels it to certain death in the forest. Princess finds refuge in the forest in the seven bogatyrs. The queen, finds out about it and poisons her...', 'Animated film based on the story of Alexander Pushkin. The new king''s wife wants to get rid of their stepdaughter and expels it to certain death in the forest. Princess finds refuge in the forest in the seven bogatyrs. The queen, finds out about it and poisons her...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kpJI5sykABFWhvh6VI4s3rtwkx4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90323'),
