  ('960915036298384941', 'The Tale of the Fox', 1941, 'Animation, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Władysław Starewicz, Irene Starewicz, Władysław Starewicz', 'Irene Starewicz', 'Romain Bouquet, Sylvain Itkine, Sylvia Bataille, Jaime Plama, Claude Dauphin, Léon Larive, Nicolas Amato, Eddy Debray', null, 'In the kingdom of animals, Master Fox is used to trick and fool everyone. So the King, the Lion, receives more and more complaints about him. He orders that Master Fox is arrested and brought to him.', 'In the kingdom of animals, Master Fox is used to trick and fool everyone. So the King, the Lion, receives more and more complaints about him. He orders that Master Fox is arrested and brought to him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eYt1ddYGIO98MzsprcRjgZuPusW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90034'),
  ('621971339686145174', 'The Tale of the Golden Rooster', 1967, 'Animation, Family', 'Aleksandra Snezhko-Blotskaya', 'Viktor Shklovskiy', 'Aleksei Gribov, Lyudmila Pirogova, Aleksey Konsovskiy, Georgiy Vitsin, Stepan Bubnov, Mariya Vinogradova, Leonid Pirogov, Anatoliy Kubatskiy', null, 'A satirical fairy tale about an old tsar Dadon and a golden cockerel who guarded the borders of his kingdom.', 'A satirical fairy tale about an old tsar Dadon and a golden cockerel who guarded the borders of his kingdom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/27fbJdeqFNGcIu2r3WdtK6qWm81.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90326'),
  ('9751004494187403', 'The Tale of The Princess Kaguya', 2013, 'Animation, Drama, Fantasy', 'Isao Takahata, Kenichi Konishi, Keisuke Nakamura', 'Riko Sakaguchi, Isao Takahata', 'Aki Asakura, Takeo Chii, Nobuko Miyamoto, Kengo Kora, Atsuko Takahata, Tomoko Tabata, Shinosuke Tatekawa, Takaya Kamikawa', 'PG', 'Found inside a shining stalk of bamboo by an old bamboo cutter and his wife, a tiny girl grows rapidly into an exquisite young lady. The mysterious young princess enthrals all who encounter her. But, ultimately, she must confront her fate.', 'Found inside a shining stalk of bamboo by an old bamboo cutter and his wife, a tiny girl grows rapidly into an exquisite young lady. The mysterious young princess enthrals all who encounter her. But, ultimately, she must confront her fate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cQidJuA546OSSXKWXoiCeINDxuj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149871'),
  ('931799016305095656', 'The Tale of the White Serpent', 1958, 'Animation, Fantasy', 'Taiji Yabushita', 'Shin Uehara, Taiji Yabushita', 'Hisaya Morishige, Mariko Miyagi', null, 'As a young boy, Xu-Xian is forced to free his pet, a small snake. Unbeknownst to him, the snake is actually a young snake goddess named Bai-Niang and she is in love with him. Many years later, when they are both adults, the princess is magically transformed into a human and sets out to find her love. But the local wizard believes her to be a vampire, and banishes Xu-Xian from the village in order to save him. Xu-Xian''s pet pandas Panda and Mimi set out to save him and bring him, in the process becoming leaders of an animal gang.', 'As a young boy, Xu-Xian is forced to free his pet, a small snake. Unbeknownst to him, the snake is actually a young snake goddess named Bai-Niang and she is in love with him. Many years later, when they are both adults, the princess is magically transformed into a human and sets out to find her love. But the local wizard believes her to be a vampire, and banishes Xu-Xian from the village in order to save him. Xu-Xian''s pet pandas Panda and Mimi set out to save him and bring him, in the process becoming leaders of an animal gang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yw2uCLVbQauBDLY2vVBCcmAWvD7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64777'),
  ('736207705350354184', 'The Tale of Tillie''s Dragon', 1995, 'Animation, Family', 'Mike Stribling', 'Mike Stribling', 'Kath Soucie, John Kassir, Wayne Powers, Frank Welker, Randy Rudy, Russi Taylor', null, 'Tillie finds the adventure of a lifetime with none other than "Herman" - a fire breathing dragon.', 'Tillie finds the adventure of a lifetime with none other than "Herman" - a fire breathing dragon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lFaZyGtHtoOFkH335wvxuryVPjY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43994'),
  ('1054722680064298333', 'The Tale of Tsar Saltan', 1967, 'Family, Fantasy', 'Aleksandr Ptushko, Igor Gelein, Valentin Zakharov', 'Igor Gelein, Aleksandr Ptushko', 'Vladimir Andreyev, Larisa Golubkina, Oleg Vidov, Kseniya Ryabinkina, Sergei Martinson, Olga Viklandt, Vera Ivleva, Nina Belyayeva', null, 'Based on a famous fairy tale, in verse, by Alexander Pushkin, this ravishingly beautiful fantasy is about love, magic, betrayal and abandoned family. Driven from the Russian court by her sisters'' scheming, the young Tsarina is thrown into the sea in a cask with her infant son. Surviving the storm-tossed voyage, the mother and her now magically-adult son land on a remote island where he falls in love with a Swan Princess in human form, and longs for reunion with his estranged father, Tsar Saltan. Merchants come to the island with news of the tsar, and the prince sends word back to him, but the sisters continue their campaign of lies and trickery to keep them apart.', 'Based on a famous fairy tale, in verse, by Alexander Pushkin, this ravishingly beautiful fantasy is about love, magic, betrayal and abandoned family. Driven from the Russian court by her sisters'' scheming, the young Tsarina is thrown into the sea in a cask with her infant son. Surviving the storm-tossed voyage, the mother and her now magically-adult son land on a remote island where he falls in love with a Swan Princess in human form, and longs for reunion with his estranged father, Tsar Saltan. Merchants come to the island with news of the tsar, and the prince sends word back to him, but the sisters continue their campaign of lies and trickery to keep them apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q5i4c9r14RSYPZiXNcJ0QlEwb7n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14480'),
  ('255769286844871888', 'The Tale of Tsar Saltan', 1984, 'Animation, Family, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Irina Litovskaya, Ivan Ivanov-Vano, Lev Milchin', 'Ivan Ivanov-Vano, Lev Milchin', 'Anastasiya Zuyeva, Mikhail Zimin, Aleksey Zolotnitskiy, Natalya Boronina, Roman Filippov, Alla Pokrovskaya, Nikolay Grabbe, Mariya Vinogradova', null, 'Tale - this is what is everyone from childhood. Give yourself a chance to once again return to the magical world created by Alexander Pushkin. Adventures brave Tsarevich Guidon, beautiful Swan-Tsar Saltan reminded of that love, loyalty and the spirit always wins!', 'Tale - this is what is everyone from childhood. Give yourself a chance to once again return to the magical world created by Alexander Pushkin. Adventures brave Tsarevich Guidon, beautiful Swan-Tsar Saltan reminded of that love, loyalty and the spirit always wins!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wHbncPwdVwXfrSztPNPhoonxzbS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90319'),
  ('494993200310715700', 'The Tale of Tsar Saltan', 2026, 'Family, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Sarik Andreasyan, Kirill Zotkin', 'Aleksey Gravitskiy', 'Pavel Priluchnyy, Aleksey Onezhen, Ilya Shuvalov, Liya Rakhmatullina, Yuliana Mitrofanova', null, 'One dark winter evening, the young Tsar Saltan was lucky enough to find himself a queen from a simple Russian family. He was so impressed by the speech of the young charmer that he married her that same evening, and took her two sisters with him to the palace as servants. However, the insidious girls do not share the happiness of their luckier sister and begin to plot intrigues. Saltan leaves for a long military campaign, during which the young queen gives birth to his son. The evil sisters write a dispatch to the Tsar, where they blatantly lie about the child: they say, the Tsarina gave birth to someone unknown, "neither a son nor a daughter." Saltan is upset, but orders them to wait until he returns. The sisters replace the letter, and as a result, the girl and her son, in the best sadistic traditions, are sealed in a wooden barrel and thrown into the ocean.', 'One dark winter evening, the young Tsar Saltan was lucky enough to find himself a queen from a simple Russian family. He was so impressed by the speech of the young charmer that he married her that same evening, and took her two sisters with him to the palace as servants. However, the insidious girls do not share the happiness of their luckier sister and begin to plot intrigues. Saltan leaves for a long military campaign, during which the young queen gives birth to his son. The evil sisters write a dispatch to the Tsar, where they blatantly lie about the child: they say, the Tsarina gave birth to someone unknown, "neither a son nor a daughter." Saltan is upset, but orders them to wait until he returns. The sisters replace the letter, and as a result, the girl and her son, in the best sadistic traditions, are sealed in a wooden barrel and thrown into the ocean.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fa8BXRSGP2b3gFa0PTvEphHwWOdb.jpg', 'plex:movie:skazka-o-tsare-saltane'),
  ('975699681558320617', 'The Tale of Zatoichi', 1962, 'Adventure, Action, Drama', 'Kenji Misumi, Chikashi Makiura, Toshiaki Kunihara', 'Minoru Inuzuka', 'Shintarō Katsu, Masayo Banri, Ryūzō Shimada, Hajime Mitamura, Shigeru Amachi, Michirō Minami, Eijirō Yanagi, Toshio Chiba', null, 'The adventures of a blind, gambling masseur and master swordsman. Zatoichi targets a yakuza-controlled village, because war with a neighbouring town''s smaller gang is brewing.', 'The adventures of a blind, gambling masseur and master swordsman. Zatoichi targets a yakuza-controlled village, because war with a neighbouring town''s smaller gang is brewing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ohFJMGouR4rwH32QOM9zk4TC000.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16692'),
  ('32336238253364088', 'The Tale of Zatoichi Continues', 1962, 'Adventure, Action, Drama', 'Kazuo Mori, Shozo Honda, Akira Inoue', 'Minoru Inuzuka', 'Shintarō Katsu, Yoshie Mizutani, Masayo Banri, Tomisaburō Wakayama, Yutaka Nakamura, Sonosuke Sawamura, Shōsaku Sugiyama, Yoshito Yamaji', null, 'Returning to the village where a year before he had killed Hirate, a much-admired opponent, Zatoichi encounters another swordsman and former rival in love.', 'Returning to the village where a year before he had killed Hirate, a much-admired opponent, Zatoichi encounters another swordsman and former rival in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wsKbxbughfNsvcK0JVzajyIrFqN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16693'),
  ('1035781787620511673', 'The Talent', 2025, 'Drama', 'Polo Menárguez, José Martín Rosete, Gabriel Cuenca', 'Polo Menárguez, Fernando León de Aranoa', 'Ester Expósito, Pedro Casablanc, Mirela Balić, Juan Pablo Fuentes, Rocío Muñoz-Cobo, Sonia Almarcha, Clara Sans, Carlos Suárez', null, 'A gifted young cellist from a fallen aristocratic family must make an impossible choice when her best friend''s powerful father offers a solution to her family''s desperate situation.', 'A gifted young cellist from a fallen aristocratic family must make an impossible choice when her best friend''s powerful father offers a solution to her family''s desperate situation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5tQOxGjjbCPXbcismTX4gXxkCoa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1351046'),
  ('711982815340314812', 'The Talent of the Hornet', 2020, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Giacomo Cimini, Maurizio Calvesi', 'Lorenzo Collalti, Giacomo Cimini', 'Sergio Castellitto, Lorenzo Richelmy, Anna Foglietta, Marina Occhionero, Cristina Marino, Guglielmo Favilla, Gabriele Greggio, David Coco', null, 'Dj Steph is a young radio deejay on the rise, who gained a lot of popularity on social media and every evening hosts a radio show with a large following, during which he receives calls from his fans. One evening, a call chills him to the bone: a cold-blooded stranger announces on live radio that he plans to take his own life, making himself explode in the middle of the city.', 'Dj Steph is a young radio deejay on the rise, who gained a lot of popularity on social media and every evening hosts a radio show with a large following, during which he receives calls from his fans. One evening, a call chills him to the bone: a cold-blooded stranger announces on live radio that he plans to take his own life, making himself explode in the middle of the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5pAAjVDpq4cCCsZsdivkCLMY6Hm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:670203'),
  ('233029609202745560', 'The Talented Mr. Ripley', 1999, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'John Seale, Anthony Minghella, Alessandro Alberti', 'Anthony Minghella', 'Matt Damon, Gwyneth Paltrow, Jude Law, Cate Blanchett, Philip Seymour Hoffman, Jack Davenport, James Rebhorn, Sergio Rubini', 'R', 'Tom Ripley is a calculating young man who believes it''s better to be a fake somebody than a real nobody. Opportunity knocks in the form of a wealthy U.S. shipbuilder who hires Tom to travel to Italy to bring back his playboy son, Dickie. Ripley worms his way into the idyllic lives of Dickie and his girlfriend, plunging into a daring scheme of duplicity, lies and murder.', 'Tom Ripley is a calculating young man who believes it''s better to be a fake somebody than a real nobody. Opportunity knocks in the form of a wealthy U.S. shipbuilder who hires Tom to travel to Italy to bring back his playboy son, Dickie. Ripley worms his way into the idyllic lives of Dickie and his girlfriend, plunging into a daring scheme of duplicity, lies and murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ojHgqtIR41O2qLKa7LFUVj0cZa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1213'),
  ('92486714740144398', 'The Tales of Hoffmann', 1951, 'Music, Fantasy, Romance', 'Michael Powell, Emeric Pressburger, Christopher Challis', 'Michael Powell, Emeric Pressburger, Dennis Arundell', 'Moira Shearer, Ludmilla Tchérina, Pamela Brown, Léonide Massine, Ann Ayars, Robert Helpmann, Frederick Ashton, Robert Rounseville', 'NR', 'A melancholy poet reflects on three women he loved and lost in the past: a mechanical performing doll, a Venetian courtesan, and the consumptive daughter of a celebrated composer.', 'A melancholy poet reflects on three women he loved and lost in the past: a mechanical performing doll, a Venetian courtesan, and the consumptive daughter of a celebrated composer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3rqMnYSLjFa9OYwoLhXLVacwhQ7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44334'),
  ('516484689137354949', 'The Talisman', 1907, 'Fantasy', 'Albert Capellani, Segundo de Chomón', null, null, null, '"Le Pied de Mouton" is an adaptation of an old French stage play titled "The Talisman" written by Alphonse Martainville and César Ribié. The atmosphere is hilarious, oneiric and delicious. The film tells the story of Gusman and Léonora, two lovers who must deal with many spells and troubles in order to preserve their love. The tale is full of princes and princesses, damsels in distress, good witches and wicked lords and is an amazing piece of work.', '"Le Pied de Mouton" is an adaptation of an old French stage play titled "The Talisman" written by Alphonse Martainville and César Ribié. The atmosphere is hilarious, oneiric and delicious. The film tells the story of Gusman and Léonora, two lovers who must deal with many spells and troubles in order to preserve their love. The tale is full of princes and princesses, damsels in distress, good witches and wicked lords and is an amazing piece of work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AgMGKG2Z1ZvzH1LzkBUQTeDszeW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196544'),
  ('252131814508572442', 'The Talk of the Town', 1942, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'George Stevens, Ted Tetzlaff, Morris Stoloff', 'Irwin Shaw, Sidney Buchman', 'Cary Grant, Jean Arthur, Ronald Colman, Edgar Buchanan, Glenda Farrell, Charles Dingle, Emma Dunn, Rex Ingram', 'NR', 'Hilarity ensues when a falsely accused fugitive from justice hides at the house of his childhood friend, which she has recently rented to a high-principled law teacher.', 'Hilarity ensues when a falsely accused fugitive from justice hides at the house of his childhood friend, which she has recently rented to a high-principled law teacher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/naMSxieb5cD1bGCu0rZ7zLJ6mtA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23159'),
  ('776886212321615757', 'The Tall Blond Man with One Black Shoe', 1972, 'Comedy, Mystery', 'Yves Robert, René Mathelin, Patrick Bureau', 'Francis Veber', 'Pierre Richard, Bernard Blier, Jean Rochefort, Mireille Darc, Paul Le Person, Jean Carmet, Colette Castel, Maurice Barrier', null, 'A hapless orchestra player becomes an unwitting pawn of rival factions within the French secret service after he is chosen as a decoy by being identified as a super secret agent.', 'A hapless orchestra player becomes an unwitting pawn of rival factions within the French secret service after he is chosen as a decoy by being identified as a super secret agent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x7LSP7cMxkjNP5fOAjj5WmjUAql.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12089'),
