  ('471369852366723911', 'The Tall Man', 2012, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Pascal Laugier, Kamal Derkaoui, John Trapman', 'Pascal Laugier', 'Jessica Biel, Jodelle Ferland, Stephen McHattie, William B. Davis, Samantha Ferris, Colleen Wheeler, Eve Harlow, Janet Wright', 'R', 'When her child goes missing, a mother looks to unravel the legend of the Tall Man, an entity who allegedly abducts children.', 'When her child goes missing, a mother looks to unravel the legend of the Tall Man, an entity who allegedly abducts children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iZGQsDlYcNaJf2MVopAZHs69FI4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86597'),
