  ('401365398350354094', 'The Tall Stranger', 1957, 'Western', 'Thomas Carr, Wilfrid M. Cline', 'Christopher Knopf', 'Joel McCrea, Virginia Mayo, Barry Kelley, Michael Ansara, Whit Bissell, James Dobson, George N. Neise, Michael Pate', 'NR', 'A Union soldier returns to his western home at the end of the Civil War and finds himself caught in the middle of a land war between his greedy half-brother and a wagon train of Confederate homesteaders.', 'A Union soldier returns to his western home at the end of the Civil War and finds himself caught in the middle of a land war between his greedy half-brother and a wagon train of Confederate homesteaders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/934fk9OnRo0YVMJRlFMg9AATziN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113697'),
