  ('910033898950839862', 'The Taming of the Shrew', 1929, 'Comedy', 'Sam Taylor, Karl Struss', 'Sam Taylor', 'Mary Pickford, Douglas Fairbanks, Edwin Maxwell, Joseph Cawthorn, Clyde Cook, Dorothy Jordan, Geoffrey Wardwell, Wilson Benge', 'NR', 'Adapted from Shakespeare''s play: Baptista Minola, a wealthy resident of Padua, is the father of Katherine and Bianca. The younger daughter, Bianca, is charming and has many suitors. But her father will not allow Bianca to be married until her older sister, who is notoriously quarrelsome and bad-tempered, is married first. When Petruchio comes from Verona to Padua in search of a wife, he hears of this situation, and he accepts the challenge of trying to woo and marry the ill-natured Katherine.', 'Adapted from Shakespeare''s play: Baptista Minola, a wealthy resident of Padua, is the father of Katherine and Bianca. The younger daughter, Bianca, is charming and has many suitors. But her father will not allow Bianca to be married until her older sister, who is notoriously quarrelsome and bad-tempered, is married first. When Petruchio comes from Verona to Padua in search of a wife, he hears of this situation, and he accepts the challenge of trying to woo and marry the ill-natured Katherine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rjFHAo0Fy88KXSWJ9a8T0NtOx1n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91715'),
  ('1082962775968361749', 'The Taming of the Shrew', 1961, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Sergey Kolosov, Vladimir Yakovlev', 'Sergey Kolosov', 'Lyudmila Kasatkina, Andrei Popov, Vladimir Blagoobrazov, Olga Krasina, Vladimir Zeldin, Vladimir Soshalsky, Yuriy Nikulin, Nikolai Pastukhov', null, 'Classic adaptation of the even more classic play by William Shakespeare.', 'Classic adaptation of the even more classic play by William Shakespeare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8J1nDbGGPTMRwFmtB1xgHFwORaQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81361'),
  ('584124164484742242', 'The Taming of the Shrew', 1967, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Franco Zeffirelli, Rinaldo Ricci, Carlo Lastricati', 'Suso Cecchi d''Amico, Paul Dehn, Franco Zeffirelli', 'Elizabeth Taylor, Richard Burton, Natasha Pyne, Michael York, Cyril Cusack, Michael Hordern, Alfred Lynch, Alan Webb', null, 'Italy, 16th century. Petruchio, a choleric, lying and poor rural landowner from Verona, arrives in Padua in search of fortune and a wife, while Baptista, a wealthy merchant, announces that he will not allow Bianca, his youngest daughter, to marry until the temperamental and unruly Katherina, his eldest daughter, does.', 'Italy, 16th century. Petruchio, a choleric, lying and poor rural landowner from Verona, arrives in Padua in search of fortune and a wife, while Baptista, a wealthy merchant, announces that he will not allow Bianca, his youngest daughter, to marry until the temperamental and unruly Katherina, his eldest daughter, does.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2LpU3kyg1PowiQoEHf7oUXOUmVa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25560'),
  ('939182538195063057', 'The Taming of the Shrewd', 2022, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Anna Wieczur, Maciej Majchrzak', 'Wojciech Saramonowicz, Weronika Murek, Hanna Węsierska', 'Magdalena Lamparska, Mikołaj Roznerski, Piotr Cyrwus, Tomasz Sapryk, Dorota Landowska, Elżbieta Trzaskoś, Magdalena Schejbal, Jan Kardasiński', null, 'When a heartbroken scientist moves back home to start over, her scheming brother hires a handsome stranger to convince her to sell their land.', 'When a heartbroken scientist moves back home to start over, her scheming brother hires a handsome stranger to convince her to sell their land.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4JXsbuWTHWy9KieVRef5CmrzDN6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:953233'),
