  ('1087098665806057618', 'The Taste of Things', 2023, 'Romance, Drama', 'Trần Anh Hùng, Jonathan Ricquebourg, Gigi Akoka', 'Trần Anh Hùng', 'Benoît Magimel, Juliette Binoche, Patrick d''Assumçao, Emmanuel Salinger, Jan Hammenecker, Frédéric Fisbach, Galatea Bellugi, Pierre Gagnaire', 'PG-13', 'Set in 1889 France, Dodin Bouffant is a chef living with his personal cook and lover Eugénie. They share a long history of gastronomy and love but Eugénie refuses to marry Dodin, so the food lover decides to do something he has never done before: cook for her.', 'Set in 1889 France, Dodin Bouffant is a chef living with his personal cook and lover Eugénie. They share a long history of gastronomy and love but Eugénie refuses to marry Dodin, so the food lover decides to do something he has never done before: cook for her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gZsXtzwI3CgCvKF5TkgHVhhbEg1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:964960'),
  ('608064406112922265', 'The Taste of Violence', 1961, 'Western', 'Jacques Robin, Robert Hossein', 'Robert Hossein, Louis Martin, Claude Desailly', 'Robert Hossein, Giovanna Ralli, Mario Adorf, Hans H. Neubert, Madeleine Robinson, Dany Jacquet, Relja Bašić, Petar Dobrić', null, 'Perez kidnaps the President''s daughter to trade her for imprisoned revolutionaries.', 'Perez kidnaps the President''s daughter to trade her for imprisoned revolutionaries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oh5cJ8Ktn5WUzvR2smWbMJpwPFy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:168188'),
  ('34860954416137962', 'The Tasters', 2025, 'Drama, History', 'Silvio Soldini, Renato Berta, Federico Parisi Asaro', 'Doriana Leondeff, Silvio Soldini, Cristina Comencini', 'Elisa Schlott, Max Riemelt, Alma Hasun, Emma Falck, Olga von Luckwald, Thea Rasche, Berit Vander, Kriemhild Hamann', null, 'In autumn 1943, in Gross-Partsch, 26-year-old Rosa, who had come from Berlin to stay with the parents of her husband Gregor, who was fighting on the Russian front, was taken by the SS to a mysterious place. Forced to taste a dish, she joins the group of tasters responsible for checking that the food destined for Hitler is not poisoned.', 'In autumn 1943, in Gross-Partsch, 26-year-old Rosa, who had come from Berlin to stay with the parents of her husband Gregor, who was fighting on the Russian front, was taken by the SS to a mysterious place. Forced to taste a dish, she joins the group of tasters responsible for checking that the food destined for Hitler is not poisoned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j1BMHOfmEARIPeJr32GAyROaFlj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1291712'),
  ('995690538765115687', 'The Tasting', 2022, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Maureen Miguel, Bastien Blum, Clémence Benard', 'Ivan Calbérac', 'Isabelle Carré, Bernard Campan, Éric Viellard, Mounir Amamra, Olivier Claverie, Geneviève Mnich, Raphaël Thiéry, Pierre Bénézit', null, 'Hortense has a big heart and no one to share it with except her cat, her embittered mom, and a group of homeless people for whom she prepares a gourmet dinner at the local church every week. While buying a nice bottle of wine, Hortense meets Jacques, a fifty-something, grumpy local cellarman. Eager to see him again, she attends a chaotic wine tasting in Jacques’ shop - meeting his best friend who clumsily tries to seduce her, and his new apprentice who turns out to have a rare gift for tasting as well as an unfiltered honesty. As Hortense and Jacques grow closer and closer, their past begins to catch up to them.', 'Hortense has a big heart and no one to share it with except her cat, her embittered mom, and a group of homeless people for whom she prepares a gourmet dinner at the local church every week. While buying a nice bottle of wine, Hortense meets Jacques, a fifty-something, grumpy local cellarman. Eager to see him again, she attends a chaotic wine tasting in Jacques’ shop - meeting his best friend who clumsily tries to seduce her, and his new apprentice who turns out to have a rare gift for tasting as well as an unfiltered honesty. As Hortense and Jacques grow closer and closer, their past begins to catch up to them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7a2kxKAqQmnxZCTuqGatYrD3SUD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:928202'),
  ('1126803911373936026', 'The Tattered Dress', 1957, 'Crime, Drama', 'Jack Arnold, Carl E. Guthrie, David Silver', 'George Zuckerman', 'Jeff Chandler, Jeanne Crain, Jack Carson, Gail Russell, Elaine Stewart, George Tobias, Edward Andrews, Phillip Reed', null, 'After a wild night, wealthy Michael Reston''s adulterous wife Charleen comes home with her ripe young body barely concealed by a dress in rags; murder results. Top New York defense lawyer J.G. Blane, whose own marriage exists in name only, arrives in Desert View, Nevada to find the townsfolk and politically powerful Sheriff Hoak distinctly hostile to the Restons. In due course, Blane discovers he''s been "taken for a ride," and that quiet desert communities can be deadly.', 'After a wild night, wealthy Michael Reston''s adulterous wife Charleen comes home with her ripe young body barely concealed by a dress in rags; murder results. Top New York defense lawyer J.G. Blane, whose own marriage exists in name only, arrives in Desert View, Nevada to find the townsfolk and politically powerful Sheriff Hoak distinctly hostile to the Restons. In due course, Blane discovers he''s been "taken for a ride," and that quiet desert communities can be deadly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vaQzmffNFyxtavsCMW3dRNSyAqY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77965'),
  ('1062990950599657112', 'The Tattoo', 1968, 'Comedy', 'Denys de La Patellière, Sacha Vierny, Bernard Stora', 'Alphonse Boudard', 'Jean Gabin, Louis de Funès, Dominique Davray, Paul Mercey, Yves Barsacq, Henri Virlogeux, Hubert Deschamps, Jean-Pierre Darras', null, 'An art dealer wants to buy a Modigliani, which is tattooed on the back of an old soldier.', 'An art dealer wants to buy a Modigliani, which is tattooed on the back of an old soldier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AvxINMO5KmpUNBZw3DpYE9CpFnA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11912'),
  ('720977049675056161', 'The Tattoo Connection', 1978, 'Action', 'Lee Tso-Nam, Chuang Yan-Chien', 'Chang Hsin-Yi, Luk Pak-Sang', 'Jim Kelly, Dorian Tan Tao-Liang, Chan Sing, Lee Hoi-Gei, Norman Wingrove, Bobby Canavarro, Cheng Fu-Hung, Chiang Tao', null, 'When a diamond is stolen in Hong Kong, the company insuring the diamond sends a former CIA agent to Hong Kong to retrieve it. Meanwhile, one of the thieves begins to have a change of heart because his girlfriend wants him to leave his criminal organization.', 'When a diamond is stolen in Hong Kong, the company insuring the diamond sends a former CIA agent to Hong Kong to retrieve it. Meanwhile, one of the thieves begins to have a change of heart because his girlfriend wants him to leave his criminal organization.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1gu8aBmcWrYF154wY96SMLf7t6c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95955'),
  ('368775853988242980', 'The Tattooed Stranger', 1950, 'Crime, Drama', 'Edward Montagne, William O. Steiner', 'Philip H. Reisman Jr.', 'John Miles, Patricia Barry, Walter Kinsella, Frank Tweddell, Rod McLennan, Henry Lasko, Arthur L. Jarrett, Jim Boles', 'NR', 'Detectives investigate the Central Park murder of a young woman with a Marine Corps tattoo.', 'Detectives investigate the Central Park murder of a young woman with a Marine Corps tattoo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/khkK56q2rTZ5rKEwMD0weO1Y02J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59165'),
  ('92408196039845976', 'The Tattooist', 2007, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Peter Burger, Leon Narbey', null, 'Jason Behr, Mia Blake, David Fane, Robbie Magasiva, Caroline Cheong, Michael Hurst, Nathaniel Lees', 'R', 'American tattoo artist Jake Sawyer wanders the world, exploring and exploiting ethnic themes in his tattoo designs. At a tattoo expo in Singapore, he gets his first glimpse at the exotic world of traditional Samoan tattoo (tatau), and, in a thoughtless act, unwittingly unleashes a powerful angry spirit. In his devastating journey into Pacific mysticism, Jake must find a way to save his new love, Sina and recover his own soul.', 'American tattoo artist Jake Sawyer wanders the world, exploring and exploiting ethnic themes in his tattoo designs. At a tattoo expo in Singapore, he gets his first glimpse at the exotic world of traditional Samoan tattoo (tatau), and, in a thoughtless act, unwittingly unleashes a powerful angry spirit. In his devastating journey into Pacific mysticism, Jake must find a way to save his new love, Sina and recover his own soul.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qwOZo4ACw54IxcjnAJW71pXfaFO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14440'),
  ('808419328059519089', 'The Tax Collector', 2020, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'David Ayer, Salvatore Totino, Robert Dierx', 'David Ayer', 'Bobby Soto, Cinthya Carmona, George López, Elpidia Carrillo, Shia LaBeouf, Lana Parrilla, Chelsea Rendon, Cheyenne Rae Hernandez', 'R', 'David Cuevas is a family man who works as a gangland tax collector for high ranking Los Angeles gang members. He makes collections across the city with his partner Creeper making sure people pay up or will see retaliation. An old threat returns to Los Angeles that puts everything David loves in harm’s way.', 'David Cuevas is a family man who works as a gangland tax collector for high ranking Los Angeles gang members. He makes collections across the city with his partner Creeper making sure people pay up or will see retaliation. An old threat returns to Los Angeles that puts everything David loves in harm’s way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3eg0kGC2Xh0vhydJHO37Sp4cmMt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:531499'),
  ('283735414607596915', 'The Te$t', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Dani de la Orden', 'Jordi Vallejo', 'Alberto San Juan, Miren Ibarguren, Blanca Suárez, Carlos Santos, Antonio Resines, Luna Fulgencio', null, 'What would you choose: be a little rich now, or wait ten years and be filthy rich? Could you wait this long? Why? And most importantly, could you come to terms with your life partner? The protagonists will have to choose between the possibility of opting for 100,000 euros at the present time or obtaining a million euros after ten years...', 'What would you choose: be a little rich now, or wait ten years and be filthy rich? Could you wait this long? Why? And most importantly, could you come to terms with your life partner? The protagonists will have to choose between the possibility of opting for 100,000 euros at the present time or obtaining a million euros after ten years...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r5DbPQNmPJYYJC0nv6di13Y2dB3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:901944'),
  ('613617494591002895', 'The Teacher', 1974, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Howard Avedis, Alfred Taylor', 'Howard Avedis', 'Angel Tompkins, Jay North, Anthony James, Marlene Schmidt, Barry Atwater, Med Flory, Rudy Herrera Jr., Quinn O''Hara', 'R', '18-year-old Sean''s first summer after completing high school is much spent with 28-year-old teacher Diane, who''s husband is too often motorcycle-racing instead of with her. Wacko Ralph also has "the hots" for Diane; and it doesn''t help that Sean was with Ralph''s younger brother, Lou, when Lou died', '18-year-old Sean''s first summer after completing high school is much spent with 28-year-old teacher Diane, who''s husband is too often motorcycle-racing instead of with her. Wacko Ralph also has "the hots" for Diane; and it doesn''t help that Sean was with Ralph''s younger brother, Lou, when Lou died', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nQzUltLrstyub09eCPsnQPkErHc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87884'),
