  ('774649021951435922', 'The Telephone', 1988, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Rip Torn, David Claessen', 'Harry Nilsson, Terry Southern', 'Whoopi Goldberg, John Heard, Elliott Gould, Hervé Villechaize, Severn Darden, Amy Wright, Don Blakely, James Victor', 'R', 'Crazy out of work actress Vashti Blue spends all her time in her small apartment with her pet owl and her telephone, which she uses to try and solve all her problems with life.', 'Crazy out of work actress Vashti Blue spends all her time in her small apartment with her pet owl and her telephone, which she uses to try and solve all her problems with life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d1KjPppx1CA5ImPCE92L8gAMBvo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91445'),
