  ('289377597833816330', 'The Telephone Book', 1971, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Jay Wolf, Nelson Lyon, David Weisman', 'Nelson Lyon', 'Sarah Kennedy, Norman Rose, James Harder, Jill Clayburgh, Ondine, Barry Morse, Ultra Violet, Geri Miller', null, 'A sexually voracious young woman receives a dirty phone call from a stranger; so satisfied by the experience, she sets out to find him somewhere in New York City.', 'A sexually voracious young woman receives a dirty phone call from a stranger; so satisfied by the experience, she sets out to find him somewhere in New York City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p3iiyFpilsJjjJGkVg5YNvdaUS6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121111'),
  ('530445252708516534', 'The Telephone Box', 1972, 'Drama, Horror', 'Antonio Mercero, Mariano Canales, Federico G. Larraya', 'Antonio Mercero, José Luis Garci', 'José Luis López Vázquez, Agustín González, Goyo Lebrero, Tito García, Carmen Martínez Sierra, Carmen Luján, Felipe Martín Puertas, José Montijano', null, 'A man gets trapped inside a telephone box and nobody is able to free him.', 'A man gets trapped inside a telephone box and nobody is able to free him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sPvPKrnF9nmtqUkrv9pWsTeRgj1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52943'),
  ('759761801524505588', 'The Telescope of Time', 2014, 'Drama, Music', 'Alceu Valença, Luís Abramo', 'Alceu Valença', 'Irandhir Santos, Hermila Guedes, Alceu Valença, Ari de Arimatéria, Ceceu Valença, Servílio de Holanda, Ivair Rodrigues', null, 'Musical drama that uses popular myths of Brazilian culture to narrate a story full of meetings and misunderstandings, betrayals and loves, crimes and punishments. Against the backdrop of the Pernambuco backlands – its people and its culture, the cordel, the bandits, the cinema and the circus – the film is a universal drama, laden with unique poetry, where reality and the dreamworld mingle.', 'Musical drama that uses popular myths of Brazilian culture to narrate a story full of meetings and misunderstandings, betrayals and loves, crimes and punishments. Against the backdrop of the Pernambuco backlands – its people and its culture, the cordel, the bandits, the cinema and the circus – the film is a universal drama, laden with unique poetry, where reality and the dreamworld mingle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gl1Dw9IHNotcblyraZSoecn7kGu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:299800'),
  ('352751105654038372', 'The Tell-Tale Heart', 1941, 'Crime, Horror', 'Jules Dassin, Paul Vogel', 'Doane R. Hoag', 'Joseph Schildkraut, Roman Bohnen, Oscar O''Shea, Will Wright', 'NR', 'In this classic Edgar Allan Poe story, a man commits a murder, but afterward the victim''s beating heart torments the murderer''s mind.', 'In this classic Edgar Allan Poe story, a man commits a murder, but afterward the victim''s beating heart torments the murderer''s mind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tP8YSWVCUe6MSwGZ1ikjO7VR2Q3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141046'),
  ('327765061857222022', 'The Tell-Tale Heart', 1953, 'Animation, Horror, Crime', 'Ted Parmelee', 'Bill Scott, Fred Grable', 'James Mason', null, 'A man''s sanity is a point of contention as he confesses to murdering an elderly man, driven by the victim''s pale blue ''vulture eye'', culminating in guilt-induced auditory hallucinations of the victim''s beating heart.', 'A man''s sanity is a point of contention as he confesses to murdering an elderly man, driven by the victim''s pale blue ''vulture eye'', culminating in guilt-induced auditory hallucinations of the victim''s beating heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AsUpsdGwNbFRpPG6BxvshwFRaut.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127401'),
  ('1024450336945340000', 'The Tell-Tale Heart', 1960, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Ernest Morris, James Wilson', 'Brian Clemens, Eldon Howard', 'Laurence Payne, Adrienne Corri, Dermot Walsh, Selma Vaz Dias, John Scott, John Martin, Annette Carell, Rosemary Rotheray', 'NR', 'A man''s sanity is a point of contention as he confesses to murdering an elderly man, driven by the victim''s pale blue ''vulture eye'', culminating in guilt-induced auditory hallucinations of the victim''s beating heart.', 'A man''s sanity is a point of contention as he confesses to murdering an elderly man, driven by the victim''s pale blue ''vulture eye'', culminating in guilt-induced auditory hallucinations of the victim''s beating heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q0w3FBZpRHrR5JmcdOngTssrq04.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:158873'),
  ('915270305107466736', 'The Tell-Tale Heart', 2009, 'Horror, Crime', 'Robert Eggers, Jarin Blaschke', 'Robert Eggers', 'Carrington Vilmont, Dan Charlton, Dan Murphy, Nathan Allison, Richard Easton', null, 'Within the chambers of a desolate house, a solitary servant tends to his invalid master. Tangibly detailed period design and hauntingly lifelike puppetry unearth the dreamworld of Poe.', 'Within the chambers of a desolate house, a solitary servant tends to his invalid master. Tangibly detailed period design and hauntingly lifelike puppetry unearth the dreamworld of Poe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yLs44Sx08WAHhgvnh0XIg7s5e9F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:383802'),
  ('611801623291478697', 'The Telling', 2009, 'Horror, Thriller', 'A.P. Rick, Nicholas Carpenter, Harry Grigsby', 'Joe Lessard', 'Bridget Marquardt, Holly Madison, Najarra Townsend, Angela Nicholas, Jean Louise O''Sullivan, Ashley Noel, Nicole Zeoli, Christine Nguyen', 'R', 'In this horror anthology film, three girls pledge the most popular - and cruelest - sorority on campus. For their final task, they must tell the scariest story they know. Containing three distinct stories - one featuring a murderous doll, one a has-been actress and her run in with a film crew of the undead and, finally, a hunt-and-kill fright-fest.', 'In this horror anthology film, three girls pledge the most popular - and cruelest - sorority on campus. For their final task, they must tell the scariest story they know. Containing three distinct stories - one featuring a murderous doll, one a has-been actress and her run in with a film crew of the undead and, finally, a hunt-and-kill fright-fest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hAL5hsqZWBHqdTgT9dGggcFtpzB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16722'),
  ('239255881778573081', 'The Telltale Heart', 1928, 'Drama, Horror', 'Charles Klein, Leon Shamroy, Leon Shamroy', 'Charles Klein', 'Otto Matieson, William Herford, Hans Fuerberg, Charles Darvas', null, 'An insane man first loves then grows to hate his neighbor, an old man whose penetrating gaze unnerves the insane man. He plans a perfect crime and executes it one night. The next day, two officers knock on the insane man''s door, investigating a shriek heard in the night. The insane man invites them in, answers their questions, and submits to an examination of his eyes by one of the officers, who proclaims him innocent. The insane man invites them to stay and relax awhile, then regales them with his theories of crime. His heart begins to beat louder. Angles on the set are skewed to suggest the man''s internal disarray.', 'An insane man first loves then grows to hate his neighbor, an old man whose penetrating gaze unnerves the insane man. He plans a perfect crime and executes it one night. The next day, two officers knock on the insane man''s door, investigating a shriek heard in the night. The insane man invites them in, answers their questions, and submits to an examination of his eyes by one of the officers, who proclaims him innocent. The insane man invites them to stay and relax awhile, then regales them with his theories of crime. His heart begins to beat louder. Angles on the set are skewed to suggest the man''s internal disarray.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tvWuDc0a7230xduESz3R6lJlbEr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150196'),
  ('653023150720867477', 'The Temp', 1993, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller, Horror', 'Tom Holland, Steve Yaconelli', 'Kevin Falls', 'Timothy Hutton, Lara Flynn Boyle, Dwight Schultz, Oliver Platt, Steven Weber, Colleen Flynn, Faye Dunaway, Scott Coffey', 'R', 'A series of mysterious accidents at a food company lead a manager to suspect his impressive new temporary secretary.', 'A series of mysterious accidents at a food company lead a manager to suspect his impressive new temporary secretary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/87h7OsuTWZURTZ1oSNfLl8bqfbO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17168'),
  ('488225685503994570', 'The Tempest', 1979, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Derek Jarman, Peter Middleton', 'Derek Jarman', 'Heathcote Williams, Toyah Willcox, Karl Johnson, Jack Birkett, Peter Bull, David Meyer, Neil Cunningham, Richard Warwick', null, 'Prospero, a potent magician, lives on a desolate isle with his virginal daughter, Miranda. He''s in exile, banished from his duchy by his usurping brother and the King of Naples. Providence brings these enemies near; aided by his vassal the spirit Ariel, Prospero conjures a tempest to wreck the Italian ship. The king''s son, thinking all others lost, becomes Prospero''s prisoner, falling in love with Miranda and she with him. Prospero''s brother and the king wander the island, as do a drunken cook and sailor, who conspire with Caliban, Prospero''s beastly slave, to murder Prospero. Prospero wants reason to triumph, Ariel wants his freedom, Miranda a husband; the sailors want to dance.', 'Prospero, a potent magician, lives on a desolate isle with his virginal daughter, Miranda. He''s in exile, banished from his duchy by his usurping brother and the King of Naples. Providence brings these enemies near; aided by his vassal the spirit Ariel, Prospero conjures a tempest to wreck the Italian ship. The king''s son, thinking all others lost, becomes Prospero''s prisoner, falling in love with Miranda and she with him. Prospero''s brother and the king wander the island, as do a drunken cook and sailor, who conspire with Caliban, Prospero''s beastly slave, to murder Prospero. Prospero wants reason to triumph, Ariel wants his freedom, Miranda a husband; the sailors want to dance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cX2q8UXpoI5NeYuBVZPNzRHy7Fr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104874'),
  ('468711504459779360', 'The Tempest', 1998, 'Drama, Fantasy, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Jack Bender, Steven Shaw', 'James S. Henerson', 'Peter Fonda, John Glover, Harold Perrineau, Katherine Heigl, John Pyper-Ferguson, Eddie Mills, Dennis Redfield, Donzaleigh Abernathy', null, 'An adaptation of Shakespeare''s classic is set in the Mississippi bayous during the Civil War.', 'An adaptation of Shakespeare''s classic is set in the Mississippi bayous during the Civil War.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xqwfH7aIqB8dsjN2s05rzBbhoLm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113885'),
  ('550778899796781659', 'The Tempest', 2010, 'Drama, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Julie Taymor, Stuart Dryburgh', 'Julie Taymor', 'Helen Mirren, Felicity Jones, Reeve Carney, David Strathairn, Tom Conti, Alan Cumming, Chris Cooper, Ben Whishaw', 'PG-13', 'An adaptation of the play by William Shakespeare. Prospera (a female version of Shakespeare''s Prospero) is the usurped ruler of Milan who has been banished to a mysterious island with her daughter. Using her magical powers, she draws her enemies to the island to exact her revenge.', 'An adaptation of the play by William Shakespeare. Prospera (a female version of Shakespeare''s Prospero) is the usurped ruler of Milan who has been banished to a mysterious island with her daughter. Using her magical powers, she draws her enemies to the island to exact her revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9xnDtCsEoaooYYwmqrB2PBFVPag.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44638'),
  ('434063636145501774', 'The Temple of Wild Geese', 1962, 'Drama', 'Yūzō Kawashima, Eiji Nishizawa, Hiroshi Murai', 'Yūzō Kawashima, Kazuo Funahashi', 'Ayako Wakao, Masao Mishima, Isao Kimura, Kuniichi Takami, Ganjirō Nakamura II, Mineko Yorozuyo, Yoshiko Kamo, Shoichi Ozawa', null, 'Satoko is a mistress by trade or fate: when her master, the silkscreen artist of the Kohoan Temple in Kyoto, dies, she is given to the temple''s lascivious head priest Kikuchi. She is drawn to a melancholy young acolyte, Jinen, who has observed the profligacy of his cruel master and Satoko''s utter dependence on the man. Jinen is both fascinated and disturbed by Satoko''s interest in him; he is similarly caught between loathing of Kikuchi and of the dark circumstances of his birth and his own moral weakness. The story unfolds in a dreamlike manner—a flashback inspired by a now-infamous image on a silkscreen in the souvenir shop at the so-called Temple of the Wild Geese.', 'Satoko is a mistress by trade or fate: when her master, the silkscreen artist of the Kohoan Temple in Kyoto, dies, she is given to the temple''s lascivious head priest Kikuchi. She is drawn to a melancholy young acolyte, Jinen, who has observed the profligacy of his cruel master and Satoko''s utter dependence on the man. Jinen is both fascinated and disturbed by Satoko''s interest in him; he is similarly caught between loathing of Kikuchi and of the dark circumstances of his birth and his own moral weakness. The story unfolds in a dreamlike manner—a flashback inspired by a now-infamous image on a silkscreen in the souvenir shop at the so-called Temple of the Wild Geese.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5tQoS5jK9DH5f4W8CCvXDKcDKsX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:333361'),
  ('249106706325329888', 'The Temple Woods Gang', 2022, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Rabah Ameur-Zaïmeche, Pierre-Hubert Martin', 'Rabah Ameur-Zaïmeche', 'Régis Laroche, Marie Loustalot, Philippe Petit, Kenji Meunier, Salim Ameur-Zaïmeche, Kamel Mezdour, Nassim Zazoui, Rida Mezdour', null, 'A retired military man lives in the Temple Woods housing project. Just as he’s burying his mother, his neighbour Bébé, who belongs to a gang of robbers from the area, is preparing to rob the convoy of a wealthy Arab prince.', 'A retired military man lives in the Temple Woods housing project. Just as he’s burying his mother, his neighbour Bébé, who belongs to a gang of robbers from the area, is preparing to rob the convoy of a wealthy Arab prince.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vopTdljiK7sUj92PWkMan6ruDE3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1000517'),
  ('913918577862295427', 'The Temptation', 2022, 'Drama', 'Pappi Corsicato, Rocco Marra', 'Pappi Corsicato, Luca Infascelli', 'Giuseppe Maggio, Margherita Vicario, Carolina Sala, Sandra Ceccarelli, Maurizio Donadoni, Giampiero Judica, Ivana Monti, Daniela Piperno', null, 'Toni leads a normal life with his wife Paola but full of enthusiasm and passion. The chance meeting with the young and wealthy Chiara will rekindle in him the desire to redeem himself and to realize his secret dream: to become an artist. The paths of the three will intertwine in a dangerous love triangle that will change the course of their lives forever.', 'Toni leads a normal life with his wife Paola but full of enthusiasm and passion. The chance meeting with the young and wealthy Chiara will rekindle in him the desire to redeem himself and to realize his secret dream: to become an artist. The paths of the three will intertwine in a dangerous love triangle that will change the course of their lives forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rbKekf98pV3o4gpQGrfgU49bkev.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1049171'),
  ('645630802721226855', 'The Temptation of Barbizon', 1946, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Romance', 'Jean Stelli, Roger Blanc, Marcel Grignon', 'André-Paul Antoine', 'Simone Renant, François Périer, Pierre Larquey, Juliette Faber, Daniel Gélin, Henri Crémieux, André Bervil, Nicolas Amato', null, 'Daniel Gelin and Juliette Faber star as a blissfully happy honeymooning couple. They are so happy that they arouse the jealous attentions of Satan. The Dark Prince sends an emissary to beak up the romance, but his advocate is promptly challenged by a representative from "up above."', 'Daniel Gelin and Juliette Faber star as a blissfully happy honeymooning couple. They are so happy that they arouse the jealous attentions of Satan. The Dark Prince sends an emissary to beak up the romance, but his advocate is promptly challenged by a representative from "up above."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rGvLdI3FW7VyRqW7LaSJPPaJJE9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:433540'),
  ('401720006064584304', 'The Temptation of Isabelle', 1985, 'Drama', 'Jacques Doillon, William Lubtchansky', 'Jacques Doillon, Jean-François Goyet', 'Ann-Gisel Glass, Jacques Bonnaffé, Fanny Bastien, Xavier Deluc, Françoise Brion, Henri Virlogeux, Anne-Marie Maillé, Charlotte Gainsbourg', null, 'Bruno devises a mean to test the love of his girlfriend Isabelle. Since Isabelle had been in love with Alain in the past, Bruno invites Alain to a surprise birthday party for her at a hotel -- what better way to judge her feelings than to get them together? Alain arrives with his current girlfriend Lio. Soon after the two couples start the evening off, their polite exteriors deteriorate.', 'Bruno devises a mean to test the love of his girlfriend Isabelle. Since Isabelle had been in love with Alain in the past, Bruno invites Alain to a surprise birthday party for her at a hotel -- what better way to judge her feelings than to get them together? Alain arrives with his current girlfriend Lio. Soon after the two couples start the evening off, their polite exteriors deteriorate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A9N7SVeQ984tIjVzIyW7k5JIRrE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:267068'),
  ('354999307383903994', 'The Temptation of Kimono', 2009, 'Drama, Romance', 'Tadashi Kyouya', 'Heitaro Han', 'Elly Akira, Risa Sakamoto, Mika Muroi, Taro Kai, Yoshihiro Tanbara', null, 'Mikage will get married to Youiti next year, she agrees to live with Youiti''s parents. One day, Youiti''s father disrobed Mikage''s Kimono and raped her. To her astonishment, her fiancé Youiti whom Mikage considers true love has an affair with his young stepmother. Shocked and devastated, what will Mikage do?', 'Mikage will get married to Youiti next year, she agrees to live with Youiti''s parents. One day, Youiti''s father disrobed Mikage''s Kimono and raped her. To her astonishment, her fiancé Youiti whom Mikage considers true love has an affair with his young stepmother. Shocked and devastated, what will Mikage do?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2oVfD5rUV2EElbQ11ds2Vf5nRaZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:247136'),
  ('255865716452317191', 'The Temptation of St. Anthony', 1898, 'Fantasy', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Georges Méliès, Jehanne d''Alcy', null, 'St. Anthony is tempted by visions of women, including one that is transformed from the image of Jesus Christ Himself!', 'St. Anthony is tempted by visions of women, including one that is transformed from the image of Jesus Christ Himself!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7fuXFtSZoiAvOChRn7gutvfVTwu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104702'),
  ('1090040311305101376', 'The Temptation of St. Tony', 2009, 'Drama', 'Veiko Õunpuu, Mart Taniel, Karin Tetsmann', 'Veiko Õunpuu', 'Taavi Eelmaa, Ravshana Kurkova, Tiina Tauraite, Sten Ljunggren, Denis Lavant, Rain Tolk, Hendrik Toompere, Katariina Unt', null, 'A mid-level manager who develops an aversion to being a good person questions his morality as he faces the challenges of middle age and loses control of his life.', 'A mid-level manager who develops an aversion to being a good person questions his morality as he faces the challenges of middle age and loses control of his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7uJEHRGq6kR9et77FJv4uWbGNbl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46756'),
  ('27263000295068991', 'The Temptation of the Mature 50s Mother-in-law', 2023, 'Romance, Drama', '김태훈', null, 'Ahn So-hee, Jeon Eun-jin, Han Seok-bong, Jo Wan-jin, Ji Min-iI, Do Hee', null, 'A young couple, Wan-jin and So-hee, are living with Wan-jin''s single father, Seok-bong. Seok-bong was preying on his daughter-in-law, who was doing the housework and preparing meals for him while her husband was away at work. He pretended to have dementia and attacked her. So-hee, who was suffering from her shame, suggested to Wan-jin to hire his father a caregiver, saying that his father seemed to be suffering from dementia, and so Bok-ja, a sexy and voluptuous caregiver who was about Seok-bong''s age, came in. Seok-bong is captivated by Bok-ja''s passionate charm and soon begins to share his love with her, and in this way, she takes the place of Wan-jin''s new mother.', 'A young couple, Wan-jin and So-hee, are living with Wan-jin''s single father, Seok-bong. Seok-bong was preying on his daughter-in-law, who was doing the housework and preparing meals for him while her husband was away at work. He pretended to have dementia and attacked her. So-hee, who was suffering from her shame, suggested to Wan-jin to hire his father a caregiver, saying that his father seemed to be suffering from dementia, and so Bok-ja, a sexy and voluptuous caregiver who was about Seok-bong''s age, came in. Seok-bong is captivated by Bok-ja''s passionate charm and soon begins to share his love with her, and in this way, she takes the place of Wan-jin''s new mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w4NBXeIu5wR8RZmw3Apq6pw72tB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1099639'),
  ('150197498855888559', 'The Temptress', 1926, 'Romance, Drama', 'Fred Niblo, H. Bruce Humberstone, William H. Daniels', 'Dorothy Farnum', 'Greta Garbo, Antonio Moreno, Marc McDermott, Lionel Barrymore, Armand Kaliz, Roy D''Arcy, Robert Anderson, Francis McDonald', 'NR', 'A seductive woman forsakes her husband and lover to pursue a young engineer.', 'A seductive woman forsakes her husband and lover to pursue a young engineer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uGJtzAm4j3BCRU8JRbvtwAn3xIM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95956'),
  ('527719699934106631', 'The Ten', 2007, 'Comedy', 'David Wain, Yaron Orbach', 'David Wain, Ken Marino', 'Paul Rudd, Adam Brody, Jon Hamm, Winona Ryder, Ken Marino, Todd Holoubek, Mather Zickel, Ali Marsh', 'R', 'Ten stories, each inspired by one of the ten commandments.', 'Ten stories, each inspired by one of the ten commandments.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/byhpbEcL1tuoNhU3x5vYF45QM8X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13173'),
  ('1021952067312770709', 'The Ten Commandments', 1923, 'Drama, History', 'Cecil B. DeMille, Bert Glennon', null, 'Theodore Roberts, Charles De Rochefort, Estelle Taylor, Julia Faye, Pat Moore, James Neill, Lawson Butt, Clarence Burton', null, 'The first part tells the story of Moses leading the Jews from Egypt to the Promised Land, his receipt of the tablets and the worship of the golden calf. The second part shows the efficacy of the commandments in modern life through a story set in San Francisco. Two brothers, rivals for the love of Mary, also come into conflict when John discovers Dan used shoddy materials to construct a cathedral.', 'The first part tells the story of Moses leading the Jews from Egypt to the Promised Land, his receipt of the tablets and the worship of the golden calf. The second part shows the efficacy of the commandments in modern life through a story set in San Francisco. Two brothers, rivals for the love of Mary, also come into conflict when John discovers Dan used shoddy materials to construct a cathedral.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zCLObhnxHTqIpCMYm63KSsO6sMp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24805'),
  ('258746984318553952', 'The Ten Commandments', 1956, 'Drama, History', 'Loyal Griggs, Cecil B. DeMille, Francisco Day', 'Fredric M. Frank, Jesse Lasky Jr., Jack Gariss', 'Charlton Heston, Yul Brynner, Anne Baxter, Edward G. Robinson, Yvonne De Carlo, Debra Paget, John Derek, Cedric Hardwicke', 'G', 'Escaping death, a Hebrew infant is raised in a royal household to become a prince. Upon discovery of his true heritage, Moses embarks on a personal quest to reclaim his destiny as the leader and liberator of the Hebrew people.', 'Escaping death, a Hebrew infant is raised in a royal household to become a prince. Upon discovery of his true heritage, Moses embarks on a personal quest to reclaim his destiny as the leader and liberator of the Hebrew people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Ei59AR64x6dMZfWobPCkZjbqTL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6844'),
  ('284639004308259382', 'The Ten Commandments', 2001, 'Music, Drama', 'Élie Chouraqui, Élie Chouraqui', null, 'Daniel Lévi, Ahmed Mouici, Ginie Line, Pablo Villafranca, Yaël Naïm, Pedro Alves, Lisbet Guldbaek, Nourith', null, 'The Ten Commandments is a French musical comedy', 'The Ten Commandments is a French musical comedy', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nz84DYLyKrqrjVCVmtPxznJKMMS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68355'),
  ('853032822748855799', 'The Ten Commandments', 2007, 'Animation, Drama, Family, Fantasy', 'John Stronach, Bill Boyce', 'Ed Naha', 'Alfred Molina, Ben Kingsley, Elliott Gould, Christian Slater, Scott McNeil, Christopher Gaze, Kathleen Barr, Lee Tockar', 'PG', 'This vibrantly animated feature recounts the biblical epic of the Hebrew prophet Moses and the Ten Commandments. Led by the word of God, Moses challenges the ominous Egyptian pharaoh, performs miracles and guides the chosen people on a 40-year journey through the desert to free them from captivity and lead them to the Promised Land.', 'This vibrantly animated feature recounts the biblical epic of the Hebrew prophet Moses and the Ten Commandments. Led by the word of God, Moses challenges the ominous Egyptian pharaoh, performs miracles and guides the chosen people on a 40-year journey through the desert to free them from captivity and lead them to the Promised Land.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yeake9TDNiyIFtqDjIAPMSJhO1u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22331'),
  ('276738304684536982', 'The Ten Commandments: The Movie', 2016, 'Drama', 'Alexandre Avancini', 'Joaquim Assis, Vivian de Oliveira', 'Guilherme Winter, Camila Rodrigues, Sergio Marone, Paulo Gorgulho, Giselle Itié, Vera Zimmermann, Denise Del Vecchio, Zécarlos Machado', null, 'Follows Moses leading and conducting the Hebrew people from the slavery of Egypt to the freedom towards the Promised Land according to the Ancient Testament Bible book of the Exodus. The story told like never before is faithful to the Scriptures.', 'Follows Moses leading and conducting the Hebrew people from the slavery of Egypt to the freedom towards the Promised Land according to the Ancient Testament Bible book of the Exodus. The story told like never before is faithful to the Scriptures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yctfYDrHAPcJP54D2BCH9R5GTY2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:372519'),
  ('1011001737249311392', 'The Ten-Year Lunch', 1987, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Aviva Slesin, Jerry Pantzer, Stuart Math', 'Peter Foges, Mary Jo Kaplan', 'Heywood Hale Broun, Marc Connelly, Margalo Gillmore, Ruth Gordon, Averell Harriman, Helen Hayes, Roberta Maxwell, Marshall Efron', null, 'The story of the legendary wits who lunched daily at the Algonquin Hotel in New York City during the 1920s. The core of the so-called Round Table group included short story and poetry writer Dorothy Parker; comic actor and writer Robert Benchley; The New Yorker founder Harold Ross; columnist and social reformer Heywood Broun; critic Alexander Woollcott; and playwrights George S. Kaufman, Marc Connelly, Edna Ferber and Robert Sherwood.', 'The story of the legendary wits who lunched daily at the Algonquin Hotel in New York City during the 1920s. The core of the so-called Round Table group included short story and poetry writer Dorothy Parker; comic actor and writer Robert Benchley; The New Yorker founder Harold Ross; columnist and social reformer Heywood Broun; critic Alexander Woollcott; and playwrights George S. Kaufman, Marc Connelly, Edna Ferber and Robert Sherwood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s8V9YfMg9qhoFQc9Bw84owXx3ny.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:182561'),
  ('140537115379160229', 'The Tenant', 1976, 'Thriller, Mystery, Drama', 'Roman Polanski, Sven Nykvist, Marc Grunebaum', 'Gérard Brach, Roman Polanski', 'Roman Polanski, Isabelle Adjani, Melvyn Douglas, Jo Van Fleet, Bernard Fresson, Shelley Winters, Lila Kedrova, Claude Dauphin', 'R', 'A quiet and inconspicuous man rents an apartment in Paris where he finds himself drawn into a rabbit hole of dangerous paranoia.', 'A quiet and inconspicuous man rents an apartment in Paris where he finds himself drawn into a rabbit hole of dangerous paranoia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Qhzb1ICFMqE3isWoln497qSH7n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11482'),
  ('817346319303011428', 'The Tenants', 1987, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Hassan Gholizadeh, Dariush Mehrjui', 'Dariush Mehrjui', 'Akbar Abdi, Ezzatollah Entezami, Farimah Farjami, Hamide Kheyrabadi, Ferdous Kaviani, Hossein Sarshar, Siavosh Tahmoures, Yarta Yaran', null, 'A satirical comedy about the oddball inhabitants of a Tehran apartment building and their landlord.', 'A satirical comedy about the oddball inhabitants of a Tehran apartment building and their landlord.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/axU3ohhipNe8MrYAFREwvXukoqz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:266236'),
  ('525545982461001784', 'The Tender Bar', 2021, 'Drama', 'Martin Ruhe, George Clooney, David Webb', 'William Monahan', 'Ben Affleck, Tye Sheridan, Daniel Ranieri, Lily Rabe, Christopher Lloyd, Max Martini, Rhenzy Feliz, Briana Middleton', 'R', 'JR is a fatherless boy growing up in the glow of a bar where the bartender, his Uncle Charlie, is the sharpest and most colorful of an assortment of quirky and demonstrative father figures. As the boy’s determined mother struggles to provide her son with opportunities denied to her — and leave the dilapidated home of her outrageous if begrudgingly supportive father — JR begins to gamely, if not always gracefully, pursue his romantic and professional dreams, with one foot persistently placed in Uncle Charlie’s bar.', 'JR is a fatherless boy growing up in the glow of a bar where the bartender, his Uncle Charlie, is the sharpest and most colorful of an assortment of quirky and demonstrative father figures. As the boy’s determined mother struggles to provide her son with opportunities denied to her — and leave the dilapidated home of her outrageous if begrudgingly supportive father — JR begins to gamely, if not always gracefully, pursue his romantic and professional dreams, with one foot persistently placed in Uncle Charlie’s bar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m6Ej3F4tYTOHD26fvX1zN9bcEUg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:727293'),
  ('351837949978658831', 'The Tender Game', 1958, 'Animation, Romance, Comedy', 'John Hubley', null, null, null, 'Inspired by the song Tenderly Jack Lawrence and Walter Gross, a tender animation on a florist and a sweeper that she falls madly in love.', 'Inspired by the song Tenderly Jack Lawrence and Walter Gross, a tender animation on a florist and a sweeper that she falls madly in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2vJVPL89gGIXm3n2QAX3OcRNcU2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163343'),
  ('1131242491233920011', 'The Tender Trap', 1955, 'Music, Comedy, Romance', 'Charles Walters, Paul Vogel', 'Julius J. Epstein', 'Frank Sinatra, Debbie Reynolds, David Wayne, Celeste Holm, Jarma Lewis, Lola Albright, Carolyn Jones, Howard St. John', 'NR', 'A young actress flirts demurely with a swinging Manhattan bachelor who thinks he has it made.', 'A young actress flirts demurely with a swinging Manhattan bachelor who thinks he has it made.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o4uIEZfI0gHfTMOc2nQLPBpGDqf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43326'),
  ('651667567201347695', 'The Tenderness', 2023, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Romance', 'Vicente Villanueva, Luis Ángel Pérez, Alicia Sánchez', 'Vicente Villanueva', 'Emma Suárez, Gonzalo de Castro, Alexandra Jiménez, Fernando Guallar, Anna Moliner, Carlos Cuevas, Raquel Arroyo, Héctor Aníbal', null, 'Queen Esmeralda hates men because they have always limited her freedom, so she does not want her two daughters to suffer the same fate. Therefore, when the ship in which they are traveling passes near an apparently deserted island, she invokes a portentous storm.', 'Queen Esmeralda hates men because they have always limited her freedom, so she does not want her two daughters to suffer the same fate. Therefore, when the ship in which they are traveling passes near an apparently deserted island, she invokes a portentous storm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/288nw1v3xns8b1SBMfnPK8mouQY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1053996'),
  ('395197415333085529', 'The Tenth Man', 1988, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Jack Gold, Alan Hume, Ray Corbett', 'Lee Langley', 'Anthony Hopkins, Kristin Scott Thomas, Derek Jacobi, Cyril Cusack, Brenda Bruce, Timothy Watson, Jim Carter, Paul Rogers', null, 'During World War 2 the Germans arrested people at random off the streets of Paris and in retaliation to sabotage by the resistance announced the execution of one in ten prisoners. Chosen as one of the victims, lawyer Chavel trades his place with another man in return for all his possessions. At the end of the war he returns to his house and tries to integrate himself with the family of the man who traded places with him, all the while hiding his true identity. However matters are complicated when a stranger arrives claiming to be Chavel.', 'During World War 2 the Germans arrested people at random off the streets of Paris and in retaliation to sabotage by the resistance announced the execution of one in ten prisoners. Chosen as one of the victims, lawyer Chavel trades his place with another man in return for all his possessions. At the end of the war he returns to his house and tries to integrate himself with the family of the man who traded places with him, all the while hiding his true identity. However matters are complicated when a stranger arrives claiming to be Chavel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xTQL6sw8waCWynVpRmS10zNVQMg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109669'),
  ('478070140710668286', 'The Tenth Man', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Daniel Burman, Daniel Ortega, Matias Famulari', 'Daniel Burman', 'Alan Sabbagh, Julieta Zylberberg, Usher Barilka, Daniel Droblas, Elvira Onetto, Adrián Stoppelman, Elisa Carricajo, Dan Breitman', null, 'After many years away, Ariel is summoned by his distant father to his childhood home in the bustling Jewish quarter of Buenos Aires, known as El Once. Over the course of seven days, during the vibrant holiday of Purim, Ariel seeks to reconnect with his father, who runs a Jewish charity and is regarded as a big macher in the close-knit community, but was frequently absent due to his obligation to fulfill the Jewish quorum of having 10 men present at all funerals.', 'After many years away, Ariel is summoned by his distant father to his childhood home in the bustling Jewish quarter of Buenos Aires, known as El Once. Over the course of seven days, during the vibrant holiday of Purim, Ariel seeks to reconnect with his father, who runs a Jewish charity and is regarded as a big macher in the close-knit community, but was frequently absent due to his obligation to fulfill the Jewish quorum of having 10 men present at all funerals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sf1wxH0qcUvTTYgHdT6dbBAHWdd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:390341'),
  ('725418361218873094', 'The Terence Davies Trilogy', 1983, 'Drama', 'Terence Davies, William Diver', 'Terence Davies', 'Terry O''Sullivan, Wilfrid Brambell, Sheila Raynor, Phillip Mawdsley, Iain Munro, Valerie Lilley, Nick Stringer, Robin Hooper', null, 'In stark black and white, Terence Davies excavates the life of his fictional alter ego, Robert Tucker, in a narrative that slips between childhood, middle age and death, shaping the raw materials of his own life into a rich tapestry of experiences and impressions.', 'In stark black and white, Terence Davies excavates the life of his fictional alter ego, Robert Tucker, in a narrative that slips between childhood, middle age and death, shaping the raw materials of his own life into a rich tapestry of experiences and impressions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pTo1YoXi2zVZFqLg1JVJUTnDmet.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48151'),
  ('451031490979166685', 'The Terminal', 2004, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Steven Spielberg, Janusz Kamiński, David H. Venghaus Jr.', 'Sacha Gervasi, Jeff Nathanson', 'Tom Hanks, Catherine Zeta-Jones, Stanley Tucci, Chi McBride, Diego Luna, Barry Shabaka Henley, Kumar Pallana, Zoe Saldaña', 'PG-13', 'An Eastern European tourist unexpectedly finds himself stranded in JFK airport, and must take up temporary residence there.', 'An Eastern European tourist unexpectedly finds himself stranded in JFK airport, and must take up temporary residence there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cPB3ZMM4UdsSAhNdS4c7ps5nypY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:594'),
  ('73954802544240205', 'The Terminal Man', 1974, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Mike Hodges, Richard H. Kline, Robert Dijoux', 'Mike Hodges', 'George Segal, Joan Hackett, Richard Dysart, Donald Moffat, Michael C. Gwynne, William Hansen, Jill Clayburgh, Norman Burton', 'PG', 'As the result of a head injury, brilliant computer scientist Harry Benson begins to experience violent seizures. In an attempt to control the seizures, Benson undergoes a new surgical procedure in which a microcomputer is inserted into his brain. The procedure is not entirely successful.', 'As the result of a head injury, brilliant computer scientist Harry Benson begins to experience violent seizures. In an attempt to control the seizures, Benson undergoes a new surgical procedure in which a microcomputer is inserted into his brain. The procedure is not entirely successful.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4kzqHiAe5pB2zaqtbpidVdpbsLY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32940'),
  ('263970718732278835', 'The Terminal Trust', 2012, 'Drama', 'Masayuki Suō, 島根淳, Rokurō Terada', 'Masayuki Suō', 'Tamiyo Kusakari, Koji Yakusho, Tadanobu Asano, Takao Osawa, Yoshihiko Hosoda, Kumi Nakamura, Eiji Kakutani, Masaaki Takarai', null, 'Shinzo Egi is an asthma sufferer who does not want to be place on life support. As a last request, Shinzo Egi asks his doctor Ayano Orii if she could follow his wish. Doctor Ayano Orii is then questioned in a criminal case because of her decision.', 'Shinzo Egi is an asthma sufferer who does not want to be place on life support. As a last request, Shinzo Egi asks his doctor Ayano Orii if she could follow his wish. Doctor Ayano Orii is then questioned in a criminal case because of her decision.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pnU4OIZJuBN3QY3uVsnOySlPd5L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:201043'),
  ('546615013680309833', 'The Terminator', 1984, 'Action, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Adam Greenberg, James Cameron, Shay Austin', 'James Cameron, Gale Anne Hurd', 'Arnold Schwarzenegger, Michael Biehn, Linda Hamilton, Paul Winfield, Lance Henriksen, Rick Rossovich, Bess Motta, Earl Boen', 'R', 'In the post-apocalyptic future, reigning tyrannical supercomputers teleport a cyborg assassin known as the "Terminator" back to 1984 to kill Sarah Connor, whose unborn son is destined to lead insurgents against 21st century mechanical hegemony. Meanwhile, the human-resistance movement dispatches a lone warrior to safeguard Sarah. Can he stop the virtually indestructible killing machine?', 'In the post-apocalyptic future, reigning tyrannical supercomputers teleport a cyborg assassin known as the "Terminator" back to 1984 to kill Sarah Connor, whose unborn son is destined to lead insurgents against 21st century mechanical hegemony. Meanwhile, the human-resistance movement dispatches a lone warrior to safeguard Sarah. Can he stop the virtually indestructible killing machine?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qvktm0BHcnmDpul4Hz01GIazWPr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:218'),
  ('155377550672896891', 'The Terminators', 2009, 'Action, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Xavier S. Puslowski, Mark Atkins', 'David Michael Latt', 'Jeremy London, A Martinez, Paul Logan, Lauren Walsh, Sara Tomko, Dustin Harnish, Clint Browning, Lucinda Rogers', 'R', 'A small band of resistance fighters battle the cyborgs that have taken control of the planet.', 'A small band of resistance fighters battle the cyborgs that have taken control of the planet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hiGlhnaKvIbGeTd7VVPOyfA6mWc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26342'),
  ('50296500023424547', 'The Terrace', 1963, 'Drama', 'Leopoldo Torre Nilsson', 'Ricardo Luna, Leopoldo Torre Nilsson, Beatriz Guido', 'Graciela Borges, Leonardo Favio, Marcela López Rey, Héctor Pellegrini, Dora Baret, Norberto Suárez, Enrique Liporace, Luis Weksler (Walmo)', null, 'A group of young aristocrats lock themselves up, for fun, on a terrace in a wealthy building in Buenos Aires. Their parents try to get them out, but they threaten to jump down if any adults enter the terrace.', 'A group of young aristocrats lock themselves up, for fun, on a terrace in a wealthy building in Buenos Aires. Their parents try to get them out, but they threaten to jump down if any adults enter the terrace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yw0c0jjGxjA5AG1c2zBTvmqCoY5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:202541'),
  ('59186046002630583', 'The Terrace', 1980, 'Drama', 'Ettore Scola, Gianfrancesco Lazotti, Paola Scola', 'Agenore Incrocci, Furio Scarpelli, Ettore Scola', 'Vittorio Gassman, Ugo Tognazzi, Jean-Louis Trintignant, Marcello Mastroianni, Stefania Sandrelli, Carla Gravina, Ombretta Colli, Galeazzo Benti', null, 'Eight Italian politicians from the communist party gather on a terrace in Rome for a get-together. They discuss about their past, present and future.', 'Eight Italian politicians from the communist party gather on a terrace in Rome for a get-together. They discuss about their past, present and future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9VQpe6Olw355r0PmxmgBBs5BFSk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77334'),
  ('818419790411262016', 'The Terrible People', 1960, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Harald Reinl, Albert Benitz', 'Wolfgang Schnitzler, J. Joachim Bartsch', 'Joachim Fuchsberger, Karin Dor, Elisabeth Flickenschildt, Karl-Georg Saebisch, Eddi Arent, Ernst Fritz Fürbringer, Fritz Rasp, Dieter Eppler', null, 'The ghost of a hanged man returns to fulfill his promise. All of his accusers must die!', 'The ghost of a hanged man returns to fulfill his promise. All of his accusers must die!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v9ql64Lr19gGZMrHLAk5vksJKUK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5630'),
  ('994936785722010568', 'The Terrible Turkish Executioner', 1903, 'Comedy', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Georges Méliès', null, 'In a public place in Constantinople at the corner of a bazaar, the executioner is seated upon a stone and is resting from his daily labors while eating a crust of bread. Suddenly there come running into the place a lot of Turkish men and women preceding some Turkish policemen, who drag along four prisoners in chains. The policemen shut up the four prisoners in the pillory. Their four heads stick up through the huge plank, which is provided with four openings. One of the policemen urges the executioner to decapitate the prisoners. He accordingly seizes a mighty sabre and cuts off by a single stroke the four heads, which roll upon the ground.', 'In a public place in Constantinople at the corner of a bazaar, the executioner is seated upon a stone and is resting from his daily labors while eating a crust of bread. Suddenly there come running into the place a lot of Turkish men and women preceding some Turkish policemen, who drag along four prisoners in chains. The policemen shut up the four prisoners in the pillory. Their four heads stick up through the huge plank, which is provided with four openings. One of the policemen urges the executioner to decapitate the prisoners. He accordingly seizes a mighty sabre and cuts off by a single stroke the four heads, which roll upon the ground.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wWAw3FOvGW8wpqThlp9twVkHxvD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:172121'),
  ('583533365058081134', 'The Terribly Sad Princess', 1968, 'Music, Comedy, Family', 'Bořivoj Zeman, František Valert, K. Berdychová', 'František Vlček, Bořivoj Zeman', 'Helena Vondráčková, Václav Neckář, Bohuš Záhorský, Jaroslav Marvan, Josef Kemr, Darek Vostřel, František Dibarbora, Oldřich Dědek', null, 'Like a fairy tale, King Henry and King Good-thought decided long ago that their only children should marry and so prevent war arising between their kingdoms ever again. But the young prince is wary of marrying anyone he doesn’t know.', 'Like a fairy tale, King Henry and King Good-thought decided long ago that their only children should marry and so prevent war arising between their kingdoms ever again. But the young prince is wary of marrying anyone he doesn’t know.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l0i8MtHc39vwYmOj51dIG4MOGEH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5589'),
  ('1145166093865677215', 'The Territory', 1981, 'Horror, Drama', 'Raúl Ruiz, Henri Alekan', 'Gilbert Adair', 'Geoffrey Carey, Paul Getty Jr., Jeffrey Kime, Rebecca Pauly, Isabelle Weingarten, Camila Mora-Scheihing, João Bénard da Costa, Artur Semedo', null, 'A small group of well-to-do vacationers go on a hiking trip into the woods just to find themselves mysteriously lost.', 'A small group of well-to-do vacationers go on a hiking trip into the woods just to find themselves mysteriously lost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vvs5n7XKXgQz5hm3Fxxpa9NuFtM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147925'),
  ('290309448466033141', 'The Territory', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Alex Pritz, Alex Pritz, Tangãi Uru-eu-wau-wau', null, 'Neidinha Bandeira, Bitaté Uru-Eu-Wau-Wau, Ari Uru-Eu-Wau-Wau, Txai Suruí', 'PG', 'The Indigenous Uru-eu-wau-wau people have seen their population dwindle and their culture threatened since coming into contact with non-Native Brazilians. Though promised dominion over their own rainforest territory, they have faced illegal incursions from environmentally destructive logging and mining, and, most recently, land-grabbing invasions spurred on by right-wing politicians like President Jair Bolsonaro. With deforestation escalating as a result, the stakes have become global.', 'The Indigenous Uru-eu-wau-wau people have seen their population dwindle and their culture threatened since coming into contact with non-Native Brazilians. Though promised dominion over their own rainforest territory, they have faced illegal incursions from environmentally destructive logging and mining, and, most recently, land-grabbing invasions spurred on by right-wing politicians like President Jair Bolsonaro. With deforestation escalating as a result, the stakes have become global.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jtN984vGSVGKBVY03tdL0KHWpuJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:913849'),
  ('762485374573023910', 'The Terror', 1963, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Roger Corman, John M. Nickolaus Jr., Paul Rapp', 'Jack Hill, Leo Gordon', 'Boris Karloff, Jack Nicholson, Sandra Knight, Dick Miller, Dorothy Neumann, Jonathan Haze', null, 'Lt. Andre Duvalier awakens on a beach to the sight of a strange woman who leads him to the gothic, towering castle that serves as home to an eerie baron.', 'Lt. Andre Duvalier awakens on a beach to the sight of a strange woman who leads him to the gothic, towering castle that serves as home to an eerie baron.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ls64LquXB0nc5MkJFWyWaXlBLj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31655'),
  ('445827866261891000', 'The Terror Live', 2013, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Kim Byung-woo, Byun Bong-sun, Song Hyun-suk', 'Kim Byung-woo', 'Ha Jung-woo, Kim Dae-myung, Lee Kyung-young, Jeon Hye-jin, David Lee, Kim So-jin, Kim Hae-in, Han Soo-hyun', null, 'A newsman discovers he''s been rigged with a bomb after he has an exclusive interview with a terrorist who blew up a bridge.', 'A newsman discovers he''s been rigged with a bomb after he has an exclusive interview with a terrorist who blew up a bridge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9VFBtfMRKh5Yfd8jQ4kPhhD441D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:209764'),
  ('588435668659204396', 'The Terror of the Tongs', 1961, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Arthur Grant, Don Mingaye, Anthony Bushell', 'Jimmy Sangster', 'Christopher Lee, Yvonne Monlaur, Geoffrey Toone, Marne Maitland, Brian Worth, Ewen Solon, Roger Delgado, Richard Leech', 'NR', 'In 1910, Hong Kong, under the rule of the British Empire, is a prosperous and bustling city, but, hidden in the shadows of its many narrow streets, the hideous members of the Red Dragon gang, a branch of the evil Chinese secret society of the Tongs, lurk and murder those who oppose to their tyranny, which thrives on vice, crime and the fear of the weakest.', 'In 1910, Hong Kong, under the rule of the British Empire, is a prosperous and bustling city, but, hidden in the shadows of its many narrow streets, the hideous members of the Red Dragon gang, a branch of the evil Chinese secret society of the Tongs, lurk and murder those who oppose to their tyranny, which thrives on vice, crime and the fear of the weakest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2KdowgrSZCaUjkxVcUw3CPRg4rI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28750'),
  ('861199867436505131', 'The Terror of Tiny Town', 1938, 'Western, Comedy, Music', 'Sam Newfield, Mack Stengler', 'Fred Myton', 'Billy Curtis, Yvonne Moray, ''Little Billy'' Rhodes, Billy Platt, John T. Bambury, Joseph Herbst, Charles Becker, Nita Krebs', null, 'In a wild west community populated entirely by residents with dwarfism, the Larson and Preston familes have been in a generations-long feud, recently strained by the actions of cattle rustler and overall devious criminal Bat Haines. Buck Larson, the hero of our tale, takes on Haines, and tries to win the heart of Nancy Preston while resolving the tensions between his and her families.', 'In a wild west community populated entirely by residents with dwarfism, the Larson and Preston familes have been in a generations-long feud, recently strained by the actions of cattle rustler and overall devious criminal Bat Haines. Buck Larson, the hero of our tale, takes on Haines, and tries to win the heart of Nancy Preston while resolving the tensions between his and her families.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ajyE9xse0JlQlYraLK9ovCALxCt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31772'),
  ('157778701034390849', 'The Terror Within', 1989, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Thierry Notz, Rohn Schmidt', 'Thomas McKelvey Cleaver', 'George Kennedy, Andrew Stevens, Starr Andreeff, Terri Treas, John Lafayette, Tommy Hinkley, Yvonne Saa, Joseph Hardin', null, 'Experiments in biological warfare have destroyed all but a few remnants of the human race. Alone in a lab, eight students work feverishly to create a vaccine before they are forced outside in search for food. It is then that the surviving scientists discover creatures mutated by the plague. Now they prepare to do battle against their worst fear: The Terror Within.', 'Experiments in biological warfare have destroyed all but a few remnants of the human race. Alone in a lab, eight students work feverishly to create a vaccine before they are forced outside in search for food. It is then that the surviving scientists discover creatures mutated by the plague. Now they prepare to do battle against their worst fear: The Terror Within.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rJRd9qUoNpW0BOcYcZRLhvZS1z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29345'),
  ('471313928934973729', 'The Terror Within II', 1991, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Andrew Stevens, Janusz Kamiński, Mauro Fiore', 'Andrew Stevens, Thomas McKelvey Cleaver', 'Andrew Stevens, Stella Stevens, Chick Vennera, R. Lee Ermey, Burton Gilliam, Clare Hoak, Larry Gilman, Barbara Alyn Woods', null, 'In a world gone mad, the last human colony struggles to survive underground, beneath a land of nightmarish mutants who seek to destroy them. But when the mutant breaks inside humanity''s final stronghold, the battle for survival pits the human colonists against their deadly invaders miles below the earth''s surface.', 'In a world gone mad, the last human colony struggles to survive underground, beneath a land of nightmarish mutants who seek to destroy them. But when the mutant breaks inside humanity''s final stronghold, the battle for survival pits the human colonists against their deadly invaders miles below the earth''s surface.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/L2du6pxDgxPpxPqaISiRBDPJnz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119353'),
  ('324648351139177316', 'The Terrorist', 1963, 'Drama, War', 'Gianfranco De Bosio', 'Luigi Squarzina, Gianfranco De Bosio', 'Gian Maria Volonté, Philippe Leroy, Tino Carraro, José Quaglio, Giulio Bosetti, Carlo Bagno, Anouk Aimée, Mario Valgoi', null, 'In Venice in 1943, a group of partisans led by Renato Braschi organize a series of autonomous terrorist attacks against the fascists while the National Liberation Committee urges caution. Renato is determined to carry out his ideas, risking his own life, and not only that...', 'In Venice in 1943, a group of partisans led by Renato Braschi organize a series of autonomous terrorist attacks against the fascists while the National Liberation Committee urges caution. Renato is determined to carry out his ideas, risking his own life, and not only that...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hYth2ednFy0FUcQFho9OgSBPj4G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:187737'),
  ('157906359028120169', 'The Terrorist', 1994, 'Drama', 'Nader Galal, Mohamed Yassin, Samir Farag', 'Lenin EL Ramly', 'Adel Emam, Sherine, Mohamed El Dafrawi, Mustafa Metwalli, Ahmad Rateb, Said Tarabeek, Madiha Yousri, Magda Zaki', null, 'Ali Abd-El-Zaher is a member of an Islamic radical group which has been launching attacks against the government and the society under the orders of the spiritual leader Brother Saif. Ali manages to assasinate an officer, but as he escapes from the authorities he gets hit by a car driven by Sewsan, the daughter of a respected Muslim family living in the Maadi district. Sewsan''s father who is a surgeon and his family take care of the injured terrorist who then tries to conceal the truth about his personality, such as his dislike of music, unveiled women and Western life styles.', 'Ali Abd-El-Zaher is a member of an Islamic radical group which has been launching attacks against the government and the society under the orders of the spiritual leader Brother Saif. Ali manages to assasinate an officer, but as he escapes from the authorities he gets hit by a car driven by Sewsan, the daughter of a respected Muslim family living in the Maadi district. Sewsan''s father who is a surgeon and his family take care of the injured terrorist who then tries to conceal the truth about his personality, such as his dislike of music, unveiled women and Western life styles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/amyrjFVIu9tE9hmk0t0odsqPTP9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86839'),
  ('176650117146131047', 'The Terrorist', 1998, 'Drama', 'Santosh Sivan, Santosh Sivan', 'Santosh Sivan, Ravi Deshpande, Vijay Deveshwar', 'Ayesha Dharker, Vishnu Varadhan, Krishna Kulasekaran, Sonu Sisupal, Anu Vardhan, Bhanu Prakash', null, 'A young female terrorist goes on a suicide assassination mission, but her resolve to complete it is put to the test.', 'A young female terrorist goes on a suicide assassination mission, but her resolve to complete it is put to the test.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1gMccHZ6Ov37MphOE2w8C3V5pJp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48233'),
  ('674671814059317880', 'The Terrornauts', 1967, 'Science Fiction', 'Montgomery Tully, Geoffrey Faithfull, Tom Walls Jr.', 'John Brunner', 'Simon Oates, Zena Marshall, Charles Hawtrey, Patricia Hayes, Stanley Meadows, Max Adrian, Frank Barry, Leonard Cracknell', 'NR', 'A group of scientists are kidnapped and taken to an outer space outpost in order to save Earth from destruction.', 'A group of scientists are kidnapped and taken to an outer space outpost in order to save Earth from destruction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5BlH6ozzUcdFknK4iUk6akIfdkQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79746'),
  ('759253843883883249', 'The Terry Fox Story', 1983, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Ralph L. Thomas, Richard Ciupka, Bill Corcoran', 'Edward Hume', 'Eric Fryer, Robert Duvall, Chris Makepeace, Elva Mai Hoover, Frank Adamson, Michael Zelniker, Rosalind Chao, Marie McCann', null, 'The true story about the Canadian cancer amputee hero, who decided to run across Canada on only one leg to raise money for cancer research.', 'The true story about the Canadian cancer amputee hero, who decided to run across Canada on only one leg to raise money for cancer research.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x8zGxhnQFmiy4zeHRseMGK5hXMi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88130'),
  ('133792022238865513', 'The Test', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Emmanuel Poulain-Arnaud, Bruno Laurec, Thomas Rames', 'Emmanuel Poulain-Arnaud, Noé Debré', 'Alexandra Lamy, Philippe Katerine, Matteo Perez, Joaquim Fossi, Chloé Barkoff-Gaillard, Lucile Jaillant, Pablo Cobo, Louvia Bachelier', null, 'Annie lives in harmony with her husband Laurent and her children: the sensitive elders Maximilien and César; the younger Antoine whom Poupi, never-complaining teen, helps raising him. But a positive pregnancy test will disturb the harmony.', 'Annie lives in harmony with her husband Laurent and her children: the sensitive elders Maximilien and César; the younger Antoine whom Poupi, never-complaining teen, helps raising him. But a positive pregnancy test will disturb the harmony.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5UuZDA5EVh5TzPV3edAULpFLqpH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:880728'),
  ('930122443327220908', 'The Test of Love', 2017, 'Drama, TV Movie, Romance', 'Arnaud Sélignac', 'Julie Jézéquel', 'Marie-Josée Croze, Fred Testot, Grégoire Plantade, Jeanne Guittet, Jessica Tougloh, Colette Kraffe, Stéphane Bissot, Pierre-Olivier Mornas', null, 'Paul is a man uncomfortable in his own skin. His 20-year marriage to Marielle is put to the test when she catches him in women''s clothes, and he can no longer live the lie. Paul attempts suicide, making Marielle realize that his life means much more to her than his appearance. She loves his true self more than the person he pretends to be. Convinced that their love will allow them to reinvent their life together, they and their two children brave the reaction of others and live with tolerance and hope.', 'Paul is a man uncomfortable in his own skin. His 20-year marriage to Marielle is put to the test when she catches him in women''s clothes, and he can no longer live the lie. Paul attempts suicide, making Marielle realize that his life means much more to her than his appearance. She loves his true self more than the person he pretends to be. Convinced that their love will allow them to reinvent their life together, they and their two children brave the reaction of others and live with tolerance and hope.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dcNwDbylhlyvTo0EKmnh38rtjAF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:488217'),
  ('1051333769005063546', 'The Testament of Ann Lee', 2025, 'History, Drama, Music', 'Mona Fastvold, William Rexer, Béla Bagota', 'Mona Fastvold, Brady Corbet', 'Amanda Seyfried, Lewis Pullman, Thomasin McKenzie, Matthew Beard, Christopher Abbott, Viola Prettejohn, David Cale, Stacy Martin', 'R', 'The extraordinary true legend of Ann Lee, founder of the devotional sect known as the Shakers, who preached gender and social equality and was revered by her followers as the female Christ.', 'The extraordinary true legend of Ann Lee, founder of the devotional sect known as the Shakers, who preached gender and social equality and was revered by her followers as the female Christ.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hBGg3IGRM7LM6ydMmDrl8mEx33Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1401281'),
  ('909879281788417798', 'The Testament of Dr. Mabuse', 1933, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Fritz Lang, Fritz Arno Wagner, Károly Vass', 'Thea von Harbou, Fritz Lang', 'Rudolf Klein-Rogge, Oscar Beregi Sr., Camilla Spira, Otto Wernicke, Paul Henckels, Theo Lingen, Rudolf Schündler, Theodor Loos', 'NR', 'After a detective is assaulted by thugs and placed in an asylum run by Professor Baum, he observes the professor''s preoccupation with another patient, the criminal genius Dr. Mabuse the hypnotist. When Mabuse''s notes are found to be connected with a rash of recent crimes, Commissioner Lohmann must determine how Mabuse is communicating with the criminals, despite conflicting reports on the doctor''s whereabouts, and capture him for good.', 'After a detective is assaulted by thugs and placed in an asylum run by Professor Baum, he observes the professor''s preoccupation with another patient, the criminal genius Dr. Mabuse the hypnotist. When Mabuse''s notes are found to be connected with a rash of recent crimes, Commissioner Lohmann must determine how Mabuse is communicating with the criminals, despite conflicting reports on the doctor''s whereabouts, and capture him for good.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tc2ET7j6X066VCjdHblSwLr8sEz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12206'),
  ('1069889270390424147', 'The Testament of Dr. Mabuse', 1962, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Werner Klingler, Albert Benitz', 'Ladislas Fodor, Robert A. Stemmle, Norbert Jacques', 'Gert Fröbe, Senta Berger, Helmut Schmid, Wolfgang Preiss, Harald Juhnke, Charles Regnier, Leon Askin, Walter Rilla', null, 'Dr. Mabuse has been locked away for years in an insane asylum. Suddenly crimes start occurring and no one knows the culprit. A detective goes to visit the Doctor to find some sort of clues to the robberies.', 'Dr. Mabuse has been locked away for years in an insane asylum. Suddenly crimes start occurring and no one knows the culprit. A detective goes to visit the Doctor to find some sort of clues to the robberies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wZvTHZkd5LLRR5xUztsXAWpPGpT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10444'),
  ('945221977610308344', 'The Testament of Professor Dowell', 1984, 'Adventure, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Leonid Menaker, Vladimir Kovzel, Oksana Strugina', 'Leonid Menaker, Igor Vinogradskiy', 'Oļgerts Kroders, Igor Vasilev, Natalya Sayko, Valentina Titova, Aleksandr Porokhovshchikov, Ernst Romanov, Bob Chuprov-Tsymba, Alexey Bobrov', 'R', 'The film is based on the popular science-fiction novel “Professor Dowell’s Head” by Russian writer Alexander Belyaev. For many years, a prominent scientist had been striving to solve the problem of immortality. He shared the results of his daring and risky experiments with his colleagues. But one day something happened that no one could have foreseen: the professor had disappeared. The best student and follower of Professor Dowell tries to use the results of his scientific research for criminal purposes. It looks like he is going to succeed…', 'The film is based on the popular science-fiction novel “Professor Dowell’s Head” by Russian writer Alexander Belyaev. For many years, a prominent scientist had been striving to solve the problem of immortality. He shared the results of his daring and risky experiments with his colleagues. But one day something happened that no one could have foreseen: the professor had disappeared. The best student and follower of Professor Dowell tries to use the results of his scientific research for criminal purposes. It looks like he is going to succeed…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vnVqWSU2wJZ0Ef7J2Iib1j5T7kM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146974'),
  ('418277467500027367', 'The Testimony', 1946, 'Crime, Drama', 'Pietro Germi, Alessandro Blasetti, Mario Monicelli', 'Ottavio Alessi', 'Roldano Lupi, Marina Berti, Ernesto Almirante, Sandro Ruffini, Cesare Fantoni, Arnoldo Foà, Dino Maronetto, Marcella Melnati', null, 'A man, standing trial for robbery with murder, faces the death penalty. The testimony of an old civil servant may give him a reprieve but not peace of mind.', 'A man, standing trial for robbery with murder, faces the death penalty. The testimony of an old civil servant may give him a reprieve but not peace of mind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qMgcQz0PNtJOnsSZWiYNyfmAnOH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117913'),
