  ('212259666864249474', 'The Texas Chainsaw Massacre: A Family Portrait', 1988, 'Documentary', 'Brad Shellady, Howard Springsteen', 'Brad Shellady', 'Forrest J. Ackerman, John Dugan, Gunnar Hansen, Edwin Neal, Jim Siedow', null, 'A documentary about the classic ''Texas Chainsaw Massacre'' film, including interviews with Gunnar Hansen, Edwin Neal, John Dugan and Jim Siedow.', 'A documentary about the classic ''Texas Chainsaw Massacre'' film, including interviews with Gunnar Hansen, Edwin Neal, John Dugan and Jim Siedow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z9lFUJa1A1f2xHxrweHAt2bRzK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28429'),
  ('251626438676267357', 'The Texas Chainsaw Massacre: The Beginning', 2006, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Jonathan Liebesman, Lukas Ettlin, Daniel J. Shaw', 'Sheldon Turner', 'Jordana Brewster, Taylor Handley, Diora Baird, Matt Bomer, R. Lee Ermey, Lew Temple, Andrew Bryniarski, Tim DeZarn', 'R', 'Chrissie and her friends set out on a road trip for a final fling before one is shipped off to Vietnam. Along the way, bikers harass the foursome and cause an accident that throws Chrissie from the vehicle. The lawman who arrives on the scene kills one of the bikers and brings Chrissie''s friends to the Hewitt homestead, where young Leatherface is learning the tools of terror.', 'Chrissie and her friends set out on a road trip for a final fling before one is shipped off to Vietnam. Along the way, bikers harass the foursome and cause an accident that throws Chrissie from the vehicle. The lawman who arrives on the scene kills one of the bikers and brings Chrissie''s friends to the Hewitt homestead, where young Leatherface is learning the tools of terror.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hTBueN0Ru3R7brwtONenDyEMNYe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10781'),
  ('636856783410519224', 'The Texas Rangers', 1936, 'Western', 'King Vidor, Edward Cronjager', 'Louis Stevens', 'Fred MacMurray, Jack Oakie, Jean Parker, Lloyd Nolan, Edward Ellis, Benny Bartlett, Frank Shannon, Frank Cordell', 'NR', 'Two down-on-their-luck former outlaws volunteer to be Texas Rangers and find themselves assigned to bring in an old friend, now a notorious outlaw.', 'Two down-on-their-luck former outlaws volunteer to be Texas Rangers and find themselves assigned to bring in an old friend, now a notorious outlaw.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AqT33eHMRJPr9vpFF4kLlu1MSNh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50104'),
  ('1060228064067130882', 'The Texican', 1966, 'Western', 'Lesley Selander, Francisco Marín', 'José Antonio de la Loma, John C. Champion', 'Audie Murphy, Broderick Crawford, Diana Lorys, Aldo Sambrell, Antonio Casas, Gérard Tichy, Antonio Molino Rojo, Luz Márquez', null, 'Wanted north of the border, Jess Carlin resides safely in Mexico. Then he hears his brother was killed in a gunfight with another man. Knowning his brother never carried a gun he heads north to find his brother''s killer. After battling bounty hunters he arrives in Rimrock, a town controlled by Luke Starr. Starr is the man he wants but he unable to find any evidence until he is given an item found by his brother''s body.', 'Wanted north of the border, Jess Carlin resides safely in Mexico. Then he hears his brother was killed in a gunfight with another man. Knowning his brother never carried a gun he heads north to find his brother''s killer. After battling bounty hunters he arrives in Rimrock, a town controlled by Luke Starr. Starr is the man he wants but he unable to find any evidence until he is given an item found by his brother''s body.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d9aruzGCNmzMsLGGn9ItyjsF67K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95410'),
  ('1111468320737281887', 'The Text of Light', 1974, 'Documentary', 'Stan Brakhage, Stan Brakhage', null, null, null, 'Time-lapse photography of books, paintings, reflections, and light falling on textures, shot entirely through a glass ashtray. "''All that is is light.'' – Dun Scotus Erigena. ''To see the world in a grain of sand.'' – William Blake. These are the primary impulses while working on this film. It is dedicated to Jim Davis who showed me the first spark of refracted film light." - S.B.', 'Time-lapse photography of books, paintings, reflections, and light falling on textures, shot entirely through a glass ashtray. "''All that is is light.'' – Dun Scotus Erigena. ''To see the world in a grain of sand.'' – William Blake. These are the primary impulses while working on this film. It is dedicated to Jim Davis who showed me the first spark of refracted film light." - S.B.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vmXaEoDcpDkoalwvCrJ1xsfClRe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:131193'),
  ('3175141897926459', 'The Thaw', 2009, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Mark A. Lewis, Jan Kiesser', 'Mark A. Lewis, Michael W. Lewis', 'Val Kilmer, Martha MacIsaac, Aaron Ashmore, Kyle Schmid, Viv Leacock, Steph Song, Anne Marie DeLuise, John Callander', null, 'At a remote Arctic research station, four ecology students discover the real horror of global warming is not the melting ice, but what''s frozen within it. A prehistoric parasite is released from the carcass of a Woolly Mammoth upon the unsuspecting students who are forced to quarantine and make necessary sacrifices, or risk infecting the rest of the world.', 'At a remote Arctic research station, four ecology students discover the real horror of global warming is not the melting ice, but what''s frozen within it. A prehistoric parasite is released from the carcass of a Woolly Mammoth upon the unsuspecting students who are forced to quarantine and make necessary sacrifices, or risk infecting the rest of the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6oxJ75L6rB88TeSspcnPA7JqjWw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23410'),
  ('5313281335182882', 'The Theatre Bizarre', 2011, 'Horror', 'Buddy Giovinazzo, Douglas Buck, David Gregory', 'Richard Stanley, Scarlett Amaris, Emiliano Ranzani', 'Udo Kier, Virginia Newcomb, Amanda Marquardt, Amelia M. Gotham, Catriona MacColl, Shane Woodward, Victoria Maurette, André Hennicke', 'R', 'Down a seedy city street in her neighborhood, young Enola Penny is obsessed with what appears to be a long abandoned theatre. One night, she sees that the front door is slightly ajar and impulsively decides to sneak inside. But there in the dark, decrepit auditorium, a show unlike any other unfolds before her eyes. Its host is an eerie human puppet named Peg Poett who will introduce Penny to six tales of the bizarre: A couple traveling in a remote part of the French Pyrenees cross paths with a lustful witch; A paranoid lover faces the wrath of a partner who has been pushed to her limit; The Freudian dreams of an unfaithful husband blur the lines between fantasy and reality; The horrors of the real world are interpreted through the mind of a child; A woman addicted to other people''s memories gets her fix through the vitreous fluid of her victims'' eyeballs; And a perverse obsession with sweets turns sour for a couple in too deep.', 'Down a seedy city street in her neighborhood, young Enola Penny is obsessed with what appears to be a long abandoned theatre. One night, she sees that the front door is slightly ajar and impulsively decides to sneak inside. But there in the dark, decrepit auditorium, a show unlike any other unfolds before her eyes. Its host is an eerie human puppet named Peg Poett who will introduce Penny to six tales of the bizarre: A couple traveling in a remote part of the French Pyrenees cross paths with a lustful witch; A paranoid lover faces the wrath of a partner who has been pushed to her limit; The Freudian dreams of an unfaithful husband blur the lines between fantasy and reality; The horrors of the real world are interpreted through the mind of a child; A woman addicted to other people''s memories gets her fix through the vitreous fluid of her victims'' eyeballs; And a perverse obsession with sweets turns sour for a couple in too deep.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qtj2RjVq9YK9oEau5tAWDTurOW0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83727'),
  ('976082357401011939', 'The Theme', 1979, 'Drama', 'Gleb Panfilov, Leonid Kalashnikov, Evgeniya Indlina', 'Gleb Panfilov, Aleksandr Chervinsky', 'Mikhail Ulyanov, Inna Churikova, Yevgeni Vesnik, Yevgeniya Nechayeva, Sergey Nikonenko, Natalya Seleznyova, Stanislav Lyubshin, Tolya Panfilov', null, 'In search of inspiration and new topics, the famous metropolitan writer Kim Yesenin goes to the province. Unexpectedly for himself, he discovers that here people live very differently than in the world familiar to him. By chance, he witnesses someone else''s love drama - intellectual Sasha and dissident Andrei who is leaving for America. He is shocked by this complex conflict and fictitious problems, where there is no place for either melancholy or depression. In this situation, the hero decides to go to Moscow...', 'In search of inspiration and new topics, the famous metropolitan writer Kim Yesenin goes to the province. Unexpectedly for himself, he discovers that here people live very differently than in the world familiar to him. By chance, he witnesses someone else''s love drama - intellectual Sasha and dissident Andrei who is leaving for America. He is shocked by this complex conflict and fictitious problems, where there is no place for either melancholy or depression. In this situation, the hero decides to go to Moscow...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aUsB23s73SnA7RkesmtYaB3wXk9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:131349'),
  ('840398702480924623', 'The Theory of Flight', 1999, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Paul Greengrass, Ivan Strasburg, Jennie Osborn', 'Richard Hawkins', 'Helena Bonham Carter, Kenneth Branagh, Gemma Jones, Holly Aird, Ray Stevenson, Ruth Jones, Sue Jones-Davies, Gwenyth Petty', 'R', 'Richard is assigned public service after crashing his homemade aircraft, leading him to meet Jane, a young woman dying of motor neuron disease. Jane wishes to be de-flowered before her death; Richard declines, struggling to maintain his relationship with his girlfriend, but offers to help pay for a gigolo to do the deed.', 'Richard is assigned public service after crashing his homemade aircraft, leading him to meet Jane, a young woman dying of motor neuron disease. Jane wishes to be de-flowered before her death; Richard declines, struggling to maintain his relationship with his girlfriend, but offers to help pay for a gigolo to do the deed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wnvKxQ2PwqLf1QOtblr8ICrxXTi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76857'),
  ('993669535930023107', 'The Thick-Walled Room', 1956, 'Drama, War', 'Masaki Kobayashi, Yûgorô Imai, Kazui Nihonmatsu', 'Kōbō Abe', 'Kō Mishima, Torahiko Hamada, Keiko Kishi, Toshiko Kobayashi, Kinzō Shin, Tsutomu Shimomoto, Eitarō Ozawa, Tomio Aoki', null, 'A group of rank-and-file soldiers are jailed for crimes against humanity, themselves victims of a nation refusing to bear its burdens as a whole.', 'A group of rank-and-file soldiers are jailed for crimes against humanity, themselves victims of a nation refusing to bear its burdens as a whole.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sRI55L5hmLs6LTa031W4q7PwLaW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159412'),
  ('709007963235682712', 'The Thicket', 2024, 'Western, Crime, Thriller', 'Elliott Lester, Guillermo Garza, Phil Chipera', 'Chris Kelly', 'Peter Dinklage, Juliette Lewis, Levon Hawke, Leslie Grace, Gbenga Akinnagbe, Esmé Creed-Miles, Andrew Schulz, Macon Blair', 'R', 'An innocent young man, Jack, goes on an epic quest to rescue his sister Lula after she has been kidnapped by the violent killer Cut Throat Bill and her gang. To save her, Jack enlists the help of a crafty bounty hunter named Reginald Jones, a grave-digging alcoholic son of an ex-slave, and a street-smart prostitute. The gang tracks Cut Throat Bill into the deadly no-man’s land known as The Big Thicket — a place where blood and chaos reign.', 'An innocent young man, Jack, goes on an epic quest to rescue his sister Lula after she has been kidnapped by the violent killer Cut Throat Bill and her gang. To save her, Jack enlists the help of a crafty bounty hunter named Reginald Jones, a grave-digging alcoholic son of an ex-slave, and a street-smart prostitute. The gang tracks Cut Throat Bill into the deadly no-man’s land known as The Big Thicket — a place where blood and chaos reign.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jsvk8e0HgITFX0gbDEjj6hOytsP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:395817'),
  ('513959344447144682', 'The Thief', 1952, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Russell Rouse, Sam Leavitt, Leon Chooluck', 'Clarence Greene, Russell Rouse', 'Ray Milland, Martin Gabel, Harry Bronson, Rita Vale, Rex O''Malley, Rita Gam, John McKutcheon, Joe Conlin', 'NR', 'A chance accident causes a nuclear physicist, who''s selling top secret material to the Russians, to fall under FBI scrutiny and go on the run.', 'A chance accident causes a nuclear physicist, who''s selling top secret material to the Russians, to fall under FBI scrutiny and go on the run.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1jXvDY9pqIQu2Y986PoVFm2sDDj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38417'),
  ('326533474722814677', 'The Thief', 1997, 'Drama, Crime', 'Pavel Chukhray, Tatyana Saulkina, Yuliya Egorova', 'Pavel Chukhray', 'Vladimir Mashkov, Yekaterina Rednikova, Mikhail Filipchuk, Yuri Belyayev, Amaliya Mordvinova, Natalya Pozdnyakova, Lidiya Savchenko, Anatoliy Koshcheev', 'R', 'Katya and her 6-year-old son Sanya, who, in 1952, meet a veteran Soviet officer named Tolyan. Katya falls in love with Tolyan, who turns out to be a small time criminal, but who also becomes a father figure to Sanya ...', 'Katya and her 6-year-old son Sanya, who, in 1952, meet a veteran Soviet officer named Tolyan. Katya falls in love with Tolyan, who turns out to be a small time criminal, but who also becomes a father figure to Sanya ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rnHqDzKmnrm47dzhQvLJtZKRVK8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46187'),
  ('1111583943617222252', 'The Thief and the Cobbler', 1993, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy, Romance', 'Richard Williams, John Leatherbarrow, Fred Calvert', 'Richard Williams, Margaret French', 'Vincent Price, Matthew Broderick, Jennifer Beals, Anthony Quayle, Joan Sims, Donald Pleasence, Jonathan Winters, Paul Matthews', 'G', 'Princess Yum Yum falls in love with Tack and saves him from being executed. Later, when the protective orbs of the palace get stolen, Tacka and Yum Yum set out to find them and save the kingdom.', 'Princess Yum Yum falls in love with Tack and saves him from being executed. Later, when the protective orbs of the palace get stolen, Tacka and Yum Yum set out to find them and save the kingdom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3OKtFuTxahr7hokPB9aO38qgOfc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26672'),
  ('380977812606051945', 'The Thief and the Dogs', 1962, 'Crime, Drama, Action, Thriller', 'Kamal El Sheikh, Mostafa Gamal Eldein, Kamal Karim', 'Naguib Mahfouz, Kamal El Sheikh, Sabry Ezzat', 'Shoukry Sarhan, Shadia, Kamal Al-Shenawy, Fakher Fakher, Nazim Sharawy, Abdel Moneim Ismail, Fifi Youssef, Motawie Eweiss', null, 'This film, inspired by Naguib Mahfouz'' The thief and the dogs, tells the story of Mahran, a thief who quickly ascends to be the head of his gang. However, his second in command conspires against Mahran to take his position and his wife. After his prison term, Mahran is thirsty for revenge. But being chased by the police and by his new enemies destines him to a tragic life in hiding.', 'This film, inspired by Naguib Mahfouz'' The thief and the dogs, tells the story of Mahran, a thief who quickly ascends to be the head of his gang. However, his second in command conspires against Mahran to take his position and his wife. After his prison term, Mahran is thirsty for revenge. But being chased by the police and by his new enemies destines him to a tragic life in hiding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jHdXuRbMCAN28OoDMtdBtjkceWx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258663'),
  ('632463415405825594', 'The Thief Lord', 2006, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Family', 'David Slama, Richard Claus', 'Richard Claus, Daniel Musgrave', 'Aaron Taylor-Johnson, Jasper Harris, Rollo Weeks, Alice Connor, George MacKay, Jim Carter, Caroline Goodall, Robert Bathurst', null, 'A tale about two young boys, Prosper and Bo, who flee to Venice after being orphaned and dumped in the care of a cruel auntie. Hiding in the canals and alleyways of the city, the boys are befriended by a gang of young urchins and their enigmatic leader, the Thief Lord. From their home base of an old cinema theater, the children steal from the rich to support themselves and soon capture the interest of a bumbling detective. However, a greater threat to the children is something from a forgotten past - a beautiful magical treasure with the power to spin time itself', 'A tale about two young boys, Prosper and Bo, who flee to Venice after being orphaned and dumped in the care of a cruel auntie. Hiding in the canals and alleyways of the city, the boys are befriended by a gang of young urchins and their enigmatic leader, the Thief Lord. From their home base of an old cinema theater, the children steal from the rich to support themselves and soon capture the interest of a bumbling detective. However, a greater threat to the children is something from a forgotten past - a beautiful magical treasure with the power to spin time itself', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mLTON0o7tEk37UQMcnIWpngq1ZK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9520'),
  ('70555695706106451', 'The Thief of Bagdad', 1924, 'Romance, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Raoul Walsh, Arthur Edeson, James T. O''Donohoe', 'Achmed Abdullah', 'Douglas Fairbanks, Snitz Edwards, Charles Belcher, Julanne Johnston, Sôjin Kamiyama, Anna May Wong, Brandon Hurst, Tote Du Crow', 'NR', 'A recalcitrant thief vies with a duplicitous Mongol ruler for the hand of a beautiful princess.', 'A recalcitrant thief vies with a duplicitous Mongol ruler for the hand of a beautiful princess.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8t4CJ591N2FATf2yUiQNQk9p0tB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28963'),
  ('151699060339240741', 'The Thief of Bagdad', 1940, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Romance', 'Tim Whelan, Ludwig Berger, Michael Powell', 'Lajos Biró', 'Conrad Veidt, Sabu, June Duprez, John Justin, Rex Ingram, Miles Malleson, Morton Selten, Mary Morris', 'NR', 'When Prince Ahmad is blinded and cast out of Bagdad by the nefarious Jaffar, he joins forces with the scrappy thief Abu to win back his royal place, as well as the heart of a beautiful princess.', 'When Prince Ahmad is blinded and cast out of Bagdad by the nefarious Jaffar, he joins forces with the scrappy thief Abu to win back his royal place, as well as the heart of a beautiful princess.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Fs29JYTOkDluTXgbvLRIaps6PO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12232'),
  ('349125530447203532', 'The Thief of Baghdad', 1961, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Family', 'Arthur Lubin, Tonino Delli Colli, Bruno Vailati', 'Augusto Frassinetti, Bruno Vailati, Filippo Sanjust', 'Steve Reeves, Giorgia Moll, Edy Vessel, Arturo Dominici, Daniele Vargas, Antonio Battistella, Fanfulla, Giancarlo Zarfati', null, 'When Karim impersonates a prince Osman, he steals the heart of Amina the Sultans daughter. The real prince intends to get Amina back by giving her a love potion. But his plan backfires and Amina becomes deathly ill. Karim must make it through 7 doors to retrieve the only thing that can save his love-a mystical blue rose. A timeless, enchanting story!', 'When Karim impersonates a prince Osman, he steals the heart of Amina the Sultans daughter. The real prince intends to get Amina back by giving her a love potion. But his plan backfires and Amina becomes deathly ill. Karim must make it through 7 doors to retrieve the only thing that can save his love-a mystical blue rose. A timeless, enchanting story!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rPGGCpHw5ENglilT0RDoYMcIEO4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124324'),
  ('213096787313404213', 'The Thief of Baghdad', 2020, 'Comedy, Action, Adventure', 'Haitham Hosny, Ahmed Khaled Mousa', 'Tamer Ibrahim', 'Mohamed Emam, Yasmine Raeis, Amina Khalil, Fathy Abdel Wahab, Mohamed Abdel Rahman, Ahmed El Awadi, Bayoumi Fouad, Ahmed Rizq', null, 'In an atmosphere of suspense and excitement, Yousef, Khaled, and Nadia embark on a journey to locate the tomb of Alexander the Great, which has been sought by everyone for years.', 'In an atmosphere of suspense and excitement, Yousef, Khaled, and Nadia embark on a journey to locate the tomb of Alexander the Great, which has been sought by everyone for years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5fIi95LZBATgdMfNkASLBdqodh8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:638796'),
  ('835330501679836998', 'The Thief of Paris', 1967, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama, History', 'Louis Malle, Patrick Bureau, Juan Luis Buñuel', 'Jean-Claude Carrière, Louis Malle', 'Jean-Paul Belmondo, Geneviève Bujold, Marie Dubois, Julien Guiomar, Paul Le Person, Christian Lude, Françoise Fabian, Marlène Jobert', null, 'In turn-of-the-century Paris, Georges Randal is brought up by his wealthy uncle, who steals his inheritance. Georges hopes to marry his cousin Charlotte, but his uncle arranges for her to marry a rich neighbour. In retaliation, Georges steals the fiancé''s family jewels, and enjoys the experience so much that he embarks upon a lifetime of burglary.', 'In turn-of-the-century Paris, Georges Randal is brought up by his wealthy uncle, who steals his inheritance. Georges hopes to marry his cousin Charlotte, but his uncle arranges for her to marry a rich neighbour. In retaliation, Georges steals the fiancé''s family jewels, and enjoys the experience so much that he embarks upon a lifetime of burglary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tPEDn3u2q8q82kREjiGKmfA7rPm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55370'),
  ('795499127109959124', 'The Thief Who Came to Dinner', 1973, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Bud Yorkin, Philip H. Lathrop, Michael D. Moore', 'Walter Hill', 'Ryan O''Neal, Jacqueline Bisset, Warren Oates, Jill Clayburgh, Charles Cioffi, Ned Beatty, Austin Pendleton, Gregory Sierra', 'PG', 'A computer programmer decides to become a thief. And when he starts making waves, an insurance investigator hounds him. He also meets a woman who becomes his accomplice.', 'A computer programmer decides to become a thief. And when he starts making waves, an insurance investigator hounds him. He also meets a woman who becomes his accomplice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2sopwAOdBOzrQ5kcBdZrC1Y9FnS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92299'),
  ('829752244207072159', 'The Thieves', 1959, 'Comedy', 'Lucio Fulci, Manuel Berenguer, Felice D''Alisera', 'Lucio Fulci, Marcello Coscia, Nanni Loy', 'Totò, Armando Calvo, Giovanna Ralli, Giacomo Furia, Enzo Turco, María Luisa Rolando, Rafael Luis Calvo, Juanjo Menéndez', null, 'An Italian-American mobster is sent back to Naples from the States. He moves to Italy with all his illegal proceeds hidden in jam jars--which fall into the wrong hands when they get to the harbour of Naples. These hands belong to people who demand their fair share. Meanwhile, the mobster is questioned by investigators.', 'An Italian-American mobster is sent back to Naples from the States. He moves to Italy with all his illegal proceeds hidden in jam jars--which fall into the wrong hands when they get to the harbour of Naples. These hands belong to people who demand their fair share. Meanwhile, the mobster is questioned by investigators.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pcliLcY5Jrv106hPY3PwKjulMgP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74812'),
  ('779146830365551485', 'The Thieves', 2012, 'Action, Crime', 'Choi Dong-hoon, Choi Young-hwan', 'Lee Ki-cheol, Choi Dong-hoon', 'Kim Yun-seok, Kim Hye-soo, Lee Jung-jae, Gianna Jun, Simon Yam, Kim Hae-sook, Oh Dal-su, Kim Soo-hyun', 'NR', 'A gang of South Korean thieves team up with a Hong Kong crew to steal a diamond necklace from a heavily-guarded casino safe in Macau. As the cops close in, old betrayals — and misunderstandings — resurface.', 'A gang of South Korean thieves team up with a Hong Kong crew to steal a diamond necklace from a heavily-guarded casino safe in Macau. As the cops close in, old betrayals — and misunderstandings — resurface.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eYJihoMqME80tp9uJIpIlRF9RI0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124157'),
  ('835903879791369434', 'The Thieving Magpie', 1965, 'Animation', 'Giulio Gianini, Emanuele Luzzati', 'Giulio Gianini, Emanuele Luzzati', null, null, 'A king and his hunting party shoot down birds. A magpie escapes the onslaught of arrows and wreaks havoc on the hunting party.', 'A king and his hunting party shoot down birds. A magpie escapes the onslaught of arrows and wreaks havoc on the hunting party.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jwTExMIWqtLQdUuhJuwOGwFMW5g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129979'),
  ('722713668834384411', 'The Thieving Magpie', 2025, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Robert Guédiguian, Pierre Milon, Ferdinand Verhaeghe', 'Robert Guédiguian, Serge Valletti', 'Ariane Ascaride, Jean-Pierre Darroussin, Gérard Meylan, Grégoire Leprince-Ringuet, Marilou Aussilloux, Lola Naymark, Robinson Stévenin, Thorvald Sondergaard', null, 'Maria, who''s not as young as she used to be and who helps people older than her, is living from hand to mouth. She can''t quite accept her precarious situation and steals a few euros here and there from all those lovely people she looks after with such devotion, and who adore her for it… But after an accusation of abuse of a vulnerable person, Maria winds up in police custody.', 'Maria, who''s not as young as she used to be and who helps people older than her, is living from hand to mouth. She can''t quite accept her precarious situation and steals a few euros here and there from all those lovely people she looks after with such devotion, and who adore her for it… But after an accusation of abuse of a vulnerable person, Maria winds up in police custody.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lvNpUwVOlj9hoY0JiH5b5OHh9SJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1175267'),
  ('16091034296724080', 'The Thin Blue Line', 1988, 'Crime, Documentary', 'Errol Morris, Robert Chappell, Stefan Czapsky', 'Errol Morris', 'Randall Adams, David Harris, Gus Rose, Jackie Johnson, Marshall Touchton, Dale Holt, Sam Kittrell, Hootie Nelson', null, 'This unique documentary dramatically re-enacts the crime scene and investigation of a police officer''s murder in Dallas.', 'This unique documentary dramatically re-enacts the crime scene and investigation of a police officer''s murder in Dallas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4w4BJk3l8y9gYwPPLRs6uPHOmGL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14285'),
  ('775393244800630006', 'The Thin Man', 1934, 'Comedy, Mystery, Crime', 'James Wong Howe, David Townsend, Edwin B. Willis', 'Albert Hackett, Frances Goodrich', 'William Powell, Myrna Loy, Maureen O''Sullivan, Nat Pendleton, Minna Gombell, Porter Hall, Henry Wadsworth, William Henry', 'NR', 'A husband and wife detective team takes on the search for a missing inventor and almost get killed for their efforts.', 'A husband and wife detective team takes on the search for a missing inventor and almost get killed for their efforts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6cL89ok9t8xEKboOjOVga2W66jj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3529'),
  ('835559815667439938', 'The Thin Man Goes Home', 1944, 'Comedy, Mystery', 'Richard Thorpe, Karl Freund', 'Robert Riskin, Dwight Taylor', 'William Powell, Myrna Loy, Lucile Watson, Gloria DeHaven, Anne Revere, Helen Vinson, Harry Davenport, Leon Ames', 'NR', 'On a trip to visit his parents, detective Nick Charles gets mixed up in a murder investigation.', 'On a trip to visit his parents, detective Nick Charles gets mixed up in a murder investigation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xKnTU1LOeRU8AubY2LO5lGRiPpv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14594'),
  ('965478678378236398', 'The Thin Red Line', 1964, 'War', 'Andrew Marton, Manuel Berenguer', 'Bernard Gordon', 'Keir Dullea, Jack Warden, James Philbrook, Bob Kanter, Ray Daley, Merlyn Yordan, Kieron Moore, Jim Gillen', null, 'Set during the Allied invasion of the island of Guadalcanal in the Pacific theater during WWII, this film is based on the novel by James Jones. Keir Dullea is Private Doll, who dreads the invasion and steals a pistol to help him protect himself. Sergeant Welsh (Jack Warden), a caustic, battle-scarred veteran, hates Doll, whom he considers a coward. In battle, Doll kills a Japanese soldier and is filled with remorse, which further angers the sergeant. The next day, an emboldened Doll wipes out an entire enemy machine gun post and begins to feel as sadistic as Welsh. The two must work together to clear away some mines, but as they do, their platoon is surprised by a Japanese raid.', 'Set during the Allied invasion of the island of Guadalcanal in the Pacific theater during WWII, this film is based on the novel by James Jones. Keir Dullea is Private Doll, who dreads the invasion and steals a pistol to help him protect himself. Sergeant Welsh (Jack Warden), a caustic, battle-scarred veteran, hates Doll, whom he considers a coward. In battle, Doll kills a Japanese soldier and is filled with remorse, which further angers the sergeant. The next day, an emboldened Doll wipes out an entire enemy machine gun post and begins to feel as sadistic as Welsh. The two must work together to clear away some mines, but as they do, their platoon is surprised by a Japanese raid.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lXsV3ameod1x2LxOtreXqWqB2w3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:188608'),
  ('336170133733047437', 'The Thin Red Line', 1998, 'Drama, History, War', 'Terrence Malick, John Toll, Gary Capo', 'Terrence Malick', 'Jim Caviezel, Nick Nolte, Sean Penn, Ben Chaplin, Elias Koteas, John Cusack, Dash Mihok, John C. Reilly', 'R', 'The story of a group of men, an Army Rifle company called C-for-Charlie, who change, suffer, and ultimately make essential discoveries about themselves during the fierce World War II battle of Guadalcanal. It follows their journey, from the surprise of an unopposed landing, through the bloody and exhausting battles that follow, to the ultimate departure of those who survived.', 'The story of a group of men, an Army Rifle company called C-for-Charlie, who change, suffer, and ultimately make essential discoveries about themselves during the fierce World War II battle of Guadalcanal. It follows their journey, from the surprise of an unopposed landing, through the bloody and exhausting battles that follow, to the ultimate departure of those who survived.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/seMydAaoxQP6F0xbE1jOcTmn5Jr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8741'),
  ('858364612103318920', 'The Thin Yellow Line', 2015, 'Drama', 'Celso R. García, Emiliano Villanueva', 'Celso R. García', 'Damián Alcázar, Joaquín Cosío, Silverio Palacios, Gustavo Sánchez Parra, Américo Hollander, Fernando Becerril, Tomihuatzi Xelhuantzi, Tara Parra', null, 'Five men are hired to paint the yellow line the road between two villages in Mexico forgotten. Aboard an old pickup truck, initiated the work of more than two hundred kilometers of asphalt and yellow paint to be completed in less than a fortnight', 'Five men are hired to paint the yellow line the road between two villages in Mexico forgotten. Aboard an old pickup truck, initiated the work of more than two hundred kilometers of asphalt and yellow paint to be completed in less than a fortnight', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bjcegq38wYxrQuCCmZWHfUfdem.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:268854'),
  ('1082521276409996389', 'The Thing', 1982, 'Horror, Mystery, Science Fiction', 'John Carpenter, Dean Cundey, Larry Franco', 'Bill Lancaster', 'Kurt Russell, Wilford Brimley, T.K. Carter, David Clennon, Keith David, Richard Dysart, Charles Hallahan, Peter Maloney', 'R', 'A research team in Antarctica is hunted by a shape-shifting alien that assumes the appearance of its victims.', 'A research team in Antarctica is hunted by a shape-shifting alien that assumes the appearance of its victims.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tzGY49kseSE9QAKk47uuDGwnSCu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1091'),
  ('742478719695878930', 'The Thing', 1990, 'Documentary', 'Giuseppe Baresi, Roberto Cimatti, Riccardo Gambacciani', null, null, null, '1989. Amidst the collapse of the Eastern Bloc, the largest communist party in Western Europe—Italy''s PCI—announces it''s going to change name, vowing to become a new ''thing''. This film shows the debates taking place in various PCI chapters across Italy after the historic decision.', '1989. Amidst the collapse of the Eastern Bloc, the largest communist party in Western Europe—Italy''s PCI—announces it''s going to change name, vowing to become a new ''thing''. This film shows the debates taking place in various PCI chapters across Italy after the historic decision.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cWDUgndKJVt91tQvUa85aLUORAh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:168735'),
  ('380806454633442924', 'The Thing', 2011, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Mystery', 'Jonnie Katz, Matthijs van Heijningen Jr., Michel Abramowicz', 'Eric Heisserer', 'Mary Elizabeth Winstead, Joel Edgerton, Ulrich Thomsen, Eric Christian Olsen, Adewale Akinnuoye-Agbaje, Paul Braunstein, Trond Espen Seim, Kim Bubbs', 'R', 'When paleontologist Kate Lloyd travels to an isolated outpost in Antarctica for the expedition of a lifetime, she joins an international team that unearths a remarkable discovery. Their elation quickly turns to fear as they realize that their experiment has freed a mysterious being from its frozen prison. Paranoia spreads like an epidemic as a creature that can mimic anything it touches will pit human against human as it tries to survive and flourish in this spine-tingling thriller.', 'When paleontologist Kate Lloyd travels to an isolated outpost in Antarctica for the expedition of a lifetime, she joins an international team that unearths a remarkable discovery. Their elation quickly turns to fear as they realize that their experiment has freed a mysterious being from its frozen prison. Paranoia spreads like an epidemic as a creature that can mimic anything it touches will pit human against human as it tries to survive and flourish in this spine-tingling thriller.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dmn2nVo8h7LMnk694JxCRIwK06p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60935'),
  ('296976755272938349', 'The Thing About Harry', 2020, 'Romance, TV Movie, Comedy', 'Anthony E. Cabral, Peter Paige, Jayson Crothers', 'Josh Senter, Peter Paige', 'Jake Borelli, Niko Terho, Britt Baron, Japhet Balaban, Peter Paige, Karamo Brown, Becca Hurd, Matt Lusk', 'PG-13', 'Two high school enemies, uber-jock Harry and out-and-proud Sam, are forced to share a car ride to their Missouri hometown for a friend''s engagement party on Valentine''s Day. Things take a turn when Sam learns Harry has come out.', 'Two high school enemies, uber-jock Harry and out-and-proud Sam, are forced to share a car ride to their Missouri hometown for a friend''s engagement party on Valentine''s Day. Things take a turn when Sam learns Harry has come out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sdn5NdFMcsub3QUwlovOA9fPJoW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:647325'),
  ('331567479318966583', 'The Thing About My Folks', 2005, 'Family, Comedy, Drama', 'Raymond De Felitta, Dan Gillham', 'Paul Reiser', 'Peter Falk, Paul Reiser, Olympia Dukakis, Elizabeth Perkins, Mackenzie Connolly, Ann Dowd, Mimi Lieber, Lydia Jordan', 'PG-13', 'Ben''s dad Sam shows up one night with a note from Ben''s mother (Sam''s wife of 46 years), that she has left. While Ben''s wife and his three sisters try to find her, Ben takes Sam on a day trip to see a farmhouse that''s for sale. The day trip turns into a road trip while dad and son explore their past, their relationship, and why Sam''s wife might have left him. The road trip includes fishing, drinking, playing pool, sleeping under the stars, and frank discussion. Anger simmers close at hand, as do love and hope. Where Sam''s wife is - and why she left - leads to the movie''s resolution.', 'Ben''s dad Sam shows up one night with a note from Ben''s mother (Sam''s wife of 46 years), that she has left. While Ben''s wife and his three sisters try to find her, Ben takes Sam on a day trip to see a farmhouse that''s for sale. The day trip turns into a road trip while dad and son explore their past, their relationship, and why Sam''s wife might have left him. The road trip includes fishing, drinking, playing pool, sleeping under the stars, and frank discussion. Anger simmers close at hand, as do love and hope. Where Sam''s wife is - and why she left - leads to the movie''s resolution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r0u9l2f5ktzDmsvnXXGOkhRDjqP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23703'),
  ('396826147828883662', 'The Thing Behind The Door', 2023, 'Horror', 'Fabrice Blin, Stéphane Chaput', 'Fabrice Blin', 'Séverine Ferrer, David Doukhan, Clémence Verniau, Philippe Lamendin, Fabien Jegoudez, Yves Lecat, Quentin Surtel', null, 'The story of Adèle, a youg woman who’s literally haunted by the death of her husband, killed in a trench during World War One. Desperate and unable to face this tragic loss, Adèle turns to black magic in the hope to bring her lover back. The miracle will happen, but Adèle will have to pay the price for opening this Pandora Box.', 'The story of Adèle, a youg woman who’s literally haunted by the death of her husband, killed in a trench during World War One. Desperate and unable to face this tragic loss, Adèle turns to black magic in the hope to bring her lover back. The miracle will happen, but Adèle will have to pay the price for opening this Pandora Box.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ouEJLj6eZuQZUZ6bf69RJg9g0lQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:691363'),
  ('679081530242591570', 'The Thing Below', 2004, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Pieter Stathis, Jim Wynorski, David Pelletier', 'Raul Sanchez Inglis, Keith Shaw, William Langlois', 'Billy Warlock, Kurt Max Runte, Catherine Lough Haggquist, Peter Graham-Gaudreau, Warren Christie, Kiara Hunter, David Richmond-Peck, Colin Lawrence', 'R', 'A top secret drilling platform in the Gulf of Mexico raises a dormant alien creature from the depths. Once loose, the creature goes on a murderous rampage.', 'A top secret drilling platform in the Gulf of Mexico raises a dormant alien creature from the depths. Once loose, the creature goes on a murderous rampage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bA1NlbAnI6a3FpUY2ZAmdkFDnn2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66121'),
