  ('215616011335596418', 'The Thing That Couldn''t Die', 1958, 'Horror', 'Russell Metty, Will Cowan, Marshall Green', 'David Duncan', 'William Reynolds, Carolyn Kearney, Jeffrey Stone, Andra Martin, Peggy Converse, Robin Hughes, Charles Horvath, James Anderson', 'NR', 'A 400 year old disembodied head hypnotizes a female psychic, who recovered it using a dowsing rod, to search for the rest of its body.', 'A 400 year old disembodied head hypnotizes a female psychic, who recovered it using a dowsing rod, to search for the rest of its body.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tBCBlmOAZnu6D4UEXxUhWTT6LOn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47001'),
  ('1039477293169631544', 'The Thing with Feathers', 2025, 'Drama', 'Dylan Southern, Ben Fordesman, Jessica Laws', 'Dylan Southern', 'Benedict Cumberbatch, David Thewlis, Sam Spruell, Vinette Robinson, Leo Bill, Garry Cooper, Jessie Cave, Adam Basil', 'R', 'After a tragic loss, a grieving father tries to raise his young sons whilst dealing with an unlikely, unpredictable, and uninvited houseguest.', 'After a tragic loss, a grieving father tries to raise his young sons whilst dealing with an unlikely, unpredictable, and uninvited houseguest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j3kM0tMW7EQaOrit0JW9NvoPPrp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1127628'),
  ('403740163552472200', 'The Thing with Two Heads', 1972, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Lee Frost, Jack Steely', 'Wes Bishop, Lee Frost, James Gordon White', 'Ray Milland, Rosey Grier, Don Marshall, Roger Perry, Chelsea Brown, Kathrine Baumann, John Dullaghan, John Bliss', 'PG', 'A rich but racist man is dying and hatches an elaborate scheme for transplanting his head onto another man''s body. His health deteriorates rapidly, and doctors are forced to transplant his head onto the only available candidate: a black man from death row.', 'A rich but racist man is dying and hatches an elaborate scheme for transplanting his head onto another man''s body. His health deteriorates rapidly, and doctors are forced to transplant his head onto the only available candidate: a black man from death row.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xYj9DpCeqM6bbvMvxlGqujU9boQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28650'),
  ('868275943586013296', 'The Thing: Terror Takes Shape', 1998, 'Documentary', 'Michael Matessino', 'Michael Matessino', 'John Carpenter, David Foster, Bill Lancaster, John J. Lloyd, Dean Cundey, Rob Bottin, Kurt Russell, Richard Masur', null, 'An in-depth look at the making of John Carpenter''s cult classic sci-fi horror The Thing, telling the story of a group of researchers in Antarctica who encounter a parasitic extra-terrestrial life-form that assimilates, then imitates other organisms.', 'An in-depth look at the making of John Carpenter''s cult classic sci-fi horror The Thing, telling the story of a group of researchers in Antarctica who encounter a parasitic extra-terrestrial life-form that assimilates, then imitates other organisms.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/enqYQR24eOAvdtFKyoWGkK3dV3s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92171'),
  ('1117799370287193481', 'The Things of Life', 1970, 'Drama, Romance', 'Claude Sautet, Jean Boffety, Jean-Claude Sussfeld', 'Claude Sautet, Jean-Loup Dabadie, Paul Guimard', 'Michel Piccoli, Romy Schneider, Lea Massari, Gérard Lartigau, Jean Bouise, Boby Lapointe, Hervé Sand, Jacques Richard', null, 'The mind of Pierre Bérard, a successful middle-aged architect, is torn between his unstable present with Hélène, his younger lover, and his happy memories of the past with Catherine, his ex-wife; but his true destiny awaits him at a crossroads on his way to Rennes…', 'The mind of Pierre Bérard, a successful middle-aged architect, is torn between his unstable present with Hélène, his younger lover, and his happy memories of the past with Catherine, his ex-wife; but his true destiny awaits him at a crossroads on his way to Rennes…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nC3b7VV5YcSkAF6WteQL8EF4lme.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3423'),
  ('771479829029871139', 'The Things of Love', 1989, 'Drama, Romance, Music, Crime', 'Jaime Chávarri, Hans Burmann', 'Jaime Chávarri, Fernando Colomo, Lázaro Irazábal', 'Ángela Molina, Ángel de Andrés López, Manuel Bandera, María Barranco, Amparo Baró, Mary Carmen Ramírez, Diana Peñalver, Juan Gea', null, 'In 1940''s Madrid. Juan plays piano for Pepita and her on-stage partner Mario. Although Mario really wants to steal Juan for himself, Juan is not interested and Mario resorts to a string of lovers as consolation. When he loves (and leaves) a young nobleman, the young man wants revenge.', 'In 1940''s Madrid. Juan plays piano for Pepita and her on-stage partner Mario. Although Mario really wants to steal Juan for himself, Juan is not interested and Mario resorts to a string of lovers as consolation. When he loves (and leaves) a young nobleman, the young man wants revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7k0fjD9deRAVBUvVXyMrpf7jDbh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77451'),
  ('28000481783873969', 'The Things of Love: Part 2', 1995, 'Drama, Music', 'Jaime Chávarri, Hans Burmann', 'Antonio Larreta, Luis Sanz', 'Ángela Molina, Manuel Bandera, Darío Grandinetti, Amparo Baró, Susú Pecoraro, Anabel Alonso, Antonio Valero, Mary Carmen Ramírez', null, 'On the way to his exile in Lisbon, Mario meets Silvia, a widow who turns out to be one of his admirers. Silvia has inherited a fortune, leading Mario to resume his career, eventually falling for him. Although Mario has relations with her, he makes it clear that will never fall in love. In Madrid, Juan Pepita and resume their relationship, and because of this the jilted Nena John Colman murders before Pepita, after being arrested. Pepita accepts a contract in Argentina, reunited with Mario. There he meets Tulio, who after starting a relationship with singer eventually ask marriage.', 'On the way to his exile in Lisbon, Mario meets Silvia, a widow who turns out to be one of his admirers. Silvia has inherited a fortune, leading Mario to resume his career, eventually falling for him. Although Mario has relations with her, he makes it clear that will never fall in love. In Madrid, Juan Pepita and resume their relationship, and because of this the jilted Nena John Colman murders before Pepita, after being arrested. Pepita accepts a contract in Argentina, reunited with Mario. There he meets Tulio, who after starting a relationship with singer eventually ask marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/B8qFTnhgOtm5r12SnFCwrx6aTP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:311239'),
  ('743605483935884833', 'The Things You Kill', 2025, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Alireza Khatami, Bartosz Świniarski, Serap Aydoğan', 'Alireza Khatami', 'Ekin Koç, Erkan Kolçak Köstendil, Hazar Ergüçlü, Selen Kurtaran, İdil Engindeniz, Ercan Kesal, Güliz Şirinyan, Aysan Sümercan', null, 'Questioning the suspicious death of his mother, a university professor and his enigmatic gardener descend into a hypnotic maze of mirrors and memories. As family secrets surface and painful truths emerge, they spiral toward a devastating reckoning with the darkness lurking within us all.', 'Questioning the suspicious death of his mother, a university professor and his enigmatic gardener descend into a hypnotic maze of mirrors and memories. As family secrets surface and painful truths emerge, they spiral toward a devastating reckoning with the darkness lurking within us all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kR8CHANk8KwQLWarMIQsk2mthhW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1001270'),
  ('907888481130851335', 'The Thinning', 2016, 'Thriller, Drama, Horror', 'Michael J. Gallagher, Greg Cotten', 'Michael J. Gallagher, Steve Greene', 'Logan Paul, Peyton List, Lia Marie Johnson, Calum Worthy, Ryan Whitney, Michael Traynor, Stacey Dash, Matthew Glave', null, 'In a post-apocalyptic future where population control is dictated by a high-school aptitude test, two students discover the test is smoke and mirrors hiding a larger conspiracy.', 'In a post-apocalyptic future where population control is dictated by a high-school aptitude test, two students discover the test is smoke and mirrors hiding a larger conspiracy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1vgtCoBbBzeoW78g8fHT4EekoM2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:419639'),
  ('1059761879027680864', 'The Thinning: New World Order', 2018, 'Action, Drama, Thriller, Horror', 'Greg Cotten, Michael J. Gallagher', 'Michael J. Gallagher, Steve Greene', 'Logan Paul, Peyton List, Lia Marie Johnson, Calum Worthy, Charles Melton, Michael Traynor, Rome Flynn, Laura Harring', 'NR', 'Blake Redding is trapped in this dark room wanting to protect his love so the only thing he will do is escape like no failed student has done before.', 'Blake Redding is trapped in this dark room wanting to protect his love so the only thing he will do is escape like no failed student has done before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uQtYfyldOV3mPzclKr0K90FTS0n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:496274'),
  ('231528598721489839', 'The Third Alibi', 1961, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Montgomery Tully, Walter J. Harvey, David Tringham', 'Maurice J. Wilson, Montgomery Tully', 'Laurence Payne, Patricia Dainton, Jane Griffiths, Edward Underdown, John Arnatt, Humphrey Lestocq, Lucy Griffiths, Olive Milbourne', null, 'A composer (Laurence Payne) is stuck in a middle-class marriage and finds that his affair with his wife''s half-sister (Jane Griffiths) has resulted in a pregnancy. When his wife refuses to give him a divorce he hatches a murder scheme that is too clever by half.', 'A composer (Laurence Payne) is stuck in a middle-class marriage and finds that his affair with his wife''s half-sister (Jane Griffiths) has resulted in a pregnancy. When his wife refuses to give him a divorce he hatches a murder scheme that is too clever by half.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wgt5yedpWUE60HutNnL5KjiBYPR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:398063'),
  ('333133901594716176', 'The Third Eye', 1966, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Mino Guerrini', 'Mino Guerrini, Piero Regnoli', 'Franco Nero, Gioia Pascal, Erika Blanc, Olga Solbelli, Marina Morgan, Gara Granda, Richard Hillock, Luciano Foti', null, 'Young nobleman Mino lives with his mother and Marta, the housekeeper, in an old, decaying castle. He is infantile and morbidly attached to the weird duo; his only hobby is taxidermy. Laura, Mino''s fiancee, is met with jealousy and hatred by the two women, and decides to leave the castle; but Marta sabotages her car brakes and she is killed. Mino takes her body back to the castle. Meanwhile, his mother is violently arguing with Marta, who throws her down the stairs and repeatedly bashes her head on the floor. The distraught Mino descends into madness: he picks up a stripper at a nightclub and brings her home, then strangles her while having sex next to Laura''s dead body. He does the same with a prostitute. Marta discovers these murders and offers to help dispose of bodies. A year later, Daniela (Laura''s twin sister) arrives at the castle...', 'Young nobleman Mino lives with his mother and Marta, the housekeeper, in an old, decaying castle. He is infantile and morbidly attached to the weird duo; his only hobby is taxidermy. Laura, Mino''s fiancee, is met with jealousy and hatred by the two women, and decides to leave the castle; but Marta sabotages her car brakes and she is killed. Mino takes her body back to the castle. Meanwhile, his mother is violently arguing with Marta, who throws her down the stairs and repeatedly bashes her head on the floor. The distraught Mino descends into madness: he picks up a stripper at a nightclub and brings her home, then strangles her while having sex next to Laura''s dead body. He does the same with a prostitute. Marta discovers these murders and offers to help dispose of bodies. A year later, Daniela (Laura''s twin sister) arrives at the castle...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kLmPX29NgK3aES021mFWVZW2v7l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104927'),
  ('855967366487856897', 'The Third Eye', 2017, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Rocky Soraya, Asep Kalila, Ateeq Shah', 'Fajar Umbara, Riheam Junianti', 'Jessica Mila, Bianca Hello, Denny Sumargo, Citra Prima, Epy Kusnandar, Derry Drajat, Voke Victoria, Shofia Shireen', null, 'When her little sister claims she sees the dead, Alia consults a psychic, who opens her own eyes to the vengeful ghosts haunting their childhood home.', 'When her little sister claims she sees the dead, Alia consults a psychic, who opens her own eyes to the vengeful ghosts haunting their childhood home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sOUhG1OMRD5RfMpMnT1AhramdZI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:480007'),
  ('861408590301304930', 'The Third Generation', 1979, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Rainer Werner Fassbinder, Rainer Werner Fassbinder, Diana Elephant', 'Rainer Werner Fassbinder', 'Harry Baer, Hark Bohm, Margit Carstensen, Eddie Constantine, Jürgen Draeger, Udo Kier, Volker Spengler, Hanna Schygulla', 'NR', 'A wildly anarchic satire of guerrilla terrorism in which a band of leftist radicals inadvertently become puppets of the West German government, which uses them to justify its authoritarian policies.', 'A wildly anarchic satire of guerrilla terrorism in which a band of leftist radicals inadvertently become puppets of the West German government, which uses them to justify its authoritarian policies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i83LSPgoioCuywFQmDrAyoTVUFq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122683'),
  ('877019329694018855', 'The Third Lover', 1962, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Claude Chabrol, Jean Rabier', 'Claude Chabrol, Paul Gégauff, Martial Matthieu', 'Jacques Charrier, Walther Reyer, Stéphane Audran, Daniel Boulanger, Erika Tweer, Michaël Munzer, Claude Romet, Louis Le Pin', null, 'On a work assignment in Germany, failed journalist Albin crosses paths with Andreas, a successful writer, and his wife Hélène, who quickly becomes the apple of Albin’s eye. While Andreas is off on a business trip, Albin tries to seduce Hélèn and, eventually, take over Andreas’ life.', 'On a work assignment in Germany, failed journalist Albin crosses paths with Andreas, a successful writer, and his wife Hélène, who quickly becomes the apple of Albin’s eye. While Andreas is off on a business trip, Albin tries to seduce Hélèn and, eventually, take over Andreas’ life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6bVUMaY3BaXQQ8FxtA0KApYEqFz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101183'),
