  ('1032855238755967269', 'The Third Murder', 2017, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', 'Hirokazu Kore-eda, Haruka Kawai, Takuya Hisano', 'Hirokazu Kore-eda', 'Masaharu Fukuyama, Koji Yakusho, Suzu Hirose, Shinnosuke Mitsushima, Mikako Ichikawa, Izumi Matsuoka, Aju Makita, Tōru Shinagawa', 'R', 'A lawyer tasked with defending a robbery-and-murder suspect begins developing doubts about what truly happened.', 'A lawyer tasked with defending a robbery-and-murder suspect begins developing doubts about what truly happened.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xENc6UYviC3JfFqKA6kReHfT2Zt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:434775'),
  ('328691284179402754', 'The Third One', 2014, 'Drama, Romance', 'Gustavo Tejeda, Rodrigo Guerrero', 'Rodrigo Guerrero', 'Carlos Echevarría, Emiliano Dionisi, Nicolás Armengol', 'NR', 'After meeting in a chat room, Fede arrives at a down- town building to have an intimate encounter with a gay couple older than him. As the night unfolds, Fede has an intense and telling experience. The next morning finds him different, as if suddenly he had found a new possible way to love.', 'After meeting in a chat room, Fede arrives at a down- town building to have an intimate encounter with a gay couple older than him. As the night unfolds, Fede has an intense and telling experience. The next morning finds him different, as if suddenly he had found a new possible way to love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zqlLnWKWbUUcwCum4mjePnKF2OB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:261776'),
