  ('562564249923457764', 'The Third Part of the Night', 1972, 'War, Drama, Horror', 'Andrzej Żuławski, Witold Sobociński, Andrzej Kotkowski', 'Andrzej Żuławski, Mirosław Żuławski', 'Leszek Teleszyński, Małgorzata Braunek, Jan Nowicki, Jerzy Goliński, Anna Milewska, Michał Grudziński, Marek Walczewski, Hanna Stankówna', null, 'Set during the Nazi occupation of Poland, the story follows Michał, who witnesses the murder of his mother, wife and child and then is hurled into a life that literally is not his own; a surreal world littered with trapdoors, doppelgängers and wormholes.', 'Set during the Nazi occupation of Poland, the story follows Michał, who witnesses the murder of his mother, wife and child and then is hurled into a life that literally is not his own; a surreal world littered with trapdoors, doppelgängers and wormholes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/26bTBcH1SVn92dVNr6X9JQxXlxe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46799'),
  ('377650904416087720', 'The Third Planet', 1991, 'Science Fiction, Drama', 'Aleksandr Rogozhkin, Nikolay Stroganov', 'Aleksandr Rogozhkin', 'Anna Matyukhina, Boris Sokolov, Svetlana Mikhalchenko, Konstantin Polyansky, Georgi Pankratov, Aleksey Poluyan', null, 'Drawing heavily from Arkady and Boris Strugatsky''s 1971 novella ''Piknik na obochine'' (''Roadside Picnic'') as well as Andrei Tarkovsky''s 1979 film adaptation (''Stalker''), ''Tretya planeta'' tells the story of a father seeking a cure for his ill daughter by venturing into an area known only as "The Zone" to request help from the mysterious healers that dwell within its forbidden borders.', 'Drawing heavily from Arkady and Boris Strugatsky''s 1971 novella ''Piknik na obochine'' (''Roadside Picnic'') as well as Andrei Tarkovsky''s 1979 film adaptation (''Stalker''), ''Tretya planeta'' tells the story of a father seeking a cure for his ill daughter by venturing into an area known only as "The Zone" to request help from the mysterious healers that dwell within its forbidden borders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4rcprZlndX54H5Qhce4MQNHeNXy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:325566'),
  ('283651468046403696', 'The Third Prince', 1983, 'Family, Fantasy, Romance', 'Antonín Moskalyk, Vít Horálek, Vladimír Zelenka', 'Ota Hofman, Antonín Moskalyk', 'Libuše Šafránková, Pavel Trávníček, Luděk Munzar, Jana Hlaváčová, Jiří Bartoška, Ota Sklenčka, František Hanus, Lubomír Kostelka', null, 'Brave sons of the king, twin brothers Jaroslav and Jaromír love and help each other. It was they and another brother - Jindrich, who once saw the portrait of Princess of Diamond Mountains, fell in love and went on her quest.', 'Brave sons of the king, twin brothers Jaroslav and Jaromír love and help each other. It was they and another brother - Jindrich, who once saw the portrait of Princess of Diamond Mountains, fell in love and went on her quest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/268wcHhFsefz0INXlN7uyUvvxx3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85628'),
  ('864679104846383465', 'The Third Secret', 1964, 'Mystery, Thriller, Drama', 'Charles Crichton, Peter Bolton, Douglas Slocombe', 'Robert L. Joseph', 'Stephen Boyd, Jack Hawkins, Richard Attenborough, Diane Cilento, Pamela Franklin, Paul Rogers, Alan Webb, Rachel Kempson', null, 'A prominent London psychologist seems to have taken his own life, causing stunned disbelief amongst his colleagues and patients. His teenage daughter refuses to believe it was suicide as this would go against all of the principles her father stood for, therefore she is convinced it was murder. She enlists the help of a former patient to try to get to the truth. However, the truth turns out to be both surprising and disturbing.', 'A prominent London psychologist seems to have taken his own life, causing stunned disbelief amongst his colleagues and patients. His teenage daughter refuses to believe it was suicide as this would go against all of the principles her father stood for, therefore she is convinced it was murder. She enlists the help of a former patient to try to get to the truth. However, the truth turns out to be both surprising and disturbing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aXaTNMIoAWDyJGNVbf4IeOQnj1I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101651'),
  ('476294865308668027', 'The Third Shadow Warrior', 1963, 'Drama, Action, War', 'Umetsugu Inoue, Shozo Honda, Eiji Nishizawa', 'Seiji Hoshikawa', 'Raizō Ichikawa, Hizuru Takachiho, Masayo Banri, Katsuhiko Kobayashi, Shigeru Amachi, Ryūzō Shimada, Tatsuya Ishiguro, Rieko Sumi', null, 'In the mountain regions of Hida, the dreams of a peasant named Kyonosuke, who longed to be a samurai, come true when he becomes one of three doubles, of shadows, of Lord Yasutaka. After months of intense and cruel training, he faces his destiny when the Lord and the other two shadows are killed in battle and he must take on the role of Lord Yasutaka....', 'In the mountain regions of Hida, the dreams of a peasant named Kyonosuke, who longed to be a samurai, come true when he becomes one of three doubles, of shadows, of Lord Yasutaka. After months of intense and cruel training, he faces his destiny when the Lord and the other two shadows are killed in battle and he must take on the role of Lord Yasutaka....', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rLFG0X1dE51SCRWaJjPXUzUNnW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:191817'),
  ('227957821189232881', 'The Third Side of the River', 2014, 'Drama', 'Celina Murga, Diego Poleri, Esteban Rey Cazes', 'Gabriel Medina, Celina Murga', 'Alián Devetac, Daniel Veronese, Gabriela Ferrero, Irina Wetzel, Tomás Omacini, Gabriela Perinotto, Carina Resnisky, Dylan Agostini Vandenbosch', null, 'Tensions rise when a doctor (Daniel Veronese) pressures his teenage son to follow in his footsteps.', 'Tensions rise when a doctor (Daniel Veronese) pressures his teenage son to follow in his footsteps.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rHSQDV28uAOGIyLe2w5c0QoSeE7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:255482'),
  ('632585727239399800', 'The Third War', 2021, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Anthony Moreau, Andrea Barone, Lucie Desclozeaux', 'Christian Kühne', 'Anthony Bajon, Karim Leklou, Leïla Bekhti, Arthur Verret, Jonas Dinal, Raphaël Quenard, Esdras Registe, Igor Kovalsky', null, 'After completing his military training, young Léo, a taciturn soldier with family problems and secret addictions, is assigned to one of the units that patrol the streets of Paris in search of possible terrorist threats as part of Operation Sentinelle.', 'After completing his military training, young Léo, a taciturn soldier with family problems and secret addictions, is assigned to one of the units that patrol the streets of Paris in search of possible terrorist threats as part of Operation Sentinelle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xS9kPRZCtBh7WGvv77eV8AvGo8i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:728132'),
  ('764411487037527185', 'The Third Wave', 2003, 'Action, Thriller', 'Anders Nilsson', 'Joakim Hansson, Anders Nilsson', 'Jakob Eklund, Irina Björklund, Nicholas Farrell, Ben Pullen, Marie Richardson, Lennart Hjulström, Jacqueline Ramel, Hanna Alsterlund', null, 'Johan Falk hasn''t been working for over a year since he resigned from the police. Most of all he wants to move out to the countryside, but fate has a different thought.', 'Johan Falk hasn''t been working for over a year since he resigned from the police. Most of all he wants to move out to the countryside, but fate has a different thought.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qANSnHCJPYfc5lsAybMFlTw36Tn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21041'),
  ('86391985838627182', 'The Third Way of Love', 2015, 'Romance, Drama', 'John H. Lee', null, 'Song Seung-heon, Liu Yifei, Jiang Mengjie, Eddy Ou, Liu Jin, Meng Jia, Jessie Chiang, Chen Yelin', null, '"The Third Way of Love" tells the sad love story of Lin Qi Zheng, who is from a rich family, and Zhou Yu who is a smart and beautiful lawyer.', '"The Third Way of Love" tells the sad love story of Lin Qi Zheng, who is from a rich family, and Zhou Yu who is a smart and beautiful lawyer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1MzImFmWJUiU5DmpfxRt1pPAdEb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:365952'),
  ('236922772278888641', 'The Third Wheel', 2002, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Jordan Brady, Jonathan Brown', 'Jay Lacopo', 'Luke Wilson, Denise Richards, Jay Lacopo, Ben Affleck, Phill Lewis, Deborah Theaker, Melissa McCarthy, Tim DeKay', null, 'The clumsy and shy Stanley is a nice fellow, beloved by his colleagues in the office. He has a crush on the gorgeous new-hire Diana, but he has difficulties to get close to her. When Stanley finally invites Diana for a date, he hits the homeless Phil with his Taurus, and his planned night turns upside down.', 'The clumsy and shy Stanley is a nice fellow, beloved by his colleagues in the office. He has a crush on the gorgeous new-hire Diana, but he has difficulties to get close to her. When Stanley finally invites Diana for a date, he hits the homeless Phil with his Taurus, and his planned night turns upside down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tP2wOztb1FW3JlyHMDzlyeZRjBS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37270'),
  ('946346776904705514', 'The Third Wife', 2019, 'Drama', 'Ash Mayfair, Chananun Chotrungroj', 'Ash Mayfair', 'Nguyen Phuong Tra My, Trần Nữ Yên Khê, Lê Vũ Long, Như Quỳnh, Maya, Lam Thanh My, Mai Cát Vi, Nguyễn Thanh Tâm', 'R', 'Though only 14 years old, May is selected to be the third wife of a wealthy landowner. Her new home seems idyllic, her husband favours her, and she quickly becomes pregnant with what she is certain will be the desired male progeny. But trouble is quietly brewing: she witnesses a forbidden tryst that will spark a chain reaction of misfortunes — and stir in May urges that until now had been dormant.', 'Though only 14 years old, May is selected to be the third wife of a wealthy landowner. Her new home seems idyllic, her husband favours her, and she quickly becomes pregnant with what she is certain will be the desired male progeny. But trouble is quietly brewing: she witnesses a forbidden tryst that will spark a chain reaction of misfortunes — and stir in May urges that until now had been dormant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lU5WzfaCT5WbqNY6JvdNkvf0ngd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:544812'),
  ('944054375700483927', 'The Third Word', 1956, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Julián Soler, José Ortiz Ramos', 'Alejandro Casona', 'Pedro Infante, Marga López, Sara García, Prudencia Grifell, Rodolfo Landa, Miguel Ángel Ferriz Sr., Emma Roldán, Eduardo Alcaraz', null, 'The English-language title of this Mexican musical was The Third Word. Singer Pedro Infante stars as a pampered young man who is sheltered by his doting aunts. Deciding that their darling boy needs an education, the ladies hire pretty schoolteacher Marga Lopez. Upon discovering that her pupil is 28 years old, Marga is momentarily nonplused, but then settles into her duties. Inevitably, romance blossoms between Pedro and Marga, much to the aunts'' dismay.', 'The English-language title of this Mexican musical was The Third Word. Singer Pedro Infante stars as a pampered young man who is sheltered by his doting aunts. Deciding that their darling boy needs an education, the ladies hire pretty schoolteacher Marga Lopez. Upon discovering that her pupil is 28 years old, Marga is momentarily nonplused, but then settles into her duties. Inevitably, romance blossoms between Pedro and Marga, much to the aunts'' dismay.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z1ZCCVqwDkYkRQp1OQDyCzTNf9A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:340211'),
  ('1147460198395770338', 'The Thirst for Gold', 1993, 'Comedy', 'Gérard Oury', 'Gérard Oury, Marcel Jullian, Christian Clavier', 'Christian Clavier, Marine Delterme, Tsilla Chelton, Philippe Khorsand, Catherine Jacob, Bernard Haller, Pascal Greggory, Patrick Le Luherne', null, 'Urbain Donnadieu''s first love is money. It''s also his second, third and fourth love. The only reason he married - a tax inspector named Fleurette - was to avoid a fine for tax evasion. For several years, he has been stealing money from his construction company and buying gold bars with his ill-gotten gains. His plan is to deposit all this wealth in a Swiss Bank, where neither his wife - whom he is about to divorce - nor the French State can get at it. Accompanied by his money-grabbing Granny Zézette, Urbain heads off for Switzerland, with his gold concealed in the walls of a model house on the back of a trailer. Unfortunately, his scheme is threatened by his wife and his embittered ex-chauffeur, who are determined to get his money at any cost...', 'Urbain Donnadieu''s first love is money. It''s also his second, third and fourth love. The only reason he married - a tax inspector named Fleurette - was to avoid a fine for tax evasion. For several years, he has been stealing money from his construction company and buying gold bars with his ill-gotten gains. His plan is to deposit all this wealth in a Swiss Bank, where neither his wife - whom he is about to divorce - nor the French State can get at it. Accompanied by his money-grabbing Granny Zézette, Urbain heads off for Switzerland, with his gold concealed in the walls of a model house on the back of a trailer. Unfortunately, his scheme is threatened by his wife and his embittered ex-chauffeur, who are determined to get his money at any cost...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/alKt5HtY5xwA6EnyYDePd0BxXEx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51195'),
  ('864935661280422131', 'The Thirsty Dead', 1974, 'Horror', 'Terry Becker, Nonong Rasca', 'Charles Dennis', 'Jennifer Billingsley, John Considine, Judith McConnell, Tani Guthrie, Fredricka Meyers, Chiqui da Rosa, Elena Sampson, Rod Navarro', 'PG', 'Beautiful young girls are kidnapped off the streets of Manila by a death cult that needs their blood to remain immortal.', 'Beautiful young girls are kidnapped off the streets of Manila by a death cult that needs their blood to remain immortal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vcKDhuVdtS0BLD0Bhkh7Z6Dwnn1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49222'),
  ('801454847518439648', 'The Thirteen', 1937, 'Adventure, War', 'Mikhail Romm, Boris Volchek, K. Eggers', 'Mikhail Romm, Iosif Prut', 'Ivan Novoseltsev, Yelena Kuzmina, Aleksey Dolinin, Aleksandr Chistyakov, Andrey Fayt, Ivan Kuznetsov, Petro Masokha, Pavel Yudin', null, 'The film tells about a band of demobilized Red Army men and two civilians who cross a Middle Asian desert. They are forced to do battle with superior forces of Basmachi rebels for the dry draw-well.', 'The film tells about a band of demobilized Red Army men and two civilians who cross a Middle Asian desert. They are forced to do battle with superior forces of Basmachi rebels for the dry draw-well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vEofg1E6tyraxh5M6mdwt0yQzlr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:264482'),
  ('196675398923146943', 'The Thirteenth Chair', 1929, 'Mystery, Drama, Horror', 'Tod Browning, Merritt B. Gerstad', 'Elliott J. Clawson', 'Conrad Nagel, Leila Hyams, Margaret Wycherly, Helene Millard, Holmes Herbert, Mary Forbes, Bela Lugosi, Charles Quatermaine', 'NR', 'Although his murdered friend was by all accounts a scoundrel, Edward Wales is determined to trap his killer by staging a seance using a famous medium. Many of the 13 seance participants had a reason and a means to kill, and one of them uses the cover of darkness to kill again. When someone close to the medium is suspected she turns detective, in the hope of uncovering the true murderer.', 'Although his murdered friend was by all accounts a scoundrel, Edward Wales is determined to trap his killer by staging a seance using a famous medium. Many of the 13 seance participants had a reason and a means to kill, and one of them uses the cover of darkness to kill again. When someone close to the medium is suspected she turns detective, in the hope of uncovering the true murderer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nYTS65rQfseJPOZkbG6TUnT8LV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111306'),
  ('397827261063149997', 'The Thirteenth Floor', 1999, 'Thriller, Science Fiction, Mystery', 'Josef Rusnak, Wedigo von Schultzendorff, Lars P. Winther', 'Ravel Centeno-Rodriguez, Josef Rusnak', 'Craig Bierko, Armin Mueller-Stahl, Gretchen Mol, Vincent D''Onofrio, Dennis Haysbert, Steven Schub, Jeremy Roberts, Rif Hutton', 'R', 'In Los Angeles, a wealthy man, known as Mr. Fuller, discovers a shocking secret about the world he lives in. Fearing for his life, he leaves a desperate message for a friend of his in the most unexpected place.', 'In Los Angeles, a wealthy man, known as Mr. Fuller, discovers a shocking secret about the world he lives in. Fearing for his life, he leaves a desperate message for a friend of his in the most unexpected place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7oaie3ZBc9UuWZLF24crro1pone.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1090'),
  ('90882716205616799', 'The Thirteenth Guest', 1932, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Albert Ray, Tom Galligan, Harry Neumann', 'Frances Hyland', 'Ginger Rogers, Lyle Talbot, J. Farrell MacDonald, Paul Hurst, Erville Alderson, Ethel Wales, James Eagles, Crauford Kent', null, 'Thirteen years after a dinner party in which the thirteenth guest failed to arrive, the remaining guests are being murdered one by one, and their bodies being placed at the same dinner table in the appropriate seats they occupied thirteen years prior.', 'Thirteen years after a dinner party in which the thirteenth guest failed to arrive, the remaining guests are being murdered one by one, and their bodies being placed at the same dinner table in the appropriate seats they occupied thirteen years prior.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g8pSYEkUOAIEYfz3veyMVOSmeSg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76964'),
  ('520245998997577808', 'The Thirteenth Hour', 1947, 'Crime, Mystery', 'William Clemens, Vincent J. Farrar, Mischa Bakaleinikoff', 'Edward Bock, Raymond L. Schrock', 'Richard Dix, Karen Morley, John Kellogg, Jim Bannon, Regis Toomey, Bernadene Hayes, Mark Dennis, Anthony Warde', 'NR', 'In this drama, a trucker''s business is nearly destroyed after he is wrongfully accused of killing a policeman with whom he recently quarreled.', 'In this drama, a trucker''s business is nearly destroyed after he is wrongfully accused of killing a policeman with whom he recently quarreled.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wwZmXI3v2o4qcaAAvTvjL0MSYuL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33686'),
  ('761499601475759938', 'The Thirteenth Tale', 2013, 'TV Movie, Drama, Mystery', 'James Kent, Andy Pearson, Jean-Philippe Gossart', 'Christopher Hampton', 'Vanessa Redgrave, Olivia Colman, Robert Pugh, Alexandra Roach, Steven Mackintosh, Tom Goodman-Hill, Sophie Turner, Antonia Clarke', null, 'Biographer Margaret Lea travels to the isolated rural mansion of the famous writer Vida Winter, who asks her to write her biography. Although initially she is reluctant, as Vida is known for constantly distorting the facts of her life, Margaret soon becomes fascinated with the story of a dark childhood, a disturbing tale that leads her to finally confront the traumas of her own past.', 'Biographer Margaret Lea travels to the isolated rural mansion of the famous writer Vida Winter, who asks her to write her biography. Although initially she is reluctant, as Vida is known for constantly distorting the facts of her life, Margaret soon becomes fascinated with the story of a dark childhood, a disturbing tale that leads her to finally confront the traumas of her own past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o3lWdFzIPFaNkwCDszhmmJ4d8LE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:242409'),
  ('967455250039144644', 'The Thirteenth Year', 1999, 'TV Movie, Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Duwayne Dunham, Michael Slovis', 'Jenny Arata', 'Chez Starbuck, Justin Jon Ross, Courtnee Draper, Brent Briscoe, Tim Redwine, Dave Coulier, Lisa Stahl, Kristen Stewart', 'G', 'A teen learns that his birth mother is a mermaid after he begins to grow fins and slimy scales on his thirteenth birthday.', 'A teen learns that his birth mother is a mermaid after he begins to grow fins and slimy scales on his thirteenth birthday.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fABYANPrfqti24Kb2vz5B2Vklml.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83965'),
  ('844798698376032081', 'The Thirty Nine Steps', 1978, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Don Sharp, John Coquillon', 'Michael Robson', 'Robert Powell, David Warner, Eric Porter, Karen Dotrice, John Mills, George Baker, Ronald Pickup, Donald Pickering', null, 'The year is 1914 and Richard Hannay, Mining Engineer who is visiting Britain for a short time before returning to South Africa, is shocked when one of his neighbours, Colonel Scudder, bursts into his rooms one night and tells him a story that Prussian ''sleeper'' agents are planning to pre-start World War I by murdering a visiting foreign minister. However, Scudder is murdered and Hannay is framed for the death by the ''sleepers''. Fleeing to Scotland Hannay attempts to clear his name and to stop the agents with the aid of Alex Mackenzie but not only is he is chased by Chief Supt Lomas for Scudder''s death but by the agents who are headed by Appleton who has managed to hide himself in a high-placed position in the British Government...', 'The year is 1914 and Richard Hannay, Mining Engineer who is visiting Britain for a short time before returning to South Africa, is shocked when one of his neighbours, Colonel Scudder, bursts into his rooms one night and tells him a story that Prussian ''sleeper'' agents are planning to pre-start World War I by murdering a visiting foreign minister. However, Scudder is murdered and Hannay is framed for the death by the ''sleepers''. Fleeing to Scotland Hannay attempts to clear his name and to stop the agents with the aid of Alex Mackenzie but not only is he is chased by Chief Supt Lomas for Scudder''s death but by the agents who are headed by Appleton who has managed to hide himself in a high-placed position in the British Government...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pnUMLpPoce6wslljzhePJQlaEnx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60287'),
  ('353379195753599859', 'The Thomas Crown Affair', 1968, 'Crime, Romance', 'Haskell Wexler, Norman Jewison, Walter Hill', 'Alan Trustman', 'Steve McQueen, Faye Dunaway, Paul Burke, Jack Weston, Biff McGuire, Addison Powell, Astrid Heeren, Gordon Pinsent', 'PG', 'Young businessman Thomas Crown is bored and decides to plan a robbery and assigns a professional agent with the right information to the job. However, Crown is soon betrayed yet cannot blow his cover because he’s in love.', 'Young businessman Thomas Crown is bored and decides to plan a robbery and assigns a professional agent with the right information to the job. However, Crown is soon betrayed yet cannot blow his cover because he’s in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oODAwa2AK3fXvK93GCbq7dFLZPi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:912'),
  ('498885735718489301', 'The Thomas Crown Affair', 1999, 'Drama, Crime, Romance', 'John McTiernan, Tom Priestley Jr., Bruce Moriarty', 'Alan Trustman', 'Pierce Brosnan, Rene Russo, Denis Leary, Frankie Faison, Faye Dunaway, Esther Cañadas, James Saito, Michael Lombard', 'R', 'Bored billionaire executive Thomas Crown entertains himself by stealing a Monet from a reputed museum with an elaborate diversion. When Catherine Banning, the insurance company''s investigator, takes an interest in Crown, he may have met his match, and a complicated back-and-forth game with seductive undertones begins between them.', 'Bored billionaire executive Thomas Crown entertains himself by stealing a Monet from a reputed museum with an elaborate diversion. When Catherine Banning, the insurance company''s investigator, takes an interest in Crown, he may have met his match, and a complicated back-and-forth game with seductive undertones begins between them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5yqs1MVlqdIg1DY5adC5jFx3d7j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:913'),
  ('682892641950426541', 'The Thompsons', 2012, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Phil Flores, Mitchell Altieri, David Rom', 'Cory Knauf, Mitchell Altieri, Phil Flores', 'Cory Knauf, Samuel Child, Mackenzie Firgens, Joseph McKelheer, Ryan Hartwig, Elizabeth Henstridge, Daniel O''Meara, Selina Giles', null, 'On the run with the law on their trail, America''s most anguished vampire family heads to England to find an ancient vampire clan. What they find instead could tear their family, and their throats, apart forever.', 'On the run with the law on their trail, America''s most anguished vampire family heads to England to find an ancient vampire clan. What they find instead could tear their family, and their throats, apart forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xsyHbPd2O9jkulaKIUxTqEn1Mb5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128841'),
  ('1119186496756007368', 'The Thorn Birds: The Missing Years', 1996, 'Drama, Romance', 'Kevin James Dobson, Ross Berryman', 'David Stevens', 'Richard Chamberlain, Amanda Donohoe, Paul Bertram, Julia Blake, Olivia Burnette, Michael Caton, Jimmy Costas, Rob Doran', null, 'At the height of WWII and ten years after their union in Matlock Island, Father Ralph reunites with Meggie who faces a deep crisis. Now, he must make up his mind, as the burden of choice is insufferable. Will he risk it all for love?', 'At the height of WWII and ten years after their union in Matlock Island, Father Ralph reunites with Meggie who faces a deep crisis. Now, he must make up his mind, as the burden of choice is insufferable. Will he risk it all for love?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ayczgdkIc6oozpSVrbdW98hhDjc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25023'),
