  ('284788195591486250', 'The Thousand Eyes of Dr. Mabuse', 1960, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Fritz Lang, Karl Löb, Walter Wischniewsky', 'Fritz Lang, Heinz Oskar Wuttig', 'Peter van Eyck, Gert Fröbe, Wolfgang Preiss, Dawn Addams, Werner Peters, Andrea Checchi, Howard Vernon, David Cameron', null, 'A reporter is murdered while driving to his job. The Police are contacted by a clairvoyant who saw the death in a vision, but some dark force is preventing him from seeing the man behind the crime...', 'A reporter is murdered while driving to his job. The Police are contacted by a clairvoyant who saw the death in a vision, but some dark force is preventing him from seeing the man behind the crime...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fcHPdXIyfMiy5k1YUJxxrFKttUu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19128'),
  ('904572021224166482', 'The Thousand Faces of Dunjia', 2017, 'Adventure, Action, Fantasy', 'Shadow Hung, Yuen Woo-Ping, Choi Sung-Fai', 'Tsui Hark, Wei Junzi, Yang Bingjia', 'Dong Chengpeng, Ni Ni, Aarif Rahman, Zhou Dongyu, Wu Bai, Yang Yiwei, Tenky Tin Kai-Man, Xu Xiangdong', null, 'The world is on the brink of catastrophe in a chaotic age where evil demons roam. In order to keep evil at bay, a mysterious organisation from the pugilist world emerges. A new constable and a young girl with a mysterious past are also drawn into this group, and the group embarks on an incredible adventure.', 'The world is on the brink of catastrophe in a chaotic age where evil demons roam. In order to keep evil at bay, a mysterious organisation from the pugilist world emerges. A new constable and a young girl with a mysterious past are also drawn into this group, and the group embarks on an incredible adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aSjTnz7zVBEVfDkbwuzDRqTiVB8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:460557'),
