  ('399519844372082269', 'The Three Brothers', 1995, 'Comedy', 'Bernard Campan, Didier Bourdon, Alain Choquart', 'Didier Bourdon, Bernard Campan, Michel Lengliney', 'Pascal Légitimus, Didier Bourdon, Bernard Campan, Antoine du Merle, Anne Jacquemin, Marine Jolivet, Annick Alane, Pierre Meyrand', null, 'Three half-brothers are reunited at their mother''s funeral. After being told of their inheritance they quickly spend the money, only to find out that they will not receive it after all. The men grow closer while deciding how to proceed.', 'Three half-brothers are reunited at their mother''s funeral. After being told of their inheritance they quickly spend the money, only to find out that they will not receive it after all. The men grow closer while deciding how to proceed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nPrUw2hLIt9uWrGwfKjr0AbGWgd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37653'),
  ('504580792493994018', 'The Three Brothers: The Return', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Bernard Campan, Didier Bourdon, Pascal Légitimus', 'Didier Bourdon, Bernard Campan', 'Didier Bourdon, Bernard Campan, Pascal Légitimus, Antoine du Merle, Sofia Lesaffre, Christian Hecq, Daniel Russo, Alison Wheeler', null, 'Three brothers are reunited on the occasion of the death of his mother. The three are in a difficult stage of their lives due to economic difficulties: Bernard is a failed actor, Didier pretends to be a professor of philosophy when, in fact, is selling sex toys and Pascal lives off a rich sexagenarian. Accompanied by Sara, the teenage daughter of Bernard, they live surprising encounters while new problems appear.', 'Three brothers are reunited on the occasion of the death of his mother. The three are in a difficult stage of their lives due to economic difficulties: Bernard is a failed actor, Didier pretends to be a professor of philosophy when, in fact, is selling sex toys and Pascal lives off a rich sexagenarian. Accompanied by Sara, the teenage daughter of Bernard, they live surprising encounters while new problems appear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v5bjUXo1FHLZQO6nfwWcoc9D6lW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:246320'),
  ('794852884605306379', 'The Three Burials of Melquiades Estrada', 2005, 'Adventure, Crime, Drama, Mystery, Western', 'Tommy Lee Jones, Chris Menges, Mary Saisselin', 'Guillermo Arriaga', 'Tommy Lee Jones, Barry Pepper, Dwight Yoakam, January Jones, Melissa Leo, Julio Cesar Cedillo, Levon Helm, Mel Rodriguez', 'R', 'When brash Texas border officer Mike Norton wrongfully kills and buries the friend and ranch hand of Pete Perkins, the latter is reminded of a promise he made to bury his friend, Melquiades Estrada, in his Mexican home town. He kidnaps Norton and exhumes Estrada''s corpse, and the odd caravan sets out on horseback for Mexico.', 'When brash Texas border officer Mike Norton wrongfully kills and buries the friend and ranch hand of Pete Perkins, the latter is reminded of a promise he made to bury his friend, Melquiades Estrada, in his Mexican home town. He kidnaps Norton and exhumes Estrada''s corpse, and the odd caravan sets out on horseback for Mexico.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uHOEb6mo45qMSJaZqbkVa7oW1Y7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8053'),
  ('158947447328514560', 'The Three Caballeros', 1944, 'Animation, Family, Music', 'Norman Ferguson, Jack Kinney, Bill Roberts', null, 'Clarence Nash, Sterling Holloway, Joaquin Garay, José Oliveira, Aurora Miranda, Carmen Molina, Dora Luz, Frank Graham', 'G', 'For Donald''s birthday he receives a box with three gifts inside. The gifts, a movie projector, a pop-up book, and a pinata, each take Donald on wild adventures through Mexico and South America.', 'For Donald''s birthday he receives a box with three gifts inside. The gifts, a movie projector, a pop-up book, and a pinata, each take Donald on wild adventures through Mexico and South America.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nMfScRxw9wVLoO7LiEjziFAKLSK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15947'),
  ('1102227255025193208', 'The Three Deaths of Marisela Escobedo', 2020, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Camila Pardo Cerezo, Carlos Pérez Osorio, Axel Pedraza', null, 'Juan Manuel Fraire Escobedo, Alejandro Fraire, Blanca Escobedo, Patricia González, Ruth Fierro, Noel Rodríguez, Leticia Carreón, Arturo Nahle', null, 'After the death of her daughter at the hand of her boyfriend, Marisela Escobedo began to fight for justice not only against the murderer but also against the corrupt Mexican judicial system.', 'After the death of her daughter at the hand of her boyfriend, Marisela Escobedo began to fight for justice not only against the murderer but also against the corrupt Mexican judicial system.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4E7nNHIchHWzpETfwAERxFuviO6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:753230'),
