  ('566198219423205073', 'The Three Faces of Terror', 2004, 'Horror', 'Sergio Stivaletti', null, 'John Phillip Law, Riccardo Serventi Longhi, Elisabetta Rocchetti, Emiliano Reggente, Ambre Even, Andrea Bruschi, Roberta Terregna, Simone Taddei', null, 'In the first story two grave robbers, thieving from an ancient Etruscan burial ground, gets in trouble when one of them tries out a ring which passes a werewolf curse to him! The second one is about a woman who wants to look like her best friend and goes to a plastic surgeon, which is the biggest mistake she''s done. The third story is about three friends and a very dangerous sea monster eating its way through their camping site! The wrap-around story is set on a train where John Phillip Law plays a mystical hypnotist who claims that he can see the past of the passengers...', 'In the first story two grave robbers, thieving from an ancient Etruscan burial ground, gets in trouble when one of them tries out a ring which passes a werewolf curse to him! The second one is about a woman who wants to look like her best friend and goes to a plastic surgeon, which is the biggest mistake she''s done. The third story is about three friends and a very dangerous sea monster eating its way through their camping site! The wrap-around story is set on a train where John Phillip Law plays a mystical hypnotist who claims that he can see the past of the passengers...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yIWFk0GmVY1msg0WEQfPUHIrU06.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64800'),
  ('988727942948966156', 'The Three Fantastic Supermen', 1967, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Gianfranco Parolini, Francesco Izzarelli', 'Gianfranco Parolini, Marcello Coscia', 'Tony Kendall, Brad Harris, Aldo Canti, Carlo Tamberlani, Rossella Bergamonti, Bettina Busch, Jochen Brockmann, Giuseppe Mattei', null, 'FBI agent Brad joins Tony and Nick, the self styled Supermen who battle crime wearing bullet-proof super-suits. They are on a case involving radioactive counterfeit money and people who can be broken down into precious jewels.', 'FBI agent Brad joins Tony and Nick, the self styled Supermen who battle crime wearing bullet-proof super-suits. They are on a case involving radioactive counterfeit money and people who can be broken down into precious jewels.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p1FoZRHufgzCoeXuQzDWvuK7evr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63432'),
  ('866917649805083697', 'The Three Friends', 1966, 'Drama', 'Victor Antoine, Ahmed Diaa Aldin', 'AbdelFattah ElSayed', 'Hassan Youssef, Mohamed Awad, Ahmed Ramzy, Yousuf Shaaban, Nagwa Fouad, Naglaa Fathy, Nabila Obeid, Magda El Khatib', null, 'Three friends are arrested after committing an accident with their car. After finishing their sentence, they become partners with the owner of a decoration workshop. But he deceives them and spends the money in gambling. They force him to sign a waiver of his workshop but he wants to get it back.', 'Three friends are arrested after committing an accident with their car. After finishing their sentence, they become partners with the owner of a decoration workshop. But he deceives them and spends the money in gambling. They force him to sign a waiver of his workshop but he wants to get it back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pdwwB2CpRpxo9qELtBMYLV2yvFv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:697177'),
  ('224271942664922385', 'The Three from the Filling Station', 1930, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Franz Planer, Wilhelm Thiele', 'Paul Frank, Franz Schulz', 'Lilian Harvey, Heinz Rühmann, Willy Fritsch, Oskar Karlweis, Fritz Kampers, Olga Tschechowa, Kurt Gerron, Gertrud Wolle', null, 'Willy, Kurt and Hans are broke, so they sell their car and open a filling station. Then, they all fall in love with the same girl.', 'Willy, Kurt and Hans are broke, so they sell their car and open a filling station. Then, they all fall in love with the same girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7JMa5tn9zdA6rwrU8qbslhEBGWU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:906'),
  ('945059664256247335', 'The Three Garcías', 1947, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Ismael Rodríguez, Ross Fisher, Jorge Cardeña', 'Fernando Méndez, Ismael Rodríguez, Carlos Orellana', 'Víctor Manuel Mendoza, Abel Salazar, Pedro Infante, Sara García, Marga López, Carlos Orellana, Fernando Soto, Antonio R. Frausto', null, 'Ruled by a tough grandma, the Garcías are three charro cousins who fall in love with young American-born Lupita and fight for her love until grandma quiets them.', 'Ruled by a tough grandma, the Garcías are three charro cousins who fall in love with young American-born Lupita and fight for her love until grandma quiets them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/maNjNWwVJdG3dBf3XEJeCLJ1Ryr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101287'),
  ('532335084100686562', 'The Three Goofy Musketeers', 1980, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Adriano Stuart, Hélio Ribeiro, Antonio Meliande', 'Renato Aragão, Victor Lustosa, Ariston Almeida', 'Renato Aragão, Dedé Santana, Mussum, Zacarias, Rosita Thomaz Lopes, Jorge Cherques, Sílvia Salgado, Pedro Aguinaga', null, 'The Three Musketeers (Dede Santana, Mussum, Zachariah) work at home Sra. Ana Rocha (Rosita Tomáz) and has the difficult task of going in Foz do Iguaçu retrieve an emerald necklace, with which the plant is Mr. Louis at stake, and Chicken Joe (Renato Aragão) who lives in a poor chicken coop offers to help. Arriving in Foz do Iguaçu, find the bad guy, but he sells the paste to a villain in Manaus, in the Amazon already, Chicken Joe takes some stones, are the villain but he sold to another bandit in Rio de Janeiro, where they find the villain and finally retrieve the necklace, and the stones that Chicken Joe took were actually diamonds.', 'The Three Musketeers (Dede Santana, Mussum, Zachariah) work at home Sra. Ana Rocha (Rosita Tomáz) and has the difficult task of going in Foz do Iguaçu retrieve an emerald necklace, with which the plant is Mr. Louis at stake, and Chicken Joe (Renato Aragão) who lives in a poor chicken coop offers to help. Arriving in Foz do Iguaçu, find the bad guy, but he sells the paste to a villain in Manaus, in the Amazon already, Chicken Joe takes some stones, are the villain but he sold to another bandit in Rio de Janeiro, where they find the villain and finally retrieve the necklace, and the stones that Chicken Joe took were actually diamonds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aWvE2QfjyRMQVUPiiiU0CLVO8xL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:172501'),
  ('856861357139431353', 'The Three Inventors', 1980, 'Animation', 'Marcelle Ponti, Michel Ocelot', 'Michel Ocelot', 'Michel Ocelot, Michel Elias', null, 'In a white lace universe, three inventors create machines which are both pretty and useful. Unfortunately people do not understand them...', 'In a white lace universe, three inventors create machines which are both pretty and useful. Unfortunately people do not understand them...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8re1G07mTxG8REcRmVG5whon0UB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:345130'),
  ('824093421871134674', 'The Three Investigators and the Carpathian Dog', 2025, 'Adventure, Family, Crime', 'Tim Dünschede, Naira Cavero Orihuel, Julia Eiber', 'Anıl Kizilbuga, Tim Dünschede', 'Julius Weckauf, Nevio Wendt, Levi Brandl, Ulrich Tukur, Jördis Triebel, Florian Lukas, Sunnyi Melles, Johannes Nussbaum', null, 'A call for help from gallery owner Mr. Prentice leads the three detectives into a new adventure: his apartment is said to be haunted. When the Carpathian dog, a valuable work of art, is also stolen, events spiral out of control because all the residents have a motive. As the suspects are eliminated one by one, the three detectives find themselves in the middle of their most exciting case yet.', 'A call for help from gallery owner Mr. Prentice leads the three detectives into a new adventure: his apartment is said to be haunted. When the Carpathian dog, a valuable work of art, is also stolen, events spiral out of control because all the residents have a motive. As the suspects are eliminated one by one, the three detectives find themselves in the middle of their most exciting case yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jPPJxIreUdG1AS71xlrwHZTK8u2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1219537'),
  ('1103727215949248940', 'The Three Investigators and the Dragon''s Legacy', 2023, 'Adventure, Family, Mystery', 'Stefania Maftei, Cristina Iliescu, Tim Dünschede', 'Anıl Kizilbuga, Tim Dünschede', 'Julius Weckauf, Nevio Wendt, Levi Brandl, Mark Waschke, Gudrun Landgrebe, Gedeon Burkhard, Jördis Triebel, Florian Lukas', null, 'During the summer vacations, the three friends are about to take a trip together to Romania, where they are allowed to complete an internship on the film set of "Dracula Rises", arranged for them by Peter''s father, who is responsible for the special effects during the filming. No sooner do they arrive in Transylvania than mysterious events begin to pile up at Countess Codrina''s old castle, which serves as the original setting for the film. The three detectives want to find out what all this may have to do with a boy who has been missing for over 50 years, a mysterious brotherhood and an enigmatic undead. Soon, not only the filming and Peter''s relationship with his father are at stake, but also the friendship of the three investigators.', 'During the summer vacations, the three friends are about to take a trip together to Romania, where they are allowed to complete an internship on the film set of "Dracula Rises", arranged for them by Peter''s father, who is responsible for the special effects during the filming. No sooner do they arrive in Transylvania than mysterious events begin to pile up at Countess Codrina''s old castle, which serves as the original setting for the film. The three detectives want to find out what all this may have to do with a boy who has been missing for over 50 years, a mysterious brotherhood and an enigmatic undead. Soon, not only the filming and Peter''s relationship with his father are at stake, but also the friendship of the three investigators.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6LgOh25OtKckq5reV4Nx9jUGT59.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:941488'),
  ('916553451469467527', 'The Three Investigators in The Secret of Skeleton Island', 2007, 'Mystery, Adventure, Family', 'Florian Baxmeyer, Jan Sebastian Ballhaus, Jan Sebastian Ballhaus', 'Thomas Oliver Walendy, David Howard, Ronald Kruschak', 'Chancellor Miller, Nick Price, Cameron Monaghan, Nigel Whitmey, Akin Omotoso, Naima Sebe, Langley Kirkwood, James Faulkner', 'PG', 'The hobby detectives “The Three Investigators” want to take a little break. So they take advantage of an offer from Peter''s father, who has accepted a job in South Africa and wants to take the detectives there. But Jupiter, Peter and Bob wouldn''t be the three investigators marks feared by the criminal world if they just lounged around in the sun on their vacation. So it''s no wonder that the clever boys soon have their next case to solve...', 'The hobby detectives “The Three Investigators” want to take a little break. So they take advantage of an offer from Peter''s father, who has accepted a job in South Africa and wants to take the detectives there. But Jupiter, Peter and Bob wouldn''t be the three investigators marks feared by the criminal world if they just lounged around in the sun on their vacation. So it''s no wonder that the clever boys soon have their next case to solve...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6fSy3VGyC0JHlUC2cG1vl36QiqI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4407'),
  ('781211772780589571', 'The Three Investigators in The Secret of Terror Castle', 2009, 'Mystery, Adventure, Family', 'Florian Baxmeyer, Peter Krause, Agne Januskyte', 'Philip LaZebnik, Aaron Mendelsohn', 'Chancellor Miller, Nick Price, Cameron Monaghan, James Faulkner, Jonathan Pienaar, Ron Smerczak, Anette Kemp, Martin Le Maitre', 'PG', 'A new case for the cult detectives! Not by coincidence, a mysterious videotape falls into the hands of Jupiter Jones, Pete Crenshaw and Bob Andrews during Jupiter''s birthday party in Rocky Beach. On it is a recording of Jupiter''s long dead parents. In their message they want to communicate to their son the key to an especially tricky riddle.', 'A new case for the cult detectives! Not by coincidence, a mysterious videotape falls into the hands of Jupiter Jones, Pete Crenshaw and Bob Andrews during Jupiter''s birthday party in Rocky Beach. On it is a recording of Jupiter''s long dead parents. In their message they want to communicate to their son the key to an especially tricky riddle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n0Gf1z98KXdiGIKczOSRZUQb6p3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28479'),
  ('286982650365009371', 'The Three Investigators: Isle of Death', 2026, 'Adventure, Family, Crime', 'Tim Dünschede, Holger Jungnickel, Julia Eiber, Daniel Rosness, Paul Baumann, Naira Cavero Orihuel, Cassandra Han', 'Tim Dünschede, Anıl Kizilbuga, Anil Kizilbuga', 'Julius Weckauf, Nevio Wendt, Levi Brandl, Momo Beier, Filip Schnack', null, 'Justus, Peter and Bob plan a summer road trip but get pulled into a case involving the secret society Sphinx. Their search leads them to the cursed volcanic Makatao, the "Dead Island," where danger and mystery await.', 'Justus, Peter and Bob plan a summer road trip but get pulled into a case involving the secret society Sphinx. Their search leads them to the cursed volcanic Makatao, the "Dead Island," where danger and mystery await.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FcQy8PqmhwRKuSmyb9eFdUe55B9V.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-three-investigators-isle-of-death'),
  ('39147336753774202', 'The Three Kings', 2001, 'Comedy, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Didier Bourdon, Bernard Campan, Bernard Déchet', 'Didier Bourdon, Bernard Campan, Olivier Rabourdin', 'Didier Bourdon, Bernard Campan, Pascal Légitimus, Virginie de Clausade, Nathalie Roussel, Claude Brosset, Didier Flamand, Walid Afkir', null, 'The Three Wise Men – Balthazar, Melchior and Gaspard – are on their way to Bethlehem to pay homage to the infant Jesus when they are suddenly, an inexplicably, transported two thousand years into the future. They find themselves walking the streets of Paris, where they encounter a young woman called Macha who, they are convinced, will lead them to the newborn Messiah.', 'The Three Wise Men – Balthazar, Melchior and Gaspard – are on their way to Bethlehem to pay homage to the infant Jesus when they are suddenly, an inexplicably, transported two thousand years into the future. They find themselves walking the streets of Paris, where they encounter a young woman called Macha who, they are convinced, will lead them to the newborn Messiah.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hRhDIVeSVYTLCpPProW1WAIm9ZU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18298'),
  ('593996519832512771', 'The Three Little Pups', 1953, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Tex Avery', null, 'Daws Butler, Bill Thompson', null, 'In this variation on "The Three Little Pigs", Droopy and his brothers, Snoopy and Loopy, repeatedly outwit the big bad wolf, a dogcatcher who tries to find a way to get the pooches out of their house of bricks.', 'In this variation on "The Three Little Pigs", Droopy and his brothers, Snoopy and Loopy, repeatedly outwit the big bad wolf, a dogcatcher who tries to find a way to get the pooches out of their house of bricks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/alWFrz2ayi9DnGlatfulYxtw1Ws.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87218'),
  ('562325930073224408', 'The Three Lives of Thomasina', 1963, 'Fantasy, Drama, Thriller, Mystery, Family', 'Don Chaffey, Paul Beeson', 'Robert Westerby', 'Patrick McGoohan, Susan Hampshire, Karen Dotrice, Laurence Naismith, Jean Anderson, Matthew Garber, Denis Gilmore, Vincent Winter', null, 'Thomasina is the pet cat of Mary McDhui, the daughter of Scottish veterinarian Andrew McDhui. When Thomasina falls ill, McDhui declares that the pet should be put down. But when Mary and her father try to bury the cat, Lori MacGregor (Susan Hampshire), who is said to be a witch, shows up and attempts to steal it.', 'Thomasina is the pet cat of Mary McDhui, the daughter of Scottish veterinarian Andrew McDhui. When Thomasina falls ill, McDhui declares that the pet should be put down. But when Mary and her father try to bury the cat, Lori MacGregor (Susan Hampshire), who is said to be a witch, shows up and attempts to steal it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kmzys3i2XyCHyvUzNIpUivWeMub.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15081'),
  ('837763146946021283', 'The Three Musketeers', 1921, 'Action, Adventure, Romance', 'Fred Niblo, Doran Cox, Arthur Edeson', null, 'Douglas Fairbanks, Adolphe Menjou, Mary MacLaren, Nigel De Brulier, Thomas Holding, Marguerite De La Motte, Willis Robards, Barbara La Marr', 'NR', 'In 17th century France, young D''Artagnan wants to join the King''s Musketeers, but instead befriends three legendary musketeers—Athos, Porthos, and Aramis—and together, they become embroiled in the political intrigue surrounding King Louis XIII and his adversaries, particularly the powerful Cardinal Richelieu.', 'In 17th century France, young D''Artagnan wants to join the King''s Musketeers, but instead befriends three legendary musketeers—Athos, Porthos, and Aramis—and together, they become embroiled in the political intrigue surrounding King Louis XIII and his adversaries, particularly the powerful Cardinal Richelieu.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/55FdDXbYk8EdIFP0UTxCd1I5r3t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82731'),
  ('356018597452039805', 'The Three Musketeers', 1942, 'Adventure, Comedy', 'Miguel M. Delgado, Gabriel Figueroa', 'Jaime Salvador', 'Cantinflas, Ángel Garasa, Janet Alcoriza, Consuelo Frank, Pituka de Foronda, Andrés Soler, Julio Villarreal, Jorge Reyes', null, 'Cantinflas and three friends return a stolen necklace to an actress who invites them to be extras at Clasa studios. While on the set, he falls asleep and dreams that he is d''Artagnan, fighting on behalf of Queen Anne.', 'Cantinflas and three friends return a stolen necklace to an actress who invites them to be extras at Clasa studios. While on the set, he falls asleep and dreams that he is d''Artagnan, fighting on behalf of Queen Anne.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hLjpIN5HkFeW4sZZqThLvhCuWwK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82793'),
  ('708100612017346072', 'The Three Musketeers', 1948, 'Adventure, Romance', 'George Sidney, Robert H. Planck', 'Robert Ardrey', 'Gene Kelly, Lana Turner, June Allyson, Van Heflin, Angela Lansbury, Gig Young, Vincent Price, Robert Coote', 'NR', 'In 17th century France, young D''Artagnan wants to join the King''s Musketeers, but instead befriends three legendary musketeers—Athos, Porthos, and Aramis—and together, they become embroiled in the political intrigue surrounding King Louis XIII and his adversaries, particularly the powerful Cardinal Richelieu.', 'In 17th century France, young D''Artagnan wants to join the King''s Musketeers, but instead befriends three legendary musketeers—Athos, Porthos, and Aramis—and together, they become embroiled in the political intrigue surrounding King Louis XIII and his adversaries, particularly the powerful Cardinal Richelieu.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jOkXsC1NjkNOxNyooRhTIf1nxsn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41609'),
  ('28788004731267705', 'The Three Musketeers', 1953, 'Adventure', 'André Hunebelle, Marcel Grignon, Bernard Toublanc-Michel', 'Michel Audiard', 'Georges Marchal, Jean Martinelli, Gino Cervi, Jacques François, Yvonne Sanson, Bourvil, Louis Arbessier, Renaud Mary', null, 'The umpteenth adaptation of Dumas'' novel finds d''Artagnan and his friends promoting the love affairs of Anne of Austria and the Duke of Buckingham, incurring the wrath of the Cardinal and exposing themselves to the cold cruelty of Milady de Winter. Also featured are the tender Mme Bonacieux, the hilarious Planchet, the Queen''s ferrets and Bethune''s executioner, against a backdrop of clanging swords.', 'The umpteenth adaptation of Dumas'' novel finds d''Artagnan and his friends promoting the love affairs of Anne of Austria and the Duke of Buckingham, incurring the wrath of the Cardinal and exposing themselves to the cold cruelty of Milady de Winter. Also featured are the tender Mme Bonacieux, the hilarious Planchet, the Queen''s ferrets and Bethune''s executioner, against a backdrop of clanging swords.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n9OVogewKnWXH2azOgvAqV0dfrq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67446'),
  ('625335388177958727', 'The Three Musketeers', 1973, 'Action, Adventure, Romance', 'David Watkin, Richard Lester, Alain Walker', 'George MacDonald Fraser', 'Michael York, Oliver Reed, Richard Chamberlain, Frank Finlay, Faye Dunaway, Raquel Welch, Christopher Lee, Geraldine Chaplin', 'PG', 'In 17th century France, young D''Artagnan wants to join the King''s Musketeers, but instead befriends three legendary musketeers—Athos, Porthos, and Aramis—and together, they become embroiled in the political intrigue surrounding King Louis XIII and his adversaries, particularly the powerful Cardinal Richelieu.', 'In 17th century France, young D''Artagnan wants to join the King''s Musketeers, but instead befriends three legendary musketeers—Athos, Porthos, and Aramis—and together, they become embroiled in the political intrigue surrounding King Louis XIII and his adversaries, particularly the powerful Cardinal Richelieu.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6qjW1e31k2XhcWpzGz6lgHcRt5W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2926'),
  ('48250214305811303', 'The Three Musketeers', 1993, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Romance', 'Stephen Herek, Dean Semler, Richard Holland', 'David Loughery', 'Chris O''Donnell, Kiefer Sutherland, Oliver Platt, Charlie Sheen, Tim Curry, Rebecca De Mornay, Paul McGann, Gabrielle Anwar', 'PG', 'D''Artagnan travels to Paris hoping to become a musketeer, one of the French king''s elite bodyguards, only to discover that the corps has been disbanded by conniving Cardinal Richelieu, who secretly hopes to usurp the throne. Fortunately, Athos, Porthos and Aramis have refused to lay down their weapons and continue to protect their king. D''Artagnan joins with the rogues to expose Richelieu''s plot against the crown.', 'D''Artagnan travels to Paris hoping to become a musketeer, one of the French king''s elite bodyguards, only to discover that the corps has been disbanded by conniving Cardinal Richelieu, who secretly hopes to usurp the throne. Fortunately, Athos, Porthos and Aramis have refused to lay down their weapons and continue to protect their king. D''Artagnan joins with the rogues to expose Richelieu''s plot against the crown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mk8UH7JRmK8adcqJJpB1ygP7B1C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10057'),
  ('284350376653631256', 'The Three Musketeers', 2011, 'Adventure, Action, Thriller', 'Paul W. S. Anderson, Jamie Christopher, Glen MacPherson', 'Alex Litvak, Andrew Davies', 'Logan Lerman, Milla Jovovich, Matthew Macfadyen, Ray Stevenson, Luke Evans, Gabriella Wilde, Juno Temple, Mads Mikkelsen', 'PG-13', 'The hot-headed young D''Artagnan along with three former legendary but now down on their luck Musketeers must unite and defeat a beautiful double agent and her villainous employer from seizing the French throne and engulfing Europe in war.', 'The hot-headed young D''Artagnan along with three former legendary but now down on their luck Musketeers must unite and defeat a beautiful double agent and her villainous employer from seizing the French throne and engulfing Europe in war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/woCADkkDIIKrOMEokbFOEsAYtUa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52451'),
  ('136779688095109474', 'The Three Musketeers', 2023, 'Adventure, Action', 'Bill Thomas, Jasmin Greenland', 'Dean Lines, Bill Thomas, Ray Bogdanovich', 'Malachi Pullar-Latchman, Jake J. Meniani, Ben Freeman, David O’Mahony, James Cosmo, Sophie-Louise Craig, Preeya Kalidas, Tom Taplin', null, 'France is in turmoil and a new, naive King finds himself manipulated by the evil Cardinal Richelieu. With a corrupt commander of the royal guard by his side the Cardinal employs the expertise of the devious and wicked Milady de Winter in a plot to bring down the monarchy and drag the country into war. As France burns the Cardinal will take control. All that stands between them and victory are the remnants of an elite group who wore loyalty to crown and country. Above all else The Musketeers will stand against the odds to foil this deadly plot.', 'France is in turmoil and a new, naive King finds himself manipulated by the evil Cardinal Richelieu. With a corrupt commander of the royal guard by his side the Cardinal employs the expertise of the devious and wicked Milady de Winter in a plot to bring down the monarchy and drag the country into war. As France burns the Cardinal will take control. All that stands between them and victory are the remnants of an elite group who wore loyalty to crown and country. Above all else The Musketeers will stand against the odds to foil this deadly plot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nS0RpKHZFBGjOn59xk3nIlkSN7K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1073140'),
  ('922895761100420471', 'The Three Musketeers in Boots', 1972, 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy, Western', 'Tomoharu Katsumata, Yasuji Mori', 'Hirokazu Fuse', 'Yasushi Suzuki, Kiyoshi Komiyama, Kurumi Kobato, Hidekatsu Shibata, Kazue Takahashi, Shoji Aoki, Shun Yashiro, Isamu Tanonaka', null, 'Pero is back in Go Go Town, a fearful place in the Wild West that desperately awaits for a sheriff to come. In this town of no law and order, Pero and a boy named Jimmy try to help Annie, daughter of a saloon owner who has just been killed.', 'Pero is back in Go Go Town, a fearful place in the Wild West that desperately awaits for a sheriff to come. In this town of no law and order, Pero and a boy named Jimmy try to help Annie, daughter of a saloon owner who has just been killed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vVVWOBsGjsqbreAFSuifSu9DxiV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:194395'),
  ('73493626023264667', 'The Three Musketeers: Adventure of Aramis', 1989, 'Animation, Adventure, Action', 'Kunihiko Yuyama, Hatsuki Tsuji', 'Yasuo Tanami', 'Eiko Yamada, Tatsuya Matsuda, Fumi Hirano, Miyoko Shoji, Akira Kamiya, Shigeru Chiba, Tessyo Genda, Mayumi Tanaka', null, 'In this reimagining of Alexandre Dumas''s classic novel, the musketeer Aramis is secretly a woman in disguise, drawn to the elite corps after exacting revenge on her lover''s murderer. Years later, plucky musketeer-in-waiting D''Artagnan is to be hanged for a crime he didn''t commit. To exonerate her friend, Aramis must uncover the truth by navigating a twisting web of court conspiracies and her own past — without revealing her secret.', 'In this reimagining of Alexandre Dumas''s classic novel, the musketeer Aramis is secretly a woman in disguise, drawn to the elite corps after exacting revenge on her lover''s murderer. Years later, plucky musketeer-in-waiting D''Artagnan is to be hanged for a crime he didn''t commit. To exonerate her friend, Aramis must uncover the truth by navigating a twisting web of court conspiracies and her own past — without revealing her secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tu4FxgMPeuaLge09z387vzfOFC2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85806'),
  ('297212199466534742', 'The Three Musketeers: D''Artagnan', 2023, 'Adventure, Action, Drama, History', 'Nicolas Bolduc, Emmanuelle Tan, Paul Rousselet', 'Alexandre de La Patellière, Matthieu Delaporte', 'François Civil, Vincent Cassel, Romain Duris, Pio Marmaï, Eva Green, Louis Garrel, Vicky Krieps, Lyna Khoudri', 'NR', 'D''Artagnan, a spirited young Gascon, is left for dead after trying to save a noblewoman from being kidnapped. Once in Paris, he tries by all means to find his attackers, unaware that his quest will lead him to the very heart of a war where the future of France is at stake. Aided by King''s Musketeers Athos, Porthos and Aramis, he faces the machinations of villainous Cardinal Richelieu and Milady de Winter, while falling in love with Constance, the Queen''s confidante.', 'D''Artagnan, a spirited young Gascon, is left for dead after trying to save a noblewoman from being kidnapped. Once in Paris, he tries by all means to find his attackers, unaware that his quest will lead him to the very heart of a war where the future of France is at stake. Aided by King''s Musketeers Athos, Porthos and Aramis, he faces the machinations of villainous Cardinal Richelieu and Milady de Winter, while falling in love with Constance, the Queen''s confidante.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hfExJPcbBtDeFDEb7I1By72Drlr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:796185'),
  ('82068744385335120', 'The Three Musketeers: Milady', 2023, 'Adventure, Action, Drama', 'Martin Bourboulon, Elisa Tulli, Nicolas Bolduc', 'Alexandre de La Patellière, Matthieu Delaporte', 'François Civil, Vincent Cassel, Romain Duris, Pio Marmaï, Eva Green, Lyna Khoudri, Louis Garrel, Vicky Krieps', 'PG-13', 'D''Artagnan, on a quest to rescue the abducted Constance, runs into the mysterious Milady de Winter again. The tension between the Catholics and the Protestants finally escalates, as the king declares war — forcing the now four musketeers into battle. But as the war goes on, they are tested physically, mentally and emotionally.', 'D''Artagnan, on a quest to rescue the abducted Constance, runs into the mysterious Milady de Winter again. The tension between the Catholics and the Protestants finally escalates, as the king declares war — forcing the now four musketeers into battle. But as the war goes on, they are tested physically, mentally and emotionally.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3biswIjw14uDVil12nMOxcTAfmH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:845111'),
  ('656099233431614405', 'The Three Must-Get-Theres', 1922, 'Romance, Comedy, Action', 'Max Linder', 'Max Linder', 'Max Linder, Bull Montana, Frank Cooke, Caroline Rankin, Jobyna Ralston, John J. Richardson, Charles Mezzetti, Clarence Wertz', 'NR', 'In this movie, Max Linder parodies the famous novel "The Three Musketeers".', 'In this movie, Max Linder parodies the famous novel "The Three Musketeers".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vFD7vtZii5AOxc6GtaD08Q4IATa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130062'),
  ('268408409686608868', 'The Three Stooges', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Peter Farrelly, Bobby Farrelly, Dawn Massaro', 'Bobby Farrelly, Peter Farrelly, Mike Cerrone', 'Sean Hayes, Will Sasso, Chris Diamantopoulos, Jane Lynch, Sofía Vergara, Jennifer Hudson, Craig Bierko, Stephen Collins', 'PG', 'Left on the doorstep of an orphanage run by nuns, three newborn knuckleheads grow up to be finger-poking, nyuk-nyuking janitors named Larry, Curly and Moe. When they learn that financial problems will soon force the only home they''ve ever known to close, the trio sets out to raise $830,000 in one month. Out in the world for the very first time, the three innocent bumblers become embroiled in a murder plot and find stardom on a TV reality show.', 'Left on the doorstep of an orphanage run by nuns, three newborn knuckleheads grow up to be finger-poking, nyuk-nyuking janitors named Larry, Curly and Moe. When they learn that financial problems will soon force the only home they''ve ever known to close, the trio sets out to raise $830,000 in one month. Out in the world for the very first time, the three innocent bumblers become embroiled in a murder plot and find stardom on a TV reality show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b0nNQCL90RGTwjxLEFsFFLQZKNe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76489'),
  ('1026456507518686556', 'The Three Stooges Go Around the World in a Daze', 1963, 'Comedy', 'Norman Maurer, Irving Lippman', 'Elwood Ullman', 'Moe Howard, Larry Fine, Joe DeRita, Jay Sheffield, Joan Freeman, Walter Burke, Peter Forster, Maurice Dallimore', 'NR', 'Phileas Fogg III, great grandson of the original Phileas Fogg, accepts a bet to duplicate his great grandfather''s famous trip around the world in response to a challenge made by Randolph Stuart III, the descendant of the original Fogg''s nemesis. Unbeknownst to anyone, However, "Stuart" is the infamous con man Vicker Cavendish who made the bet in order to cover up his robbing the bank of England by framing Fogg for the crime. This makes for a dangerous journey for Fogg and his servants (the stooges) and Amelia Carter, whom they rescue from thugs during a train ride. Can they make it back to England in time ?', 'Phileas Fogg III, great grandson of the original Phileas Fogg, accepts a bet to duplicate his great grandfather''s famous trip around the world in response to a challenge made by Randolph Stuart III, the descendant of the original Fogg''s nemesis. Unbeknownst to anyone, However, "Stuart" is the infamous con man Vicker Cavendish who made the bet in order to cover up his robbing the bank of England by framing Fogg for the crime. This makes for a dangerous journey for Fogg and his servants (the stooges) and Amelia Carter, whom they rescue from thugs during a train ride. Can they make it back to England in time ?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qw1kb82nPI8RwNBAJ1Ekhv0v8kU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100053'),
  ('920892866409854404', 'The Three Stooges in Orbit', 1962, 'Science Fiction, Comedy', 'William P. Whitley, Edward Bernds', 'Elwood Ullman', 'Moe Howard, Larry Fine, Joe DeRita, Emil Sitka, Carol Christensen, Edson Stroll, George N. Neise, Rayford Barnes', 'NR', 'The fate of the planet in the hands of Larry, Moe and Curly Joe? That''s exactly the situation the trio finds themselves in when they befriend a wacky scientist and must defend his secret invention from a pair of malevolent Martians. Sight gags, slapstick and plenty of nyuks abound as the Stooges bumble their way through an adventure of intergalactic proportions.', 'The fate of the planet in the hands of Larry, Moe and Curly Joe? That''s exactly the situation the trio finds themselves in when they befriend a wacky scientist and must defend his secret invention from a pair of malevolent Martians. Sight gags, slapstick and plenty of nyuks abound as the Stooges bumble their way through an adventure of intergalactic proportions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pzYDmFgYu5VQpVDwy8wqEzB5AP2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114046'),
  ('889636094476687972', 'The Three Stooges Meet Hercules', 1962, 'Comedy, Adventure', 'Charles J. Rice, Herb Wallerstein, Edward Bernds', 'Elwood Ullman', 'Moe Howard, Larry Fine, Joe DeRita, Vicki Trickett, Marlin McKeever, Mike McKeever, Emil Sitka, Barbara Hines', null, 'The Three Stooges manage to crash through the time barrier with their slap-happy antics in this classic feature-length comedy. Larry, Moe, and Curly-Joe are friends of a young scientist, Schuyler Davis, who has created a time machine. Together with Schuyler''s girlfriend, Diane, they are all transported back to ancient Ithaca which is ruled by the tyrannical King Odius. The lecherous king promptly takes a liking to Diane and banishes Schuyler and The Stooges to the galleys. When they manage to escape, they begin promoting Schuyler as "Hercules" at local gladiatorial combats - until the real Hercules shows up. But, with their unique "charm," The Stooges convince Hercules to help them rescue Diane. Written by Robert Lynch', 'The Three Stooges manage to crash through the time barrier with their slap-happy antics in this classic feature-length comedy. Larry, Moe, and Curly-Joe are friends of a young scientist, Schuyler Davis, who has created a time machine. Together with Schuyler''s girlfriend, Diane, they are all transported back to ancient Ithaca which is ruled by the tyrannical King Odius. The lecherous king promptly takes a liking to Diane and banishes Schuyler and The Stooges to the galleys. When they manage to escape, they begin promoting Schuyler as "Hercules" at local gladiatorial combats - until the real Hercules shows up. But, with their unique "charm," The Stooges convince Hercules to help them rescue Diane. Written by Robert Lynch', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p1Jc9rO4kUhKiICSgIQRstdLiZC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41279'),
  ('533807796124928407', 'The Three Swordsmen', 1994, 'Action, Comedy', 'Taylor Wong Tai-Loi, Chow Kim-Ming, Head Chow Kei-Sheung', 'Damien Lee, Sze Mei-Yee', 'Andy Lau, Brigitte Lin, Elvis Tsui Kam-Kong, Yu Li, Siqin Gaowa, Leung See-Ho, Lisa Tung, Cao Ying', null, 'Samurai and Smiling Sam are two famous martial arts masters in Central China. On the night before the big martial arts competition, someone murders the Empress, and the two swordsmen are framed for the crime. Determined to clear their name, they soon uncover a heinous plot that must be stopped. Meanwhile, a third swordsman, Big Knife, tries to track the pair down so he can join their fight.', 'Samurai and Smiling Sam are two famous martial arts masters in Central China. On the night before the big martial arts competition, someone murders the Empress, and the two swordsmen are framed for the crime. Determined to clear their name, they soon uncover a heinous plot that must be stopped. Meanwhile, a third swordsman, Big Knife, tries to track the pair down so he can join their fight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vc8QCpQWWr4zJ67zMN6EAII5vvR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143292'),
  ('464380295215844611', 'The Three Thieves', 1954, 'Comedy', 'Lionello De Felice, Alain Roux, Romolo Garroni', 'Félicien Marceau, Filippo Sanjust, Lionello De Felice', 'Totò, Jean-Claude Pascal, Simone Simon, Gino Bramieri, Giovanna Ralli, Memmo Carotenuto, Mario Castellani, Lauro Gazzolo', null, 'Tapioca, a small-time thief, hides out in an elegant apartment, where he is soon joined by Cascarilla, one of his apprentices who has become better than his master. When the owners arrive home, the latter offers the wife a bunch of love letters she has written to various lovers for ten million.', 'Tapioca, a small-time thief, hides out in an elegant apartment, where he is soon joined by Cascarilla, one of his apprentices who has become better than his master. When the owners arrive home, the latter offers the wife a bunch of love letters she has written to various lovers for ten million.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6v8QGowOPUUdc4i7t19DKl0gDef.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71127'),
  ('141887706397083191', 'The Three Treasures', 1959, 'Fantasy, Action, Drama', 'Hiroshi Inagaki, Teruo Maru', 'Ryuzo Kikushima, Toshio Yasumi', 'Toshirō Mifune, Takashi Shimura, Setsuko Hara, Kinuyo Tanaka, Yōko Tsukasa, Kyōko Kagawa, Kumi Mizuno, Misa Uehara', null, 'The legend of the birth of Shintoism. In Fourth Century Japan, the Emperor''s son Ouso expects to succeed his father on the throne, but Otomo, the Emperor''s vassal, prefers Ouso''s stepbrother, and conspires to have Ouso die on a dangerous mission he has contrived. But Ouso prevails in the mission and returns to his father''s castle under a new name, Prince Yamato Takeru. Otomo plots to have the Prince sent into even greater danger, but Otomo is unaware that the gods have favored the Prince and the outcome is far from what any of them expected.', 'The legend of the birth of Shintoism. In Fourth Century Japan, the Emperor''s son Ouso expects to succeed his father on the throne, but Otomo, the Emperor''s vassal, prefers Ouso''s stepbrother, and conspires to have Ouso die on a dangerous mission he has contrived. But Ouso prevails in the mission and returns to his father''s castle under a new name, Prince Yamato Takeru. Otomo plots to have the Prince sent into even greater danger, but Otomo is unaware that the gods have favored the Prince and the outcome is far from what any of them expected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qJMKNuVPayFisBeyu7AHlZDngAg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:224119'),
  ('9039266703994016', 'The Three Veterans', 1984, 'Family, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Oldřich Lipský, Aleš Dospiva, Stanislava Hutková', 'Oldřich Lipský', 'Rudolf Hrušínský, Petr Čepek, Josef Somr, Vida Neuwirthová, Július Satinský, Zdeněk Svěrák, Miloš Kopecký, Lubomír Lipský', null, 'It is a story of three veterans released from the army. During one night spent camping in the country they one by one wake up and meet three elvish brothers. Each of the veterans is given a magic item - one gets magic harp that provides him with servants by wish, other one endless pouch of gold and the last one owns magic hat that can create all the staff excluding money and people.', 'It is a story of three veterans released from the army. During one night spent camping in the country they one by one wake up and meet three elvish brothers. Each of the veterans is given a magic item - one gets magic harp that provides him with servants by wish, other one endless pouch of gold and the last one owns magic hat that can create all the staff excluding money and people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Rlq42VH5JQtRufuLJ2Nsmjxo2m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46091'),
  ('414794681668650569', 'The Three Wise Men vs. Santa', 2022, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Paco Caballero, Juan Gordon', 'Carmen López Areal, Benjamín Herranz, Jelen Morales', 'Karra Elejalde, David Verdaguer, Janick, Andrés Almeida, Adal Ramones, Eva Ugarte, Isa Montalbán, Cosette Silguero', null, 'The Three Wise Men, fed up with Santa taking more and more prominence from them, have decided to confront each other without knowing that this war will awaken a much more dangerous common enemy, the Krampus, who had been inactive for centuries.', 'The Three Wise Men, fed up with Santa taking more and more prominence from them, have decided to confront each other without knowing that this war will awaken a much more dangerous common enemy, the Krampus, who had been inactive for centuries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hdTxXcsW31yYdNLLVCLXvbrSG5H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:987758'),
  ('855603313210697853', 'The Three Wise Men: The Truth', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Víctor García León, Eva Díaz', 'Daniel Castro, Víctor García León, Teresa Bellón', 'Camila Viyuela, Mauro Muñiz, Javier Carramiñana, Pedro Gutiérrez, Sofía Gómez Maza, Gorka Aguinagalde, Paula Iwasaki, Sergio Alcover', null, 'While they prepare for the Three Wise Men''s Cavalcade, Melchior, Gaspar and Balthazar open the doors to their palace for the first time for the filming of a documentary about their daily lives.', 'While they prepare for the Three Wise Men''s Cavalcade, Melchior, Gaspar and Balthazar open the doors to their palace for the first time for the filming of a documentary about their daily lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hDQGyMm7j7yhaSwoOOiuSm2BlaE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1061694'),
  ('674849942727338260', 'The Three-Sided Mirror', 1927, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jean Epstein, Maurice Morlot', null, 'Jeanne Helbling, Suzy Pierson, Olga Day, Raymond Guérin-Catelain, René Ferté, Jean Garat', null, 'A wealthy young businessman consecutively falls in love with a classy English woman (Pearl), a Russian sculptress (Athalia), and a naive working-class girl (Lucie).', 'A wealthy young businessman consecutively falls in love with a classy English woman (Pearl), a Russian sculptress (Athalia), and a naive working-class girl (Lucie).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2f2EUgEKwiEa0F5BVODeaqzyMbP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93189'),
  ('145360293465170862', 'The Three-way Wedding', 2010, 'Drama', 'Jacques Doillon, Caroline Champetier', 'Jacques Doillon', 'Pascal Greggory, Julie Depardieu, Louis Garrel, Agathe Bonitzer, Louis-Do de Lencquesaing', null, 'When a famous playwright invites the cast of his new play - including his enchanting assistant, his ex-wife and her new lover - to his country estate, a series of seductions and surprising alliances ensue.', 'When a famous playwright invites the cast of his new play - including his enchanting assistant, his ex-wife and her new lover - to his country estate, a series of seductions and surprising alliances ensue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6en5Gq95ySnjxu44eTSeLxOCVla.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72848'),
  ('667332808209421538', 'The Threepenny Opera', 1931, 'Music, Drama, Crime', 'G.W. Pabst, Fritz Arno Wagner', 'Bertolt Brecht, Léo Lania, Ladislaus Vajda', 'Albert Préjean, Florelle, Jacques Henley, Gaston Modot, Margo Lion, Antonin Artaud, Lucy de Matha, Vladimir Sokoloff', null, 'The French-language version of the The Threepenny Opera with a different cast from the German version.', 'The French-language version of the The Threepenny Opera with a different cast from the German version.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Gim9Bq4c4qlV1Xt1zPhcymoJRG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156326'),
  ('876504524812528073', 'The Threesome', 2025, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Chad Hartigan, Sing Howe Yam, Ian Campbell', 'Ethan Ogilby', 'Zoey Deutch, Jonah Hauer-King, Ruby Cruz, Jaboukie Young-White, Josh Segarra, Robert Longstreet, Arden Myrin, Kristin Slaysman', 'R', 'Connor has a threesome with his long-time crush Olivia and an alluring stranger named Jenny. It surprisingly serves as the spark to a full blown relationship with Olivia, until both women end up pregnant and all three are thrust into a difficult journey toward new realities that none of them could have expected.', 'Connor has a threesome with his long-time crush Olivia and an alluring stranger named Jenny. It surprisingly serves as the spark to a full blown relationship with Olivia, until both women end up pregnant and all three are thrust into a difficult journey toward new realities that none of them could have expected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7vQUAw3CX60dhzgzC7BQZFN7Y31.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:993708'),
