  ('269792864876368368', 'The Throne', 2015, 'Drama, History', 'Hong Seung-chul, Lee Joon-ik, Kim Tae-kyeong', 'Cho Chul-hyun, O Seung-hyeon, Lee Song-won', 'Yoo Ah-in, Song Kang-ho, Lee Hyo-je, So Ji-sub, Moon Geun-young, Jeon Hye-jin, Kim Hae-sook, Park Won-sang', null, 'Ancient Korea, July 4, 1762. The Crown Prince Hyojang, posthumously named Sado, son of King Yeongjo of Joseon, is accused of treason. Thus, the king asks him to commit suicide, but his closest vassals prevent it, so the king orders the prince to get inside a wooden rice chest, where he suffers deprivation of food and water.', 'Ancient Korea, July 4, 1762. The Crown Prince Hyojang, posthumously named Sado, son of King Yeongjo of Joseon, is accused of treason. Thus, the king asks him to commit suicide, but his closest vassals prevent it, so the king orders the prince to get inside a wooden rice chest, where he suffers deprivation of food and water.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fxucCjHL566llnZC3TfWTdReHee.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:315439'),
  ('290590962042378028', 'The Throwaways', 2015, 'Action, Thriller, Fantasy', 'Tony Bui, José David Montero', 'Michael Arlen Ross, Don Handfield', 'Sam Huntington, James Caan, Peter Brooke, Kevin Dillon, Katie McGrath, Noel Clarke, Darrell D''Silva, Valentin Ganev', null, 'Notorious hacker Drew Reynolds is captured by the CIA and given a proposition - work for them or spend the rest of his life in prison. Agreeing on the condition that he can form his own team, he puts together a group of "throwaways" - the people deemed expendable and seemingly the worst in the organization.', 'Notorious hacker Drew Reynolds is captured by the CIA and given a proposition - work for them or spend the rest of his life in prison. Agreeing on the condition that he can form his own team, he puts together a group of "throwaways" - the people deemed expendable and seemingly the worst in the organization.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1265SilA4N4Q09SAnKguZjbuARJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:321621'),
  ('689481817978552492', 'The Thundermans Return', 2024, 'Family, Science Fiction, Action, Comedy', 'Beth Correll, Sarah Schmaus, Trevor Kirschner', null, 'Kira Kosarin, Jack Griffo, Addison Riecke, Diego Velazquez, Maya Le Clark, Chris Tallman, Rosa Blasi, Dana Snyder', 'G', 'Twins Phoebe and Max are enjoying their superhero lifestyle, but when one ''save'' goes awry, the Thundermans are sent back to Hiddenville. While Hank and Barb enjoy their return, and Billy and Nora look forward to a normal high school life, Max and Phoebe are determined to regain their superhero status.', 'Twins Phoebe and Max are enjoying their superhero lifestyle, but when one ''save'' goes awry, the Thundermans are sent back to Hiddenville. While Hank and Barb enjoy their return, and Billy and Nora look forward to a normal high school life, Max and Phoebe are determined to regain their superhero status.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2J5eeroLDY0d45mVjpuGhcLZs3W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1094556'),
  ('864045154023450235', 'The Thursday', 1964, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Dino Risi, Mariano Laurenti, Renato Rizzuto', 'Dino Risi, Pipolo, Castellano', 'Walter Chiari, Michèle Mercier, Roberto Ciccolini, Umberto D''Orsi, Ellen Kessler, Alice Kessler, Emma Baron, Milena Vukotić', null, 'It''s the story of a day spent by Dino, separated by his wife, who sees his son Robertino after five years. Dino has not contributed anything in life and to win the affection of his son, invents a story about his past. At the end of the day however, he will succeed in establishing a positive relationship with his son and telling the truth about himself.', 'It''s the story of a day spent by Dino, separated by his wife, who sees his son Robertino after five years. Dino has not contributed anything in life and to win the affection of his son, invents a story about his past. At the end of the day however, he will succeed in establishing a positive relationship with his son and telling the truth about himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ncTbPJTuyhvwfCaONEqlKzCsddm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83217'),
  ('678685821396475888', 'The Thursday Murder Club', 2025, 'Comedy, Mystery, Crime', 'Chris Columbus, Josh Robertson, Danni Lizaitis', 'Katy Brand, Suzanne Heathcote', 'Helen Mirren, Pierce Brosnan, Ben Kingsley, Celia Imrie, David Tennant, Jonathan Pryce, Naomi Ackie, Daniel Mays', 'PG-13', 'A group of senior sleuths passionate about solving cold cases get plunged into a real-life murder mystery in this comic crime caper.', 'A group of senior sleuths passionate about solving cold cases get plunged into a real-life murder mystery in this comic crime caper.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jbnazCHr8S2l2glyvjPTpa4NbEw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:744653'),
  ('145900060327615867', 'The Ticket', 2016, 'Drama', 'Ido Fluk, Zachary Galler, Alejandro Ramia', 'Ido Fluk, Sharon Mashihi', 'Dan Stevens, Malin Åkerman, Kerry Bishé, Oliver Platt, Peter Mark Kendall, Liza J. Bennett, Skylar Gaertner, Ekaterina Samsonov', 'NR', 'A blind man who regains his vision finds himself becoming metaphorically blinded by his obsession for the superficial.', 'A blind man who regains his vision finds himself becoming metaphorically blinded by his obsession for the superficial.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uyaUbLVoxgJMw3JSGljyOGYpXtz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:334535'),
  ('378957131609548948', 'The Ticket of Leave Man', 1937, 'Horror', 'George King, Tom Cundall, Hal Mason', 'H.F. Maltby, A.R. Rawlinson', 'Tod Slaughter, John Warwick, Marjorie Taylor, Robert Adair, Peter Gawthorne, Jenny Lynn, Arthur West Payne, Norman Pierce', null, 'A man is accused of a series of murders that were actually committed by a crazed killer called "The Tiger." He must prove his innocence and catch the murderer.', 'A man is accused of a series of murders that were actually committed by a crazed killer called "The Tiger." He must prove his innocence and catch the murderer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lAzYXdMve2JRNk2uMGNfYwDpAba.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144147'),
  ('287037717508735028', 'The Ticklish Ones', 1975, 'Western, Comedy', 'Jesús Franco', 'Nicole Guettard', 'Lina Romay, Fred Williams, Olivier Mathot, Richard Bigotini, Alfred Baillou, Pamela Stanford, Brigitte Monnin, Lise Franval', null, 'Central America in 1915. It is the age of revolutions, tyranny, captains and colonels in a small provincial town that is often invaded by some revolutionary group or other. There is a brothel of which the Madame Simone and most of the girls, are French. Many of the girls are in love with rebel leader Carlos Ribas and when government troops re-occupy the area, they hide him. When the soldiers discover him, they take both him and the girls prisoner. The governor sends the girls out in a cart to amuse the troops, but they manage to escape along the way and take refuge in a convent where they take over the nuns.', 'Central America in 1915. It is the age of revolutions, tyranny, captains and colonels in a small provincial town that is often invaded by some revolutionary group or other. There is a brothel of which the Madame Simone and most of the girls, are French. Many of the girls are in love with rebel leader Carlos Ribas and when government troops re-occupy the area, they hide him. When the soldiers discover him, they take both him and the girls prisoner. The governor sends the girls out in a cart to amuse the troops, but they manage to escape along the way and take refuge in a convent where they take over the nuns.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uze8SPDlhSwjcZQyvaU4oG7UJIb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:261643'),
  ('1045665488115544042', 'The Tie That Binds', 1995, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Wesley Strick, Bobby Bukowski, John Cameron', 'Michael Auerbach', 'Daryl Hannah, Keith Carradine, Moira Kelly, Vincent Spano, Julia Devin, Ray Reinhardt, Barbara Tarbuck, Ned Vaughn', 'R', 'A young couple adopts a traumatized child, unaware that her parents are fugitives and murderers who will do anything to get her back.', 'A young couple adopts a traumatized child, unaware that her parents are fugitives and murderers who will do anything to get her back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xwrY46PITbSoCiKm9gTnDWP47Kh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79593'),
  ('2173849953485053', 'The Tied Up Balloon', 1967, 'Comedy, Drama, Fantasy', 'Binka Zhelyazkova, Emil Vagenstein', 'Yordan Radichkov', 'Grigor Vachkov, Georgi Kaloyanchev, Georgi Partsalev, Ivan Bratanov, Georgi Georgiev-Getz, Konstantin Kisimov, Lyubomir Dimitrov, Janet Miteva', null, 'A barrage balloon appears unexpectedly over a Bulgarian village during World War II. The startled villagers decide to knock it down with a fusillade yet the balloon flies off to the mountains. The villagers, armed to their teeth, set off after it. But they are not alone in this undertaking...', 'A barrage balloon appears unexpectedly over a Bulgarian village during World War II. The startled villagers decide to knock it down with a fusillade yet the balloon flies off to the mountains. The villagers, armed to their teeth, set off after it. But they are not alone in this undertaking...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8fefVBs0Fqr6g5sdTyqcYQUv52Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:260454'),
  ('717477515469180657', 'The Ties', 2020, 'Drama', 'Francesca Polic Greco, Nicole Biondi, Daniele Luchetti', 'Daniele Luchetti, Domenico Starnone, Francesco Piccolo', 'Alba Rohrwacher, Luigi Lo Cascio, Laura Morante, Silvio Orlando, Giovanna Mezzogiorno, Adriano Giannini, Linda Caridi, Francesca De Sapio', null, 'Naples, early 1980s. The strained marriage between Aldo and Vanda is fractured one evening when Aldo admits, unprompted, his infidelity. Equally hurt and bewildered, Vanda attempts to hide her pain from the couple''s two school-age kids, lest they discover that their cramped apartment is not a home of trust and love. 30 years later, Aldo and Vanda are still tied together, but their relationship with each other and their children continues to be defined by what happened all those years ago.', 'Naples, early 1980s. The strained marriage between Aldo and Vanda is fractured one evening when Aldo admits, unprompted, his infidelity. Equally hurt and bewildered, Vanda attempts to hide her pain from the couple''s two school-age kids, lest they discover that their cramped apartment is not a home of trust and love. 30 years later, Aldo and Vanda are still tied together, but their relationship with each other and their children continues to be defined by what happened all those years ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sdxSGa9cqsvlOZuvRtcH2Nu0ebE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:659290'),
  ('787300979184905125', 'The Ties That Bind Us', 2025, 'Drama', 'Carine Tardieu, Elin Kirschfink, Yann Maritaud', 'Carine Tardieu, Agnès Feuvre, Raphaële Moussafir', 'Pio Marmaï, Valeria Bruni Tedeschi, Vimala Pons, Raphaël Quenard, César Botti, Catherine Mouchet, Marie-Christine Barrault, Mélissa Barbaud', null, 'A young single father trying to find the strength to love. A feminist librarian, single by conviction, who’s decided that she won’t be a mother. A six-year-old child trying to find a place in a new family structure. By revealing their aspirations, their fears, their choices, Carine Tardieu depicts different ways in which humans create families.', 'A young single father trying to find the strength to love. A feminist librarian, single by conviction, who’s decided that she won’t be a mother. A six-year-old child trying to find a place in a new family structure. By revealing their aspirations, their fears, their choices, Carine Tardieu depicts different ways in which humans create families.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tRLvA1kqbII1IuFDaRncQUkDLqW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1096642'),
  ('698972644694484181', 'The Tiger', 2015, 'Action, History, Adventure, Drama', 'Park Hoon-jung, Lee Mo-gae, Lee Seong-hwan', 'Park Hoon-jung', 'Choi Min-sik, Jeong Man-sik, Kim Sang-ho, Sung Yoo-bin, Jung Suk-won, Lee Na-ra, Jung Zi-so, Kim Ye-joon', 'PG-13', 'In 1925 Korea, Japanese rulers demand the last remaining tiger be killed. The tiger easily defeats his pursuers until a legendary hunter takes him on.', 'In 1925 Korea, Japanese rulers demand the last remaining tiger be killed. The tiger easily defeats his pursuers until a legendary hunter takes him on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tPI6t2Cvu7vWO9iDs4Cigq8svWl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:363093'),
  ('939851750623442994', 'The Tiger and The President', 2022, 'Comedy, History', 'Jean-Marc Peyrefitte, Lubomir Bakchev', 'Jean-Marc Peyrefitte, Marc Syrigas', 'André Dussollier, Jacques Gamblin, Christian Hecq, Cyril Couton, Astrid Whettnall, Laura Benson, Anna Mouglalis, Patrick d''Assumçao', null, '1920. Georges Clémenceau just lost the french presidential elections to the unknown Paul Deschanel, an idealistic who wants to change the country. But, one day, Deschanel falls from a train and disappear. At daybreak, France is looking for its president, a great chance for the « Tiger » Georges Clémenceau.', '1920. Georges Clémenceau just lost the french presidential elections to the unknown Paul Deschanel, an idealistic who wants to change the country. But, one day, Deschanel falls from a train and disappear. At daybreak, France is looking for its president, a great chance for the « Tiger » Georges Clémenceau.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w2mhMAkKKIfwhmnpwUicJPAHpN1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:957325'),
  ('260994198461195691', 'The Tiger and the Pussycat', 1967, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Dino Risi, Alessandro D''Eva, Renzo Genta', 'Agenore Incrocci, Furio Scarpelli', 'Vittorio Gassman, Ann-Margret, Eleanor Parker, Fiorenzo Fiorentini, Antonella Steni, Caterina Boratto, Jacques Herlin, Eleonora Brown', null, 'A middle-aged businessman finds himself in thirst for romance adventure, and it seems that a proper partner is not far away.', 'A middle-aged businessman finds himself in thirst for romance adventure, and it seems that a proper partner is not far away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/etbs5fn6mEVRNOsBeAu8SNaanr4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92572'),
  ('507561264828545691', 'The Tiger and the Snow', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Roberto Benigni, Fabio Cianchetti', 'Roberto Benigni, Vincenzo Cerami', 'Roberto Benigni, Jean Reno, Nicoletta Braschi, Emilia Fox, Giuseppe Battiston, Tom Waits, Andrea Renzi, Lucia Poli', null, 'Love and injury in time of war. Attilio de Giovanni teaches poetry in Italy. He has a romantic soul, and women love him. But he is in love with Vittoria, and the love is unrequited. Every night he dreams of marrying her, in his boxer shorts and t-shirt, as Tom Waits sings. Vittoria travels to Iraq with her friend, Fuad, a poet; they are there with the second Gulf War breaks out. Vittoria is injured. Attilio must get to her side, and then, as war rages around him, he must find her the medical care she needs. In war, does love conquer all?', 'Love and injury in time of war. Attilio de Giovanni teaches poetry in Italy. He has a romantic soul, and women love him. But he is in love with Vittoria, and the love is unrequited. Every night he dreams of marrying her, in his boxer shorts and t-shirt, as Tom Waits sings. Vittoria travels to Iraq with her friend, Fuad, a poet; they are there with the second Gulf War breaks out. Vittoria is injured. Attilio must get to her side, and then, as war rages around him, he must find her the medical care she needs. In war, does love conquer all?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/18ZaN20XRwG2dOJYuo8tvWdDMCR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10846'),
  ('994715003437970521', 'The Tiger Blade', 2005, 'Action, Comedy, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Theeratorn Siriphunvaraporn', 'Kulachat Jitkhachornwanich', 'Atsadawut Luengsuntorn, Pimolrat Pisolyabutr, Pongpat Wachirabunjong, Amornrit Sriphung, Chalad Na Songkhla, Aanan Boonnak, Ampha Phoosit, Sueangsuda Lawanprasert', null, 'When a highly volatile case confronts the police, a young cop with mystical powers is put on the case. He and his team-mate must hunt down and capture the brutal and deadly Five Bullet Bandit.', 'When a highly volatile case confronts the police, a young cop with mystical powers is put on the case. He and his team-mate must hunt down and capture the brutal and deadly Five Bullet Bandit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tBgQGFZIbW3bTkuTAIlzvZ2X9DO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41088'),
  ('950782927995388243', 'The Tiger Brigades', 2006, 'Action, Adventure, Crime', 'Jérôme Cornuau, Stéphane Cami', 'Xavier Dorison, Fabien Nury', 'Clovis Cornillac, Diane Kruger, Édouard Baer, Olivier Gourmet, Thierry Frémont, Jacques Gamblin, Stefano Accorsi, Léa Drucker', null, 'The film, set in 1912, is about the exploits of France''s first motorized police brigade.', 'The film, set in 1912, is about the exploits of France''s first motorized police brigade.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2l1t2c2WySP5pxK5dTNr0HWAtor.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16276'),
