  ('1039163484057434434', 'The Tiger of Eschnapur', 1959, 'Adventure, Drama, Romance', 'Fritz Lang, Eva Ebner, Richard Angst', 'Fritz Lang', 'Debra Paget, Paul Hubschmid, Walther Reyer, Claus Holm, Sabine Bethmann, Luciana Paluzzi, René Deltgen, Valéry Inkijinoff', null, 'In Eschnapur, a German architect saves the life of the Maharajah''s favorite temple dancer and becomes Maharajah''s friend but their friendship is tested when the architect and the dancer fall in-love, triggering the Maharajah''s vengeful ire.', 'In Eschnapur, a German architect saves the life of the Maharajah''s favorite temple dancer and becomes Maharajah''s friend but their friendship is tested when the architect and the dancer fall in-love, triggering the Maharajah''s vengeful ire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eOQud8hEPgBJ82AmJ2HPjZLmpnz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71041'),
  ('1094904124507415822', 'The Tiger of Santa Julia', 2002, 'Comedy, Drama, Action', 'Alejandro Gamboa, Pablo Martínez de Velasco, Alfredo Kassem', 'Alejandro Gamboa', 'Miguel Rodarte, Irán Castillo, Fernando Luján, Isaura Espinoza, Adalberto Parra, Cristina Michaus, Ivonne Montero, Anilú Pardo', null, 'An army deserter turned bandit robs from thieves to give the money to the poor. He was famous for being caught by the police "with his pants down"', 'An army deserter turned bandit robs from thieves to give the money to the poor. He was famous for being caught by the police "with his pants down"', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wV9iDhGabHKrONzVebKjpz9OXqR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73524'),
  ('713074199814148520', 'The Tiger Rising', 2022, 'Adventure, Family, Drama', 'Ray Giarratana, Shane F. Kelly', 'Ray Giarratana', 'Dennis Quaid, Katharine McPhee, Queen Latifah, Sam Trammell, Christian Convery, Madalen Mills, Angela Giarratana, Faith Dillon', 'PG', 'When 12-year-old Rob Horton discovers a caged tiger in the woods near his home, his imagination runs wild and life begins to change in the most unexpected ways. With the help of a wise and mysterious maid, Willie May and the stubborn new girl in school, he must navigate through childhood memories, heartache, and wondrous adventures.', 'When 12-year-old Rob Horton discovers a caged tiger in the woods near his home, his imagination runs wild and life begins to change in the most unexpected ways. With the help of a wise and mysterious maid, Willie May and the stubborn new girl in school, he must navigate through childhood memories, heartache, and wondrous adventures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mEukzqPoCpbrXLGslT8qdTuyRKZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:793269'),
  ('379241323409436971', 'The Tiger''s Apprentice', 2024, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'Paul Watling, Yong Duk Jhun, Raman Hui Shing-Ngai', 'Christopher L. Yost, David Magee', 'Brandon Soo Hoo, Henry Golding, Lucy Liu, Sandra Oh, Michelle Yeoh, Bowen Yang, Leah Lewis, Tan Kheng Hua', 'PG', 'After the death of his grandmother, Tom Lee discovers he is part of a long lineage of magical protectors known as the Guardians. With guidance from a mythical tiger named Hu and the other Zodiac animal warriors, Tom trains to take on an evil force that threatens humanity.', 'After the death of his grandmother, Tom Lee discovers he is part of a long lineage of magical protectors known as the Guardians. With guidance from a mythical tiger named Hu and the other Zodiac animal warriors, Tom trains to take on an evil force that threatens humanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/64ZktFMmTzsm47wdsaMOID0DzcY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:598387'),
  ('1051526757229437576', 'The Tiger''s Nest', 2022, 'Family, Adventure', 'Brando Quilici', 'Rupert Thomson, Hugh Hudson', 'Sunny Pawar, Claudia Gerini, Amandeep Singh, Yoon C. Joyce, Shi Yang, Samir Gurung, Legyaan Thapa', null, 'In the valleys of the Himalayas, an orphan boy saves a Bengal tiger cub from the ruthless poachers who killed the tiger''s mother. Together they set out in the Himalayan mountains to the Taktsang monastery in Bhutan known as "The Tiger''s Nest" where Buddhist monks took refuge after the 1950 Chinese invasion of Tibet and protect the big cats. A new great film for the whole family that talks about the importance of defending animals through the story of the friendship between two orphans, a tiger cub and a child, in a tale of brotherhood and the discovery of life.', 'In the valleys of the Himalayas, an orphan boy saves a Bengal tiger cub from the ruthless poachers who killed the tiger''s mother. Together they set out in the Himalayan mountains to the Taktsang monastery in Bhutan known as "The Tiger''s Nest" where Buddhist monks took refuge after the 1950 Chinese invasion of Tibet and protect the big cats. A new great film for the whole family that talks about the importance of defending animals through the story of the friendship between two orphans, a tiger cub and a child, in a tale of brotherhood and the discovery of life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1oZFVPrdMbmEchJkGWr9T5mVeZ7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:654910'),
  ('929150066357549178', 'The Tiger''s Tail', 2006, 'Drama, Comedy, Crime', 'John Boorman, Seamus Deasy', 'John Boorman', 'Brendan Gleeson, Kim Cattrall, Ciarán Hinds, Sinéad Cusack, Sean McGinley, Angeline Ball, Cathy Belton, Denis Conway', 'R', 'After a chance encounter, a Dubliner is stalked by a murderous facsimile of himself.', 'After a chance encounter, a Dubliner is stalked by a murderous facsimile of himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tjmEMHtngREqVm2NOzIrE4Lx52L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10097'),
  ('645314125716604513', 'The Tigger Movie', 2000, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Jun Falkenstein, Allen Daviau, Nick Bates', 'Jun Falkenstein', 'Jim Cummings, Nikita Hopkins, Ken Sansom, John Fiedler, Peter Cullen, Andre Stojka, Kath Soucie, Tom Attenborough', 'G', 'Winnie the Pooh, Piglet, Owl, Kanga, Roo, and Rabbit are preparing a suitable winter home for Eeyore, the perennially dejected donkey, but Tigger''s continual bouncing interrupts their efforts. Rabbit suggests that Tigger go find others of his kind to bounce with, but Tigger thinks "the most wonderful thing about tiggers is" he''s "the only one!" Just in case though, the joyously jouncy feline sets out to see if he can find relatives.', 'Winnie the Pooh, Piglet, Owl, Kanga, Roo, and Rabbit are preparing a suitable winter home for Eeyore, the perennially dejected donkey, but Tigger''s continual bouncing interrupts their efforts. Rabbit suggests that Tigger go find others of his kind to bounce with, but Tigger thinks "the most wonderful thing about tiggers is" he''s "the only one!" Just in case though, the joyously jouncy feline sets out to see if he can find relatives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9OdZKUdGfaBAUwRLbtWpFWKbILO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15655'),
  ('100055682042556433', 'The Tijuana Story', 1957, 'Crime', 'László Kardos, Benjamin H. Kline', 'Lou Morheim', 'Rodolfo Acosta, James Darren, Robert McQueeney, Jean Willes, Joy Stoner, Paul Newlan, George E. Stone, Michael Fox', 'NR', 'Courageous newspaper editor Manuel Acosta Mesa tries to take on the mob in Tijuana through his newspaper, reporting on the violence, prostitution and drug sales in the border town.', 'Courageous newspaper editor Manuel Acosta Mesa tries to take on the mob in Tijuana through his newspaper, reporting on the violence, prostitution and drug sales in the border town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gnmOaWzZzuRTBpmBlQO1p0Ja5Hx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:207853'),
  ('95769326309805287', 'The Tillman Story', 2010, 'Documentary', 'Amir Bar-Lev, Sean Kirby, Igor Martinović', 'Amir Bar-Lev, Mark Monroe, Joe Bini', 'Josh Brolin, Mary Tillman, Russell Baer, Pat Tillman Sr., Philip Kensinger, Stan Goff, Jason Parsons, Bryan O''Neal', 'R', 'Pat Tillman never thought of himself as a hero. His choice to leave a multimillion-dollar football contract and join the military wasn''t done for any reason other than he felt it was the right thing to do. The fact that the military manipulated his tragic death in the line of duty into a propaganda tool is unfathomable and thoroughly explored in Amir Bar-Lev''s riveting and enraging documentary.', 'Pat Tillman never thought of himself as a hero. His choice to leave a multimillion-dollar football contract and join the military wasn''t done for any reason other than he felt it was the right thing to do. The fact that the military manipulated his tragic death in the line of duty into a propaganda tool is unfathomable and thoroughly explored in Amir Bar-Lev''s riveting and enraging documentary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aIHiKAWoGmleP6ODNfQOOCaMeix.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43924'),
  ('422299075733805303', 'The Time and Turn of Augusto Matraga', 2011, 'Drama, Adventure, Western', 'Vinicius Coimbra', 'Vinicius Coimbra, Manuela Dias', 'João Miguel, José Wilker, Chico Anysio, Irandhir Santos, Ivan de Almeida, Teca Pereira, José Dumont, Júlio Andrade', null, 'Based on Guimarães Rosa''s (classic Brazilian author) short story, the movie tells the story of Augusto Matraga, a bankrupt and violent farmer who lives above the Law in Minas Gerais'' hinterland. During a difficult time, he finds himself in the middle of a trap that nearly kills him. Born again, Matraga resorts to faith and hard work in the pursuit of redemption. Years later, he arrives at the village reigned by the hinterland''s ruler and his thugs. This new friendship will challenge his destiny. Inside Matraga, the Saint and the Warrior will duel until his time comes.', 'Based on Guimarães Rosa''s (classic Brazilian author) short story, the movie tells the story of Augusto Matraga, a bankrupt and violent farmer who lives above the Law in Minas Gerais'' hinterland. During a difficult time, he finds himself in the middle of a trap that nearly kills him. Born again, Matraga resorts to faith and hard work in the pursuit of redemption. Years later, he arrives at the village reigned by the hinterland''s ruler and his thugs. This new friendship will challenge his destiny. Inside Matraga, the Saint and the Warrior will duel until his time comes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u95OLyTTOElKPxRfHBUbLzh3Hn3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:339853'),
  ('64375589142236874', 'The Time Capsule', 2022, 'Drama, Romance, Science Fiction', 'Erwann Marshall, Edward Herrera', 'Chad Fifer, Erwann Marshall', 'Todd Grinnell, Brianna Hildebrand, KaDee Strickland, Baron Vaughn, Ravi Patel, Nelson Bonilla, Orelon Sidney, Voltaire Colin Council', null, 'In the near future, a politician fresh off an electoral loss escapes to his family''s summer lake house. His vacation is disrupted by the appearance of his first love, who has just returned from a 20-year space voyage and hasn''t aged a day.', 'In the near future, a politician fresh off an electoral loss escapes to his family''s summer lake house. His vacation is disrupted by the appearance of his first love, who has just returned from a 20-year space voyage and hasn''t aged a day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c12EChMNDP11dJzoruUBIHwsYRa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:974188'),
  ('611329621210180967', 'The Time Guardian', 1987, 'Science Fiction', 'Brian Hannant, Geoff Burton, Philip Hearnshaw', 'Brian Hannant, John Baxter', 'Tom Burlinson, Nikki Coghill, Dean Stockwell, Carrie Fisher, Peter Merrill, Tim Robertson, Jim Holt, Thye Liew Wan', 'PG', 'In the distant future, the human race nears extinction and a new race of beast-like creatures rule the earth. The few surviving people live in the City, a huge protected construction with the ability to travel in both space and time. The City travels back to our time to save humanity...', 'In the distant future, the human race nears extinction and a new race of beast-like creatures rule the earth. The few surviving people live in the City, a huge protected construction with the ability to travel in both space and time. The City travels back to our time to save humanity...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uP71xrn6X5wuMi4f2BB6EBSB9BU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32064'),
  ('220267937167296630', 'The Time Has Come for Love to Try', 1980, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Zoran Čalić', 'Zoran Čalić, Jovan Marković, Gordan Mihić', 'Rialda Kadrić, Vladimir Petrović, Dragomir ''Gidra'' Bojanić, Marko Todorović, Jelena Žigon, Darinka ''Dara'' Čalenić, Ljiljana Janković, Milan Srdoč', null, 'Though the problem of Marija''s pregnancy may be solved, her relationship with Boba causes a rift between the Pavlović and Todorović families.', 'Though the problem of Marija''s pregnancy may be solved, her relationship with Boba causes a rift between the Pavlović and Todorović families.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cmJr4oknReZKTVk05YpEVW84EPX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55113'),
  ('36420584578077680', 'The Time It Takes', 2024, 'Drama', 'Francesca Comencini, Luca Bigazzi', 'Francesca Comencini', 'Romana Maggiora Vergano, Fabrizio Gifuni, Anna Mangiocavallo, Luca Donini, Daniele Monterosi, Lallo Circosta, Luca Massaro, Giuseppe Lo Piccolo', null, 'A devoted father working in film shares a magical bond with his daughter, but as she enters adolescence and falls into addiction, he takes her to Paris in a final effort to save her and their fading connection.', 'A devoted father working in film shares a magical bond with his daughter, but as she enters adolescence and falls into addiction, he takes her to Paris in a final effort to save her and their fading connection.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3YrO0qSnbAvxVJKRMXrajhYkzfH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1103750'),
  ('485573016644616706', 'The Time Machine', 1960, 'Thriller, Adventure, Fantasy, Science Fiction, Romance', 'Paul Vogel, George Pal, William Shanks', 'David Duncan', 'Rod Taylor, Alan Young, Yvette Mimieux, Sebastian Cabot, Tom Helmore, Whit Bissell, Doris Lloyd, Bob Barran', 'G', 'A Victorian Englishman travels to the far future and finds that humanity has divided into two hostile species.', 'A Victorian Englishman travels to the far future and finds that humanity has divided into two hostile species.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sotBnRlFJ67cPisjAUXzbPxi9kC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2134'),
  ('101660772751106889', 'The Time Machine', 2002, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Action', 'Simon Wells, Donald McAlpine, Hiro Narita', 'John Logan, David Duncan', 'Guy Pearce, Mark Addy, Phyllida Law, Sienna Guillory, Laura Kirk, Josh Stamberg, John W. Momrow, Max Baker', 'PG-13', 'Hoping to alter the events of the past, a 19th-century inventor instead travels 800,000 years into the future, where he finds mankind divided into two warring races.', 'Hoping to alter the events of the past, a 19th-century inventor instead travels 800,000 years into the future, where he finds mankind divided into two warring races.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iYayQahkghlbAsfOQX8b5eBzGVy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2135'),
  ('115953692962858464', 'The Time of Indifference', 2021, 'Drama', 'Marco Matteo Donat-Cattin, Gabriella Giannattasio, Miguel Lombardi', 'Alessandro Valenti, Leonardo Guerra Seràgnoli', 'Valeria Bruni Tedeschi, Edoardo Pesce, Vincenzo Crea, Beatrice Grannò, Awa Ly, Blu Yoshimi, Giovanna Mezzogiorno, Giovanni Anzaldo', null, 'Maria Grazia and her children Michele and Carla are left without a livelihood. Maria Grazia''s money-hungry lover Leo develops a plan to take the last property from the family - the attic in which they live. Michele tries to thwart Leo''s plans, but when his attempts fail, young Carla takes over.', 'Maria Grazia and her children Michele and Carla are left without a livelihood. Maria Grazia''s money-hungry lover Leo develops a plan to take the last property from the family - the attic in which they live. Michele tries to thwart Leo''s plans, but when his attempts fail, young Carla takes over.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aLqxVIAGIo49OPuaxXptWxbITl8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:640917'),
  ('565815658825924499', 'The Time of Love', 2007, 'Family, TV Movie', 'Thierry Chabert', 'Louis Gardel', 'Pierre-François Martin-Laval, Richard Oiry, Robin Causse, Andrée Damant, Pierre Maguelon, Franck de la Personne, Armelle Deutsch', null, 'The last episode of Pagnol''s memories (see also "La Gloire de Mon Père" "le Château de Ma Mère" and "Le Temps des secrets") deals with the teenage years of Marcel. While always spending his Summers in his dear Garrigue, he is now on the way to the Baccalaureat. He ''s got a good pal Lagneau (The Lamb) who of course infuriates the teachers when he "bleats"...', 'The last episode of Pagnol''s memories (see also "La Gloire de Mon Père" "le Château de Ma Mère" and "Le Temps des secrets") deals with the teenage years of Marcel. While always spending his Summers in his dear Garrigue, he is now on the way to the Baccalaureat. He ''s got a good pal Lagneau (The Lamb) who of course infuriates the teachers when he "bleats"...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wHOBVfxAfCKm7iQ1Xs60jzAckSD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:165147'),
  ('882818811871154910', 'The Time of Secrets', 2007, 'Family, TV Movie', 'Thierry Chabert', 'Louis Gardel, Ariane Gardel Beaulande', 'Pierre-François Martin-Laval, Richard Oiry, Andrée Damant, Pierre Maguelon, Franck de la Personne, Armelle Deutsch, Robin Causse, Fanny Paillard', null, 'The story takes us from the dear Garrigue to the secondary school where Marcel is first ill at ease because he is a scholarship holder and because he went to the grade school (the other bourgeois pupils had probably a private tutor). A fight against a rich kid ,that augurs badly for what is to follow. (to be followed in "Le Temps des Amours" )', 'The story takes us from the dear Garrigue to the secondary school where Marcel is first ill at ease because he is a scholarship holder and because he went to the grade school (the other bourgeois pupils had probably a private tutor). A fight against a rich kid ,that augurs badly for what is to follow. (to be followed in "Le Temps des Amours" )', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5fvWs7l9ZrPinZ50on56lbW0mrv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103655'),
  ('403345984982339327', 'The Time of Secrets', 2022, 'Family, Drama, History', 'Christophe Barratier, Jérôme Alméras, Sylvie Brocheré', 'Christophe Barratier, Laurent Turner', 'Léo Campion, Lucie Loste Berset, Baptiste Négrel, Guillaume de Tonquédec, Mélanie Doutey, François-Xavier Demaison, Anne Charrier, Octave Charrier', null, 'Marseille, July 1905. Nearly a teenager, Marcel Pagnol embarks in his last summer vacation before high school and returns, at last, to his beloved hills in Provence. What begins as a summer of boyhood adventures becomes one of the first loves, and unearthed secrets.', 'Marseille, July 1905. Nearly a teenager, Marcel Pagnol embarks in his last summer vacation before high school and returns, at last, to his beloved hills in Provence. What begins as a summer of boyhood adventures becomes one of the first loves, and unearthed secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dszp8SMGaKZnDlEJuZQnSXmenuv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:728878'),
  ('205385537625356284', 'The Time of Their Lives', 1946, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Horror', 'Charles Barton, Seward Webb, Charles Van Enger', 'Walter DeLeon, Val Burton, Bradford Ropes', 'Bud Abbott, Lou Costello, Marjorie Reynolds, Binnie Barnes, John Shelton, Gale Sondergaard, Lynn Baggett, Jess Barker', 'NR', 'Two ghosts, who were mistakenly branded as traitors during the Revolutionary War, return to 20th century New England to retrieve a letter from George Washington which would prove their innocence.', 'Two ghosts, who were mistakenly branded as traitors during the Revolutionary War, return to 20th century New England to retrieve a letter from George Washington which would prove their innocence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wFO5tIivUKS9PU9feLIm8G1oHaK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33546'),
  ('1040070475098111411', 'The Time of Your Life', 1948, 'Comedy, Drama', 'H. C. Potter, James Wong Howe, Joseph A. Valentine', 'William Saroyan', 'James Cagney, William Bendix, Wayne Morris, Jeanne Cagney, Broderick Crawford, Ward Bond, James Barton, Paul Draper', 'NR', 'Joe spends a lot of his time at Nick''s Pacific Street Saloon. Tom, who credits Joe with once saving his life, stops by regularly to run errands for Joe. Today, Tom notices a woman named Kitty when she comes into Nick''s, and he quickly falls in love with her. Meanwhile, a distraught young man repeatedly calls his girlfriend, begging her to marry him. Nick himself muses on all the various persons who come into his bar, some to ask for work and others just to pass the time.', 'Joe spends a lot of his time at Nick''s Pacific Street Saloon. Tom, who credits Joe with once saving his life, stops by regularly to run errands for Joe. Today, Tom notices a woman named Kitty when she comes into Nick''s, and he quickly falls in love with her. Meanwhile, a distraught young man repeatedly calls his girlfriend, begging her to marry him. Nick himself muses on all the various persons who come into his bar, some to ask for work and others just to pass the time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pIlsRsR2785SKJA2Cuhe4u17Otp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76076'),
  ('850940442356454042', 'The Time Shifters', 1999, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Action', 'Mario Azzopardi, Jonathan Wright, William Spahic', 'Kurt Inderbitzin, Gay Walch', 'Casper Van Dien, Catherine Bell, Theresa Saldana, Peter Outerbridge, Julian Richings, Catherine Oxenberg, Martin Sheen, Lawrence Dane', 'PG-13', 'Tom Merrick gets caught up in a time-traveling conspiracy and must set the timeline right before it is irrevocably altered.', 'Tom Merrick gets caught up in a time-traveling conspiracy and must set the timeline right before it is irrevocably altered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rDuUjfilSUOPlwQH6MYJ2mpTn3k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7837'),
  ('7043413186253805', 'The Time That Remains', 2009, 'Drama, History', 'Elia Suleiman, Juna Suleiman, Marc-André Batigne', 'Elia Suleiman', 'Saleh Bakri, Elia Suleiman, Samar Qudha Tanus, Shafika Bajjali, Zuhair Abu Hanna, Ayman Espanioli, Tarik Kopty, Amer Hlehel', 'PG-13', 'An examination of the creation of the state of Israel in 1948 through to the present day. A semi-biographic film, in four chapters, about a family spanning from 1948 until recent times. Combined with intimate memories of each member, the film attempts to portray the daily life of those Palestinians who remained in their land and were labelled "Israeli-Arabs," living as a minority in their own homeland.', 'An examination of the creation of the state of Israel in 1948 through to the present day. A semi-biographic film, in four chapters, about a family spanning from 1948 until recent times. Combined with intimate memories of each member, the film attempts to portray the daily life of those Palestinians who remained in their land and were labelled "Israeli-Arabs," living as a minority in their own homeland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e5TZB7yvSr7LDoVrlVeeSotpRD0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44898'),
  ('971693672027112812', 'The Time That Remains', 2025, 'Drama, Romance, Fantasy', 'Adolfo Alix Jr., Odyssey Flores', 'Adolfo Alix Jr., Jerry Gracio, Mixkaela Villalon', 'Carlo Aquino, Bing Pimentel, Beauty Gonzalez, Jasmine Curtis-Smith, Erin Rose Espiritu, Cristine Reyes, Rita Avila, Archie Adamos', 'R', 'Surrounded by a string of deaths, an older woman relives her romance with a mysterious, ageless lover as an inspector closes in on their dark secret.', 'Surrounded by a string of deaths, an older woman relives her romance with a mysterious, ageless lover as an inspector closes in on their dark secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pjtrhgskggN2uD3lF2A9QxHO2Wd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1550223'),
  ('227964175249597092', 'The Time Thief', 2021, 'Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Yan Binsse, Isabelle Thez-Axelrad, Steve Asselin', 'Fred Pellerin', 'Jade Charbonneau, Marc Messier, Céline Bonnier, Guillaume Cyr, Émile Proulx-Cloutier, Marie-Ève Beauregard, Pier-Luc Funk, Sonia Cordeau', null, 'In 1988, in Saint-Élie-de-Caxton, an 11-years-old boy is worried for his grandmother''s life. Worn out by illness, the old storyteller tries to convince her grandson that Death no longer exists. Her story will bring back to life the extraordinary people from the village in 1927 who, by using rocambolesque tricks, will eliminate Death that threatens them. From now on, Death will coincide with the birth of legends.', 'In 1988, in Saint-Élie-de-Caxton, an 11-years-old boy is worried for his grandmother''s life. Worn out by illness, the old storyteller tries to convince her grandson that Death no longer exists. Her story will bring back to life the extraordinary people from the village in 1927 who, by using rocambolesque tricks, will eliminate Death that threatens them. From now on, Death will coincide with the birth of legends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h6toq0PTWgoPDasyUrU8fb5fOJ0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:767553'),
  ('144642293137719277', 'The Time to Die', 1970, 'Crime, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'André Farwagi, Willy Kurant', 'André Farwagi, Alain Morineau', 'Anna Karina, Bruno Cremer, Jean Rochefort, Billy Kearns, Daniel Moosmann, Michel Beaune, Jacques Debary, Catherine Rich', null, 'The movie starts with a mysterious girl riding her horse into a tree. Then she''s rescued by millionaire Max Topfer, who is startled to discover in her possession a video showing him being shot by a man he doesn’t know. Both the girl, who has total amnesia, and the tape appear to have come from the future. With the aid of bodyguard Helmut, Max Topfer tries to find out why a total stranger is apparently going to kill him on camera.', 'The movie starts with a mysterious girl riding her horse into a tree. Then she''s rescued by millionaire Max Topfer, who is startled to discover in her possession a video showing him being shot by a man he doesn’t know. Both the girl, who has total amnesia, and the tape appear to have come from the future. With the aid of bodyguard Helmut, Max Topfer tries to find out why a total stranger is apparently going to kill him on camera.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/stSzbq0bszPKyuTqghBVbJlLAFp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:230352'),
  ('214284848947302581', 'The Time to Live and the Time to Die', 1985, 'Drama', 'Hou Hsiao-hsien, Mark Lee Ping-Bing, Tsui Siu-Ming', 'Chu Tien-Wen, Hou Hsiao-hsien', 'Yu An-shun, Tien Feng, Mei Fang, Tang Ru-Yun, Hsin Shu-Fen, Hsiao Ai, Ng Siu-Ying, Grace Chen', 'PG', 'An autobiographical film based on Taiwanese director Hou Hsiao-hsien''s memories of his youth growing up in Taiwan after emigrating from mainland China.', 'An autobiographical film based on Taiwanese director Hou Hsiao-hsien''s memories of his youth growing up in Taiwan after emigrating from mainland China.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7yFSUy939rX5CncqieINpajnM3q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45999'),
  ('90538921376819488', 'The Time Traveler''s Wife', 2009, 'Drama, Romance, Fantasy', 'Robert Schwentke, Florian Ballhaus, Mike Topoozian', 'Bruce Joel Rubin', 'Eric Bana, Rachel McAdams, Arliss Howard, Ron Livingston, Stephen Tobolowsky, Michelle Nolden, Jane McLean, Hailey McCann', 'PG-13', 'Due to a genetic disorder, handsome librarian Henry DeTamble involuntarily zips through time, appearing at various moments in the life of his true love, the beautiful artist Clare Abshire.', 'Due to a genetic disorder, handsome librarian Henry DeTamble involuntarily zips through time, appearing at various moments in the life of his true love, the beautiful artist Clare Abshire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/J3ewuzQwhFro0pDpdcbZ4j7MYy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24420'),
  ('522684815086432959', 'The Time Travelers', 1964, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Drama', 'Ib Melchior, Vilmos Zsigmond', 'Ib Melchior', 'Preston Foster, Philip Carey, Merry Anders, John Hoyt, Dennis Patrick, Joan Woodbury, Steve Franken, Berry Kroeger', 'PG', 'Research scientists experimenting with time warps are accidentally propelled forward into an unbearable future.', 'Research scientists experimenting with time warps are accidentally propelled forward into an unbearable future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cc3deOS6bejonPRPLsbZBg1LlPN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49160'),
  ('768492803133129004', 'The Times of Harvey Milk', 1984, 'Documentary', 'Rob Epstein, Frances Reid', 'Rob Epstein', 'Harvey Milk, Harvey Fierstein, Anne Kronenberg, Tory Hartmann, Tom Ammiano, Jim Elliot, Henry Der, Jeannine Yeomans', null, 'Harvey Milk was an outspoken human rights activist and one of the first openly gay U.S. politicians elected to public office; even after his assassination in 1978, he continues to inspire disenfranchised people around the world.', 'Harvey Milk was an outspoken human rights activist and one of the first openly gay U.S. politicians elected to public office; even after his assassination in 1978, he continues to inspire disenfranchised people around the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/icHnX0RALT9Mn8CVhtqBl04jqXi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33138'),
  ('27994184046808406', 'The Timid Toreador', 1940, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Norm McCabe, Robert Clampett', null, null, null, 'The bull makes short work of the matador, and then turns on Porky, a tamale vendor who wanders into the ring accidentally. But then he makes the mistake of actually eating most of Porky''s extra hot tamales.', 'The bull makes short work of the matador, and then turns on Porky, a tamale vendor who wanders into the ring accidentally. But then he makes the mistake of actually eating most of Porky''s extra hot tamales.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yWmNurvQ7A69ioyzZG1KB84P9M2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236427'),
  ('654434871937767979', 'The Tin Drum', 1979, 'Drama, History, War', 'Volker Schlöndorff, Igor Luther', 'Jean-Claude Carrière, Volker Schlöndorff, Franz Seitz Junior', 'Mario Adorf, Angela Winkler, David Bennent, Katharina Thalbach, Daniel Olbrychski, Tina Engel, Berta Drews, Roland Teubner', 'R', 'In 1924, Oskar Matzerath is born in the Free City of Danzig. At age three, he falls down a flight of stairs and stops growing. In 1939, World War II breaks out.', 'In 1924, Oskar Matzerath is born in the Free City of Danzig. At age three, he falls down a flight of stairs and stops growing. In 1939, World War II breaks out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z4QsBWJbbBxct2zU7LnYSOw8UFz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:659'),
