  ('1035625425455012423', 'The Tinder Box', 1959, 'Fantasy, Family', 'Erich Gusko, Siegfried Hartmann', 'Fred Rodrian, Siegfried Hartmann, Anneliese Kocialek', 'Rolf Ludwig, Heinz Schubert, Rolf Defrank, Hannes Fischer, Hans Fiebrandt, Maria Besendahl, Senta Bonacker, Bella Waldritter', null, 'A young soldier discovers three chests of copper, silver and gold and an old tinder-box in the hollow of an old oak tree. He is now rich. But he squanders the money until it is all gone. All he has left is the old tinder-box. He uses it to light a small pipe and three large dogs come to his rescue. Based on the fairy-tale by Hans Christian Anderson.', 'A young soldier discovers three chests of copper, silver and gold and an old tinder-box in the hollow of an old oak tree. He is now rich. But he squanders the money until it is all gone. All he has left is the old tinder-box. He uses it to light a small pipe and three large dogs come to his rescue. Based on the fairy-tale by Hans Christian Anderson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iiPibE35N67wPlpAagJ5yZ2Jxkg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13100'),
  ('368023717135291063', 'The Tinder Swindler', 2022, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Felicity Morris, Edgar Dubrovsky', null, 'Shimon Yehuda Hayut, Cecilie Fjellhøy, Pernilla Sjöholm, Ayleen Charlotte, Kristoffer Kumar, Erlend Ofte Arntsen, Natalie Remøe Hansen', null, 'Posing as a wealthy, jet-setting diamond mogul, an Israeli conman wooed women online then conned them out of millions of dollars. Now, some victims plan for payback.', 'Posing as a wealthy, jet-setting diamond mogul, an Israeli conman wooed women online then conned them out of millions of dollars. Now, some victims plan for payback.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iLUSFjdavIf0SrP7ldoQ1xomQVC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:923632'),
