  ('1084219613343599881', 'The Tiniest Place', 2011, 'Documentary', 'Tatiana Huezo, Ernesto Pardo, Analeine Cal y Mayor', 'Tatiana Huezo', 'Elba Escalante, Pablo Alvarenga, Armando Aguilar, Rosi Alvarenga, Rudy Espinoza, Orlando Aguilar, Belyini Barahona, Cristela Lara', null, 'Years after the Salvadoran military destroyed the village of Cinquera in that country’s civil war, survivors have returned to rebuild their community. Soulful, beautifully rendered, this amazing debut is an evocative testament to place, memory and the power of life to rebound from tragedy.', 'Years after the Salvadoran military destroyed the village of Cinquera in that country’s civil war, survivors have returned to rebuild their community. Soulful, beautifully rendered, this amazing debut is an evocative testament to place, memory and the power of life to rebound from tragedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5l2H4Mvgo1NRfzAkQH9V70FwxqF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81663'),
  ('276243919173802221', 'The Tip of the Iceberg', 2016, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'David Cánovas, Juan Carlos Gómez', 'David Cánovas, José Amaro Carrillo, Alberto García Martín', 'Maribel Verdú, Carmelo Gómez, Fernando Cayo, Bárbara Goenaga, Jesús Castejón, Carlo D''Ursi, Juan Fernández, Álex García', null, 'A large, multinational company is badly shaken when three of its employees commit suicide. Sofía Cuevas, one of the company’s top executives, is chosen to prepare an in-house report to try and shed some light on the events.', 'A large, multinational company is badly shaken when three of its employees commit suicide. Sofía Cuevas, one of the company’s top executives, is chosen to prepare an in-house report to try and shed some light on the events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/38mBeDyrz2wpweR49wZWpB07xAW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:366502'),
