  ('256677717812788602', 'The Tit and the Moon', 1994, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Bigas Luna, José Luis Alcaine', 'Bigas Luna, Cuca Canals', 'Biel Duran, Mathilda May, Gérard Darmon, Miguel Poveda, Abel Folk, Laura Mañá, Genís Sánchez, Xavier Massé', null, 'A child does not stand the idea of having a new brother and dreams about drinking milk from the breasts of his mother again. The child asks the moon to bring him a tit only for him.', 'A child does not stand the idea of having a new brother and dreams about drinking milk from the breasts of his mother again. The child asks the moon to bring him a tit only for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rUYqLL2DXnWuyXoH468AlumoJIE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13375'),
  ('693191291987660298', 'The Titan', 2018, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Lennart Ruff, Cristina Foradada, Jan-Marcello Kahl', 'Arash Amel', 'Sam Worthington, Taylor Schilling, Tom Wilkinson, Agyness Deyn, Nathalie Emmanuel, Corey Johnson, Aleksandar Jovanović, Steven Cree', 'R', 'On a bleak future Earth, a soldier endures a radical genetic transformation to save humanity. But his wife fears he''s becoming more creature than man.', 'On a bleak future Earth, a soldier endures a radical genetic transformation to save humanity. But his wife fears he''s becoming more creature than man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qRmQazyIBZR4pQIk9VruiZul0Au.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:476926'),
  ('384579765422896739', 'The Titfield Thunderbolt', 1953, 'Comedy', 'Charles Crichton, David Peers, Paul Beeson', 'T. E. B. Clarke', 'Stanley Holloway, George Relph, Naunton Wayne, John Gregson, Godfrey Tearle, Hugh Griffith, Gabrielle Brune, Sidney James', null, 'When British Railways announce the closure of the Titfield to Mallingford branch line a group of local residents make a bid to run it themselves, backed by a monied member of the community who is attracted by the complete lack of licensing hours on trains. Unfortunately the local bus company starts to use methods that can hardly be seen as fair competition.', 'When British Railways announce the closure of the Titfield to Mallingford branch line a group of local residents make a bid to run it themselves, backed by a monied member of the community who is attracted by the complete lack of licensing hours on trains. Unfortunately the local bus company starts to use methods that can hardly be seen as fair competition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pGIAJXG5l8mrtuljnkufBM0ARaQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24381'),
  ('757433767852034994', 'The To Do List', 2013, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Maggie Carey, Doug Emmett', 'Maggie Carey', 'Aubrey Plaza, Johnny Simmons, Bill Hader, Alia Shawkat, Sarah Steele, Scott Porter, Rachel Bilson, Christopher Mintz-Plasse', 'R', 'Feeling pressured to become more sexually experienced before she goes to college, Brandy Klark makes a list of things to accomplish before hitting campus in the fall.', 'Feeling pressured to become more sexually experienced before she goes to college, Brandy Klark makes a list of things to accomplish before hitting campus in the fall.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vSVYCcvDJljrESZo1jJyXPVvwfk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129139'),
  ('551136938658385870', 'The Toast of New Orleans', 1950, 'Drama, Music, Romance', 'Norman Taurog, William E. Snyder', 'Sy Gomberg, George Wells', 'Kathryn Grayson, Mario Lanza, David Niven, J. Carrol Naish, James Mitchell, Richard Hageman, Clinton Sundberg, Sig Arno', 'NR', 'Snooty opera singer meets a rough-and-tumble fisherman in the Louisiana bayous, but this fisherman can sing! Her agent lures him away to New Orleans to teach him to sing opera but comes to regret this rash decision when the singers fall in love.', 'Snooty opera singer meets a rough-and-tumble fisherman in the Louisiana bayous, but this fisherman can sing! Her agent lures him away to New Orleans to teach him to sing opera but comes to regret this rash decision when the singers fall in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yQXM9oeJ4gE2uV9mTWrAxpVYyrE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52847'),
  ('577539597598391822', 'The Toast of New York', 1937, 'Comedy, Drama, History', 'Rowland V. Lee, J. Peverell Marley, Alexander Hall', 'Dudley Nichols, John Twist, Joel Sayre', 'Edward Arnold, Cary Grant, Frances Farmer, Jack Oakie, Donald Meek, Thelma Leeds, Clarence Kolb, Billy Gilbert', 'NR', 'After the American Civil War, Jim Fisk, a former peddler and cotton smuggler, arrives in New York, along with his partners Nick and Luke, where he struggles to make his way through the treacherous world of Wall Street''s financial markets.', 'After the American Civil War, Jim Fisk, a former peddler and cotton smuggler, arrives in New York, along with his partners Nick and Luke, where he struggles to make his way through the treacherous world of Wall Street''s financial markets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kpEdaj5Fd2D4VuFhKW1bMdl7EeM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52359'),
  ('347586844725720001', 'The Tobacconist', 2018, 'Drama, History', 'Nikolaus Leytner, Hermann Dunzendorfer, Anton Maria Aigner', 'Klaus Richter, Nikolaus Leytner', 'Simon Morzé, Bruno Ganz, Johannes Krisch, Emma Nova, Karoline Eichhorn, Regina Fritsch, Elfriede Irrall, Michael Fitz', null, 'Vienna, 1937, on the eve of the annexation of Austria into Nazi Germany. The young and inexperienced Franz Huchel begins to learn about both the joys and hardships of life by working as an apprentice to the mutilated war veteran Otto Trsnjek in a small tobacco shop, where he meets the famous psychiatrist Sigmund Freud, a regular customer, who will become a valuable friend in times of chaos and uncertainty.', 'Vienna, 1937, on the eve of the annexation of Austria into Nazi Germany. The young and inexperienced Franz Huchel begins to learn about both the joys and hardships of life by working as an apprentice to the mutilated war veteran Otto Trsnjek in a small tobacco shop, where he meets the famous psychiatrist Sigmund Freud, a regular customer, who will become a valuable friend in times of chaos and uncertainty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x7BiptuHXVNYbfMcVSgqtgifWiN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:538061'),
  ('211720595580222161', 'The Tobacconist of Vallecas', 1987, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Eloy de la Iglesia, Manuel Rojas', 'José Luis Alonso de Santos', 'Emma Penella, José Luis Gómez, Maribel Verdú, José Luis Manzano, Fernando Guillén, Jesús Puente, Antonio Gamero, Antonio Iranzo', null, 'Leandro, an unemployed mason and his friend, Tocho, attempt to rob a tobacconist in the Vallecas district of Madrid, but Mrs. Justa, the tobacconist, impedes it alerting the neighbors who notify police. Inside the shop, the confrontation between the two friends and their ''hostages'', the tobacconist and her niece Angeles, is relaxing, and a budding sympathy arises between them.', 'Leandro, an unemployed mason and his friend, Tocho, attempt to rob a tobacconist in the Vallecas district of Madrid, but Mrs. Justa, the tobacconist, impedes it alerting the neighbors who notify police. Inside the shop, the confrontation between the two friends and their ''hostages'', the tobacconist and her niece Angeles, is relaxing, and a budding sympathy arises between them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sYVf05vuuHZ53iJLJg1o1hdwHPq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111708'),
  ('1103033218519355149', 'The Todd Killings', 1971, 'Thriller', 'Barry Shear, Harold E. Stine, John H. Roe', 'Dennis Murphy, Joel Oliansky', 'Robert F. Lyons, Richard Thomas, Belinda Montgomery, Ed Asner, Gloria Grahame, Barbara Bel Geddes, Sherry E. DeBoer, Holly Near', 'R', 'Based on the true story of ''60s thrill-killer Charles Schmidt ("The Pied Piper of Tucson"), Skipper Todd (Robert F. Lyons) is a charismatic 23-year old who charms his way into the lives of high school kids in a small California town. Girls find him attractive and are only too willing to accompany him to a nearby desert area to be his "girl for the night." Not all of them return, however. Featuring Richard Thomas as his loyal hanger-on and a colorful assortment of familiar actors in vivid character roles including Barbara Bel Geddes, Gloria Grahame, Edward Asner, Fay Spain, James Broderick and Michael Conrad.', 'Based on the true story of ''60s thrill-killer Charles Schmidt ("The Pied Piper of Tucson"), Skipper Todd (Robert F. Lyons) is a charismatic 23-year old who charms his way into the lives of high school kids in a small California town. Girls find him attractive and are only too willing to accompany him to a nearby desert area to be his "girl for the night." Not all of them return, however. Featuring Richard Thomas as his loyal hanger-on and a colorful assortment of familiar actors in vivid character roles including Barbara Bel Geddes, Gloria Grahame, Edward Asner, Fay Spain, James Broderick and Michael Conrad.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nwBPxOA51wzV6CTcuZu5YB40Dhl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:169228'),
  ('215353188828830715', 'The Together Project', 2016, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Sólveig Anspach, Isabelle Razavet', 'Sólveig Anspach, Jean-Luc Gaget', 'Samir Guesmi, Florence Loiret Caille, Didda Jónsdóttir, Philippe Rebbot, Estéban, Olivia Côte, Frosti Runólfsson, Johanna Nizard', null, 'Samir, a lanky crane operator in Montreuil, falls madly for Agathe. As master swimmer at the pool Thorez he decides to take swimming lessons with her. But the lie does not last three lessons - Agathe hate liars. Chosen to represent the Seine-Saint-Denis, Agathe flies to Iceland for the 10th Congress of the International Masters Swimming. Samir has no choice but to fly in turn also.', 'Samir, a lanky crane operator in Montreuil, falls madly for Agathe. As master swimmer at the pool Thorez he decides to take swimming lessons with her. But the lie does not last three lessons - Agathe hate liars. Chosen to represent the Seine-Saint-Denis, Agathe flies to Iceland for the 10th Congress of the International Masters Swimming. Samir has no choice but to fly in turn also.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/boN4R7vdMzfs6QYV9CWI2ZEOV3f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:389044'),
  ('784912749592393896', 'The Toilers and the Wayfarers', 1997, 'Romance, Drama', 'Keith Froelich', null, 'Matt Klemp, Ralf Schirg, Andrew Woodhouse, Jerome Samuels, Joan Wheeler, Michael Glen, Ralph Jacobus, James Newman', null, 'Phillip and Dieter nearly suffocate hiding their sexual identity in the face of puritanical small town values. Joined by a mysterious German relative, the three misfits escape to the big city searching for a place to belong.', 'Phillip and Dieter nearly suffocate hiding their sexual identity in the face of puritanical small town values. Joined by a mysterious German relative, the three misfits escape to the big city searching for a place to belong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bW0twSuJpJM12S8FG1QT8ErTZYO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27218'),
  ('139466943437637043', 'The Toilets Were Closed from the Inside', 1976, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Patrice Leconte, Bruno Nuytten', 'Patrice Leconte, Gotlib', 'Coluche, Jean Rochefort, Roland Dubillard, Danièle Evenou, Robert Berri, Jean Luisi, Billy Bourbon, Olga Valéry', null, 'A bus conductor gets dressed for work in the morning, goes to the toilet, where he is killed by a bomb. The Commissioner and his fat, bumbling assistant, Inspector Charbonnier are put on the case. After interviewing friends, wives, colleagues, and spying on strangers who might be connected, our heroes trace the assassin down to a mental institution where, it seems, the murder victim has been an inmate for the last three years...', 'A bus conductor gets dressed for work in the morning, goes to the toilet, where he is killed by a bomb. The Commissioner and his fat, bumbling assistant, Inspector Charbonnier are put on the case. After interviewing friends, wives, colleagues, and spying on strangers who might be connected, our heroes trace the assassin down to a mental institution where, it seems, the murder victim has been an inmate for the last three years...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xPVwBbT4RupyNeuxfYEakXwpaSW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67754'),
  ('241215921652038690', 'The Tokyo Night Sky Is Always the Densest Shade of Blue', 2017, 'Drama', 'Yoichi Kamakari, Yuya Ishii, Jun Ishii', 'Yuya Ishii', 'Shizuka Ishibashi, Sosuke Ikematsu, Ryuhei Matsuda, Mikako Ichikawa, Tetsushi Tanaka, Ryo Sato, Takahiro Miura, Yoshimi Nozaki', null, 'Mika works as a nurse by day; by night she entertains covetous men at a girls'' bar. Shinji is blind in one eye and ekes out a living as a construction worker. Young and grown-up at the same time, they both lead a lonely existence, but somehow their paths keep miraculously crossing under the Tokyo sky.', 'Mika works as a nurse by day; by night she entertains covetous men at a girls'' bar. Shinji is blind in one eye and ekes out a living as a construction worker. Young and grown-up at the same time, they both lead a lonely existence, but somehow their paths keep miraculously crossing under the Tokyo sky.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rG21rKfRLhJ8zsUQGCtvKMQwCT1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:438339'),
  ('844334138396558751', 'The Tokyo Trial', 2006, 'Crime, Drama', 'Gao Qunshu, Zhang Xigui', null, 'Kelly Lin Hsi-Lei, Liu Weiwei, Eric Tsang Chi-Wai, Damian Lau Chung-Yan, Ding Yongdai, Kenneth Tsang, Ken Chu, Gardner Tse Kwan-Ho', null, 'This film was directed by Gao Qunshu and is about the International Military Tribunal for the Far East after Japan''s surrender in World War II. The movie presents the trial from the point of view of the Chinese judge Mei Ju-ao. The director and his crew spent more than a year doing research to finish the script, which is based on historical data. It cost 18 million yuan (2.25 million U.S. dollars). This film hired actors from 11 countries, including mainland China, Hong Kong, Japan and other places, including actors such as Kenneth Tsang and Damian Lau. They recreated court scenes from the trial in Chinese, English and Japanese. It was shown in cinemas and around 100 universities across mainland China to mark the 75th anniversary of the start of Japan''s invasion of China.', 'This film was directed by Gao Qunshu and is about the International Military Tribunal for the Far East after Japan''s surrender in World War II. The movie presents the trial from the point of view of the Chinese judge Mei Ju-ao. The director and his crew spent more than a year doing research to finish the script, which is based on historical data. It cost 18 million yuan (2.25 million U.S. dollars). This film hired actors from 11 countries, including mainland China, Hong Kong, Japan and other places, including actors such as Kenneth Tsang and Damian Lau. They recreated court scenes from the trial in Chinese, English and Japanese. It was shown in cinemas and around 100 universities across mainland China to mark the 75th anniversary of the start of Japan''s invasion of China.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/imCVVGwxWcwwe969StsfkjdLJJY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:382635'),
  ('604156284064994097', 'The Toll', 2020, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Michael Nader, Jordan Kennington', 'Michael Nader', 'Jordan Hayes, Max Topplin, James McGowan, Rosemary Dunsmore, Thomas L. Colford, Sharon McFarlane, Jana Peck, Jess Brown', null, 'A socially awkward driver and a weary passenger try to make it to their destination while being haunted by a supernatural threat.', 'A socially awkward driver and a weary passenger try to make it to their destination while being haunted by a supernatural threat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q6vV6sSWz9cytmc8L9IEBjjyFmV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:638045'),
  ('47703367101092688', 'The Toll', 2021, 'Comedy, Thriller, Crime', 'Adrian Peckitt, Lottie McDowell, Simone Pereira Hind', 'Matt Redd', 'Michael Smiley, Annes Elwy, Gary Beadle, Iwan Rheon, Steve Oram, Evelyn Mok, Paul Kaye, Julian Glover', 'NR', 'Brendan works solo shifts in the quietest toll booth in Wales, hiding from a criminal past where nobody would ever look. When he finally gets rumbled, word of his whereabouts gets out and his enemies head west for revenge. Meanwhile, local traffic cop Catrin’s investigation into a simple robbery finds her heading for the booth at exactly the wrong time.', 'Brendan works solo shifts in the quietest toll booth in Wales, hiding from a criminal past where nobody would ever look. When he finally gets rumbled, word of his whereabouts gets out and his enemies head west for revenge. Meanwhile, local traffic cop Catrin’s investigation into a simple robbery finds her heading for the booth at exactly the wrong time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2BTbYZ1zdNrpFRvLFEkRUP5vCJd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:790646'),
  ('990273223814087310', 'The Toll of the Sea', 1923, 'Drama, Romance', 'Chester M. Franklin, J.A. Ball', 'Frances Marion', 'Beatrice Bentley, Kenneth Harlan, Anna May Wong, Priscilla Moran, Etta Lee, Ming Young', null, 'A young Chinese woman saves an American man washed up onto the shore and the two fall in love, only for him to have second thoughts.', 'A young Chinese woman saves an American man washed up onto the shore and the two fall in love, only for him to have second thoughts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mC3UjJRy86Xp6eoTRRQwVIZKIZU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75804'),
