  ('938158884058779696', 'The Tomb', 1986, 'Fantasy, Horror', 'Fred Olen Ray, Paul Elliott, Tony Brewster', 'Kenneth J. Hall', 'Cameron Mitchell, John Carradine, Sybil Danning, Michelle Bauer, Richard Hench, Susan Stokey, David O''Hara, George Hoth', null, 'An Egyptian princess rises from the dead and goes to California for the amulets she needs.', 'An Egyptian princess rises from the dead and goes to California for the amulets she needs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jzeZ6Fnqzq37OUVogtuviJTYB4z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5735'),
  ('747001121893870698', 'The Tomb', 2006, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'Bruno Mattei, Luigi Ciccarese, Tullio Antiga', 'Barbara Di Girolamo', 'Hugo Baret, Anna Marcello, Kasya Zurakowska, Robert Madison, David Brass', 'NR', 'A group of young archaeologists flies to Mexico to study the Mayan culture, but they find trouble when they stumble upon an unknown cursed temple.', 'A group of young archaeologists flies to Mexico to study the Mayan culture, but they find trouble when they stumble upon an unknown cursed temple.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/28ZaPBPp0CR99JOJy9ePdNOt9t8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72683'),
  ('439183669746381644', 'The Tomb', 2009, 'Horror', 'Michael Staininger, Anthony E. Cabral, Chris Benson', 'John Shirley', 'Wes Bentley, Kaitlin Doubleday, Sofya Skya, Cary-Hiroyuki Tagawa, Mackenzie Rosman, Joel Lewis, Christa Campbell, Michael Madsen', 'R', 'Successful writer and scholar Jonathan Merrick falls under the spell of the irresistible, bewitchingly beautiful Ligeia. She''s fighting a fatal illness and she will stop at nothing to defeat death, her one true enemy.', 'Successful writer and scholar Jonathan Merrick falls under the spell of the irresistible, bewitchingly beautiful Ligeia. She''s fighting a fatal illness and she will stop at nothing to defeat death, her one true enemy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jlUzImT4x2Gkm46dUpw47AhuYFR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36686'),
  ('59265136490945557', 'The Tomb of Dracula', 1980, 'Animation, Drama, Horror, TV Movie', 'Hiroshi Wagatsuma, Minoru Okazaki, Hisao Shirai', 'Tadaaki Yamazaki', 'Ryō Ishihara, Hiroko Suzuki, Kazuyuki Sogabe, Keiichi Noda, Kenji Utsumi, Mami Koyama, Yasuo Hisamatsu, Hidekatsu Shibata', null, 'Boston, United States. Dracula, the immortal vampire, interrupts a satanic ritual and flees with Dolores, the woman whom the members of the evil cult are about to murder. Overwhelmed by his love for her, and unable to drink her blood, they have a son together, whom they name Janus. (Loosely based on Marvel''s The Tomb of Dracula comic book series.)', 'Boston, United States. Dracula, the immortal vampire, interrupts a satanic ritual and flees with Dolores, the woman whom the members of the evil cult are about to murder. Overwhelmed by his love for her, and unable to drink her blood, they have a son together, whom they name Janus. (Loosely based on Marvel''s The Tomb of Dracula comic book series.)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yXPbuYFjt45k9BXHUr0lX4WQed3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90450'),
  ('1008573125052576212', 'The Tomb of Ligeia', 1964, 'Horror', 'Roger Corman, Arthur Grant', 'Paul Mayersberg', 'Vincent Price, Elizabeth Shepherd, John Westbrook, Derek Francis, Oliver Johnston, Richard Vernon, Frank Thornton, Ronald Adam', 'NR', 'Verden Fell is shattered after the death of his lovely wife. But, after an unexpected encounter with Lady Rowena Trevanion, Fell soon finds himself married again. Nevertheless, his late wife''s spirit seems to hang over the dilapidated abbey that Fell shares with his new bride. Lady Rowena senses that something is amiss and, when she investigates, makes a horrifying discovery -- learning that Fell''s dead wife is closer than she ever imagined possible.', 'Verden Fell is shattered after the death of his lovely wife. But, after an unexpected encounter with Lady Rowena Trevanion, Fell soon finds himself married again. Nevertheless, his late wife''s spirit seems to hang over the dilapidated abbey that Fell shares with his new bride. Lady Rowena senses that something is amiss and, when she investigates, makes a horrifying discovery -- learning that Fell''s dead wife is closer than she ever imagined possible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j8gc33Q97xorBvnMUQLXs9Yla0H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29030'),
  ('1091958653647814688', 'The Tomorrow Job', 2023, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'Bruce Wemple', 'Bruce Wemple', 'Grant Schumacher, Caitlin Duffy, Ariella Mastroianni, Chris Cimperman, George Katt, Andrew Gombas, LeJon Woods, Catharine Daddario', null, 'A team of thieves use a time travel drug to trade places with their future selves to execute the ultimate heist. When interrupted on a job the team must fix their past mistakes to prevent disastrous consequences.', 'A team of thieves use a time travel drug to trade places with their future selves to execute the ultimate heist. When interrupted on a job the team must fix their past mistakes to prevent disastrous consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Ah3pJ3iuX28PKHjGLyIrEsFVq5q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1064912'),
  ('1020106912497073334', 'The Tomorrow Man', 1996, 'Thriller, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Bill D''Elia, Eddy Donno', null, 'Julian Sands, Giancarlo Esposito, Craig Wasson, Obba Babatundé, Ray Baker, Sydney Walsh, James Saito, Joseph Whipp', null, 'A mysterious spacecraft has crash-landed somewhere in rural Oregon, immediately drawing the attention of relentless government agents. Meanwhile, computer expert Jonathan Driscoll is blindsided when his car hits a figure who seemingly appeared out of thin air — the synthetic being known only as Ken. Ken is a highly advanced android from the future, programmed with a critical, time-sensitive mission: to travel back and prevent the cataclysmic sabotage of the world''s first inveterate rocket. This rocket is not merely a launch vehicle; it is the cornerstone of future deep space exploration and, by extension, the survival of the human race.', 'A mysterious spacecraft has crash-landed somewhere in rural Oregon, immediately drawing the attention of relentless government agents. Meanwhile, computer expert Jonathan Driscoll is blindsided when his car hits a figure who seemingly appeared out of thin air — the synthetic being known only as Ken. Ken is a highly advanced android from the future, programmed with a critical, time-sensitive mission: to travel back and prevent the cataclysmic sabotage of the world''s first inveterate rocket. This rocket is not merely a launch vehicle; it is the cornerstone of future deep space exploration and, by extension, the survival of the human race.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yvHy65xsv8jr1MmpdNHoyThFP0d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125989'),
  ('1103805177621738886', 'The Tomorrow Man', 2019, 'Drama, Romance', 'Noble Jones, Noble Jones', 'Noble Jones', 'John Lithgow, Blythe Danner, Derek Cecil, Katie Aselton, Sophie Thatcher, Eve Harlow, Wendy Makkena, Isabelle Boni', 'PG-13', 'Ed Hemsler spends his life preparing for a disaster that may never come. Ronnie Meisner spends her life shopping for things she may never use. In a small town somewhere in America, these two people will try to find love while trying not to get lost in each other’s stuff.', 'Ed Hemsler spends his life preparing for a disaster that may never come. Ronnie Meisner spends her life shopping for things she may never use. In a small town somewhere in America, these two people will try to find love while trying not to get lost in each other’s stuff.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7YVxf3nUxrJ2xX4SU7Efp7LqPZ5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:565391'),
  ('301473410570356458', 'The Tomorrow War', 2021, 'Action, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Nick Satriano, Brad Ricker, Matt Haggerty', 'Zach Dean', 'Chris Pratt, Yvonne Strahovski, J.K. Simmons, Betty Gilpin, Sam Richardson, Edwin Hodge, Jasmine Mathews, Ryan Kiera Armstrong', 'PG-13', 'The world is stunned when a group of time travelers arrive from the year 2051 to deliver an urgent message: Thirty years in the future, mankind is losing a global war against a deadly alien species. The only hope for survival is for soldiers and civilians from the present to be transported to the future and join the fight. Among those recruited is high school teacher and family man Dan Forester. Determined to save the world for his young daughter, Dan teams up with a brilliant scientist and his estranged father in a desperate quest to rewrite the fate of the planet.', 'The world is stunned when a group of time travelers arrive from the year 2051 to deliver an urgent message: Thirty years in the future, mankind is losing a global war against a deadly alien species. The only hope for survival is for soldiers and civilians from the present to be transported to the future and join the fight. Among those recruited is high school teacher and family man Dan Forester. Determined to save the world for his young daughter, Dan teams up with a brilliant scientist and his estranged father in a desperate quest to rewrite the fate of the planet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/34nDCQZwaEvsy4CFO5hkGRFDCVU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:588228'),
  ('155019601784370888', 'The Toolbox Murders', 1978, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Dennis Donnelly, Gary Graver', 'Neva Friedenn, Ann Kindberg, Robert Easter', 'Cameron Mitchell, Pamelyn Ferdin, Wesley Eure, Aneta Corsaut, Nicolas Beauvy, Tim Donnelly, Faith McSwain, Marciee Drake', 'R', 'A serial killer, plagued by the memory of a fatal car accident, uses various tools to murder female tenants of a Los Angeles apartment complex, then abducts a teenaged girl who lives there with her family. When the police express doubt that the murders are connected to the girl''s disappearance, her brother sets out to search for her on his own.', 'A serial killer, plagued by the memory of a fatal car accident, uses various tools to murder female tenants of a Los Angeles apartment complex, then abducts a teenaged girl who lives there with her family. When the police express doubt that the murders are connected to the girl''s disappearance, her brother sets out to search for her on his own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d9ghDjhGW5zQ0MYFFWG8ioH70uE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27495'),
  ('571516151545414105', 'The Tooth and the Nail', 2017, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Jung Sik, Kim Hwi, Yun Jong-ho', 'Jung Sik, Lee Jung-ho', 'Go Soo, Kim Joo-hyuk, Moon Sung-keun, Park Sung-woong, Im Hwa-young, Park Ji-a, Kim Ooh-jin, Oh Kwang-rok', null, 'Seok-jin, a magician at a club, meets a mysterious woman, Ha-yeon, who soon becomes his assistant and fiance. Things take a turn when she is found dead and he must find out what happened.', 'Seok-jin, a magician at a club, meets a mysterious woman, Ha-yeon, who soon becomes his assistant and fiance. Things take a turn when she is found dead and he must find out what happened.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zUSFu3uQxsD9vnpF3pEA7DNtppz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:452714'),
  ('1128714717465303081', 'The Tooth Fairy', 2006, 'Horror', 'Chuck Bowman, Bonnie Benwick, Bryant Marshall', null, 'Lochlyn Munro, Chandra West, Steve Bacic, Jianna Ballard, Carrie Anne Fleming, Peter New, Jesse Hutch, Ben Cotton', null, 'A woman and her daughter (Nicole Muñoz) encounter a deadly legend at a bed-and-breakfast.', 'A woman and her daughter (Nicole Muñoz) encounter a deadly legend at a bed-and-breakfast.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i0dms1hH1ObbysPscPDKjgqNns0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53953'),
  ('222586186898184994', 'The Top Bet', 1991, 'Action, Comedy', 'Corey Yuen, Jeffrey Lau Chun-Wai, Jimmy Leung Chi-Ming', 'Jeffrey Lau Chun-Wai', 'Carol Cheng, Anita Mui Yim-Fong, Richard Ng Man-Tat, Sandra Ng Kwan-Yu, Shing Fui-On, Jeffrey Lau Chun-Wai, Kenny Bee, Yuen Wah', null, 'Sing and Mei are two siblings with special powers which the former uses to gamble. When both are unavailable, a gangster hires Fanny, a con artist, to compete in a gambling competition.', 'Sing and Mei are two siblings with special powers which the former uses to gamble. When both are unavailable, a gangster hires Fanny, a con artist, to compete in a gambling competition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3GNxrDJJJXwNvYzJCq6cIvwUHFb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:191324'),
  ('981608045877081148', 'The Top Scorer', 1980, 'Comedy', 'Kartal Tibet', 'Osman F. Seden', 'Kemal Sunal, Suna Yıldızoğlu, Yavuz Şimsek, Gölge Başar, Reha Yurdakul, Suzan Avcı, Handan Adalı, Muadelet Tibet', null, 'Sait, who is in love with Sevim, a football enthusiast, starts playing football to catch her attention. When Sevim mocks him, Sait gets angry and decides to become a football player.', 'Sait, who is in love with Sevim, a football enthusiast, starts playing football to catch her attention. When Sevim mocks him, Sait gets angry and decides to become a football player.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Ah7LGD1tGmAD14eWQ4Zatb1VfE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:436063'),
  ('278558831537307150', 'The Top Secret: Murder in Mind', 2016, 'Thriller', 'Keishi Otomo, Takuro Ishizaka', 'Izumi Takahashi, Keishi Otomo', 'Toma Ikuta, Masaki Okada, Tori Matsuzaka, Lisa Oda, Nao Omori, Chiaki Kuriyama, Koji Kikkawa, Ayumu Mochizuki', null, 'Set in the late 21st century, an MRI scanner is introduced at the National Research Institute of Police Science''s 9th Forensics Laboratory. The machine is able to scan the memories from even the deceased. As ethical questions arise over the machine''s use, the 9th Forensics Laboratory members, including rookie Ikko Aoki and Chief Tsuyoshi Maki, struggle to solve cases.', 'Set in the late 21st century, an MRI scanner is introduced at the National Research Institute of Police Science''s 9th Forensics Laboratory. The machine is able to scan the memories from even the deceased. As ethical questions arise over the machine''s use, the 9th Forensics Laboratory members, including rookie Ikko Aoki and Chief Tsuyoshi Maki, struggle to solve cases.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zUXblXofh4z3goCo2UAe9SdbpVe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:375532'),
  ('790735770065069610', 'The Torch', 1950, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, War', 'Emilio Fernández, Gabriel Figueroa', 'Íñigo de Martino, Emilio Fernández', 'Paulette Goddard, Pedro Armendáriz, Gilbert Roland, Walter Reed, Julio Villarreal, Carlos Múzquiz, Margarito Luna, José Torvay', 'NR', 'The story of a fear-inspiring revolutionary general who develops a passion for the daughter of a wealthy villager. It''s hate at first sight so far as the girl is concerned, but this will soon change.', 'The story of a fear-inspiring revolutionary general who develops a passion for the daughter of a wealthy villager. It''s hate at first sight so far as the girl is concerned, but this will soon change.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ZKXrge0q1PpSVF8vdhGMjpMY3f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:214559'),
  ('252395356818049863', 'The Torrent', 2012, 'Drama', 'Simon Lavoie, Mathieu Laverdière', 'Anne Hébert', 'Victor Andres Trelles Turgeon, Laurence Leboeuf, Dominique Quesnel, Anthony Therrien, Marco Bacon, Roger Blay, Normand Canac-Marquis, Aubert Pallascio', null, 'It’s 1922 in the Quebec countryside, and Claudine Perreault has big plans for her son, François. He’ll enter the priesthood so that God will forgive her for bearing a child out of wedlock. But 17-year-old François is dead set against joining the seminary. Enraged, Claudine strikes him so violently he goes deaf. After his mother’s death, François begins a different kind of relationship with a woman when he buys the wild and aloof young Amica from an Innu peddler.', 'It’s 1922 in the Quebec countryside, and Claudine Perreault has big plans for her son, François. He’ll enter the priesthood so that God will forgive her for bearing a child out of wedlock. But 17-year-old François is dead set against joining the seminary. Enraged, Claudine strikes him so violently he goes deaf. After his mother’s death, François begins a different kind of relationship with a woman when he buys the wild and aloof young Amica from an Innu peddler.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f6KJzShcxA1jy4P6urCBYpyibs6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:155036'),
  ('986181461780547429', 'The Tortoise and the Hare', 1935, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'Wilfred Jackson', 'Larry Clemmons', 'Eddie Holden, Ned Norton, Pinto Colvig, Marcellite Garner, Dorothy Compton, Beatrice Hagen, Mary Moder', 'NR', 'The Tortoise and the Hare is an animated short film released on January 5, 1935 by United Artists, produced by Walt Disney and directed by Wilfred Jackson. Based on an Aesop''s fable of the same name, The Tortoise and the Hare won the 1934 Academy Award for Best Short Subject: Cartoons. This cartoon is also believed to be one of the influences for Bugs Bunny.', 'The Tortoise and the Hare is an animated short film released on January 5, 1935 by United Artists, produced by Walt Disney and directed by Wilfred Jackson. Based on an Aesop''s fable of the same name, The Tortoise and the Hare won the 1934 Academy Award for Best Short Subject: Cartoons. This cartoon is also believed to be one of the influences for Bugs Bunny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/luNLDY3zc76PWVkKlOpSSlPAnYH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58159'),
  ('725732164180831463', 'The Torture Chamber of Dr. Sadism', 1967, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Harald Reinl, Ernst W. Kalinke, Dieter Liphardt', 'Manfred R. Köhler', 'Lex Barker, Karin Dor, Christopher Lee, Carl Lange, Christiane Rücker, Vladimir Medar, Dieter Eppler', null, 'In the Olden Tymes, Count Regula is drawn and quartered for killing twelve virgins in his dungeon torture chamber. Thirty-five years later, he comes back to seek revenge on the daughter of his intended thirteenth victim and the son of his prosecutor in order to attain immortal life.', 'In the Olden Tymes, Count Regula is drawn and quartered for killing twelve virgins in his dungeon torture chamber. Thirty-five years later, he comes back to seek revenge on the daughter of his intended thirteenth victim and the son of his prosecutor in order to attain immortal life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4maIxWxoC5mMloFqQhqpd3NfS5y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12602'),
  ('194498639236509190', 'The Torture Club', 2014, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Kōta Yoshida, Naoyoshi Kawamatsu, Masafumi Seki', 'Kōta Yoshida', 'Noriko Kohara, Haruna Yoshizumi, Yuki Mamiya, Mika Yano, Nami Motoyama, Kanako Mochida, Reiko Hayama, Shungicu Uchida', null, 'The "Torture Club" is an official after-school activity at the private school Saint Honesty Gakuen. Yuzuki has no idea about the club when she enrolls, and gets abducted by the club members and hauled off the club-room. There, she finds out that upper-class student Aoi, her secret idol, is in the club, and decides to join, but…', 'The "Torture Club" is an official after-school activity at the private school Saint Honesty Gakuen. Yuzuki has no idea about the club when she enrolls, and gets abducted by the club members and hauled off the club-room. There, she finds out that upper-class student Aoi, her secret idol, is in the club, and decides to join, but…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rJQQxeNqf4Cs0NtlftVJyfHDoEc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:297090'),
  ('736952871608170495', 'The Tortured', 2010, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Rob Lieberman, Peter F. Woeste', 'Marek Posival', 'Erika Christensen, Jesse Metcalfe, Bill Moseley, Chelah Horsdal, Fulvio Cecere, Aaron Pearl, Kayden Kessler, Sheila Shah', 'R', 'An upper-middle-class couple''s life is destroyed when their only child is kidnapped and killed. Obsessed with revenge, the couple seizes an opportunity to kidnap the killer.', 'An upper-middle-class couple''s life is destroyed when their only child is kidnapped and killed. Obsessed with revenge, the couple seizes an opportunity to kidnap the killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s5kXFJaRYaR0KEROXhWlQaM7Wje.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47518'),
  ('993299622218759591', 'The Torturer', 2005, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Lamberto Bava, Ugo Menegatti, Alessandro Scuderi', 'Lamberto Bava, Diego Cestino, Andrea Valentini', 'Simone Corrente, Elena Bouryka, Carla Cassola, María Blanco-Fafián, Emilio De Marchi, Alessandro Santini', null, 'The gorgeous young actress Ginette auditions for the lead role in the first long feature film of the controversial artist Alex Sherba and she''s almost immediately submitted to a long series of harassing questions and indecent proposals. Alex quickly turns out to be a mentally unstable and potentially dangerous man, and when she finds an earring belonging to a missing friend of hers, Ginette even suspects that he might be a killer and starts her very own private investigation. Meanwhile, the torturing of other poor girls cheerfully continues in the dungeon of Alex'' parental house.', 'The gorgeous young actress Ginette auditions for the lead role in the first long feature film of the controversial artist Alex Sherba and she''s almost immediately submitted to a long series of harassing questions and indecent proposals. Alex quickly turns out to be a mentally unstable and potentially dangerous man, and when she finds an earring belonging to a missing friend of hers, Ginette even suspects that he might be a killer and starts her very own private investigation. Meanwhile, the torturing of other poor girls cheerfully continues in the dungeon of Alex'' parental house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ww2NXW118wp8d1P1VUAnas3VJFW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47606'),
  ('1148797479620716306', 'The Toth Family', 1969, 'Drama, War, Comedy', 'Zoltán Fábri, György Illés', 'Zoltán Fábri', 'Zoltán Latinovits, Imre Sinkovits, Márta Fónay, Venczel Vera, István Dégi, Antal Páger, Iván Darvas, János Rajz', null, 'The Toth family resides in Northern Hungary. The couple has a daughter and a son, the latter a member of the armed forces. When his weary major is ordered to take a vacation, the son talks him into a visit to his family home. Comedy ensues when the Toths go overboard trying to make things pleasant for the visiting major in hopes of an easier life for their son the soldier.', 'The Toth family resides in Northern Hungary. The couple has a daughter and a son, the latter a member of the armed forces. When his weary major is ordered to take a vacation, the son talks him into a visit to his family home. Comedy ensues when the Toths go overboard trying to make things pleasant for the visiting major in hopes of an easier life for their son the soldier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oSjxEkgwITSdpi7lIIIpxZ546g9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8776'),
  ('523563907705979520', 'The Touch', 1971, 'Drama, Romance', 'Ingmar Bergman, Sven Nykvist', 'Ingmar Bergman', 'Elliott Gould, Bibi Andersson, Max von Sydow, Sheila Reid, Margaretha Byström, Elsa Ebbesen-Thornblad, Barbro Hiort af Ornäs, Åke Lindström', null, 'A Swedish housewife begins an adulterous affair with an American archaeologist, unaware of his emotional scars as a Holocaust survivor; consequently, their relationship will be painfully difficult.', 'A Swedish housewife begins an adulterous affair with an American archaeologist, unaware of his emotional scars as a Holocaust survivor; consequently, their relationship will be painfully difficult.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4bz8hRBj8jsLFBa5nKP28MQufEd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105254'),
  ('243726417644384473', 'The Touch', 1992, 'Horror, Drama, Thriller, Mystery', 'Albert Mkrtchyan, Boris Kocherov, Vil Ermolin', 'Andrei Goryunov', 'Aleksandr Zuev, Maryana Polteva, Vsevolod Abdulov, Igor Pushkaryov, Aleksandra Kharitonova, Andrey Annenskiy, Nikolai Averyushkin, Andrey Dudarenko', null, 'Olga Nikolayevna kills her little son Kolya and then herself. Andrey, the most laid-back and friendly cop in Russia, gets on the case.', 'Olga Nikolayevna kills her little son Kolya and then herself. Andrey, the most laid-back and friendly cop in Russia, gets on the case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vRSC6Rx60zmGFTMIYqlAgdPOqNc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:260604'),
  ('554064867621693719', 'The Touch', 2002, 'Action, Fantasy', 'Peter Pau Tak-Hai, Peter Pau Tak-Hai', 'Laurent Courtiaud, Julien Carbon, J. D. Zeik', 'Michelle Yeoh, Ben Chaplin, Richard Roxburgh, Lung Sihung, Brandon Chang, Margaret Wang, Dane Cook, Emmanuel Lanzi', null, 'A sister and brother, the last heirs of a family of acrobats, are called upon by a Buddhist monk sect to retrieve an artifact that their ancestors have protected throughout the ages.', 'A sister and brother, the last heirs of a family of acrobats, are called upon by a Buddhist monk sect to retrieve an artifact that their ancestors have protected throughout the ages.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/voQXY7v9G8n4cPQEZIabkBzwzB6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32091'),
  ('202078668255197299', 'The Touch of Her Flesh', 1967, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Michael Findlay, Roberta Findlay', 'Michael Findlay', 'Suzanne Marre, Angelique Pettyjohn, Michael Findlay, Vivian Del Rio, Peggy Steffans, Sally Farb, Ron Skideri, Roberta Findlay', null, 'Richard Jennings returns from a business trip to discover his wife in bed with a lover. Panic stricken, he staggers to the street and is hit by a car, losing an eye. Scorned and vengeful, he adopts a new identity and begins a murderous rampage against all women he deems "immoral."', 'Richard Jennings returns from a business trip to discover his wife in bed with a lover. Panic stricken, he staggers to the street and is hit by a car, losing an eye. Scorned and vengeful, he adopts a new identity and begins a murderous rampage against all women he deems "immoral."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1W66LaWPd4X3qsoURxw974U35Hx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121620'),
  ('1036479244015294737', 'The Touch of Satan', 1971, 'Horror', 'Jordan Cronenweth, Don Henderson, Ron Sawade', 'James E. McLarty', 'Michael Berry, Emby Mellay, Lee Amber, Yvonne Winslow, Jeanne Gerson, Robert Easton, Lew Horn, Sharon Crabtree', 'PG', 'A murderous and decrepit old woman resides on a California walnut farm with her family. On a whim, a traveler named Jodie makes a brief side trip to the farm, where he meets and falls in love with Melissa, the proverbial farmer''s daughter. Jodie and Melissa grow closer as Melissa begins to reveal the strange, dark history of her family.', 'A murderous and decrepit old woman resides on a California walnut farm with her family. On a whim, a traveler named Jodie makes a brief side trip to the farm, where he meets and falls in love with Melissa, the proverbial farmer''s daughter. Jodie and Melissa grow closer as Melissa begins to reveal the strange, dark history of her family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hYuIjm96PQnzZzkvNm35BhX8kHl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31382'),
  ('64231234166492767', 'The Tough Ones', 1999, 'Drama, Crime', 'Aleksi Mäkelä, Pini Hellstedt', 'Aleksi Bardy', 'Samuli Edelmann, Juha Veijonen, Teemu Lehtilä, Kalevi Haapoja, Sari Havas, Pia Latomäki, Eero Aho, Arttu Kapulainen', null, 'The Tough Ones tells a story of two friends who have a hard time finding their place in the society. Antti and Jussi are released from jail. While they were doing time for bank robbery, the third man involved in the robbery, the one who was not convicted, has become a policeman. He tries to help his friends to settle into the small town in Pohjanmaa, but the boys start a black market liquor business instead. The road seems to lead back to the jail.', 'The Tough Ones tells a story of two friends who have a hard time finding their place in the society. Antti and Jussi are released from jail. While they were doing time for bank robbery, the third man involved in the robbery, the one who was not convicted, has become a policeman. He tries to help his friends to settle into the small town in Pohjanmaa, but the boys start a black market liquor business instead. The road seems to lead back to the jail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gIyzNrM8BnyuB6guykvlXhsbkX1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38821'),
  ('976229592797234584', 'The Tourist', 2010, 'Action, Thriller, Romance', 'Florian Henckel von Donnersmarck, John Seale, Marco Trentini', 'Florian Henckel von Donnersmarck, Julian Fellowes, Christopher McQuarrie', 'Johnny Depp, Angelina Jolie, Paul Bettany, Timothy Dalton, Steven Berkoff, Rufus Sewell, Christian De Sica, Alessio Boni', 'PG-13', 'American tourist Frank meets mysterious British woman Elise on the train to Venice. Romance seems to bud, but there''s more to her than meets the eye.', 'American tourist Frank meets mysterious British woman Elise on the train to Venice. Romance seems to bud, but there''s more to her than meets the eye.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oXe1nw4HcS32YVpvxwsWEVdvEXA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37710'),
  ('705638757168924463', 'The Tournament', 2009, 'Horror, Action, Thriller', 'Scott Mann, Emil Topuzov, Shero Rauf', 'Jonathan Frank, Gary Young, Nick Rowntree', 'Robert Carlyle, Kelly Hu, Ian Somerhalder, Liam Cunningham, Ving Rhames, Sébastien Foucan, Craig Conway, John Lynch', 'R', 'Every seven years, in an unsuspecting town, The Tournament takes place. A battle royale between 30 of the world''s deadliest assassins. The last man standing receives the $10,000,000 cash prize and the title of World''s No. 1 Assassin, which itself carries the legendary million dollar-a-bullet price tag.', 'Every seven years, in an unsuspecting town, The Tournament takes place. A battle royale between 30 of the world''s deadliest assassins. The last man standing receives the $10,000,000 cash prize and the title of World''s No. 1 Assassin, which itself carries the legendary million dollar-a-bullet price tag.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zVkPQAIoCNDc8khNjmSAiTb3lV5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24056'),
  ('53644898082954576', 'The Tournament', 2015, 'Drama', 'Elodie Namer, Julien Poupard', 'Elodie Namer', 'Michelangelo Passaniti, Lou de Laâge, Magne-Håvard Brekke, Adam Corbier, Fabien Libiszewski, Thomas Solivérès, Aliocha Schneider, Viktoria Kozlova', null, 'Budapest International Chess Tournament. The most likely winner: Cal Fournier (22), French champion, immature genius, socially awkward, compulsive player. But this time, an unusual 9-years-old Hungarian opponent disrupts this smooth-running routine.', 'Budapest International Chess Tournament. The most likely winner: Cal Fournier (22), French champion, immature genius, socially awkward, compulsive player. But this time, an unusual 9-years-old Hungarian opponent disrupts this smooth-running routine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dNHTIVg4tdi0vpr8VQxVmMqlSfP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:334312'),
