  ('174503009378107914', 'The Tower', 2012, 'Action, Drama', 'Lee Beom-seok, Kim Ji-hoon, Kim Yeong-ho', 'Kim Sang-don, Kim Ji-hoon, Heo Jun-seok', 'Sul Kyung-gu, Son Ye-jin, Kim Sang-kyung, Jo Min-ah, Do Ji-han, Ahn Sung-ki, Lee Han-wi, Cha In-pyo', 'PG-13', 'Tower Sky, a luxurious building complex, has organised a lavish Christmas party for its VIP guests. However, things go awry when a fire breaks out and thousands of lives are endangered.', 'Tower Sky, a luxurious building complex, has organised a lavish Christmas party for its VIP guests. However, things go awry when a fire breaks out and thousands of lives are endangered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bt6OTuiq8ANbhIsOmZFztTw3Y2X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154030'),
  ('1068223208572747437', 'The Tower', 2023, 'Horror, Fantasy, Drama', 'Guillaume Nicloux, Christophe Offenstein, Leonard Gaultier', 'Guillaume Nicloux', 'Angèle Mac, Hatik, Ahmed Abdel Laoui, Jules Houplain, Bruni Makaya, Jules Dhios Francisco, Kylian Larmonie, Laurent Poignot', null, 'In the heart of a city, the inhabitants of a tower wake up one morning to find that their building is shrouded in an opaque fog, obstructing doors and windows - a strange dark matter that devours anything that tries to pass through it. Trapped, the residents try to organize themselves, but to ensure their survival they gradually succumb to their most primitive instincts, until they sink into horror...', 'In the heart of a city, the inhabitants of a tower wake up one morning to find that their building is shrouded in an opaque fog, obstructing doors and windows - a strange dark matter that devours anything that tries to pass through it. Trapped, the residents try to organize themselves, but to ensure their survival they gradually succumb to their most primitive instincts, until they sink into horror...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9wcvKsdNs5eImAYFD4b12d0fSs9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:852432'),
  ('122145799967927776', 'The Towering Inferno', 1974, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'John Guillermin, Phil Ball, Fred J. Koenekamp', 'Stirling Silliphant', 'Steve McQueen, Paul Newman, William Holden, Faye Dunaway, Fred Astaire, Susan Blakely, Richard Chamberlain, Jennifer Jones', 'PG', 'At the opening party of a colossal—but poorly constructed—skyscraper, a massive fire breaks out, threatening to destroy the tower and everyone in it.', 'At the opening party of a colossal—but poorly constructed—skyscraper, a massive fire breaks out, threatening to destroy the tower and everyone in it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mFM1GbrRrT3DWUFFo8koSITFnYe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5919'),
  ('121592824652274878', 'The Town', 2010, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Robert Elswit, Ben Affleck, Donald Murphy', 'Aaron Stockard, Ben Affleck, Peter Craig', 'Ben Affleck, Jeremy Renner, Rebecca Hall, Jon Hamm, Blake Lively, George Carroll, Pete Postlethwaite, Owen Burke', 'R', 'Doug MacRay is a longtime thief, who, smarter than the rest of his crew, is looking for his chance to exit the game. When a bank job leads to the group kidnapping an attractive branch manager, he takes on the role of monitoring her – but their burgeoning relationship threatens to unveil the identities of Doug and his crew to the FBI Agent who is on their case.', 'Doug MacRay is a longtime thief, who, smarter than the rest of his crew, is looking for his chance to exit the game. When a bank job leads to the group kidnapping an attractive branch manager, he takes on the role of monitoring her – but their burgeoning relationship threatens to unveil the identities of Doug and his crew to the FBI Agent who is on their case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3NIzyXkfylsjflRKSz8Fts3lXzm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23168'),
  ('893776720980786354', 'The Town Is Quiet', 2000, 'Drama', 'Robert Guédiguian, Bernard Cavalié', 'Robert Guédiguian, Jean-Louis Milesi', 'Ariane Ascaride, Jean-Pierre Darroussin, Jacques Boudet, Pascale Roberts, Véronique Balme, Christine Brücher, Jacques Pieiller, Julie-Marie Parmentier', null, 'A dark tale of working-class life in Marseilles, a city in crisis. Interesting characters include a hard-bitten but compassionate fish market worker with a drug addicted daughter and a moody bartender with a shocking secret life.', 'A dark tale of working-class life in Marseilles, a city in crisis. Interesting characters include a hard-bitten but compassionate fish market worker with a drug addicted daughter and a moody bartender with a shocking secret life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8d2NBr4in07pEQgO1PwENJH0IO1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67385'),
  ('499158623237661345', 'The Town Rat and the Country Rat', 1927, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Władysław Starewicz', null, null, null, 'The Country Rat visits his friend the Town Rat, but finds that life in the great metropolis is rather too hectic (and dangerous - there''s a live cat among all the puppet rodents!)', 'The Country Rat visits his friend the Town Rat, but finds that life in the great metropolis is rather too hectic (and dangerous - there''s a live cat among all the puppet rodents!)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jPWsTNA8k45mQ7iznJGJBaEfwKX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90048'),
  ('608211461800557791', 'The Town Santa Forgot', 1993, 'Animation', 'Robert Alvarez', null, 'Dick Van Dyke, Miko Hughes, Ashley Johnson, Melinda Peterson, Phil Proctor, Hal Smith, Melinda Peterson, Phil Proctor', null, 'A spoiled brat sends a very long list to Santa Claus who misdelivers the gifts to a town with the same name as the boy, who learns it''s better to give than receive.', 'A spoiled brat sends a very long list to Santa Claus who misdelivers the gifts to a town with the same name as the boy, who learns it''s better to give than receive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ydeFP9gByQDAinK46OUKOoqwBVa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125878'),
  ('220745375394781272', 'The Town that Dreaded Sundown', 2014, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Alfonso Gomez-Rejon, Michael Goi', 'Earl E. Smith', 'Addison Timlin, Veronica Cartwright, Travis Tope, Anthony Anderson, Joshua Leonard, Denis O''Hare, Spencer Treat Clark, Andy Abele', 'R', 'A masked maniac terrorizes the same small community where a murderer known as the Phantom Killer struck decades earlier.', 'A masked maniac terrorizes the same small community where a murderer known as the Phantom Killer struck decades earlier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dHXH9Gzk14am6KFFG7B3W60P5R4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:287084'),
  ('606710813512746939', 'The Town That Dreaded Sundown', 1976, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller, Crime', 'Charles B. Pierce, James W. Roberson', 'Earl E. Smith', 'Ben Johnson, Andrew Prine, Dawn Wells, Jimmy Clem, Jim Citty, Charles B. Pierce, Robert Aquino, Cindy Butler', 'R', 'When two young lovers are savagely beaten and tortured on a back country road in Texarkana, local police are baffled and must find "the Phantom Killer" before he can kill again.', 'When two young lovers are savagely beaten and tortured on a back country road in Texarkana, local police are baffled and must find "the Phantom Killer" before he can kill again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sI6kUePh4S3T1rDozPR0Etg7E8X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48197'),
  ('866211561440408715', 'The Towrope', 2012, 'Drama', 'William Vega, Sofia Oggioni', 'William Vega', 'Joghis Seudin Arias, Julio César Roble, Floralba Achicanoy, Heraldo Romero', null, 'In this poetic, richly allegorical debut by Colombian director William Vega, a teenage girl flees to a rundown inn after being driven from her home in the Andean highlands by civil war, as the violence engulfing the country creeps ever closer to her remote refuge. (TIFF)', 'In this poetic, richly allegorical debut by Colombian director William Vega, a teenage girl flees to a rundown inn after being driven from her home in the Andean highlands by civil war, as the violence engulfing the country creeps ever closer to her remote refuge. (TIFF)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fV4aoSpFpoJ3c9grpI6g71c0FHV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128209'),
  ('164081834364788038', 'The Toxic Avenger', 1984, 'Action, Comedy, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Lloyd Kaufman, Michael Herz, Lloyd Kaufman', 'Joe Ritter', 'Andree Maranda, Mitch Cohen, Jennifer Prichard, Cindy Manion, Robert Prichard, Gary Schneider, Pat Ryan, Mark Torgl', 'R', 'A gang of thugs devise a cruel hoax that goes horribly wrong as Melvin, a nerdy emaciated janitor at the local health club, is cast through a third story window into a vat of hazardous toxic waste.', 'A gang of thugs devise a cruel hoax that goes horribly wrong as Melvin, a nerdy emaciated janitor at the local health club, is cast through a third story window into a vat of hazardous toxic waste.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/so0CGT1fZe2SlVdYXCewghxUgoj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15239'),
  ('601598678018751993', 'The Toxic Avenger Part II', 1989, 'Action, Comedy, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Lloyd Kaufman, Michael Herz, James A. Lebovitz', 'Lloyd Kaufman, Gay Partington Terry', 'Ron Fazio, John Altamura, Phoebe Legere, Rick Collins, Rikiya Yasuoka, Tsutomu Sekine, Mayako Katsuragi, Shinoburyû', 'R', 'Melvin Junko was a nerdy weakling until he fell into a vat of toxic waste, turning him into the first ever superhuman creature from New Jersey. This time, he takes on Tokyo.', 'Melvin Junko was a nerdy weakling until he fell into a vat of toxic waste, turning him into the first ever superhuman creature from New Jersey. This time, he takes on Tokyo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m5o7B3VSAjvinjtSYxXD38senvb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28165'),
  ('7542473705644126', 'The Toxic Avenger Part III: The Last Temptation of Toxie', 1989, 'Action, Comedy, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Michael Herz, Lloyd Kaufman, James A. Lebovitz', 'Lloyd Kaufman, Gay Partington Terry', 'Ron Fazio, John Altamura, Phoebe Legere, Rick Collins, Lisa Gaye, Jessica Dublin, Michael J. Kaplan, Tsutomu Sekine', 'R', 'Desperate to raise money for the experimental surgery that could restore his blind fiancee''s eyesight, Toxie accepts a lucrative job with the evil multinational conglomerate Apocalypse Inc.', 'Desperate to raise money for the experimental surgery that could restore his blind fiancee''s eyesight, Toxie accepts a lucrative job with the evil multinational conglomerate Apocalypse Inc.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yEOliKp5hZIBR0lDr9L3mJLijT0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28169'),
  ('128259059100770021', 'The Toxic Avenger Unrated', 2025, 'Action, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Dana Gonzales, Macon Blair, Derek Peterson', 'Macon Blair', 'Peter Dinklage, Jacob Tremblay, Taylour Paige, Julia Davis, Jonny Coyne, Elijah Wood, Kevin Bacon, David Yow', 'NR', 'When a downtrodden janitor, Winston Gooze, is exposed to a catastrophic toxic accident, he’s transformed into a new kind of hero: The Toxic Avenger. Now, Toxie must rise from outcast to savior, taking on ruthless corporate overlords and corrupt forces who threaten his son, his friends, and his community.', 'When a downtrodden janitor, Winston Gooze, is exposed to a catastrophic toxic accident, he’s transformed into a new kind of hero: The Toxic Avenger. Now, Toxie must rise from outcast to savior, taking on ruthless corporate overlords and corrupt forces who threaten his son, his friends, and his community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cCWojb6N9UcTzNVtS4bOM3vQ30x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:338969'),
  ('650384332776608150', 'The Toy', 1976, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jean-Michel Carbonnaux, Francis Veber, Étienne Becker', 'Francis Veber', 'Pierre Richard, Michel Bouquet, Fabrice Greco, Jacques François, Daniel Ceccaldi, Charles Gérard, Michel Aumont, Gérard Jugnot', null, 'When Francois, a journalist, tours a big store for an article, he is chosen by the son of the newspaper''s owner, Rambal-Cochet, as his new toy. Needing money and unwilling to quit his job, Francois agrees to this ridiculous assignment. Gradually befriending the spoiled boy, he induces him to play at making a newspaper, unveiling publicly the tyrannical way of life of the father. The powerful emotional climax we experience with the child astonishes both men.', 'When Francois, a journalist, tours a big store for an article, he is chosen by the son of the newspaper''s owner, Rambal-Cochet, as his new toy. Needing money and unwilling to quit his job, Francois agrees to this ridiculous assignment. Gradually befriending the spoiled boy, he induces him to play at making a newspaper, unveiling publicly the tyrannical way of life of the father. The powerful emotional climax we experience with the child astonishes both men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o4X5KTSqAvelfw49Gx5BZDUEYCm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56648'),
  ('502484832758278646', 'The Toy', 1982, 'Comedy, Family', 'Richard Donner, László Kovács', 'Francis Veber', 'Richard Pryor, Jackie Gleason, Ned Beatty, Scott Schwartz, Teresa Ganzel, Wilfrid Hyde-White, Tony King, Annazette Chase', 'PG', 'On one of his bratty son Eric''s annual visits, the plutocrat U.S. Bates takes him to his department store and offers him anything in it as a gift. Eric chooses a black janitor who has made him laugh with his antics. At first the man suffers many indignities as Eric''s "toy", but gradually teaches the lonely boy what it is like to have and to be a friend.', 'On one of his bratty son Eric''s annual visits, the plutocrat U.S. Bates takes him to his department store and offers him anything in it as a gift. Eric chooses a black janitor who has made him laugh with his antics. At first the man suffers many indignities as Eric''s "toy", but gradually teaches the lonely boy what it is like to have and to be a friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yt7Z37Uo2zls64XikaYh8nCwTAv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23805'),
  ('782729288321021324', 'The Toy Box', 1971, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Ronald Víctor García, Richard Eisman', 'Ronald Víctor García', 'Sean Kenney, Ann Perry, Neal Bishop, Debbie Osborne, T.E. Brown, Lisa Goodman, Kathy Hilton, Maria Arnold', null, 'When Ralph persuades his girlfriend, Donna, to participate in a bizarre party, she discovers the guests are to perform erotic plays in the presence of a corpse - Ralph''s millionaire uncle. The players are promised gifts from the "toy box." Ralph and Donna await their turn, when the mansion''s doors lock at midnight; and it''s not long before they discover the players are being murdered by...the dead uncle?', 'When Ralph persuades his girlfriend, Donna, to participate in a bizarre party, she discovers the guests are to perform erotic plays in the presence of a corpse - Ralph''s millionaire uncle. The players are promised gifts from the "toy box." Ralph and Donna await their turn, when the mansion''s doors lock at midnight; and it''s not long before they discover the players are being murdered by...the dead uncle?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vPyyXzJjG6frF8wLPJXnxcJhTQk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81479'),
  ('47686877077784809', 'The Toybox', 2018, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Tom Nagel, Ashley Eberbach, Ken Stachnik', 'Jeff Denton', 'Mischa Barton, Denise Richards, Greg Violand, Brian Nagel, Katie Keene, Matt Mercer, Andrew Staton, Carolyne Maraghi', null, 'An estranged family take a trip to the desert in their used RV and become stranded and isolated in the scorching terrain. They soon learn their RV holds terrible, haunting secrets, and it starts killing them off one by one.', 'An estranged family take a trip to the desert in their used RV and become stranded and isolated in the scorching terrain. They soon learn their RV holds terrible, haunting secrets, and it starts killing them off one by one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f2m9g3Vhokis2fP6sufZo2esdC4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:516784'),
  ('9241705928023676', 'The Trace We Leave Behind', 2017, 'Thriller, Horror', 'J.C. Feyer, Gustavo Hadba', 'Beatriz Manela, André Pereira', 'Rafael Cardoso, Leandra Leal, Cláudia Abreu, Jonas Bloch, Felipe Camargo, Domingos Montagner, Natália Guedes, Alice Wegmann', null, 'A young physician coordinating the transfer of patients between state-run hospitals in the city of Rio de Janeiro struggles with a mystery: a patient goes missing one night and completely disappears from the system. As the doctor attempts to find out the truth, he slowly loses his sense of reality.', 'A young physician coordinating the transfer of patients between state-run hospitals in the city of Rio de Janeiro struggles with a mystery: a patient goes missing one night and completely disappears from the system. As the doctor attempts to find out the truth, he slowly loses his sense of reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gAkpDXhLRHfF8K4o6VZH0tQj3Uc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:438154'),
  ('916027518991968257', 'The Tracey Fragments', 2007, 'Drama', 'Bruce McDonald, Steve Cosens', 'Maureen Medved', 'Elliot Page, Maxwell McCabe-Lokos, Ari Cohen, Erin McMurtry, Zie Souwand, Stephen Amell, Kate Todd, Ryan Cooley', 'R', 'Tracey Berkowitz, 15, a self-described normal girl, loses her 9-year old brother, Sonny. In flashbacks and fragments, we meet her overbearing parents and the sweet, clueless Sonny. We watch Tracey navigate high school, friendless, picked on and teased. She develops a thing for Billy Zero, a new student, imagining he''s her boyfriend. We see the day she loses Sonny and we watch her try to find him.', 'Tracey Berkowitz, 15, a self-described normal girl, loses her 9-year old brother, Sonny. In flashbacks and fragments, we meet her overbearing parents and the sweet, clueless Sonny. We watch Tracey navigate high school, friendless, picked on and teased. She develops a thing for Billy Zero, a new student, imagining he''s her boyfriend. We see the day she loses Sonny and we watch her try to find him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9a99MNftmHNTLIYHfKXtGdAV6oF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16725'),
  ('214001316536569787', 'The Track', 1975, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Serge Leroy, Claude Renoir, Roberto Giandalia', 'André G. Brunelin', 'Mimsy Farmer, Jean-Luc Bideau, Michael Lonsdale, Michel Constantin, Jean-Pierre Marielle, Philippe Léotard, Paul Crauchet, Michel Robin', null, 'Somewhere in rural France, a young English female tourist is sexually assaulted by two men in the countryside. After she manages to escape, a party of local hunters agree to track her in order to cover up the scandal.', 'Somewhere in rural France, a young English female tourist is sexually assaulted by two men in the countryside. After she manages to escape, a party of local hunters agree to track her in order to cover up the scandal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xQ0OAxYE2gHCTgDAfp5JdL1lyuD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76412'),
  ('992911741127386177', 'The Tracker', 1988, 'Action, Western, TV Movie', 'John Guillermin, George Tirl, Doug Metzger', 'Kevin Jarre', 'Kris Kristofferson, Scott Wilson, Mark Moses, Karen Kopins, David Huddleston, John Quade, Don Swayze, Geoffrey Blake', 'PG-13', 'After a series of vicious crimes by a renegade group of cowboys, led by "Red Jack" Stilwell, a legendary tracker, Noble Adams is pulled out of retirement to capture Stilwell, dead or alive. Reluctantly, needing more men, he allows his son, Tom to tag along, revealing to Tom a whole brutal side of ruthlessness Noble thought he left behind.', 'After a series of vicious crimes by a renegade group of cowboys, led by "Red Jack" Stilwell, a legendary tracker, Noble Adams is pulled out of retirement to capture Stilwell, dead or alive. Reluctantly, needing more men, he allows his son, Tom to tag along, revealing to Tom a whole brutal side of ruthlessness Noble thought he left behind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6X9vXLIzzHHJlDU2nC7RTqtqXVW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67933'),
  ('457763591968757400', 'The Tracker', 2002, 'Drama, History', 'Rolf de Heer, Ian Jones', 'Rolf de Heer', 'David Gulpilil, Gary Sweet, Damon Gameau, Grant Page, Noel Wilton', null, 'Somewhere in Australia in the early 20th century outback, an Aboriginal man is accused of murdering a white woman. Three white men are on a mission to capture him with the help of an experienced Indigenous man.', 'Somewhere in Australia in the early 20th century outback, an Aboriginal man is accused of murdering a white woman. Three white men are on a mission to capture him with the help of an experienced Indigenous man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zNDbpSbjpV0bLVA0mUY1TH2YohT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13439'),
  ('320595401930584371', 'The Trader', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Tamta Gabrichidze', null, 'Gela', null, 'A traveling trader provides a window into rural life in the Republic of Georgia, where potatoes are currency and ambition is crushed by poverty.', 'A traveling trader provides a window into rural life in the Republic of Georgia, where potatoes are currency and ambition is crushed by poverty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zmihpJaqCHoNetmQMaxQkdp2qoa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:489354'),
  ('374624953223454677', 'The Traffic Policeman', 1960, 'Comedy', 'Luigi Zampa, Leonida Barboni, Paolo Bianchini', 'Rodolfo Sonego, Luigi Zampa, Ugo Guerra', 'Alberto Sordi, Marisa Merlini, Vittorio De Sica, Riccardo Garrone, Mara Berni, Carlo Pisacane, Mario Riva, Sylva Koscina', null, 'An unemployed man gets a job as traffic policeman but the traffic in the big city creates innumerous problems for the poor guy.', 'An unemployed man gets a job as traffic policeman but the traffic in the big city creates innumerous problems for the poor guy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wGj1SrP46McKydvcWQZv9kIGaAQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60046'),
  ('494347263659316966', 'The Tragedy of "W"', 1984, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Shinichiro Sawai, Seizō Sengen, Isao Fujisawa', 'Shinichiro Sawai, Haruhiko Arai', 'Hiroko Yakushimaru, Masanori Sera, Yukio Ninagawa, Kōji Shimizu, Minoru Uchida, Noboru Nakaya, Kōjirō Kusanagi, Yoshie Minami', null, 'A young theatre actress fights for her uncertain career while having to confront the personal sacrifices that will arise from it.', 'A young theatre actress fights for her uncertain career while having to confront the personal sacrifices that will arise from it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/83OTqaGiI3A1vRq5v2ua2t2HYbD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:326598'),
  ('555581055053794799', 'The Tragedy of Macbeth', 2021, 'Drama', 'Bruno Delbonnel, Katterli Frauenfelder, Jeff Hubbard', 'Joel Coen', 'Denzel Washington, Frances McDormand, Alex Hassell, Bertie Carvel, Brendan Gleeson, Corey Hawkins, Harry Melling, Miles Anderson', 'R', 'Macbeth, the Thane of Glamis, receives a prophecy from a trio of witches that one day he will become King of Scotland. Consumed by ambition and spurred to action by his wife, Macbeth murders his king and takes the throne for himself.', 'Macbeth, the Thane of Glamis, receives a prophecy from a trio of witches that one day he will become King of Scotland. Consumed by ambition and spurred to action by his wife, Macbeth murders his king and takes the throne for himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tDNJEhcLbX3jIk3BMCur9pCdaVD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:591538'),
  ('858342983638995769', 'The Trail', 2024, 'Thriller, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Stefan Müller', 'Martin Kroissenbrunner', 'Corinna Pumm, Paul Hassler, Stefan Schnuderl, Julia Foidl, Sophia Grabner, Oliver Haas', null, 'A young woman embarks on a remote hiking trail in the Alps to cope with a trauma. In the midst of the rustic landscape, she is now not only confronted with her own fears, but also has to face an alien threat.', 'A young woman embarks on a remote hiking trail in the Alps to cope with a trauma. In the midst of the rustic landscape, she is now not only confronted with her own fears, but also has to face an alien threat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/quKLhY8wdmMiwLkCURVpNUnHYxj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:996064'),
