  ('597569542998020606', 'The Trail of ''98', 1928, 'Adventure, Action', 'Clarence Brown, John F. Seitz, Charles Dorian', 'Joseph Farnham', 'Dolores del Río, Ralph Forbes, Karl Dane, Harry Carey, Tully Marshall, George Cooper, Emily Fitzroy, Tenen Holtz', 'NR', 'Fortune hunters from all over the country rushing to the Klondike in 1897 to seek their fortunes in the gold are tested by hardships of the journey.', 'Fortune hunters from all over the country rushing to the Klondike in 1897 to seek their fortunes in the gold are tested by hardships of the journey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cZNboVPUtOlPgLuYEwbtD6Gj1K0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117435'),
