  ('475646389991747783', 'The Transfiguration', 2016, 'Horror, Drama', 'Michael O''Shea, Niki Janowski', 'Michael O''Shea', 'Eric Ruffin, Chloë Levine, Luis Scott, Dangelo Bonneli, Aaron Moten, Carter Redwood, JaQwan J. Kelly, Tarikk Mudu', null, 'When troubled teen Milo, who has a fascination with vampire lore, meets the equally alienated Sophie, the two form a bond that begins to blur Milo''s fantasy into reality.', 'When troubled teen Milo, who has a fascination with vampire lore, meets the equally alienated Sophie, the two form a bond that begins to blur Milo''s fantasy into reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b7DWSZeP9Rxbmoase8RaIg6I369.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:392818'),
  ('178549466928847841', 'The Transformers: The Movie', 1986, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Action, Adventure, Family', 'Nelson Shin, Koichi Tsunoda, Masatoshi Fukui', 'Ron Friedman', 'Judd Nelson, Peter Cullen, Frank Welker, Leonard Nimoy, Orson Welles, Casey Kasem, Dan Gilvezan, Scatman Crothers', 'PG', 'The Autobots must stop a colossal planet-consuming robot who goes after the Autobot Matrix of Leadership. At the same time, they must defend themselves against an all-out attack from the Decepticons.', 'The Autobots must stop a colossal planet-consuming robot who goes after the Autobot Matrix of Leadership. At the same time, they must defend themselves against an all-out attack from the Decepticons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xJ5W0mOAWCVaXmU0pBZh4NjSRv2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1857'),
  ('5555903174050845', 'The Transition Period', 2009, 'Documentary', 'Zhou Hao', null, null, null, 'As Chinese Communist Party secretary, Guo Yongchang was the most powerful man in his county, located in the rural inland province of Henan. Guo invited acclaimed documentary filmmaker Zhou Hao to record his final months in office. Through Zhou’s lens, we see Guo work tirelessly to achieve his greatest desire: for Henan to match the affluence of booming coastal areas.Â Zhou also captures the sordid details of local-level politics in pursuit of growth: lavish parties with foreign investors, threats to local workers protesting unpaid wages, and offers of bribes and kickbacks. (dGenerate Films)', 'As Chinese Communist Party secretary, Guo Yongchang was the most powerful man in his county, located in the rural inland province of Henan. Guo invited acclaimed documentary filmmaker Zhou Hao to record his final months in office. Through Zhou’s lens, we see Guo work tirelessly to achieve his greatest desire: for Henan to match the affluence of booming coastal areas.Â Zhou also captures the sordid details of local-level politics in pursuit of growth: lavish parties with foreign investors, threats to local workers protesting unpaid wages, and offers of bribes and kickbacks. (dGenerate Films)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vDARWq5PJtDP6DYyR633URpmRCG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129404'),
  ('914708163497139858', 'The Translators', 2019, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Régis Roinsard, Guillaume Schiffman', 'Régis Roinsard, Romain Compingt, Daniel Presley', 'Olga Kurylenko, Lambert Wilson, Manolis Mavromatakis, Sidse Babett Knudsen, Alex Lawther, Riccardo Scamarcio, Sara Giraudeau, Eduardo Noriega', 'PG', 'Nine translators, hired to translate the eagerly awaited final book of a bestselling trilogy, are confined in a luxurious bunker.', 'Nine translators, hired to translate the eagerly awaited final book of a bestselling trilogy, are confined in a luxurious bunker.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8A6qALzfMxgj51ly8KyTCZfXutG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:477018'),
  ('818313193685199073', 'The Transporter', 2002, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Pierre Morel, Corey Yuen, Olivier Chiavassa', 'Luc Besson, Robert Mark Kamen', 'Jason Statham, Shu Qi, François Berléand, Matt Schulze, Ric Young, Doug Rand, Didier Saint Melin, Tonio Descanvelle', 'PG-13', 'Former Special Forces officer Frank Martin will deliver anything to anyone for the right price, and his no-questions-asked policy puts him in high demand. But when he realizes his latest cargo is alive, it sets in motion a dangerous chain of events. The bound and gagged Lai is being smuggled to France by a shady American businessman, and Frank works to save her as his own illegal activities are uncovered by a French detective.', 'Former Special Forces officer Frank Martin will deliver anything to anyone for the right price, and his no-questions-asked policy puts him in high demand. But when he realizes his latest cargo is alive, it sets in motion a dangerous chain of events. The bound and gagged Lai is being smuggled to France by a shady American businessman, and Frank works to save her as his own illegal activities are uncovered by a French detective.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dncJ81z1BahrT3ogLvlxOUC5n4u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4108'),
  ('925659491554014909', 'The Transporter Refueled', 2015, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Camille Delamarre, Christophe Collette, Paulo Gonçalves', 'Adam Cooper, Bill Collage, Luc Besson', 'Ed Skrein, Ray Stevenson, Loan Chabanol, Gabriella Wright, Tatiana Pajković, Wenxia Yu, Radivoje Bukvić, Noémie Lenoir', 'PG-13', 'The fast-paced action movie is again set in the criminal underworld in France, where Frank Martin is known as The Transporter, because he is the best driver and mercenary money can buy. In this installment, he meets Anna and they attempt to take down a group of ruthless Russian human traffickers who also have kidnapped Frank’s father.', 'The fast-paced action movie is again set in the criminal underworld in France, where Frank Martin is known as The Transporter, because he is the best driver and mercenary money can buy. In this installment, he meets Anna and they attempt to take down a group of ruthless Russian human traffickers who also have kidnapped Frank’s father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/71kaQfdrMy0LHSeLRADsvlDGCgb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:287948'),
  ('10379528419188230', 'The Trap', 1946, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Howard Bretherton, James S. Brown Jr., Frank Fox', 'Miriam Kissinger', 'Sidney Toler, Mantan Moreland, Victor Sen Yung, Tanis Chandler, Larry J. Blake, Kirk Alyn, Rita Quigley, Anne Nagel', 'NR', 'When a troupe of showgirls with their impresario and press agent vacation at a Malibu Beach resort, two of them are garroted. Charlie takes on the case assisted by Number Two Son Jimmy and faithful chauffeur Birmingham Brown.', 'When a troupe of showgirls with their impresario and press agent vacation at a Malibu Beach resort, two of them are garroted. Charlie takes on the case assisted by Number Two Son Jimmy and faithful chauffeur Birmingham Brown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/209R5pMdoLpu2P3xqm7sa7JaynA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38472'),
  ('378498938263619798', 'The Trap', 1959, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Norman Panama, Daniel L. Fapp, Daniel McCauley', 'Richard Alan Simmons, Norman Panama', 'Richard Widmark, Lee J. Cobb, Tina Louise, Earl Holliman, Carl Benton Reid, Lorne Greene, Peter Baldwin, Chuck Wassil', null, 'Lawyer Ralph Anderson arrives in Tula, an amazingly remote town in the desert, as reluctant emissary of mob chief Victor Massonetti, who wants the airstrip clear for his unofficial exit from the country. Ralph''s arrival has a profound effect on his estranged father, the sheriff; his brother Tip, an alcoholic deputy; and his ex-sweetheart Linda, now married to Tip. Tension builds as a small army of gangsters takes over the town. Then the situation abruptly changes...', 'Lawyer Ralph Anderson arrives in Tula, an amazingly remote town in the desert, as reluctant emissary of mob chief Victor Massonetti, who wants the airstrip clear for his unofficial exit from the country. Ralph''s arrival has a profound effect on his estranged father, the sheriff; his brother Tip, an alcoholic deputy; and his ex-sweetheart Linda, now married to Tip. Tension builds as a small army of gangsters takes over the town. Then the situation abruptly changes...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rLjpxeOusngbY2cR3EPrbP2maa8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70324'),
  ('935135327620667538', 'The Trap', 1966, 'Adventure, Western, Drama, Romance', 'Sidney Hayers, Robert Krasker', 'David D. Osborn', 'Rita Tushingham, Oliver Reed, Rex Sevenoaks, Barbara Chilcott, Blain Fairman, Walter Marsh, Merv Campone, Linda Goranson', null, 'A French-Canadian fur trapper takes a mute girl as his unwilling wife to live with him in his remote cabin in the woods.', 'A French-Canadian fur trapper takes a mute girl as his unwilling wife to live with him in his remote cabin in the woods.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qdiAXBVYvSqmN0KEFVvSqzo46nE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51445'),
