  ('1054458024233842155', 'The Trap', 1996, 'Drama, Thriller, Mystery, Crime', 'Kaizo Hayashi, Tsuyoshi Sugino, Yuichi Nagata', 'Daisuke Tengan, Kaizo Hayashi', 'Masatoshi Nagase, Yui Natsukawa, Tomoko Yamaguchi, Tetta Sugimoto, Kiyotaka Nanbara, Akaji Maro, Shiro Sano, Mika Ohmine', null, 'When a hooded stranger appears in private eye ''Mike'' Hama''s office with the cryptic challenge "I want you to look for me," Hama is drawn into a string of bizarre serial murders that have Yokohama''s police baffled and the city terrified.', 'When a hooded stranger appears in private eye ''Mike'' Hama''s office with the cryptic challenge "I want you to look for me," Hama is drawn into a string of bizarre serial murders that have Yokohama''s police baffled and the city terrified.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nPEhcdm305gdDX1WTaHOD281m1o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122235'),
  ('959141476088823074', 'The Trap', 2007, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Srdan Golubović, Aleksandar Ilić', 'Melina Pota Koljević, Srđan Koljević', 'Nebojša Glogovac, Nataša Ninković, Anica Dobra, Vuk Kostić, Vojin Ćetković, Boris Isaković, Bogdan Diklić, Predrag Laković', null, 'Mladen and Marija are an ordinary and happy married couple of the "middle class" of the society in which they live as tenants. Mladen works as a civil engineer in a state company, and Marija is an English teacher in primary school. The couple finds joy in their only son, Nemanja. They discover that Nemanja has a rare heart disease and healing is possible with an operation in a foreign medical center, which costs €26,000.', 'Mladen and Marija are an ordinary and happy married couple of the "middle class" of the society in which they live as tenants. Mladen works as a civil engineer in a state company, and Marija is an English teacher in primary school. The couple finds joy in their only son, Nemanja. They discover that Nemanja has a rare heart disease and healing is possible with an operation in a foreign medical center, which costs €26,000.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j1dLkT7MIwgzuGasL4ohFKERfMm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4352'),
  ('210825076212692985', 'The Trap', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Erik White, Edward A. Gutentag', 'Jana Savage, Nile Evans, Brandon Broussard', 'T.I., Mike Epps, Loretta Devine, Meagan Tandy, Teyana Taylor, Stephen Bishop, Queen Latifah, Mila J.', null, 'A man returns home to Atlanta to help and turn around his family''s struggling restaurant with the help of a new chicken recipe.', 'A man returns home to Atlanta to help and turn around his family''s struggling restaurant with the help of a new chicken recipe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/swk3ionimeKwX1e6k1XbHCSeYv0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:592348'),
  ('234956963525951242', 'The Trap', 2022, 'Comedy, Action', 'Frank Perozo', 'Junior Rosario, Kendy Yanoreth', 'Raymond Pozo, Pepe Sierra, Miguel Céspedes, Caroline Aquino', null, 'Uncle and nephew try to recover their lands from a corrupt casino owner. A farmer is pressured to pay his gambling son''s huge debt. Both problems have the same source, and will come together.', 'Uncle and nephew try to recover their lands from a corrupt casino owner. A farmer is pressured to pay his gambling son''s huge debt. Both problems have the same source, and will come together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nXhPTEIEDxekCZg9DwZQNshZ432.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1090328'),
  ('383301644353222083', 'The Trap', 2026, 'Documentary', 'Máté Fuchs, Bálint Bíró, Máté Dobray, Balázs Domokos, Székely Róbert', 'Máté Fuchs, András Pethő, Bálint Bíró', 'Niké Kurta, Viktor Orbán, Krisztián Orbán, Dóra Győrffy, László Csaba', null, 'Viktor Orbán was given a rare opportunity in 2010. He won a supermajority in parliament, giving him a strong mandate to put Hungary on a path to development. He also received external assistance for this. The global economy boomed in the 2010s, and Hungary received an unprecedented amount of funding from the European Union, on a scale unseen in over a century. What did Viktor Orbán do with these unprecedented opportunities? To what extent did he keep the promises he made 16 years ago? This film tells that story.', 'Viktor Orbán was given a rare opportunity in 2010. He won a supermajority in parliament, giving him a strong mandate to put Hungary on a path to development. He also received external assistance for this. The global economy boomed in the 2010s, and Hungary received an unprecedented amount of funding from the European Union, on a scale unseen in over a century. What did Viktor Orbán do with these unprecedented opportunities? To what extent did he keep the promises he made 16 years ago? This film tells that story.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F3S9VDUKYg2yZsfCynvAX6Ln2RGN.jpg', 'plex:movie:a-csapda-az-orban-korszak-elvesztett-lehetosegeinek-tortenete'),
  ('738348018193351608', 'The Trapalhão and the Blue Light', 1999, 'Comedy, Family', 'Paulo Aragão, Alexandre Boury, Nonato Estrela', 'Renato Aragão, Paulo Cursino', 'Renato Aragão, Dedé Santana, Roberto Guilherme, Christine Fernandes, André Segatti, Adriana Esteves, Danielle Winits, Debby Lagranha', null, 'David, a rock singer, and Didi, his assistant, are transported to a distant world. They must help princess Allim to face the evil Vizir, who wants to become king by marrying her.', 'David, a rock singer, and Didi, his assistant, are transported to a distant world. They must help princess Allim to face the evil Vizir, who wants to become king by marrying her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8U7ZBMPIuFHT9AuOLYWUVbFwsO0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128454'),
  ('1114109000279352673', 'The Trapalhão in King Solomon''s Mines', 1977, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'J.B. Tanko', 'J.B. Tanko', 'Renato Aragão, Dedé Santana, Mussum, Vera Setta, Francisco Di Franco, Wilson Grey, Monique Lafond, Milton Vilar', null, 'Woman hires three clumsy adventurers to rescue her missing archaeologist father, who was trying to find the legendary King Solomon''s mines.', 'Woman hires three clumsy adventurers to rescue her missing archaeologist father, who was trying to find the legendary King Solomon''s mines.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/23HLa72P9XzVox9qJGWeKSIr4Qp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143550'),
  ('713302337041955064', 'The Trapalhão in Noah''s Ark', 1983, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Del Rangel, Carlos Egberto Silveira', 'Aguinaldo Silva, Doc Comparato, Paulo Aragão', 'Renato Aragão, Gracindo Júnior, Nádia Lippi, Milton Moraes, Sérgio Mallandro, Xuxa Meneghel, Manfredo Colassanti, Fábio Villa Verde', null, 'Duda is a zoo cleaner. He and his friend Kiko and Zeca are actively engaged in an animal protection group. For this reason, they are summoned by mystic Noé to fight animal hunters in the Pantanal region, in Brazil, who are after animal skins and furs, and are led by the mean Morel. They accept the mission and, on their way, meet archaeologist Marcos and photographer Carla, who are in search of a lost pyramid built by the Phoenician. Together, they try to beat the hunters.', 'Duda is a zoo cleaner. He and his friend Kiko and Zeca are actively engaged in an animal protection group. For this reason, they are summoned by mystic Noé to fight animal hunters in the Pantanal region, in Brazil, who are after animal skins and furs, and are led by the mean Morel. They accept the mission and, on their way, meet archaeologist Marcos and photographer Carla, who are in search of a lost pyramid built by the Phoenician. Together, they try to beat the hunters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2iTCBIpdgAlLxVycmyZ5ZTafxeT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:274847'),
  ('1067647271644611252', 'The Trapalhão in the Plateau of the Apes', 1976, 'Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'J.B. Tanko', 'J.B. Tanko', 'Renato Aragão, Dedé Santana, Mussum, Carlos Kurt, Milton Carneiro, Alan Fontaine, Rosina Malbouisson, Olívia Pineschi', null, 'This movie is a spoof of "Planet of the Apes" (1968) and follows the storyline of the original step by step - in spite of being a crazy parody of the original film. A group of men lands in a balloon on an area (it''s not a planet, it''s more like a hill) where talking apes rule and humans are slaves. The apes try to transform the guys in monkeys; a simian princess falls in love with one of them; and so on. This film is one of the several movies made for the popular Brazilian group "Os Trapalhões" - Didi (Renato Aragão), Dedé, Mussum and Zacarias (who at this point hadn''t joined the troupe yet) -, many of them inspired by American blockbusters. It''s a very fun entertainment, but the humor is very "local" to be understood in other countries. Oh, yeah, the ape "makeup" is terrible, but that''s part of the fun. The movie doesn''t take itself seriously.', 'This movie is a spoof of "Planet of the Apes" (1968) and follows the storyline of the original step by step - in spite of being a crazy parody of the original film. A group of men lands in a balloon on an area (it''s not a planet, it''s more like a hill) where talking apes rule and humans are slaves. The apes try to transform the guys in monkeys; a simian princess falls in love with one of them; and so on. This film is one of the several movies made for the popular Brazilian group "Os Trapalhões" - Didi (Renato Aragão), Dedé, Mussum and Zacarias (who at this point hadn''t joined the troupe yet) -, many of them inspired by American blockbusters. It''s a very fun entertainment, but the humor is very "local" to be understood in other countries. Oh, yeah, the ape "makeup" is terrible, but that''s part of the fun. The movie doesn''t take itself seriously.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5kR69LiTcoxHzyWZP3BCZQW4z2J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:248230'),
  ('642884497022430694', 'The Trapalhão in Treasure Island', 1975, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'J.B. Tanko, Walter Schilke, José Tavares', 'J.B. Tanko, Victor Lustosa, Neyde Figueiredo', 'Renato Aragão, Dedé Santana, Eliane Martins, Mário Cardoso, Zeni Pereira, Germano Filho, Rafael de Carvalho, Edson Guimarães', null, 'Two fishermen Dogfish names Zé Cação and Lula discover the result of a theft of a dangerous gang of smugglers and go immediately to be persecuted by them. In pursuit of the bandits is also the federal agent Carlos, passionate young Diana, of which the fishermen meet and become friends. The action takes place on board the Fishermen, however, when the weather warms there comes the pirate Long John Silver, who is looking for a fabulous map of a treasure that was hidden on a nearby island. The map, now divided into two parts, it becomes cause for persecution, with plenty of good humor and adrenaline, which changed hands throughout the film and leading everyone to the island where the treasure was buried.', 'Two fishermen Dogfish names Zé Cação and Lula discover the result of a theft of a dangerous gang of smugglers and go immediately to be persecuted by them. In pursuit of the bandits is also the federal agent Carlos, passionate young Diana, of which the fishermen meet and become friends. The action takes place on board the Fishermen, however, when the weather warms there comes the pirate Long John Silver, who is looking for a fabulous map of a treasure that was hidden on a nearby island. The map, now divided into two parts, it becomes cause for persecution, with plenty of good humor and adrenaline, which changed hands throughout the film and leading everyone to the island where the treasure was buried.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cR9tU9Y2TL7yjf7WRzNtA2ekpSf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:172519'),
  ('191582429054858989', 'The Trapalhões and the King of Football', 1986, 'Comedy, Family', 'Carlos Manga', 'Aguinaldo Silva, Ricardo Linhares', 'Renato Aragão, Dedé Santana, Mussum, Zacarias, Pelé, José Lewgoy, Milton Moraes, Maurício do Valle', null, 'The team of Galinheiro Futebol Clube, formed by emeritus fighters, has as technical Cardea, advised by three direct assistants: Elvis, former player as Cardinal and aspiring singer; Fumê, cook of Independência Futebol Clube, great team in which Cardeal also works as a wardrobe; and Lupine, samba and composer.', 'The team of Galinheiro Futebol Clube, formed by emeritus fighters, has as technical Cardea, advised by three direct assistants: Elvis, former player as Cardinal and aspiring singer; Fumê, cook of Independência Futebol Clube, great team in which Cardeal also works as a wardrobe; and Lupine, samba and composer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Sj5cH5kJa79fvA2Pw5nL3n5Ouu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:181191'),
  ('744784494247556385', 'The Trapalhões and the Tree of Youth', 1991, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'José Alvarenga Jr., Walter Carvalho', 'Paulo Andrade, Mauro Wilson', 'Renato Aragão, Dedé Santana, Mussum, Cristiana Oliveira, Duda Little, Andréa Faria, Conrado, Nill', null, 'Didi, Dedé, Mussum (Mussum) and Zacarias are forest rangers that they work in the Amazon rain forest where they fight the action of smugglers with the aid of Juliana, a beautiful engineer. There are many funny scenes where they find the mythical source of the fountain of youth which they drink, becoming again children.', 'Didi, Dedé, Mussum (Mussum) and Zacarias are forest rangers that they work in the Amazon rain forest where they fight the action of smugglers with the aid of Juliana, a beautiful engineer. There are many funny scenes where they find the mythical source of the fountain of youth which they drink, becoming again children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gJtL538F4brfsSOrbxAAiRRBQqH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133012'),
  ('616879840877953466', 'The Trapalhões and the Wizard of Oróz', 1984, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family, Fantasy, Music', 'Dedé Santana, Victor Lustosa, José Tadeu Ribeiro', 'Gilvan Pereira, Dedé Santana, Renato Aragão', 'Renato Aragão, Dedé Santana, Mussum, Zacarias, José Dumont, Arnaud Rodrigues, Xuxa Meneghel, Maurício do Valle', null, 'Didi, Soró and Tatu in search food and water head for the town of Oróz. On their journey they find a Scarecrow, a man in a metal vat, and later are arrested by a Lion Sheriff.', 'Didi, Soró and Tatu in search food and water head for the town of Oróz. On their journey they find a Scarecrow, a man in a metal vat, and later are arrested by a Lion Sheriff.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fs5tyRLXTLLw0tzsolL4a8UHd3C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123568'),
  ('438964772757578067', 'The Trapalhões in A Dog''s Will', 1987, 'Family, Comedy', 'Roberto Farias, Walter Carvalho', 'Roberto Farias, Ariano Suassuna', 'Renato Aragão, Dedé Santana, Zacarias, Mussum, Betty Gofman, José Dumont, Emmanuel Cavalcanti, Cláudia Jimenez', null, 'In the small town of Taperoá João Grilo and confusion Chicó live setting, addressing a sacristan and a humble baker. Everyone lives under the excesses of the bishop, the priest and the major. Until an attack on the city, all die at the hands of the bandit Severino and must stand trial in the sky, which puts everyone before God and the Virgin Mary.', 'In the small town of Taperoá João Grilo and confusion Chicó live setting, addressing a sacristan and a humble baker. Everyone lives under the excesses of the bishop, the priest and the major. Until an attack on the city, all die at the hands of the bandit Severino and must stand trial in the sky, which puts everyone before God and the Virgin Mary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7HqZlijQFlX31MmKMiEl8kALZ5k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133009'),
  ('381670129104761090', 'The Trapalhões in Serra Pelada', 1982, 'Family, Comedy, Adventure', 'J.B. Tanko, Marco Antonio Rocha, Victor Lustosa', 'Gilvan Pereira', 'Renato Aragão, Dedé Santana, Mussum, Zacarias, Gracindo Júnior, Louise Cardoso, Ana Maria Magalhães, Eduardo Conde', null, 'The friends Curió, Boroca (Dedé Santana), Mexelete and Bateia they venture in search of gold in the mine of Serra Pelada. The area is controlled by the foreigner Von Bermann, whose orders are executed by the bully Bira. Thirsty of being able to, the foreigner smuggles the gold and he wants to take possession of the lands of the Brazilian Ribamar, that refuses to do business before the son''s arrival Chicão. With the help of the four dabblers, the boy struggles with the thieves and it helps the father in danger.', 'The friends Curió, Boroca (Dedé Santana), Mexelete and Bateia they venture in search of gold in the mine of Serra Pelada. The area is controlled by the foreigner Von Bermann, whose orders are executed by the bully Bira. Thirsty of being able to, the foreigner smuggles the gold and he wants to take possession of the lands of the Brazilian Ribamar, that refuses to do business before the son''s arrival Chicão. With the help of the four dabblers, the boy struggles with the thieves and it helps the father in danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wYwUK4lmYx5bhb2Mprxy3j1tJ8q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143552'),
  ('10052859016225764', 'The Trapalhões in the Kingdom of Fantasy', 1985, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family, Fantasy, Animation', 'Dedé Santana, Caique Martins Ferreira, Caxa Aragão', 'Dedé Santana, Jorge Fernando, Paulo Andrade', 'Renato Aragão, Dedé Santana, Mussum, Zacarias, Xuxa Meneghel, Maurício do Valle, Ataíde Arcoverde, Beto Carrero', null, 'The Trapalhões put on a show to raise money for an orphanage run by Sister Maria (Xuxa), which is facing financial difficulties. During the performance, the ticket money is stolen. Now, the Trapalhões and Sister Maria must go on an adventure to catch the thieves.', 'The Trapalhões put on a show to raise money for an orphanage run by Sister Maria (Xuxa), which is facing financial difficulties. During the performance, the ticket money is stolen. Now, the Trapalhões and Sister Maria must go on an adventure to catch the thieves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hUm2JrHuGBXgVYB0V8qbG7hiaLA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133005'),
  ('746667028258625903', 'The Trapalhões in the Land of Monsters', 1989, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Flávio Migliaccio', 'Mauro Wilson, Paulo Andrade', 'Renato Aragão, Dedé Santana, Mussum, Zacarias, Angélica, Conrado, Vanessa de Oliveira, Geórgia Gomide', null, 'In a television program Angelica (Angelica), the daughter of a businessman who aspires to be a singer, eventually earning his "crazy dream", which is recording a video clip at the top of Sugar Loaf in Rio de Janeiro, with the Domino Group . The father forbids it to go, so she runs away with her boyfriend to the Sugar Loaf. When her father learns commands Didi (Renato Aragão), Dede (Dede Santana), Mussum (Mussum) and Zechariah (Zechariah) to think in three days or call the police. Trying to find her, the quartet falls into a hole in the Sugar Loaf which is populated by strange creatures, some good, the Grunks, and some bad, the Barks.', 'In a television program Angelica (Angelica), the daughter of a businessman who aspires to be a singer, eventually earning his "crazy dream", which is recording a video clip at the top of Sugar Loaf in Rio de Janeiro, with the Domino Group . The father forbids it to go, so she runs away with her boyfriend to the Sugar Loaf. When her father learns commands Didi (Renato Aragão), Dede (Dede Santana), Mussum (Mussum) and Zechariah (Zechariah) to think in three days or call the police. Trying to find her, the quartet falls into a hole in the Sugar Loaf which is populated by strange creatures, some good, the Grunks, and some bad, the Barks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bfzIrFwrYMq36TnHsGxj3IYXyL6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:172435'),
  ('611585967718584189', 'The Trapalhões in the Tail of the Comet', 1986, 'Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Dedé Santana, José Tadeu Ribeiro', 'Roberto Silveira', 'Renato Aragão, Dedé Santana, Mussum, Zacarias, Mauricio de Sousa, José Vasconcellos', null, 'A journey back in time in the form of a cartoon with characterizations of the Trapalhões, from the time of the Roman Empire to the present day, through the Middle Ages, the Old West and the First World War. They begin the film by doing a stand-up show at the Teatro Scala, in Rio de Janeiro, receiving on stage the designer Mauricio de Sousa. From then on, the story unfolds in a cartoon, in which Os Trapalhões is chased by an evil wizard whose aim is to try to hold Didi''s (always unsuccessful) hand to rule the world during the passage of the famous Halley Comet.', 'A journey back in time in the form of a cartoon with characterizations of the Trapalhões, from the time of the Roman Empire to the present day, through the Middle Ages, the Old West and the First World War. They begin the film by doing a stand-up show at the Teatro Scala, in Rio de Janeiro, receiving on stage the designer Mauricio de Sousa. From then on, the story unfolds in a cartoon, in which Os Trapalhões is chased by an evil wizard whose aim is to try to hold Didi''s (always unsuccessful) hand to rule the world during the passage of the famous Halley Comet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2DGNbWQKpTwbugIOIRuMiMG1Gmv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146536'),
  ('206639605269378998', 'The Trapalhões in the War of the Planets', 1978, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family, Science Fiction', 'Adriano Stuart', 'Renato Aragão, Adriano Stuart', 'Renato Aragão, Dedé Santana, Zacarias, Mussum, Pedro Aguinaga, Arlete Moreira, Wilma Dias, Tereza Mascarenhas', null, 'Coming from outer space, Prince Flick asks the Trapalhões to help him free his planet from the domain of evil Zuco and free Princess Myrna, who has been taken prisoner. He offers a reward, the four friends accept the mission and embark in a spaceship driven by a hairy monster called Bonzo. Once on the planet, they they defeat Zuco, but they fail to save Princess Myrna''s life. Her place on the throne is then taken by Loya, the girlfriend Didi met on that planet. Back on Earth, os Trapalhões think their adventure was but a dream, but they are convinced otherwise when they find their reward.', 'Coming from outer space, Prince Flick asks the Trapalhões to help him free his planet from the domain of evil Zuco and free Princess Myrna, who has been taken prisoner. He offers a reward, the four friends accept the mission and embark in a spaceship driven by a hairy monster called Bonzo. Once on the planet, they they defeat Zuco, but they fail to save Princess Myrna''s life. Her place on the throne is then taken by Loya, the girlfriend Didi met on that planet. Back on Earth, os Trapalhões think their adventure was but a dream, but they are convinced otherwise when they find their reward.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cU1M9bCqxrHZZvP2p9C79L8iZ5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42209'),
  ('1058264029650374147', 'The Trapped 13: How We Survived The Thai Cave', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Pailin Wedel', null, 'Ekapol Chanthawong, Ei Khan, Panumas Sangdee, Chanin Vibulrungruang, June Yoon', null, 'In this compelling documentary, members of the Thai youth soccer team tell their stories of getting trapped in Tham Luang Cave in 2018 — and surviving.', 'In this compelling documentary, members of the Thai youth soccer team tell their stories of getting trapped in Tham Luang Cave in 2018 — and surviving.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jQb1UjOdc2DsU4SqDebrVH8dHvC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1025169'),
  ('215296337123850478', 'The Travel Companion', 2026, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Travis Wood, Alex Mallis, Jason Chiu', 'Alex Mallis, Travis Wood, Weston Auburn', 'Tristan Turner, Anthony Oberbeck, Naomi Asa, Joanna Arnow, Brit Fryer, Steven Phillips-Horst, Anil Joseph, Daryush Parsi', null, 'Simon, a struggling documentary filmmaker, enjoys free flights courtesy of his best friend and roommate, Bruce, who works for an airline. However, when Beatrice, a more successful filmmaker, enters the picture and starts dating Bruce, Simon risks flying too close to the sun.', 'Simon, a struggling documentary filmmaker, enjoys free flights courtesy of his best friend and roommate, Bruce, who works for an airline. However, when Beatrice, a more successful filmmaker, enters the picture and starts dating Bruce, Simon risks flying too close to the sun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9kgNTjPBpD6eshgvgRIPD0G9wBC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1465827'),
