  ('803157683653520097', 'The Traveler', 2010, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Michael Oblowitz, Neil Cervin, Mark D. Currie', 'Joseph C. Muscat', 'John Cassini, Val Kilmer, Camille Sullivan, Dylan Neal, Paul McGillion, Chris Gauthier, Sierra Pitkin, Denise Poole', 'R', 'On a dark Christmas Eve in a small town, the lone Sheriffs on the night shift encounter a mysterious man who goes by the name of Mr. Nobody. As the night progresses, the Sheriffs discover that this isn''t just a nobody, but a vengeful killer whose past threatens to haunt them all.', 'On a dark Christmas Eve in a small town, the lone Sheriffs on the night shift encounter a mysterious man who goes by the name of Mr. Nobody. As the night progresses, the Sheriffs discover that this isn''t just a nobody, but a vengeful killer whose past threatens to haunt them all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7vZ2C66SwastgmQKJ1wC41F2WFK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32612'),
  ('850665262371460523', 'The Traveling Executioner', 1970, 'Comedy, Drama, Western', 'Jack Smight, Philip H. Lathrop', 'Garrie Bateson', 'Stacy Keach, Bud Cort, Marianna Hill, Graham Jarvis, James Sloyan, M. Emmet Walsh, John Bottoms, Ford Rainey', 'R', 'Jonas Candide performs his job as state executioner in early 20th century Mississippi like a combination preacher and carnival barker, persuading condemned men to accept their deaths before electrocuting them on his electric chair. After he''s assigned his first woman to execute, however, Jonas'' sense of purpose is shaken.', 'Jonas Candide performs his job as state executioner in early 20th century Mississippi like a combination preacher and carnival barker, persuading condemned men to accept their deaths before electrocuting them on his electric chair. After he''s assigned his first woman to execute, however, Jonas'' sense of purpose is shaken.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ftINDhhILKZrEJ72rWcJObXc4oJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90517'),
  ('358353457653283050', 'The Traveller', 1979, 'Horror, Drama', 'Paul Naschy, Alejandro Ulloa, Sebastián Almeida', 'Eduarda Targioni, Paul Naschy', 'Paul Naschy, Sara Lezana, David Rocha, Ana Harpo, Blanca Estrada, Irene Gutiérrez Caba, Pepe Ruiz, Paloma Hurtado', null, 'The devil, following in the footsteps of Christ, decides to become flesh and take a stroll around Earth to see how humans have progressed, and have a little fun creating havoc and mayhem in the process.', 'The devil, following in the footsteps of Christ, decides to become flesh and take a stroll around Earth to see how humans have progressed, and have a little fun creating havoc and mayhem in the process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/outZic7rHhHTQy6LtmTZpI9xMxk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:216134'),
  ('1092025312780808936', 'The Traveller', 2024, 'Action, Fantasy', 'Wuershan, Xia Peng, Rui Zhong', 'Lili Wang, Wuershan, Zhou Mengjie', 'Hu Xianxu, Vanda Margraf, William Feng, Qiao Zhenyu, Song Ningfeng, Narana Erdyneeva, Nashi, Lan Xiya', null, 'Zhang Chulan, who has been hiding his identity as an Inhuman, is caught up in the vortex of fighting between different Inhuman sects since he meets Feng Baobao, who has a mysterious background. As the secret that Zhang Chulan is the heir to the mysterious technique "Air Body Source Stream" is made public, the Inhuman world has started a fierce battle around him, with forces such as Nadutong, Quanxie Sect, Tianyi Sect, and so on appearing one by one and the battle is about to break out, but at this time, Zhang Chulan accidentally unveils the secret of the year....', 'Zhang Chulan, who has been hiding his identity as an Inhuman, is caught up in the vortex of fighting between different Inhuman sects since he meets Feng Baobao, who has a mysterious background. As the secret that Zhang Chulan is the heir to the mysterious technique "Air Body Source Stream" is made public, the Inhuman world has started a fierce battle around him, with forces such as Nadutong, Quanxie Sect, Tianyi Sect, and so on appearing one by one and the battle is about to break out, but at this time, Zhang Chulan accidentally unveils the secret of the year....', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iBBXdLCqxRrqTAXe0iIzhSAHc1Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1072890'),
  ('452255750925821176', 'The Travelling Cat Chronicles', 2018, 'Drama', 'Koichiro Miki, Takashi Komatsu', 'Hiro Arikawa, Emiko Hiramatsu', 'Sota Fukushi, Mitsuki Takahata, Yuko Takeuchi, Alice Hirose, Takuro Ohno, Ryosuke Yamamoto, Tomoya Maeno', null, 'Satoru is a young man with a warm heart. He has a cat named Nana, but, due to circumstances, he can''t raise cat Nana anymore. He travels with Nana to find a person who will take care of Nana. During his travels, he meets various people like his childhood friend and his first love. His unknown past and secret are revealed.', 'Satoru is a young man with a warm heart. He has a cat named Nana, but, due to circumstances, he can''t raise cat Nana anymore. He travels with Nana to find a person who will take care of Nana. During his travels, he meets various people like his childhood friend and his first love. His unknown past and secret are revealed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hz4u554QVihax6vtuNkW1hlFHs9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:512340'),
  ('924342675287513071', 'The Travelling Players', 1975, 'Drama, War, History', 'Giorgos Arvanitis, Theo Angelopoulos, Takis Katselis', 'Theo Angelopoulos', 'Eva Kotamanidou, Vangelis Kazan, Aliki Georgouli, Kiriakos Katrivanos, Stratos Pahis, Nina Papazaphiropoulou, Giannis Fyrios, Alekos Boubis', null, 'A traveling theatre troupe tours the Greek countryside from 1939 to the early 1950s, staging “Golfo the Shepherdess”. As the years pass, its members endure persecution, betrayal, executions, and exile. Their personal stories become entangled with the country’s major historical events, in a seemingly endless cycle of violence and loss.', 'A traveling theatre troupe tours the Greek countryside from 1939 to the early 1950s, staging “Golfo the Shepherdess”. As the years pass, its members endure persecution, betrayal, executions, and exile. Their personal stories become entangled with the country’s major historical events, in a seemingly endless cycle of violence and loss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3SQKTdfFNoYtwyFCfUm1WQ4dNEe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:689'),
  ('72535518938019479', 'The Treacherous', 2015, 'Drama, History, Crime', 'Min Kyu-dong, Park Hong-yeol, Jung Hae-ji', 'Min Kyu-dong, Lee Yoon-Seong', 'Ju Ji-hoon, Kim Kang-woo, Lim Ji-yeon, Lee You-young, Cheon Ho-jin, Cha Ji-yeon, Go Kyung-pyo, Seo Young-joo', null, 'The story of Joseon''s tyrant king Yeonsan who exploits the populace for his own carnal pleasures, his seemingly loyal retainer who controls him and all court dealings, and a woman who seeks vengeance.', 'The story of Joseon''s tyrant king Yeonsan who exploits the populace for his own carnal pleasures, his seemingly loyal retainer who controls him and all court dealings, and a woman who seeks vengeance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1YpS9sXZ8bRrmPwULftGbfwImnR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:338803'),
  ('632636628382980958', 'The Treadmill', 2022, 'Drama', 'Beppe Gallo, Claudia Gerini', 'Claudia Gerini, Antonio Baiocco, Fabio Morici', 'Claudia Gerini, Claudia Vismara, Stefano Pesce, Maurizio Lombardi, Corrado Fortuna, Alessandro Bisegna, Daniela Virgilio, Lia Grieco', null, 'A tormented Emma, runs on her treadmill while doing online counseling, deluding herself to escape from her past. This balance will break when, after twenty-six years, her younger sister bursts in with an unsustainable request.', 'A tormented Emma, runs on her treadmill while doing online counseling, deluding herself to escape from her past. This balance will break when, after twenty-six years, her younger sister bursts in with an unsustainable request.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hkMEK3alAlIBXmIEOlmyNQDM9Pa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:884125'),
  ('265532578070694579', 'The Treasure', 1923, 'Drama', 'G.W. Pabst, Otto Tober', 'Willy Hennings', 'Albert Steinrück, Lucie Mannheim, Ilka Grüning, Werner Krauss, Hans Brausewetter', null, 'On the surface a straightforward tale of the search for a buried treasure, the film is a textbook example of German expressionism, with the passions of the protagonists conveyed as much through symbolism as action.', 'On the surface a straightforward tale of the search for a buried treasure, the film is a textbook example of German expressionism, with the passions of the protagonists conveyed as much through symbolism as action.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wLwKwvBMFq9Jr890pwxscwkRazC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175869'),
  ('268190359540416231', 'The Treasure Hunter', 2009, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Zhao Xiaoding, Kevin Chu', 'Lam Chiu-Wing, Yip Wan-Chiu, Shao Huiting', 'Jay Chou, Lin Chi-ling, Chen Daoming, Baron Chen, Miao Pu, Ian Powers, Kenneth Tsang, Eric Tsang Chi-Wai', null, 'In the northwest desert where countless prosperous dynasties have flourished and fallen, there is rumor of a treasure of unbelievable riches buried among it. A group of mysterious guardians have been guarding the map to the location of the treasure until a fierce rivalry erupted. A notorious international crime group, The Company hunted down the map keeper and before they managed to secure the map, the keeper passed the map to a young chivalrous man Ciao Fei. Ciao Fei was forced to give up the map to save the live of his mentor’s daughter Lan Ting. Teaming up with Hua Ding Bang and Lan Ting they embark on a dangerous journey to recover the map and fight to protect the ancient treasure.', 'In the northwest desert where countless prosperous dynasties have flourished and fallen, there is rumor of a treasure of unbelievable riches buried among it. A group of mysterious guardians have been guarding the map to the location of the treasure until a fierce rivalry erupted. A notorious international crime group, The Company hunted down the map keeper and before they managed to secure the map, the keeper passed the map to a young chivalrous man Ciao Fei. Ciao Fei was forced to give up the map to save the live of his mentor’s daughter Lan Ting. Teaming up with Hua Ding Bang and Lan Ting they embark on a dangerous journey to recover the map and fight to protect the ancient treasure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hHF1pLZLHSs5Yf72LgADx00I0j5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37848'),
  ('1044439337851775001', 'The Treasure of Abbot Thomas', 1974, 'Mystery, TV Movie, Horror', 'Lawrence Gordon Clark', 'John Bowen', 'Michael Bryant, Sheila Dunn, Anne Blake, Frank Mills, Virginia Balfour, Paul Lavers, John Herrington, Peggy Aitchison', null, 'The Reverend Justin Somerton, a scholar of medieval history, and his protégé Lord Peter Dattering are visiting an abbey library. While studying a stained glass window, they uncover clues leading to a treasure hidden by a disgraced abbot.', 'The Reverend Justin Somerton, a scholar of medieval history, and his protégé Lord Peter Dattering are visiting an abbey library. While studying a stained glass window, they uncover clues leading to a treasure hidden by a disgraced abbot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kZhupqYBSdRy2ob1hbjvzAqCNSz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141735'),
  ('1024463503061165677', 'The Treasure of Jamaica Reef', 1975, 'Adventure', 'Virginia L. Stone, Clive Trenchard, Alec McCrombie', 'J.A.S. McCrombie', 'Stephen Boyd, Cheryl Ladd, Chuck Woolery, David Ladd, Darby Hinton, Art Metrano, Rosey Grier', 'PG', 'An adventure film about the search for a more than 200-year-old treasure on the ocean floor.', 'An adventure film about the search for a more than 200-year-old treasure on the ocean floor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uTUlzQtZloI5Q6xAA0VetXh2bdg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43607'),
  ('1080766018987480812', 'The Treasure of Moctezuma', 1968, 'Action', 'René Cardona, René Cardona Jr.', 'Gregorio Walerstein, Rafael García Travesí', 'El Santo, Jorge Rivero, Maura Monti, Noé Murayama, Amadee Chabot, Manuel Capetillo, José Luis Carol, Miguel Gómez Checa', null, 'Santo and Jorge Rivero team-up to stop an international syndicate from stealing Mexico''s greatest treasure.', 'Santo and Jorge Rivero team-up to stop an international syndicate from stealing Mexico''s greatest treasure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ZOEq7FeIDsFB3NpMG0BX8ZzKBe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:276175'),
  ('211146404055153355', 'The Treasure of Pancho Villa', 1955, 'Western', 'George Sherman, Lew Borzage, William E. Snyder', 'Niven Busch', 'Rory Calhoun, Shelley Winters, Gilbert Roland, Joseph Calleia, Fanny Schiller, Carlos Múzquiz, Tony Carbajal, Pasquel Pena', 'NR', 'In 1915, an American adventurer joins the supporters of Mexican revolutionary Pancho Villa.', 'In 1915, an American adventurer joins the supporters of Mexican revolutionary Pancho Villa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e8JVALldJEdm2wE48nWG6OiR3od.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78266'),
  ('362493110224501870', 'The Treasure of San Gennaro', 1966, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Dino Risi, Tony Tounsi, Franco Montemurro', 'Adriano Baracco, Dino Risi, Ennio De Concini', 'Nino Manfredi, Senta Berger, Mario Adorf, Harry Guardino, Totò, Pinuccio Ardia, Vittoria Crispo, Ralf Wolter', null, 'A pair of Americans want to perform the greatest robbery: the treasure of San Gennaro, in Napoli.', 'A pair of Americans want to perform the greatest robbery: the treasure of San Gennaro, in Napoli.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wAj2GiU25Xh8zgkEG7VC5zMj6cq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58404'),
  ('584831915493485241', 'The Treasure of Swamp Castle', 1985, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'Attila Dargay, Irén Henrik, Árpád Lossonczy', 'Attila Dargay, József Nepp, József Romhányi', 'András Kern, Judit Pogány, Hilda Gobbi, György Bárdy, Gábor Maros, Ferenc Zenthe, József Képessy, Judit Hernádi', 'G', 'Szaffi is a full-length animated feature based on Mór Jókai’s short books The Gypsy Baron (A cigánybáró) and Szaffi. It has adventure, and treasure, and love, and a little black cat, and a war, and picturesque villains - a governor with a pressure release valve in his skull and a fat pig-loving baron, and of course, the good gypsies.', 'Szaffi is a full-length animated feature based on Mór Jókai’s short books The Gypsy Baron (A cigánybáró) and Szaffi. It has adventure, and treasure, and love, and a little black cat, and a war, and picturesque villains - a governor with a pressure release valve in his skull and a fat pig-loving baron, and of course, the good gypsies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fzNpexbkf5tw5bw9LcSndwekyqg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40993'),
  ('429401947122570498', 'The Treasure of the Beatitude', 1959, 'Comedy', 'Nikos Tsiforos, Yiannis Hatzopoulos, Nikos Dimopoulos', 'Nikos Tsiforos, Polyvios Vasileiadis', 'Georgia Vasileiadou, Vasilis Avlonitis, Nikos Rizos, Xenia Kalogeropoulou, Giorgos Lefteriotis, Stefanos Linaios, Antzela Zileia, Nikos Fermas', null, 'Theoni finds a strange way to gain some money, in order to pay her bills , by renting rooms in her rickety house.', 'Theoni finds a strange way to gain some money, in order to pay her bills , by renting rooms in her rickety house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q5FYFVeTE0hWpccDqr8RCbnMeVQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:332060'),
  ('309267221260228351', 'The Treasure of the White Falcons', 2005, 'Adventure, Family', 'Jules van den Steenhoven, Christian Zübert', 'Christian Zübert', 'David Bode, Kevin Köppe, Tamino-Turgay zum Felde, Victoria Scherer, Jannis Niewöhner, Christian Wimmer, Cornelia Schmaus, Wotan Wilke Möhring', null, 'Three friends find a treasure map from the mysterious ''White Falcons'', a juvenile gang whose leader disappeared ten years before.', 'Three friends find a treasure map from the mysterious ''White Falcons'', a juvenile gang whose leader disappeared ten years before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1XF76XQoOTg1tz0sspNWPtMyMm9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67352'),
  ('639278817123092490', 'The Treasures of Satan', 1902, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Georges Méliès', null, 'The setting of this fantastic scene represents the hall of an old chateau in which a miser has locked up seven large bags containing his wealth. Satan, who has made his way into the chateau, puts the seven bags in a strong box, and makes with his hands some cabalistic motions. The miser comes into the hall and is greatly astonished to find his fortune missing. He opens the coffer and immediately the bags leap out. He gathers them up and puts them back into the coffer. When he opens it again he finds that they have been transformed into seven young girls, who rush out and chase after him, beating him unmercifully. They shut him up in the coffer from which his gold has vanished. The miser pushes open the lid of the coffer, and to his profound despair finds that both young girls and money have disappeared. (This view is most sensational in its mysterious scenes.) (Star Film Catalog)', 'The setting of this fantastic scene represents the hall of an old chateau in which a miser has locked up seven large bags containing his wealth. Satan, who has made his way into the chateau, puts the seven bags in a strong box, and makes with his hands some cabalistic motions. The miser comes into the hall and is greatly astonished to find his fortune missing. He opens the coffer and immediately the bags leap out. He gathers them up and puts them back into the coffer. When he opens it again he finds that they have been transformed into seven young girls, who rush out and chase after him, beating him unmercifully. They shut him up in the coffer from which his gold has vanished. The miser pushes open the lid of the coffer, and to his profound despair finds that both young girls and money have disappeared. (This view is most sensational in its mysterious scenes.) (Star Film Catalog)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gB8pOSKywBR125NOb1i8QDwq3La.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108278'),
  ('501272092261608514', 'The Treatment', 2014, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Hans Herbots, Frank van den Eeden', 'Carl Joos', 'Geert Van Rampelberg, Ina Geerts, Johan van Assche, Laura Verlinden, Ingrid De Vos, Dominique Van Malder, Roel Swanenberg, Kyan Steverlynck', 'NR', 'Inspector Nick Cafmeyer seems to have it all - looks, brains and a successful career. But a dark cloud hangs over his life: since the age of nine, he has been haunted by the unsolved disappearance of his younger brother, Bjorn. Plettinckx, a known sex offender, was questioned but quickly released. Plettinckx lives close by and takes fiendish pleasure in harassing Nick. Then, when a disturbing case comes to light involving a missing nine-year-old, Nick heads a massive search which turns into a relentless manhunt.', 'Inspector Nick Cafmeyer seems to have it all - looks, brains and a successful career. But a dark cloud hangs over his life: since the age of nine, he has been haunted by the unsolved disappearance of his younger brother, Bjorn. Plettinckx, a known sex offender, was questioned but quickly released. Plettinckx lives close by and takes fiendish pleasure in harassing Nick. Then, when a disturbing case comes to light involving a missing nine-year-old, Nick heads a massive search which turns into a relentless manhunt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nzVhjAjEaugzs0CSmEO50W5mTcc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:251577'),
  ('1092041185110651266', 'The Tree', 2010, 'Drama', 'Julie Bertuccelli, Nigel Bluck', 'Julie Bertuccelli', 'Charlotte Gainsbourg, Morgan Davies, Marton Csokas, Christian Byers, Tom Russell, Gabriel Gotting, Aden Young, Penne Hackforth-Jones', null, 'The O''Neills lived happily in their house in the Australian countryside. That was until one day fate struck blindly, taking the life of Peter, the father, leaving his grief-stricken wife Dawn alone with their four children. Among them, eight-year-old Simone denies this reality. She is persuaded that her father still lives in the giant fig tree growing near their house and speaks to her through its leaves. But the tree becomes more and more invasive and threatens the house. It must be felled. Of course, Simone won''t allow it.', 'The O''Neills lived happily in their house in the Australian countryside. That was until one day fate struck blindly, taking the life of Peter, the father, leaving his grief-stricken wife Dawn alone with their four children. Among them, eight-year-old Simone denies this reality. She is persuaded that her father still lives in the giant fig tree growing near their house and speaks to her through its leaves. But the tree becomes more and more invasive and threatens the house. It must be felled. Of course, Simone won''t allow it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3KIBrK8FsBVCJxoYOzOgS72zmRR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51409'),
  ('860177126302825384', 'The Tree in a Test Tube', 1942, 'Documentary', 'Charles McDonald, Harold S. Sintzenich', null, 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, Lee Vickers, Pete Smith', null, 'Stan Laurel and Oliver Hardy are stopped by narrator Pete Smith for the purpose of showing the audience how much wood and wood by-products the average person carries.', 'Stan Laurel and Oliver Hardy are stopped by narrator Pete Smith for the purpose of showing the audience how much wood and wood by-products the average person carries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8RLXyt7FDwl4m7zvyE61GCoFis4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107289'),
  ('816236014915462381', 'The Tree of Blood', 2018, 'Drama', 'Julio Medem, Kiko de la Rica', 'Julio Medem', 'Álvaro Cervantes, Úrsula Corberó, Najwa Nimri, Patricia López Arnaiz, Daniel Grao, Joaquín Furriel, María Molins, Emilio Gutiérrez Caba', null, 'Marc and Rebeca, a young couple, travel to an old country house that used to belong to their family. Once there, they write the shared history of their roots, creating a huge family tree that harbours relationships of love, heartbreak, sex, madness, jealousy and infidelity, and under which also lies a history laden with secrets.', 'Marc and Rebeca, a young couple, travel to an old country house that used to belong to their family. Once there, they write the shared history of their roots, creating a huge family tree that harbours relationships of love, heartbreak, sex, madness, jealousy and infidelity, and under which also lies a history laden with secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z3GhO9usvGOkGm9Okiym8RyET8t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:502350'),
  ('968540499699998809', 'The Tree of Guernica', 1975, 'Drama, War', 'Fernando Arrabal, Ramón F. Suárez, Roberto Palmerini', 'Fernando Arrabal', 'Mariangela Melato, Ron Faber, Cosimo Cinieri, Rocco Fontana, Franco Ressel, Mario Novelli, Cirylle Spiga, Diego Bardon', null, 'The fictional town of Villa Romero is the set upon which the events of Spain''s civil war play out. Villa Romero is home to Vandale (Mariangela Melato) a witch, count Cerralbo (Bento Urago) a powerless land baron, and his four sons. Three of Cerralbo''s sons are ruthless sadists who pillage the countryside, but the fourth, Goya (Ron Faber), is an artist challenging authority and the church.', 'The fictional town of Villa Romero is the set upon which the events of Spain''s civil war play out. Villa Romero is home to Vandale (Mariangela Melato) a witch, count Cerralbo (Bento Urago) a powerless land baron, and his four sons. Three of Cerralbo''s sons are ruthless sadists who pillage the countryside, but the fourth, Goya (Ron Faber), is an artist challenging authority and the church.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pevFMwalJv2dbtzQR1T02TTk99c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104354'),
  ('636693938766835832', 'The Tree of Life', 2011, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Terrence Malick, Emmanuel Lubezki, Paul Atkins', 'Terrence Malick', 'Brad Pitt, Jessica Chastain, Hunter McCracken, Sean Penn, Fiona Shaw, Tye Sheridan, Laramie Eppler, Will Wallace', 'PG-13', 'The impressionistic story of a Texas family in the 1950s. The film follows the life journey of the eldest son, Jack, through the innocence of childhood to his disillusioned adult years as he tries to reconcile a complicated relationship with his father. Jack finds himself a lost soul in the modern world, seeking answers to the origins and meaning of life while questioning the existence of faith.', 'The impressionistic story of a Texas family in the 1950s. The film follows the life journey of the eldest son, Jack, through the innocence of childhood to his disillusioned adult years as he tries to reconcile a complicated relationship with his father. Jack finds himself a lost soul in the modern world, seeking answers to the origins and meaning of life while questioning the existence of faith.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l8cwuB5WJSoj4uMAsnzuHBOMaSJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8967'),
  ('971535024941333694', 'The Tree of Wooden Clogs', 1978, 'Drama', 'Ermanno Olmi, Ermanno Olmi', 'Ermanno Olmi', 'Luigi Ornaghi, Francesca Moriggi, Omar Brignoli, Antonio Ferrari, Teresa Brescianini, Giuseppe Brignoli, Carlo Rota, Pasqualina Brolis', 'NR', 'On a turn-of-the-20th-century northern Italian farm, a group of sharecroppers eke out a threadbare existence. A priest advises Batisti and his wife Batistina that their young son Minec should be formally educated, so they sacrifice his help in the fields and send him to school. When Minec''s wooden shoe breaks one day, Batisti--in an act of desperation--puts the family''s future at risk to replace the clog.', 'On a turn-of-the-20th-century northern Italian farm, a group of sharecroppers eke out a threadbare existence. A priest advises Batisti and his wife Batistina that their young son Minec should be formally educated, so they sacrifice his help in the fields and send him to school. When Minec''s wooden shoe breaks one day, Batisti--in an act of desperation--puts the family''s future at risk to replace the clog.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ld4l2XWuECX6c6lWd2BWv1olg2N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31542'),
  ('1103917066278153382', 'The Tree We Hurt', 1986, 'Drama', 'Dimos Avdeliodis', 'Dimos Avdeliodis', 'Yannis Avdeliodis, Nikos Mioteris, Marina Delivoria, Katerina Kyriakodi', null, 'The friendship between two young boys during the summertime in 60''s Chios Island.', 'The friendship between two young boys during the summertime in 60''s Chios Island.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rLxhPTxN5msoxEsUrlakncXtf1T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270328'),
  ('848425298077564925', 'The Tree, the Mayor and the Mediatheque', 1993, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Éric Rohmer, Diane Baratier', 'Éric Rohmer', 'Pascal Greggory, Arielle Dombasle, Fabrice Luchini, Clémentine Amouroux, François-Marie Banier, Michel Jaouen, Jean Parvulesco, Galaxie Barbouth', null, 'The socialist mayor of a small village in France dreams of building an arts center but he runs up against some opposition.', 'The socialist mayor of a small village in France dreams of building an arts center but he runs up against some opposition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/roGLahpgFtg6MYNtgdCXNgEE511.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134463'),
  ('524364157611686682', 'The Tree''s Knees', 1931, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Hugh Harman, Rudolf Ising', null, 'Johnny Murray', null, 'Bosko the woodsman spurns cutting down trees and plays music instead. The trees and animals dance and make their own music.', 'Bosko the woodsman spurns cutting down trees and plays music instead. The trees and animals dance and make their own music.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ykdLoG8p1VDQOt3nIQwhBqPFg9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162719'),
  ('1035706700029817484', 'The Trench', 1999, 'War, History', 'William Boyd, Tony Pierce-Roberts', 'William Boyd', 'Daniel Craig, Danny Dyer, James D''Arcy, Paul Nicholls, Julian Rhind-Tutt, Ciarán McMenamin, Cillian Murphy, Ben Whishaw', null, 'The Trench tells the story of a group of young British soldiers on the eve of the Battle of the Somme in the summer of 1916, the worst defeat in British military history. Against this ill-fated backdrop, the movie depicts the soldiers'' experience as a mixture of boredom, fear, panic, and restlessness, confined to a trench on the front lines.', 'The Trench tells the story of a group of young British soldiers on the eve of the Battle of the Somme in the summer of 1916, the worst defeat in British military history. Against this ill-fated backdrop, the movie depicts the soldiers'' experience as a mixture of boredom, fear, panic, and restlessness, confined to a trench on the front lines.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tEK7lwfMz7Hy3LhuunPH0cjQDXl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27123'),
  ('239312720114327969', 'The Trespasser', 1929, 'Drama', 'Edmund Goulding, Josiah Zuro, George Barnes', 'Edmund Goulding', 'Gloria Swanson, Robert Ames, Purnell Pratt, Henry B. Walthall, Wally Albright, William Holden, Blanche Friderici, Kay Hammond', null, 'A stenographer who works for a lawyer falls in love with and marries a wealthy young man. His family has the marraige annulled, after which she gives birth to a child. Her former boss helps her out to ensure the child''s welfare, which starts gossip that she is a "kept woman."', 'A stenographer who works for a lawyer falls in love with and marries a wealthy young man. His family has the marraige annulled, after which she gives birth to a child. Her former boss helps her out to ensure the child''s welfare, which starts gossip that she is a "kept woman."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8IIvlovQzJ4BXbdNiAvtXRbu90u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53796'),
  ('957902540182770060', 'The Trespasser', 2002, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Beto Brant, Claudia Gama, Lígia Feliciano', 'Beto Brant, Renato Ciasca', 'Paulo Miklos, Marco Ricca, Alexandre Borges, Mariana Ximenes, Malu Mader, Chris Couto, George Freire, Tanah Correa', null, 'Two businessmen hire a hitman to kill their third partner and are then blackmailed by the hitman as he takes over their company.', 'Two businessmen hire a hitman to kill their third partner and are then blackmailed by the hitman as he takes over their company.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eToltyeAuwv9SMKdX9n9QQvdR1G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53960'),
  ('471139463843146830', 'The Trial', 1962, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Orson Welles, Edmond Richard, Sophie Becker', 'Orson Welles', 'Anthony Perkins, Jeanne Moreau, Romy Schneider, Orson Welles, Akim Tamiroff, Elsa Martinelli, Suzanne Flon, Madeleine Robinson', 'NR', 'Arrested for an unnamed crime, Josef K. is trapped in a surreal bureaucratic maze where justice is unknowable and guilt is assumed.', 'Arrested for an unnamed crime, Josef K. is trapped in a surreal bureaucratic maze where justice is unknowable and guilt is assumed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4qDUe5HqB8pXNplSBlsoyVjNP3r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3009'),
  ('526217269833665200', 'The Trial', 1993, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Phil Meheux, David Hugh Jones', 'Harold Pinter', 'Kyle MacLachlan, Anthony Hopkins, Jason Robards, Juliet Stevenson, Polly Walker, Alfred Molina, David Thewlis, Michael Kitchen', null, 'Joseph K. awakes one morning, to find two strange men in his room, telling him he has been arrested. Joseph is not told what he is charged with, and despite being "arrested," is allowed to remain free and go to work. But despite the strange nature of his arrest, Joseph soon learns that his trial, however odd, is very real, and tries desperately to spare himself from the court''s judgement.', 'Joseph K. awakes one morning, to find two strange men in his room, telling him he has been arrested. Joseph is not told what he is charged with, and despite being "arrested," is allowed to remain free and go to work. But despite the strange nature of his arrest, Joseph soon learns that his trial, however odd, is very real, and tries desperately to spare himself from the court''s judgement.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t3nlCW5pGQJSdLXlq5rwZFNaggb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69703'),
  ('1137507721922057221', 'The Trial', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Maria Ramos, Alan Schvarsberg, David Alves Mattos', 'Maria Ramos', 'Dilma Rousseff, Gleisi Hoffmann, Lindbergh Farias, Janaína Paschoal, José Eduardo Cardozo, Eduardo Cunha, Roberto Requião, Luiz Inácio Lula da Silva', null, 'The impeachment and removal from office of Brazilian President Dilma Rousseff in 2016 was triggered by a corruption scandal involving, among others, her then vice-president Michel Temer. Director Maria Augusta Ramos follows the trial against Rousseff from the point of view of her defence team. This is a courtroom drama that unfolds slowly: the appearances of the various parties gradually turn the proceedings into something akin to theatre. Inside the courtroom, grand emotions are played to full effect whilst, on the other side of the doors, lobbyists and supporters pace the corridors. Meanwhile, outside, in front of Brasília’s modernist government buildings, demonstrators are chanting like a Greek chorus. Only the main character, Rousseff herself, remains professional and aloof.', 'The impeachment and removal from office of Brazilian President Dilma Rousseff in 2016 was triggered by a corruption scandal involving, among others, her then vice-president Michel Temer. Director Maria Augusta Ramos follows the trial against Rousseff from the point of view of her defence team. This is a courtroom drama that unfolds slowly: the appearances of the various parties gradually turn the proceedings into something akin to theatre. Inside the courtroom, grand emotions are played to full effect whilst, on the other side of the doors, lobbyists and supporters pace the corridors. Meanwhile, outside, in front of Brasília’s modernist government buildings, demonstrators are chanting like a Greek chorus. Only the main character, Rousseff herself, remains professional and aloof.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8fo3dSn0mfu8Pi5a6RTE7WAzpxJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:500833'),
  ('1094940790857145741', 'The Trial of Billy Jack', 1974, 'Action, Drama, Music, Thriller', 'Tom Laughlin, Jack A. Marta', 'Tom Laughlin, Delores Taylor', 'Tom Laughlin, Delores Taylor, Victor Izay, Teresa Kelly, Sara Lane, Geo Anne Sosa, Riley Hill, Sparky Watt', 'PG', 'After Billy Jack in sentenced to four years in prison for the "involuntary manslaughter" of the first film, the Freedom School expands and flourishes under the guidance of Jean Roberts. The utopian existence of the school is characterized by everything ranging from "yoga sports" to muckracking journalism. The diverse student population airs scathing political exposes on their privately owned television station. The narrow-minded townspeople have different ideas about their brand of liberalism. Billy Jack is released and things heat up for the school. Students are threatened and abused and the Native Americans in the neighboring village are taunted and mistreated. After Billy Jack undergoes a vision quest, the governor and the police plot to permanently put an end to their liberal shenanigans, leaving it up to Billy Jack to save the day.', 'After Billy Jack in sentenced to four years in prison for the "involuntary manslaughter" of the first film, the Freedom School expands and flourishes under the guidance of Jean Roberts. The utopian existence of the school is characterized by everything ranging from "yoga sports" to muckracking journalism. The diverse student population airs scathing political exposes on their privately owned television station. The narrow-minded townspeople have different ideas about their brand of liberalism. Billy Jack is released and things heat up for the school. Students are threatened and abused and the Native Americans in the neighboring village are taunted and mistreated. After Billy Jack undergoes a vision quest, the governor and the police plot to permanently put an end to their liberal shenanigans, leaving it up to Billy Jack to save the day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xlYSv3tebgES8isB1hJWLc4cjy4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83980'),
  ('1096412136975784937', 'The Trial of Donald Duck', 1948, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack King', null, 'Clarence Nash', 'NR', 'Donald is caught in the rain while eating his lunch. He ducks into a restaurant for a cup of coffee, but Chez Pierre is a very ritzy place, and by the time all is said and done, he''s facing a bill for $35.99, and he only got a drop of coffee, and he only has a nickel. Pierre takes him to court, where this story is told, and is ordered to pay $10 or wash dishes for ten days.', 'Donald is caught in the rain while eating his lunch. He ducks into a restaurant for a cup of coffee, but Chez Pierre is a very ritzy place, and by the time all is said and done, he''s facing a bill for $35.99, and he only got a drop of coffee, and he only has a nickel. Pierre takes him to court, where this story is told, and is ordered to pay $10 or wash dishes for ten days.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b9jVivp8yf14OE8p73H0rT2P28M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67603'),
  ('738339347768891691', 'The Trial of Joan of Arc', 1963, 'Drama, History', 'Robert Bresson, Pierre Guffroy, Léonce-Henri Burel', 'Robert Bresson', 'Florence Delay, Jean-Claude Fourneau, Roger Honorat, Marc Jacquier, Jean Gillibert, Michel Herubel, André Régnier, Arthur Le Bau', null, 'Rouen, Normandy, 1431, during the Hundred Years'' War. After being captured by French soldiers from an opposing faction, Joan of Arc, the Maid of Orléans, is unjustly tried by an ecclesiastical court overseen by her English enemies.', 'Rouen, Normandy, 1431, during the Hundred Years'' War. After being captured by French soldiers from an opposing faction, Joan of Arc, the Maid of Orléans, is unjustly tried by an ecclesiastical court overseen by her English enemies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gHb9UUow3j25sMCb3wDIZatfIg1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48764'),
  ('294547736826719109', 'The Trial of Michael Jackson', 2026, 'Drama, Documentary', 'Richard Macer', null, 'Adam Fielding, Benjamin Boyd, Shane Whitworth, William Meredith, Francis Maston', null, 'Michael Jackson (Adam Fielding) and the story pertaining to his 2005 trial, where he was accused and fully acquitted of all 13 counts of molestation. This documentary uses actual court documents for accuracy. With Thomas Mesereau as Michael''s defense attorney and Susan Yu also, they are able to prove the heinous sensationalist allegations against Michael Jackson as false. Michael Jackson was successfully acquitted of all allegations.', 'Michael Jackson (Adam Fielding) and the story pertaining to his 2005 trial, where he was accused and fully acquitted of all 13 counts of molestation. This documentary uses actual court documents for accuracy. With Thomas Mesereau as Michael''s defense attorney and Susan Yu also, they are able to prove the heinous sensationalist allegations against Michael Jackson as false. Michael Jackson was successfully acquitted of all allegations.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F4SV7N3SQPuZ0MSUcyfKJr3lixk6.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-trial-of-michael-jackson'),
  ('816049348145049093', 'The Trial of Mr. Wolf', 1941, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng, Carl W. Stalling', null, 'Mel Blanc, Sara Berner', null, 'The Big Bad Wolf is on trial for crimes committed against Little Red Riding Hood and her grandmother. When given a chance to speak in his defense, Mr. Wolf explains the supposed real story: He is the victim.', 'The Big Bad Wolf is on trial for crimes committed against Little Red Riding Hood and her grandmother. When given a chance to speak in his defense, Mr. Wolf explains the supposed real story: He is the victim.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wQNiMPYZzrZHbJP66M2Jl9oNEjE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236482'),
  ('630942656116919152', 'The Trial of the Incredible Hulk', 1989, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Drama, Action, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Bill Bixby, Chuck Colwell, Lee Knippelberg', 'Gerald Di Pego', 'Bill Bixby, Lou Ferrigno, Marta DuBois, Nancy Everhard, Nicholas Hormann, Richard Cummings Jr., Joseph Mascolo, John Rhys-Davies', 'NR', 'Falsely accused of assault, Dr. David Banner is arrested and placed on trial, facing the possibility of a long prison sentence. Blind attorney Matt Murdock takes on his defence, while secretly operating as the vigilante Daredevil. As the courtroom battle unfolds, Banner’s struggle to control the Hulk leads to a dangerous confrontation with criminal mastermind Wilson Fisk.', 'Falsely accused of assault, Dr. David Banner is arrested and placed on trial, facing the possibility of a long prison sentence. Blind attorney Matt Murdock takes on his defence, while secretly operating as the vigilante Daredevil. As the courtroom battle unfolds, Banner’s struggle to control the Hulk leads to a dangerous confrontation with criminal mastermind Wilson Fisk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jaaeLvonWry3TdTXaGSu2VveNEG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26883'),
  ('666390407899342009', 'The Trials of Cate McCall', 2013, 'Drama', 'Karen Moncrieff, Antonio Calvache', 'Karen Moncrieff', 'Kate Beckinsale, Nick Nolte, James Cromwell, Anna Schafer, Mark Pellegrino, Clancy Brown, Taye Diggs, Isaiah Washington', null, 'In order to be reinstated to the bar and recover custody of her daughter, a hotshot lawyer, now in recovery and on probation, must take on the appeal of a woman wrongfully convicted of murder.', 'In order to be reinstated to the bar and recover custody of her daughter, a hotshot lawyer, now in recovery and on probation, must take on the appeal of a woman wrongfully convicted of murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2u9raM4MWJTtGVQ7MeYwfgGouRl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:253279'),
  ('207341547968762348', 'The Trials of Henry Kissinger', 2002, 'Documentary', 'Eugene Jarecki', 'Alex Gibney', 'Henry Kissinger, Brian Cox, Christopher Hitchens, Seymour Hersh', 'G', 'This riveting documentary depicts former Secretary of State Henry Kissinger as a warmonger responsible for military cover-ups in Vietnam, Cambodia and East Timor, as well as the assassination of a Chilean leader in 1970. Based on a book by journalist Christopher Hitchens, the film includes interviews with historians, political analysts and such journalists as New York Times writer William Safire, a former Nixon speechwriter.', 'This riveting documentary depicts former Secretary of State Henry Kissinger as a warmonger responsible for military cover-ups in Vietnam, Cambodia and East Timor, as well as the assassination of a Chilean leader in 1970. Based on a book by journalist Christopher Hitchens, the film includes interviews with historians, political analysts and such journalists as New York Times writer William Safire, a former Nixon speechwriter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hTzpmKT6w14A33L4ZQElLaZxPvM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54714'),
  ('499263434661014561', 'The Trials of Oscar Wilde', 1960, 'Drama, History', 'Ken Hughes, Ted Moore, James Liggat', 'Ken Hughes', 'Peter Finch, Yvonne Mitchell, James Mason, Nigel Patrick, John Fraser, Lionel Jeffries, Emrys Jones, Maxine Audley', null, 'England, 1890s. The brutal and embittered Marquis of Queensberry, who believes that his youngest son, Bosie, has an inappropriate relationship with the famous Irish writer Oscar Wilde, maintains an ongoing feud with the latter in order to ruin his reputation and cause his fall from grace.', 'England, 1890s. The brutal and embittered Marquis of Queensberry, who believes that his youngest son, Bosie, has an inappropriate relationship with the famous Irish writer Oscar Wilde, maintains an ongoing feud with the latter in order to ruin his reputation and cause his fall from grace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v5Kr4MvmqbBwS7a1CXFAsISmQCr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:172535'),
  ('209531145699416608', 'The Triangle', 1982, 'Animation', 'Priit Pärn, Arvi Ilves, Sigrun Alaots', 'Priit Pärn', 'Maria Klenskaja, Eino Baskin, Eero Spriit', null, 'Julia spends every night preparing a multi-course feast for her husband Viktor. Until one day Eduard appears from under the electric stove and starts demanding his share of the meal.', 'Julia spends every night preparing a multi-course feast for her husband Viktor. Until one day Eduard appears from under the electric stove and starts demanding his share of the meal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1TJn8B8QzAVHdjlhMLDOVOLpMaL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127155'),
  ('259740914034664740', 'The Triangle', 2001, 'Thriller, TV Movie, Horror', 'Lewis Teague, Woody Sidarous, Ric Waite', 'Bing Howenstein, Ted Humphrey', 'Luke Perry, Olivia D''Abo, Polly Shannon, Dan Cortese, David Hewlett, Dorian Harewood, Robert Dodds, Matthew Warry-Smith', 'PG', 'This made-for-TV movie follows a group of friends as they try to find a boat lost for 50 years in the Bermuda Triangle.', 'This made-for-TV movie follows a group of friends as they try to find a boat lost for 50 years in the Bermuda Triangle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4iR7GXeVo6rw891RBFCvv4A5Ako.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71147'),
  ('391832397640853479', 'The Tribe', 1998, 'Drama', 'Stephen Poliakoff, Wit Dąbal', 'Stephen Poliakoff', 'Jonathan Rhys Meyers, Jeremy Northam, Joely Richardson, Anna Friel, Trevor Eve, Laura Fraser, George Costigan, Michael Feast', 'R', 'Property developer Jamie has to evict some weird, post-modern hippies from a building. But they slowly drag him into their dark underworld of bizarre rituals and dangerous liaisons.', 'Property developer Jamie has to evict some weird, post-modern hippies from a building. But they slowly drag him into their dark underworld of bizarre rituals and dangerous liaisons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/asSDcVmSaadLcO6qz6LXu8eI1qb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55821'),
  ('195180585637739319', 'The Tribe', 2014, 'Drama, Crime', 'Myroslav Slaboshpytskyi, Serhii Stepanskyi, Valentyn Vasyanovych', 'Myroslav Slaboshpytskyi', 'Hryhoriy Fesenko, Yana Novikova, Rosa Babiy, Oleksandr Dsiadevych, Oleksandr Osadchyi, Ivan Tishko, Alexandr Sidelnikov, Alexander Panivan', null, 'Deaf-mute Sergey enters a specialized boarding school for the deaf. In navigating through the school''s hierarchy, he encounters a corrupt underbelly of criminality, known as The Tribe. By participating in several robberies, he gets propelled higher into the organization, when he meets one of the Chief’s concubines Anya, and unwittingly breaks all the unwritten rules of the group."', 'Deaf-mute Sergey enters a specialized boarding school for the deaf. In navigating through the school''s hierarchy, he encounters a corrupt underbelly of criminality, known as The Tribe. By participating in several robberies, he gets propelled higher into the organization, when he meets one of the Chief’s concubines Anya, and unwittingly breaks all the unwritten rules of the group."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/itZcDkDN4HQ15f6HbriABjlIwoF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:271397'),
  ('763680513986220691', 'The Tribe', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Fernando Colomo', 'Joaquín Oristrell, Fernando Colomo, Yolanda García Serrano', 'Paco León, Carmen Machi, Luis Bermejo, Julián López, Bárbara Santa-Cruz, Rebeca Sala, Maite Sandoval, Manuel Huedo', null, 'A cleaner woman with vocational street dancer tries to recover her long-stranded son that she gave for adoption, a former CEO who lost everything, including his memories.', 'A cleaner woman with vocational street dancer tries to recover her long-stranded son that she gave for adoption, a former CEO who lost everything, including his memories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pASeM9pyZtqDqTkXD1mNvqqh9hK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:504345'),
  ('60244819393294328', 'The Tribes of Palos Verdes', 2017, 'Drama', 'Giles Dunning, Brendan Malloy, Emmett Malloy', 'Karen Croner', 'Maika Monroe, Jennifer Garner, Cody Fern, Justin Kirk, Noah Silver, Alicia Silverstone, Elisabeth Röhm, Goran Višnjić', 'R', 'When the situation at her idyllic Palos Verdes home turns volatile, young Medina attempts to surf her way to happiness.', 'When the situation at her idyllic Palos Verdes home turns volatile, young Medina attempts to surf her way to happiness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8w4JecmVtqcSMk4mdiHURzISsYz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:324562'),
  ('724553513714989654', 'The Tribulations of Balthazar Kober', 1988, 'Drama, Fantasy, History', 'Wojciech Has, Waldemar Prokopowicz, Janusz Weychert', 'Wojciech Has', 'Rafał Wieczyński, Michael Lonsdale, Emmanuelle Riva, Daniel Emilfork, Gabriela Kownacka, Adrianna Biedrzyńska, Evelyne Dassas, Christine Laurent', null, 'Story about the young Balthazar thrown from one remarkable event to the other. On his way through a plague hit the landscape, he meets the Kabbalists, priests - and himself.', 'Story about the young Balthazar thrown from one remarkable event to the other. On his way through a plague hit the landscape, he meets the Kabbalists, priests - and himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nd1fJ2azY5aefwsQuHK6OfUrtBW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105760'),
  ('496916866461104976', 'The Tricky Master', 1999, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Wong Jing, Ko Chiu-Lam, Bosco Lam Tsz-Ho', 'Wong Jing', 'Nick Cheung Ka-Fai, Stephen Chow, Sandra Ng Kwan-Yu, Suki Kwan Sau-Mei, Wong Jing, Kelly Lin Hsi-Lei, Bobby Yip Kin-Sang, Ken Lo Wai-Kwong', null, 'Undercover cop Leung Foon is having trouble taking down the illegal trading operation headed by crime boss Ferrari. So to accomplish his mission, he asks for help from the renowned Master Wong, an expert in gambling tricks.', 'Undercover cop Leung Foon is having trouble taking down the illegal trading operation headed by crime boss Ferrari. So to accomplish his mission, he asks for help from the renowned Master Wong, an expert in gambling tricks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mFF1AtJdfVgY1E4I7lNfE3cA4Mt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53281'),
  ('466215060253790704', 'The Tricyclist', 1957, 'Comedy', 'Jack Pinoteau, Pierre Petit', 'Jack Pinoteau, Jacques Vilfrid, Jean Aurel', 'Darry Cowl, Roger Carel, Béatrice Altariba, Pierre Mondy, Maurice Gardett, Mario David, Jean-Claude Brialy, Jess Hahn', null, 'Antoine Peyralout is baker Mouillefarine''s tricycle delivery man. Comical and stuttering, Antoine shows more interest in the local soccer team than in professional integrity. A wedding cake pays the price for it and the young man is dismissed. Not dispirited in the least, Antoine decides to go to Nice, where his favorite team will play the final of the Cup. On his merry (and eventful) way, he has the opportunity to save a pretty camper, Popeline, with whom he falls in love. Once in Nice, he discovers that Dabek, the brilliant goal-keeper is not up to his task following bad news...', 'Antoine Peyralout is baker Mouillefarine''s tricycle delivery man. Comical and stuttering, Antoine shows more interest in the local soccer team than in professional integrity. A wedding cake pays the price for it and the young man is dismissed. Not dispirited in the least, Antoine decides to go to Nice, where his favorite team will play the final of the Cup. On his merry (and eventful) way, he has the opportunity to save a pretty camper, Popeline, with whom he falls in love. Once in Nice, he discovers that Dabek, the brilliant goal-keeper is not up to his task following bad news...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zSZXQJofQdernnSzO7eP6QdJ34i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:169958'),
  ('1087809139516092616', 'The Trigger Effect', 1996, 'Drama, Thriller', 'David Koepp, Newton Thomas Sigel', 'David Koepp', 'Kyle MacLachlan, Elisabeth Shue, Dermot Mulroney, Richard T. Jones, Bill Smitrovich, Michael Rooker, Tori Kristiansen, Tyra Kristiansen', 'R', 'A blackout leaves those affected to consider what is necessary, what is legal, and what is questionable, in order to survive in a predatory environment.', 'A blackout leaves those affected to consider what is necessary, what is legal, and what is questionable, in order to survive in a predatory environment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9LZLXVwhhmkdye4JXoLP06fm5G2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58770'),
  ('891313008788647829', 'The Trip', 1967, 'Drama', 'Roger Corman, Paul Rapp, Dennis Hopper', 'Jack Nicholson', 'Peter Fonda, Susan Strasberg, Bruce Dern, Dennis Hopper, Salli Sachse, Barboura Morris, Judy Lang, Luana Anders', null, 'After his wife leaves him, a disillusioned director dives into the drug scene, trying anything his friend suggests.', 'After his wife leaves him, a disillusioned director dives into the drug scene, trying anything his friend suggests.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tRX6gEJ4G1oFBDxEGdIhfogdjCN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22694'),
  ('1134336231186894698', 'The Trip', 2002, 'Drama, Romance', 'Miles Swain, Alexa Sheehan, Charles L. Barbee', 'Miles Swain', 'Larry Sullivan, Steve Braun, Jill St. John, Ray Baker, Sirena Irwin, Alexis Arquette, Art Hindle, Julie Brown', 'R', 'When 19-year-old gay-rights activist Tommy and 24-year-old Alan first meet in 1973, they find themselves on the opposite sides of the political coin...', 'When 19-year-old gay-rights activist Tommy and 24-year-old Alan first meet in 1973, they find themselves on the opposite sides of the political coin...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9eaNr0CYiEaofbw5MF5Nsr2MnOI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15850'),
  ('1042340772519535410', 'The Trip', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Harold Trompetero, Manuel Castañeda, Jacques Toulemonde', 'Dago García', 'Antonio Sanint, Carolina Gómez, María Margarita Giraldo, Adelaida López, Miguel Canal, Jack Villalobos, Luis Fernando Múnera, Álvaro Rodríguez', null, 'Alex Peinado decides to takes his family on a road trip to Cartagena after 11 years of continuous work. But he also has a secret plan at the same time.', 'Alex Peinado decides to takes his family on a road trip to Cartagena after 11 years of continuous work. But he also has a secret plan at the same time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/woNVTsjF0cu7gM2j39NGmQiTrht.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88278'),
  ('125208888797233244', 'The Trip', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Michael Winterbottom, Ben Smithard, Brian James Fitzpatrick', 'Michael Winterbottom', 'Steve Coogan, Rob Brydon, Claire Keelan, Margo Stilley, Paul Popplewell, Rebecca Johnson, Dolya Gavanski, Kerry Shale', 'NR', 'When Steve Coogan is asked by The Observer to tour the country''s finest restaurants, he envisions it as the perfect getaway with his beautiful girlfriend. But, when she backs out on him, he has no one to accompany him but his best friend and source of eternal aggravation, Rob Brydon.', 'When Steve Coogan is asked by The Observer to tour the country''s finest restaurants, he envisions it as the perfect getaway with his beautiful girlfriend. But, when she backs out on him, he has no one to accompany him but his best friend and source of eternal aggravation, Rob Brydon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tjGrjHNjsR0klih0bkGBHbukMdX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63578'),
  ('262978675852851182', 'The Trip', 2021, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Matthew Weston, Annett Ødegaard, Matthew Cooper', 'John Niven, Tommy Wirkola, Nick Ball', 'Noomi Rapace, Aksel Hennie, Atle Antonsen, Christian Rubeck, André Eriksen, Nils Ole Oftebro, Stig Frode Henriksen, Tor Erik Gunstrøm', null, 'A dysfunctional couple head to a remote lakeside cabin under the guise of reconnecting, but each has secret designs to kill the other. Before they can carry out their respective plans, unexpected visitors arrive and the couple is faced with a greater danger than anything they could have plotted.', 'A dysfunctional couple head to a remote lakeside cabin under the guise of reconnecting, but each has secret designs to kill the other. Before they can carry out their respective plans, unexpected visitors arrive and the couple is faced with a greater danger than anything they could have plotted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ebG8W3shUDBqhOz3VmB4m02HkFf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:760747'),
  ('51513894648692830', 'The Trip 2', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Harold Trompetero, Ignacio Gonzalez', 'Dago García', 'John Leguizamo, Karen Martínez, María Gabriela de Faría, Kristina Lilley, Sebastián Suárez, Martín Karpan, Marcela Carvajal, Julio Cesar Herrera', null, 'Lucho Calvo and his family arrive to Cartagena to have a memorable familiar vacation, but in his despair to bring a perfect vacation to his family, all his plans don''t go well.', 'Lucho Calvo and his family arrive to Cartagena to have a memorable familiar vacation, but in his despair to bring a perfect vacation to his family, all his plans don''t go well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cgPKC6IGeNQAFNwI9tckuUFQpZr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:212877'),
  ('423768891288152909', 'The Trip 3', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Juan Camilo Pinzón, Sergio Iván Castaño', 'Dago García', 'Alberto Barrero, Claudia Liliana González, Margalida Castro, Nicole Santamaría, Variel Sánchez, Salvatore Basile, Jacques Toukhmanian, César Mora', null, 'At the end of the vacations Alvaro Crespo plans the best return home with his peculiar family, but instead of being a quiet and pleasant trip, it becomes an odyssey when the family is involved in a robbery and will have to flee from the police, while they manage to prove their innocence.', 'At the end of the vacations Alvaro Crespo plans the best return home with his peculiar family, but instead of being a quiet and pleasant trip, it becomes an odyssey when the family is involved in a robbery and will have to flee from the police, while they manage to prove their innocence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lNP4isKBejt5UF2mdEm2Fgy0o6x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:395895'),
  ('351538462156336586', 'The Trip 4', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Juan Camilo Pinzón, Manuel Castañeda', 'Dago García', 'Diego Vásquez, Aída Morales, María Margarita Giraldo, Víctor Tarazona, Manuela Valdés Ruiz, Fernando Solórzano, Adelaida Buscato, Mijail Mulkay', null, 'The Rubio family leaves their Colombian hometown of Sasaima for a vacation in Miami, where they make a splash with their colorful charm and naïveté.', 'The Rubio family leaves their Colombian hometown of Sasaima for a vacation in Miami, where they make a splash with their colorful charm and naïveté.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xJUrHQwwiWVZYUYjvqRKNHVDsJd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:434608'),
  ('425498125069999611', 'The Trip 5', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Mario Ribero Ferreira, Diego Jiménez, Álvaro Cortés', 'Dago García', 'Adriana Ricardo, Waldo Urrego, José Daniel Cristancho, Gill González, Ricardo Mejía, John Alex Castillo, Alma Rodríguez, Catalina Londoño', null, 'A group of employees from the Central Worker''s Bank become heroes when they prevent a robbery. Their reward: a trip to Melgar, all expenses paid. This trip will reveal joys, griefs and other feelings that perhaps only appear after a few shots.', 'A group of employees from the Central Worker''s Bank become heroes when they prevent a robbery. Their reward: a trip to Melgar, all expenses paid. This trip will reveal joys, griefs and other feelings that perhaps only appear after a few shots.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2R22DxXMIxpl21AXOdqktkbzWzy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:565527'),
  ('236974746583731008', 'The Trip 6', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Rodrigo Triana, Daniel Moure, Manuel Alejandro Gómez', 'Dago García', 'Amparo Grisales, Jhon Álex Toro, Cecilia Navia, Michell Orozco, Cristian Duque, Andrés de la Mora, Armando Ortíz, Julián Navarro', null, 'Unwilling to let his daughter attend a high school trip unsupervised, a protective father and his charismatic mother-in-law show up to crash the party.', 'Unwilling to let his daughter attend a high school trip unsupervised, a protective father and his charismatic mother-in-law show up to crash the party.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5vSFW0rxMDZg8j5cr0JICBDSrGM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:920143'),
  ('1106006275962925685', 'The Trip 7', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Ricardo Coral, David Andrés Coral, Carlos Arango De Montis', 'Dago García', 'Víctor Hugo Trespalacios, Aída Morales, Paula Estrada, David Trejos, Bárbara Perea, Julio Pachón, Julián Díaz, Liliana Gonzalez', null, 'Two naive documentary filmmakers decide to venture out and accompany the Cabello family, to discover, on a chaotic trip, why there is no one in the family who would miss the plan next to the river.', 'Two naive documentary filmmakers decide to venture out and accompany the Cabello family, to discover, on a chaotic trip, why there is no one in the family who would miss the plan next to the river.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h8Pfn0FFCBw7ayuseFiLH9VbOXi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1222560'),
  ('941824975730772520', 'The Trip 8', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Felipe Martínez Amador', 'Dago García', 'Victoria Ortiz, Erick Cañete, Christian Tappán, Constanza Hernández, Variel Sánchez, Maya Zapata, Fernando Memije, Daniela Tapia', null, 'After meeting in Paris, Rosa and Pierre, her French boyfriend, decided to travel to Colombia with the hope of celebrating their wedding and spending their honeymoon. But plans change after introducing the in-laws, who, driven by a bombshell secret, decide to stop the happy marriage at all costs. Amid absurd situations and a dog who, apparently, is the only sane one on the trip, the long-awaited honeymoon will end up turning into a real honeymoon from hell.', 'After meeting in Paris, Rosa and Pierre, her French boyfriend, decided to travel to Colombia with the hope of celebrating their wedding and spending their honeymoon. But plans change after introducing the in-laws, who, driven by a bombshell secret, decide to stop the happy marriage at all costs. Amid absurd situations and a dog who, apparently, is the only sane one on the trip, the long-awaited honeymoon will end up turning into a real honeymoon from hell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oP4BuJ4toBC5KLczNy9c38cMgbr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1586841'),
  ('1064183497088337986', 'The Trip to Bountiful', 1985, 'Drama', 'Fred Murphy, Peter Masterson', 'Horton Foote', 'Geraldine Page, John Heard, Carlin Glynn, Richard Bradford, Rebecca De Mornay, Kevin Cooney, Harvey Lewis, Gil Glasgow', 'PG', 'Carrie Watts is living the twilight of her life trapped in an apartment in 1940s Houston, Texas with a controlling daughter-in-law and a hen-pecked son. Her fondest wish – just once before she dies – is to revisit Bountiful, the small Texas town of her youth which she still refers to as "home."', 'Carrie Watts is living the twilight of her life trapped in an apartment in 1940s Houston, Texas with a controlling daughter-in-law and a hen-pecked son. Her fondest wish – just once before she dies – is to revisit Bountiful, the small Texas town of her youth which she still refers to as "home."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qJ6A6fvp8PLFxxLVPLveFUmTOCG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47908'),
  ('424378383113694630', 'The Trip to Greece', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Thanasis Kafetzis, Thanassis Kafetzis, Zoe Liang', null, 'Steve Coogan, Rob Brydon, Claire Keelan, Rebecca Johnson, Marta Barrio, Timothy Leach, Cordelia Bugeja, Justin Edwards', 'PG-13', 'Steve Coogan and Rob Brydon continue their travelogue series with a visit to Greece.', 'Steve Coogan and Rob Brydon continue their travelogue series with a visit to Greece.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jeO1whXLtQrCNAvjlO4XeAea0rP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:611179'),
  ('305337961329743437', 'The Trip to Italy', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Michael Winterbottom, James Clarke, Zoe Liang', 'Michael Winterbottom', 'Steve Coogan, Rob Brydon, Rosie Fellner, Claire Keelan, Marta Barrio, Timothy Leach, Ronni Ancona, Rebecca Johnson', 'NR', 'Years after their successful restaurant review tour of Northern England, Steve Coogan and Rob Brydon are commissioned for a new tour in Italy.', 'Years after their successful restaurant review tour of Northern England, Steve Coogan and Rob Brydon are commissioned for a new tour in Italy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gbdN1MGJI2vIV9yKqDkAsazWQIT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:242088'),
  ('492490003349952456', 'The Trip to Panama', 2006, 'Adventure, Family, Animation', 'Martin Otevrel, Guido Schmelich', 'Guido Schmelich', 'Til Schweiger, Dietmar Bär, Ralf Schmitz, Mirco Nontschew, Anke Engelke, Santiago Ziesmer, Friedrich Schoenfelder, Gerald Schaale', null, 'The two friends Little Tiger and Little Bear live happily together in a little house by the lake. But when they find a strange wooden crate from Panama, they both fantasise about a beautiful place where everything is bigger, better and more beautiful.', 'The two friends Little Tiger and Little Bear live happily together in a little house by the lake. But when they find a strange wooden crate from Panama, they both fantasise about a beautiful place where everything is bigger, better and more beautiful.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hw5DgvvhrByvxFE4dYs7I125Bn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29283'),
