  ('696967104821673545', 'The Trip to Squash Land', 1967, 'Fantasy, Adventure, Animation', 'Lars von Trier', null, null, null, 'The earliest recognized film by Lars Trier (made in his youth before he adopted the "von") is this stop motion cartoon, where a super-sausage saves a bunny.', 'The earliest recognized film by Lars Trier (made in his youth before he adopted the "von") is this stop motion cartoon, where a super-sausage saves a bunny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ff0zqgBGMxj8YdvcPjcjY8OO4VR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:209209'),
  ('1072552896097604257', 'The Triple Conjurer and the Living Head', 1900, 'Comedy', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Georges Méliès', null, 'A conjurer (along with two duplicates) conjure up (and then cause to vanish) a beautiful woman head-first.', 'A conjurer (along with two duplicates) conjure up (and then cause to vanish) a beautiful woman head-first.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8sec0fiN0PEAIzHDBus7IqTJgju.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106805'),
  ('28807564405862672', 'The Triple Echo', 1972, 'Drama, War', 'Michael Apted, John Coquillon', 'Robin Chapman', 'Glenda Jackson, Oliver Reed, Brian Deacon, Anthony May, Gavin Richards, Jenny Lee Wright, Kenneth Colley, Daphne Heard', null, 'After her husband is captured during WWII, homesteader Alice is forced to maintain their land herself. One day, a wandering soldier named Barton stops by the farm and the pair begin a relationship. When the military police pass through the area looking for deserters, Barton is forced to disguise himself as a woman to stay with Alice. But he soon catches the eye of a sergeant posted nearby.', 'After her husband is captured during WWII, homesteader Alice is forced to maintain their land herself. One day, a wandering soldier named Barton stops by the farm and the pair begin a relationship. When the military police pass through the area looking for deserters, Barton is forced to disguise himself as a woman to stay with Alice. But he soon catches the eye of a sergeant posted nearby.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8oRVuHySIdMX286CtBcXMLASvth.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43701'),
  ('179345413517375626', 'The Triplets of Belleville', 2003, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Sylvain Chomet, Sylvain Chomet', 'Sylvain Chomet', 'Suzy Falk, Lina Boudreau, Betty Bonifassi, Michèle Caucheteux, Jean-Claude Donda, Mari-Lou Gauthier, Charles Linton, Monica Viegas', 'PG-13', 'When her grandson is kidnapped during the Tour de France, Madame Souza and her beloved pooch Bruno team up with the Belleville Sisters—an aged song-and-dance team from the days of Fred Astaire—to rescue him.', 'When her grandson is kidnapped during the Tour de France, Madame Souza and her beloved pooch Bruno team up with the Belleville Sisters—an aged song-and-dance team from the days of Fred Astaire—to rescue him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/enw6C4fDw88g0nOQgIJXjgH3NHi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9662'),
  ('412263787179356335', 'The Tripper', 2006, 'Horror, Comedy', 'David Arquette, Bobby Bukowski', 'Joe Harris', 'David Arquette, Courteney Cox, Richmond Arquette, Paz de la Huerta, Lukas Haas, Balthazar Getty, Redmond Gleeson, Jaime King', 'R', 'A Ronald Reagan-obsessed serial killer targets a bunch of hippies who are heading to a weekend-long concert.', 'A Ronald Reagan-obsessed serial killer targets a bunch of hippies who are heading to a weekend-long concert.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ffdwEch96j7I2MhSC23c5gihUL6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9847'),
  ('268666189770446849', 'The Triumph of Sherlock Holmes', 1935, 'Thriller, Mystery, Crime', 'Leslie S. Hiscott, James Davidson, W.L. Trytel', null, 'Arthur Wontner, Lyn Harding, Leslie Perrins, Ian Fleming, Charles Mortimer, Minnie Rayner, Michael Shepley, Jane Carr', 'NR', 'Holmes, retired to Sussex, is drawn into a last case when his arch enemy Moriarty arranges with an American gang to kill one John Douglas, a country gentleman with a mysterious past. Holmes'' methods baffle Watson and Lestrade, but his results astonish them. In a long flashback, the victim''s wife tells the story of the sinister Vermissa Valley.', 'Holmes, retired to Sussex, is drawn into a last case when his arch enemy Moriarty arranges with an American gang to kill one John Douglas, a country gentleman with a mysterious past. Holmes'' methods baffle Watson and Lestrade, but his results astonish them. In a long flashback, the victim''s wife tells the story of the sinister Vermissa Valley.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l2JQqEq7nu4SJ5uyeEwX0fAjBg6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48251'),
  ('1004191198715360692', 'The Triumph of the Nerds: The Rise of Accidental Empires', 1996, 'Documentary', 'Paul Sen', 'Bob Cringely', 'Bob Cringely, Steve Jobs, Bill Gates, Steve Wozniak, Larry Ellison, Paul G. Allen', null, 'It happened more or less by accident; the people who made it happen were amateurs; and for the most part they still are. From his own Silicon Valley garage, author Bob Cringley puts PC bigshots and nerds on the spot, and tells their incredible true stories. Like the industry itself, the series is informative, funny and brash.', 'It happened more or less by accident; the people who made it happen were amateurs; and for the most part they still are. From his own Silicon Valley garage, author Bob Cringley puts PC bigshots and nerds on the spot, and tells their incredible true stories. Like the industry itself, the series is informative, funny and brash.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8lZRJGB15UlVjy2kgYVl8JluWV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15554'),
  ('395028499268147181', 'The Trixxer', 2004, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Tobi Baumann, Nina Sollich, Gerhard Schirlo', 'Oliver Welke, Bastian Pastewka, Oliver Kalkofe', 'Oliver Kalkofe, Bastian Pastewka, Thomas Fritsch, Tanja Wenzel, Olli Dittrich, Christoph Maria Herbst, Thomas Heinze, Anke Engelke', null, 'A mysterious serial killer is shocking the underworld. Scotland Yard is investigating the case. Clues lead the detectives to Blackwhite Castle.', 'A mysterious serial killer is shocking the underworld. Scotland Yard is investigating the case. Clues lead the detectives to Blackwhite Castle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tHcKs8FBYsxxHV3COhBM2EsY0eL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7281'),
  ('776378955700992224', 'The Trojan Horse', 1961, 'History, Adventure, War', 'Giorgio Ferroni, Rino Filippini, Piero Braccialini', 'Giorgio Ferroni, Ugo Liberatore, Federico Zardi', 'Steve Reeves, Juliette Mayniel, John Drew Barrymore, Lidia Alfonsi, Edy Vessel, Warner Bentivegna, Luciana Angiolillo, Arturo Dominici', 'NR', 'Trojan hero Aeneas battles to save his city from the Greeks, but once Troy falls, he leads the 600 survivors to Italy and founds the city of Rome.', 'Trojan hero Aeneas battles to save his city from the Greeks, but once Troy falls, he leads the 600 survivors to Italy and founds the city of Rome.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rVmO7O9jkEaGOoL1viGQxNP4eBZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146023'),
  ('230212179968401585', 'The Trojan Women', 1971, 'Drama', 'Mihalis Kakogiannis, Alfio Contini', 'Edith Hamilton', 'Katharine Hepburn, Vanessa Redgrave, Geneviève Bujold, Irene Papas, Patrick Magee, Brian Blessed, Alberto Sanz, Pauline Letts', 'PG', 'In the aftermath of the Trojan Wars, Queen Hecuba takes stock of the defeated kingdom. Her son has been killed, and his widow, Andromache, is left to raise their son, Astyanax, alone. Hecuba''s daughter, Cassandra, fears being enslaved by her Greek masters, while Helen of Troy risks being executed. Astyanax also becomes the focus of the Greeks'' attention as the last male heir of the Trojan royal family.', 'In the aftermath of the Trojan Wars, Queen Hecuba takes stock of the defeated kingdom. Her son has been killed, and his widow, Andromache, is left to raise their son, Astyanax, alone. Hecuba''s daughter, Cassandra, fears being enslaved by her Greek masters, while Helen of Troy risks being executed. Astyanax also becomes the focus of the Greeks'' attention as the last male heir of the Trojan royal family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o6EjYCJXNc9VpeJOyJ1UsRP1hYV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47446'),
  ('1014158152967111781', 'The Trotsky', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Jacob Tierney, Guy Dufaux', 'Jacob Tierney', 'Jay Baruchel, Emily Hampshire, Geneviève Bujold, Colm Feore, Jessica Paré, Tommie-Amber Pirie, Kaniehtiio Horn, Erika Rosenbaum', 'NR', 'Leon Bronstein is not your average Montreal West high school student. For one thing, none of his peers can claim to be the reincarnation of early 20th century Soviet iconoclast and Red Army hero, Leon Trotsky. When his father sends Leon to public school as punishment for starting a hunger strike at Papa''s clothing factory, Leon quickly lends new meaning to the term ''student union'', determined as he is to live out his pre-ordained destiny to the fullest and change the world.', 'Leon Bronstein is not your average Montreal West high school student. For one thing, none of his peers can claim to be the reincarnation of early 20th century Soviet iconoclast and Red Army hero, Leon Trotsky. When his father sends Leon to public school as punishment for starting a hunger strike at Papa''s clothing factory, Leon quickly lends new meaning to the term ''student union'', determined as he is to live out his pre-ordained destiny to the fullest and change the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dSZRDk2xpVdf0BHVqKnSeVUIxLH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46584'),
  ('1131741872839332958', 'The Trouble I See', 2026, 'Documentary', 'Sally O''Grady, Patrick Gregory', null, 'Tonette Jones, Rashaan Williams, Jamillah Jones, Joey Atkins', 'Not Rated', 'Set inside the Richmond City Jail, The Trouble I See… follows two incarcerated fathers chosen to participate in a powerful father-daughter dance. Spanning five years, this deeply moving documentary explores generational cycles of incarceration, gun violence, and systemic inequality—while celebrating the unbreakable bonds of family, love, and resilience.', 'Set inside the Richmond City Jail, The Trouble I See… follows two incarcerated fathers chosen to participate in a powerful father-daughter dance. Spanning five years, this deeply moving documentary explores generational cycles of incarceration, gun violence, and systemic inequality—while celebrating the unbreakable bonds of family, love, and resilience.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FgPdpfwQrr04nbSmTzqrdlMOlthv.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-trouble-i-see'),
  ('940629920083947184', 'The Trouble with Angels', 1966, 'Comedy', 'Ida Lupino, Lionel Lindon', 'Blanche Hanalis', 'Hayley Mills, June Harding, Rosalind Russell, Binnie Barnes, Camilla Sparv, Mary Wickes, Marge Redmond, Dolores Sutton', 'PG', 'Mary and her friend, Rachel, are new students at St. Francis Academy, a boarding school run by the iron fist of Mother Superior. The immature teens grow bored and begin playing pranks on both the unsuspecting nuns and their unpleasant classmates, becoming a constant thorn in Mother Superior''s side. However, as the years pass, Mary and Rachel slowly mature and begin to see the nuns in a different light.', 'Mary and her friend, Rachel, are new students at St. Francis Academy, a boarding school run by the iron fist of Mother Superior. The immature teens grow bored and begin playing pranks on both the unsuspecting nuns and their unpleasant classmates, becoming a constant thorn in Mother Superior''s side. However, as the years pass, Mary and Rachel slowly mature and begin to see the nuns in a different light.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bv0yTpB2so7mtjG7VIbZyfuJaO1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38606'),
  ('85406542402970879', 'The Trouble with Being Born', 2020, 'Science Fiction, Drama', 'Timm Kröger, Sandra Wollner, Astrid Schäfer', 'Sandra Wollner, Roderick Warich', 'Lena Watson, Dominik Warta, Ingrid Burkhard, Jana McKinnon, Simon Hatzl, Susanne Gschwendtner', null, 'Elli is an android and lives with a man she calls her father. Together they drift through the summer. During the day they swim in the pool and at night he takes her to bed. She shares his memories and anything else he programs her to recall. Memories that mean everything to him but nothing to her. Yet, one night she sets off into the woods following a fading echo… The story of a machine and the ghosts we all carry within us.', 'Elli is an android and lives with a man she calls her father. Together they drift through the summer. During the day they swim in the pool and at night he takes her to bed. She shares his memories and anything else he programs her to recall. Memories that mean everything to him but nothing to her. Yet, one night she sets off into the woods following a fading echo… The story of a machine and the ghosts we all carry within us.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qwGRTBVfUTEnNBQNg14S1Hrjzfi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:664589'),
  ('430572987633141833', 'The Trouble with Bliss', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Michael Knowles, Ben Wolf', 'Douglas Light, Michael Knowles', 'Michael C. Hall, Brie Larson, Peter Fonda, Glenn Kubota, Lucy Liu, Brad William Henke, Chris Messina, Mary Goggin', 'PG-13', '35-year-old Morris Bliss is clamped in the jaws of New York City inertia: he wants to travel but has no money, he needs a job but has no prospects, he still shares an apartment with his widowed father, and the premature death of his mother has left him emotionally walled up. When he finds himself wrapped up in an awkward relationship with Stephanie, the 18-year-old daughter of a former classmate, Morris quickly discovers his static life unraveling and opening up in ways that are long overdue.', '35-year-old Morris Bliss is clamped in the jaws of New York City inertia: he wants to travel but has no money, he needs a job but has no prospects, he still shares an apartment with his widowed father, and the premature death of his mother has left him emotionally walled up. When he finds himself wrapped up in an awkward relationship with Stephanie, the 18-year-old daughter of a former classmate, Morris quickly discovers his static life unraveling and opening up in ways that are long overdue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jpBpUvy6sHzcACt5iJaDPAoEmdJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90122'),
  ('735541162620976659', 'The Trouble with Girls', 1969, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'Peter Tewksbury, John Clarke Bowman, Jacques R. Marquette', 'Arnold Peyser, Lois Peyser', 'Elvis Presley, Marlyn Mason, Nicole Jaffe, Sheree North, Edward Andrews, John Carradine, Anissa Jones, Vincent Price', 'G', 'Chautauqua manager Walter Hale and his loyal business manager struggle to keep their traveling troupe together in small town America.', 'Chautauqua manager Walter Hale and his loyal business manager struggle to keep their traveling troupe together in small town America.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hMGjplBCvmnpFTielOBvbNx82ym.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45598'),
  ('77794030995910599', 'The Trouble with Harry', 1955, 'Comedy, Mystery', 'Alfred Hitchcock, Robert Burks, Howard Joslin', 'John Michael Hayes', 'John Forsythe, Shirley MacLaine, Edmund Gwenn, Mildred Natwick, Mildred Dunnock, Jerry Mathers, Royal Dano, Parker Fennelly', 'PG', 'The trouble with Harry is that he’s dead. In a quiet Vermont village, a corpse creates unexpected chaos as several townspeople each believe they may be to blame.', 'The trouble with Harry is that he’s dead. In a quiet Vermont village, a corpse creates unexpected chaos as several townspeople each believe they may be to blame.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uUXLq7fEG3hI46ZFMZzgHj11S6S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11219'),
  ('11491295289814021', 'The Trouble with Jessica', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama, Crime', 'Matt Winn, Tristan Oliver', 'Matt Winn, James Handel', 'Alan Tudyk, Shirley Henderson, Rufus Sewell, Olivia Williams, Indira Varma, Anne Reid, Sylvester Groth, David Schaal', null, 'Sarah and Tom are in terrible financial trouble. On the brink of losing everything, they’ve managed to find a buyer for their stylish London home. When their best friends Richard and Beth come round for a final dinner, an uninvited old friend, Jessica, tags along.', 'Sarah and Tom are in terrible financial trouble. On the brink of losing everything, they’ve managed to find a buyer for their stylish London home. When their best friends Richard and Beth come round for a final dinner, an uninvited old friend, Jessica, tags along.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9wCT73zvdbX8gkvocS5nU68T1IG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1056746'),
  ('1005461290754408534', 'The Trouble with Spies', 1987, 'Comedy, Adventure, Action', 'Burt Kennedy, Álex Phillips Jr.', 'Burt Kennedy', 'Donald Sutherland, Ned Beatty, Ruth Gordon, Lucy Gutteridge, Michael Hordern, Robert Morley, Gregory Sierra, Suzanne Danielle', 'PG-13', 'George Trent, a British spy, has gone incommunicado in Ibiza. Appleton Porter (Donald Sutherland) is sent to find out what happened to Trent. Porter settles into a small hotel with several busybody guests. He probes them for information about Trent, their former neighbor. Meanwhile, the spy survives several attempts on his life as he attempts to solve the mystery.', 'George Trent, a British spy, has gone incommunicado in Ibiza. Appleton Porter (Donald Sutherland) is sent to find out what happened to Trent. Porter settles into a small hotel with several busybody guests. He probes them for information about Trent, their former neighbor. Meanwhile, the spy survives several attempts on his life as he attempts to solve the mystery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/daZGGLrccuN7IZNh8opBXBA8MKf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119383'),
  ('1042888889635933470', 'The Trouble with You', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance, Crime', 'Pierre Salvadori, Julien Poupard', 'Benjamin Charbit, Pierre Salvadori, Benoît Graffin', 'Adèle Haenel, Pio Marmaï, Audrey Tautou, Damien Bonnard, Vincent Elbaz, Octave Bossuet, Hocine Choutri, Alexandre Marouani', null, 'Detective Yvonne is the widow of police chief Santi, a local hero in a town on the French Riviera. When she learns he was in fact a crooked cop, she tries to right his wrongs. Crossing paths with Antoine, a victim of Santi, sets off a series of wild events.', 'Detective Yvonne is the widow of police chief Santi, a local hero in a town on the French Riviera. When she learns he was in fact a crooked cop, she tries to right his wrongs. Crossing paths with Antoine, a victim of Santi, sets off a series of wild events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n8MFhzVkIYhsZYFgzJNnl2wDxmi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:519106'),
  ('649818964363197161', 'The Troublemaker', 1951, 'Comedy', 'Gilberto Martínez Solares, Jorge Stahl Jr., Jesús González Gancy', null, 'Germán Valdés, Rebeca Iturbide, Perla Aguiar, Marcelo Chávez, Wolf Ruvinskis, Juan García, José René Ruiz, Charles Rooner', null, 'Well-intentioned Tin Tan who is always making trouble for other people, sometimes on purpose and sometimes by accident.', 'Well-intentioned Tin Tan who is always making trouble for other people, sometimes on purpose and sometimes by accident.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/phQTVdX1lfSEQDK191gD4QwfTr4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:335225'),
  ('1053778695533430376', 'The Troubles of Alfred', 1972, 'Comedy', 'Pierre Richard', 'Yves Robert, Roland Topor, Pierre Richard', 'Pierre Richard, Anny Duperey, Jean Carmet, Paul Préboist, Yves Robert, Paul Le Person, Mario David, Robert Dalban', null, 'Unlucky in love, Alfred tries to commit suicide, only to be thwarted by police efforts to prevent a simultaneous attempt by a nearby young woman. Recovering, the young lady puts him up at her house, as he has run out of places to live. He joins a Parisian sporting team and seems to have transferred his bad luck to a corrupt television boss who is attempting to manipulate the game so that Alfred''s Paris team loses.', 'Unlucky in love, Alfred tries to commit suicide, only to be thwarted by police efforts to prevent a simultaneous attempt by a nearby young woman. Recovering, the young lady puts him up at her house, as he has run out of places to live. He joins a Parisian sporting team and seems to have transferred his bad luck to a corrupt television boss who is attempting to manipulate the game so that Alfred''s Paris team loses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b1upysXG6WkdH9b6EzGPJWq9b6S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67420'),
  ('42998849333462259', 'The Troubleshooter', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Julien Guetta', 'Dominique Baumard', 'Éric Judor, Laure Calamy, Brigitte Roüan, Philippe Duquesne, Déborah Lukumuena, Satya Dusaugey, Louise Labèque, Ilan Debrabant', null, 'Alex, 43, is not a man of many responsibilities. He works as a tow truck driver in the car repair garage run with an iron fist by his mother Antoinette. She hopes he will someday take over the business, but Alex manages to consistently prove that he’s not up to the task. One day, he assists a woman whose car broke down and ends up spending the night at her place. The next morning, she is nowhere to be found, and Alex discovers he is alone... with three kids!', 'Alex, 43, is not a man of many responsibilities. He works as a tow truck driver in the car repair garage run with an iron fist by his mother Antoinette. She hopes he will someday take over the business, but Alex manages to consistently prove that he’s not up to the task. One day, he assists a woman whose car broke down and ends up spending the night at her place. The next morning, she is nowhere to be found, and Alex discovers he is alone... with three kids!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aEzrseBVEWsCMZwbo4qVXAqHoB9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:510469'),
  ('336706388566719526', 'The Troubleshooters', 1988, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Mi Jiashan', 'Mi Jiashan', 'Zhang Guoli, Ge You, Liang Tian, Pan Hong, Ma Xiaoqing, Geng Li, Hou Yaohua, Qi Mo', null, 'For anyone with tricky personal troubles — marital, professional and otherwise — Yu Guan and his buddies have a new business that will provide the solution, from taking the abuse of a man’s nagging wife to showering an obscure writer with awards.', 'For anyone with tricky personal troubles — marital, professional and otherwise — Yu Guan and his buddies have a new business that will provide the solution, from taking the abuse of a man’s nagging wife to showering an obscure writer with awards.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x7dGWxmBqozw9PHtRdvZy8Q7XDl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:191463'),
  ('315534061179422045', 'The Trough', 2018, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Nick Cheung Ka-Fai, Chung Lam-Hung', 'Nick Cheung Ka-Fai, Wen Ning', 'Nick Cheung Ka-Fai, Xu Jinglei, Lam Suet, Ni Dahong, Vithaya Pansringarm, Yuen Wah, Louis Cheung, He Jiong', null, 'Yu Chau is a cop who has gone so deep undercover within the triad. He can no longer tell which side of the law he''s on. When he accidentally kills one of his pals in an operation, he runs off into the boonies to lick his wounds. Upon his return, he teams up with fellow officers Jim and Jackie to catch a triad Boss, only to unveil collusion with government officials at the highest level. Yu Chau once again faces the dilemma of taking the law into his own hands...', 'Yu Chau is a cop who has gone so deep undercover within the triad. He can no longer tell which side of the law he''s on. When he accidentally kills one of his pals in an operation, he runs off into the boonies to lick his wounds. Upon his return, he teams up with fellow officers Jim and Jackie to catch a triad Boss, only to unveil collusion with government officials at the highest level. Yu Chau once again faces the dilemma of taking the law into his own hands...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9LiqCJBLkSRzRZuRCUW17ysB0NN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:521288'),
  ('398010922591880588', 'The Trout', 1982, 'Romance, Drama', 'Joseph Losey, Henri Alekan', 'Monique Lange, Joseph Losey', 'Isabelle Huppert, Jean-Pierre Cassel, Jeanne Moreau, Daniel Olbrychski, Jacques Spiesser, Isao Yamagata, Jean-Paul Roussillon, Roland Bertin', null, 'The sexual and social dysfunctional behaviour of the corporate elite are further aggravated when a naive married woman becomes the obsession of two wealthy suitors.', 'The sexual and social dysfunctional behaviour of the corporate elite are further aggravated when a naive married woman becomes the obsession of two wealthy suitors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9p9119YyTz43a8I4amfy0hEwCBw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92238'),
  ('1137201763727097652', 'The Truce', 1974, 'Romance, Drama', 'Sergio Renán, Carlos Galettini', 'Aída Bortnik, Sergio Renán', 'Héctor Alterio, Luis Brandoni, Ana María Picchio, Marilina Ross, Aldo Barbero, Juan José Camero, Carlos Carella, Cipe Lincovsky', null, 'A man has to come to terms with his wasted youth, estranged family and grim prospects for the future.', 'A man has to come to terms with his wasted youth, estranged family and grim prospects for the future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1R0I3Jm91smJnt84HEJTg61cAKP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127449'),
  ('466846673811558590', 'The Truce', 1997, 'Drama, History, War', 'Francesco Rosi, Gianni Arduini, Carolina Rosi', 'Francesco Rosi, Stefano Rulli, Sandro Petraglia', 'John Turturro, Massimo Ghini, Rade Šerbedžija, Roberto Citran, Claudio Bisio, Andy Luotto, Lorenza Indovina, Stefano Dionisi', null, 'After the liberation of Auschwitz, an Italian prisoner of War begins a torturous voyage home to Turin, through a Europe caught between war and peace.', 'After the liberation of Auschwitz, an Italian prisoner of War begins a torturous voyage home to Turin, through a Europe caught between war and peace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k4GWXtFvRQ8zKuf6ICOpjcyNjYE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30529'),
  ('78506403588656060', 'The Truce', 2025, 'Drama, History', 'Miguel Ángel Vivas, Rafa García, Natalia Rodriguez', 'Miguel Ángel Vivas, Ignasi Rubio, Fran Carballal', 'Miguel Herrán, Arón Piper, Javier Pereira, Fernando Valdivielso, Alejandro Jato, Federico Pérez Rey, José Pastor, Manel Llunell', null, 'Karlag, short for Karaganda Corrective Labor Camp, was one of the largest labor camps within the Soviet Gulag system. Established in 1931, it was located in the Karagandy Region of Kazakhstan. The film will explore the hardships faced by people during the 1930s-1950s and the resilience of human dignity despite the daily struggle for survival. The atmosphere of Karlag will be conveyed through costumes, props, and sets created after extensive research in archives and museums.', 'Karlag, short for Karaganda Corrective Labor Camp, was one of the largest labor camps within the Soviet Gulag system. Established in 1931, it was located in the Karagandy Region of Kazakhstan. The film will explore the hardships faced by people during the 1930s-1950s and the resilience of human dignity despite the daily struggle for survival. The atmosphere of Karlag will be conveyed through costumes, props, and sets created after extensive research in archives and museums.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gk3VVTTRWVhuAVpuxJrGKCKBat5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1434973'),
  ('1002449360307691941', 'The Truce Hurts', 1948, 'Animation, Comedy', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera', null, 'Billy Bletcher, William Hanna', 'NR', 'Butch convinces Tom and Jerry that there''s no reason to fight and they should all sign a peace treaty. Tom and Butch even rescue their pals from a fellow cat and dog. But then a steak falls off a truck and the boys can''t decide how to divvy it up, ultimately losing it completely, and the truce is off.', 'Butch convinces Tom and Jerry that there''s no reason to fight and they should all sign a peace treaty. Tom and Butch even rescue their pals from a fellow cat and dog. But then a steak falls off a truck and the boys can''t decide how to divvy it up, ultimately losing it completely, and the truce is off.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yR4bYgCq5DETlrH28PlNB3kP7Ty.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40239'),
  ('154814515692519799', 'The Truck', 2008, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Kwon Hyung-jin', 'Jang Hyung-mo', 'Yoo Hai-jin, Jin Goo, Kim Joon-bae, Jang Jun-nyeong, Lee Chae-young, Ji Soo-won, Kim Jung-hak, Park Jeong-hak', null, 'Cheol-min makes a living by working in the shipping business. He has a daughter suffering from a heart condition, and in need of surgery. To save his daughter, he urgently needs the tremendous amount of 60,000,000 won. To make this money, he gets involved in dangerous illegal gambling and barely saves his life by promising he will take care of body disposal for the gang. On his way to Gangwon-do where he intends to dump the bodies, he encounters a police van that had been in an accident, and ends up giving the police officer a ride. Although this situation is tense, events take a turn for the worse.', 'Cheol-min makes a living by working in the shipping business. He has a daughter suffering from a heart condition, and in need of surgery. To save his daughter, he urgently needs the tremendous amount of 60,000,000 won. To make this money, he gets involved in dangerous illegal gambling and barely saves his life by promising he will take care of body disposal for the gang. On his way to Gangwon-do where he intends to dump the bodies, he encounters a police van that had been in an accident, and ends up giving the police officer a ride. Although this situation is tense, events take a turn for the worse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rXKg2UHplq2GoJjBEebt1UmHLDb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47830'),
  ('724539922690988511', 'The True Adventures of Wolfboy', 2019, 'Drama', 'Martin Krejčí, Patrick Cunningham, Craig A. Pinckes', 'Olivia Dufault', 'Jaeden Martell, Sophie Giannamore, John Turturro, Eve Hewson, Chris Messina, Michelle Wilson, Chloë Sevigny, Stephen McKinley Henderson', null, 'Follows a young boy who runs away from home in the search of his estranged mother.', 'Follows a young boy who runs away from home in the search of his estranged mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mF2ZYPwhMwRp1rJSCI7KKIkw4fc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:509932'),
  ('139931119896389492', 'The True Cost', 2015, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Andrew Morgan', 'Andrew Morgan', 'Vandana Shiva, Stella McCartney, Stephen Colbert, John Oliver, Richard Wolff, Mark Crispin Miller', 'PG-13', 'Film from Andrew Morgan. The True Cost is a documentary film exploring the impact of fashion on people and the planet.', 'Film from Andrew Morgan. The True Cost is a documentary film exploring the impact of fashion on people and the planet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x7oDFes0HCWAYAwlEA5b3TCqX9S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:339065'),
  ('1008564755950393663', 'The True Game of Death', 1978, 'Action', 'Chen Hsin-I', 'Zhang Zong-Yang', 'Lung Tien-hsiang, Lee Man-Tai, Tang Chia-Chuan, Pang San, Alice Meyer, Ali Tai, Chang Chung-Yang, Si Wai', null, 'The film begins with footage of Bruce Lee''s funeral. The narrator then says that there is a new actor "who looks quite like him" that will become Lee''s successor. His name is Hsao Lung. Later Hsao Lung is filming a movie. On the set, he is approached by a group of gangsters, led by a man named George, who want to control Hsao Lung. Hsao Lung declines, so they go after his girlfriend Alice, forcing her poison Hsao. During sex, the poison takes action and Hsao supposedly dies. Hsao fakes his death and pretends to be a chef so that he can watch over Alice. Alice is kidnapped by the gangsters, so Hsao starts looking for her and goes to a shipyard. There he fights off 4 motorcycle-riding gangsters that are wearing multi-colored tracksuits, one of them being the iconic green and black one from Game of Death. He defeats them and goes to the tower of death.', 'The film begins with footage of Bruce Lee''s funeral. The narrator then says that there is a new actor "who looks quite like him" that will become Lee''s successor. His name is Hsao Lung. Later Hsao Lung is filming a movie. On the set, he is approached by a group of gangsters, led by a man named George, who want to control Hsao Lung. Hsao Lung declines, so they go after his girlfriend Alice, forcing her poison Hsao. During sex, the poison takes action and Hsao supposedly dies. Hsao fakes his death and pretends to be a chef so that he can watch over Alice. Alice is kidnapped by the gangsters, so Hsao starts looking for her and goes to a shipyard. There he fights off 4 motorcycle-riding gangsters that are wearing multi-colored tracksuits, one of them being the iconic green and black one from Game of Death. He defeats them and goes to the tower of death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kZ2FCR5KQwUNRjWF2koU5fc5FqF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:272461'),
  ('353463600930373661', 'The True Glory', 1945, 'Documentary, War', 'Garson Kanin, Carol Reed', 'Paddy Chayefsky', 'Leslie Banks, Robert Harris, Sam Levene, Peter Ustinov, Dwight D. Eisenhower, George S. Patton, Richard Attenborough, Winston Churchill', 'NR', 'A documentary account of the allied invasion of Europe during World War II compiled from the footage shot by nearly 1400 cameramen. It opens as the assembled allied forces plan and train for the D-Day invasion at bases in Great Britain and covers all the major events of the war in Europe from the Normandy landings to the fall of Berlin.', 'A documentary account of the allied invasion of Europe during World War II compiled from the footage shot by nearly 1400 cameramen. It opens as the assembled allied forces plan and train for the D-Day invasion at bases in Great Britain and covers all the major events of the war in Europe from the Normandy landings to the fall of Berlin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x0WVHmRXeNOyqtXGniOIf5jshda.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49011'),
  ('617182205530198441', 'The True Story of Ah Q', 1981, 'Drama', 'Fuxi Xu, Chen Zhenxiang, Cen Fan', 'Chen Baichen', 'Yan Shunkai, Li Wei, Yikang Jin, Wang Suya, Youyun Zhang, Li Dingbao, Baohe Yang, Fuming Bao', null, 'Based on the 1921 novella of the same name by one of China''s most well-known modern writers, Lu Xun (Lu Hsun), the True Story of Ah Q is set during the 1911 revolution. Ah Q is a lowly peasant who wants to rise above his class, or at least get out of his grinding poverty. At first he thinks the way to do it is by marrying into a better station in life; later, he joins the revolution as he feels that is the only way he and others like him can transcend poverty. In this film version of Lu Xun''s story, the character of Ah Q might benefit from a more rounded humanity to make him appealing to those not familiar with the harsh environment in China before the 1911 revolution.', 'Based on the 1921 novella of the same name by one of China''s most well-known modern writers, Lu Xun (Lu Hsun), the True Story of Ah Q is set during the 1911 revolution. Ah Q is a lowly peasant who wants to rise above his class, or at least get out of his grinding poverty. At first he thinks the way to do it is by marrying into a better station in life; later, he joins the revolution as he feels that is the only way he and others like him can transcend poverty. In this film version of Lu Xun''s story, the character of Ah Q might benefit from a more rounded humanity to make him appealing to those not familiar with the harsh environment in China before the 1911 revolution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3CoTYHKPGUNUr0KSHcvHMkody36.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198484'),
  ('207238677174868057', 'The True Story of Jesse James', 1957, 'Western', 'Nicholas Ray', 'Walter Newman, Nunnally Johnson', 'Robert Wagner, Jeffrey Hunter, Hope Lange, Agnes Moorehead, Alan Hale Jr., Alan Baxter, John Carradine, Rachel Stephens', 'NR', 'Having fought with the Confederacy during the Civil War, Jesse James and his brother Frank dream of a farm life in Missouri. Harassed by Union sympathizers, they assemble a gang of outlaws, robbing trains and becoming folk heroes in the process. Jesse marries his sweetheart, Zee, and maintains an aura of domesticity, but after a group of lawmen launch an attack on his mother''s house, Jesse plans one more great raid -- on a Minnesota bank.', 'Having fought with the Confederacy during the Civil War, Jesse James and his brother Frank dream of a farm life in Missouri. Harassed by Union sympathizers, they assemble a gang of outlaws, robbing trains and becoming folk heroes in the process. Jesse marries his sweetheart, Zee, and maintains an aura of domesticity, but after a group of lawmen launch an attack on his mother''s house, Jesse plans one more great raid -- on a Minnesota bank.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dB7Qium9wQXEjakLsgRcagt9eKO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83354'),
  ('1131318767720064828', 'The True Story of Pirates', 2022, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Stéphane Bégoin', 'Stéphane Bégoin', 'Jean Soulat, Martin Mares, Anna Flori-Lamour, Philippe Hrodej, Edward Mayhew', 'PG-13', 'Thanks to new excavations in Mauritius and Madagascar, as well as archival and museum research in France, Spain, England and Canada, a group of international scholars paint a new portrait of the world of piracy in the Indian Ocean.', 'Thanks to new excavations in Mauritius and Madagascar, as well as archival and museum research in France, Spain, England and Canada, a group of international scholars paint a new portrait of the world of piracy in the Indian Ocean.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a30btJePt2UrLLF1esu8vdVBzFT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1068126'),
  ('283508454699451725', 'The True Story of Puss ''n Boots', 2009, 'Family, Adventure, Animation', 'Macha Makeïeff, Jérôme Deschamps, Pascal Hérold', 'Pascal Hérold', 'Jérôme Deschamps, Yolande Moreau, Louise Wallon, Arthur Deschamps, Jean-Claude Bolle-Reddat', 'G', 'Following the death of their miller father, his eldest son inherits the mill, the middle one a donkey, and the youngest a cat. While initially disappointed, the lad soon learns not only that the cat can talk but is quite resourceful.', 'Following the death of their miller father, his eldest son inherits the mill, the middle one a donkey, and the youngest a cat. While initially disappointed, the lad soon learns not only that the cat can talk but is quite resourceful.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/va4tC2RBC0uwpmq0cctruJmZgFs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25353'),
  ('41279428726970188', 'The True Story of the Nun of Monza', 1980, 'Drama', 'Bruno Mattei, Giuseppe Bernardini', 'Claudio Fragasso', 'Zora Kerova, Mario Cutini, Paola Corazzi, Annie Carol Edel, Franco Garofalo, Paola Montenero, Mario Novelli, Ornella Picozzi', null, 'Sister Virginia de Leyva becomes the new Mother Superior at the convent of Monza. Said convent turns out to be a veritable hotbed of sinful carnality and depravity. Debauched priest Don Arrigone and lecherous womanizer Giampaolo Osio plot to seduce sister Virginia. But will their wicked and lustful actions continue to go unnoticed?', 'Sister Virginia de Leyva becomes the new Mother Superior at the convent of Monza. Said convent turns out to be a veritable hotbed of sinful carnality and depravity. Debauched priest Don Arrigone and lecherous womanizer Giampaolo Osio plot to seduce sister Virginia. But will their wicked and lustful actions continue to go unnoticed?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dXpw7vnJff4Wf52UbQWB5TIXwiI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69570'),
  ('227292900633492551', 'The True Story of the Weeping Woman', 2007, 'Horror', 'Miguel A. Martinez, Aurora Martínez', 'Aurora Martínez', 'Brenda Castro, Eleazar García Jr., Antonio Lozano', null, 'A woman dreams every night that she wanders around the city screaming for her dead children and realizes that the old house where she lives is actually the tomb of murdered children.', 'A woman dreams every night that she wanders around the city screaming for her dead children and realizes that the old house where she lives is actually the tomb of murdered children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vgDOARN4pZM5rK0ktXUVmgG4Ys8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:516830'),
  ('933789399798049033', 'The Truffle Hunters', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Michael Dweck, Gregory Kershaw', null, 'Carlo Gonella, Sergio Cauda, Aurelio Conterno, Angelo Gagliardi, Maria Cicciù, Gianfranco Curti, Paolo Stacchini, Piero Botto', 'PG-13', 'In the secret forests of Northern Italy, a dwindling group of joyful old men and their faithful dogs search for the world’s most expensive ingredient, the white Alba truffle. Their stories form a real-life fairy tale that celebrates human passion in a fragile land that seems forgotten in time.', 'In the secret forests of Northern Italy, a dwindling group of joyful old men and their faithful dogs search for the world’s most expensive ingredient, the white Alba truffle. Their stories form a real-life fairy tale that celebrates human passion in a fragile land that seems forgotten in time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A8kuHpb1AKvRVbYbxBK4hua008p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:653762'),
  ('892198102115974775', 'The Truk', 2018, 'Drama', 'Sarah Marx, Rabeir Ourak', 'Ekoué Labitey, Sarah Marx, Hamé', 'Sandor Funtek, Alexis Manenti, Sandrine Bonnaire, Lauréna Thellier, Virginie Acariès, Julie Meunier, Sacha Bejaoui, Moussa Sylla', null, 'Fresh out of jail, Ulysse has only one idea in mind: making money. Confronted by his depressed mother, Gabrielle, the bills that never stop piling up and his desire to live his life to the full, he makes a plan. With his best friend, David, he travels from rave to rave, selling a mixture of water and Ketamine from their food truck. Together, they hit the road...', 'Fresh out of jail, Ulysse has only one idea in mind: making money. Confronted by his depressed mother, Gabrielle, the bills that never stop piling up and his desire to live his life to the full, he makes a plan. With his best friend, David, he travels from rave to rave, selling a mixture of water and Ketamine from their food truck. Together, they hit the road...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uqV9TCwXvXaHz1vm9jX0alsp4ea.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:539048'),
  ('259824005065668940', 'The Truman Show', 1998, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Peter Weir, Peter Biziou, Marco Rubeo', 'Andrew Niccol', 'Jim Carrey, Laura Linney, Noah Emmerich, Natascha McElhone, Holland Taylor, Ed Harris, Paul Giamatti, Brian Delate', 'PG', 'In a picture-perfect seaside town, an insurance salesman begins to realize that his entire existence may be staged and observed by a vast unseen audience as part of a reality TV show.', 'In a picture-perfect seaside town, an insurance salesman begins to realize that his entire existence may be staged and observed by a vast unseen audience as part of a reality TV show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vuza0WqY239yBXOadKlGwJsZJFE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37165'),
