  ('1015306095996238406', 'The Truth About Bebe Donge', 1952, 'Drama', 'Henri Decoin, Léonce-Henri Burel', 'Maurice Aubergé', 'Danielle Darrieux, Jean Gabin, Gabrielle Dorziat, Claude Génia, Jacques Castelot, Daniel Lecourtois, Marcel André, Madeleine Lambert', null, 'François Donge, a rich industrialist and womaniser, meets a girl nicknamed Bébé who he marries. Ten years later, poisoned by his wife and dying in hospital, he recalls his married life and understands how his wife who adored him suffered from his many affairs and indifference.', 'François Donge, a rich industrialist and womaniser, meets a girl nicknamed Bébé who he marries. Ten years later, poisoned by his wife and dying in hospital, he recalls his married life and understands how his wife who adored him suffered from his many affairs and indifference.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pe0gZ8osPo05iEbZxIur0YwDYsH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63224'),
