  ('1068578510176844052', 'The Truth About Charlie', 2002, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Jonathan Demme, Tak Fujimoto, Anne Ventura', 'Marcel Moussy, François Truffaut, Peter Stone', 'Thandiwe Newton, Mark Wahlberg, Tim Robbins, Christine Boisson, LisaGay Hamilton, Park Joong-hoon, Ted Levine, Stephen Dillane', 'PG-13', 'Regina meets charming Joshua while vacationing in Martinique, as she contemplates ending her whirlwind marriage to enigmatic Charlie. Upon her return to Paris, she finds that both her apartment and her bank account have been emptied, and her husband has been murdered. Stuck in ever-increasing danger and with four men pursuing her, another stranger offers assistance - but who can she trust?', 'Regina meets charming Joshua while vacationing in Martinique, as she contemplates ending her whirlwind marriage to enigmatic Charlie. Upon her return to Paris, she finds that both her apartment and her bank account have been emptied, and her husband has been murdered. Stuck in ever-increasing danger and with four men pursuing her, another stranger offers assistance - but who can she trust?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kQ6SdbWStviMhTFt5tatjpGvRGV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13440'),
  ('62740818271845005', 'The Truth About Emanuel', 2013, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Francesca Gregorini, Polly Morgan, Jim Charleston', 'Francesca Gregorini', 'Kaya Scodelario, Jessica Biel, Alfred Molina, Frances O''Connor, Jimmi Simpson, Aneurin Barnard, Sam Jaeger, Jonathan Schmock', 'NR', 'A troubled young woman becomes obsessed with her mysterious new neighbor, who bears a striking resemblance to the girl''s dead mother.', 'A troubled young woman becomes obsessed with her mysterious new neighbor, who bears a striking resemblance to the girl''s dead mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z98jqAlVlnXyYnTlC95Na8FQXHF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:157351'),
  ('808026257211673155', 'The Truth About Jane', 2000, 'Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'Lee Rose, Eric Van Haren Noman', 'Lee Rose', 'Ellen Muth, Stockard Channing, James Naughton, Noah Fleiss, RuPaul, Kelly Rowan, Jenny O''Hara, Alicia Lagano', null, 'High schooler Jane struggles with the self-discovery that she is a lesbian after developing an intense friendship with another girl. However, this is only the start of Jane''s troubles when her unaccepting mother Janice also contends with the surprising revelation brought forth by her only daughter.', 'High schooler Jane struggles with the self-discovery that she is a lesbian after developing an intense friendship with another girl. However, this is only the start of Jane''s troubles when her unaccepting mother Janice also contends with the surprising revelation brought forth by her only daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e4BheMHfvzFxCKWOWG4CdV2YaOr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52805'),
  ('277319041641348891', 'The Truth About Jussie Smollett?', 2025, 'Documentary', 'Gagan Rehill, Ryan Earl Parker', null, 'Jussie Smollett, Donald Trump, Stephen Colbert, Lee Daniels, Rahm Emanuel, Robin Roberts, Dave Chappelle', 'R', 'The shocking true story of an allegedly fake story that some now say might just be a true story. With first-hand interviews from those at the helm, including investigating police, lawyers, journalists and Jussie himself, this compelling documentary invites the audience to decide for themselves who is telling The Truth About Jussie Smollett?', 'The shocking true story of an allegedly fake story that some now say might just be a true story. With first-hand interviews from those at the helm, including investigating police, lawyers, journalists and Jussie himself, this compelling documentary invites the audience to decide for themselves who is telling The Truth About Jussie Smollett?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iRR9Ri2GX3c5bikrz1Zuj4u5bkl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1517212'),
  ('214336107990401135', 'The Truth About Love', 2005, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'John Hay, Graham Frake', 'Peter Bloore, William Johnston', 'Jennifer Love Hewitt, Dougray Scott, Jimi Mistry, Kate Miles, Branka Katić, Stefan Dennis, Simon Webbe, Thomas S.W. Boyd', 'R', 'As part of a drunken bet with her sister Felicity, happily married Alice sends an anonymous Valentine''s card to her husband Sam to see if he hides it. When he does, what was a prank leads to a series of events and revelations that may put her marriage at risk, and leaves her looking for answers.', 'As part of a drunken bet with her sister Felicity, happily married Alice sends an anonymous Valentine''s card to her husband Sam to see if he hides it. When he does, what was a prank leads to a series of events and revelations that may put her marriage at risk, and leaves her looking for answers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h4vfB0pL7YDY9DUIvnYWGlSjKdf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14933'),
  ('1071279363786527848', 'The Truth About Love Is...', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Max Croci, Fabio Zamarion', 'Federico Sperindei', 'Ambra Angiolini, Massimo Poggio, Carolina Crescentini, Edoardo Pesce, Arisa, Pia Engleberth, Giuliana De Sio, Gabriele Anagni', null, 'Dora, raises her two children with the help of her eccentric family, free-spirited best friend, and a charming poet-turned- nanny.', 'Dora, raises her two children with the help of her eccentric family, free-spirited best friend, and a charming poet-turned- nanny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/udA49ZVjWcf7FX5D4IzUyyUxnOK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:447916'),
  ('1017402738104662610', 'The Truth About Mother Goose', 1957, 'Animation', 'Bill Justice, Wolfgang Reitherman', null, 'John Dehner, Page Cavanaugh, Kevin Corcoran, Ginny Tyler', 'NR', 'We learn the true stories behind various nursery rhymes. Little Jack Horner: a servant to a city official was delivering a present to King Henry VIII, baked, as was the custom of the time, in a pie. The present was the deed to a valuable estate, which Horner stole. Mary, Mary, Quite Contrary: Mary Stuart brought "quite contrary" French style to the Scottish court. After a series of disastrous romances, she was jailed; the jailer''s son, captivated by her, helped her escape. After a brief but disastrous attempted coup, she fled to England, where her sister, Queen Elizabeth, soon grew jealous and had her imprisoned. London Bridge: The bridge, finished in 1209, was soon lined by shops with luxury apartments upstairs, turning into a popular commercial and cultural zone. The Great Fire that broke out in 1666 spread to the bridge, but the houses were rebuilt. Over the ages, things decayed. In 1823, things finally got bad enough that the bridge was demolished and replaced.', 'We learn the true stories behind various nursery rhymes. Little Jack Horner: a servant to a city official was delivering a present to King Henry VIII, baked, as was the custom of the time, in a pie. The present was the deed to a valuable estate, which Horner stole. Mary, Mary, Quite Contrary: Mary Stuart brought "quite contrary" French style to the Scottish court. After a series of disastrous romances, she was jailed; the jailer''s son, captivated by her, helped her escape. After a brief but disastrous attempted coup, she fled to England, where her sister, Queen Elizabeth, soon grew jealous and had her imprisoned. London Bridge: The bridge, finished in 1209, was soon lined by shops with luxury apartments upstairs, turning into a popular commercial and cultural zone. The Great Fire that broke out in 1666 spread to the bridge, but the houses were rebuilt. Over the ages, things decayed. In 1823, things finally got bad enough that the bridge was demolished and replaced.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dC3MdgktwiPuAahS0P3ORGC7jwM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97884'),
  ('926150645891857934', 'The Truth About Spring', 1965, 'Adventure, Comedy, Drama', 'Richard Thorpe, Ted Sturgis, Edward Scaife', 'James Lee Barrett', 'Hayley Mills, John Mills, James MacArthur, Lionel Jeffries, Harry Andrews, Niall MacGinnis, David Tomlinson, Lionel Murton', null, 'Tommy Tyler, a lazy Caribbean sailor, and his tom-boy daughter, Spring, are out to search for a buried treasure. Tommy brings aboard William Ashton, a young lawyer, to help with the search. Ashton turns out to be handy when they encounter dangerous rivals. Tommy also tries to play match maker between Ashton and Spring – a difficult task indeed.', 'Tommy Tyler, a lazy Caribbean sailor, and his tom-boy daughter, Spring, are out to search for a buried treasure. Tommy brings aboard William Ashton, a young lawyer, to help with the search. Ashton turns out to be handy when they encounter dangerous rivals. Tommy also tries to play match maker between Ashton and Spring – a difficult task indeed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bq1SWRxGmQhsQgxs9vSxuO7V1KG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:192988'),
  ('118881759255898962', 'The Truth and Tragedy of Moriah Wilson', 2026, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Marina Zenovich, Ben Bloodwell, Clair Popkin', null, 'Olivia Sinnott', null, 'An intimate, arresting portrait of cyclist Moriah Wilson—raised by a fierce, loving family—whose singular drive becomes her superpower, carrying her to athletic brilliance and, devastatingly, toward a life cut short by murder.', 'An intimate, arresting portrait of cyclist Moriah Wilson—raised by a fierce, loving family—whose singular drive becomes her superpower, carrying her to athletic brilliance and, devastatingly, toward a life cut short by murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zoa2XatA43nKhF1kx8nVcVyH1M0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1629369'),
  ('334623655983870227', 'The Truth Beneath', 2016, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Lee Kyoung-mi, Son Jae-hyuk, Ju Sung-lim', 'Jung So-young, Park Chan-wook, Lee Kyoung-mi', 'Son Ye-jin, Kim Joo-hyuk, Choi Yu-hwa, Kim Min-jae, Park Jin-woo, Son Seong-chan, Kim Eui-sung, Shin Ji-hoon', 'PG-13', 'For 15 days, a politician and his wife navigate a scandal after their daughter goes missing on the eve of the national elections.', 'For 15 days, a politician and his wife navigate a scandal after their daughter goes missing on the eve of the national elections.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vpEpvGpwUw96c7vmDaVHpupo5RN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:401133'),
  ('777964546183778410', 'The Truth on the Savolta Affair', 1980, 'Drama', 'Antonio Drove, Gilberto Azevedo, José María Ochoa', 'Antonio Drove, Antonio Larreta', 'José Luis López Vázquez, Charles Denner, Omero Antonutti, Ovidi Montllor, Alfredo Pea, Stefania Sandrelli, Pau Garsaball, Alfred Lucchetti', null, 'Barcelona between 1917 and 1923. Is the era of gangsterism, during which gunmen clash between anarchists and thugs paid by The Patronal showed a shocking number of deaths. The confrontation between anarchists and workers of the factory owners Savolta arms worsens when Savolta family decides to end the rebellion hiring murderers hired and plotting to hide their illegal transactions with Germany. Adapted from the novel by Eduardo Mendoza.', 'Barcelona between 1917 and 1923. Is the era of gangsterism, during which gunmen clash between anarchists and thugs paid by The Patronal showed a shocking number of deaths. The confrontation between anarchists and workers of the factory owners Savolta arms worsens when Savolta family decides to end the rebellion hiring murderers hired and plotting to hide their illegal transactions with Germany. Adapted from the novel by Eduardo Mendoza.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vA8pIRDAKKzu5wUhznh23KNpLVq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144332'),
  ('449494695486390551', 'The Truth Shall Not Sink with Sewol', 2014, 'Documentary', 'Lee Sang-ho, Ahn Hae-ryong', null, 'Lee Sang-ho, Lee Jong-in, Sohn Suk-hee, Park Geun-hye', null, 'A documentary on the South Korean ferry disaster that claimed the lives of more than 300 passengers in April, 2014.', 'A documentary on the South Korean ferry disaster that claimed the lives of more than 300 passengers in April, 2014.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1MveFD2Da1IrYKp4Z4OLsFgCGl1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:298153'),
  ('391998465556841718', 'The Truth vs. Alex Jones', 2024, 'Documentary', 'Dan Reed', null, 'Alex E. Jones, Russell Dowden, Rob Jacobson, Josh Owens, Christopher Jordan, Mark Barden, Alissa Parker, Robbie Parker', 'R', 'Filmed over four years with unprecedented access, this documentary chronicles the riveting courtroom drama of two defamation lawsuits brought by Sandy Hook Elementary School shooting victims'' families against Alex Jones and his website, InfoWars.', 'Filmed over four years with unprecedented access, this documentary chronicles the riveting courtroom drama of two defamation lawsuits brought by Sandy Hook Elementary School shooting victims'' families against Alex Jones and his website, InfoWars.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9fbfpfAiN81knlV0gi0XyQnk7bS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1242397'),
  ('507428820075775150', 'The Trygon Factor', 1966, 'Crime', 'Cyril Frankel, Harry Waxman', 'Derry Quinn, Stanley Munro', 'Stewart Granger, Susan Hampshire, Cathleen Nesbitt, James Culliford, Brigitte Horney, Robert Morley, Sophie Hardy, Colin Gordon', null, 'A Scotland Yard detective is investigating a string of robberies and a murder, and the information he uncovers leads him to the estate of a wealthy but strange English family, who share their mansion with a group of nuns. The detective comes to suspect that neither the family nor the nuns is quite what they seem to be.', 'A Scotland Yard detective is investigating a string of robberies and a murder, and the information he uncovers leads him to the estate of a wealthy but strange English family, who share their mansion with a group of nuns. The detective comes to suspect that neither the family nor the nuns is quite what they seem to be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zLgeZ1g768KkqugQ8ysdm7fIzVf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98327'),
  ('146695863309149838', 'The Tsugua Diaries', 2021, 'Drama', 'Miguel Gomes, Maureen Fazendeiro, Mário Castanheira', 'Mariana Ricardo, Miguel Gomes, Maureen Fazendeiro', 'Crista Alfaiate, Carloto Cotta, João Nunes Monteiro, Isabel Cardoso, Joaquim Carvalho, Mário Castanheira, Maureen Fazendeiro, Miguel Gomes', null, 'Crista, Carloto and João are building an airy greenhouse for butterflies in the garden. The three of them share household routines, day after day… And they are not the only ones.', 'Crista, Carloto and João are building an airy greenhouse for butterflies in the garden. The three of them share household routines, day after day… And they are not the only ones.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1IFh89w4BrQNxFbmpuko7WqZLGo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:838146'),
