  ('1055216759618414845', 'The Tuche Family', 2011, 'Comedy, Family', 'Arnaud Stefani, Olivier Baroux', 'Philippe Mechelen', 'Jean-Paul Rouve, Isabelle Nanty, Claire Nadeau, Théo Fernandez, Sarah Stern, Pierre Lottin, Philippe Lefebvre, Fadila Belkebla', null, 'Everyone in the village of Bouzolles knows the Tuche family, who live by the philosophy "Man is not made to work." Despite their lack of money, they strive to be happy... that is, until their hand-to-mouth existence is turned on its head. After winning the lottery, the Tuches get rich beyond their wildest dreams and move to Monaco. And while attempting to fit in in their swanky new homeland, they struggle to stay true to the same principles by which they''ve always lived.', 'Everyone in the village of Bouzolles knows the Tuche family, who live by the philosophy "Man is not made to work." Despite their lack of money, they strive to be happy... that is, until their hand-to-mouth existence is turned on its head. After winning the lottery, the Tuches get rich beyond their wildest dreams and move to Monaco. And while attempting to fit in in their swanky new homeland, they struggle to stay true to the same principles by which they''ve always lived.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uG8o2RST9yx0N7IInzUNMAIGbxY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66129'),
  ('703013137641180765', 'The Tuche Family: The American Dream', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Christian Abomnes, Olivier Baroux', 'Julien Hervé, Nessim Chikhaoui, Lionel Dutemple', 'Jean-Paul Rouve, Isabelle Nanty, Sarah Stern, Claire Nadeau, Théo Fernandez, Pierre Lottin, Christian de la Cortina, Ralph Amoussou', null, 'Les Tuche, a modest french family, change his life after winning a super lottery. Thanks to the money of his parents, the son, Donald (aka "coin-coin") goes to Los Angeles to improve his english. On the L.A. University, he meets Jennifer, daughter of a famous American financier.', 'Les Tuche, a modest french family, change his life after winning a super lottery. Thanks to the money of his parents, the son, Donald (aka "coin-coin") goes to Los Angeles to improve his english. On the L.A. University, he meets Jennifer, daughter of a famous American financier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/27KhcV8Yd98yhEk6vcU1cKHn8Rj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:369776'),
  ('153772049741185982', 'The Tulse Luper Suitcases, Part 1: The Moab Story', 2003, 'War, Drama, Adventure, Romance', 'Peter Greenaway, Reinier van Brummelen', 'Peter Greenaway', 'JJ Feild, Raymond J. Barry, Ornella Muti, Michèle Bernier, Valentina Cervi, Caroline Dhavernas, Scot Williams, Anna Galiena', null, 'A comic study of 20th-century history, reconstructing the life of writer, creator and professional prisoner Tulse Luper. Born in 1911 Newport and last heard of in 1989, Luper’s life is pieced together from the evidence found in 92 suitcases scattered across the globe. In the first of three parts, we follow Luper through three distinct episodes: as a child during the First World War; as an explorer in Mormon Utah; and as a writer in Belgium during the rise of fascism.', 'A comic study of 20th-century history, reconstructing the life of writer, creator and professional prisoner Tulse Luper. Born in 1911 Newport and last heard of in 1989, Luper’s life is pieced together from the evidence found in 92 suitcases scattered across the globe. In the first of three parts, we follow Luper through three distinct episodes: as a child during the First World War; as an explorer in Mormon Utah; and as a writer in Belgium during the rise of fascism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/roUKvEKMSxxjo3Du0MIrwUHzjdN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3097'),
  ('20955433702044031', 'The Tumbling Trapalhões', 1981, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family, Music', 'Antônio Gonçalves, J.B. Tanko, Hélio Ribeiro', 'Tereza Trautman, Chico Buarque, Antonio Pedro', 'Renato Aragão, Dedé Santana, Mussum, Zacarias, Lucinha Lins, Mário Cardoso, Mila Moreira, Eduardo Conde', null, 'Humble officials, friends Didi, Dedé, Mussum and Zacarias become the great attraction of the circus Bartolo, thanks to its incredible ability to make the public laugh. But success has a price: the opposition of the magician Assis Satan and the greed of the Baron, the owner of the circus. Together, the four friends will have to fight them.', 'Humble officials, friends Didi, Dedé, Mussum and Zacarias become the great attraction of the circus Bartolo, thanks to its incredible ability to make the public laugh. But success has a price: the opposition of the magician Assis Satan and the greed of the Baron, the owner of the circus. Together, the four friends will have to fight them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bJdSknYRayF1YMHJM0sSwyR828e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88730'),
  ('903312584176247869', 'The Tumbling Trapalhões: Heading to Hollywood', 2017, 'Comedy, Music, Family', 'Hélcio Alemão Nagamine, João Daniel Tikhomiroff, Claudio Botelho', 'Mauro Lima', 'Renato Aragão, Dedé Santana, Letícia Colin, Emílio Dantas, Alinne Moraes, Marcos Frota, Livian Aragão, Rafael Vitti', null, 'Since the ban on use of animals in circus shows, the Great Sumatra Circus faces a major financial crisis. Baron, who owns the circus, accepts unseemly proposals from the mayor to hold cattle auctions, rallies and other alternative events at the circus. Unhappy with the news, circus artists come together to plan a new show and re-attract the audience, led by Didi, Dedé and Karina.', 'Since the ban on use of animals in circus shows, the Great Sumatra Circus faces a major financial crisis. Baron, who owns the circus, accepts unseemly proposals from the mayor to hold cattle auctions, rallies and other alternative events at the circus. Unhappy with the news, circus artists come together to plan a new show and re-attract the audience, led by Didi, Dedé and Karina.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yacasOzhUrO08YLwJxjk6oh0hIO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:430840'),
  ('313241146106810335', 'The Tune', 1992, 'Animation, Comedy, Music', 'Bill Plympton, John Donnelly', null, 'Daniel Neiden, Maureen McElheron, Marty Nelson, Emily Bindiger, Chris Hoffman, Jimmy Ceribello, Ned Reynolds, Jeff Knight', 'NR', 'Del is a song writer for the obnoxious Mr. Mega, and in love with Didi, Mega''s secretary. His quest to write a hit tune brings him to the wacky world of Flooby Nooby, where he just might learn to write songs from the heart.', 'Del is a song writer for the obnoxious Mr. Mega, and in love with Didi, Mega''s secretary. His quest to write a hit tune brings him to the wacky world of Flooby Nooby, where he just might learn to write songs from the heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4pheWWXiVMQ4zK6O9mm4YnSwZ6S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41313'),
  ('582867997051628957', 'The Tuner', 2005, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Kira Muratova, Gennady Karyuk, Yefim Turetsky', 'Sergei Chetvertkov, Yevhen Holubenko, Kira Muratova', 'Georgiy Deliev, Alla Demidova, Renata Litvinova, Nina Ruslanova, Sergey Bekhterev, Natalya Buzko, Zhan Daniel, Vladimir Komarov', null, 'A young piano tuner befriends two rich old-ladies, and plots, with the help of his girlfriend, to betray their trust and steal from them.', 'A young piano tuner befriends two rich old-ladies, and plots, with the help of his girlfriend, to betray their trust and steal from them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vPVuY2Ya1tXVZnVT8OiZL5X29Gj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61385'),
  ('684862191734460566', 'The Tunnel', 1935, 'Science Fiction', 'Maurice Elvey', 'L. du Garde Peach', 'Richard Dix, Leslie Banks, Madge Evans, Helen Vinson, C. Aubrey Smith, Basil Sydney, Henry Oscar, Hilda Trevelyan', 'NR', 'An engineer leads the building of a trans-Atlantic tunnel linking Britain and the United States.', 'An engineer leads the building of a trans-Atlantic tunnel linking Britain and the United States.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/90GSfO1eKuUnSCj94jRMGlDRS7v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29705'),
  ('237729440658465733', 'The Tunnel', 1988, 'Drama', 'Antonio Drove, José María Manzarbeitia, Gilberto Azevedo', 'Ernesto Sábato', 'Jane Seymour, Peter Weller, Fernando Rey, Manuel de Blas, Marga Herrera, Yelena Samarina, Tomás Sáez, Jaime Toja', 'R', 'A painter becomes obsessed and begins an affair with a mysterious woman who was touched deeply by one of his works.', 'A painter becomes obsessed and begins an affair with a mysterious woman who was touched deeply by one of his works.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8G7d6Wbbs8C3KUap3ImuYQ7JY9Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:189320'),
  ('8957477462858709', 'The Tunnel', 2001, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Roland Suso Richter, Martin Langer', 'Johannes W. Betz', 'Heino Ferch, Nicolette Krebitz, Sebastian Koch, Alexandra Maria Lara, Claudia Michelsen, Felix Eitner, Mehmet Kurtuluş, Heinrich Schmieder', null, 'Inspired by true events, Olympic swimmer Harry Melchior defects from East Germany in the 1960s and hatches a daring plot to help his sister and others flee East Berlin through a 145-yard underground tunnel.', 'Inspired by true events, Olympic swimmer Harry Melchior defects from East Germany in the 1960s and hatches a daring plot to help his sister and others flee East Berlin through a 145-yard underground tunnel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/teLjI0tmEytPJvP1uQWg0PTGa4A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3577'),
  ('685691047280300501', 'The Tunnel', 2011, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Steve Davis, Carlo Ledesma, Paul Brenner', 'Enzo Tedeschi, Julian Harvey', 'Bel Deliá, Luke Arnold, Andy Rodoreda, James Caitlin, Goran D. Kleut, Arianna Gusi, Peter McAllum, Shannon Jones', 'NR', 'In 2007, in the midst of the drought and water shortages, the NSW State government has unveiled plans to tap into and recycle millions of litres of water trapped in a network of abandoned train tunnels just beneath the heart of Sydney. However the government suddenly goes cold on the plan and it is not made public why. There is talk of homeless people who use the tunnel as shelter going missing, even though the government states that there are no homeless people in there. This, and the silence from the officials and ministers, leads a journalist, Natasha to begin an investigation into a government cover-up. She and her crew Pete (Producer), Steve (Cameraman) and Tangles (Sound Technichian) decide to investigate the story in the tunnel.', 'In 2007, in the midst of the drought and water shortages, the NSW State government has unveiled plans to tap into and recycle millions of litres of water trapped in a network of abandoned train tunnels just beneath the heart of Sydney. However the government suddenly goes cold on the plan and it is not made public why. There is talk of homeless people who use the tunnel as shelter going missing, even though the government states that there are no homeless people in there. This, and the silence from the officials and ministers, leads a journalist, Natasha to begin an investigation into a government cover-up. She and her crew Pete (Producer), Steve (Cameraman) and Tangles (Sound Technichian) decide to investigate the story in the tunnel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d9cWMXgqRYZhBqnf7UI4eaFTJsF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46221'),
  ('1126127776395979363', 'The Tunnel', 2014, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Park Gyu-Taek, Kang Seong-hoon', 'Yu Se-mun', 'Jeong Yu-mi, Song Jae-rim, Yeon Woo-jin, Son Byung-ho, Lee Si-won, Bae Woo-hee, Jeon Cho-bin, Min Do-hee', null, 'Ki-Chul drives his friends out to a resort situated by an abandoned coal mine. His father owns the resort. When they get there, they cross paths with a spooky man who warns them about the coal mine. Later, the friends find themselves in a desperate situation and enter the tunnels of the abandoned coal mine. Will they ever see the light of day again?', 'Ki-Chul drives his friends out to a resort situated by an abandoned coal mine. His father owns the resort. When they get there, they cross paths with a spooky man who warns them about the coal mine. Later, the friends find themselves in a desperate situation and enter the tunnels of the abandoned coal mine. Will they ever see the light of day again?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mLqQa5IAnIdYxPDRlKNKC5nvIAC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:294811'),
  ('567532606848619912', 'The Tunnel', 2017, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Pepón Montero, Carmela Martínez Oliart, José Moreno Moti', 'Juan Maidagán, Pepón Montero', 'Arturo Valls, Raúl Cimas, Natalia de Molina, Neus Asensi, Manel Barceló, Àlex Batllori, Abraham Fuya, Carmela Lloret', null, 'The thirteen survivors of a catastrophe by a tunnel''s collapse tries to balance their experience trapped along 15 days inside it with their day-by-day outside it.', 'The thirteen survivors of a catastrophe by a tunnel''s collapse tries to balance their experience trapped along 15 days inside it with their day-by-day outside it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kz6O0JgdXdTKddmY4SThac56VZP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:427109'),
  ('549179247804028835', 'The Tunnel', 2019, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Pål Øie, Sjur Aarthun', 'Kjersti Helen Rasmussen', 'Thorbjørn Harr, Ylva Fuglerud, Mikkel Bratt Silset, Lisa Carlehed, Ingvild Holthe Bygdnes, Per Egil Aske, Peter Førde, Daniel Alexander Skadal', null, 'When a truck crashes inside a tunnel, people on their way home for Christmas are brutally trapped in a deadly fire. With a blizzard raging outside, and the first responders struggling to get to the accident, it''s every man for himself.', 'When a truck crashes inside a tunnel, people on their way home for Christmas are brutally trapped in a deadly fire. With a blizzard raging outside, and the first responders struggling to get to the accident, it''s every man for himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x2Nkkk0znwNDtqCdZKFQNA4Ayxg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:606154'),
  ('750218496843185695', 'The Tunnel of Love', 1958, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Gene Kelly, Robert J. Bronner, Al Jennings', 'Joseph Fields, Jerome Chodorov', 'Doris Day, Richard Widmark, Gig Young, Gia Scala, Elisabeth Fraser, Elizabeth Wilson, Vikki Dougan, Doodles Weaver', 'NR', 'A series of misunderstandings leaves a married man believing he has impregnated the owner of an adoption agency, and that she will be his and his wife''s surrogate.', 'A series of misunderstandings leaves a married man believing he has impregnated the owner of an adoption agency, and that she will be his and his wife''s surrogate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Ka6ev90Lo8CAPPXM1Q3Snxf9ad.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45599'),
  ('610728054085024047', 'The Tunnel to Summer, the Exit of Goodbyes', 2022, 'Animation, Drama, Romance, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Tomomi Yabuki, Seiji Tachikawa, Tomomi Yabuki', 'Tomohisa Taguchi', 'Ouji Suzuka, Marie Iitoyo, Tasuku Hatanaka, Arisa Komiya, Haruka Terui, Rikiya Koyama, Seiran Kobayashi, Chiko Mizumori', 'PG-13', 'Urashima Tunnel – Once you enter that tunnel, you can get whatever you want, but at a price. Kaoru Tohno, who seems to have an elusive personality and traumatic past, and Anzu Hanashiro, who is struggling to reconcile her ideal image and true-to-heart attitude, team up to investigate the Urashima Tunnel and get what they want. This is an unforgettable summer story of nostalgia and sprinting in a remote countryside.', 'Urashima Tunnel – Once you enter that tunnel, you can get whatever you want, but at a price. Kaoru Tohno, who seems to have an elusive personality and traumatic past, and Anzu Hanashiro, who is struggling to reconcile her ideal image and true-to-heart attitude, team up to investigate the Urashima Tunnel and get what they want. This is an unforgettable summer story of nostalgia and sprinting in a remote countryside.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5AGA6pbBKXZTI8k1c6odx30JuQR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:916192'),
  ('426479739515832952', 'The Turbo Charged Prelude for 2 Fast 2 Furious', 2003, 'Action', 'Philip G. Atwell', 'Keith Dinielli', 'Paul Walker, Minka Kelly, Peter Aylward, Rodney Neil, Vin Diesel', null, 'Turbo-Charged Prelude is a 2003 short film, directed by Philip Atwell, featuring Paul Walker, reprising his role as Brian O''Conner, in a short series of sequences which bridge The Fast and The Furious with its first sequel, 2 Fast 2 Furious.', 'Turbo-Charged Prelude is a 2003 short film, directed by Philip Atwell, featuring Paul Walker, reprising his role as Brian O''Conner, in a short series of sequences which bridge The Fast and The Furious with its first sequel, 2 Fast 2 Furious.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cmhFOjy47UqrOafl0oQiygcJ7oT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77959'),
  ('793624545247359425', 'The Turin Horse', 2011, 'Drama', 'Béla Tarr, Fred Kelemen, Ágnes Hranitzky', 'Béla Tarr, László Krasznahorkai', 'János Derzsi, Erika Bók, Mihály Kormos, Lajos Kovács, Mihály Ráday', null, 'A monumental windstorm and an abused horse''s refusal to work or eat signal the beginning of the end for a poor farmer and his daughter.', 'A monumental windstorm and an abused horse''s refusal to work or eat signal the beginning of the end for a poor farmer and his daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2kSElneXSKmMsGL55k0CbPGqLbu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81401'),
  ('449847340112023330', 'The Turkish Coffee Table', 2026, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Can Evrenol, Hakan Dinçkuyucu, Ladin Esen', 'Can Evrenol, Caye Casas', 'Bora Gökşingöl, Alper Kul, Algı Eke, Hatice Aslan', null, 'When Zehra and İbrahim, a couple adjusting to new parenthood, argue over a coffee table, it seems like a harmless domestic spat. Wanting to assert himself for once, İbrahim insists on buying it. But when he’s left alone to assemble it, he makes a single irreversible mistake — and begins spiraling into a pit of lies, panic, and performative calm as he tries to hide the truth from the people he loves the most.', 'When Zehra and İbrahim, a couple adjusting to new parenthood, argue over a coffee table, it seems like a harmless domestic spat. Wanting to assert himself for once, İbrahim insists on buying it. But when he’s left alone to assemble it, he makes a single irreversible mistake — and begins spiraling into a pit of lies, panic, and performative calm as he tries to hide the truth from the people he loves the most.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FhQKsEox3iQmpCSHJPc9CohkmiT9.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-turkish-coffee-table'),
  ('529884164368300828', 'The Turkish Gambit', 2005, 'Mystery, Adventure, Action, Drama, History', 'Dzhanik Fayziev, Andrei Zhegalov, Mikhail Buyanov', 'Boris Akunin', 'Egor Beroev, Olga Krasko, Marat Basharov, Vladimir Ilin, Dmitriy Pevtsov, Viktor Verzhbitskiy, Aleksandr Baluev, Aleksey Guskov', null, 'The film is based on the second book from the Adventures of Erast Petrovich Fandorin series of novels written by the Russian author Boris Akunin. The film takes place in 1877 during the Russian-Turkish war. Erast Fandorin has just escaped from Turkish prison and is trying to get on the Russian side as soon as possible to give important information about the upcoming attack of the enemy. On his way he meets Varvara Suvorova, a young lady who is going to see her fiancée - a soldier of the Russian army. Erast also knows that there is a spy somewhere in the Russian army, everyone is under suspicion.', 'The film is based on the second book from the Adventures of Erast Petrovich Fandorin series of novels written by the Russian author Boris Akunin. The film takes place in 1877 during the Russian-Turkish war. Erast Fandorin has just escaped from Turkish prison and is trying to get on the Russian side as soon as possible to give important information about the upcoming attack of the enemy. On his way he meets Varvara Suvorova, a young lady who is going to see her fiancée - a soldier of the Russian army. Erast also knows that there is a spy somewhere in the Russian army, everyone is under suspicion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sgHkvzl6mcgorOQtr3Dt0Ppf18n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53129'),
  ('137078878621070858', 'The Turks Must Be Crazy', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Murat Aslan, Eyüp Boz', 'Murat Aslan', 'Peker Açıkalın, Önder Açıkbaş, Durul Bazan, Timur Acar, Erdem Akakçe, Ruhi Sarı, Burhan Öçal, Oya Aydoğan', null, 'The famous businessman Fahri and his family are kidnapped by Somali pirates. The pirates demand a large ransom from Turkey for the release of the businessman and his family. The Turkish government decides to form an illegal team for this task. Colonel Mehmet, who has been imprisoned for a long time, is offered this mission in exchange for his release. Mehmet, along with six people selected from the prisoners, will try to rescue Fahri and his family.', 'The famous businessman Fahri and his family are kidnapped by Somali pirates. The pirates demand a large ransom from Turkey for the release of the businessman and his family. The Turkish government decides to form an illegal team for this task. Colonel Mehmet, who has been imprisoned for a long time, is offered this mission in exchange for his release. Mehmet, along with six people selected from the prisoners, will try to rescue Fahri and his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/XSvRXJdfJffcIWxVvg36LixvMv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37575'),
  ('1004451794283761893', 'The Turn of the Screw', 1974, 'Drama, Thriller, Horror, TV Movie', 'Dan Curtis, Art Seidel, Ben Colman', 'William F. Nolan', 'Lynn Redgrave, Kathryn Leigh Scott, Megs Jenkins, John Barron, Anthony Langdon, Benedict Taylor, James Laurenson, Jasper Jacob', null, 'An English governess is hired to take care of two adorable orphans, who turn out to be not exactly what they seem to be.', 'An English governess is hired to take care of two adorable orphans, who turn out to be not exactly what they seem to be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8EgjTUOepTHNXEdtQxpbhPFhTuC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126689'),
  ('739009279756042294', 'The Turn of the Screw', 1992, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Rusty Lemorande, Witold Stok', 'Rusty Lemorande', 'Patsy Kensit, Stéphane Audran, Julian Sands, Marianne Faithfull, Laura Cox, Olivier Debray, Bryony Brind, Thomas Krygier', 'R', 'A young woman is hired by a wealthy but sinister man to tutor his two children at the family''s isolated estate. When the woman gets there, she finds that the two children are not quite what they seem to be--in fact, they are possessed by the spirits of the evil Quint and his lover.', 'A young woman is hired by a wealthy but sinister man to tutor his two children at the family''s isolated estate. When the woman gets there, she finds that the two children are not quite what they seem to be--in fact, they are possessed by the spirits of the evil Quint and his lover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/isU8DXeunHv0wCZFzy0Wf9Waufx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:135060'),
  ('1101951813540019894', 'The Turn of the Screw', 1999, 'Drama, Thriller, Horror, TV Movie', 'Ben Bolt, David Odd', null, 'Jodhi May, Colin Firth, Grace Robinson, Joe Sowerbutts, Caroline Pegg, Pam Ferris, Jason Salkey, Jenny Howe', null, 'A governess put in charge of two young children begins to see the ghost of her dead predecessor.', 'A governess put in charge of two young children begins to see the ghost of her dead predecessor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6onrGh18ZFxUZMDIJD3xdi0m0FQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46968'),
  ('314075042884757625', 'The Turn of the Screw', 2009, 'Thriller, Drama, Horror, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Tim Fywell, Tony Miller, Emma Saunders', 'Sandy Welch', 'Michelle Dockery, Eva Sayer, Josef Lindsay, Dan Stevens, Mark Umbers, Corin Redgrave, Wendy Albiston, Nicola Walker', null, 'A young governess, Ann, is sent to a country house to take care of two orphans, Miles and Flora. Soon after her arrival, Miles is expelled from boarding school. Although charmed by her young charge, she secretly fears there are ominous reasons behind his expulsion. With Miles back at home, the governess starts noticing ethereal figures roaming the estate''s grounds. Desperate to learn more about these sinister sightings she discovers that the suspicious circumstances surrounding the death of her predecessor hold grim implications for herself. As she becomes increasingly fearful that malevolent forces are stalking the children the governess is determined to save them, risking herself and her sanity in the process.', 'A young governess, Ann, is sent to a country house to take care of two orphans, Miles and Flora. Soon after her arrival, Miles is expelled from boarding school. Although charmed by her young charge, she secretly fears there are ominous reasons behind his expulsion. With Miles back at home, the governess starts noticing ethereal figures roaming the estate''s grounds. Desperate to learn more about these sinister sightings she discovers that the suspicious circumstances surrounding the death of her predecessor hold grim implications for herself. As she becomes increasingly fearful that malevolent forces are stalking the children the governess is determined to save them, risking herself and her sanity in the process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gU6VIBiClt3YwElPd0YEV5fqPmW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63517'),
  ('827107294433289709', 'The Turn-of-the-Century Blind Man', 1898, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Alice Guy-Blaché', null, null, null, 'A blind man begging for change tries to outsmart a cop. There is no known director for this film, although it is included in the filmography of Alice Guy-Blaché.', 'A blind man begging for change tries to outsmart a cop. There is no known director for this film, although it is included in the filmography of Alice Guy-Blaché.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hoRARM36BLTQP6zSq8rG9moVR2X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119951'),
  ('168239430817977789', 'The Turning', 2020, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Alice Vignoles-Russell, Jonas Spaccarotelli, Nigel Pollock', 'Chad Hayes, Carey Hayes', 'Mackenzie Davis, Finn Wolfhard, Brooklynn Prince, Mark Huberman, Niall Greig Fulton, Kim Adis, Joely Richardson, Denna Thomsen', 'PG-13', 'A young woman quits her teaching job to become a private tutor and governess for two wealthy young kids, but soon starts to suspect there’s more to their house than meets the eye.', 'A young woman quits her teaching job to become a private tutor and governess for two wealthy young kids, but soon starts to suspect there’s more to their house than meets the eye.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uiMHiHp9eAjJty8rddoUnL9G5fU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:492611'),
  ('1105554725279838403', 'The Turning Point', 1945, 'Drama, War', 'Fridrikh Ermler, Arkadi Koltsaty, Karl Gakkel', 'Boris Chirskov', 'Mikhail Derzhavin, Pyotr Andriyevsky, Yuriy Tolubeev, Andrei Abrikosov, Aleksandr Zrazhevsky, Nikolai Korn, S. Rakhmanin, Mark Bernes', null, 'The film tells the story of those who took part in the Battle of Stalingrad in 1942, which became a turning point in the Great Patriotic War. For five months, the city resisted the Nazi offensive. Surrendering Stalingrad to the enemy would have meant losing the war, but holding on to the city seemed almost impossible.', 'The film tells the story of those who took part in the Battle of Stalingrad in 1942, which became a turning point in the Great Patriotic War. For five months, the city resisted the Nazi offensive. Surrendering Stalingrad to the enemy would have meant losing the war, but holding on to the city seemed almost impossible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tidOMPsO6d4ntThlzkmBEQPn0XY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154620'),
  ('955745710641720556', 'The Turning Point', 1952, 'Crime, Drama', 'William Dieterle, Lionel Lindon, Irvin Talbot', 'Warren Duff', 'William Holden, Edmond O''Brien, Alexis Smith, Tom Tully, Ed Begley, Danny Dayton, Adele Longmire, Ray Teal', 'NR', 'Special prosecutor John Conroy hopes to combat organized crime in his city and appoints his cop father Matt as chief investigator. John doesn''t understand why Matt is reluctant, but cynical reporter Jerry McKibbon thinks he knows: he''s seen Matt with mob lieutenant Harrigan. Jerry''s friendship with John is tested by the question of what to do about Matt, and by his attraction to John''s girl Amanda. Meanwhile, the threatened racketeers adopt increasingly violent means of defense.', 'Special prosecutor John Conroy hopes to combat organized crime in his city and appoints his cop father Matt as chief investigator. John doesn''t understand why Matt is reluctant, but cynical reporter Jerry McKibbon thinks he knows: he''s seen Matt with mob lieutenant Harrigan. Jerry''s friendship with John is tested by the question of what to do about Matt, and by his attraction to John''s girl Amanda. Meanwhile, the threatened racketeers adopt increasingly violent means of defense.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oAQOQEev0CS4HNeKQ8S8FcjtTpK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61095'),
  ('826881537962887018', 'The Turning Point', 1977, 'Drama, Romance', 'Herbert Ross, Jack Roe, Peter Burrell', 'Arthur Laurents', 'Anne Bancroft, Shirley MacLaine, Tom Skerritt, Mikhail Baryshnikov, Leslie Browne, Martha Scott, Antoinette Sibley, Starr Danias', 'PG', 'As young dancers, they were best friends and fierce rivals. Deedee left the stage for marriage and motherhood, while Emma would become an international ballet icon. But when Deedee''s teenage daughter is invited to join Emma''s dance company and begins an affair with a young Russian star, the two women are forced to confront the choices they''ve made, the resentments they''ve hidden and the emotional truths they must face at the turning point.', 'As young dancers, they were best friends and fierce rivals. Deedee left the stage for marriage and motherhood, while Emma would become an international ballet icon. But when Deedee''s teenage daughter is invited to join Emma''s dance company and begins an affair with a young Russian star, the two women are forced to confront the choices they''ve made, the resentments they''ve hidden and the emotional truths they must face at the turning point.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6CD90BQEDexEIMqIwMSnbJStF5x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61280'),
  ('591327391523890501', 'The Turning Point', 2021, 'Drama', 'Riccardo Antonaroli, Emanuele Zarlenga', 'Roberto Cimpanelli, Gabriele Scarfone', 'Andrea Lattanzi, Brando Pacitto, Ludovica Martino, Chabeli Sastre González, Claudio Bigagli, Marcello Fonte, Cristian Di Sante, Tullio Sorrentino', null, 'A slacker who does his best to avoid confrontation strikes up an unlikely friendship with a dangerous thug who suddenly forces his way into his life.', 'A slacker who does his best to avoid confrontation strikes up an unlikely friendship with a dangerous thug who suddenly forces his way into his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ge7URX8RFL4zAiJ76dprYqs3HEt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:828588'),
  ('303283566776342985', 'The Turning Wind', 1962, 'Drama', 'Tony Rabatoni, Glauber Rocha, Torquato Neto', 'Glauber Rocha, Luiz Paulino dos Santos, José Teles de Magalhães', 'Antônio Pitanga, Luiza Maranhão, Lucy de Carvalho, Aldo Teixeira, Lídio Silva, Edmundo Albuquerque, Francisco dos Santos Brito, Hélio de Oliveira', null, 'In Bahia, an educated black man returns to his home fishing village to try and free people from mysticism, in particular the Candomblé religion, which he considers a factor of political and social oppression, with tragic outcome.', 'In Bahia, an educated black man returns to his home fishing village to try and free people from mysticism, in particular the Candomblé religion, which he considers a factor of political and social oppression, with tragic outcome.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p5WgRzMPrbaOCOR3Oin5U8k6kMh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66184'),
  ('87915388849282102', 'The Turpins: A New House of Horror - A Diane Sawyer Special Event', 2026, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Diane Sawyer', null, 'Follows Diane Sawyer interviewing Turpin siblings about their experiences in the foster care system after being rescued from their parents'' home in 2018, with three siblings speaking out for the first time about facing abuse again.', 'Follows Diane Sawyer interviewing Turpin siblings about their experiences in the foster care system after being rescued from their parents'' home in 2018, with three siblings speaking out for the first time about facing abuse again.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F72I1MMGeFOWQke25adyMj8UfxBH.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-turpins-a-new-house-of-horror-a-diane-sawyer-special-event'),
  ('619729601438796741', 'The Tuskegee Airmen', 1995, 'War, History, Drama, TV Movie', 'Robert Markowitz, Ron Orieux, Frank M. Holgate', null, 'Laurence Fishburne, Allen Payne, Malcolm-Jamal Warner, Courtney B. Vance, Andre Braugher, Christopher McDonald, Daniel Hugh Kelly, John Lithgow', 'PG-13', 'During the Second World War, a special project is begun by the US Army Air Corps to integrate African American pilots into the Fighter Pilot Program. Known as the "Tuskegee Airman" for the name of the airbase at which they were trained, these men were forced to constantly endure harassement, prejudice, and much behind the scenes politics until at last they were able to prove themselves in combat.', 'During the Second World War, a special project is begun by the US Army Air Corps to integrate African American pilots into the Fighter Pilot Program. Known as the "Tuskegee Airman" for the name of the airbase at which they were trained, these men were forced to constantly endure harassement, prejudice, and much behind the scenes politics until at last they were able to prove themselves in combat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8xgYqh9XlFLusp4R8u5ocZM0WjV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31894'),
  ('307464631072829117', 'The Tutor', 2017, 'Mystery, Drama, Fantasy, Horror', 'Iván Noel, Eli Vera, Luciano Giletta', 'Iván Noel', 'Romina Pinto, Cristina Maresca, Valentino Vinco, Malena Alonso, Julio Mendez', null, 'Mona picks up her first job tutoring two orphaned children living in a derelict house in the country. Her obsession with trying to educate these two nearly feral children blinds her to the fact they have other plans for her.', 'Mona picks up her first job tutoring two orphaned children living in a derelict house in the country. Her obsession with trying to educate these two nearly feral children blinds her to the fact they have other plans for her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3iIZ5tNsFVJm6gXualQhZQW6uIK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:412941'),
  ('1126448934187845797', 'The Tutor', 2023, 'Mystery, Thriller, Action', 'Jordan Ross, Brian Rigney Hubbard', 'Ryan King', 'Garrett Hedlund, Noah Schnapp, Victoria Justice, Jonny Weston, Kabby Borders, Matt Borlenghi, Ekaterina Baker, Joseph Castillo-Midyett', 'R', 'When a professional tutor takes a job at a remote manor, he soon finds himself battling his disturbed student’s obsessions, which threaten to expose his darkest secrets and unravel his carefully crafted persona.', 'When a professional tutor takes a job at a remote manor, he soon finds himself battling his disturbed student’s obsessions, which threaten to expose his darkest secrets and unravel his carefully crafted persona.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wmTOuCeJnTPaAPMK19Y8Ixpi3Gl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:995012'),
  ('57846178030908036', 'The Tuxedo', 2002, 'Thriller, Action, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Kevin Donovan, Stephen F. Windon, Greg Michael', 'Michael J. Leeson, Michael J. Wilson', 'Jackie Chan, Jennifer Love Hewitt, Jason Isaacs, Debi Mazar, Ritchie Coster, Peter Stormare, Mia Cottet, Romany Malco', 'PG-13', 'Cabbie-turned-chauffeur Jimmy Tong learns there is really only one rule when you work for playboy millionaire Clark Devlin : Never touch Devlin''s prized tuxedo. But when Devlin is temporarily put out of commission in an explosive accident, Jimmy puts on the tux and soon discovers that this extraordinary suit may be more black belt than black tie. Paired with a partner as inexperienced as he is, Jimmy becomes an unwitting secret agent.', 'Cabbie-turned-chauffeur Jimmy Tong learns there is really only one rule when you work for playboy millionaire Clark Devlin : Never touch Devlin''s prized tuxedo. But when Devlin is temporarily put out of commission in an explosive accident, Jimmy puts on the tux and soon discovers that this extraordinary suit may be more black belt than black tie. Paired with a partner as inexperienced as he is, Jimmy becomes an unwitting secret agent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lTMnOx7E2zEzIGY0og1KkfgYMhY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10771'),
  ('483942096143315826', 'The TV Set', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Jake Kasdan, Carey Dietrich, Bradley Morris', 'Jake Kasdan', 'David Duchovny, Sigourney Weaver, Ioan Gruffudd, Judy Greer, Fran Kranz, Lindsay Sloane, Justine Bateman, Lucy Davis', 'R', 'As a writer named Mike struggles to shepherd his semi-autobiographical sitcom into development, his vision is slowly eroded by a domineering network executive named Lenny who favors trashy reality programming. The irony, of course, is that every crass suggestion Lenny makes improves the show''s response from test audiences and brings the show a step closer to getting on the air.', 'As a writer named Mike struggles to shepherd his semi-autobiographical sitcom into development, his vision is slowly eroded by a domineering network executive named Lenny who favors trashy reality programming. The irony, of course, is that every crass suggestion Lenny makes improves the show''s response from test audiences and brings the show a step closer to getting on the air.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/djR3SWD7ZEs5lcrjUifaWVCG7eY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17320'),
  ('1091782881120985741', 'The Twelve Chairs', 1962, 'Comedy', 'Tomás Gutiérrez Alea, Ramón F. Suárez', 'Tomás Gutiérrez Alea, Ugo Ulive', 'Enrique Santisteban, Reynaldo Miravalles, René Sánchez, Pilín Vallejo, Idalberto Delgado, Ana Viñas, Manuel Pereiro, Pedro Martín Planas', null, 'When her country is taken over by socialist revolutionaries, a wealthy woman can''t bear to give up all of her wealth and possessions to the new government, so she hides all of her treasures in the 12 chairs of a dining-room set. After her death her nephew finds out what she had done and, since the chairs had been "nationalized" and are now in the possession of a dozen different people, he sets out to track them down and get the treasures he believes rightfully belong to him.', 'When her country is taken over by socialist revolutionaries, a wealthy woman can''t bear to give up all of her wealth and possessions to the new government, so she hides all of her treasures in the 12 chairs of a dining-room set. After her death her nephew finds out what she had done and, since the chairs had been "nationalized" and are now in the possession of a dozen different people, he sets out to track them down and get the treasures he believes rightfully belong to him.', null, 'tmdb:movie:106176'),
  ('88594194562249063', 'The Twelve Chairs', 1970, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Mel Brooks, Đorđe Nikolić', 'Mel Brooks', 'Ron Moody, Frank Langella, Dom DeLuise, Andréas Voutsinas, Diana Coupland, Mel Brooks, David Lander', 'G', 'In 1920s Soviet Russia, a fallen aristocrat, a priest and a con artist search for a treasure of jewels hidden inside one of twelve dining chairs, lost during the revolution.', 'In 1920s Soviet Russia, a fallen aristocrat, a priest and a con artist search for a treasure of jewels hidden inside one of twelve dining chairs, lost during the revolution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qw0yZKqdWyakNRasQ3NvEiRyZpN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24918'),
  ('140220557603053809', 'The Twelve Gold Medallions', 1970, 'Drama, Action', 'Cheng Kang, Pao Hsueh-Li, Charles Tung Shao-Yung', 'Cheng Kang', 'Elliot Ngok Wah, Chin Ping, Ching Miao, Lisa Chiao Chiao, Wang Hsieh, Huang Tsung-Hsun, Yang Chi-Ching, Ku Feng', null, 'While a brave Chinese general and his men fight against the Tartar invaders, several swordsmen try to obtain twelve golden medallions on whose possession depends the future of the Song dynasty.', 'While a brave Chinese general and his men fight against the Tartar invaders, several swordsmen try to obtain twelve golden medallions on whose possession depends the future of the Song dynasty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jx7Ackds0kw23P0sI7tV5SAHcFq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65207'),
  ('496054691128389037', 'The Twelve Jurors', 1963, 'TV Movie, Drama, Crime', 'Günter Gräwert, Oskar Schnirch', 'Reginald Rose', 'Heini Göbel, Herbert Bötticher, Siegfried Lowitz, Ernst Fritz Fürbringer, Wolfgang Weiser, Ralf Wolter, Mario Adorf, Robert Graf', null, 'Did an 18-year-old immigrant from the slums murder his father in cold blood? The twelve jurors must find a unanimous verdict.', 'Did an 18-year-old immigrant from the slums murder his father in cold blood? The twelve jurors must find a unanimous verdict.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sI3msTEuju2vCE8vHjjNoOv6qx7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:269165'),
  ('964833219705104309', 'The Twelve Months', 1956, 'Fantasy, Animation, Family, Adventure', 'Ivan Ivanov-Vano, V. Sveshnikova, Galina Andreeva', 'Nikolay Erdman, Samuil Marshak', 'Lyudmila Kasatkina, Galina Novozhilova, Georgiy Vitsin, Erast Garin, Grigoriy Shpigel, Tatyana Barysheva, Yuliya Yulskaya, Vladimir Volodin', null, 'A poor girl was given an impossible task by her stepmother: to gather snowdrops in a winter forest. Suddenly she stumbled across twelve brothers who happened to be the twelve months.', 'A poor girl was given an impossible task by her stepmother: to gather snowdrops in a winter forest. Suddenly she stumbled across twelve brothers who happened to be the twelve months.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h7FecX2q0v8bA5EY6RrGxiibCss.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42647'),
