  ('798216809655409879', 'The Twelve Months of the Summer', 1988, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Drama, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Richard Hobert', 'Richard Hobert', 'Hans Mosesson, Bergljót Arnadóttir, Victoria Möllerström-Hjelm, Göran Stangertz, Kajsa Reingardt, Halvar Björk, Pierre Lindstedt, Eddie Axberg', null, 'Roger and Lars are family men who live a life as a traveling construction workers on large sites worldwide. They are offered a very generous contract they can''t turn down. One-years work for a ten year salary. All they have to do is sign and honor the contract. But they don''t know where they are going or what they are supposed to build. Blindfolded they are brought to a place with summer the year round. At this strange place they meet fellow workers. Together, they realize that there is something very wrong in this paradise.', 'Roger and Lars are family men who live a life as a traveling construction workers on large sites worldwide. They are offered a very generous contract they can''t turn down. One-years work for a ten year salary. All they have to do is sign and honor the contract. But they don''t know where they are going or what they are supposed to build. Blindfolded they are brought to a place with summer the year round. At this strange place they meet fellow workers. Together, they realize that there is something very wrong in this paradise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d9bQaOD2ArJYAnMSe8mQGuuXwqR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106048'),
  ('1133527286574423554', 'The Twelve Tasks of Asterix', 1976, 'Family, Animation, Comedy, Adventure', 'René Goscinny, Albert Uderzo', 'René Goscinny, Albert Uderzo, Pierre Tchernia', 'Roger Carel, Jacques Morel, Jean Martinelli, Henri Virlogeux, Micheline Dax, Pierre Tornade, Roger Lumont, Stéphane Steeman', null, 'Asterix and Obelix depart on an adventure to complete twelve impossible tasks to prove to Caesar that they are as strong as the Gods. You''ll roar with laughter as they outwit, outrun, and generally outrage the very people who are trying to prove them "only human".', 'Asterix and Obelix depart on an adventure to complete twelve impossible tasks to prove to Caesar that they are as strong as the Gods. You''ll roar with laughter as they outwit, outrun, and generally outrage the very people who are trying to prove them "only human".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7cZQZOYZFJcLjZnxWjO5PcUtmDZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9385'),
  ('833299793346390916', 'The Twilight of the Golds', 1996, 'Drama', 'Ross Kagan Marks, Tom Richmond', 'Jonathan Tolins, Seth Bass', 'Garry Marshall, Faye Dunaway, Brendan Fraser, Jennifer Beals, Jon Tenney, Rosie O''Donnell, Sean O''Bryan, John Schlesinger', null, 'A woman discovers her unborn baby has a genetic predisposition to homosexuality, unwittingly exposing deep-seated prejudices within her family.', 'A woman discovers her unborn baby has a genetic predisposition to homosexuality, unwittingly exposing deep-seated prejudices within her family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5p0c5yZxFzWaClp7wrv38vtAm8Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72483'),
  ('438565469266996013', 'The Twilight People', 1972, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Eddie Romero, María Abelardo, Fredy Conde', 'Eddie Romero', 'John Ashley, Pat Woodell, Jan Merlin, Charles Macaulay, Pam Grier, Ken Metcalfe, Kim Ramos, Mona Morena', 'PG', 'A kidnapped diver is taken to an island inhabited by a mad scientist and his half-animal, half-human creations.', 'A kidnapped diver is taken to an island inhabited by a mad scientist and his half-animal, half-human creations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hrGalDLpZNvp7ii0T08VS4Sq6F5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85674'),
  ('39086412796615025', 'The Twilight Saga: Breaking Dawn - Part 1', 2011, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Romance', 'Bill Condon, Justin Muller, John M. Morse', 'Melissa Rosenberg', 'Kristen Stewart, Robert Pattinson, Taylor Lautner, Billy Burke, Peter Facinelli, Michael Sheen, Elizabeth Reaser, Kellan Lutz', 'PG-13', 'Bella Swan and Edward Cullen''s honeymoon phase is abruptly disrupted by betrayals and unforeseen tragedies that endanger their world.', 'Bella Swan and Edward Cullen''s honeymoon phase is abruptly disrupted by betrayals and unforeseen tragedies that endanger their world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qs8LsHKYlVRmJbFUiSUhhRAygwj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50619'),
  ('195334400488467325', 'The Twilight Saga: Breaking Dawn - Part 2', 2012, 'Fantasy, Drama, Romance', 'Bill Condon, Guillermo Navarro, Justin Muller', 'Melissa Rosenberg', 'Kristen Stewart, Robert Pattinson, Taylor Lautner, Peter Facinelli, Elizabeth Reaser, Ashley Greene, Jackson Rathbone, Kellan Lutz', 'PG-13', 'After the birth of Renesmee, the Cullens gather other vampire clans in order to protect the child from a false allegation that puts the family in front of the Volturi.', 'After the birth of Renesmee, the Cullens gather other vampire clans in order to protect the child from a false allegation that puts the family in front of the Volturi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7IGdPaKujv0BjI0Zd0m0a4CzEjJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50620'),
  ('1036295389896046556', 'The Twilight Saga: Eclipse', 2010, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Drama, Romance', 'David Slade, Javier Aguirresarobe, E.J. Foerster', 'Melissa Rosenberg', 'Kristen Stewart, Robert Pattinson, Taylor Lautner, Bryce Dallas Howard, Dakota Fanning, Billy Burke, Peter Facinelli, Elizabeth Reaser', 'PG-13', 'Bella once again finds herself surrounded by danger as Seattle is ravaged by a string of mysterious killings and a malicious vampire continues her quest for revenge. In the midst of it all, she is forced to choose between her love for Edward and her friendship with Jacob, knowing that her decision has the potential to ignite the ageless struggle between vampire and werewolf. With her graduation quickly approaching, Bella is confronted with the most important decision of her life.', 'Bella once again finds herself surrounded by danger as Seattle is ravaged by a string of mysterious killings and a malicious vampire continues her quest for revenge. In the midst of it all, she is forced to choose between her love for Edward and her friendship with Jacob, knowing that her decision has the potential to ignite the ageless struggle between vampire and werewolf. With her graduation quickly approaching, Bella is confronted with the most important decision of her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dK4Gi1UdMiHzHc7r7CZQG4IQ9Sr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24021'),
  ('189353971937276855', 'The Twilight Saga: New Moon', 2009, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Drama, Romance', 'Chris Weitz, Cindy Smith, Mike Topoozian', 'Melissa Rosenberg', 'Kristen Stewart, Robert Pattinson, Taylor Lautner, Dakota Fanning, Michael Sheen, Ashley Greene, Rachelle Lefevre, Billy Burke', 'PG-13', 'Forks, Washington resident Bella Swan is reeling from the departure of her vampire love, Edward Cullen, and finds comfort in her friendship with Jacob Black, a werewolf. But before she knows it, she''s thrust into a centuries-old conflict, and her desire to be with Edward at any cost leads her to take greater and greater risks.', 'Forks, Washington resident Bella Swan is reeling from the departure of her vampire love, Edward Cullen, and finds comfort in her friendship with Jacob Black, a werewolf. But before she knows it, she''s thrust into a centuries-old conflict, and her desire to be with Edward at any cost leads her to take greater and greater risks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k2qTooPlHffgNABNWxeJdGMglPK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18239'),
  ('505080691967741083', 'The Twilight Zone: Rod Serling''s Lost Classics', 1994, 'Fantasy, Thriller, Mystery, Horror, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Robert Markowitz, Jacek Laskus', 'Rod Serling', 'James Earl Jones, Amy Irving, Gary Cole, Patrick Bergin, Julia Campbell, Jack Palance, Heidi Swedberg, Priscilla Pointer', 'NR', 'James Earl Jones hosts this film based on two stories by the late Rod Serling, who wrote the stories of the original ''The Twilight Zone'' (1959) series. In "The Theatre," a young woman attends a movie only to find that her life story is being revealed on the screen. In "Where the Dead Are," a Boston surgeon in 1868 searches for a scientist who may have the answer to a medical mystery.', 'James Earl Jones hosts this film based on two stories by the late Rod Serling, who wrote the stories of the original ''The Twilight Zone'' (1959) series. In "The Theatre," a young woman attends a movie only to find that her life story is being revealed on the screen. In "Where the Dead Are," a Boston surgeon in 1868 searches for a scientist who may have the answer to a medical mystery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kP63L0E7Ftesqq8npKDQV4v078L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29803'),
  ('810984964887340261', 'The Twin', 1984, 'Comedy', 'Yves Robert, Robert Fraisse', 'Élisabeth Rappeneau, Boris Bergman, Yves Robert', 'Pierre Richard, Camilla More, Carey More, Jean-Pierre Kalfon, Andréa Ferréol, Jacques Frantz, Jean-Pierre Castaldi, Paul Le Person', null, 'Matthias Duval is in love, but he can''t choose between the two twin sisters Betty and Liz Kerner. To pick up the two sisters, he invents his own twin brother and will play both characters.', 'Matthias Duval is in love, but he can''t choose between the two twin sisters Betty and Liz Kerner. To pick up the two sisters, he invents his own twin brother and will play both characters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ctu39oPSwB9Wp2L1nwieZdBwOD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39978'),
  ('681275741986240040', 'The Twin', 2017, 'Thriller, Drama, TV Movie', 'Christopher Ray, Fred Olen Ray, Max Derin', 'Max Derin, Michael Waite, Roger Stigliano', 'Brigid Brannagh, Timothy Granaderos, Jess Gabor, Mark Lindsay Chapman, Louis Mandylor, Calista Carradine, Tracy Brooks Swope, David Novak', null, 'Jocelyn''s boyfriend is perfect--except for his dangerous identical twin brother, Derek, who just escaped from a mental institution. When Derek unspools a twisted plan of revenge with Jocelyn in his crosshairs, her mother Ashley must act fast before she falls victim to a psychopath.', 'Jocelyn''s boyfriend is perfect--except for his dangerous identical twin brother, Derek, who just escaped from a mental institution. When Derek unspools a twisted plan of revenge with Jocelyn in his crosshairs, her mother Ashley must act fast before she falls victim to a psychopath.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ph9ahRsR5GobFEPquv4iFmmOwC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:452928'),
  ('503142084688712067', 'The Twin', 2022, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Daniel Lindholm, Matilde Matvere, Doris Altmets', 'Taneli Mustonen, Aleksi Hyvärinen', 'Teresa Palmer, Steven Cree, Barbara Marten, Tristan Ruggeri, Andres Dvinjaninov, Nick Connor, Tiiu Uibo, Raivo Trass', null, 'Every parent''s worst nightmare is just the beginning for Rachel''s ordeal as in the aftermath of a tragic accident, she and her husband Anthony decide to move to the other side of the world to focus on their surviving twin son Elliot. What begins as a time of healing and isolation in the Finnish countryside turns into a desperate battle for the very soul of their son as an entity claiming to be his dead twin brother takes over Elliot — setting Rachel on a diabolical journey to unravel the horrible truth about her twin son.', 'Every parent''s worst nightmare is just the beginning for Rachel''s ordeal as in the aftermath of a tragic accident, she and her husband Anthony decide to move to the other side of the world to focus on their surviving twin son Elliot. What begins as a time of healing and isolation in the Finnish countryside turns into a desperate battle for the very soul of their son as an entity claiming to be his dead twin brother takes over Elliot — setting Rachel on a diabolical journey to unravel the horrible truth about her twin son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uUUSkKQEptTHjYejxzaT5TVkiAG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:477462'),
  ('1057437016667171287', 'The Twins Effect', 2003, 'Action, Comedy, Horror', 'Dante Lam Chiu-Yin, Donnie Yen, Alex Mok Siu-Chung', 'Chan Hing-Kai, Jack Ng Wai-Lun', 'Edison Chen, Charlene Choi Chuek-Yin, Gillian Chung, Ekin Cheng Yee-Kin, Jackie Chan, Karen Mok Man-Wai, Josie Ho, Anthony Wong Chau-Sang', null, 'An evil Duke attempts to kill and collect the blood of a royal family of European vampires in order to become all powerful. The only surviving member of the family travels to Hong Kong, only to complicate his struggle by falling in love with a mortal girl who just happens to have a vampire hunter for a brother.', 'An evil Duke attempts to kill and collect the blood of a royal family of European vampires in order to become all powerful. The only surviving member of the family travels to Hong Kong, only to complicate his struggle by falling in love with a mortal girl who just happens to have a vampire hunter for a brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/frwUWEGWFiIlYekPRuZFG5N250Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17457'),
  ('1136033375034443155', 'The Twins Effect II', 2004, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy, Romance', 'Corey Yuen, Patrick Leung Pak-Kin, Chan Chi-Ying', 'John Chan Kin-Chung, Roy Szeto Wai-Cheuk, Peter Tsi', 'Chen Bolin, Jaycee Chan, Gillian Chung, Charlene Choi Chuek-Yin, Daniel Wu, Qu Ying, Tony Leung Ka-fai, Fan Bingbing', null, 'Set in Flower Capital, a land ruled by an Evil Queen. All men in the kingdom are slaves to women. However, a prophecy foretells that one day, the Star of Rex will find and wield a mythical sword, rise to power, overthrow the queen, and restore the balance of the two sexes.', 'Set in Flower Capital, a land ruled by an Evil Queen. All men in the kingdom are slaves to women. However, a prophecy foretells that one day, the Star of Rex will find and wield a mythical sword, rise to power, overthrow the queen, and restore the balance of the two sexes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4UNGA2zrHgHmQQ8LY7S8uEKL3Dv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10257'),
