  ('897748984442168141', 'The Twister: Caught in the Storm', 2025, 'Documentary', 'Alexandra Lacey, David Vollrath', 'Alexandra Lacey', 'Mac Wright, Kaylee Parker, Chad Crilley, Doug Heady, Cecil Cornish, Andrew Keegan Tinney, Steven Weersing, Barack Obama', 'R', 'In May 2011, a massive tornado ripped through Joplin, Missouri. With pulse-pounding firsthand footage, this documentary goes inside a deadly twister.', 'In May 2011, a massive tornado ripped through Joplin, Missouri. With pulse-pounding firsthand footage, this documentary goes inside a deadly twister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ggXb37lX9gW4SR7kpMaraXDFeFR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1437446'),
  ('147171971538839994', 'The Twisters', 2024, 'Action, Adventure, Drama', 'Michael Su, Michael Su', 'Jeffery Anderson', 'Tiffany, Mark Justice, Kayla Fields, Paul Logan, Curtis Strong, Sofia Riba, Corbin Timbrook, Vinney Pugliese', null, 'A deadly patchwork of destructive cyclones is on an apocalyptic path of convergence at a populated Midwest city center. There, the twisters will merge into one mega tornado that threatens to obliterate the cities for hundreds of miles around.', 'A deadly patchwork of destructive cyclones is on an apocalyptic path of convergence at a populated Midwest city center. There, the twisters will merge into one mega tornado that threatens to obliterate the cities for hundreds of miles around.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9xjSHm0R9tII8JCWHS1VdbftFk1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1311844'),
  ('401512322221219603', 'The Twits', 2025, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Phil Johnston, Todd Demong, Valentin Beaumont', 'Phil Johnston, Meg Favreau', 'Margo Martindale, Johnny Vegas, Maitreyi Ramakrishnan, Ryan Anderson Lopez, Emilia Clarke, Natalie Portman, Timothy Simons, Nicole Byer', 'PG', 'When the meanest, nastiest villains pull a trick to take over their town, two brave children team up with a family of magical animals to bring them down.', 'When the meanest, nastiest villains pull a trick to take over their town, two brave children team up with a family of magical animals to bring them down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zNP1nMRFqa9qAkpCkLeHa1V7kDR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:927254'),
