  ('631717246904292260', 'The Two Missionaries', 1974, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'Franco Rossi, Gábor Pogány, Salvatore Basile', 'Franco Rossi, Augusto Caminito, Fausto Saraceni', 'Terence Hill, Bud Spencer, Jean-Pierre Aumont, Robert Loggia, Mario Pilar, Salvatore Basile, Maria Cumani Quasimodo, Jacques Herlin', null, 'Two missionaries come into conflict with the authorities when they turn their missionary into a parrot farm. The Bishop of Maracaibo calls them his ''black sheep'' and the Monsignore has been called to check on their behavior. Like usual, our heroes help the poor to defend themselves and provoke some funny fist fights in the process.', 'Two missionaries come into conflict with the authorities when they turn their missionary into a parrot farm. The Bishop of Maracaibo calls them his ''black sheep'' and the Monsignore has been called to check on their behavior. Like usual, our heroes help the poor to defend themselves and provoke some funny fist fights in the process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/emaRH39H6N2qPPWOjLN2SzDT7FK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11681'),
