  ('498488322518460756', 'The Ugly Duckling', 1997, 'Animation', 'David Elvin, Martin Gates, Christian De Vita', 'Sue Radley, Martin Gates', 'Peter Bayliss, Michael Bell, Jon David Bush, Christian Campbell, Maria Darling, Avriel Epps, Robert Waiting, Rosie Glossop', 'G', 'The Ugly Duckling teams up with friend Scruffy, and the lovable misfits embark on a journey that helps them realize that their differences are what make them special.', 'The Ugly Duckling teams up with friend Scruffy, and the lovable misfits embark on a journey that helps them realize that their differences are what make them special.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8V15nsuvDM6vcxZ3lfPny8jxtSb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:358057'),
