  ('475089060971451928', 'The Ugly Ones', 1966, 'Action, Western', 'Enzo Barboni, Eugenio Martín', 'James Donald Prindle, José Gutiérrez Maesso, Eugenio Martín', 'Richard Wyler, Tomas Milian, Halina Zalewska, Hugo Blanco, Enzo Fiermonte, Lola Gaos, Ricardo Canales, Mario Brega', null, 'Escaped outlaw Jose Gomez returns to his home town pursued by bounty killer Luke Chilson. The towns people protect Gomez, unaware, at first, that he is now a changed and dangerous man.', 'Escaped outlaw Jose Gomez returns to his home town pursued by bounty killer Luke Chilson. The towns people protect Gomez, unaware, at first, that he is now a changed and dangerous man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eKDw7gqhQl9kulLuvVZtE1X1jU7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73832'),
  ('1118839115487506578', 'The Ugly Stepsister', 2025, 'Horror, Comedy, Drama', 'Emilie Blichfeldt, Marcel Zyskind', 'Emilie Blichfeldt', 'Lea Myren, Ane Dahl Torp, Thea Sofie Loch Næss, Flo Fagerli, Isac Calmroth, Malte Gårdinger, Ralph Carlsson, Cecilia Forss', 'NR', 'In a fairy-tale kingdom where beauty is a brutal business, Elvira battles to compete with her incredibly beautiful stepsister, and she will go to any length to catch the prince’s eye.', 'In a fairy-tale kingdom where beauty is a brutal business, Elvira battles to compete with her incredibly beautiful stepsister, and she will go to any length to catch the prince’s eye.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rayAREIKtSinuov10GvrZHyXfXH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1284120'),
  ('310478319219079475', 'The Ugly Swans', 2006, 'Science Fiction, Drama', 'Konstantin Lopushansky, Vladislav Gurtchin, Vladimir Studennikov', 'Boris Strugatskiy, Konstantin Lopushansky, Vyacheslav Rybakov', 'Gregory Hlady, Aleksey Kortnev, Leonid Mozgovoy, Rimma Sarkisyan, Olga Samoshina, Aleksandr Tsybulsky, Vasily Mikhailov, Viktor Mikhaylov', null, 'In the near future, writer Victor Banev gets himself on a UN commission to investigate what''s going on in the remote town of Tashlinsk, where reports tell of a virus-created race of brainiac mutants. Banev''s tween daughter Ira is enrolled at a school for gifted children which has been taken over by the mutants, who have grown to despise ordinary humanity.', 'In the near future, writer Victor Banev gets himself on a UN commission to investigate what''s going on in the remote town of Tashlinsk, where reports tell of a virus-created race of brainiac mutants. Banev''s tween daughter Ira is enrolled at a school for gifted children which has been taken over by the mutants, who have grown to despise ordinary humanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4On18W8CFxOakkHhBmpQLsjZV0U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53252'),
  ('896336135806087367', 'The Ugly Truth', 2009, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Robert Luketic, Russell Carpenter, Tyler Romary', 'Karen McCullah, Nicole Eastman', 'Katherine Heigl, Gerard Butler, Eric Winter, Nick Searcy, Bree Turner, John Michael Higgins, Kevin Connolly, Cheryl Hines', 'R', 'A romantically challenged morning show producer is reluctantly embroiled in a series of outrageous tests by her chauvinistic correspondent to prove his theories on relationships and help her find love. His clever ploys, however, lead to an unexpected result.', 'A romantically challenged morning show producer is reluctantly embroiled in a series of outrageous tests by her chauvinistic correspondent to prove his theories on relationships and help her find love. His clever ploys, however, lead to an unexpected result.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2rq96Ihbqb1eU3TEBVtgFlqbeX7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20943'),
  ('934779231714048189', 'The Ultimate Accessory', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Valérie Lemercier, Denis Lenoir', 'Valérie Lemercier', 'Valérie Lemercier, Gilles Lellouche, Marina Foïs, Nanou Garcia, Brigitte Roüan, Chantal Ladesou, Samatin Pendev, Olivier Perrier', null, 'The story of Aleksandra and Cyrille, a prominent, trendy, and very well-off Parisian couple, whose life is not quite the same after seven-year-old Alekseï from Russia suddenly pops up in their 100% cashmere, childless home. Aleksandra soon realises that this little boy they have adopted is not quite what she had been hoping for...', 'The story of Aleksandra and Cyrille, a prominent, trendy, and very well-off Parisian couple, whose life is not quite the same after seven-year-old Alekseï from Russia suddenly pops up in their 100% cashmere, childless home. Aleksandra soon realises that this little boy they have adopted is not quite what she had been hoping for...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lrNcEffsVjlAZ5NkEfKNBiKaZna.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:225564'),
  ('169287398020346495', 'The Ultimate Christmas Present', 2000, 'TV Movie, Family, Comedy', 'Greg Beeman, David Markowitz, Karl Herrmann', 'Hallie Einhorn, Michael Hitchcock', 'Hallee Hirsh, Spencer Breslin, Hallie Todd, Brenda Song, John Salley, Susan Ruttan, John B. Lowe, Greg Kean', 'G', 'When 13-year-old Allie Thompson and her best friend Sam happen upon a weather-making machine discarded by none other than Santa Claus, they use it to cause a snow day in Los Angeles. But when the machine gets out of hand, it threatens to ruin Christmas.', 'When 13-year-old Allie Thompson and her best friend Sam happen upon a weather-making machine discarded by none other than Santa Claus, they use it to cause a snow day in Los Angeles. But when the machine gets out of hand, it threatens to ruin Christmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4h5gZzj4l1TwOglj5ve0KSLFojz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71887'),
