  ('952538546007369260', 'The Ultimate Duo', 2026, 'Comedy, Crime, Action', 'Park Chul-hwan', 'Park Chul-hwan', 'Bae Sung-woo, Jung Ga-ram, Esom, Cho Han-cheul, Yoon Kyung-ho, Kim Byung-nam', null, 'A troublemaking veteran detective and a rich rookie detective go on a work trip to Seoul to reinvestigate a mysterious murder.', 'A troublemaking veteran detective and a rich rookie detective go on a work trip to Seoul to reinvestigate a mysterious murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aFIdWSkC5nh7kgAJRHP3ZKlBUuT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:608067'),
  ('929881972117299336', 'The Ultimate Gift', 2007, 'Romance, Drama, Family', 'Michael O. Sajbel, Brian Baugh, Randall Badger', 'Cheryl McKay', 'Drew Fuller, Abigail Breslin, James Garner, Bill Cobbs, Ali Hillis, Lee Meriwether, Brian Dennehy, Brett Rice', 'PG', 'When his wealthy grandfather finally dies, Jason Stevens fully expects to benefit when it comes to the reading of the will. But instead of a sizable inheritance, Jason receives a test, a series of tasks he must complete before he can get any money.', 'When his wealthy grandfather finally dies, Jason Stevens fully expects to benefit when it comes to the reading of the will. But instead of a sizable inheritance, Jason receives a test, a series of tasks he must complete before he can get any money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8BdVk1u110lwHFELTEO9HrPrIDa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14624'),
  ('126669708118625892', 'The Ultimate Life', 2013, 'Drama, Romance', 'Michael Landon Jr.', 'Cheryl McKay', 'Peter Fonda, Bill Cobbs, Ali Hillis, Lee Meriwether, Logan Bartholomew, David Mann, Drew Waters, Abigail Mavity', 'PG', 'Despite his best intentions, billionaire Jason Stevens can’t find enough time to keep his beloved Alexia a priority. But when he discovers his late grandfather’s journal, he is transported back to Red Stevens’ incredible world. With everything he loves hanging in the balance, Jason Stevens hopes the past will prepare him well for the future.', 'Despite his best intentions, billionaire Jason Stevens can’t find enough time to keep his beloved Alexia a priority. But when he discovers his late grandfather’s journal, he is transported back to Red Stevens’ incredible world. With everything he loves hanging in the balance, Jason Stevens hopes the past will prepare him well for the future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lRjea5SWCiKzDIpgNDzyvyOSTp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:195757'),
  ('881449864173855436', 'The Ultimate Playlist of Noise', 2021, 'Drama, Music', 'Bennett Lasseter, Vincent Patin', 'Mitchell Winkie', 'Keean Johnson, Madeline Brewer, Oliver Cooper, Ariela Barer, Ian Gomez, Emily Skeggs, Carol Mansell, Carrie Louise Putrello', null, 'After learning he must undergo brain surgery that will render him deaf, Marcus, an audio-obsessed high school senior, decides to seize control of his fate by recording the Ultimate Playlist of Noise — a bucket list of all his favorite sounds.', 'After learning he must undergo brain surgery that will render him deaf, Marcus, an audio-obsessed high school senior, decides to seize control of his fate by recording the Ultimate Playlist of Noise — a bucket list of all his favorite sounds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9e0SRcHiFLcKCOL7HKUcVor49Va.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:776884'),
  ('290237383410616125', 'The Ultimate Underdog Collection', 1964, 'Action, Family', null, null, null, null, 'A shoe shine puppy transforms himself into a superhero every time Sweet Polly Purebread (a pretty TV reporter) gets in trouble.', 'A shoe shine puppy transforms himself into a superhero every time Sweet Polly Purebread (a pretty TV reporter) gets in trouble.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Q9ZtFJXIFIknkYYUJw5MN4Bk8E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47081'),
  ('964965067080970819', 'The Ultimate Warrior', 1975, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Robert Clouse, Gerald Hirschfeld', 'Robert Clouse', 'Yul Brynner, Max von Sydow, Joanna Miles, William Smith, Richard Kelton, Stephen McHattie, Darrell Zwerling, Lane Bradbury', 'R', 'Only a few people still live in New York in 2012. They are organized in gangs with their own turf. One of them is led by Baron, another one by Carrot, and they are constantly at war with each other.', 'Only a few people still live in New York in 2012. They are organized in gangs with their own turf. One of them is led by Baron, another one by Carrot, and they are constantly at war with each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1RyccpnEHahPtWOoKjwO40pGPmB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32053'),
  ('1019987342991319610', 'The Ultimate Weapon', 1998, 'Action', 'Jon Cassar, Bert Tougas, John Strong', 'Robert Paul Marius', 'Hulk Hogan, Carl Marotte, Cynthia Preston, Lynne Adams, Daniel Pilon, Michael D''Amico, David Nerman, Vlasta Vrana', 'R', 'When mercenary "Hardball" Cutter discovers that the team he is working with is actually a group of IRA gunrunners, he decides to put a stop to their plans. Furious with Cutter, the gunrunners target him, his partner, and his family.', 'When mercenary "Hardball" Cutter discovers that the team he is working with is actually a group of IRA gunrunners, he decides to put a stop to their plans. Furious with Cutter, the gunrunners target him, his partner, and his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/irLwtIARtLqnWbtOZifsqAJWFQo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81861'),
  ('919988526460064477', 'The Umbrellas of Cherbourg', 1964, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jacques Demy, Jean Rabier, André Flédérick', 'Jacques Demy, Jacques Demy', 'Catherine Deneuve, Nino Castelnuovo, Anne Vernon, Mireille Perrey, Marc Michel, Ellen Farner, Jean Champion, Jean-Pierre Dorat', 'PG-13', 'This simple romantic tragedy begins in 1957. Guy Foucher, a 20-year-old French auto mechanic, has fallen in love with 17-year-old Geneviève Emery, an employee in her widowed mother''s chic but financially embattled umbrella shop. On the evening before Guy is to leave for a two-year tour of combat in Algeria, he and Geneviève make love. She becomes pregnant and must choose between waiting for Guy''s return or accepting an offer of marriage from a wealthy diamond merchant.', 'This simple romantic tragedy begins in 1957. Guy Foucher, a 20-year-old French auto mechanic, has fallen in love with 17-year-old Geneviève Emery, an employee in her widowed mother''s chic but financially embattled umbrella shop. On the evening before Guy is to leave for a two-year tour of combat in Algeria, he and Geneviève make love. She becomes pregnant and must choose between waiting for Guy''s return or accepting an offer of marriage from a wealthy diamond merchant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tAgTf64XKK5ir7w5C7dnB53jWWG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5967'),
  ('404641717994648118', 'The Unamenables', 1959, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Yuri Chulyukin, Konstantin Brovin, Ekaterina Stashevskaya-Naroditckaya', 'Tatyana Sytina', 'Nadezhda Rumyantseva, Yuri Belov, Aleksey Kozhevnikov, Valentin Kozlov, Vera Karpova, Svetlana Kharitonova, Viktor Yegorov, Yuriy Nikulin', null, 'Two foolish and frivolous guys cause suffering for the whole youth union at the factory. It was already decided to dismiss Anatoly Grachkin and his friend Victor Gromoboev but they are taken under the wing by Nadia Berestova, a diminutive funny woman, known as the popular one at the plant. At first, Nadia took it with reluctance and apprehension, but gradually this commission became the most important thing in her life.', 'Two foolish and frivolous guys cause suffering for the whole youth union at the factory. It was already decided to dismiss Anatoly Grachkin and his friend Victor Gromoboev but they are taken under the wing by Nadia Berestova, a diminutive funny woman, known as the popular one at the plant. At first, Nadia took it with reluctance and apprehension, but gradually this commission became the most important thing in her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jphylsWiNDYKFGJXJgymY1KU0qA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159999'),
  ('859261267212623247', 'The Unbearable Lightness of Being', 1988, 'Drama, Romance', 'Philip Kaufman, Sven Nykvist, Simon Brook', 'Jean-Claude Carrière, Philip Kaufman', 'Daniel Day-Lewis, Juliette Binoche, Lena Olin, Derek de Lint, Stellan Skarsgård, Erland Josephson, Pavel Landovský, Donald Moffat', 'R', 'Successful surgeon Tomas leaves Prague for an operation, meets a young photographer named Tereza, and brings her back with him. Tereza is surprised to learn that Tomas is already having an affair with the bohemian Sabina, but when the Soviet invasion occurs, all three flee to Switzerland. Sabina begins an affair, Tom continues womanizing, and Tereza, disgusted, returns to Czechoslovakia. Realizing his mistake, Tomas decides to chase after her.', 'Successful surgeon Tomas leaves Prague for an operation, meets a young photographer named Tereza, and brings her back with him. Tereza is surprised to learn that Tomas is already having an affair with the bohemian Sabina, but when the Soviet invasion occurs, all three flee to Switzerland. Sabina begins an affair, Tom continues womanizing, and Tereza, disgusted, returns to Czechoslovakia. Realizing his mistake, Tomas decides to chase after her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g1kPEwATsCI8DnGx6ViAhUVKQSI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10644'),
  ('183676498664587535', 'The Unbearable Salesman', 1957, 'Animation', 'Paul J. Smith', null, 'Grace Stafford, June Foray, Daws Butler', null, 'Woody is a salesman, trying to unload his wares on a hibernating (and reasonably irritated) bear.', 'Woody is a salesman, trying to unload his wares on a hibernating (and reasonably irritated) bear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lRbU1ttwLlUbUnSuzji3t40vCIj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235008'),
  ('432955198572398622', 'The Unbearable Weight of Massive Talent', 2022, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Sándor Jani, Bence Kalmár, Zoltán Virányi-Fontan', 'Kevin Etten, Tom Gormican', 'Nicolas Cage, Pedro Pascal, Sharon Horgan, Ike Barinholtz, Alessandra Mastronardi, Jacob Scipio, Lily Mo Sheen, Neil Patrick Harris', 'R', 'Creatively unfulfilled and facing financial ruin, Nick Cage must accept a $1 million offer to attend the birthday of a dangerous superfan. Things take a wildly unexpected turn when Cage is recruited by a CIA operative and forced to live up to his own legend, channeling his most iconic and beloved on-screen characters in order to save himself and his loved ones.', 'Creatively unfulfilled and facing financial ruin, Nick Cage must accept a $1 million offer to attend the birthday of a dangerous superfan. Things take a wildly unexpected turn when Cage is recruited by a CIA operative and forced to live up to his own legend, channeling his most iconic and beloved on-screen characters in order to save himself and his loved ones.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aqhLeieyTpTUKPOfZ3jzo2La0Mq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:648579'),
  ('968588580086363529', 'The Unbelievable Truth', 1990, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Hal Hartley, Michael Spiller, Ted Hope', 'Hal Hartley', 'Adrienne Shelly, Robert John Burke, Christopher Cooke, Julia McNeal, Katherine Mayfield, Gary Sauer, Mark Chandler Bailey, David Healy', 'R', 'After serving time for murder, Josh Hutton returns to his home town where he meets Audry Hugo. No one can remember exactly what Josh did...', 'After serving time for murder, Josh Hutton returns to his home town where he meets Audry Hugo. No one can remember exactly what Josh did...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/36Gqgyh1nOguvnIH8RBfhj7EpjH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38545'),
  ('773132408279820648', 'The Unbelievers', 2013, 'Documentary', 'Gus Holwerda', 'Luke Holwerda, Gus Holwerda', 'Richard Dawkins, Lawrence Krauss, Ayaan Hirsi Ali, Woody Allen, Cameron Diaz, Ricky Gervais, Stephen Hawking, Penn Jillette', null, 'Scientists Richard Dawkins and Lawrence Krauss travel the globe promoting a scientific worldview and the rational questioning of religious belief.', 'Scientists Richard Dawkins and Lawrence Krauss travel the globe promoting a scientific worldview and the rational questioning of religious belief.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e3rRgbUY2Fon26zwJMkei9b26hg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:191502'),
  ('445597120099743568', 'The Unborn', 1991, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Rodman Flender, Wally Pfister', 'John Brancato, Michael Ferris', 'Brooke Adams, Jeff Hayenga, James Karen, K Callan, Jane Cameron, Kathy Griffin, Wendy Hammers, Laura Stockman', 'R', 'Joy turns to horror when a pregnant mother discovers the nightmarish truth behind her doctor''s unexpected success in helping her conceive.', 'Joy turns to horror when a pregnant mother discovers the nightmarish truth behind her doctor''s unexpected success in helping her conceive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zilEvurrEostVxGSklgsJm7hJXx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87451'),
  ('366482931733172810', 'The Unborn', 2003, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Bhandit Thongdee, Surachet Thongmee', 'Bhandit Thongdee, Songsak Mongkolthong', 'Intira Jaroenpura, Prangthong Changdham, Karunpon Thieansuwan, Aranya Namwong, Wannakit Siriput, Kuensit Suwanwatthakee, Voravit Keawpet, Intra Werawattanachai', null, 'After waking up in a hospital to discover that she has been pregnant for ten weeks, a drug addict begins to experience vivid hallucinations.', 'After waking up in a hospital to discover that she has been pregnant for ten weeks, a drug addict begins to experience vivid hallucinations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AcWX3n80ufLYTdFgMdb7PjVB5Ix.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:238647'),
