  ('568470629402589042', 'The Unborn Child', 2011, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Poj Arnon, Thanadol Nuansut, Thanadol Nuansut', 'Poj Arnon', 'Somchai Kemklad, Pitchanart Sakakorn, Chinaradee Anupongpichat, Arisara Thongborisut, Akrabhaj Bunnag, Chudapha Chanthakhet, Krailat Kriengkrai, Ganthida Chaang', null, 'A couple and their young daughter are tormented by a paranormal, malevolent presence which is soon connected to a temple and a series of abortions.', 'A couple and their young daughter are tormented by a paranormal, malevolent presence which is soon connected to a temple and a series of abortions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/riFvrGYmbibGSqVXnSS14pHHlUu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72745'),
  ('221559357101412008', 'The Unborn II', 1994, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Rick Jacobson', 'Daniella Purcell, Mark Evan Schwartz', 'Michele Greene, Robin Curtis, Scott Valentine, Darryl Henriques, Carole Ita White, Brittney Powell, Leonard O. Turner, Anneliza Scott', 'R', 'A sinister fertility experiment has created a generation of twisted children. A relentless woman has made it her business to destroy these mutant babies before they destroy the world! One mother and her only friend are torn between love an repulsion of this deformed being and are ready to fight for it''s survival, but this baby doesn''t need love. It''s been programmed to survive at any cost.', 'A sinister fertility experiment has created a generation of twisted children. A relentless woman has made it her business to destroy these mutant babies before they destroy the world! One mother and her only friend are torn between love an repulsion of this deformed being and are ready to fight for it''s survival, but this baby doesn''t need love. It''s been programmed to survive at any cost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5pgY1h1w2kvuKkhvP8qA5QrQley.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60632'),
  ('371323706963341548', 'The Unbreakable Boy', 2025, 'Family, Drama', 'Kristopher S. Kimlin, Jon Gunn', 'Jon Gunn', 'Zachary Levi, Meghann Fahy, Jacob Laval, Drew Powell, Gavin Warren, Patricia Heaton, Todd Terry, Liza Marie Gonzalez', 'PG', 'When Scott and Teresa LeRette learn that their son Austin is both autistic and has brittle bone disease, they initially worry for their son’s future. But with Scott’s growing faith and Austin’s incredible spirit, they become ''unbreakable'', finding joy, gratitude, and courage even in the most trying times.', 'When Scott and Teresa LeRette learn that their son Austin is both autistic and has brittle bone disease, they initially worry for their son’s future. But with Scott’s growing faith and Austin’s incredible spirit, they become ''unbreakable'', finding joy, gratitude, and courage even in the most trying times.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ob1cuQzzggELGtWx5TchixKsBVn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:765897'),
  ('496086095905245756', 'The Unbroken', 2009, 'Drama', 'Mutsuo Naganuma, Setsuro Wakamatsu, Taiichi Sugiyama', 'Takuya Nishioka', 'Ken Watanabe, Kyoka Suzuki, Mitsuko Kusabue, Takashi Kashiwabara, Erika Toda, Tomokazu Miura, Yasuko Matsuyuki, Shigeru Kōyama', null, 'Onchi was exiled to posts around Asia and Africa due to his work as head of a labor union for National Air Line. He is ordered to return to head office after ten years, and continues to struggle. When a National Air Line plane is involved in the worst air disaster in Japanese history, he is assigned to console and provide restitution to the families of the victims.', 'Onchi was exiled to posts around Asia and Africa due to his work as head of a labor union for National Air Line. He is ordered to return to head office after ten years, and continues to struggle. When a National Air Line plane is involved in the worst air disaster in Japanese history, he is assigned to console and provide restitution to the families of the victims.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jzTu440f7pWM0W5JyVeUzcLaOFf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:206719'),
  ('1085138711982784265', 'The Unburied', 2020, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'Leonel Pazos Scioli, Alejandro Cohen Arazi', 'Alejandro Cohen Arazi', 'Demián Salomón, Héctor Alba, Fernando Miasnik, Mirta Busnelli, Sergio Dioguardi, Sebastián Mogordoy, Pablo Palacio, Carolina Marcovsky', 'NR', 'Maximiliano is a psychiatrist who suffers from strange visions of his past. He grew up in an orphanage and then left for the big city. When his adoptive father dies, he goes back to his hometown where he will be reunited with his brothers and discover a dark family secret.', 'Maximiliano is a psychiatrist who suffers from strange visions of his past. He grew up in an orphanage and then left for the big city. When his adoptive father dies, he goes back to his hometown where he will be reunited with his brothers and discover a dark family secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3j9Gn1Qe1fwQCihA3kSZJqtOVll.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:766008'),
  ('1016375662113028942', 'The Uncanny', 1977, 'Horror', 'Denis Héroux, Harry Waxman, Stéphane Reichel', 'Michel Parry', 'Peter Cushing, Ray Milland, Susan Penhaligon, Joan Greenwood, Roland Culver, Simon Williams, Alexandra Stewart, Donald Pilon', null, 'Wilbur Gray, a horror writer, has stumbled upon a terrible secret, that cats are supernatural creatures who really call the shots. In a desperate attempt to get others to believe him, Wilbur spews three tales of feline horror.', 'Wilbur Gray, a horror writer, has stumbled upon a terrible secret, that cats are supernatural creatures who really call the shots. In a desperate attempt to get others to believe him, Wilbur spews three tales of feline horror.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kLfcSCWIDQd48OGU1Xo5cYLi6Yq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75903'),
  ('405884606401318510', 'The Uncle', 2019, 'Drama, Thriller, Mystery', 'Kim Hyoung Jin', 'Kim Hyoung Jin', 'Chung Ye-jin, Kang Shin-hyo, Kang Shin-chul, Ko Kyu-pil, No Ji-yoo, Jung Whee', null, 'The life of Ipse, a 19-year-old girl who cannot get out of her own bed due to psychological trauma, is as motionless as a plant. Having no family and no clue of her family''s mysterious history, she lives completely dependent on her neighbors, but starts to feel suffocated under the abuse and the looks she gets as if she was something to be eaten up. One day, in the midst of her hellish everyday life, a stranger comes to her house.', 'The life of Ipse, a 19-year-old girl who cannot get out of her own bed due to psychological trauma, is as motionless as a plant. Having no family and no clue of her family''s mysterious history, she lives completely dependent on her neighbors, but starts to feel suffocated under the abuse and the looks she gets as if she was something to be eaten up. One day, in the midst of her hellish everyday life, a stranger comes to her house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uWcEOd8yuu7HiRZUqrzVZ7WXMli.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:566936'),
  ('324537871644495366', 'The Uncle from Brooklyn', 1995, 'Comedy', 'Franco Maresco, Daniele Ciprì, Lillo Iacolino', 'Daniele Ciprì, Franco Maresco', 'Salvatore Gattuso, Pippo Agusta, Salvatore Schiera, Gaspare Marchione, Natale Lauria, Rosario Carollo, Pietro Rizzo, Francesco Arnao', null, 'Set in apocalyptic Palermo peopled by ignorant, inbred, flatulent gluttons and deformed Mafiosi, a dark comedy which centers on a poor family of three-middle aged brothers who are coerced, by local Mafia honchos, into hiding a mysterious old man known as the Uncle from Brooklyn in their home.', 'Set in apocalyptic Palermo peopled by ignorant, inbred, flatulent gluttons and deformed Mafiosi, a dark comedy which centers on a poor family of three-middle aged brothers who are coerced, by local Mafia honchos, into hiding a mysterious old man known as the Uncle from Brooklyn in their home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4rTDFNEr2pSUTYulzv2zc19ystW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62572'),
  ('370451165343792279', 'The Uncovering', 2018, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Javier Salmones, Nacho Ruipérez', 'Mario Fernández Alonso, Nacho Ruipérez', 'Leonardo Sbaraglia, Michel Noher, Jan Cornet, Nesrin Cavadzade, Jelena Jovanova Perikj, Arben Bajraktaraj, Cristina Fernández Pintado, Francesc Garrido', null, 'The sudden reappearance of the young Vera in a coastal village makes Jordi decide to undertake the search for his father, who has been presumed dead for over twenty years.', 'The sudden reappearance of the young Vera in a coastal village makes Jordi decide to undertake the search for his father, who has been presumed dead for over twenty years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2cRLwvG39DG6aDCti51k9sJRDq0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:534937'),
  ('881631735625578617', 'The Uncut Story of Mewtwo''s Origin', 1999, 'Animation, Drama, Fantasy', 'Kunihiko Yuyama', 'Takeshi Shudo', 'Yosuke Akimoto, Showtaro Morikubo, Kyoko Hikami, Etsuko Kozakura, Yuji Ueda, Satomi Korogi, Masachika Ichimura', null, 'The devious leader of Team Rocket Organization, Giovanni, has a fervent ambition to take control of the Pokémon world through both financial and military means. To achieve his military needs, he covets a Pokémon stronger and more adept than any other, a veritable living war weapon, so he enlists a scientist named Doctor Fuji to create this being from the DNA of the ancestor of all Pokémon and most powerful of Pokémon, Mew, which Fuji had found on a previous jungle expedition. Fuji accepts, for he is heavily into the prospect of cloning to create and restore life itself, because of his love for his deceased daughter, Amber.', 'The devious leader of Team Rocket Organization, Giovanni, has a fervent ambition to take control of the Pokémon world through both financial and military means. To achieve his military needs, he covets a Pokémon stronger and more adept than any other, a veritable living war weapon, so he enlists a scientist named Doctor Fuji to create this being from the DNA of the ancestor of all Pokémon and most powerful of Pokémon, Mew, which Fuji had found on a previous jungle expedition. Fuji accepts, for he is heavily into the prospect of cloning to create and restore life itself, because of his love for his deceased daughter, Amber.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/13ojzcdgxnTeAtHlbXk09zALcbY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:315520'),
  ('426569109080490806', 'The Undead', 1957, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'Roger Corman, William A. Sickner, Lou Place', 'Mark Hanna, Charles B. Griffith', 'Pamela Duncan, Richard Garland, Allison Hayes, Val Dufour, Mel Welles, Dorothy Neumann, Billy Barty, Bruno VeSota', null, 'Two psychics place a prostitute under hypnosis in order to learn about her past-life experiences. When they unwittingly send her back in time, she finds herself in the Middle Ages, suspected of being a witch and on the verge of being executed.', 'Two psychics place a prostitute under hypnosis in order to learn about her past-life experiences. When they unwittingly send her back in time, she finds herself in the Middle Ages, suspected of being a witch and on the verge of being executed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/osMONnDvj0QLSOR0pQR3HwVCVSG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29071'),
  ('434377637560178260', 'The Undecided Groom', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Giorgio Amato, Andrea Gabriele', 'Giorgio Amato', 'Gianmarco Tognazzi, Ilenia Pastorelli, Stefano Pesce, Francesco Pannofino, Morena Gentile, Ornella Muti, Giulia Gualano, Giorgio Colangeli', null, 'An unlikely marriage between two worlds that would like to unite, but their diversity will inexorably make them incompatible. And the more they try, the more they move away, with the hand of fate. Or maybe not...', 'An unlikely marriage between two worlds that would like to unite, but their diversity will inexorably make them incompatible. And the more they try, the more they move away, with the hand of fate. Or maybe not...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2W0p1wnQkZkQMMETyQiV9QcIhcc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1058954'),
  ('764728527107412270', 'The Undefeated', 1969, 'Western', 'Andrew V. McLaglen, William H. Clothier', 'James Lee Barrett', 'John Wayne, Rock Hudson, Antonio Aguilar, Roman Gabriel, Marian McCargo, Lee Meriwether, Merlin Olsen, Melissa Newman', 'PG', 'After the Civil War, ex-Union Colonel John Henry Thomas and ex-Confederate Colonel James Langdon are leading two disparate groups of people through strife-torn Mexico. John Henry and company are bringing horses to the unpopular Mexican government for $35 a head while Langdon is leading a contingent of displaced southerners, who are looking for a new life in Mexico after losing their property to carpetbaggers. The two men are eventually forced to mend their differences in order to fight off both bandits and revolutionaries, as they try to lead their friends and kin to safety.', 'After the Civil War, ex-Union Colonel John Henry Thomas and ex-Confederate Colonel James Langdon are leading two disparate groups of people through strife-torn Mexico. John Henry and company are bringing horses to the unpopular Mexican government for $35 a head while Langdon is leading a contingent of displaced southerners, who are looking for a new life in Mexico after losing their property to carpetbaggers. The two men are eventually forced to mend their differences in order to fight off both bandits and revolutionaries, as they try to lead their friends and kin to safety.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vWoGmFL5LvnF5rDgizfvPWyecmk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18972'),
  ('513572868589675652', 'The Under-Gifted', 1980, 'Comedy', 'Claude Zidi', 'Michel Fabre', 'Daniel Auteuil, Michel Galabru, Maria Pacôme, Philippe Taccini, Hubert Deschamps, Raymond Bussières, Étienne Draber, Tonie Marshall', null, 'The story centers around a graduating class of "less-gifted" students in a private Versailles high school. Only a miracle has brought the students this far along, and after a practical joke misfires and the whole school is dynamited, the students are in deep trouble. They have to present themselves in court for their punishment and it could not be worse: If they don''t pass their high-school graduation exams, they go to prison!', 'The story centers around a graduating class of "less-gifted" students in a private Versailles high school. Only a miracle has brought the students this far along, and after a practical joke misfires and the whole school is dynamited, the students are in deep trouble. They have to present themselves in court for their punishment and it could not be worse: If they don''t pass their high-school graduation exams, they go to prison!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rbYoFUzstYpGw1A2UYDSh7SqQOn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60175'),
  ('260883571736329390', 'The Undercover Man', 1949, 'Crime, Drama', 'Joseph H. Lewis, Wilbur McGaugh, Burnett Guffey', 'Frank J. Wilson', 'Glenn Ford, Nina Foch, James Whitmore, Barry Kelley, Frank Tweddell, Howard St. John, John F. Hamilton, Leo Penn', 'NR', 'Frank Warren is a treasury agent assigned to put an end to the activities of a powerful mob crime boss. Frank works undercover, posing as a criminal to seek information, but is frustrated when all he finds are terrified witnesses and corrupt police officers.', 'Frank Warren is a treasury agent assigned to put an end to the activities of a powerful mob crime boss. Frank works undercover, posing as a criminal to seek information, but is frustrated when all he finds are terrified witnesses and corrupt police officers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5l3CoMK953DUsvEaKPbHoGhJgXH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23189'),
  ('31995773837891765', 'The Underdog', 1960, 'Comedy', 'Dinos Dimopoulos', 'Christos Giannakopoulos, Alekos Sakellarios', 'Aliki Vougiouklaki, Alekos Alexandrakis, Stefanos Linaios, Thanasis Veggos, Marika Krevata, Joly Garbi, Stavros Xenidis, Tasso Kavadia', null, 'A young woman asks from a ship magnate to help her immigrate to Australia but he falls in love with her.', 'A young woman asks from a ship magnate to help her immigrate to Australia but he falls in love with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ugwCderybjTPRjO1XZC9SFBwbo5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:367159'),
  ('789507833560301908', 'The Underdog Knight', 2008, 'Action, Crime', 'Ding Sheng', 'Ding Sheng, Wong Jing', 'Liu Ye, Anthony Wong Chau-Sang, You Yongzhi, Young Liu, Sun Honglei, Yu Rongguang, Ellen Chan Nga-Lun, Otto Wong', null, 'Lao San is a young veteran high in Kungfu power but low in intelligence. After landing on a job as a body guard for a wealthy antique collector, Lao San finds out his boss''s plot to rob the National Art Museum.', 'Lao San is a young veteran high in Kungfu power but low in intelligence. After landing on a job as a body guard for a wealthy antique collector, Lao San finds out his boss''s plot to rob the National Art Museum.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pJzR2PdFReutUkOT4y9uq0B8Hl3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33338'),
  ('750697349664160867', 'The Underdoggs', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Charles Stone III, Mitchell Amundsen', 'Danny Segal, Isaac Schamis', 'Snoop Dogg, Tika Sumpter, Elias Ferguson, Jonigan Booth, Caleb Dixon, Adan James Carrillo, Alexander Michael Gordon, Kylah Davila', 'R', 'Jaycen ''Two Js'' Jennings is a washed-up former pro football star who has hit rock bottom. When sentenced to community service coaching the Underdoggs, an unruly pee-wee football team in his hometown, he sees it mostly as an opportunity to rebuild his public image. But in the process, he may just turn his life around and rediscover his love of the game.', 'Jaycen ''Two Js'' Jennings is a washed-up former pro football star who has hit rock bottom. When sentenced to community service coaching the Underdoggs, an unruly pee-wee football team in his hometown, he sees it mostly as an opportunity to rebuild his public image. But in the process, he may just turn his life around and rediscover his love of the game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/haFB89tlAcex3WHuy3trtp1yhwt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1007826'),
