  ('951255036306335411', 'The Unheard', 2023, 'Drama, Horror, Mystery', 'Jeffrey A. Brown, Owen Levelle, Dayna Schutz', 'Michael Rasmussen, Shawn Rasmussen', 'Lachlan Watson, Nick Sandow, Brendan Meyer, Michele Hicks, Shunori Ramanathan, Boyana Balta, Beckett Guest, Michelle Violette', 'NR', 'Chloe Grayden undergoes an experimental procedure to restore her hearing. Soon she begins to suffer from auditory hallucinations related to the disappearance of her mother.', 'Chloe Grayden undergoes an experimental procedure to restore her hearing. Soon she begins to suffer from auditory hallucinations related to the disappearance of her mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nRW7jHeSMAsuSQyLDYIc04T9F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1088619'),
  ('436770999752067774', 'The Unheard Woman', 2016, 'TV Movie, Drama, History', 'Hans Steinbichler, Christian Rein, Eckhard W. Kuchenbecker', 'Christian Lex, Angelika Schwarzhuber', 'Sebastian Bezzel, Rosalie Thomass, Romy Butz, Gisela Schneeberger, Gundi Ellert, Andreas Giebel, Tom Kreß, Benedikt Hösl', null, 'What if nobody wants to believe you? Hanni, a farmer''s wife and mother of three, is worried about her daughter Magdalena. The girl is smaller than the others, more sensitive, vomits more often and has increasingly poor eyesight. The doctors, the teacher and the family all say it must be her psyche. Glasses with normal lenses will certainly help. But as a mother, Hanni senses that a new pair of glasses won''t change anything and that there is more at stake. Even plagued by an unheard-of memory from her youth, she begins to fight unwaveringly and unstoppably for her daughter''s suffering, not only putting her family''s happiness and her livelihood at risk, but also not shying away from the Bavarian justice system in the end.', 'What if nobody wants to believe you? Hanni, a farmer''s wife and mother of three, is worried about her daughter Magdalena. The girl is smaller than the others, more sensitive, vomits more often and has increasingly poor eyesight. The doctors, the teacher and the family all say it must be her psyche. Glasses with normal lenses will certainly help. But as a mother, Hanni senses that a new pair of glasses won''t change anything and that there is more at stake. Even plagued by an unheard-of memory from her youth, she begins to fight unwaveringly and unstoppably for her daughter''s suffering, not only putting her family''s happiness and her livelihood at risk, but also not shying away from the Bavarian justice system in the end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kypIrXzIm6hG10dt8yrZfYj4j5E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:403480'),
  ('762890447407097839', 'The Unholy', 1988, 'Horror', 'Camilo Vila, Henry Vargas', 'Philip Yordan, Fernando Fonseca', 'Ben Cross, Ned Beatty, William Russ, Jill Carroll, Hal Holbrook, Trevor Howard, Nicole Fortier, Peter Frechette', 'R', 'A priest battles a demon that kills sinners in the act of sinning.', 'A priest battles a demon that kills sinners in the act of sinning.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oPyGrEVmjtt1NiPunNDyjE1SVNh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86680'),
  ('1127109274475387486', 'The Unholy', 2021, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Evan Spiliotopoulos, Craig Wrobleski', 'Evan Spiliotopoulos', 'Jeffrey Dean Morgan, Cricket Brown, William Sadler, Katie Aselton, Cary Elwes, Diogo Morgado, Bates Wilder, Marina Mazepa', 'PG-13', 'Alice is a young hearing-impaired girl who, after a supposed visitation from the Virgin Mary, is inexplicably able to hear, speak and heal the sick. As word spreads and people from near and far flock to witness her miracles, a disgraced journalist hoping to revive his career visits the small New England town to investigate. When terrifying events begin to happen all around, he starts to question if these phenomena are the works of the Virgin Mary or something much more sinister.', 'Alice is a young hearing-impaired girl who, after a supposed visitation from the Virgin Mary, is inexplicably able to hear, speak and heal the sick. As word spreads and people from near and far flock to witness her miracles, a disgraced journalist hoping to revive his career visits the small New England town to investigate. When terrifying events begin to happen all around, he starts to question if these phenomena are the works of the Virgin Mary or something much more sinister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bShgiEQoPnWdw4LBrYT5u18JF34.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:632357'),
  ('758502257965712765', 'The Unholy Four', 1970, 'Western', 'Enzo Barboni, Mario Montuori', 'Mario Di Nardo, George Eastman, Franco Rosetti', 'Leonard Mann, Woody Strode, Pietro Martellanza, Helmuth Schneider, George Eastman, Ida Galli, Alain Naya, Dino Strano', null, 'A young man who has lost his memory, escapes from prison with three other convicts. The other men help him find back bits of his past, until they arrive at a village where two warring families recognize him. Apparently he has a reputation for being a fast gun, and he has been paid to kill a man - who says he is his father. His younger brother is jealous of the attention the prodigal son receives, and things come to a dramatic end.', 'A young man who has lost his memory, escapes from prison with three other convicts. The other men help him find back bits of his past, until they arrive at a village where two warring families recognize him. Apparently he has a reputation for being a fast gun, and he has been paid to kill a man - who says he is his father. His younger brother is jealous of the attention the prodigal son receives, and things come to a dramatic end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iUcHIkAyuHm9yAkJoNMBA0bvvZG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75086'),
  ('166866102972197973', 'The Unholy Rollers', 1972, 'Action, Comedy, Drama', 'Vernon Zimmerman, Michael Shea', 'Howard R. Cohen', 'Claudia Jennings, Louis Quinn, Betty Anne Rees, Roberta Collins, Alan Vint, Candice Roman, Jay Varela, Charlene Jones', 'R', 'Karen wants more action out of life and quits her job at the cannery to become a skater in the roller derby. She encounters friction from the other skaters - especially Mickey, the current number one star of the team. Karen proves herself a feisty competitor but refuses to be a team player. As she skates her way to roller stardom, she incurs the wrath of jealous team members and the owner of the team.', 'Karen wants more action out of life and quits her job at the cannery to become a skater in the roller derby. She encounters friction from the other skaters - especially Mickey, the current number one star of the team. Karen proves herself a feisty competitor but refuses to be a team player. As she skates her way to roller stardom, she incurs the wrath of jealous team members and the owner of the team.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sRVDvu2cfueiWuQvmi7CqaPreIW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91891'),
  ('390757206460497922', 'The Unholy Three', 1925, 'Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'David Kesson, Tod Browning', 'Waldemar Young', 'Lon Chaney, Mae Busch, Matt Moore, Victor McLaglen, Harry Earles, Matthew Betz, Edward Connelly, William Humphrey', 'NR', 'Three sideshow performers form a conspiracy known as "The Unholy Three" - a ventriloquist, midget, and strongman working together to commit a series of robberies.', 'Three sideshow performers form a conspiracy known as "The Unholy Three" - a ventriloquist, midget, and strongman working together to commit a series of robberies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aU3eZJEuzFzngrnTQJrqhTQ8zzO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27505'),
  ('1086306948115888039', 'The Unholy Three', 1930, 'Crime, Drama', 'Jack Conway', 'J. C. Nugent, Elliott Nugent', 'Lon Chaney, Lila Lee, Elliott Nugent, Harry Earles, John Miljan, Ivan Linow, Clarence Burton, Crauford Kent', null, 'A trio of former sideshow performers double as the "Unholy Three" in a scam to nab some shiny rocks.', 'A trio of former sideshow performers double as the "Unholy Three" in a scam to nab some shiny rocks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4NLoePBFJX8O0yCwBbhrqhHFXFp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27504'),
  ('197794993323693115', 'The Unholy Trinity', 2025, 'Western, Adventure, Crime', 'Richard Gray, Thomas Scott Stanton, Elaine Grainger', 'Lee Zachariah', 'Pierce Brosnan, Samuel L. Jackson, Brandon Lessard, Veronica Ferres, Gianni Capaldi, Q''orianka Kilcher, Tim Daly, Ethan Peck', 'R', 'Set against the turbulent backdrop of 1870s Montana, in the moments before the execution of Isaac Broadway, he gives his estranged son, Henry, an impossible task: murder the man who framed him for a crime he didn’t commit. Intent on fulfilling his promise, Henry travels to the remote town of Trinity, where an unexpected turn of events traps him in town and leaves him caught between Gabriel Dove, the town’s upstanding new sheriff, and a mysterious figure named St. Christopher.', 'Set against the turbulent backdrop of 1870s Montana, in the moments before the execution of Isaac Broadway, he gives his estranged son, Henry, an impossible task: murder the man who framed him for a crime he didn’t commit. Intent on fulfilling his promise, Henry travels to the remote town of Trinity, where an unexpected turn of events traps him in town and leaves him caught between Gabriel Dove, the town’s upstanding new sheriff, and a mysterious figure named St. Christopher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gXYYIX5VesrDtR1iYJfvUnJBPLB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1195518'),
  ('1008049061304278548', 'The Unholy Wife', 1957, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'John Farrow, Lucien Ballard, Emmett Emerson', 'Jonathan Latimer', 'Diana Dors, Rod Steiger, Tom Tryon, Beulah Bondi, Marie Windsor, Arthur Franz, Luis van Rooten, Joe De Santis', 'NR', 'A woman marries a man for his wealth, then concocts a plan to kill him, take his money, and run off with her lover. Things go wrong when they accidentally kill the wrong person.', 'A woman marries a man for his wealth, then concocts a plan to kill him, take his money, and run off with her lover. Things go wrong when they accidentally kill the wrong person.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jBM9xGHTLGbh1i5AUylTY4i0Ril.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25722'),
  ('1009861474461924310', 'The Unicorn in the Garden', 1953, 'Animation, Fantasy', 'William T. Hurtz', null, null, null, 'Based on James Thurber''s short-story about a mild, henpecked man who, while preparing his breakfast, looks out the window and sees a unicorn eating flowers in the garden. He rushes upstairs to inform his domineering wife, and she accuses him of being crazy and threatens to have him put away. He persists that he did see a unicorn in the garden, and she phones for the authorities to come take him away. But when they arrive, with strait-jackets, they find the wife rambling and raving about seeing the unicorn, and promptly take her away.', 'Based on James Thurber''s short-story about a mild, henpecked man who, while preparing his breakfast, looks out the window and sees a unicorn eating flowers in the garden. He rushes upstairs to inform his domineering wife, and she accuses him of being crazy and threatens to have him put away. He persists that he did see a unicorn in the garden, and she phones for the authorities to come take him away. But when they arrive, with strait-jackets, they find the wife rambling and raving about seeing the unicorn, and promptly take her away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hsuT6j3hhRLCGc3IAepOQL5g0mn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128753'),
  ('656799600579960653', 'The Unintentional Kidnapping of Mrs. Elfriede Ott', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Andreas Prochaska, Andrea Inreiter-Aust', 'Andreas Prochaska', 'Michael Ostrowski, Andreas Kiendl, Elfriede Ott, Gerhard Liebmann, Angelika Niedetzky, Monica Reyes, Simon Hatzl, Thomas Mraz', null, 'Horst receives the monthly pension from his grandmother. The only problem is, that she is dead. As a local politician wants to congratulate the grandmother to her birthday Horst "borrows" an old lady from a hospital nearby, not recognizing that he just kidnapped actress Elfriede Ott.', 'Horst receives the monthly pension from his grandmother. The only problem is, that she is dead. As a local politician wants to congratulate the grandmother to her birthday Horst "borrows" an old lady from a hospital nearby, not recognizing that he just kidnapped actress Elfriede Ott.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3iuuvMNa3SxqAd3jrlLKhXEdW9a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59255'),
  ('572550256356367553', 'The Uninvited', 1944, 'Mystery, Horror, Fantasy, Romance', 'Charles Lang, Lewis Allen', 'Dodie Smith, Frank Partos', 'Ray Milland, Ruth Hussey, Gail Russell, Donald Crisp, Alan Napier, Cornelia Otis Skinner, Barbara Everest, Dorothy Stickney', 'NR', 'A pair of siblings from London [Ray Milland and Ruth Hussey] purchase a surprisingly affordable, lonely cliff-top house in Cornwall, England. Only to discover that it actually carries a ghostly price, and soon they’re caught up in a bizarre romantic triangle from beyond the grave. Rich in atmosphere, The Uninvited, directed by Lewis Allen, was groundbreaking for the seriousness with which it treated the supernatural, haunted house genre, and it remains an elegant and eerie experience, featuring a classic score by Victor Young. A tragic family past, a mysteriously locked room, cold chills, bumps in the night - this gothic Hollywood classic has it all.', 'A pair of siblings from London [Ray Milland and Ruth Hussey] purchase a surprisingly affordable, lonely cliff-top house in Cornwall, England. Only to discover that it actually carries a ghostly price, and soon they’re caught up in a bizarre romantic triangle from beyond the grave. Rich in atmosphere, The Uninvited, directed by Lewis Allen, was groundbreaking for the seriousness with which it treated the supernatural, haunted house genre, and it remains an elegant and eerie experience, featuring a classic score by Victor Young. A tragic family past, a mysteriously locked room, cold chills, bumps in the night - this gothic Hollywood classic has it all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uwp5ahLmWliRyX3mPoLHU7BKhf5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16373'),
  ('904798464268783713', 'The Uninvited', 1996, 'Horror, TV Movie, Mystery', 'Larry Shaw, Carl Lawrence Ludwig', 'Karen Clark', 'Sharon Lawrence, Beau Bridges, Shirley Knight, Alex D. Linz, Lawrence Pressman, Emily Bridges, Kathleen Lloyd, James Pickens Jr.', null, 'A family, trying to pull themselves together after losing their infant son, moves into a new home, where, almost immediately, the mother begins experiencing paranormal phenomena. She finds it playful at first, but as it grows increasingly malevolent, she is unable to convince her husband of it, and she must contend with it to protect her family from its influence.', 'A family, trying to pull themselves together after losing their infant son, moves into a new home, where, almost immediately, the mother begins experiencing paranormal phenomena. She finds it playful at first, but as it grows increasingly malevolent, she is unable to convince her husband of it, and she must contend with it to protect her family from its influence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qLrqOl9VzpWjp661It30SBAmuHa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:131914'),
  ('1047603546697686017', 'The Uninvited', 2003, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Lee Soo-youn, Cho Yong-kyu', 'Lee Soo-youn', 'Park Shin-yang, Gianna Jun, Yu Seon, Lee Joo-sil, Lee Seok-jun, Kim Yeo-jin, Seo Jeong-gyu, Kim Yong-wan', null, 'An engaged interior designer sees two small girls on the subway train that die there. He sees them again in his apartment. A woman he meets can also see them. He talks to her about his forgotten childhood.', 'An engaged interior designer sees two small girls on the subway train that die there. He sees them again in his apartment. A woman he meets can also see them. He talks to her about his forgotten childhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wVh1LRHa5IfsRh3gX4jykIDwQAP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29448'),
  ('543014356682422833', 'The Uninvited', 2009, 'Horror', 'Thomas Guard, Charles Guard, James Bitonti', 'Carlo Bernard, Craig Rosenberg, Doug Miro', 'Emily Browning, Arielle Kebbel, David Strathairn, Elizabeth Banks, Maya Massar, Kevin McNulty, Jesse Moss, Dean Paul Gibson', 'PG-13', 'Anna returns home after spending time in a psychiatric facility following her mother''s tragic death and discovers that her mother''s former nurse, Rachel, has moved into their house and become engaged to her father. Soon after she learns this shocking news, Anna is visited by her mother''s ghost, who warns her that Rachel has evil intentions.', 'Anna returns home after spending time in a psychiatric facility following her mother''s tragic death and discovers that her mother''s former nurse, Rachel, has moved into their house and become engaged to her father. Soon after she learns this shocking news, Anna is visited by her mother''s ghost, who warns her that Rachel has evil intentions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1xQlzKUDLuCe3SUGIGL6K1PtldH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14254'),
  ('211304289863358564', 'The Uninvited', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Rob Leitzell, Nadia Conners, Silawn Lewis', 'Nadia Conners', 'Elizabeth Reaser, Walton Goggins, Lois Smith, Eva De Dominici, Rufus Sewell, Pedro Pascal, Roland Rubio, Kate Comer', 'R', 'Rose and Sammy enjoy an idyllic life with love, a Hollywood Hills home, and a curious son. During a party, Sammy assigns unusual significance to it, while Rose juggles preparations amid distractions. The unexpected arrival of Helen, who claims residence there, oscillates between confusion and lucidity. Strangely, Helen possesses intimate knowledge of the house and its guests. Her revelations spark drama, unearthing hidden truths and compelling Rose to confront her past, future, and the desire for change.', 'Rose and Sammy enjoy an idyllic life with love, a Hollywood Hills home, and a curious son. During a party, Sammy assigns unusual significance to it, while Rose juggles preparations amid distractions. The unexpected arrival of Helen, who claims residence there, oscillates between confusion and lucidity. Strangely, Helen possesses intimate knowledge of the house and its guests. Her revelations spark drama, unearthing hidden truths and compelling Rose to confront her past, future, and the desire for change.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/clojTZu0mEYAMejfoU4fgJ6FLJU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1113421'),
  ('491331172764387774', 'The Uninvited Guest', 2005, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller, Horror', 'Guillem Morales, Sergi Bartrolí', 'Guillem Morales', 'Andoni Gracia, Mónica López, Francesc Garrido, Agustí Villaronga, Minnie Marx, Pablo Derqui, Violeta Llueca, Xavier Capdet', null, 'Mysterious events lead an increasingly paranoid architect to believe a stranger is lurking in his large house.', 'Mysterious events lead an increasingly paranoid architect to believe a stranger is lurking in his large house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y7k9wy9kjxDqe5kIBqw210CZi0Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48594'),
  ('769216178192065378', 'The Union', 2024, 'Action, Comedy', 'Julian Farino, Alan Stewart, Alex Oakley', 'Joe Barton, David Guggenheim', 'Mark Wahlberg, Halle Berry, J.K. Simmons, Mike Colter, Adewale Akinnuoye-Agbaje, Jessica De Gouw, Alice Lee, Jackie Earle Haley', 'PG-13', 'A New Jersey construction worker goes from regular guy to aspiring spy when his long-lost high school sweetheart recruits him for an espionage mission.', 'A New Jersey construction worker goes from regular guy to aspiring spy when his long-lost high school sweetheart recruits him for an espionage mission.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d9CTnTHip1RbVi2OQbA2LJJQAGI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:704239'),
  ('1023134946769699639', 'The Union: The Business Behind Getting High', 2007, 'Comedy, Documentary', 'Brett Harvey', null, 'George H. W. Bush, George W. Bush, Chris Bennett, Tommy Chong, Joe Rogan, Craig X. Rubin, Maestro', null, 'Filmmaker Adam Scorgie explores the illegal marijuana industry in British Columbia, revealing how the international business is most likely more profitable than it would be if it was lawful in this enlightening documentary. Marijuana growers, law enforcement officials, physicians, politicians, criminologists, economists and celebrities—including comedian Tommy Chong—shed light on this topical subject in a series of compelling interviews.', 'Filmmaker Adam Scorgie explores the illegal marijuana industry in British Columbia, revealing how the international business is most likely more profitable than it would be if it was lawful in this enlightening documentary. Marijuana growers, law enforcement officials, physicians, politicians, criminologists, economists and celebrities—including comedian Tommy Chong—shed light on this topical subject in a series of compelling interviews.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6szDJcCbjyAilGVaqUbT9k5bD7G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36443'),
  ('983572642231425202', 'The United States of America', 1975, 'Documentary', 'Bette Gordon, James Benning', null, 'James Benning, Bette Gordon', null, 'A conceptual bicentennial film dealing with spatial and temporal relationships between two travelers, their car, and the geographic, political, and social changes from NY to Los Angeles.', 'A conceptual bicentennial film dealing with spatial and temporal relationships between two travelers, their car, and the geographic, political, and social changes from NY to Los Angeles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y5FSB8ImN5takDEt8EqEY0IZzYU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:380429'),
  ('630938238237692095', 'The United States of Leland', 2003, 'Crime, Drama', 'Matthew Ryan Hoge, William Paul Clark, Dawn Massaro', 'Matthew Ryan Hoge', 'Ryan Gosling, Don Cheadle, Chris Klein, Kevin Spacey, Jena Malone, Lena Olin, Michelle Williams, Martin Donovan', 'R', 'A withdrawn young man, Leland Fitzgerald is imprisoned for the murder of a mentally disabled boy, who also happened to be the brother of his girlfriend, Becky. As the community struggles to deal with the killing, Pearl Madison, a teacher at the prison, decides to write about Leland''s case. Meanwhile, others affected by the murder, including Becky and her sister, Julie, must contend with their own problems.', 'A withdrawn young man, Leland Fitzgerald is imprisoned for the murder of a mentally disabled boy, who also happened to be the brother of his girlfriend, Becky. As the community struggles to deal with the killing, Pearl Madison, a teacher at the prison, decides to write about Leland''s case. Meanwhile, others affected by the murder, including Becky and her sister, Julie, must contend with their own problems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/60B0kXNSy3isCSZtM3vl2GWeKdE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13573'),
  ('780289529262593626', 'The United States vs. Billie Holiday', 2021, 'Music, Drama, History', 'Fanny Hudon, Luc-Eric Duhamel, Félix Larivière-Charron', 'Suzan-Lori Parks', 'Andra Day, Trevante Rhodes, Garrett Hedlund, Leslie Jordan, Miss Lawrence, Adriane Lenox, Natasha Lyonne, Rob Morgan', 'R', 'Billie Holiday spent much of her career being adored by fans. In the 1940s, the government targeted Holiday in a growing effort to racialize the war on drugs, ultimately aiming to stop her from singing her controversial ballad, "Strange Fruit."', 'Billie Holiday spent much of her career being adored by fans. In the 1940s, the government targeted Holiday in a growing effort to racialize the war on drugs, ultimately aiming to stop her from singing her controversial ballad, "Strange Fruit."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vEzkxuE2sJcmHYjXQHM8xvR9ICH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:566076'),
  ('1012395920640600866', 'The United Way', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Mat Hodgson', 'Mat Hodgson', 'Éric Cantona, David Beckham, Ole Gunnar Solskjaer, Nicky Butt, Bryan Robson, Ryan Giggs, Martin Edwards, Ron Atkinson', null, 'The United Way is the legendary story of one of the most iconic sports teams in the world, Manchester United, from their humblest of beginnings to a behemoth with over 650 million supporters worldwide. Presented by Eric Cantona and featuring Charlton, Best, Cantona, Beckham, and Ronaldo, alongside stunning archival and never-before-seen footage, The United Way celebrates the global phenomenon of a unifying club for the people, by the people.', 'The United Way is the legendary story of one of the most iconic sports teams in the world, Manchester United, from their humblest of beginnings to a behemoth with over 650 million supporters worldwide. Presented by Eric Cantona and featuring Charlton, Best, Cantona, Beckham, and Ronaldo, alongside stunning archival and never-before-seen footage, The United Way celebrates the global phenomenon of a unifying club for the people, by the people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bF1E2UnkDm17xxBpLqqsyhGPQDB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:811959'),
  ('547954688953521813', 'The Unity of Heroes', 2018, 'Action', 'Lin Zhenzhao', 'Niu Xinyao, Gao Yuhao, Yang Ning', 'Vincent Zhao Wenzhuo, Michael Tong Man-Lung, Wei Na, Li Lubing, Li Bingyuan, Chen Chen, Wei Xiaohuan', null, 'A shipment of a narcotic more dangerous than opium is about to be distributed across the country by a corrupt pharmaceutical company. In the face of foreign and domestic enemies, can Wong Fei-Hung stop the spread of this dangerous narcotic and save lives in time?', 'A shipment of a narcotic more dangerous than opium is about to be distributed across the country by a corrupt pharmaceutical company. In the face of foreign and domestic enemies, can Wong Fei-Hung stop the spread of this dangerous narcotic and save lives in time?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l5juynjltgsQCyAoEaPKDeMYDBs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:537328'),
  ('62944887342735788', 'The Universal Theory', 2023, 'Mystery, Thriller, Drama', 'Roland Stuprich, Timm Kröger', 'Roderick Warich, Timm Kröger', 'Jan Bülow, Olivia Ross, Hanns Zischler, Gottfried Breitfuß, Philippe Graber, David Bennent, Imogen Kogge, Dirk Böhling', null, 'Johannes, a doctor of physics, travels with his doctoral supervisor to a scientific congress in the Alps. A series of mysterious incidents occur on site. He meets Karin, a mysterious jazz pianist who seems to know more about him than she can know. Suddenly, mysterious deaths begin to pile up and Johannes tries to uncover the secret under the mountain.', 'Johannes, a doctor of physics, travels with his doctoral supervisor to a scientific congress in the Alps. A series of mysterious incidents occur on site. He meets Karin, a mysterious jazz pianist who seems to know more about him than she can know. Suddenly, mysterious deaths begin to pile up and Johannes tries to uncover the secret under the mountain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b7NKIMoP2fhIf90q6fUCuoAA0K8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:932801'),
  ('1141880184540859092', 'The Unjust', 2010, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Ryoo Seung-wan, Chung Chung-hoon, Park Noo-ri', 'Park Hoon-jung', 'Hwang Jung-min, Ryoo Seung-bum, Yoo Hai-jin, Cheon Ho-jin, Don Lee, Woo Jung-kook, Jo Young-jin, Jeong Man-sik', null, 'An honest cop has to compromise with his principles when he is told to find a scapegoat for a high-profile serial killer case in exchange for a big promotion.', 'An honest cop has to compromise with his principles when he is told to find a scapegoat for a high-profile serial killer case in exchange for a big promotion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hn2Pu51LaCGihMPc5iPlmBWdq42.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61062'),
  ('139169424220988784', 'The Unknown', 1927, 'Drama, Thriller, Romance, Horror', 'Tod Browning, Merritt B. Gerstad, Harry Sharrock', 'Joseph Farnham', 'Lon Chaney, Norman Kerry, Joan Crawford, Nick De Ruiz, John George, Frank Lanning, Tom Amandares, Margaret Bert', 'NR', 'On the lam, criminal Alonzo hides in the circus as The Armless Wonder – a performer who uses his feet to hurl knives. Alonzo keeps the arms he really has concealed to hide his identity. Meanwhile, ringmaster''s daughter Nanon has a phobia of being touched by men, but is romantically pursued by not only Alonzo but the strongman Malabar. Alonzo''s desperation to remain with Nanon will only end in tragedy.', 'On the lam, criminal Alonzo hides in the circus as The Armless Wonder – a performer who uses his feet to hurl knives. Alonzo keeps the arms he really has concealed to hide his identity. Meanwhile, ringmaster''s daughter Nanon has a phobia of being touched by men, but is romantically pursued by not only Alonzo but the strongman Malabar. Alonzo''s desperation to remain with Nanon will only end in tragedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c9R1wE1vMJWMZNdmqXUV8oTaCPQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27503'),
  ('752142476358234118', 'The Unknown', 2000, 'Science Fiction, Horror, Mystery', 'Anders Jacobsson, Michael Hjorth', 'Michael Hjorth, Tomas Tivemark', 'Jacob Ericksson, Marcus Palm, Ann-Sofie Rase, Ingar Sigvardsdotter, Tomas Tivemark', null, 'Five young field-biologists are sent to northern Sweden to investigate effects of a large forest fire. However, what was thought to be some weeks of camping and easy work soon turns into a nightmare as they find the remains of a mysterious creature and take it in for examination...', 'Five young field-biologists are sent to northern Sweden to investigate effects of a large forest fire. However, what was thought to be some weeks of camping and easy work soon turns into a nightmare as they find the remains of a mysterious creature and take it in for examination...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sTuaZUUTY6X3sTlHikr50mPr4f9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34754'),
  ('416718283077458162', 'The Unknown Country', 2023, 'Drama', 'Morrisa Maltz, Andrew Hajek', 'Morrisa Maltz', 'Lily Gladstone, Raymond Lee, Richard Ray Whitman, Lainey Bearkiller Shangreaux, Devin Shangreaux, Jasmine Bearkiller Shangreaux, Pam Richter, Dale Leander Toller', 'NR', 'A grieving woman embarks on an unexpected road trip as she grapples with the pain of her recent loss and seeks to understand her place in the world.', 'A grieving woman embarks on an unexpected road trip as she grapples with the pain of her recent loss and seeks to understand her place in the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/boKTvkCcBIUDHSo3GccmeWDgzst.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:934606'),
  ('105615595890093896', 'The Unknown Girl', 2016, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Jean-Pierre Dardenne, Luc Dardenne, Alain Marcoen', 'Jean-Pierre Dardenne, Luc Dardenne', 'Adèle Haenel, Olivier Bonnaud, Jérémie Renier, Louka Minnella, Nadège Ouedraogo, Christelle Cornil, Olivier Gourmet, Pierre Sumkay', null, 'Jenny, a young doctor who feels guilty after a young woman she refused to see winds up dead a few days later, decides to find out who the girl was, after the police can''t identify the young woman.', 'Jenny, a young doctor who feels guilty after a young woman she refused to see winds up dead a few days later, decides to find out who the girl was, after the police can''t identify the young woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/owxEl8EMMTwiy73L5n5zM9jaTws.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:340481'),
  ('43697745935379941', 'The Unknown Known', 2013, 'Documentary, History', 'Errol Morris', 'Errol Morris', 'Donald Rumsfeld, Kenn Medeiros, Errol Morris', 'PG-13', 'Former United States Secretary of Defense, Donald Rumsfeld, discusses his career in Washington D.C. from his days as a congressman in the early 1960s to planning the invasion of Iraq in 2003.', 'Former United States Secretary of Defense, Donald Rumsfeld, discusses his career in Washington D.C. from his days as a congressman in the early 1960s to planning the invasion of Iraq in 2003.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8BiCtoif98SAhSRRNfshRL75xCW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:209799'),
  ('756149698746553157', 'The Unknown Man', 1951, 'Crime, Drama', 'William C. Mellor, Richard Thorpe', 'George Froeschel, Ronald Millar', 'Walter Pidgeon, Ann Harding, Barry Sullivan, Keefe Brasselle, Lewis Stone, Eduard Franz, Richard Anderson, Dawn Addams', 'NR', 'A scrupulously honest lawyer discovers that the client he''s gotten off was really guilty.', 'A scrupulously honest lawyer discovers that the client he''s gotten off was really guilty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1TTSjgIbHRbKlUSCU7alcSaqqyD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68976'),
  ('713288732508304356', 'The Unknown Man', 2021, 'Drama', 'Anthony Schatteman', 'Anthony Schatteman', 'Geert Van Rampelberg, Samuel Suchod, Anna Sacuto, Cathy Ruiz', null, 'Louis, a Flemish writer, decides to isolate himself at the Côte d’Azur, hoping this place will bring him inspiration.', 'Louis, a Flemish writer, decides to isolate himself at the Côte d’Azur, hoping this place will bring him inspiration.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4TpBhdaSl5ALHbgeaYOLF8Q3haz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:879945'),
  ('410450921193774941', 'The Unknown Policeman', 1941, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Miguel M. Delgado, Felipe Palomino, Gabriel Figueroa', 'Miguel M. Delgado', 'Cantinflas, Mapy Cortés, Daniel Herrera, Gloria Marín, Julio Villarreal, Agustín Isunza, Carlos López Moctezuma, Alfredo Varela', null, 'A gang of thieves has jeopardized the city and even the police, whose chief urges their forces to captured the band within 48 hours. Meanwhile, band members meet in a cafe run by a widow and her daughter and her suitor, Cantinflas, who maintains a scuffle with the robbers running all at the station. Since then, Cantinflas become a member of the police force for special missions.', 'A gang of thieves has jeopardized the city and even the police, whose chief urges their forces to captured the band within 48 hours. Meanwhile, band members meet in a cafe run by a widow and her daughter and her suitor, Cantinflas, who maintains a scuffle with the robbers running all at the station. Since then, Cantinflas become a member of the police force for special missions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uqv69ruL7APgVQizjD2bsQRRinO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82784'),
  ('1108263588287078998', 'The Unknown Saint', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Alaa Eddine Aljem, Amine Berrada', 'Alaa Eddine Aljem', 'Younes Bouab, Salah Bensalah, Bouchaib Essamak, Mohamed Naimane, Anas El Baz, Hassan Ben Badida, Abdelghani Kitab, Ahmed Yarziz', null, 'Following a stint behind bars, a thief returns to where he buried his loot, only to find that his hiding spot is now a shrine to an unknown saint.', 'Following a stint behind bars, a thief returns to where he buried his loot, only to find that his hiding spot is now a shrine to an unknown saint.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sRZlSz4gvTjhk3gxsOUUcPZCp1D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:596876'),
  ('473663773460510634', 'The Unknown Soldier', 1955, 'Drama, War', 'Edvin Laine, Osmo Harkimo, Antero Ruuhonen', 'Juha Nevalainen', 'Kosti Klemelä, Heikki Savolainen, Reino Tolvanen, Veikko Sinisalo, Åke Lindman, Pentti Siimes, Leo Riuttu, Kaarlo Halttunen', null, 'It is the summer of 1941. An eastern-Finnish machine gun company receives an order to turn in their surplus equipment. The company is transferred to the front lines. The next morning the soldiers wake to the sound of guns – the war has begun.', 'It is the summer of 1941. An eastern-Finnish machine gun company receives an order to turn in their surplus equipment. The company is transferred to the front lines. The next morning the soldiers wake to the sound of guns – the war has begun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3vXBRAd4tydmLsIvQGiVzwS6QOQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36439'),
  ('366048461621291738', 'The Unknown Soldier', 1985, 'Drama, War', 'Rauni Mollberg, Esa Vuorinen, Veikko Aaltonen', 'Veikko Aaltonen, Väinö Linna, Rauni Mollberg', 'Risto Tuorila, Pirkka-Pekka Petelius, Paavo Liski, Mika Mäkelä, Pertti Koivula, Tero Niva, Ossi-Ensio Korvuo, Mikko Niskanen', null, 'Second silver screen adaption of the Finnish war book by Väinö Linna. The story is based on Linna''s experiences as an infantry man in the Finnish army during the so called "Continuation War" (1941-1944).', 'Second silver screen adaption of the Finnish war book by Väinö Linna. The story is based on Linna''s experiences as an infantry man in the Finnish army during the so called "Continuation War" (1941-1944).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7GFnQOBBKOafcoozoL7aqSZk4DL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41205'),
  ('998146291571285639', 'The Unknown Terror', 1957, 'Horror', 'Charles Marquis Warren, Joseph F. Biroc, Nathan Barragar', 'Kenneth Higgins', 'John Howard, Mala Powers, Paul Richards, May Wynn, Gerald Milton, Duane Grey, Richard Gilden, Martín Garralaga', null, 'A woman leads an expedition into a remote jungle to find her long-lost brother, but instead finds a mad scientist who has created a fungus monster that feeds on the local inhabitants.', 'A woman leads an expedition into a remote jungle to find her long-lost brother, but instead finds a mad scientist who has created a fungus monster that feeds on the local inhabitants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xudWQokqNpPs9yFA8WYsO78HdtM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116216'),
  ('376453830653401181', 'The Unknown Woman', 2006, 'Thriller, Drama, Mystery', 'Giuseppe Tornatore, Fabio Zamarion, Barbara Pastrovich', 'Giuseppe Tornatore', 'Kseniya Rappoport, Michele Placido, Claudia Gerini, Pierfrancesco Favino, Clara Dossena, Alessandro Haber, Piera Degli Esposti, Pino Calabrese', null, 'A Ukrainian woman named Irena calculatedly insinuates herself into the lives of a young, affluent Italian family. Stopping at nothing to become the couple''s trusted maid and the beloved nanny to their fragile young daughter, Irena risks everything in her quest to uncover the truth about the family.', 'A Ukrainian woman named Irena calculatedly insinuates herself into the lives of a young, affluent Italian family. Stopping at nothing to become the couple''s trusted maid and the beloved nanny to their fragile young daughter, Irena risks everything in her quest to uncover the truth about the family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/piBn5ydvdfCHSfys6N1A7LNwQft.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10886'),
  ('685868795692055175', 'The Unlikely Pilgrimage of Harold Fry', 2023, 'Drama', 'Hettie Macdonald, Kate McCullough', 'Rachel Joyce', 'Jim Broadbent, Penelope Wilton, Linda Bassett, Earl Cave, Joseph Mydell, Bethan Cullinane, Nina Singh, Monika Gossmann', null, 'Harold Fry is an unremarkable man who has made mistakes with all the important things: being a husband, a father and a friend. And now, well into his 60s, he is content to fade quietly into the background of life. Until, one day – Harold learns his old friend Queenie is dying. Harold leaves home, walking to his post office to send her a letter. And out of the blue, Harold decides to keep walking, all the way to her hospice, 450 miles away.', 'Harold Fry is an unremarkable man who has made mistakes with all the important things: being a husband, a father and a friend. And now, well into his 60s, he is content to fade quietly into the background of life. Until, one day – Harold learns his old friend Queenie is dying. Harold leaves home, walking to his post office to send her a letter. And out of the blue, Harold decides to keep walking, all the way to her hospice, 450 miles away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pmP1Z6qKYCTLZH2JKqxltwAZHSY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:844409'),
  ('911423120319860503', 'The Unlikely Prince', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Alessandro Siani, Roy Bava, Marita D''Elia', 'Alessandro Siani, Fabio Bonifacci', 'Alessandro Siani, Christian De Sica, Sarah Felberbaum, Serena Autieri, Lello Musella, Nello Iorio, Alan Cappelli Goetz, Salvatore Misticone', null, 'Needing good PR, a snooty princess orchestrates a brief romance with an ordinary guy. But the schlub she picks proves more resourceful than expected.', 'Needing good PR, a snooty princess orchestrates a brief romance with an ordinary guy. But the schlub she picks proves more resourceful than expected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eLEPO2XJMWhYqHt3v4ZFEsUlLio.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:170354'),
  ('115153280709077861', 'The Unloved', 2009, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Samantha Morton, Thomas Townend', 'Tony Grisoni, Samantha Morton', 'Molly Windsor, Robert Carlyle, Susan Lynch, Craig Parkinson, Andrea Lowe, Lauren Socha, Michael Socha, Johann Myers', null, 'Lucy is eleven years old. Having been neglected by her estranged mother and father, she is placed in a children''s home. Through her eyes, we follow her struggle to cope with the system; her only saving being her self-belief and certainty that she is being watched over and protected by the holy spirit.', 'Lucy is eleven years old. Having been neglected by her estranged mother and father, she is placed in a children''s home. Through her eyes, we follow her struggle to cope with the system; her only saving being her self-belief and certainty that she is being watched over and protected by the holy spirit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h8IJpERlvkOyIM6qpycvb0EsibI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53445'),
  ('122144819606135655', 'The Unloved Woman', 1949, 'Drama', 'Emilio Fernández, Gabriel Figueroa, Jaime Contreras', 'Emilio Fernández, Mauricio Magdaleno', 'Dolores del Río, Pedro Armendáriz, Columba Domínguez, Roberto Cañedo, Gilberto González, Mimí Derba, Julio Villarreal, Enriqueta Reza', null, 'Emilio Fernandez directs Dolores Del Rio and Pedro Armendariz in a classic tale of family and obsession. Raimunda''s daughter Acacia hates her stepfather Esteban, and in order to escape her suffocating home life she''s accepted a marriage proposal from a man she doesn''t even love. But Esteban has become obsessed with Acacia, and in order to ensure that she doesn''t leave he''s plotting to murder the girl''s unsuspecting fiancée. As Esteban''s true nature emerges, mother and daughter must band together to support one another and make sure that their family bond remains strong even in the darkest of times.', 'Emilio Fernandez directs Dolores Del Rio and Pedro Armendariz in a classic tale of family and obsession. Raimunda''s daughter Acacia hates her stepfather Esteban, and in order to escape her suffocating home life she''s accepted a marriage proposal from a man she doesn''t even love. But Esteban has become obsessed with Acacia, and in order to ensure that she doesn''t leave he''s plotting to murder the girl''s unsuspecting fiancée. As Esteban''s true nature emerges, mother and daughter must band together to support one another and make sure that their family bond remains strong even in the darkest of times.', null, 'tmdb:movie:3437'),
  ('317727923730558099', 'The Unmatchable Match', 1990, 'Crime, Action', 'Parkman Wong Pak-Man, Andrew Lau Wai-Keung, Tony Miu Kin-Fai', 'Andy Liu Chi-Keung, James Fung Shui-Hung, Parkman Wong Pak-Man', 'Stephen Chow, Vivian Chow, Michael Chan Wai-Man, Shing Fui-On, Ricky Wong Chun-Tong, Lau Yuk-Gei, James Ha Chim-Si, Chow Cheong-Wa', null, 'Chow is an undercover cop who must befriend former triad kingpin Chan Wai-Man to investigate a brutal diamond heist. It turns out that Chan is innocent of the theft, but not of the fencing of the stolen goods', 'Chow is an undercover cop who must befriend former triad kingpin Chan Wai-Man to investigate a brutal diamond heist. It turns out that Chan is innocent of the theft, but not of the fencing of the stolen goods', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hMQI24C9pOssRrPve60YkGoQmxi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:250809'),
  ('377380002578042250', 'The Unmentionables', 1963, 'Animation, Comedy, Crime, Family', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Mel Blanc, Ralph James, Julie Bennett', 'NR', 'In a spoof of TV''s "Untouchables" Rocky and Mugsy chase "Elegant Ness" (Bugs) through the ACME cereal company.', 'In a spoof of TV''s "Untouchables" Rocky and Mugsy chase "Elegant Ness" (Bugs) through the ACME cereal company.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/facIPifF4X9EeFvNJK4fey1SVse.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234464'),
  ('271410799612038', 'The Unnamable', 1988, 'Horror', 'Jean-Paul Ouellette, Tom Fraser', 'Jean-Paul Ouellette', 'Charles Klausmeyer, Mark Kinsey Stephenson, Alexandra Durrell, Laura Albert, Eben Ham, Blane Wheatley, Mark Parra, Delbert Spain', 'R', 'Students from Miskatonic University decide to spend the night in the Winthrop house, a spot widely believed to have been haunted for the past 300 years, ever since Joshua Winthrop was horribly murdered and mutilated by the hideous creature born of his wife.', 'Students from Miskatonic University decide to spend the night in the Winthrop house, a spot widely believed to have been haunted for the past 300 years, ever since Joshua Winthrop was horribly murdered and mutilated by the hideous creature born of his wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A2hg2S2ATA7VjZe7GKkyaSRO5Ki.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40549'),
  ('860737992371895155', 'The Unnamable II: The Statement of Randolph Carter', 1992, 'Horror', 'Jean-Paul Ouellette, Greg Gardiner, Roger Olkowski', 'Jean-Paul Ouellette', 'Mark Kinsey Stephenson, Charles Klausmeyer, Maria Ford, John Rhys-Davies, Julie Strain, Peter Breck, David Warner, Richard Domeier', 'R', 'A creature of demonic nature, too hideous to have a name, once again terrorizes the college kids that summoned it.', 'A creature of demonic nature, too hideous to have a name, once again terrorizes the college kids that summoned it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4hqRGLDf5HJwbDTxfsipgWtqRis.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29098'),
  ('579613857045454152', 'The Unnaturals', 1969, 'Crime, Horror, Thriller', 'Antonio Margheriti, Riccardo Pallottini', 'Antonio Margheriti', 'Joachim Fuchsberger, Marianne Koch, Helga Anders, Claudio Camaso, Dominique Boschero, Luciano Pigozzi, Marianne Leibl, Giuliano Raffaelli', null, 'During a thunderstorm, a group of members of London''s high society seek refuge in a remote mansion in the countryside. They are received by Uriat and his mother, who appears to be able to communicate with the dead. The guests engage in a séance, but it will reveal each and everyone''s darkest secrets.', 'During a thunderstorm, a group of members of London''s high society seek refuge in a remote mansion in the countryside. They are received by Uriat and his mother, who appears to be able to communicate with the dead. The guests engage in a séance, but it will reveal each and everyone''s darkest secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jr0hcPOvyfIlJc0Mg7Q994r9y5n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236786'),
  ('1047634529181157861', 'The Unpolished', 2007, 'Drama', 'Pia Marais', 'Pia Marais, Horst Markgraf', 'Ceci Chuh, Birol Ünel, Pascale Schiller, Georg Friedrich, Joana Preiss, Joseph Malerba, Johanna Gastdorf', null, 'Stevie, a precocious 14-year-old girl must cope with the instabilities of her immoderate parents. When they decide to move to a small provincial town in Germany, Stevie attempts to slip into a normal life. Whilst her parents playfully escape their responsibilities, Stevie tries to make a good impression in town, spreading stories of grandeur and claiming to be the daughter of a diplomat. She makes progress. Yet the good weather doesn’t last and before long, she discovers that her parents have once more resorted to illegal means, as a way of supporting their leisurely lifestyle. As friends and hangers-on of her parents fill their new home, the chaos continually mounts. It is in this atmosphere of physical and emotional destruction, that Stevie must now start to define herself and perhaps even break free.', 'Stevie, a precocious 14-year-old girl must cope with the instabilities of her immoderate parents. When they decide to move to a small provincial town in Germany, Stevie attempts to slip into a normal life. Whilst her parents playfully escape their responsibilities, Stevie tries to make a good impression in town, spreading stories of grandeur and claiming to be the daughter of a diplomat. She makes progress. Yet the good weather doesn’t last and before long, she discovers that her parents have once more resorted to illegal means, as a way of supporting their leisurely lifestyle. As friends and hangers-on of her parents fill their new home, the chaos continually mounts. It is in this atmosphere of physical and emotional destruction, that Stevie must now start to define herself and perhaps even break free.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9r1kO8jnGs1POAYtclYBA8cXVI5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66174'),
  ('122651864850489965', 'The Unprecedented Defence of the Fortress Deutschkreuz', 1967, 'Drama, War, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Werner Herzog', 'Werner Herzog', 'Peter H. Bumm, Georg Eska, Karl-Heinz Steffel, Wolfgang von Ungern-Sternberg', null, 'A satire on war and on the stupid things war inspires people to do. Four young men enter an abandoned fortress. Inside, they find military uniforms, which they immediately resolve to use to stage a bizarre war game. Their actions appear all the more senseless in relation to the peaceful everyday reality of the workers in the surrounding countryside.', 'A satire on war and on the stupid things war inspires people to do. Four young men enter an abandoned fortress. Inside, they find military uniforms, which they immediately resolve to use to stage a bizarre war game. Their actions appear all the more senseless in relation to the peaceful everyday reality of the workers in the surrounding countryside.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5P1doaM9Wk4rJOpIqCfHxaEL23q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45518'),
  ('416431279733930508', 'The Unruly Hare', 1945, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Frank Tashlin, Carl W. Stalling', null, 'Mel Blanc, Arthur Q. Bryan', null, 'When Elmer Fudd disturbs Bugs with his railroad surveying, Bugs fights back.', 'When Elmer Fudd disturbs Bugs with his railroad surveying, Bugs fights back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xvTsEwt0cca7U0O5pMF85CFAa5O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236954'),
