  ('652001714465584492', 'The Unscrupulous Ones', 1962, 'Drama, Crime', 'Ruy Guerra, Gerson Tavares, João Elias', 'Miguel Torres, Ruy Guerra', 'Norma Bengell, Jece Valadão, Daniel Filho, Hugo Carvana, Lucy de Carvalho, Glauce Rocha, Germana de Lamare', null, 'Upon learning that his rich dad is on the brink of bankruptcy, spoiled Vavá summons his friend Jandir with a plan to get some quick cash: they will blackmail an uncle of Vavá by taking compromising photos of his lover, Leda.', 'Upon learning that his rich dad is on the brink of bankruptcy, spoiled Vavá summons his friend Jandir with a plan to get some quick cash: they will blackmail an uncle of Vavá by taking compromising photos of his lover, Leda.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/16r4nuqmYoy9TEmDp9L9waTcuib.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28525'),
  ('408196978098392633', 'The Unseeable', 2006, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Wisit Sasanatieng, Chankit Chamnivikaipong', 'Kongkiat Khomsiri', 'Siraphan Wattanajinda, Suporntip Chuangrangsri, Tassawan Seneewongse, Visa Konska, Sarut Wijittranon, Raenkum Saninn, Chonnipha Wisetsood, Phusanisa Pitithanasansombat', null, 'Set in 1934 Siam, the story involves a young pregnant woman named Nualchan who''s searching for her missing husband. She comes to stay in the spooky rural mansion of a widow, Runjuan.', 'Set in 1934 Siam, the story involves a young pregnant woman named Nualchan who''s searching for her missing husband. She comes to stay in the spooky rural mansion of a widow, Runjuan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iPSR77iTf62h5qdtoLvYIiNgMPw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26687'),
  ('1069922389720820119', 'The Unseen', 1945, 'Mystery, Thriller, Horror', 'John F. Seitz, Lewis Allen', 'Raymond Chandler, Hagar Wilde', 'Joel McCrea, Gail Russell, Herbert Marshall, Phyllis Brooks, Isobel Elsom, Norman Lloyd, Mikhail Rasumny, Elisabeth Risdon', 'NR', 'David Fielding, who has recently lost his wife, moves into a new neighborhood under a cloud of suspicion. Many feel that his wife''s death in a car crash was no accident. Elizabeth Howard, the governess he hires to look after his children, makes it her mission to find out the truth. When other murders seem to be following David to his new town, Elizabeth investigates with the help of David''s son Barnaby.', 'David Fielding, who has recently lost his wife, moves into a new neighborhood under a cloud of suspicion. Many feel that his wife''s death in a car crash was no accident. Elizabeth Howard, the governess he hires to look after his children, makes it her mission to find out the truth. When other murders seem to be following David to his new town, Elizabeth investigates with the help of David''s son Barnaby.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gx9HkWioGnl94XS45Az80c7uvjt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44001'),
  ('97058567451365909', 'The Unseen', 1980, 'Horror', 'Danny Steinmann, Roberto A. Quezada', 'Kim Henkel', 'Barbara Bach, Stephen Furst, Sydney Lassick, Karen Lamm, Lois Young, Lelia Goldoni, Douglas Barr, Maida Severn', 'R', 'A trio of female reporters find themselves staying overnight in a house occupied by a hostile being lurking in the basement', 'A trio of female reporters find themselves staying overnight in a house occupied by a hostile being lurking in the basement', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/66BAwSfIef99UztzXgVBt8sNR4W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40241'),
  ('250667020092958486', 'The Unseen', 2016, 'Action, Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Geoff Redknap, Stephen Maier', 'Geoff Redknap', 'Aden Young, Camille Sullivan, Julia Sarah Stone, Ben Cotton, Max Chadburn, Alison Araya, Maxwell Haynes, Kurt Ostlund', null, 'A man, who years earlier mysteriously abandoned his family and isolated himself in a small northern town, returns for one last chance to reconnect with his troubled daughter. When she goes missing, he risks everything to find her, including exposing the fact that he is becoming invisible.', 'A man, who years earlier mysteriously abandoned his family and isolated himself in a small northern town, returns for one last chance to reconnect with his troubled daughter. When she goes missing, he risks everything to find her, including exposing the fact that he is becoming invisible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fNZeKZ2U6hAZRH9HouFN5tdEarf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:399611'),
  ('172125217845742196', 'The Unshrinkable Jerry Mouse', 1964, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones, Maurice Noble', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Tom enjoys the role of top cat until an adorable red-and-white-haired kitten is brought into the house of a young blonde woman.', 'Tom enjoys the role of top cat until an adorable red-and-white-haired kitten is brought into the house of a young blonde woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5OjZz9XFLtPWIxXIBT9VZyv65Ow.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:223037'),
  ('1062694347174931687', 'The Unsinkable Molly Brown', 1964, 'Comedy', 'Charles Walters, Daniel L. Fapp, Hank Moonjean', 'Helen Deutsch', 'Debbie Reynolds, Harve Presnell, Ed Begley, Jack Kruschen, Hermione Baddeley, Vassili Lambrinos, Fred Essler, Harvey Lembeck', 'NR', 'The buoyant Molly Brown has survived the first crisis of her life—a flood. Sixteen years later she sets out to make her way in the world. She assures the Leadville saloon keeper that she can sing and play the piano, and learns quickly. Soon she marries Johnny Brown, who in a few years will be able to replace the original cigar wrapper wedding ring with a replica in gold and gemstones. The Browns head for Europe and bring a few crowned heads back to Denver for a party that turns into a ballroom brawl. Molly goes to Europe alone, returning on the Titanic. She didn''t survive a flood as a baby for the story to end here.', 'The buoyant Molly Brown has survived the first crisis of her life—a flood. Sixteen years later she sets out to make her way in the world. She assures the Leadville saloon keeper that she can sing and play the piano, and learns quickly. Soon she marries Johnny Brown, who in a few years will be able to replace the original cigar wrapper wedding ring with a replica in gold and gemstones. The Browns head for Europe and bring a few crowned heads back to Denver for a party that turns into a ballroom brawl. Molly goes to Europe alone, returning on the Titanic. She didn''t survive a flood as a baby for the story to end here.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gMFUWB1BHqLtiB2t1pstE6FpT7F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42797'),
  ('442156276702534998', 'The Unspoiled Diamond', 1982, 'Romance, Drama', 'Toshiya Fujita, Masaki Tamura', 'Akiko Tanaka', 'Misako Tanaka, Yukiji Asaoka, Eri Ishida, Kazuya Kosaka, Bang-ho Cho, Sachiko Ito, Yuki Kitazume, Haruna Takase', null, 'A college student has an affair with a married, middle-aged teacher.', 'A college student has an affair with a married, middle-aged teacher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mNXJeugqzzWPRfclrFwmkefGaOr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:369471'),
  ('1093778322550525502', 'The Unspoken', 2015, 'Thriller, Horror, Mystery', 'Sheldon Wilson, Eric J. Goldstein', 'Sheldon Wilson', 'Jodelle Ferland, Sunny Suljic, Neal McDonough, Matt Bellefleur, Fulvio Cecere, Chilton Crane, Jake Croker, Rukiya Bernard', null, 'In 1997 the close-knit Anderson family vanished from their home without a trace. No bodies were ever found and no explanation satisfied curiosity. For 17 years the house has remained undisturbed...until now. This eerily expert frightener is further enlivened by terrific performances from ‘Suits’/’Arrow’ star Neal McDonough and SILENT HILL/THE TALL MAN/TIDELAND’s Jodelle Ferland.', 'In 1997 the close-knit Anderson family vanished from their home without a trace. No bodies were ever found and no explanation satisfied curiosity. For 17 years the house has remained undisturbed...until now. This eerily expert frightener is further enlivened by terrific performances from ‘Suits’/’Arrow’ star Neal McDonough and SILENT HILL/THE TALL MAN/TIDELAND’s Jodelle Ferland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pWLDlwcR10Zevqx5RyzMR0nHsI2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:363689'),
  ('349685245734124255', 'The Unsuspected', 1947, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Michael Curtiz, Elwood Bredell, Leo F. Forbstein', 'Ranald MacDougall', 'Joan Caulfield, Claude Rains, Audrey Totter, Constance Bennett, Hurd Hatfield, Ted North, Fred Clark, Harry Lewis', 'NR', 'The secretary of an affably suave radio mystery host mysteriously commits suicide after his wealthy young niece disappears.', 'The secretary of an affably suave radio mystery host mysteriously commits suicide after his wealthy young niece disappears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cUhDjZUHtWuB1tAnpHbIXeQMsGb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29117'),
  ('453492929674167060', 'The Untamable Whiskers', 1904, 'Fantasy, Comedy', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Georges Méliès', null, 'The background of this picture represents a scene along the beautiful river Seine in Paris. A gentleman enters, and taking a blackboard from the side of the picture, he draws on it a sketch of a novelist. Then, standing in the centre, he causes the living features of his sketch to appear in the place of his own, which is utterly devoid of whiskers. The change is made so mysteriously that the eye cannot notice it until one sees quite another person in the place of the first. Again another sketch is shown on the board, this one being that of a miser; then an English cockney; a comic character; a French policeman, and last of all, the grinning visage of Mephistopheles. It is almost impossible to give this film a more definite description; suffice it to say that it is something entirely new in motion pictures and is sure to please. (Méliès Catalog)', 'The background of this picture represents a scene along the beautiful river Seine in Paris. A gentleman enters, and taking a blackboard from the side of the picture, he draws on it a sketch of a novelist. Then, standing in the centre, he causes the living features of his sketch to appear in the place of his own, which is utterly devoid of whiskers. The change is made so mysteriously that the eye cannot notice it until one sees quite another person in the place of the first. Again another sketch is shown on the board, this one being that of a miser; then an English cockney; a comic character; a French policeman, and last of all, the grinning visage of Mephistopheles. It is almost impossible to give this film a more definite description; suffice it to say that it is something entirely new in motion pictures and is sure to please. (Méliès Catalog)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r3bnSsNeAtA2zPcnVoDGt9M5rI2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44324'),
  ('988502888718359749', 'The Untamed', 2016, 'Science Fiction, Drama, Thriller, Horror', 'Alex Ezpeleta, Amat Escalante, Manuel Alberto Claro', 'Gibrán Portela, Amat Escalante', 'Ruth Ramos, Simone Bucio, Jesús Meza, Eden Villavicencio, Kenny Johnston, Pablo López Pérez, Zair Alberto Gutiérrez, Oscar Escalante', null, 'A meteorite deposits an alien monster with strange powers near the home of an unhappy couple.', 'A meteorite deposits an alien monster with strange powers near the home of an unhappy couple.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oDuOKue0CCUPc3febMJmdFVysZR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:387801'),
