  ('125876702543505319', 'The Untold History Of The United States', 2012, 'Documentary, History', 'Oliver Stone', 'Matt Graham, Peter Kuznick, Oliver Stone', 'Oliver Stone, Vasili Arkhipov, Franklin D. Roosevelt, Henry A. Wallace, Harry S. Truman, Joseph Stalin, Winston Churchill, Barack Obama', 'G', 'Oliver Stone charts the history of the United States from the Second World War to the present.', 'Oliver Stone charts the history of the United States from the Second World War to the present.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qGiBpv3qKlJtBHA17xymVdN3U44.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:189215'),
  ('538039220557321557', 'The Untold Story', 1993, 'Comedy, Crime, Horror', 'Herman Yau, Cho Wai-Kei', 'Law Kam-Fai', 'Danny Lee Sau-Yin, Anthony Wong Chau-Sang, Emily Kwan Bo-Wai, Lau Siu-Ming, Shing Fui-On, Eric Kei Ka-Fat, Lam King-Kong, Parkman Wong Pak-Man', 'R', 'Macau cops begin to suspect a man running a pork buns restaurant of murder, after tracing the origin of a case full of chopped up human remains that washed ashore, which leads them to him.', 'Macau cops begin to suspect a man running a pork buns restaurant of murder, after tracing the origin of a case full of chopped up human remains that washed ashore, which leads them to him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tQ7Ymo92AOXZFrMX5TBAfAdYECt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39857'),
  ('666455074454876400', 'The Untold Story 2', 1998, 'Crime, Horror', 'Kingson Shek Siu-Lun, Andy Ng Yiu-Kuen, Ko Chiu-Lam', 'Law Kam-Fai', 'Paulyn Sun, Emotion Cheung Kam-Ching, Anthony Wong Chau-Sang, Yeung Fan, Jamie Luk Kim-Ming, Helena Law Lan, Melvin Wong, Simon Cheung Yuk-San', null, 'An unhappily married couple invite the wife''s beautiful cousin, who has survived a horrifying experience in Mainland China, to live with them. She has her own special way of overcoming hardship and becomes the master of the human barbecue.', 'An unhappily married couple invite the wife''s beautiful cousin, who has survived a horrifying experience in Mainland China, to live with them. She has her own special way of overcoming hardship and becomes the master of the human barbecue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nLGPHeC3T1HdUio3FU6M9ScvatQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:188813'),
  ('228786202330383383', 'The Untold Story of the Vatican', 2020, 'Documentary, History', 'Yoan Cart, Diane Riethof, Marc Jampolsky', 'Marie Thiry, Marc Jampolsky', 'Cédric Zimmerlin, Éric Herson-Macarel, Ali Guentas, Hugues Boucher, Pierre Val, François Rabette', null, 'What started as a simple tomb became over a 2,000 years history the universal seat of Christendom and is today one of the most visited museum in the world with invaluable collections of Arts, Manuscripts, Maps. Using spectacular 3D modelisation and CGI to give viewers as never before a true understanding of the history of this architectural masterpiece and its extensions, the film will also use animation to tell relevant historical events. This heritage site reveals new untold secrets with the help of historians deciphering the Vatican’s rich archives and manuscripts collection and following the restorations at work (newly discovered frescoes by Raphael) and recent excavations. A story where Religion, Politics, Arts and Science meet to assert religious authority and serve as a spiritual benchmark.', 'What started as a simple tomb became over a 2,000 years history the universal seat of Christendom and is today one of the most visited museum in the world with invaluable collections of Arts, Manuscripts, Maps. Using spectacular 3D modelisation and CGI to give viewers as never before a true understanding of the history of this architectural masterpiece and its extensions, the film will also use animation to tell relevant historical events. This heritage site reveals new untold secrets with the help of historians deciphering the Vatican’s rich archives and manuscripts collection and following the restorations at work (newly discovered frescoes by Raphael) and recent excavations. A story where Religion, Politics, Arts and Science meet to assert religious authority and serve as a spiritual benchmark.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/glcnVi1G5NFVuD6gx8LXtPpNSvk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:772796'),
  ('971343049131579988', 'The Untold Tale of the Three Kingdoms', 2020, 'Comedy, History', 'Tetsuya Kudô, Keiya Tabuchi, Yuichi Fukuda', 'Yuichi Fukuda', 'Yo Oizumi, Tsuyoshi Muro, Kento Kaku, Kanna Hashimoto, Mizuki Yamamoto, Koshi Mizukami, Satoshi Hashimoto, Tsutomu Takahashi', null, 'A new interpretation of "Records of the Three Kingdoms," which is historical text of the three states of Wei, Shu, and Wu in China.', 'A new interpretation of "Records of the Three Kingdoms," which is historical text of the three states of Wei, Shu, and Wu in China.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1NgilbIRzrgS2k4Z7IsqkyxWMx7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:726654'),
  ('61669822926886849', 'The Untouchables', 1987, 'Crime, History, Thriller', 'Brian De Palma, Stephen H. Burum, Glen Trotiner', 'David Mamet', 'Kevin Costner, Sean Connery, Robert De Niro, Charles Martin Smith, Andy Garcia, Richard Bradford, Jack Kehoe, Brad Sullivan', 'R', 'Elliot Ness, an ambitious prohibition agent, is determined to take down Al Capone. In order to achieve this goal, he forms a group given the nickname “The Untouchables”.', 'Elliot Ness, an ambitious prohibition agent, is determined to take down Al Capone. In order to achieve this goal, he forms a group given the nickname “The Untouchables”.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tPq0R4jTO4Ey8ZspFaWK9wGA4Ls.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117'),
  ('1105945946928268138', 'The Unvanquished', 1964, 'Drama', 'Claude Renoir, Alain Cavalier', 'Alain Cavalier, Alain Cavalier', 'Alain Delon, Lea Massari, Georges Géret, Maurice Garrel, Robert Castel, Viviane Attia, Robert Bazil, Paul Pavel', null, 'In this drama that alludes to the Algerian War with France of the 1960s, Thomas is a deserter from the French Foreign Legion who is on the run from authorities. He helps damsel in distress Dominique, who has been taken hostage by a group of terrorists. Thomas is wounded but manages to escape after killing the guard who inflicted the injury. Dominique gives Thomas money to escape to France after he secures her freedom, but he is caught between the Foreign Legion and the terrorists seeking revenge.', 'In this drama that alludes to the Algerian War with France of the 1960s, Thomas is a deserter from the French Foreign Legion who is on the run from authorities. He helps damsel in distress Dominique, who has been taken hostage by a group of terrorists. Thomas is wounded but manages to escape after killing the guard who inflicted the injury. Dominique gives Thomas money to escape to France after he secures her freedom, but he is caught between the Foreign Legion and the terrorists seeking revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ozkODwxrNcsVS1yC1HDIX0hyrGm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137859'),
  ('760428573027310303', 'The Up in Smoke Tour', 2000, 'Music, Documentary', 'Philip G. Atwell', 'Dr. Dre', 'Dr. Dre, Snoop Dogg, Eminem, Ice Cube, Nate Dogg, Warren G, Kurupt, Proof', 'NR', 'The Up in Smoke Tour is a West Coast hip hop tour in 2000 featuring artists Ice Cube, Eminem, Proof, Snoop Dogg, Dr. Dre, Nate Dogg, Kurupt, D12, MC Ren, Westside Connection, Mel-Man, Tha Eastsidaz, Doggy''s Angels, Devin The Dude, Warren G, TQ, Truth Hurts and Xzibit.', 'The Up in Smoke Tour is a West Coast hip hop tour in 2000 featuring artists Ice Cube, Eminem, Proof, Snoop Dogg, Dr. Dre, Nate Dogg, Kurupt, D12, MC Ren, Westside Connection, Mel-Man, Tha Eastsidaz, Doggy''s Angels, Devin The Dude, Warren G, TQ, Truth Hurts and Xzibit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uK3wmbgtY3u2PXWBhpN62IW86x3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19349'),
  ('226383864494898378', 'The Up-Standing Sitter', 1948, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Robert McKimson', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Daffy Duck is working as a babysitter for the Acme Baby Sitting Agency. While he''s sitting on a chicken egg, it hatches. The chick decides Daffy is a stranger and he should have nothing to do with him, so flees. Daffy has to catch it.', 'Daffy Duck is working as a babysitter for the Acme Baby Sitting Agency. While he''s sitting on a chicken egg, it hatches. The chick decides Daffy is a stranger and he should have nothing to do with him, so flees. Daffy has to catch it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6iuzzrAQDfzscrBtebTyMZ88Rfu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:237296'),
  ('32142183100242703', 'The Upper Hand', 1966, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Denys de La Patellière, Walter Wottitz', 'Denys de La Patellière', 'Jean Gabin, Gert Fröbe, George Raft, Claudio Brook, Nadja Tiller, Marcel Bozzuffi, Mireille Darc, Claude Brasseur', 'NR', 'In Paris, a gold smuggler is at war with other local gangsters who want piece of the action. Then the mob shows up and makes things worse. And an undercover US Treasury Department agent is trying to infiltrate the smuggling business.', 'In Paris, a gold smuggler is at war with other local gangsters who want piece of the action. Then the mob shows up and makes things worse. And an undercover US Treasury Department agent is trying to infiltrate the smuggling business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u21RnFYSEildxLx224uTwcGTaxQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76745'),
  ('231806617056365760', 'The Ups and Downs of a Handyman', 1976, 'Comedy', 'John Sealey, Douglas Hill', 'Derrick Slater, John Sealey', 'Barry Stokes, Gay Soper, Bob Todd, Sue Lloyd, Chic Murray, Robert Dorning, Valerie Leon, Nita Lorraine', 'R', 'A young handyman and his wife move to a small village and set up business. There, the handyman encounters numerous strange characters, including a local constable more inept than a squad car full of Keystone Kops; an elderly magistrate whose primary passion is spanking young women; a schoolmistress with a closetful of kinks; and more predatory housewives than the young man can handle.', 'A young handyman and his wife move to a small village and set up business. There, the handyman encounters numerous strange characters, including a local constable more inept than a squad car full of Keystone Kops; an elderly magistrate whose primary passion is spanking young women; a schoolmistress with a closetful of kinks; and more predatory housewives than the young man can handle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/icVWOs5qlzTiTmVqlZIBObRhiOO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:269426'),
  ('99211854798194760', 'The Upside', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'G.A. Aguilar, Timothy Bird, Brad Robinson', 'Olivier Nakache, Éric Toledano', 'Kevin Hart, Bryan Cranston, Nicole Kidman, Golshifteh Farahani, Aja Naomi King, Tate Donovan, Jahi Di''Allo Winston, Genevieve Angelson', 'PG-13', 'Phillip is a wealthy quadriplegic who needs a caretaker to help him with his day-to-day routine in his New York penthouse. He decides to hire Dell, a struggling parolee who''s trying to reconnect with his ex and his young son. Despite coming from two different worlds, an unlikely friendship starts to blossom.', 'Phillip is a wealthy quadriplegic who needs a caretaker to help him with his day-to-day routine in his New York penthouse. He decides to hire Dell, a struggling parolee who''s trying to reconnect with his ex and his young son. Despite coming from two different worlds, an unlikely friendship starts to blossom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hPZ2caow1PCND6qnerfgn6RTXdm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:440472'),
  ('1119567174189661512', 'The Upside of Anger', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Richard Greatrex, Mike Binder', 'Mike Binder', 'Joan Allen, Kevin Costner, Erika Christensen, Keri Russell, Alicia Witt, Evan Rachel Wood, Mike Binder, Tom Harper', 'R', 'After her husband runs off with his secretary, Terry Wolfmeyer is left to fend for herself -- and her four daughters. As she hits rock bottom, Terry finds a friend and drinking buddy in next-door neighbor Denny, a former baseball player. As the two grow closer, and her daughters increasingly rely on Denny, Terry starts to have reservations about where their relationship is headed.', 'After her husband runs off with his secretary, Terry Wolfmeyer is left to fend for herself -- and her four daughters. As she hits rock bottom, Terry finds a friend and drinking buddy in next-door neighbor Denny, a former baseball player. As the two grow closer, and her daughters increasingly rely on Denny, Terry starts to have reservations about where their relationship is headed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/UdLPKVq6Cfw7ig1ancmDkclfZg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11354'),
  ('1069799159897720478', 'The Upturned Glass', 1947, 'Crime, Drama', 'Lawrence Huntington, Reginald H. Wyer, Basil Keys', 'John Monaghan, Pamela Mason', 'James Mason, Rosamund John, Pamela Mason, Ann Stephens, Morland Graham, Brefni O''Rorke, Henry Oscar, Jane Hylton', 'NR', 'A neurosurgeon relates to his students in medical school a story about an affair he had with a married woman and how after the affair was over, the woman fell out a window and died. The surgeon, suspecting that she was murdered, set out to find her killer -- but, instead of turning the suspect over to the police, he planned to take his own revenge on the murderer.', 'A neurosurgeon relates to his students in medical school a story about an affair he had with a married woman and how after the affair was over, the woman fell out a window and died. The surgeon, suspecting that she was murdered, set out to find her killer -- but, instead of turning the suspect over to the police, he planned to take his own revenge on the murderer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kduVBUAcvoOQBbTr0OMOV43c0NV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77649'),
  ('130429324370502303', 'The Urban Crisis and the New Militants: Module 7 - Cicero March', 1966, 'Documentary', 'Mike Gray, Bill Cottle', null, null, null, 'For a generation of young activists, the reality of war, imperialism, racism and the growing fragility of democratic liberalism was too much to handle. Force became a means to wrestle with this tension. As the discourse of a “country torn” finds its way into mainstream political analyses (for many the deep divisions in this country are not a new political reality), we should reflect on the writings of political dissidents and radicals. We should recognize the diversity of political analysis that is very much alive. The histories of armed struggle, if taken seriously, provide us with a means to think more critically about the center, and complicate its claims of moral and political right.', 'For a generation of young activists, the reality of war, imperialism, racism and the growing fragility of democratic liberalism was too much to handle. Force became a means to wrestle with this tension. As the discourse of a “country torn” finds its way into mainstream political analyses (for many the deep divisions in this country are not a new political reality), we should reflect on the writings of political dissidents and radicals. We should recognize the diversity of political analysis that is very much alive. The histories of armed struggle, if taken seriously, provide us with a means to think more critically about the center, and complicate its claims of moral and political right.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k80PAMOp0bJMtOzQwg37INLrtGa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:246076'),
  ('157457076292310111', 'The Usual Idiots 3: The Comeback', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Massimo Schiavon, Martino Ferro, Francesco Mandelli', 'Francesco Mandelli, Martino Ferro, Fabrizio Biggio', 'Francesco Mandelli, Fabrizio Biggio, Andrea Delogu, Guè, ANNA, Gabriele Vagnato, Sabrina Ferilli, Carlo Amleto', null, 'I Soliti Idioti return to the cinema ten years after the second film and many things have changed in the world. We will see the most beloved characters compete with the contemporary, with the same cynical and amused eye that distinguished the previous episodes. This new adventure focuses on a current and universal theme: the family.', 'I Soliti Idioti return to the cinema ten years after the second film and many things have changed in the world. We will see the most beloved characters compete with the contemporary, with the same cynical and amused eye that distinguished the previous episodes. This new adventure focuses on a current and universal theme: the family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g4CNrkOL6r374IxG3XpVgOlGe2E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1148368'),
  ('271492894654253152', 'The Usual Idiots: The Movie', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Enrico Lando', 'Francesco Mandelli, Fabrizio Biggio, Martino Ferro', 'Fabrizio Biggio, Francesco Mandelli, Mădălina Ghenea, Valeria Bilello, Giordano De Plano, Miriam Leone, Marco Foschi, Gianmarco Tognazzi', null, 'A movie based on the italian sitcom "I Soliti Idioti".', 'A movie based on the italian sitcom "I Soliti Idioti".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bHlUku0S8WKJdQxDnUj8aAXsMbv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77941'),
  ('1061460109504633719', 'The Usual Suspects', 1995, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Bryan Singer, Newton Thomas Sigel, Kenneth Kokin', 'Christopher McQuarrie', 'Stephen Baldwin, Gabriel Byrne, Benicio del Toro, Kevin Pollak, Kevin Spacey, Chazz Palminteri, Pete Postlethwaite, Suzy Amis', 'R', 'Held in an L.A. interrogation room, Verbal Kint attempts to convince the feds that a mythic crime lord, Keyser Soze, not only exists, but was also responsible for drawing him and his four partners into a multi-million dollar heist that ended with an explosion in San Pedro harbor – leaving few survivors. Verbal lures his interrogators with an incredible story of the crime lord''s almost supernatural prowess.', 'Held in an L.A. interrogation room, Verbal Kint attempts to convince the feds that a mythic crime lord, Keyser Soze, not only exists, but was also responsible for drawing him and his four partners into a multi-million dollar heist that ended with an explosion in San Pedro harbor – leaving few survivors. Verbal lures his interrogators with an incredible story of the crime lord''s almost supernatural prowess.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/99X2SgyFunJFXGAYnDv3sb9pnUD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:629'),
  ('918883181085969229', 'The V Word', 2006, 'Horror, TV Movie', 'Ernest R. Dickerson', 'Mick Garris', 'Michael Ironside, Branden Nadon, Arjay Smith, Jodelle Ferland, Lynda Boyd', null, 'Two curious teenage boys break into an old mortuary looking for thrills, only to find themselves stalked by a former teacher who is a very real vampire looking to increase the ranks of the undead.', 'Two curious teenage boys break into an old mortuary looking for thrills, only to find themselves stalked by a former teacher who is a very real vampire looking to increase the ranks of the undead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yZAd0WJfq5TAWNVMqBeXY71vRi0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:233738'),
  ('191517130491969898', 'The V.I.P.s', 1963, 'Drama', 'Anthony Asquith, Peter Medak, Kip Gowans', 'Terence Rattigan', 'Elizabeth Taylor, Richard Burton, Louis Jourdan, Elsa Martinelli, Margaret Rutherford, Maggie Smith, Rod Taylor, Orson Welles', null, 'Wealthy passengers fogged in at London''s Heathrow Airport fight to survive a variety of personal trials.', 'Wealthy passengers fogged in at London''s Heathrow Airport fight to survive a variety of personal trials.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rlDromcNudpKl69gzqnBNotu9lo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37222'),
  ('150264603461075937', 'The Vaccine War', 2023, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Uday Singh Mohite, Aanchal Poddaar, Vivek Agnihotri', 'Vivek Agnihotri', 'Nana Patekar, Pallavi Joshi, Sapthami Gowda, Raima Sen, Girija Oak, Mohan Kapur, Nivedita Bhattacharya, Anupam Kher', 'NR', 'Faced with the catastrophic challenge of fighting a global crisis like no other, Indian scientists take on the mantle of producing vaccine despite not having enough resources and infrastructure to save the nation''s sixteen million citizens.', 'Faced with the catastrophic challenge of fighting a global crisis like no other, Indian scientists take on the mantle of producing vaccine despite not having enough resources and infrastructure to save the nation''s sixteen million citizens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ceWCWvbEogkXU1It8gH1l2rcfEJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1046620'),
  ('793193488254146961', 'The Vagabond', 1916, 'Comedy', 'Roland Totheroh, Charlie Chaplin, William C. Foster', 'Vincent Bryan, Charlie Chaplin', 'Charlie Chaplin, Edna Purviance, Eric Campbell, Charlotte Mineau, Albert Austin, Phyllis Allen, Lloyd Bacon, Henry Bergman', null, 'A tramp tries to earn money by playing the violin, but he’s soon facing off against the jealous competition.', 'A tramp tries to earn money by playing the violin, but he’s soon facing off against the jealous competition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mr6io815BjVxNSMeartcd4mCADU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13707'),
  ('844732651575343139', 'The Vagrant', 1992, 'Comedy, Horror, Thriller', 'Chris Walas, John J. Connor, Jack Wallner', 'Richard Jefferies', 'Bill Paxton, Michael Ironside, Marshall Bell, Mitzi Kapture, Colleen Camp, Patrika Darbo, Marc McClure, Stuart Pankin', 'R', 'A business man buys a house, but he has a hard time trying to get rid of its previous tenant, a dirty bum.', 'A business man buys a house, but he has a hard time trying to get rid of its previous tenant, a dirty bum.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8XTaMcU4WxafaIxT6HvfYHL8KTP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:186869'),
  ('82638825610753476', 'The Vain Parlor Maid', 1908, 'Comedy', 'Johann Schwarzer', null, null, null, 'A housemaid is cleaning a studio. When she sees a sculpture of a nude woman in life-size, lying on a couch, she starts to compare this idealized body with her own. She takes off her clothes one by one, thus revealing her own naked body, and she compares the various parts of her body with those of the statue. The master of the house enters the studio. When he sees his housemaid naked, he tells her to go into the next room, and then goes into that room himself.', 'A housemaid is cleaning a studio. When she sees a sculpture of a nude woman in life-size, lying on a couch, she starts to compare this idealized body with her own. She takes off her clothes one by one, thus revealing her own naked body, and she compares the various parts of her body with those of the statue. The master of the house enters the studio. When he sees his housemaid naked, he tells her to go into the next room, and then goes into that room himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wUe6YcWrRpTIsIX5VnNs0uLYsd6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196558'),
  ('294733622607890636', 'The Valachi Papers', 1972, 'Crime, Drama', 'Terence Young, Aldo Tonti', 'Stephen Geller', 'Charles Bronson, Lino Ventura, Jill Ireland, Walter Chiari, Joseph Wiseman, Gerald S. O''Loughlin, Amedeo Nazzari, Fausto Tozzi', 'R', 'When Joe Valachi has a price put on his head by Don Vito Genovese, he must take desperate steps to protect himself while in prison. An unsuccessful attempt to slit his throat puts him over the edge to break the sacred code of silence.', 'When Joe Valachi has a price put on his head by Don Vito Genovese, he must take desperate steps to protect himself while in prison. An unsuccessful attempt to slit his throat puts him over the edge to break the sacred code of silence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tfSxMeFaMkH0ZtrGjZzn8VpMzkQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33357'),
  ('51647580800935365', 'The Valdemar Legacy', 2010, 'Horror, Mystery', 'José Luis Alemán', 'José Luis Alemán', 'Paul Naschy, Óscar Jaenada, Laia Marull, Daniele Liotti, Silvia Abascal, Ana Risueño, Luis Zahera, Eusebio Poncela', 'R', 'Luisa Llorente, an expert on taxation of old buildings, had recently gone to the Victorian mansion Valdemar to conduct an inventory of property ownership. After she mysteriously disappeared, Maximilian, president of her company, engaged the services of a private detective to help find her. But soon they will discover that it is not the first disappearance at Valdemar mansion!', 'Luisa Llorente, an expert on taxation of old buildings, had recently gone to the Victorian mansion Valdemar to conduct an inventory of property ownership. After she mysteriously disappeared, Maximilian, president of her company, engaged the services of a private detective to help find her. But soon they will discover that it is not the first disappearance at Valdemar mansion!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tYTe2HRLBWgHpgNfEoRASxee60C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28396'),
  ('151523405879779497', 'The Valdemar Legacy II: The Forbidden Shadow', 2010, 'Mystery, Horror', 'José Luis Alemán, David Azcano', 'José Luis Alemán', 'Daniele Liotti, Óscar Jaenada, Laia Marull, Silvia Abascal, Rodolfo Sancho, Ana Risueño, Norma Ruiz, Santi Prego', null, 'A group of friends discover an ancient book, the Necronomicon, the Book of the Deads. They discover that the book is a link between our world and the world of ancients creatures, older than our civilizations.', 'A group of friends discover an ancient book, the Necronomicon, the Book of the Deads. They discover that the book is a link between our world and the world of ancients creatures, older than our civilizations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5yWhk9N6RPhHIZ5s17VZq5b5vwR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:299340'),
  ('1115475950304921259', 'The Valdez Horses', 1973, 'Western, Action, Adventure, Drama', 'John Sturges, Armando Nannuzzi, Godofredo Pacheco', 'Clair Huffaker, Massimo De Rita, Dino Maiuri', 'Charles Bronson, Jill Ireland, Vincent Van Patten, Fausto Tozzi, Ettore Manni, Corrado Gaipa, Diana Lorys, Marcel Bozzuffi', 'PG', 'Chino Valdez is a loner horse breeder living in the old west. Partly a loner by choice, and partly because, being a ''half-breed'', he finds himself unwelcome almost everywhere he goes. One day, a young runaway named Jimmy shows up at his door looking for work and a roof over his head. Reluctantly, Chino agrees to take him in and teach him the art of raising, breaking and breeding horses, until the pair finally begin to accept each other.', 'Chino Valdez is a loner horse breeder living in the old west. Partly a loner by choice, and partly because, being a ''half-breed'', he finds himself unwelcome almost everywhere he goes. One day, a young runaway named Jimmy shows up at his door looking for work and a roof over his head. Reluctantly, Chino agrees to take him in and teach him the art of raising, breaking and breeding horses, until the pair finally begin to accept each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sFbU6gkpG8XNoTMxAKkZLzFUJMx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73984'),
  ('34597174551864218', 'The Valet', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Robert Fraisse, Francis Veber', 'Francis Veber, Declan May', 'Gad Elmaleh, Alice Taglioni, Daniel Auteuil, Kristin Scott Thomas, Richard Berry, Virginie Ledoyen, Dany Boon, Michel Jonasz', 'PG-13', 'Caught by tabloid paparazzi with his mistress Elena, a famous and beautiful fashion model, billionaire Pierre Levasseur tries to avoid a divorce by inventing a preposterous lie. He uses the presence of a passerby in the photo to claim to his wife that it''s not him Elena is seeing but the other man, one François Pignon. Pignon is a modest little man who works as a parking valet. To make the story convincing, Elena has to move in with Pignon.', 'Caught by tabloid paparazzi with his mistress Elena, a famous and beautiful fashion model, billionaire Pierre Levasseur tries to avoid a divorce by inventing a preposterous lie. He uses the presence of a passerby in the photo to claim to his wife that it''s not him Elena is seeing but the other man, one François Pignon. Pignon is a modest little man who works as a parking valet. To make the story convincing, Elena has to move in with Pignon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eVP6mln9G4dOoRRrQsY55T0sHOR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21427'),
  ('678982584040716219', 'The Valet', 2022, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Richard Wong, Riley Flanagan, Frank Capra III', 'Francis Veber', 'Eugenio Derbez, Samara Weaving, Max Greenfield, Betsy Brandt, Marisol Nichols, Amaury Nolasco, Carmen Salinas, Noemi Gonzalez', 'PG-13', 'World famous movie star Olivia faces a PR disaster when a paparazzi snaps a photo of her with her married lover, Vincent. The hard-working valet Antonio accidentally appears in the same photo and is enlisted to pose as Olivia’s new boyfriend as a cover-up. This ruse with Olivia thrusts Antonio into the spotlight and unexpected chaos.', 'World famous movie star Olivia faces a PR disaster when a paparazzi snaps a photo of her with her married lover, Vincent. The hard-working valet Antonio accidentally appears in the same photo and is enlisted to pose as Olivia’s new boyfriend as a cover-up. This ruse with Olivia thrusts Antonio into the spotlight and unexpected chaos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q7FmdJHKMLIC4XgWfcFRIu2iVdL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:810171'),
  ('1097091562623181543', 'The Valiant', 1929, 'Drama', 'William K. Howard, Lucien N. Andriot, J. Gordon Cooper', null, 'Paul Muni, Marguerite Churchill, Johnny Mack Brown, DeWitt Jennings, Edith Yorke, Clifford Dempsey, Richard Carlyle, Henry Kolker', null, 'A man condemned to execution tries to convince two women that he is not their son and brother, and that they must get on with their lives.', 'A man condemned to execution tries to convince two women that he is not their son and brother, and that they must get on with their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m9c3ZNBjtEh5gvg2ixYVbXLgPCi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113207'),
  ('1065638571186400799', 'The Valiant Ones', 1975, 'Adventure, Action', 'King Hu, Ming Ta-Chun, Chris Chen Ching-Chu', 'King Hu', 'Roy Chiao, Pai Ying, Hsu Feng, Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Han Ying-Chieh, Lee Man-Tai, Lau Kong, Ng Ming-Choi', null, 'A righteous husband-and-wife swordfighting duo struggle to protect China from the machinations of Japanese pirates and corrupt officials.', 'A righteous husband-and-wife swordfighting duo struggle to protect China from the machinations of Japanese pirates and corrupt officials.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sJafN7HGmD6spXjFbtCSqaU09cM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76293'),
  ('339063407765970049', 'The Valley', 1972, 'Drama', 'Barbet Schroeder, Néstor Almendros', 'Barbet Schroeder', 'Bulle Ogier, Michael Gothard, Jean-Pierre Kalfon, Valérie Lagrange, Monique Giraudy, Jérôme Beauvarlet', null, 'Viviane, a French Consul''s wife, is in New Guinea to find exotic feathers for export to Paris. She encounters four European travelers who are en route to "La Vallée": The Valley, high in the Guinean mountains, is shown on maps as ''obscured by clouds'' and is beyond their previous experiences. Viviane joins their trek to find rare feathers and soon becomes entwined in their journey. Their extended stay with the Mapuga tribe brings a denouement between western and indigenous values before their final quest toward the ''Valley of the Gods''.', 'Viviane, a French Consul''s wife, is in New Guinea to find exotic feathers for export to Paris. She encounters four European travelers who are en route to "La Vallée": The Valley, high in the Guinean mountains, is shown on maps as ''obscured by clouds'' and is beyond their previous experiences. Viviane joins their trek to find rare feathers and soon becomes entwined in their journey. Their extended stay with the Mapuga tribe brings a denouement between western and indigenous values before their final quest toward the ''Valley of the Gods''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5aeeuieLTqJQuJMtwnS3yedd2Cx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63327'),
  ('379131329178689403', 'The Valley of Death', 1968, 'Western, Adventure', 'Harald Reinl, Ernst W. Kalinke', 'Harald Reinl, Herbert Reinecker', 'Lex Barker, Pierre Brice, Karin Dor, Rik Battaglia, Ralf Wolter, Eddi Arent, Fred Vincent, Kurt Waitzmann', 'NR', 'An army gold shipment and its escort vanish in the Ozarks, prompting accusations of theft and desertion but frontiersman Old Shatterhand and Apache chief Winnetou help solve the mystery of the missing army gold.', 'An army gold shipment and its escort vanish in the Ozarks, prompting accusations of theft and desertion but frontiersman Old Shatterhand and Apache chief Winnetou help solve the mystery of the missing army gold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sB8Eboh8CuFNIAetA93PyFANgIh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10638'),
  ('238766438756009102', 'The Valley of Decision', 1945, 'Drama, Romance', 'Tay Garnett, Joseph Ruttenberg, Marvin Stuart', 'Sonya Levien, John Meehan', 'Greer Garson, Gregory Peck, Donald Crisp, Lionel Barrymore, Preston Foster, Marsha Hunt, Gladys Cooper, Reginald Owen', 'NR', 'Mary Rafferty comes from a poor family of steel mill workers in 19th Century Pittsburgh. Her family objects when she goes to work as a maid for the wealthy Scott family which controls the mill. Mary catches the attention of handsome scion Paul Scott, but their romance is complicated by Paul''s engagement to someone else and a bitter strike among the mill workers.', 'Mary Rafferty comes from a poor family of steel mill workers in 19th Century Pittsburgh. Her family objects when she goes to work as a maid for the wealthy Scott family which controls the mill. Mary catches the attention of handsome scion Paul Scott, but their romance is complicated by Paul''s engagement to someone else and a bitter strike among the mill workers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kiHMWi0OWMIovdCnd4AbMEyQh3c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43610'),
  ('838385374146300256', 'The Valley of Gwangi', 1969, 'Fantasy, Science Fiction, Thriller, Western, Adventure', 'Jim O''Connolly, Erwin Hillier', 'William Bast', 'James Franciscus, Gila Golan, Richard Carlson, Laurence Naismith, Freda Jackson, Gustavo Rojo, Dennis Kilbane, Mario De Barros', 'G', 'A turn of the century wild west show struggling to make a living in Mexico comes into the possession of a tiny prehistoric horse. This leads to an expedition to the Forbidden Valley where they discover living dinosaurs. They capture one and take it back to be put on display, leading to inevitable mayhem.', 'A turn of the century wild west show struggling to make a living in Mexico comes into the possession of a tiny prehistoric horse. This leads to an expedition to the Forbidden Valley where they discover living dinosaurs. They capture one and take it back to be put on display, leading to inevitable mayhem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5RP7yHpTHsLlQEP8V3gji743Sbh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42329'),
  ('642564915342521442', 'The Valley of the Bees', 1968, 'Drama, History', 'František Vláčil, Aleš Dospiva, Jan Kratochvíl', 'František Vláčil, Vladimír Körner', 'Petr Čepek, Jan Kačer, Zdeněk Kryzánek, Věra Galatíková, Miroslav Macháček, Josef Somr, Václav Kotva, Josef Kotapiš', null, 'Cast out by his father, young Ondrej joins the Order of the Teutonic Knights, where he is raised by strict monk Armin. After years of hardship, Ondrej escapes from the Order when he is wrongly punished, and sets out for his former home. Arriving to discover his father to be dead, Ondrej now not only assumes control of his father''s properties, but seeks to marry his former stepmother.', 'Cast out by his father, young Ondrej joins the Order of the Teutonic Knights, where he is raised by strict monk Armin. After years of hardship, Ondrej escapes from the Order when he is wrongly punished, and sets out for his former home. Arriving to discover his father to be dead, Ondrej now not only assumes control of his father''s properties, but seeks to marry his former stepmother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xhLW4pc1x2nZjLeGIwCdXbcJ9ZE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25908'),
  ('146414084393802942', 'The Vampire', 1945, 'Documentary', 'Jean Painlevé', null, 'Max Schreck', null, 'After a look at some strange creatures, the narrator and camera take us to the Chaco forest, on the borders of Paraguay, Argentina, and Brazil, where a vampire bat lives, desmodus rotondus, attacking wildlife and domesticated creatures, killing small ones by draining all their blood and killing large ones by leaving a parasite in their bloodstream. Four inches long, with a 12-inch wingspread, we see it walk, approach a victim, pull out a patch of fur large enough for it to engage its teeth, then lap six or seven ounces of blood. Its saliva may be an anesthetic keeping its victims from waking. A stub nose and harelip contribute to its efficiency and its hideous look.', 'After a look at some strange creatures, the narrator and camera take us to the Chaco forest, on the borders of Paraguay, Argentina, and Brazil, where a vampire bat lives, desmodus rotondus, attacking wildlife and domesticated creatures, killing small ones by draining all their blood and killing large ones by leaving a parasite in their bloodstream. Four inches long, with a 12-inch wingspread, we see it walk, approach a victim, pull out a patch of fur large enough for it to engage its teeth, then lap six or seven ounces of blood. Its saliva may be an anesthetic keeping its victims from waking. A stub nose and harelip contribute to its efficiency and its hideous look.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uZbofvHFRT6mQ3iAPWyqXQrabJ3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144694'),
  ('678967657959185441', 'The Vampire', 1957, 'Horror', 'Fernando Méndez, Rosalío Solano', 'Ramón Rodríguez', 'Abel Salazar, Ariadna Welter, Carmen Montejo, José Luis Jiménez, Mercedes Soler, Alicia Montoya, Germán Robles', null, 'A pretty young Mexican girl returns to her hometown to make funeral arrangements for her beloved aunt, who has just died. Soon she begins to hear disturbing stories about the town being infested by vampires, and she eventually begins to suspect that her remaining aunt and the mysterious next-door neighbor may be involved.', 'A pretty young Mexican girl returns to her hometown to make funeral arrangements for her beloved aunt, who has just died. Soon she begins to hear disturbing stories about the town being infested by vampires, and she eventually begins to suspect that her remaining aunt and the mysterious next-door neighbor may be involved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pVFdcttm0zmmWb5x3TgFbssLlNm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120303'),
  ('332989613438824079', 'The Vampire and the Ballerina', 1960, 'Horror', 'Renato Polselli, Ernesto Gastaldi, Angelo Baistrocchi', 'Renato Polselli, Giuseppe Pellegrini, Ernesto Gastaldi', 'Hélène Rémy, Tina Gloriani, Walter Brandi, Isarco Ravaioli, María Luisa Rolando, Gino Turini, Pier Ugo Gragnani, Brigitte Castor', 'NR', 'A troupe of beautiful dancers find themselves stranded in a sinister castle, not knowing it is home to a group of vampires.', 'A troupe of beautiful dancers find themselves stranded in a sinister castle, not knowing it is home to a group of vampires.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a6QbNjSDHbNcwf64b9K3Lnx3fsh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107387'),
  ('223550637139548709', 'The Vampire Bat', 1933, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Frank R. Strayer, Ira H. Morgan, Abe Meyer', 'Edward T. Lowe Jr.', 'Lionel Atwill, Fay Wray, Melvyn Douglas, Maude Eburne, George E. Stone, Dwight Frye, Robert Frazer, Rita Carlyle', 'NR', 'A German village is stricken by a series of murders that appear to be the work of vampires.', 'A German village is stricken by a series of murders that appear to be the work of vampires.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bGN3Ik3CatDC9wvfV55LLBrBGh8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43148'),
  ('442887971111289991', 'The Vampire Doll', 1970, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Michio Yamamoto, Kunihiko Watanabe, Kazutami Hara', 'Hiroshi Nagano, Ei Ogawa', 'Kayo Matsuo, Akira Nakao, Atsuo Nakamura, Yukiko Kobayashi, Yoko Minakaze, Jun Usami, Kaku Takashina, Tadao Futami', null, 'A young man goes missing after visiting his girlfriend''s isolated country home. His sister and her boyfriend trace him to the creepy mansion, but their search becomes perilous when they uncover a gruesome family history.', 'A young man goes missing after visiting his girlfriend''s isolated country home. His sister and her boyfriend trace him to the creepy mansion, but their search becomes perilous when they uncover a gruesome family history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4U5kCOqxDUaY8XxKsOewSSgVq2h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115018'),
  ('518383693718568817', 'The Vampire Family', 1990, 'Horror', 'Igor Shavlak, Gennadiy Klimov, Aleksandr Machilskiy', 'Marina Sobe-Panek, Igor Shavlak, Gennadiy Klimov', 'Igor Shavlak, Elena Karadzhova, Yuri Katin-Yartsev, Nikolay Kochegarov, Nikolai Voloshin, Aleksandr Ryzhkov, Vsevolod Khabarov, Aleksandr Samoylenko', null, 'A newspaper sends a young reporter into the Russian countryside to make a nice, sensationalist yarn out of some strange stories going around. Once in the countryside, Igor is accommodated by a peasant family living in the middle of nowhere close to a ruined church. The family is convinced that their dead patriarch will return from the dead as a blood-drinking fiend exactly nine and a half days after his demise.', 'A newspaper sends a young reporter into the Russian countryside to make a nice, sensationalist yarn out of some strange stories going around. Once in the countryside, Igor is accommodated by a peasant family living in the middle of nowhere close to a ruined church. The family is convinced that their dead patriarch will return from the dead as a blood-drinking fiend exactly nine and a half days after his demise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hEuTOCLwi3ahae2o8r15ryt9gFv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:356053'),
  ('1070119211572535039', 'The Vampire Girls', 1969, 'Horror', 'Alfredo Uribe, Federico Curiel', 'Adolfo Torres Portillo, Federico Curiel', 'John Carradine, María Duval, Pedro Armendáriz Jr., Aarón Rodríguez Arellano, Marta Romero, Maura Monti, Dagoberto Rodríguez, Manuel Garay', null, 'A wrestler tries to break up a covey of vampires, led by the King of Vampires.', 'A wrestler tries to break up a covey of vampires, led by the King of Vampires.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gk1Owno72KdqNjfhqwfcQkmOvVL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:328987'),
  ('730478904268376705', 'The Vampire Happening', 1971, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Gérard Vandenberg, Freddie Francis', 'August Rieger', 'Pia Degermark, Thomas Hunter, Yvor Murillo, Ferdy Mayne, Joachim Kemmer, Oskar Wegrostek, Lyvia Bauer, Daria Damar', null, 'An American actress inherits a Transylvanian castle, unaware that her ancestor was really a vampire countess, and has emerged from her tomb to ravage the nearby village and Catholic seminary', 'An American actress inherits a Transylvanian castle, unaware that her ancestor was really a vampire countess, and has emerged from her tomb to ravage the nearby village and Catholic seminary', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8mVyjEG4p9TofKuyfAkCIOIClEO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76765'),
  ('159657886779376080', 'The Vampire Lovers', 1970, 'Horror', 'Moray Grant, Roy Ward Baker, Derek Whitehurst', 'Tudor Gates', 'Ingrid Pitt, Peter Cushing, George Cole, Kate O''Mara, Ferdy Mayne, Douglas Wilmer, Madeline Smith, Dawn Addams', 'R', 'In the heart of Styria the Karnstein Family, even after their mortal deaths, rise from their tombs spreading evil in the countryside in their lust for fresh blood. Baron Hartog whose family are all victims of Karnstein vampirism, opens their graves and drives a stake through their diabolical hearts. One grave he cannot locate is that of the legendary beautiful Mircalla Karnstein. Years of peace follow that grisly night until Mircalla reappears to avenge her family''s decimation and satisfy her desire for blood.', 'In the heart of Styria the Karnstein Family, even after their mortal deaths, rise from their tombs spreading evil in the countryside in their lust for fresh blood. Baron Hartog whose family are all victims of Karnstein vampirism, opens their graves and drives a stake through their diabolical hearts. One grave he cannot locate is that of the legendary beautiful Mircalla Karnstein. Years of peace follow that grisly night until Mircalla reappears to avenge her family''s decimation and satisfy her desire for blood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6MTiYnp62i2kdweHjhchwJscQrj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31952'),
  ('800677287166310890', 'The Vampire Next Door', 2024, 'Horror', 'Sean King', 'Sean King', 'Alex Matthews, Jessica Ferguson, Bella Chadwick, Taylor King, Elijah Golden, Josh Kay, Seth Kerrigan, Andrew Larkin', null, 'When twenty-year-old Cameron discovers he has a female vampire living next door, she enlists him to help her avenge the murder of a former lover. Cameron reluctantly agrees and goes along on the adventure, until he finds out the shocking truth.', 'When twenty-year-old Cameron discovers he has a female vampire living next door, she enlists him to help her avenge the murder of a former lover. Cameron reluctantly agrees and goes along on the adventure, until he finds out the shocking truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nBrzD4DOsj1lbXvjODGAbA8ddm8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1232645'),
  ('74599927372832721', 'The Vampire of Dusseldorf', 1965, 'Adventure, Crime, Thriller', 'Robert Hossein, Alain Levent', 'Georges Tabet, André Tabet, Robert Hossein', 'Robert Hossein, Marie-France Pisier, Roger Dutoit, Annie Anderson, Anne Carrère, Michel Dacquin, Norma Dugo, Paul Pavel', null, 'A true story of Peter Kurten, a serial killer who committed nine murders and many other offenses in Dusseldorf during the Great Depression era.', 'A true story of Peter Kurten, a serial killer who committed nine murders and many other offenses in Dusseldorf during the Great Depression era.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nlMW3JREe7X0ReiaV9hbGGYapiA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65978'),
  ('563607641028036047', 'The Vampire Wino', 1989, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Rafael Villaseñor Kuri', 'Antonio Orellana', 'Pedro Weber ''Chatanuga'', Gabriela Goldsmith, Guillermo de Alvarado ''Condorito'', Charly Valentino', null, 'A vampire is sent into outer space by 3 scientists but his rocket ship lands in Mexico City where he meets different people and has comedic adventures.', 'A vampire is sent into outer space by 3 scientists but his rocket ship lands in Mexico City where he meets different people and has comedic adventures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rM4XX4S7F9YUQaHlcaa2JgtzMNs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:255900'),
  ('463446032990034433', 'The Vampire''s Coffin', 1958, 'Horror', 'Fernando Méndez, Víctor Herrera', null, 'Abel Salazar, Ariadna Welter, Germán Robles, Yerye Beirute, Alicia Montoya', null, 'In Sierra Negra, graverobbers Barraza and Mendoza steal the coffin of Count Karol de Lavud, before heading to a hospital. Barraza sees a medallion upon the coffin''s opening and demands more money from Mendoza. Meanwhile, Marta González, recovering from traumatic events, works as a nurse with Dr. Saldívar. When Barraza removes the wooden stake in order to steal Lavud''s medallion, the vampire returns to life and begins a crime spree, hunting down Marta to marry her.', 'In Sierra Negra, graverobbers Barraza and Mendoza steal the coffin of Count Karol de Lavud, before heading to a hospital. Barraza sees a medallion upon the coffin''s opening and demands more money from Mendoza. Meanwhile, Marta González, recovering from traumatic events, works as a nurse with Dr. Saldívar. When Barraza removes the wooden stake in order to steal Lavud''s medallion, the vampire returns to life and begins a crime spree, hunting down Marta to marry her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1x8hmJae871qRd6CDiuEyUm0V8A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123793'),
  ('1150906719587685415', 'The Vampire''s Ghost', 1945, 'Horror', 'Lesley Selander, Robert Pittack, Bud Thackery', 'John K. Butler, Leigh Brackett', 'John Abbott, Charles Gordon, Peggy Stewart, Grant Withers, Emmett Vogan, Adele Mara, Roy Barcroft, Martin Wilkins', 'NR', 'In a small African port, a tawdry bar is run by a old man named Webb Fallon. Fallon is actually a vampire, but he is becoming weary of his "life" of the past few hundred years.', 'In a small African port, a tawdry bar is run by a old man named Webb Fallon. Fallon is actually a vampire, but he is becoming weary of his "life" of the past few hundred years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6VBcL2UzHqGqzFPvh0bR5zqDh3k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91283'),
  ('853568446225474521', 'The Vampires of Coyoacan', 1974, 'Horror', 'Arturo Martínez, Xavier Cruz', 'Rogelio Agrasánchez Sr., Mario Cid, Arturo Martínez', 'Germán Robles, Aarón Rodríguez Arellano, Superzan, Sasha Montenegro, Carlos López Moctezuma, Nathanael León, Pura Vargas, Mister Tempest', null, 'In the service of Satan, a murderous vampire is turning wrestlers into his unwitting thrall, and it''s up to Mil Máscaras and Superzan to stop him and save the world.', 'In the service of Satan, a murderous vampire is turning wrestlers into his unwitting thrall, and it''s up to Mil Máscaras and Superzan to stop him and save the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/se2b4rXUHUfwcgHsqSTEQxsneJL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:136325'),
  ('592338436044538988', 'The Vampires of Poverty', 1978, 'Comedy', 'Luis Ospina, Carlos Mayolo, Eduardo Carvajal', 'Carlos Mayolo, Luis Ospina', 'Luis Alfonso Londoño, Carlos Mayolo, Ramiro Arbeláez, Eduardo Carvajal, Javier Villa, Fabián Ramírez, Astrid Orozco, Jaime Ceballos', 'NR', 'Two filmmakers travel around impoverished sectors of the cities of Bogotá and Cali in search of the images of abjection needed to complete a documentary commissioned by German TV. Meanwhile, another camera captures these “vampire” filmmakers feeding off the misery of their marginal subjects.', 'Two filmmakers travel around impoverished sectors of the cities of Bogotá and Cali in search of the images of abjection needed to complete a documentary commissioned by German TV. Meanwhile, another camera captures these “vampire” filmmakers feeding off the misery of their marginal subjects.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vgZtCNWbIaxvIl5fYrLmJ4nH3h4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129075'),
  ('197094721173808032', 'The Vampires or, The Arch Criminals of Paris', 1915, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Louis Feuillade, Georges Guérin, Manichoux', 'Louis Feuillade', 'Jean Aymé, Édouard Mathé, Marcel Lévesque, Théodore Thalès, Rita Herlor, Florense Simoni, Stacia Napierkowska, Louis Leubas', null, 'Paris is prey to an invisible terror against which the police can do nothing: a sinister organization that sows chaos and death. The intrepid journalist Philippe Guérande and his partner embark on a long crusade to put an end to the crimes of the Great Vampire and Irma Vep, his dangerous accomplice. (A ten episode movie serial.)', 'Paris is prey to an invisible terror against which the police can do nothing: a sinister organization that sows chaos and death. The intrepid journalist Philippe Guérande and his partner embark on a long crusade to put an end to the crimes of the Great Vampire and Irma Vep, his dangerous accomplice. (A ten episode movie serial.)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8jO0Zmd468zS9WRLHpwsKUowZAX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29082'),
  ('26723778328183395', 'The Vampires'' Night Orgy', 1973, 'Horror', 'Andrés Vich, León Klimovsky, Antonio L. Ballesteros', 'Gabriel Moreno Burgos, Antonio Fos', 'Dyanik Zurakowska, Helga Liné, Jack Taylor, José Guardiola, Charo Soriano, Manuel de Blas, David Aller, Luis Ciges', 'R', 'A busload of tourists stops in to visit a small European town. What they don''t know is that the town is completely inhabited by vampires.', 'A busload of tourists stops in to visit a small European town. What they don''t know is that the town is completely inhabited by vampires.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/umJ8qcWcN2iQeD9KG7jqBmT3WE0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119589'),
  ('268338167818088977', 'The Van', 1977, 'Comedy', 'Sam Grossman, Irv Goodnoff, Morris Chapnick', 'Robert J. Rosenthal, Celia Susan Cotelo', 'Stuart Goetz, Deborah White, Harry Moses, Marcie Barkin, Bill Adler, Steve Oliver, Connie Hoffman, Danny DeVito', 'R', 'Bobby blows all his college savings on a van and tries to get the girl of his dreams. It''s a wild time with Bobby and his friends.', 'Bobby blows all his college savings on a van and tries to get the girl of his dreams. It''s a wild time with Bobby and his friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vfahwduYFHzO5yf4rweyaadBe6x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31919'),
  ('635913513407370557', 'The Van', 1996, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Stephen Frears, Oliver Stapleton', 'Roddy Doyle', 'Colm Meaney, Donal O''Kelly, Ger Ryan, Caroline Rothwell, Neilí Conroy, Rúaidhrí Conroy, Brendan O''Carroll, Stuart Dunne', 'R', 'In a working-class quarter of Dublin, ''Bimbo'' Reeves gets laid off from his job and, with his redundancy payout, buys a van and sells fish and chips with his buddy, Larry. Due to Ireland''s surprising success at the 1990 FIFA World Cup, their business starts off well, but the relationship between the two friends soon becomes strained as Bimbo behaves more like a typical boss.', 'In a working-class quarter of Dublin, ''Bimbo'' Reeves gets laid off from his job and, with his redundancy payout, buys a van and sells fish and chips with his buddy, Larry. Due to Ireland''s surprising success at the 1990 FIFA World Cup, their business starts off well, but the relationship between the two friends soon becomes strained as Bimbo behaves more like a typical boss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2TdHo37gBCZFT613VcLMbP5eM65.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11844'),
  ('662878143434884150', 'The Vanguard', 2008, 'Action, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Matthew Hope', 'Matthew Hope', 'Karen Admiraal, Jack Bailey, Ray Bullock Jr., Emma Choy, Christopher Hatherall, Terry Cole', null, 'The year is 2015 and overpopulation and famine have plunged our planet into chaos and one desperate survivor finds himself being hunted and pursued by hordes of rage-crazed zombies.', 'The year is 2015 and overpopulation and famine have plunged our planet into chaos and one desperate survivor finds himself being hunted and pursued by hordes of rage-crazed zombies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/97P4QE9z3X2kRek659u0ZoTlzDy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11926'),
