  ('732394482758412295', 'The Vanished World of Gloves', 1982, 'Animation', 'Jiří Barta, Michael Gahut, Vladimír Malík', 'Jiří Barta', null, null, 'Using an array of gloves in different styles and from different historical periods, the film is a short history of the cinema - from silent movies via pastiches of Buñuel and Fellini and Close Encounters of the Third Kind to a futurist junkyard where tin cans become animated police cars in a city of urban decay.', 'Using an array of gloves in different styles and from different historical periods, the film is a short history of the cinema - from silent movies via pastiches of Buñuel and Fellini and Close Encounters of the Third Kind to a futurist junkyard where tin cans become animated police cars in a city of urban decay.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AwcgqAjh5E7KtIF9afSKFI1NzEh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:262054'),
  ('1022943581393179602', 'The Vanishing', 1988, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'George Sluizer, Toni Kuhn', 'Tim Krabbé, George Sluizer', 'Bernard-Pierre Donnadieu, Gene Bervoets, Johanna ter Steege, Gwen Eckhaus, Pierre Forget, Bernadette Le Saché, Tania Latarjet, Lucille Glenn', 'NR', 'Rex and Saskia, a young couple in love, are on vacation when they stop at a busy service station. Saskia is abducted in broad daylight and three years pass with no answers or closure surrounding her disappearance. Rex has nearly given up all hope when he suddenly begins receiving letters from her abductor.', 'Rex and Saskia, a young couple in love, are on vacation when they stop at a busy service station. Saskia is abducted in broad daylight and three years pass with no answers or closure surrounding her disappearance. Rex has nearly given up all hope when he suddenly begins receiving letters from her abductor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eE5bbuRJluooG2MjEAsLEYyuJoa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8740'),
  ('654977233365338460', 'The Vanishing', 1993, 'Thriller, Drama, Mystery, Horror', 'Peter Suschitzky, George Sluizer, Yudi Bennett', 'Todd Graff', 'Kiefer Sutherland, Jeff Bridges, Nancy Travis, Sandra Bullock, Park Overall, Lisa Eichhorn, George Hearn, Lynn Hamilton', 'R', 'The boyfriend of an abducted woman never gives up the search as the abductor looks on.', 'The boyfriend of an abducted woman never gives up the search as the abductor looks on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/whCG6TGm3h9AHBkfh5M0MnJ8zT0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1644'),
  ('957834811854114649', 'The Vanishing', 2019, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Jamie Hamer, Abi Ross, Ben Burt', 'Celyn Jones, Joe Bone', 'Gerard Butler, Peter Mullan, Connor Swindells, Søren Malling, Ólafur Darri Ólafsson, Gary Lewis, Emma King, Ken Drury', 'R', 'Three lighthouse keepers on an uninhabited island off the coast of Scotland discover something that isn''t theirs to keep.', 'Three lighthouse keepers on an uninhabited island off the coast of Scotland discover something that isn''t theirs to keep.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/owYLROHpJWbYWEHjaEvDsnoz4Ux.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:449459'),
  ('733548183390577603', 'The Vanishing Duck', 1958, 'Animation, Comedy', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera', null, 'Red Coffey, June Foray, George O''Hanlon', null, 'George gives Joan a baby duck for her birthday. While they are out celebrating, Tom goes after the duck, but his plans are thwarted when it (and, later, Jerry) finds a jar of vanishing cream and uses it to get even.', 'George gives Joan a baby duck for her birthday. While they are out celebrating, Tom goes after the duck, but his plans are thwarted when it (and, later, Jerry) finds a jar of vanishing cream and uses it to get even.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qxRAQZT2imcvYsEBpHcpYw3srjh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99102'),
  ('815835051364665665', 'The Vanishing Lady', 1896, 'Mystery', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Georges Méliès, Jehanne d''Alcy', null, 'Georges Méliès makes a woman disappear, then reappear.', 'Georges Méliès makes a woman disappear, then reappear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jnXmSPju0CAfJ9g4Zijgo103wHM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104466'),
  ('535205326009939598', 'The Vanishing Lion', 2003, 'Romance, Fantasy', 'Agnès Varda, Marjolaine Grandjean, Etienne Grandou', 'Agnès Varda', 'Julie Depardieu, Frédérick E. Grasser Hermé, Silvia Urrutia, David Deciron, Bernard Werber, Valérie Donzelli, Agnès Varda', 'NR', 'An adventure of three characters: Clarisse, a psychic’s apprentice, Lazare, who works at the Parisian catacombs, and the bronze statue of a lion at the Denfert-Rochereau (in the 14th arrondissement). Clarisse and Laraze meet daily, but one day Lazare disappears and the lion disappears as well!', 'An adventure of three characters: Clarisse, a psychic’s apprentice, Lazare, who works at the Parisian catacombs, and the bronze statue of a lion at the Denfert-Rochereau (in the 14th arrondissement). Clarisse and Laraze meet daily, but one day Lazare disappears and the lion disappears as well!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3VgAqpANf8PyXyAXss0SeKVgKas.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139426'),
  ('395646418708826703', 'The Vanishing of Pato', 2012, 'Crime', 'Rocco Mortelliti', 'Maurizio Nichetti, Rocco Mortelliti, Andrea Camilleri', 'Nino Frassica, Maurizio Casagrande, Neri Marcorè, Alessandra Mortelliti, Flavio Bucci, Gilberto Idonea, Roberto Herlitzka, Simona Marchini', null, 'Based on the historical novel by Andrea Camilleri, The Vanishing of Patò is set in Vigàta, the town that Detective Montalbano fans know and love...but it''s 1890, Easter weekend. Two rival investigators look into the disappearance of Antonio Patò, a quiet accountant who vanishes after his performance as Judas in the town''s annual Passion Play.', 'Based on the historical novel by Andrea Camilleri, The Vanishing of Patò is set in Vigàta, the town that Detective Montalbano fans know and love...but it''s 1890, Easter weekend. Two rival investigators look into the disappearance of Antonio Patò, a quiet accountant who vanishes after his performance as Judas in the town''s annual Passion Play.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3w15b9ZGlwyTvjGHkTX7Mbico4q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116679'),
  ('418319078964969851', 'The Vanishing of Sidney Hall', 2018, 'Drama, Mystery, Romance', 'Shawn Christensen, Daniel Katz', 'Shawn Christensen, Jason Dolan', 'Logan Lerman, Elle Fanning, Kyle Chandler, Michelle Monaghan, Blake Jenner, Nathan Lane, Margaret Qualley, Yahya Abdul-Mateen II', 'R', 'Over the course of 12 years, and three stages of life, Sidney Hall falls in love, writes the book of a generation and then disappears without a trace.', 'Over the course of 12 years, and three stages of life, Sidney Hall falls in love, writes the book of a generation and then disappears without a trace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e8SJJEliAK9g0EG5agPsbxWoWoI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:353066'),
  ('1004003462439379332', 'The Vanishing Point', 2007, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Laurent de Bartillat, Jean-Marc Selva', 'Alain Ross, Laurent de Bartillat', 'Sylvie Testud, Jean-Pierre Marielle, James Thierrée, Agathe Dronne, Christiane Millet, Miglen Mirtchev, Jean-Gabriel Nordmann, Nicolas Pignon', null, 'Lucie Audibert, a student of Art History, does research work on Watteau and is certain that a hidden sense that nobody has ever deciphered can be found in a few of his paintings. The further she explores this the more Professor Jean Dussart - for unclear reasons - tries to discourage her.', 'Lucie Audibert, a student of Art History, does research work on Watteau and is certain that a hidden sense that nobody has ever deciphered can be found in a few of his paintings. The further she explores this the more Professor Jean Dussart - for unclear reasons - tries to discourage her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d3rLeEX4ZI9M1gYsXfL94b66FTs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15331'),
  ('644352427240355841', 'The Vanishing Prairie', 1954, 'Documentary', 'James Algar, Cleveland P. Grant, Herb Crisler', null, 'Winston Hibler', null, 'Story of the American Prairie as it was when vast herds of bison and elk grazed.', 'Story of the American Prairie as it was when vast herds of bison and elk grazed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1PUnknBOYnsP659OAQqJGsApx7w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114499'),
  ('934786677294135448', 'The Vanishing Private', 1942, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack King', null, 'Clarence Nash, Billy Bletcher', 'NR', 'Private Duck is a camouflage painter. He paints a giant cannon with some very gaudy colors, until Sergeant Pete explains that the point is to make it so the cannon can''t be seen. Donald finds a bucket of experimental invisible paint and makes the cannon disappear. Pete isn''t happy with this, and knocks Donald into the paint, then chases him, until he runs into the general. As Pete tries to explain, Donald prods him with a cactus, then goes off to steal some pies. Eventually, Pete goes berserk and starts throwing grenades willy-nilly and gets in more trouble with the general.', 'Private Duck is a camouflage painter. He paints a giant cannon with some very gaudy colors, until Sergeant Pete explains that the point is to make it so the cannon can''t be seen. Donald finds a bucket of experimental invisible paint and makes the cannon disappear. Pete isn''t happy with this, and knocks Donald into the paint, then chases him, until he runs into the general. As Pete tries to explain, Donald prods him with a cactus, then goes off to steal some pies. Eventually, Pete goes berserk and starts throwing grenades willy-nilly and gets in more trouble with the general.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t74XBsLUl5nmwoEvdkIh9H9bEwv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64706'),
  ('567289071839608992', 'The Vanity Serum', 2004, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Alex Infascelli, Stefano Ricciotti, Inti Carboni', 'Antonio Manzini', 'Margherita Buy, Barbora Bobuľová, Valerio Mastandrea, Francesca Neri, Antonino Bruschetta, Luis Molteni, Maddalena Maggi, Marco Giallini', null, 'A troubled detective investigates the disappearance of junk TV celebrities who hosted the same controversial talk show.', 'A troubled detective investigates the disappearance of junk TV celebrities who hosted the same controversial talk show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wLyvNAR2Cqm9liV41R7ieBX2RHK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58278'),
  ('494403722916481117', 'The Vanquished', 1953, 'Drama, Crime', 'Michelangelo Antonioni, Pietro Notarianni, Jimmy Mason', 'Suso Cecchi d''Amico, Michelangelo Antonioni, Roger Nimier', 'Etchika Choureau, Jean-Pierre Mocky, Jacques Sempey, Henri Poirier, Annie Noël, Guy De Meulan, Franco Interlenghi, Anna Maria Ferrero', null, 'Three tales of privileged youth entangled in murder: French students kill for money, an Italian student smuggles cigarettes, and an English poet exploits a grim discovery.', 'Three tales of privileged youth entangled in murder: French students kill for money, an Italian student smuggles cigarettes, and an English poet exploits a grim discovery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/luIGHd6YIwIfs7woRAinM7ef637.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90770'),
  ('512540093571828517', 'The Vanquisher', 2009, 'Action, Thriller', 'Manop Udomdej', null, 'Sophita Sribanchean, Kessarin Ektawatkul, Jacqueline Apithananont, Pete Thongchua, Saito Kano, Sarunyu Wongkrachang, Yanee Tramoth', null, 'After completing a covert mission in southern Thailand, CIA agent Gunja finds herself forced to fight off operatives who''ve been ordered to take her out at all costs. She survives and after two years of laying low, re-emerges in Bangkok to face her old foes and foil a plot to detonate a bomb in the city.', 'After completing a covert mission in southern Thailand, CIA agent Gunja finds herself forced to fight off operatives who''ve been ordered to take her out at all costs. She survives and after two years of laying low, re-emerges in Bangkok to face her old foes and foil a plot to detonate a bomb in the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vdk2PAs8jUjb2zzzK6d1SitGrdm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42546'),
  ('189692753723073583', 'The Vast of Night', 2019, 'Drama, Mystery, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Andrew Patterson, M.I. Littin-Menz, Brandi Price', null, 'Sierra McCormick, Jake Horowitz, Bruce Davis, Gail Cronauer, Cheyenne Barton, Mark Banik, Gregory Peyton, Adam Dietrich', 'PG-13', 'At the dawn of the space-race, two radio-obsessed teens discover a strange frequency over the airwaves in what becomes the most important night of their lives and in the history of their small town.', 'At the dawn of the space-race, two radio-obsessed teens discover a strange frequency over the airwaves in what becomes the most important night of their lives and in the history of their small town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q2P9lYkctl5Ory71HEBMaFxbVlD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:565743'),
  ('558610127688924791', 'The Vatican Tapes', 2015, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Phil Miller, Mark Neveldine, Gerardo Madrazo', 'Christopher Borrelli, Michael C. Martin', 'Olivia Taylor Dudley, Michael Peña, Peter Andersson, Djimon Hounsou, Kathleen Robertson, Montanna Gillis, Noemi Gonzalez, Alison Lohman', 'R', 'In a highly secured vault deep within the walls of Vatican City, the Catholic Church holds thousands of old films and video footage documenting exorcisms/supposed exorcisms and other unexplained religious phenomena they feel the world is not ready to see. This is the first tape - Case 83-G - stolen from these archives and exposed to the public by an anonymous source.', 'In a highly secured vault deep within the walls of Vatican City, the Catholic Church holds thousands of old films and video footage documenting exorcisms/supposed exorcisms and other unexplained religious phenomena they feel the world is not ready to see. This is the first tape - Case 83-G - stolen from these archives and exposed to the public by an anonymous source.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eXN0zdTpm772ZCfnCeLAONguqxe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:157544'),
  ('248641718879395944', 'The Vault', 2017, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Dan Bush, Andrew Shulkind', 'Conal Byrne, Dan Bush', 'James Franco, Taryn Manning, Francesca Eastwood, Scott Haze, Q''orianka Kilcher, Jeff Gum, Clifton Collins Jr., Keith Loneker', null, 'Two estranged sisters are forced to rob a bank in order to save their brother. But this is no ordinary bank.', 'Two estranged sisters are forced to rob a bank in order to save their brother. But this is no ordinary bank.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eMXA8Mbl9P9kNVGhMKqwr5Xni8C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:416160'),
  ('251196515835738967', 'The Vault', 2021, 'Drama, Action, Thriller', 'Sandra Hermida, Margarita Huguet, Manel Martínez', 'Rafa Martínez, Andrés M. Koppel, Borja González Santaolalla', 'Freddie Highmore, Àstrid Bergès-Frisbey, Jose Coronado, Liam Cunningham, Sam Riley, Luis Tosar, Emilio Gutiérrez Caba, Axel Stein', 'R', 'Madrid, Spain, 2010. While the whole city follows the national team''s successful participation in the World Cup, a group of daring thieves look for a way into one of the most secure and guarded places on the planet.', 'Madrid, Spain, 2010. While the whole city follows the national team''s successful participation in the World Cup, a group of daring thieves look for a way into one of the most secure and guarded places on the planet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kWhXubAiIcHW0xn5GThflqaKZqh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:630004'),
  ('905816815479868189', 'The Vault of Horror', 1973, 'Horror', 'Roy Ward Baker, Denys N. Coop', 'Milton Subotsky', 'Anna Massey, Terry-Thomas, Glynis Johns, John Forbes-Robertson, Curd Jürgens, Dawn Addams, Ishaq Bux, Michael Craig', 'R', 'The sequel to Tales from the Crypt. Five strangers trapped in a basement vault converse about their recurring nightmares. Their stories include vampires, bodily dismemberment, east Indian mysticism, an insurance scam, and an artist who kills by painting his victims'' deaths.', 'The sequel to Tales from the Crypt. Five strangers trapped in a basement vault converse about their recurring nightmares. Their stories include vampires, bodily dismemberment, east Indian mysticism, an insurance scam, and an artist who kills by painting his victims'' deaths.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/10H05rKoxX2hggBeEMwpm9il2GL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53868'),
  ('988884705426810938', 'The Veil', 2016, 'Horror', 'Phil Joanou, Steeven Petitteville, Isaac Mejía', 'Robert Ben Garant', 'Jessica Alba, Thomas Jane, Lily Rabe, Shannon Woodward, Aleksa Palladino, Reid Scott, Lenny Jacobson, Meegan Warner', 'NR', '30 years ago, when members of a religious cult known as Heaven''s Veil take their own lives. The truth behind what really happened remains buried deep in the memory of the sole survivor, a five-year-old girl. Now as an adult she returns to the compound with a documentary crew. They soon discover something that is far more terrifying than anything they could have imagined.', '30 years ago, when members of a religious cult known as Heaven''s Veil take their own lives. The truth behind what really happened remains buried deep in the memory of the sole survivor, a five-year-old girl. Now as an adult she returns to the compound with a documentary crew. They soon discover something that is far more terrifying than anything they could have imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e9hB3QrBIUDSHCmwbceVxVgLRqv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:257087'),
  ('797504045407288759', 'The Veil', 2017, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Brent Ryan Green, Tom Marvel, Eugene Mazzola', 'Jeff Goldberg', 'William Levy, William Moseley, Serinda Swan, Nick E. Tarabay, Adam Gregory, Brett DelBuono, Billy Blair, Elizabeth Tabish', null, 'Set in a war-torn land where tribal factions live in fear of annihilation, the film tells the story of a deadly warrior leading a destructive war campaign. When he is betrayed by his own and left for dead, he is healed by a mysterious princess and taken in by a hidden tribe that believes he was chosen to wage a final battle.', 'Set in a war-torn land where tribal factions live in fear of annihilation, the film tells the story of a deadly warrior leading a destructive war campaign. When he is betrayed by his own and left for dead, he is healed by a mysterious princess and taken in by a hidden tribe that believes he was chosen to wage a final battle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/obO5rrYLAhq22UFECGqlnFhWLWX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:393306'),
  ('475484469540618766', 'The Veiled Man', 1987, 'Drama', 'Maroun Bagdadi, Patrick Blossier', 'Maroun Bagdadi', 'Bernard Giraudeau, Michel Piccoli, Laure Marsac, Michel Albertini, Sandrine Dumas, Fouad Naim, Jonathan Layna, Sonia Itchti', null, 'Claire (Laure Marsac) is a 16-year-old young woman who discovers her father Pierre (Bernard Giraudeau) is not a healing physician but a killer with a bloody war record in the Lebanese conflict. She runs away from home and into the arms of Kamal (Michal Albertini). While Pierre stalks two terrorists, Claire and Kamal are violently confronted by Kamal''s abandoned wife and family. The ravages of the conflict extend to those who are never participants in the battle but are among the casualties of war.', 'Claire (Laure Marsac) is a 16-year-old young woman who discovers her father Pierre (Bernard Giraudeau) is not a healing physician but a killer with a bloody war record in the Lebanese conflict. She runs away from home and into the arms of Kamal (Michal Albertini). While Pierre stalks two terrorists, Claire and Kamal are violently confronted by Kamal''s abandoned wife and family. The ravages of the conflict extend to those who are never participants in the battle but are among the casualties of war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/85yfbdqfQqgV7biYU1WDnLh5h82.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64889'),
  ('444469391078922643', 'The Veldt', 1987, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Aloizas Jančoras, Nazim Tulakhodzhayev, A. Podolskiy', 'Nazim Tulakhodzhayev', 'Yuri Belyayev, Nelli Pshyonnaya, Tamar Skhirtladze, Aleksandra Yakovleva-Aasmyae, Henrikas Kurauskas, Gogi Gegechkori, Vladas Bagdonas, Darius Palekas', null, 'Adaptation of three short stories by Ray Bradbury. An atmosphere of hostility forms inside an unnamed city, and the citizens are unsettled by the materialization of ghosts and the memories of their loved ones.', 'Adaptation of three short stories by Ray Bradbury. An atmosphere of hostility forms inside an unnamed city, and the citizens are unsettled by the materialization of ghosts and the memories of their loved ones.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6rh7OMxi1M4Wcg37Pxr9YnyXKjI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90972'),
  ('604584871305881523', 'The VelociPastor', 2018, 'Action, Horror, Comedy', 'Jesse Gouldsbury, Brendan Steere', 'Brendan Steere', 'Gregory James Cohan, Alyssa Kempinski, Daniel Steere, Fernando Pacheco de Castro, Aurelio Voltaire, Yang Jiechang, Jesse Turits, Zachary Steere', 'NR', 'After losing his parents, a priest travels to China, where he inherits a mysterious ability to turn into a dinosaur. At first horrified by this new power, a prostitute convinces him to fight crime. And ninjas.', 'After losing his parents, a priest travels to China, where he inherits a mysterious ability to turn into a dinosaur. At first horrified by this new power, a prostitute convinces him to fight crime. And ninjas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/trSmNw63luh84MBy5XLH0UiN1BC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:457712'),
  ('1009638757089018992', 'The Velocity of Gary', 1999, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Dan Ireland, Sholto J. Roeg, Courtney King', 'James Still', 'Vincent D''Onofrio, Salma Hayek Pinault, Thomas Jane, Olivia D''Abo, Shawn Michael Howard, Khalil Kain, Chad Lindberg, Cordelia Richards', 'R', 'When bisexual porn star Valentino meets new-in-town hustler Gary, there is an immediate attraction between the two. Valentino helps get Gary a job at a phone-sex company, and they become fast friends and lovers, but tension threatens their relationship when Gary and Valentino''s friend Mary becomes involved. When Valentino finds out he is dying and Mary is going to have his child, the three must work through hard times together.', 'When bisexual porn star Valentino meets new-in-town hustler Gary, there is an immediate attraction between the two. Valentino helps get Gary a job at a phone-sex company, and they become fast friends and lovers, but tension threatens their relationship when Gary and Valentino''s friend Mary becomes involved. When Valentino finds out he is dying and Mary is going to have his child, the three must work through hard times together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8wQlK0QukCXXmvmDARAx65wnX4j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133575'),
  ('921074152078057562', 'The Velvet Queen', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Marie Amiguet, Vincent Munier, Marie Amiguet', 'Marie Amiguet, Vincent Munier', 'Vincent Munier, Sylvain Tesson, Marie Amiguet', null, 'High up on the Tibetan plateau. Amongst unexplored and inaccessible valleys lies one of the last sanctuaries of the wild world, where rare and undiscovered fauna lives. Vincent Munier, one of the world’s most renowned wildlife photographers takes the adventurer and novelist Sylvain Tesson (In the Forest of Siberia) with him on his latest mission. For several weeks, they’ll explore these valleys searching for unique animals and try to spot the snow leopard, one of the rarest and most difficult big cats to approach.', 'High up on the Tibetan plateau. Amongst unexplored and inaccessible valleys lies one of the last sanctuaries of the wild world, where rare and undiscovered fauna lives. Vincent Munier, one of the world’s most renowned wildlife photographers takes the adventurer and novelist Sylvain Tesson (In the Forest of Siberia) with him on his latest mission. For several weeks, they’ll explore these valleys searching for unique animals and try to spot the snow leopard, one of the rarest and most difficult big cats to approach.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sWGaJQDoJFbkshYdABhctrAtx7N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:842356'),
  ('48147181120217894', 'The Velvet Touch', 1948, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Joseph Walker, Jack Gage, C. Bakaleinikoff', 'Leo Rosten', 'Rosalind Russell, Leo Genn, Claire Trevor, Sydney Greenstreet, Leon Ames, Frank McHugh, Walter Kingsford, Dan Tobin', 'NR', 'After accidentally killing her lecherous producer, a famous actress tries to hide her guilt.', 'After accidentally killing her lecherous producer, a famous actress tries to hide her guilt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pIExpZkAaHnZ4106e8n82sfUKQv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29116'),
  ('355619288532738411', 'The Velvet Underground', 2021, 'Documentary, Music', 'Edward Lachman, Tinx Chan, Todd Haynes', 'Todd Haynes', 'Lou Reed, John Cale, Sterling Morrison, Maureen Tucker, Jonas Mekas, Jonathan Richman, John Waters, Nico', 'R', 'Experience the iconic rock band''s legacy in the first major documentary to tell their story. Directed with the era’s avant-garde spirit by Todd Haynes, this kaleidoscopic oral history combines exclusive interviews with dazzling archival footage.', 'Experience the iconic rock band''s legacy in the first major documentary to tell their story. Directed with the era’s avant-garde spirit by Todd Haynes, this kaleidoscopic oral history combines exclusive interviews with dazzling archival footage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9uRF6vERWfhlSZKc1sAJTTdG2Ix.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:543836'),
  ('753547146493129552', 'The Velvet Underground and Nico: A Symphony of Sound', 1966, 'Music, Documentary', 'Andy Warhol, Paul Morrissey', null, 'John Cale, Lou Reed, Nico, Sterling Morrison, Maureen Tucker, Christian Aaron Boulogne, Gerard Malanga, Billy Name', 'PG', 'The film depicts a rehearsal of The Velvet Underground including Nico, and is essentially one long loose improvisation.', 'The film depicts a rehearsal of The Velvet Underground including Nico, and is essentially one long loose improvisation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pbbgk8Zm4AliHGmrKBgKh5P0EYo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73241'),
