  ('801896260906600299', 'The Vengeance of She', 1968, 'Adventure, Fantasy', 'Wolfgang Suschitzky, Cliff Owen, Terence A. Clegg', 'Peter O''Donnell', 'John Richardson, Olga Schoberová, Edward Judd, Colin Blakely, Jill Melford, George Sewell, André Morell, Noel Willman', 'G', 'Beautiful young European girl, Carol, is possessed by the spirit of Ayesha – “She Who Must be Obeyed” – and led to the lost city of Kuma, where she is destined to become queen.', 'Beautiful young European girl, Carol, is possessed by the spirit of Ayesha – “She Who Must be Obeyed” – and led to the lost city of Kuma, where she is destined to become queen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Uw5sJcj1gjC6mXEynf9GQcqd7L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64428'),
