  ('784515761006569212', 'The Vengeful Beauty', 1978, 'Action, Adventure', 'Ho Meng-Hua, Hung Hak, Cho Wai-Kei', 'Szeto On', 'Chen Ping, Elliot Ngok Wah, Norman Tsui Siu-Keung, Lo Lieh, Lam Fai-Wong, Johnny Wang Lung-Wei, Susan Shaw Yam-Yam, Wai Wang', null, 'Despite its stand-alone title, this mixture of martial arts and exploitation is a semi-sequel to Shaw Brothers''s Flying Guillotine series. This time, the focus is Rong Qui-yan, a kung fu student turned dutiful wife whose life falls apart when her husband is murdered by a squad of government operatives led by the duplicitous Jin Gang-Feng. Qui-yan is forced to go into hiding as she plots her revenge and finds allies in fellow fugitive Ma Seng and ex-lover Wang-jun.', 'Despite its stand-alone title, this mixture of martial arts and exploitation is a semi-sequel to Shaw Brothers''s Flying Guillotine series. This time, the focus is Rong Qui-yan, a kung fu student turned dutiful wife whose life falls apart when her husband is murdered by a squad of government operatives led by the duplicitous Jin Gang-Feng. Qui-yan is forced to go into hiding as she plots her revenge and finds allies in fellow fugitive Ma Seng and ex-lover Wang-jun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3LxNUJsynu0CbxthSP9beX1fJqM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75520'),
  ('491338499107795676', 'The Venture Bros.: Radiant Is the Blood of the Baboon Heart', 2023, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Christopher McCulloch, Gabriel Lee', 'Christopher McCulloch, Doc Hammer', 'James Urbaniak, Patrick Warburton, Michael Sinterniklaas, Doc Hammer, Christopher McCulloch, Nina Arianda, Clancy Brown, John Hodgman', 'R', 'A nationwide manhunt for Hank Venture leads to untold dangers and unexpected revelations, while The Monarch is literally out for Dr Venture''s blood. An imposing evil from the past reemerges to wreak havoc on the Ventures, The Guild, and even the Monarch marriage—it will take friends and foes alike to restore the Ventures'' world to order… or end it once and for all.', 'A nationwide manhunt for Hank Venture leads to untold dangers and unexpected revelations, while The Monarch is literally out for Dr Venture''s blood. An imposing evil from the past reemerges to wreak havoc on the Ventures, The Guild, and even the Monarch marriage—it will take friends and foes alike to restore the Ventures'' world to order… or end it once and for all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u3ZgJfyBpTox5U7RfhCDIXlHnO4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:828898'),
