  ('250253035262078577', 'The Verdict', 1946, 'Mystery, Crime', 'Don Siegel, Ernest Haller', 'Peter Milne', 'Sydney Greenstreet, Peter Lorre, Joan Lorring, George Coulouris, Rosalind Ivan, Paul Cavanagh, Arthur Shields, Morton Lowry', 'NR', 'After an innocent man is executed in a case he was responsible for, a Scotland Yard superintendent finds himself investigating the murder of his key witness.', 'After an innocent man is executed in a case he was responsible for, a Scotland Yard superintendent finds himself investigating the murder of his key witness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mBaLOlfTOd71p9cJnaAMeK5NFcL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35123'),
  ('843081305546497216', 'The Verdict', 1982, 'Drama', 'Sidney Lumet, Andrzej Bartkowiak, Burtt Harris', 'David Mamet', 'Paul Newman, Charlotte Rampling, Jack Warden, James Mason, Milo O''Shea, Lindsay Crouse, Edward Binns, Julie Bovasso', 'R', 'Frank Galvin is a down-on-his-luck lawyer and reduced to drinking and ambulance chasing, when a former associate reminds him of his obligations in a medical malpractice suit by serving it to Galvin on a silver platter—all parties are willing to settle out of court. Blundering his way through the preliminaries, Galvin suddenly realizes that the case should actually go to court—to punish the guilty, to get a decent settlement for his clients... and to restore his standing as a lawyer.', 'Frank Galvin is a down-on-his-luck lawyer and reduced to drinking and ambulance chasing, when a former associate reminds him of his obligations in a medical malpractice suit by serving it to Galvin on a silver platter—all parties are willing to settle out of court. Blundering his way through the preliminaries, Galvin suddenly realizes that the case should actually go to court—to punish the guilty, to get a decent settlement for his clients... and to restore his standing as a lawyer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iYEuFP1bpj5yOenKliiRFcNO3VE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24226'),
  ('82093480685549191', 'The Verdict', 2013, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Jan Verheyen, Frank van den Eeden, Marcus Himbert', 'Jan Verheyen', 'Koen De Bouw, Johan Leysen, Veerle Baetens, Jappe Claes, Joke Devynck, Jo De Meyere, Chris Lomme, Hendrik Aerts', null, 'When his wife''s murderer is released due to a procedural error, Luc will do everything in his power to stop it from happening... He is going to take justice into his own hands and will then compete with the constitutional state which let him down.', 'When his wife''s murderer is released due to a procedural error, Luc will do everything in his power to stop it from happening... He is going to take justice into his own hands and will then compete with the constitutional state which let him down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9yEeUUkHOtasAHS77YF2jhoJrwu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:225975'),
  ('64436411423083466', 'The Verdict', 2016, 'TV Movie', 'Lars Kraume, Jens Harant', 'Lars Kraume, Oliver Berben, Ferdinand von Schirach', 'Florian David Fitz, Lars Eidinger, Martina Gedeck, Burghart Klaußner, Jördis Triebel, Rainer Bock, Robert Homann-Cauquil', null, 'A hijacker threatens to bring down a passenger plane to a crowded football stadium. Fighter pilot Lars Koch decides to shoot down the machine. The court of Berlin should decide whether Lars Koch is a hero or a murderer. The viewers become jurors, and their decision determines the outcome of the film.', 'A hijacker threatens to bring down a passenger plane to a crowded football stadium. Fighter pilot Lars Koch decides to shoot down the machine. The court of Berlin should decide whether Lars Koch is a hero or a murderer. The viewers become jurors, and their decision determines the outcome of the film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vdNtuh38H5FZEB8J12wICZhmjCl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:421958'),
  ('379832432008472231', 'The Vertical Ray of the Sun', 2000, 'Drama, Romance', 'Trần Anh Hùng, Mark Lee Ping-Bing, Ludovic Bernard', 'Trần Anh Hùng', 'Trần Nữ Yên Khê, Như Quỳnh, Lê Khanh, Ngo Quang Hai, Chu Hùng, Mạnh Cường, Lê Tuấn Anh, Doan Viet Ha', 'PG-13', 'Hanoi comes across almost picture-perfect in director Tran Anh Hung''s beautiful, elegiac tale about the lives and loves of three Vietnamese sisters. A mood characteristic of Hung''s films is set early on with the vivid sounds of birds, insects and water and the way the lighting enhances the subtle use of color. They all combine to gem-like effect here.', 'Hanoi comes across almost picture-perfect in director Tran Anh Hung''s beautiful, elegiac tale about the lives and loves of three Vietnamese sisters. A mood characteristic of Hung''s films is set early on with the vivid sounds of birds, insects and water and the way the lighting enhances the subtle use of color. They all combine to gem-like effect here.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mZCgbOi383Cohv0sIlH5XDEfQTa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34899'),
  ('572140316194851262', 'The Very Edge', 1963, 'Drama', 'Cyril Frankel', 'Elizabeth Jane Howard', 'Anne Heywood, Richard Todd, Nicole Maurey, Jack Hedley, Jeremy Brett, Maurice Denham, Patrick Magee, Gwen Watford', null, 'Tracey Lawrence is assautled in her home and is so affected by the traumatic event she now finds all men totally repulsive, including her husband. Her attitude does not change with time, and to make matters worse her husband has got romantically involved with his secretary. Also, the police still have not tracked down Tracey''s attacker and there is no guarantee that she is safe.', 'Tracey Lawrence is assautled in her home and is so affected by the traumatic event she now finds all men totally repulsive, including her husband. Her attitude does not change with time, and to make matters worse her husband has got romantically involved with his secretary. Also, the police still have not tracked down Tracey''s attacker and there is no guarantee that she is safe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fFeX95MKvTGzRTmIpKO5sm9lghu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:274102'),
  ('1049838623612329784', 'The Very Excellent Mr. Dundee', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Charles Schner, Dean Murphy, Roger Lanser', 'Dean Murphy, Robert Mond', 'Paul Hogan, Shane Jacobson, John Cleese, Chevy Chase, Olivia Newton-John, Rachael Carpani, Jim Jefferies, Kerry Armstrong', 'PG-13', 'Paul Hogan is reluctantly thrust back into the spotlight as he desperately attempts to restore his sullied reputation on the eve of being knighted.', 'Paul Hogan is reluctantly thrust back into the spotlight as he desperately attempts to restore his sullied reputation on the eve of being knighted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xcsy4HxILSzkxwqKnljk1PYbbEK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:604768'),
  ('439569597549045626', 'The Very Eye of Night', 1958, 'Music, Fantasy', 'Maya Deren', 'Maya Deren', 'Don Freisinger, Richard Sandifer, Patricia Ferrer, Bud Bready, Genaro Gómez, Barbara Levin, Richard Englund, Rosemary Williams', null, 'Dancers, shown in photographic negative, perform a series of ballet moves, solos, pas de deux, larger groupings. The dancers glide and rotate untroubled by gravity against a slowly changing starfield background. Their movements are accompanied by music scored for a small ensemble of woodwind and percussion.', 'Dancers, shown in photographic negative, perform a series of ballet moves, solos, pas de deux, larger groupings. The dancers glide and rotate untroubled by gravity against a slowly changing starfield background. Their movements are accompanied by music scored for a small ensemble of woodwind and percussion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gCfddhFdMDsfszV7hYD8HJcLLyp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105577'),
  ('904915764252019544', 'The Very Late Afternoon of a Faun', 1984, 'Comedy', 'Věra Chytilová, Eva Solařová, Miroslav Khun', 'Ester Krumbachová, Věra Chytilová', 'Leoš Suchařípa, Libuše Pospíšilová, Vlasta Špicnerová, Jiří Hálek, Ivan Vyskočil, František Kovářík, Erna Červená, Věra Pávková', null, 'A bachelor named Faun with a Don Juan complex, seized with a hypochondriac''s fear of the ineluctable approach of death, enters a race against time''s passage. Faun''s sexual love is imbued with the narcissistic vanity of a self-satisfied bacchant who even towards old age can''t manage to forgo his lifelong pose as an irresistable seducer of women. He desperately searches for meaning in superficial, fleeting sex.', 'A bachelor named Faun with a Don Juan complex, seized with a hypochondriac''s fear of the ineluctable approach of death, enters a race against time''s passage. Faun''s sexual love is imbued with the narcissistic vanity of a self-satisfied bacchant who even towards old age can''t manage to forgo his lifelong pose as an irresistable seducer of women. He desperately searches for meaning in superficial, fleeting sex.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9D7l6isHiTML5xiPRfTfR2J8jBX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66117'),
  ('217195661940450473', 'The Very Merry Widows', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Catherine Corsini, Jeanne Lapoirie', 'Catherine Corsini, Christophe Morand, Philippe Blasband', 'Jane Birkin, Pierre Richard, Clovis Cornillac, Jérémie Elkaïm, Laurent Grévill, Amira Casar, Pierre Laroche, Émilie Dequenne', null, 'Renée is Laurence''s grandmother and she intends to show her how to make rich men fall in love with her, in order to get their life insurance''s money. Both women will meet several men in the course of the movie. Even the cynical Renée will fall deeply in love again. But even after getting married, Laurence and Renée don''t seem to be able to love their husband for a long time. Will they manage to get rid of their rich, loving but irritating husbands? Will their husbands survive the experience? Or will true love triumph at the end?', 'Renée is Laurence''s grandmother and she intends to show her how to make rich men fall in love with her, in order to get their life insurance''s money. Both women will meet several men in the course of the movie. Even the cynical Renée will fall deeply in love again. But even after getting married, Laurence and Renée don''t seem to be able to love their husband for a long time. Will they manage to get rid of their rich, loving but irritating husbands? Will their husbands survive the experience? Or will true love triumph at the end?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yXfLtd0PgRilHQ5CI23DeyFofPe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72345'),
  ('451921049680091540', 'The Very Private Life of Mister Sim', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Guillaume Deffontaines, Michel Leclerc', 'Michel Leclerc, Baya Kasmi', 'Jean-Pierre Bacri, Isabelle Gélinas, Vimala Pons, Sixtine Dutheil, Christian Bouillette, Vincent Lacoste, Félix Moati, Carole Franck', null, 'Mister Sim is of no concern whatsoever. At least, this is what he thinks about himself. His wife has left him, his job has left him, and when goes to see his father in a remote part of Italy, not even Dad has the time to have lunch with him. He then receives an unexpected offer: to travel through France selling toothbrushes that will "revolutionize oral-dental hygiene." He takes advantage of the job to catch up with people from his childhood, to meet the first big love of his life, along with his daughter, and to make amazing discoveries and, in so doing, rediscover himself.', 'Mister Sim is of no concern whatsoever. At least, this is what he thinks about himself. His wife has left him, his job has left him, and when goes to see his father in a remote part of Italy, not even Dad has the time to have lunch with him. He then receives an unexpected offer: to travel through France selling toothbrushes that will "revolutionize oral-dental hygiene." He takes advantage of the job to catch up with people from his childhood, to meet the first big love of his life, along with his daughter, and to make amazing discoveries and, in so doing, rediscover himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xTENwzN3RmWjCwfijxjk2mFJsPb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:372640'),
  ('911735311695814807', 'The Very Same Munchhausen', 1979, 'Comedy, Drama, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Mark Zakharov, Vladimir Nakhabtsev, Yuriy Rabinovich', 'Grigori Gorin', 'Oleg Yankovskiy, Inna Churikova, Yelena Koreneva, Igor Kvasha, Aleksandr Abdulov, Leonid Yarmolnik, Yuri Katin-Yartsev, Vladimir Dolinskiy', null, 'A philosophical and poetic portrait of the famous (or maybe infamous?) Baron Munchhausen. His crazy, yet very merriment, stories, views and behavior is what sets him apart from others. He becomes alienated from the society that failed to grasp his brilliance. In fact, his brilliance is what underlines the faults with the society itself. It''s a beautiful yet tragic story that is filled with dense and intellectual dialogue.', 'A philosophical and poetic portrait of the famous (or maybe infamous?) Baron Munchhausen. His crazy, yet very merriment, stories, views and behavior is what sets him apart from others. He becomes alienated from the society that failed to grasp his brilliance. In fact, his brilliance is what underlines the faults with the society itself. It''s a beautiful yet tragic story that is filled with dense and intellectual dialogue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ofW7l89csAAe9XpVINFCjlQIpiv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27937'),
  ('556312452698805709', 'The Very Thought of You', 1998, 'Comedy, Romance', 'David Johnson, Nick Hamm', 'Peter Morgan', 'Monica Potter, Rufus Sewell, Tom Hollander, Joseph Fiennes, Ray Winstone, Debora Weston, Jan Pearson, Rebecca Craig', 'PG-13', 'Laurence recounts to his neighbour how his life long friendship with Frank and Daniel has been overturned in just three days by their each independently meeting, and falling for, Martha, who has no idea of their connection. Slowly the tale unfolds, the narrative moving backwards and forwards gradually filling in the gaps until we see the whole picture', 'Laurence recounts to his neighbour how his life long friendship with Frank and Daniel has been overturned in just three days by their each independently meeting, and falling for, Martha, who has no idea of their connection. Slowly the tale unfolds, the narrative moving backwards and forwards gradually filling in the gaps until we see the whole picture', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5BdJ9K9NGpbCSmjIZpuZJgMf4ie.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6373'),
  ('575169283175965630', 'The Very Very Big Company', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Pierre Jolivet, Pascal Ridao', 'Simon Michaël, Pierre Jolivet', 'Roschdy Zem, Marie Gillain, Jean-Paul Rouve, Adrien Jolivet, Guilaine Londez, Arlette Thomas, Wilfried Romoli, Vikash Dhorasoo', null, 'Four friends decide to confront a multinational agrochemical company that is polluting their region. They have 30 days to gather evidence.', 'Four friends decide to confront a multinational agrochemical company that is polluting their region. They have 30 days to gather evidence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tz9h6oruyScOA4sweJWr4CiHEXw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17607'),
  ('890728445699053248', 'The Veteran', 2011, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Matthew Hope, Jude Campbell, Emily Perowne', 'Robert Henry Craft, Matthew Hope', 'Toby Kebbell, Adi Bielski, Brian Cox, Tony Curran, Ashley Thomas, Tom Brooke, Ivanno Jeremiah, Mem Ferda', 'R', 'Soldier Robert Miller returns home from Afghanistan unable to fit back into society. Living on a violent council estate and finding work in undercover surveillance, he becomes obsessed with taking down a group of local gangsters who are intrinsically tied to a suspected terrorist cell. Taking the situation into his own hands, Robert embarks on a brutal quest for justice, with devastating consequences.', 'Soldier Robert Miller returns home from Afghanistan unable to fit back into society. Living on a violent council estate and finding work in undercover surveillance, he becomes obsessed with taking down a group of local gangsters who are intrinsically tied to a suspected terrorist cell. Taking the situation into his own hands, Robert embarks on a brutal quest for justice, with devastating consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i1gSsXTWtCmNQArmIeUpAysHEmi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70196'),
  ('77698176618047540', 'The Veterinarian''s Adopted Children', 1968, 'Family, Comedy', 'Carl Ottosen', 'Carl Ottosen', 'Dirch Passer, Ove Sprogøe, Judy Gringer, Axel Strøbye, Lone Hertz, Winnie Mortensen, Karl Stegger, Susanne Bruun-Koppel', null, 'Winnie''s mother is going to Bangkok to settle an inheritance matter and is looking for a good boarding house for her child. She calls Dr. Linager, who tells her that he has a boarding house for "expensive children," but the price is no object to Winnie''s mother. When Winnie shows up, the good Dr. Linager is a little surprised. He is a veterinarian and thought he was going to be looking after a Siamese cat, but everyone in the house naturally welcomes the charming little Winnie.', 'Winnie''s mother is going to Bangkok to settle an inheritance matter and is looking for a good boarding house for her child. She calls Dr. Linager, who tells her that he has a boarding house for "expensive children," but the price is no object to Winnie''s mother. When Winnie shows up, the good Dr. Linager is a little surprised. He is a veterinarian and thought he was going to be looking after a Siamese cat, but everyone in the house naturally welcomes the charming little Winnie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/thI3LMFiIYEdLsz00W4MUATey4s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41431'),
  ('318219645043820402', 'The Vets', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Thierry Pouget, François Mathon, Julie Manoukian', 'Julie Manoukian', 'Clovis Cornillac, Noémie Schmidt, Carole Franck, Matthieu Sampeur, Juliane Lepoureau, Lilou Fogli, Stéphane Rideau, Antoine Chappey', null, 'In the heart of Morvan, Nico, the last vet in the area, struggles to save his patients, his clinic, and his family. When Michel, his partner and mentor, announces his retirement, Nico knows that the hard part is yet to come. "Don''t worry, I''ve found the next generation" Except that ... The next generation is Alexandra, a 24-hour graduate, brilliant, misanthropic, and not at all willing to return to bury herself in the village of her childhood. Will Nico manage to make her stay?', 'In the heart of Morvan, Nico, the last vet in the area, struggles to save his patients, his clinic, and his family. When Michel, his partner and mentor, announces his retirement, Nico knows that the hard part is yet to come. "Don''t worry, I''ve found the next generation" Except that ... The next generation is Alexandra, a 24-hour graduate, brilliant, misanthropic, and not at all willing to return to bury herself in the village of her childhood. Will Nico manage to make her stay?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w7bS4nnqZArSgkFU96uPIhxNP6v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:613348'),
  ('689190326279921747', 'The Vexxer', 2007, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Cyrill Boss, Philipp Stennert', 'Oliver Welke, Oliver Kalkofe, Bastian Pastewka', 'Oliver Kalkofe, Bastian Pastewka, Joachim Fuchsberger, Christiane Paul, Christoph Maria Herbst, Martin Semmelrogge, Wolfgang Völz, Achim Mentzel', null, 'Scotland Yard investigators have to prevent the murder of Victoria Dickman when her name is found on a death list.', 'Scotland Yard investigators have to prevent the murder of Victoria Dickman when her name is found on a death list.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/miD6UUIcikgDHWHhS9HxySDcS92.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1269'),
  ('955558970020285262', 'The Vice of Hope', 2018, 'Drama', 'Vincenzo Desole, Timiana Scalzone, Dario Lauritano', 'Umberto Contarello, Edoardo De Angelis', 'Pina Turco, Massimiliano Rossi, Cristina Donadio, Marcello Romolo, Marina Confalone, Odette Gomis, Juliet Esey Joseph, Maria Angela Robustelli', null, 'To support her family, Maria works as a trafficker of surrogate mothers, transporting them from place to place along a river — but when one disappears, Maria is left with the task of finding her and must enter deeper into a world she wishes to escape.', 'To support her family, Maria works as a trafficker of surrogate mothers, transporting them from place to place along a river — but when one disappears, Maria is left with the task of finding her and must enter deeper into a world she wishes to escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7vix8c4bBtCvpGbr4uZvkuffCqE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:512897'),
  ('477915226944605657', 'The Vicious Circle', 1957, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Gerald Thomas, Otto Heller, William Hill', 'Francis Durbridge', 'John Mills, Derek Farr, Noelle Middleton, Wilfrid Hyde-White, Roland Culver, Mervyn Johns, Rène Ray, Lionel Jeffries', 'NR', 'When Dr. Howard Latimer finds the German actress whom he had just met at the London Airport murdered in his flat, he is led into a world of murder, blackmail, and a fake passport scam.', 'When Dr. Howard Latimer finds the German actress whom he had just met at the London Airport murdered in his flat, he is led into a world of murder, blackmail, and a fake passport scam.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8qoLbhMyyl6Rew3XBN9Vll5bala.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99620'),
