  ('73896234589392076', 'The Victim', 1980, 'Action, Comedy, Drama', 'Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Lam Ching-Ying', 'Lau Tin-Chi', 'Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Bryan Leung Kar-Yan, Fanny Wang, Chang Yi, Peter Chan Lung, Wilson Tong Wai-Shing, Yuen Miu, Karl Maka', null, 'Chung Yao, a martial arts expert, has long been on the run from his stepbrother, who he caught trying to rape his wife on their wedding night. His brother has never given up the chase however, and Chung Yao live in constant fear that the vengeful stepbrother will murder him and his wife.', 'Chung Yao, a martial arts expert, has long been on the run from his stepbrother, who he caught trying to rape his wife on their wedding night. His brother has never given up the chase however, and Chung Yao live in constant fear that the vengeful stepbrother will murder him and his wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nH8hx6cyy2GRRrlSC6x8PI9UbCc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73652'),
