  ('844023745741017536', 'The Victim', 2011, 'Thriller, Action, Horror', 'Michael Biehn, Eric Curtis', 'Michael Biehn', 'Michael Biehn, Jennifer Blanc, Ryan Honey, Danielle Harris, Denny Kirkwood, Tanya Newbould, Dana Daurey, Alyssa Lobit', 'R', 'Annie''s life is in jeopardy after she''s witnessed the horrific rape and murder of her closest friend. Fleeing from two attackers she stumbles across Kyle, a recluse living in the middle of the woods. Kyle finds the stillness of the woods comforting. The ruggedly handsome loner stays far from civilization - that is - until a single knock on his door throws his solitary life into chaos.', 'Annie''s life is in jeopardy after she''s witnessed the horrific rape and murder of her closest friend. Fleeing from two attackers she stumbles across Kyle, a recluse living in the middle of the woods. Kyle finds the stillness of the woods comforting. The ruggedly handsome loner stays far from civilization - that is - until a single knock on his door throws his solitary life into chaos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rMWGCTARl355jcUTylJoduVtQFA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44008'),
  ('108188451780739354', 'The Victoria System', 2025, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Sylvain Desclous, Inès Tabarin, Nicolas Saubost', 'Sylvain Desclous, Laurette Polmanss', 'Damien Bonnard, Jeanne Balibar, Antonia Buresi, Sharif Andoura, Valentina Nesi, Cédric Appietto, Éric Reinhardt', null, 'The film centers on David Kolski, who is overseeing the construction of the highest tower ever built in France. The developer’s constant pressure, crushing delivery delays, overworked employees… David lives in a hurry. One night, while returning home for dinner, he meets a woman of astonishing beauty who captivates him. He is mesmerized. This woman is Victoria. Ambitious and intelligent, beautiful and independent, the human resources director for a multinational company, she runs her life as the ones of her employees, with an iron hand. Immediately, David also finds himself trapped in this fascinating system.', 'The film centers on David Kolski, who is overseeing the construction of the highest tower ever built in France. The developer’s constant pressure, crushing delivery delays, overworked employees… David lives in a hurry. One night, while returning home for dinner, he meets a woman of astonishing beauty who captivates him. He is mesmerized. This woman is Victoria. Ambitious and intelligent, beautiful and independent, the human resources director for a multinational company, she runs her life as the ones of her employees, with an iron hand. Immediately, David also finds himself trapped in this fascinating system.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jecs6kdzEyks717OJtARIitZAQ6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1001249'),
  ('265421879557552428', 'The Victors', 1963, 'Drama, War', 'Carl Foreman, Christopher Challis', 'Carl Foreman', 'Eli Wallach, George Hamilton, George Peppard, Jeanne Moreau, Romy Schneider, Maurice Ronet, Peter Fonda, Albert Finney', null, 'Intercutting dramatic vignettes with newsreel footage, the story follows the characters from an infantry squad as they make their way from Sicily to Germany during the end of World War II.', 'Intercutting dramatic vignettes with newsreel footage, the story follows the characters from an infantry squad as they make their way from Sicily to Germany during the end of World War II.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bVzJNdrhSjEzeyLle0rbJaH7Xon.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3012'),
